ULL,'2025-01-06 21:15:23','2025-01-06 21:15:23',NULL,NULL),(30,'Zoom Meeting','zoom-meeting',NULL,'zoom',NULL,'2025-01-06','1',14,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-06 21:36:03','2025-01-06 21:36:51','2025-01-06 21:36:51',NULL),(60,'Quo Vadis Retail FAQs: Shipping, Services, and More','quo-vadis-retail-faqs-shipping-services-and-more',NULL,'1. Do you send money internationally?ΓÇ¿Yes! We send money via Western Union to most countries, ensuring fast and secure transactions for our customers.\r\n2. Can you ship packages to Europe?ΓÇ¿Absolutely! We send packages to Europe through Dompak, providing reliable delivery options by both plane and boat.\r\n3. How long does it take for packages to arrive in Europe?\r\n* By Plane: Packages typically arrive in 5-8 business days.\r\n* By Boat: Delivery takes approximately 4-6 weeks.\r\n4. What types of products do you sell?ΓÇ¿We offer a wide variety of gifts, books, cards, and cosmetics imported from Europe. These items make thoughtful presents and are perfect for celebrating heritage and tradition.\r\n5. Do you provide packing supplies?ΓÇ¿Yes, we offer boxes in all sizes for your convenience. Bring your items to us, and weΓÇÖll help you pack them securely.\r\n6. How does the shipping process work?ΓÇ¿Simply bring your package to us, and weΓÇÖll take care of the rest.\r\n* We weigh and measure your package.\r\n* A shipping label is prepared and attached.\r\n* Your package is ready to ship safely!\r\n7. Is there a weight limit for packages?ΓÇ¿No, there is no weight limit for packages sent through Quo Vadis Retail.\r\n8. Are there any restrictions on what can be shipped?ΓÇ¿Yes, please note that fluids cannot be shipped in your packages.\r\n9. How do I know when my package has been delivered?ΓÇ¿WeΓÇÖll call you as soon as your package is delivered to its destination, giving you peace of mind and confirmation of arrival.\r\n10. Can I trust Dompak for safe delivery?ΓÇ¿Yes, Dompak is a reliable service that ensures your packages are delivered safely and securely throughout Europe.\r\nIf you have any other questions or need assistance, feel free to contact us or visit Quo Vadis Retail. We\'re here to help!',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 16:47:18','2025-01-17 19:46:14','2025-01-17 19:46:14',NULL),(61,'Frequently Asked Questions','frequently-asked-questions',NULL,'Do you send money internationally?ΓÇ¿Yes! We send money via Western Union to most countries, ensuring fast and secure transactions for our customers.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:47:42','2025-01-17 19:51:04','2025-01-17 19:51:04',NULL),(62,'FAQ','faq',NULL,'Can you ship packages to Europe?ΓÇ¿Absolutely! We send packages to Europe through Dompak, providing reliable delivery options by both plane and boat.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:50:04','2025-01-17 19:51:23','2025-01-17 19:51:23',NULL),(63,'Do you send money internationally?','do-you-send-money-internationally',NULL,'ΓÇ¿Yes! We send money via Western Union to most countries, ensuring fast and secure transactions for our customers.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:53:04','2025-01-17 19:53:04',NULL,NULL),(64,'Can you ship packages to Europe?ΓÇ¿','can-you-ship-packages-to-europe',NULL,'Absolutely! We send packages to Europe through Dompak, providing reliable delivery options by both plane and boat.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:53:55','2025-01-17 19:53:55',NULL,NULL),(65,'How long does it take for packages to arrive in Europe?','how-long-does-it-take-for-packages-to-arrive-in-europe',NULL,'* By Plane: Packages typically arrive in 5-8 business days.\r\n* By Boat: Delivery takes approximately 4-6 weeks.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:54:36','2025-01-17 19:54:36',NULL,NULL),(66,'What types of products do you sell?','what-types-of-products-do-you-sell',NULL,'ΓÇ¿We offer a wide variety of gifts, books, cards, and cosmetics imported from Europe. These items make thoughtful presents and are perfect for celebrating heritage and tradition.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:55:33','2025-01-17 19:55:33',NULL,NULL),(67,'Do you provide packing supplies?','do-you-provide-packing-supplies',NULL,'ΓÇ¿Yes, we offer boxes in all sizes for your convenience. Bring your items to us, and weΓÇÖll help you pack them securely.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:56:12','2025-01-17 19:56:12',NULL,NULL),(68,'How does the shipping process work?ΓÇ¿','how-does-the-shipping-process-work',NULL,'ΓÇ¿Simply bring your package to us, and weΓÇÖll take care of the rest.\r\n* We weigh and measure your package.\r\n* A shipping label is prepared and attached.\r\n* Your package is ready to ship safely!',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:56:56','2025-01-17 19:56:56',NULL,NULL),(69,'Is there a weight limit for packages?','is-there-a-weight-limit-for-packages',NULL,'No, there is no weight limit for packages sent through Quo Vadis Retail.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:57:36','2025-01-17 19:57:36',NULL,NULL),(70,'Are there any restrictions on what can be shipped?','are-there-any-restrictions-on-what-can-be-shipped',NULL,'Yes, please note that fluids cannot be',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:58:12','2025-01-17 19:58:12',NULL,NULL),(71,'How do I know when my package has been delivered?','how-do-i-know-when-my-package-has-been-delivered',NULL,'ΓÇ¿WeΓÇÖll call you as soon as your package is delivered to its destination, giving you peace of mind and confirmation of arrival.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:59:02','2025-01-17 19:59:02',NULL,NULL),(72,'Can I trust Dompak for safe delivery?','can-i-trust-dompak-for-safe-delivery',NULL,'Yes, Dompak is a reliable service that ensures your packages are delivered safely and securely throughout Europe.\r\nIf you have any other questions or need assistance, feel free to contact us or visit Quo Vadis Retail. We\'re here to help!',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 19:59:57','2025-01-17 19:59:57',NULL,NULL),(73,'What services does HOUZPITAL provide?','what-services-does-houzpital-provide',NULL,'HOUZPITAL offers a wide range of restoration and environmental services, including water damage restoration, fire and smoke damage restoration, mold remediation, asbestos removal, biohazard cleanup, storm damage restoration, duct cleaning, and more. We also provide smart home integration and fire suppression system installation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:03:12','2025-01-17 22:03:12',NULL,NULL),(74,'How quickly can you respond to an emergency?','how-quickly-can-you-respond-to-an-emergency',NULL,'We offer 24/7 emergency response services. Our team is committed to arriving promptly to assess the damage and begin restoration work as quickly as possible.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:03:49','2025-01-17 22:03:49',NULL,NULL),(75,'What is the 360┬░ Restoration Process?','what-is-the-360-restoration-process',NULL,'Our 360┬░ Restoration Process ensures a comprehensive approach to property restoration. From the initial damage assessment to the final stages of reconstruction and monitoring, we manage every step to ensure your property is fully restored and safe.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:04:32','2025-01-17 22:04:32',NULL,NULL),(76,'Are your services environmentally friendly?','are-your-services-environmentally-friendly',NULL,'Yes, we prioritize environmentally conscious practices throughout our restoration processes. This includes using eco-friendly products, minimizing waste, and ensuring energy-efficient solutions whenever possible.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:05:11','2025-01-17 22:05:11',NULL,NULL),(77,'What is smart home integration, and how does it work?','what-is-smart-home-integration-and-how-does-it-work',NULL,'Smart home integration involves incorporating advanced technology into your restoration project. This can include smart thermostats, security systems, lighting controls, and other connected devices to enhance your home\'s safety, efficiency, and convenience.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:05:57','2025-01-17 22:05:57',NULL,NULL),(78,'Do you handle insurance claims?','do-you-handle-insurance-claims',NULL,'Yes, we work closely with your insurance company to streamline the claims process. Our team provides detailed documentation and communicates directly with your insurer to ensure a smooth and hassle-free experience.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:06:31','2025-01-17 22:06:31',NULL,NULL),(79,'How do I know if I need mold remediation?','how-do-i-know-if-i-need-mold-remediation',NULL,'How do I know if I need mold remediation?\r\nSigns you may need mold remediation include visible mold growth, a persistent musty odor, or health symptoms like allergies or respiratory issues. If you suspect mold, we recommend scheduling a professional assessment as soon as possible.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:07:00','2025-01-17 22:07:00',NULL,NULL),(80,'Are your technicians certified?','are-your-technicians-certified',NULL,'Are your technicians certified?\r\nYes, all our technicians are fully certified and trained in the latest restoration and remediation techniques. We ensure our team adheres to industry standards and best practices.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:07:32','2025-01-17 22:07:32',NULL,NULL),(81,'Can you help with construction or remodeling after restoration?','can-you-help-with-construction-or-remodeling-after-restoration',NULL,'Absolutely. In addition to restoration services, we offer construction and remodeling services to bring your property back to its original stateΓÇöor better.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:08:16','2025-01-17 22:08:16',NULL,NULL),(82,'How do I schedule a service or request an estimate?','how-do-i-schedule-a-service-or-request-an-estimate',NULL,'How do I schedule a service or request an estimate?\r\nYou can schedule a service or request an estimate by contacting us at (844) 379-6888, emailing info@houzpital.com, or filling out the contact form on our website at houzpital.com.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:08:51','2025-01-17 22:08:51',NULL,NULL),(83,'Is HOUZPITAL licensed and insured?','is-houzpital-licensed-and-insured',NULL,'Is HOUZPITAL licensed and insured?\r\nYes, we are fully licensed and insured, ensuring our clients receive professional and reliable services with peace of mind.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:09:32','2025-01-17 22:09:32',NULL,NULL),(84,'Do you offer services for commercial properties?','do-you-offer-services-for-commercial-properties',NULL,'Do you offer services for commercial properties?\r\nYes, we provide restoration and environmental services for both residential and commercial properties.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-17 22:10:09','2025-01-17 22:10:09',NULL,NULL),(95,'Water Damage Cleanup','water-damage-cleanup',NULL,'Water Damage Cleanup\r\nFind and stop the source of the water. If water is still flowing or leaking into your home, you need to get it stopped right away to mitigate any further damage and before any cleanup can begin. It is also important to know where your main water line shut off valve is located; turning this off can help stop the flow of water into your home until you can address the source of the water.\r\nRemove and dry the water. This is the most important step in water damage cleanup because the longer the water is present, the worse the damage will be. You have to act fast to remove standing water and begin drying out the area to prevent mold from growing and materials from deteriorating. This step often requires wet/dry vacuums to adequately remove standing water, industrial fans and air movers to increase airflow, and dehumidifiers to remove excess moisture from the air and thoroughly dry out all the water.\r\nRepair or replace damaged materials and belongings. Depending on the extent of the water damage, porous materials like carpets and drywall may have to be removed and replaced. Wood floors, trim, and window/door casings may be salvageable if thorough drying was achieved before any warping or cupping resulted from the water damage. Other wood pieces like furniture may need to be sanded and re-finished to adequately repair them. Removing damaged materials from the area needs to be complete before the next step can begin.\r\nCleaning and sanitizing. Water damage often leaves mud, muck and grime behind, and, depending on the source of the water, could even contain harmful contaminants and bio-hazardous chemicals. You want to be sure that all surfaces are properly cleaned and the areas has been thoroughly sanitized to prevent any further microbial growth and ensure all harmful contaminants, dirt, and other impurities are removed from the area. Be sure to use industry-approved cleaning agents that will not cause further damage to surfaces.\r\nFinal rebuild, repair, and restoration. Once all the above steps have been completed, it is time to put your home back together. If areas of drywall have to be removed, new pieces will be reinstalled, and damaged flooring will be replaced. This is the step where all the final touches are made to return your home to its pre-loss condition. Depending on the availability of materials and workers to install them, this step could end up taking some time. The best bet to get the entire water damage cleanup process done quickly and correctly is to call in the professionals at Atlantic Restoration. Our team of trained and experienced water damage cleanup professionals are standing by to take your call so we can respond quickly and get the water stopped. We have all the equipment and tools necessary to remove water and dry the area efficiently and thoroughly, and we even have the ability to make any necessary repairs to your home.',NULL,'2025-01-09','1',6,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-22 07:01:27','2025-01-22 07:19:30',NULL,NULL),(96,'How to Avoid Pipe Bursts in the Winter','how-to-avoid-pipe-bursts-in-the-winter',NULL,'Extreme Temperatures\r\nExtreme temperatures, either cold or hot, increase the possibility that your pipes will burst. Lack of rainfall to cool the earth and extreme heat during the summer season can cause the land to dry out, making the soil looser. Pipes have much more space to shift within the ground as they expand due to the extreme heat. To avoid burst pipes during summertime, reduce the amount of water you use and use reduced pressure when turning on the faucets to help relieve your system.\r\nOlder Pipes\r\nYour pipes might not even be affected by cold or heat, however, if they are old, rusted, and have gone through too much wear and tear, they are prone to bursting. Each and every year, have your pipes checked to make sure they can endure the water pressure.\r\nHard Water Corrodes Pipes\r\nThe type of water flowing through your pipes can have an impact on their integrity.  Hard water contains higher levels of calcium and magnesium than soft water. Both minerals can be fatal to the pipes in your house. When these minerals accumulate in the faucets and pipes, they can reduce water pressure. The accumulation can corrode your pipes over time, causing holes in the water flow.\r\nHow to Avoid Winter Pipe Bursts\r\nPerform Regular Checkups. The best way to prevent burst pipes in the warmer months is to inspect them regularly. If you are unable to conduct regular inspections, conduct them every other year.\r\nTurn off the Water Supply While Traveling\r\nWhen households flood, it is usually because the property owners have gone away. Pipes are left unattended during this time, and small leaks go undetected for far too long. When the temperature is extremely hot, the pipelines can burst. When traveling, make sure to turn off the water supply or have a friend come by to check your pipes every few days.\r\nPipe Insulation\r\nInsulating wraps or tape may also protect your pipes from the elements. You might be able to do this on your own, but a skilled flood prevention expert can assist you.\r\nContact the Pros\r\nThere are several things you can do to protect your pipes during the winter months, and these suggestions are a good place to begin. We can assist you if you require immediate water damage repair and cleanup. Our goal is to put the house owner at ease while providing high-quality restoration and repair in a professional and timely manner. For water damage cleanup call us today.',NULL,'2024-12-17','1',6,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-22 07:02:56','2025-01-22 07:20:54',NULL,NULL),(97,'Most Common Reasons For Water Damage and Cleanup Help','most-common-reasons-for-water-damage-and-cleanup-help',NULL,'Leaking Pipes\r\nA leaky pipe inside the kitchen sink can cause serious damage to the cabinet below it. A burst pipe within the walls may make things much more difficult. The water damage from such a leak will be immense, as the whole wall would be soaked, and it would promote the growth of mildew and mold. Worse still will be leaky drainage pipes in the soil beneath your concrete foundation. You will very likely have to pay for costly repairs if this happens.\r\nBlocked Drains\r\nDrains in your bathtub, bathroom floor, and kitchen sink can clog for a variety of reasons. Toiletries, hair, oils, dirt, and many other foreign substances can clog drain pipes and prevent proper drainage. Clogged drains could quickly back up and create water damage and flooding inside your home if you do not deal with it immediately.\r\nSump Pump Failure\r\nYou can have a big flooding disaster in your basement should your sump pump stop functioning. Afterward, you will have to worry about mold, moisture, and bacteria. Always ensure that the sump pump is positioned upright to ensure optimal performance. Make sure the outflow pipeΓÇÖs vent hole is clean. Your discharge pipes should always be tightly connected and drained at approximately seven feet away from your home. If you find the sump pump leaking, seek professional help right away.\r\nClogged Gutters\r\nSome common culprits that can clog your gutters include foliage, grass, ice, and sludge. Because most people dislike cleaning home gutters, debris builds up and clogs the drainage. When your gutters clog, water accumulates in the clogged area, and the extra water overflows near the propertyΓÇÖs structures, causing damage. This water may also pool in your basement, causing mold and mildew growth, and a bad odor.\r\nMalfunctioning Air Conditioner\r\nHVAC systems work by removing moisture from the air and condensing it in an overflow pan. The water is afterward sent outside via the condenser line using the overflow pan. If the overflow pan is broken or the condenser line clogs up, the drainage line of the air conditioning unit begins malfunctioning. This much water may soak through your ceiling, causing damage.\r\nIf you notice any signs of water damage, call us right away. We will extract the water, dry your home, and perform any necessary repairs to return it to its original condition. We not only cleanup your property, but we also ensure the safety of you and your family.',NULL,'2024-11-15','1',6,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-22 07:04:29','2025-01-22 07:20:34',NULL,NULL),(98,'Mission Statement & Values','mission-statement-values',NULL,'Mission Statement\r\nTo lead the property restoration industry by integrating innovative smart home technologies and comprehensive environmental safety practices, safeguarding homes and businesses for the future.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nValues\r\n* INNOVATION ΓÇô Continuously pushing the boundaries of restoration with the latest technology.\r\n* INTEGRITY ΓÇô Upholding transparency and honesty in all our dealings.\r\n* QUALITY ΓÇô Ensuring every project meets the highest standards of craftsmanship and service.\r\n* CUSTOMER FOCUS ΓÇô Building lasting relationships by putting our clientsΓÇÖ needs first.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-22 20:59:18','2025-01-26 17:58:47','2025-01-26 17:58:47',NULL),(99,'Mission Statement & Values','mission-statement-values-2',NULL,'Mission Statement\r\nTo lead the property restoration industry by integrating innovative smart home technologies and comprehensive environmental safety practices, safeguarding homes and businesses for the future.\r\n\r\nValues\r\n* INNOVATION ΓÇô Continuously pushing the boundaries of restoration with the latest technology.\r\n* INTEGRITY ΓÇô Upholding transparency and honesty in all our dealings.\r\n* QUALITY ΓÇô Ensuring every project meets the highest standards of craftsmanship and service.\r\n* CUSTOMER FOCUS ΓÇô Building lasting relationships by putting our clientsΓÇÖ needs first.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-22 20:59:20','2025-01-22 20:59:20',NULL,NULL),(100,'A Lifetime of Caring: From People to Pets','a-lifetime-of-caring-from-people-to-pets',NULL,'Hi, I\'m Jeff, and helping people has always been my life\'s calling. With a career spanning healthcare, insurance, and people management, IΓÇÖve gained a deep understanding of the challenges people face, especially in tough times. These experiences have taught me the importance of empathy, resilience, and effective problem-solving, making me well-equipped to assist others through even the most difficult situations.\r\nWhen IΓÇÖm not working, you can find me volunteering with dog rescues, giving our furry friends a second chance at life. Whether itΓÇÖs people or pets, my passion lies in making a positive difference wherever I can.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-23 00:46:11','2025-01-23 00:46:11',NULL,NULL),(101,'Why Choose vBiz Me?','why-choose-vbiz-me',NULL,'Because in todayΓÇÖs fast-paced world, seconds matter. We help you make an unforgettable impression while keeping it easy, professional, and impactful.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-23 02:13:35','2025-01-23 02:13:35',NULL,NULL),(102,'We Sell European Products and Ship To Europe','we-sell-european-products-and-ship-to-europe',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-23 07:29:45','2025-01-25 02:18:34','2025-01-25 02:18:34',NULL),(104,'Quo Vadis Retail','quo-vadis-retail',NULL,'Quo Vadis Retail is your one-stop destination for unique and meaningful treasures inspired by tradition, faith, and artistry. Located in the heart of Little Poland in New Britain, CT, we proudly celebrate and share the rich cultural heritage of Poland with our community and beyond.\r\nOur store offers a diverse selection of high-quality products, from stylish shirts and hats to intricately designed plates, Christmas ornaments, and novelty items like keychains and drinking glasses adorned with PolandΓÇÖs insignia. For those seeking timeless elegance, explore our collection of real silver placards and religious masterpieces, including the iconic Last Supper and other cherished Catholic works.\r\nAt Quo Vadis Retail we are dedicated to making these exceptional treasures accessible to everyone. With shipping services available across Europe, we ensure that the beauty of Polish traditions can be shared far and wide.\r\nWhether youΓÇÖre searching for a meaningful gift, a keepsake, or a way to honor your faith and heritage, Quo Vadis Retail is here to provide high-quality items that inspire and connect.\r\nQuo Vadis Retail ΓÇô Treasures of Tradition Delivered to You.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-24 21:10:31','2025-01-25 02:18:29','2025-01-25 02:18:29',NULL),(105,'About Grzegorz & Ania','about-gregorz-anna',NULL,'At Quo Vadis Retail, we pride ourselves on offering a unique shopping experience rooted in tradition, quality, and exceptional customer service. Owners Grzegorz and Ania bring a personal touch to the store, combining their diverse backgrounds and passion for community to create a destination that truly stands out.\r\nOur journey began when a local real estate agent approached us with the opportunity to take over the store. Known for my dedication to soccer as both a player and coach, and with a strong connection to the community, I saw this as a chance to expand our impact. With my fatherΓÇÖs experience in the travel industry and AniaΓÇÖs expertise in aloe herbal products through Forever Products, we decided to embrace the challenge and make Quo Vadis our own.\r\nOur main focus is and always will be on you, our valued customer. At Quo Vadis Retail, the client is the most important person in the store. Whether youΓÇÖre browsing our diverse selection of products or seeking assistance, weΓÇÖre here to ensure your needs are met with care and professionalism.\r\nThank you for choosing Quo Vadis Retail. We look forward to serving you and continuing to be a trusted part of this vibrant community.\r\nQuo Vadis RetailΓÇô Where Tradition Meets Exceptional Service.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,66,70,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-24 21:22:19','2025-03-12 14:23:55',NULL,NULL),(106,'Houzpital Mission Statement','houzpital-mission-statement',NULL,'Our Mission Is To Empower Clients With The Knowledge They Require To Maintain Healthier Spaces',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-26 17:55:59','2025-01-26 17:55:59',NULL,NULL),(107,'Our Mission','mission-statement-for-pr-construction',NULL,'At PR Construction, our mission is to redefine the standards of excellence in the construction industry. We are driven by a relentless commitment to perfection, refusing to settle for anything less than 100%. Every project we undertake is a testament to our unwavering dedication, meticulous craftsmanship, and pursuit of absolute precision.\r\n\r\nWe believe that half-measures, compromises, and \"good enough\" have no place in the work we do. From concept to completion, we hold ourselves accountable to the highest standards, ensuring that every detail reflects our core belief: true excellence is found in perfection.\r\n\r\nAt PR Construction, we donΓÇÖt just build structuresΓÇöwe build trust, set benchmarks, and create enduring legacies of quality and excellence.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 01:11:31','2025-03-08 17:52:39',NULL,NULL),(108,'Hector Ruiz ΓÇô Vice President of PR Construction','hector-ruiz-vice-president-of-pr-construction',NULL,'Hector Ruiz, Vice President of PR Construction, brings decades of experience and an unwavering commitment to excellence in the construction industry. Throughout his career, Hector worked with several companies, gaining extensive knowledge of the field but becoming increasingly disillusioned with the widespread practices of cutting corners and delivering subpar work.\r\nDriven by his belief that every customer deserves the best craftsmanship and respect for their investment, Hector decided to take a stand against mediocrity. Frustrated with witnessing \"half-done\" projects and a lack of accountability, he partnered with his son to establish PR Construction. Together, they founded the company on the principle of perfectionism, with a mission to deliver 100% quality in every project, every time.\r\nHectorΓÇÖs leadership, integrity, and passion for craftsmanship are the foundation of PR Construction. He ensures that every project reflects the companyΓÇÖs core values: meticulous attention to detail, superior quality, and customer satisfaction. With Hector at the helm, PR Construction has become a trusted name in the industry, known for raising the bar and setting a new standard of excellence.\r\n\r\n\r\nH├⌐ctor Ruiz ΓÇô Vicepresidente de PR Construction\r\n\r\nH├⌐ctor Ruiz, vicepresidente de PR Construction, aporta d├⌐cadas de experiencia y un compromiso inquebrantable con la excelencia en la industria de la construcci├│n. A lo largo de su carrera, H├⌐ctor trabaj├│ con varias empresas, adquiriendo un vasto conocimiento del campo, pero sinti├⌐ndose cada vez m├ís desilusionado por las pr├ícticas generalizadas de recortar esquinas y entregar trabajos de baja calidad.\r\nImpulsado por su creencia de que cada cliente merece la mejor mano de obra y respeto por su inversi├│n, H├⌐ctor decidi├│ tomar una postura contra la mediocridad. Frustrado por presenciar proyectos \"a medias\" y una falta de responsabilidad, se asoci├│ con su hijo para fundar PR Construction. Juntos, establecieron la empresa sobre el principio del perfeccionismo, con la misi├│n de entregar un 100% de calidad en cada proyecto, siempre.\r\nEl liderazgo, la integridad y la pasi├│n de H├⌐ctor por la artesan├¡a son la base de PR Construction. ├ël asegura que cada proyecto refleje los valores fundamentales de la empresa: atenci├│n meticulosa a los detalles, calidad superior y satisfacci├│n del cliente. Con H├⌐ctor al mando, PR Construction se ha convertido en un nombre de confianza en la industria, conocido por elevar el est├índar y establecer un nuevo nivel de excelencia.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 01:55:21','2025-01-27 01:55:21',NULL,NULL),(109,'Home Improvement License','home-improvement-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-16','1',10,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 03:00:24','2025-03-16 19:12:50',NULL,NULL),(110,'Home Improvement License','home-improvement-license-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 03:06:54','2025-03-21 22:33:39',NULL,NULL),(111,'Click Here to Verify','dcp-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-16','1',10,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 03:08:55','2025-03-16 19:13:05',NULL,NULL),(112,'What types of construction services do you provide?','what-types-of-construction-services-do-you-provide',NULL,'We specialize in a wide range of services, including remodeling, restoration, demolition, bathroom and kitchen renovations, flooring, crown molding, window installation, painting, siding, and door installation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 08:25:23','2025-01-27 08:25:23',NULL,NULL),(113,'What sets PR Construction apart from other construction companies?','what-sets-pr-construction-apart-from-other-construction-companies',NULL,'What sets PR Construction apart from other construction companies?\r\nOur commitment to perfection. We donΓÇÖt believe in cutting corners or settling for anything less than 100%. Every project is handled with meticulous attention to detail and craftsmanship to ensure the highest quality results.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 08:25:53','2025-01-27 08:25:53',NULL,NULL),(114,'How do you ensure the quality of your work?','how-do-you-ensure-the-quality-of-your-work',NULL,'We maintain strict quality control throughout the project, use high-quality materials, and employ skilled professionals who share our dedication to excellence.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 08:26:28','2025-01-27 08:26:28',NULL,NULL),(115,'Can you handle both residential and commercial projects?','can-you-handle-both-residential-and-commercial-projects',NULL,'Yes, we work on both residential and commercial projects, regardless of size. Whether itΓÇÖs a small home improvement or a large-scale commercial renovation, we deliver the same level of quality and precision.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 08:27:03','2025-01-27 08:27:03',NULL,NULL),(116,'Are you licensed and insured?','are-you-licensed-and-insured',NULL,'Absolutely! PR Construction is fully licensed and insured, ensuring peace of mind for our clients.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 08:29:17','2025-01-27 08:29:17',NULL,NULL),(117,'How do you handle project timelines?','how-do-you-handle-project-timelines',NULL,'We provide a detailed project schedule at the start and keep clients informed of progress. While we strive to meet deadlines, our priority is delivering flawless results without compromising quality.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 08:29:50','2025-01-27 08:29:50',NULL,NULL),(118,'Do you offer free estimates?','do-you-offer-free-estimates',NULL,'Yes, we offer free, no-obligation estimates. WeΓÇÖll assess your project, discuss your goals, and provide a detailed breakdown of costs.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-27 08:30:26','2025-01-27 08:30:26',NULL,NULL),(119,'What areas do you serve?','what-are