ding on the project, so feel free to ask during your consultation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 00:01:33','2025-01-28 00:01:33',NULL,NULL),(182,'Can you help with design ideas and material selection?','can-you-help-with-design-ideas-and-material-selection-2',NULL,'Absolutely. We offer guidance on design and material selection to ensure your project matches your vision, style, and budget.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 00:01:33','2025-01-28 00:01:33',NULL,NULL),(183,'How do you communicate with clients during a project?','how-do-you-communicate-with-clients-during-a-project-2',NULL,'Communication is key to our process. We provide regular updates, are available for questions at any time, and ensure youΓÇÖre involved in all major decisions.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 00:01:33','2025-01-28 00:01:33',NULL,NULL),(184,'WhatΓÇÖs your pricing structure?','whats-your-pricing-structure-2',NULL,'Our pricing is project-specific, based on scope, materials, and complexity. We believe in transparent pricing and provide detailed quotes upfront so there are no surprises.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 00:01:33','2025-01-28 00:01:33',NULL,NULL),(185,'Can you handle emergency repairs?','can-you-handle-emergency-repairs-2',NULL,'Yes, we offer emergency repair services. If you have an urgent issue, contact us immediately, and weΓÇÖll do our best to assist.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 00:01:33','2025-01-28 00:01:33',NULL,NULL),(186,'Do you handle permits and inspections?','do-you-handle-permits-and-inspections-2',NULL,'Yes, we take care of obtaining necessary permits and scheduling inspections to ensure your project complies with local regulations and codes.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 00:01:33','2025-01-28 00:01:33',NULL,NULL),(187,'How can I get started with PR Construction?','how-can-i-get-started-with-pr-construction-2',NULL,'How can I get started with PR Construction?\r\nItΓÇÖs simple! Contact us to schedule a free consultation. WeΓÇÖll discuss your project goals, provide a detailed estimate, and guide you through the next steps.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 00:01:33','2025-01-28 00:01:33',NULL,NULL),(188,'Our Mission','our-mission-2',NULL,'Making people aware of their innovative ideas and supporting them in turning ideas into viable products.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:15:45','2025-01-28 15:15:45',NULL,NULL),(189,'About Me','about-me',NULL,'Wil Jacques is an Mechinal Engineer, MBA, USPTO Registered Patent Agent, and senior-level intellectual property subject matter expert with over 25 years of engineering, strategy development, business development & sales,  patenting, commercialization, and licensing experience.\r\nHis love for turning dreams into reality and deep passion for innovation led him to establish Emanus with his professional colleagues in 1999.\r\nToday, Emanus is a leader in the U.S. and a sought-after contributor to the innovation community.\r\n\r\nEclectic is the word that best describes this passionate founder who has grown Emanus into the go-to IP partner for hundreds of businesses in the USA.\r\n\r\nWilΓÇÖs stints with Naval Sea Systems Command (NAVSEA), Prudential, Union Carbide/Praxair, Competitive Technologies, IP Finance, Nerac, CPA Global, and Sun Life Financial before founding Emanus, have helped him build a diverse network of professionals and build his business acumen.\r\nHis specific competencies include patented technology valuation, market due diligence, business opportunity identification, and licensing negotiations as an agent of the patent and/or technology owner.',NULL,'2025-01-28','1',16,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:18:09','2025-01-28 15:46:13',NULL,NULL),(190,'What services does Emanus offer to help protect and commercialize my invention?','what-services-does-emanus-offer-to-help-protect-and-commercialize-my-invention',NULL,'Emanus provides a comprehensive suite of services, including idea discussion and valuation, patent and prior art searches, drafting of provisional and regular patent applications, prosecution and response to office actions, and assistance with product development and commercialization strategies.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:25:40','2025-01-28 15:25:40',NULL,NULL),(191,'How do I know if my invention is patentable?','how-do-i-know-if-my-invention-is-patentable',NULL,'To be patentable, an invention must be novel, non-obvious, and useful. Emanus conducts thorough patentability searches to assess these criteria and ensure that your idea doesn\'t infringe on existing patents, helping you avoid future legal disputes.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:26:34','2025-01-28 15:26:34',NULL,NULL),(192,'What is the difference between a provisional and a non-provisional patent application?','what-is-the-difference-between-a-provisional-and-a-non-provisional-patent-application',NULL,'A provisional patent application provides a priority date for your invention and offers temporary protection for one year, allowing you to test and refine your idea. It is not a substitute for a non-provisional (regular) patent application, which is necessary for long-term protection.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:28:15','2025-01-28 15:28:15',NULL,NULL),(193,'Can I develop and market my product without obtaining patent protection?','can-i-develop-and-market-my-product-without-obtaining-patent-protection',NULL,'While it\'s legally permissible to develop and market a product without patent protection if it meets patentability and non-infringement criteria, doing so carries the risk of competitors copying your idea. Obtaining a patent secures exclusive rights to produce, develop, license, and sell your invention, preventing others from exploiting it without your consent.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:29:13','2025-01-28 15:29:13',NULL,NULL),(194,'What types of intellectual property protection does Emanus assist with?','what-types-of-intellectual-property-protection-does-emanus-assist-with',NULL,'Emanus assists with various forms of intellectual property protection, including patents, trademarks, and copyrights. They guide clients through the processes of securing these protections to safeguard their innovations.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:30:04','2025-01-28 15:30:04',NULL,NULL),(195,'How can I avoid common mistakes during the patent application process?','how-can-i-avoid-common-mistakes-during-the-patent-application-process',NULL,'Common mistakes in patent applications include vague descriptions, missing drawings, and fee errors. Emanus emphasizes the importance of providing detailed descriptions, including necessary illustrations, and ensuring all fees are correctly paid to avoid rejections.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:30:44','2025-01-28 15:30:44',NULL,NULL),(196,'What is the process for registering a trademark, and how much does it cost?','what-is-the-process-for-registering-a-trademark-and-how-much-does-it-cost',NULL,'Registering a trademark involves selecting a unique mark, conducting a thorough search to ensure it\'s not already in use, and filing an application with the appropriate authorities. In the USA, the filing fee ranges from $250 to $350 per class of goods or services.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 15:31:22','2025-01-28 15:31:22',NULL,NULL),(197,'President/Founder','presidentfounder',NULL,'IΓÇÖve been working alongside my father, Hector Ruiz, since I was 12 years old, learning the importance of quality craftsmanship and affordability. Those lessons inspired me to start PR Construction LLC, where I am proud to serve as President and continue our family tradition of excellence.\r\nI believe in clear communication and always take the time to explain project details to ensure my customers fully understand whatΓÇÖs needed to get the job done right. My goal is always the same: to deliver exceptional results on every project, no matter the size, while exceeding expectations with quality work and outstanding service.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 17:15:54','2025-01-28 17:15:54',NULL,NULL),(198,'CT Home Improvement','ct-home-improvement',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',9,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-28 17:38:02','2025-01-28 17:38:02',NULL,NULL),(199,'Asbestos Contractors Certificate','asbestos-contractors-certificate',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-30 01:15:26','2025-01-30 01:15:26',NULL,NULL),(200,'Click Here to Verify','dept-of-consumer-protection-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-16','1',10,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-30 01:22:39','2025-03-16 19:10:13',NULL,NULL),(201,'CT Lead Abatement Contractor','ct-lead-abatement-contractor',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-30 02:31:02','2025-01-30 02:31:02',NULL,NULL),(202,'CT HIC License','ct-hic-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-16','1',10,1,71,NULL,NULL,'2025-01-30 02:43:33','2025-03-16 19:12:11',NULL,NULL),(205,'The Mission of MPM Electrical','my-misson',NULL,'At Making Power Moves, LLC, our mission is to deliver high-quality, reliable electrical services tailored to the specific needs of our clients. We are committed to safety, professionalism, and customer satisfaction, ensuring that every project is completed to the highest standards.\r\n\r\nFor more information or to schedule a service, please contact us at 959-599-8836 or info@makingpowermoveselectrical.com.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 20:48:07','2025-12-02 17:05:51',NULL,NULL),(206,'What areas do you serve?','what-areas-do-you-serve-3',NULL,'What areas do you serve?\r\nWe proudly serve New Haven County, Hartford County, Litchfield County, and Bridgeport County in Connecticut.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 20:58:22','2025-02-01 20:58:22',NULL,NULL),(207,'Do you offer emergency electrical services?','do-you-offer-emergency-electrical-services',NULL,'Yes, we provide 24/7 emergency services to address any urgent electrical issues you may encounter.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 20:59:02','2025-02-01 20:59:02',NULL,NULL),(208,'Are your electricians certified?','are-your-electricians-certified',NULL,'Absolutely. Our team consists of certified electricians with over 11 years of experience, ensuring professional and reliable service.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 20:59:46','2025-02-01 20:59:46',NULL,NULL),(209,'Can you install EV chargers at my home or business?','can-you-install-ev-chargers-at-my-home-or-business',NULL,'Yes, we specialize in installing EV chargers tailored to the specific needs of both residential and commercial clients.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 21:00:26','2025-02-01 21:00:26',NULL,NULL),(210,'What types of electrical installations do you handle?','what-types-of-electrical-installations-do-you-handle',NULL,'We handle a wide range of electrical installations, including new construction projects, panel service upgrades, and more.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 21:01:12','2025-02-01 21:01:12',NULL,NULL),(211,'How can I request a quote for a project?','how-can-i-request-a-quote-for-a-project',NULL,'You can request a quote by calling us at 959-599-8836 or emailing info@makingpowermoveselectrical.com.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 21:02:20','2025-02-01 21:02:20',NULL,NULL),(212,'Do you offer maintenance services for commercial properties?','do-you-offer-maintenance-services-for-commercial-properties',NULL,'Yes, we develop customized maintenance plans to keep electrical systems at optimal performance, reducing the risk of downtime and costly repairs.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-01 21:05:08','2025-02-01 21:05:08',NULL,NULL),(213,'Sobre M├¡','sobre-mi',NULL,'┬íHola! Soy Cecelia Sanchez, fundadora y due├▒a de Santo Domingo Stylist LLC. Con m├ís de 20 a├▒os de experiencia en la industria de la belleza, mi pasi├│n siempre ha sido transformar el cabello y realzar la belleza ├║nica de cada cliente.\r\n\r\nMi camino en la peluquer├¡a comenz├│ en Santo Domingo, donde aprend├¡ las bases del estilismo y perfeccion├⌐ mis t├⌐cnicas en cortes, color y tratamientos capilares. Con ganas de seguir creciendo profesionalmente, me mud├⌐ a Nueva York, donde trabaj├⌐ en varios salones reconocidos, adquiriendo a├║n m├ís experiencia en las ├║ltimas tendencias y t├⌐cnicas avanzadas del sector.\r\n\r\nDespu├⌐s de a├▒os de perfeccionar mi arte y construir una clientela fiel, decid├¡ seguir mi sue├▒o de tener mi propio sal├│n. Fue as├¡ como me establec├¡ en Connecticut y abr├¡ Santo Domingo Stylist LLC, un espacio donde la belleza, la salud capilar y el servicio excepcional son la prioridad.\r\n\r\nAdem├ís de ser empresaria, soy madre de tres hijos, lo que me ha ense├▒ado la importancia del esfuerzo, la dedicaci├│n y el amor por lo que hago. Mi objetivo es que cada cliente que cruce nuestras puertas se sienta especial y salga con una sonrisa, sabiendo que su cabello ha recibido el mejor cuidado posible.\r\n\r\nGracias por confiar en m├¡ y en mi equipo. ┬íEspero verte pronto en Santo Domingo Stylist LLC! ≡ƒÆçΓ£¿',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 02:30:26','2025-02-11 02:30:26',NULL,NULL),(214,'Declaraci├│n de Misi├│n de Santo Domingo Stylist','declaracion-de-mision-de-santo-domingo-stylist',NULL,'En Santo Domingo Hairstylist, nuestra misi├│n es resaltar la belleza y la confianza de cada cliente a trav├⌐s de un estilismo experto, cortes precisos y t├⌐cnicas innovadoras de color. Con ra├¡ces en la herencia y el arte dominicano, nos especializamos en crear un cabello impecable y saludable con pasi├│n y creatividad. Nuestro compromiso es brindar una experiencia de sal├│n excepcional donde el estilo se une con la cultura, y cada cliente se va sinti├⌐ndose empoderado, elegante y radiante.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 02:32:06','2025-02-11 02:32:06',NULL,NULL),(215,'┬┐Qu├⌐ tipo de cortes ofrecen?','que-tipo-de-cortes-ofrecen',NULL,'Ofrecemos cortes de precisi├│n para mujeres, hombres y ni├▒os, dise├▒ados para realzar la forma y textura natural del cabello. Utilizamos t├⌐cnicas avanzadas para garantizar un corte limpio y favorecedor.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:15:18','2025-02-11 06:15:18',NULL,NULL),(216,'┬┐C├│mo puedo saber qu├⌐ tipo de coloraci├│n es mejor para m├¡?','como-puedo-saber-que-tipo-de-coloracion-es-mejor-para-mi',NULL,'Brindamos asesor├¡as personalizadas para ayudarte a elegir el mejor servicio de coloraci├│n seg├║n tu tono de piel, textura capilar y preferencias. Ofrecemos retoque de ra├¡ces, color completo, mechas, balayage, reflejos, ombre y correcci├│n de color.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:15:56','2025-02-11 06:15:56',NULL,NULL),(217,'┬┐Cu├ínto tiempo dura un tratamiento de keratina y c├│mo debo cuidarlo?','cuanto-tiempo-dura-un-tratamiento-de-keratina-y-como-debo-cuidarlo',NULL,'Los tratamientos de keratina y alisado pueden durar entre 3 y 6 meses, dependiendo del tipo de cabello y el mantenimiento posterior. Se recomienda usar productos sin sulfatos y evitar el exceso de calor para prolongar sus efectos.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:16:40','2025-02-11 06:16:40',NULL,NULL),(218,'┬┐Qu├⌐ son los peinados protectores y por qu├⌐ son importantes?','que-son-los-peinados-protectores-y-por-que-son-importantes',NULL,'Los peinados protectores est├ín dise├▒ados para minimizar la manipulaci├│n del cabello, reduciendo el quiebre y protegi├⌐ndolo de factores ambientales. Ejemplos incluyen trenzas, torsadas y recogidos, ideales para mantener la salud capilar y favorecer el crecimiento.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:17:20','2025-02-11 06:17:20',NULL,NULL),(219,'┬┐Con qu├⌐ frecuencia debo hacerme un tratamiento de hidrataci├│n profunda?','con-que-frecuencia-debo-hacerme-un-tratamiento-de-hidratacion-profunda',NULL,'Se recomienda un tratamiento de hidrataci├│n profunda al menos una vez al mes para mantener el cabello saludable, mejorar su elasticidad y prevenir el quiebre. Para cabello seco o tratado qu├¡micamente, puede ser necesario con mayor frecuencia.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:18:04','2025-02-11 06:18:04',NULL,NULL),(220,'┬┐C├│mo se realiza la depilaci├│n de cejas con cera?','como-se-realiza-la-depilacion-de-cejas-con-cera',NULL,'┬┐C├│mo se realiza la depilaci├│n de cejas con cera?\r\n\r\nUtilizamos una t├⌐cnica precisa para dar forma a tus cejas de acuerdo con la estructura de tu rostro. La cera elimina el vello desde la ra├¡z, dejando un acabado limpio y natural con una duraci├│n de varias semanas',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:18:32','2025-02-11 06:18:32',NULL,NULL),(221,'┬┐Ofrecen servicios de peinado para bodas y eventos especiales?','ofrecen-servicios-de-peinado-para-bodas-y-eventos-especiales',NULL,'S├¡, contamos con peinados exclusivos para novias y eventos especiales, adaptados a cada estilo y preferencia. Recomendamos agendar una consulta previa para asegurarnos de que el resultado sea perfecto para tu gran d├¡a.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:19:36','2025-02-11 06:19:36',NULL,NULL),(222,'┬┐Cu├ínto tiempo dura un secado profesional y qu├⌐ beneficios tiene?','cuanto-tiempo-dura-un-secado-profesional-y-que-beneficios-tiene',NULL,'┬┐Cu├ínto tiempo dura un secado profesional y qu├⌐ beneficios tiene?\r\n\r\nUn secado profesional puede durar varios d├¡as dependiendo del tipo de cabello y las condiciones clim├íticas. Ayuda a suavizar la textura, reducir el frizz y dar un acabado elegante y duradero.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:20:08','2025-02-11 06:20:08',NULL,NULL),(223,'┬┐Necesito hacer una cita previa o aceptan clientes sin cita?','necesito-hacer-una-cita-previa-o-aceptan-clientes-sin-cita',NULL,'Recomendamos agendar una cita previa para garantizar disponibilidad, especialmente para servicios de coloraci├│n, tratamientos y peinados para eventos. Sin embargo, aceptamos clientes sin cita seg├║n disponibilidad.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:20:55','2025-02-11 06:20:55',NULL,NULL),(224,'┬┐Necesito hacer una cita previa o aceptan clientes sin cita?','necesito-hacer-una-cita-previa-o-aceptan-clientes-sin-cita-2',NULL,'Recomendamos agendar una cita previa para garantizar disponibilidad, especialmente para servicios de coloraci├│n, tratamientos y peinados para eventos. Sin embargo, aceptamos clientes sin cita seg├║n disponibilidad.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,81,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-11 06:21:28','2025-02-11 06:21:28',NULL,NULL),(225,'Our Mission','our-mission-3',NULL,'At Swag Custom Rides, we stand out not only for our exceptional automotive work but also for our deep commitment to empowering kids with learning disabilities. We offer these young individuals the chance to gain hands-on experience in car restoration, while also building valuable skills and confidence. Beyond the shop, we actively engage in community events, giving our kids the opportunity to participate and connect with others. We also prioritize supporting local businesses and fostering a sense of community, ensuring that every project and event weΓÇÖre part of contributes to making a positive impact locally. At our shop, itΓÇÖs about more than just carsΓÇöitΓÇÖs about creating opportunities, building relationships, and giving back.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,78,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 16:41:35','2025-02-15 16:41:35',NULL,NULL),(226,'About Me','about-me-2',NULL,'Kenneth Rivera is the Director of Marketing and Head of the Detail Shop at Swag Rides, bringing a meticulous level of professionalism and a creative edge to everything he does. With a keen eye for branding and design, Kenneth excels in brand management, ensuring Swag Rides stands out in a competitive market. His expertise as a graphic designer and content creator allows him to craft visually compelling campaigns that captivate and engage audiences.\r\n\r\nBeyond his marketing acumen, Kenneth is a true foodie, always on the lookout for the next great culinary experience. His passion for philanthropy drives him to give back to the community, using his skills and influence to make a positive impact. Whether heΓÇÖs perfecting the art of car detailing, shaping the brandΓÇÖs image, or creating dynamic content, KennethΓÇÖs dedication and creativity set him apart as a leader in his field.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,78,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 16:50:08','2025-02-15 16:50:08',NULL,NULL),(227,'What services does Swag Detailers offer?','what-services-does-swag-detailers-offer',NULL,'Swag Detailers specializes in premium auto detailing services and offers a range of auto care supplies.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,78,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 18:23:34','2025-02-15 18:23:34',NULL,NULL),(228,'Where is Swag Detailers located?','where-is-swag-detailers-located',NULL,'Where is Swag Detailers located?\r\nSwag Detailers is based in New Britain, Connecticut, United States.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,78,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 18:24:03','2025-02-15 18:24:03',NULL,NULL),(229,'Does Swag Detailers provide any educational programs?','does-swag-detailers-provide-any-educational-programs',NULL,'Yes, Swag Detailers, through its affiliate SWAG Custom Rides, offers hands-on learning experiences for kids and teens, including those with learning disabilities.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,78,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 19:01:36','2025-02-15 19:01:36',NULL,NULL),(230,'Is Swag Detailers involved in any community initiatives?','is-swag-detailers-involved-in-any-community-initiatives',NULL,'Yes, SWAG Custom Rides is recognized as the first and only automotive custom restoration non-profit shop in America, focusing on restoring vehicles while transforming lives.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,78,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 19:02:14','2025-02-15 19:02:14',NULL,NULL),(231,'How can I book an appointment with Swag Detailers?','how-can-i-book-an-appointment-with-swag-detailers',NULL,'To schedule an appointment, you can visit their official website or contact them directly through their listed phone number or email address.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,78,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 19:03:23','2025-02-15 19:03:23',NULL,NULL),(232,'Test blog 111','test-blog-111',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">Test blog 111</span></p>',NULL,'2025-02-15','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 22:41:17','2025-04-27 21:14:06',NULL,NULL),(234,'Test blog 333','test-blog-333',NULL,'Test blog 333',NULL,'2025-02-17','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-15 22:42:04','2025-02-15 22:42:04',NULL,NULL),(235,'Super Lawyer','super-lawyer',NULL,'I founded and head the Moynahan Law Firm, Waterbury, Connecticut.I have earned and have become a successful trial lawyer, earning the Super Lawyer of New England and Connecticut awards from 2009 to 2012 and Best Criminal Defense Attorney accolade in 2013. I am also the CEO and owner of Moynahan Partners, which offers business development consultancy, identifying strategic business partnerships and funding sources.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 13:58:01','2025-02-23 13:58:01',NULL,NULL),(236,'Our Mission','our-mission-4',NULL,'At The Moynahan Law Firm, our focus is on building long term relationships with our clients and within the law community in the region. We earn our relationships due to the trust we develop and the results we produce. We talk with our clients. We hear what you have to say. We work closely with you. We take the time to understand what your needs are, and together, we identify the goals. Our role is to provide you with the counsel and advice you need to reach those goals. Selectively and strategically, we have built our law firm to offer our clients the breadth and experience of a full-service law firm while remaining committed to being accessible and responsive to our clientsΓÇÖ needs.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 14:59:10','2025-02-23 14:59:10',NULL,NULL),(237,'What types of cases does Moynahan Law Firm handle?','what-types-of-cases-does-moynahan-law-firm-handle',NULL,'We specialize in both personal injury cases (like car, motorcycle, bus, and truck accidents; medical malpractice; slip and fall incidents; and more) as well as criminal defense matters (including charges related to murder, sexual assault, possession, and domestic violence).',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 16:16:58','2025-02-23 16:16:58',NULL,NULL),(238,'What is The Moynahan Method?','what-is-the-moynahan-method',NULL,'The Moynahan Method is our unique, client-centered approach. It means deep listening, personalized legal strategies through our Priority Individual Plan (PIP), and a commitment to treating every client with dignity and respect.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 16:20:52','2025-02-23 16:20:52',NULL,NULL),(239,'How do I schedule a consultation or case evaluation?','how-do-i-schedule-a-consultation-or-case-evaluation',NULL,'You can easily get in touch by calling (203) 597-6364 or filling out our online contact form for a no-obligation case evaluation. WeΓÇÖre here to discuss your case and outline how we can help.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 16:21:52','2025-02-23 16:21:52',NULL,NULL),(240,'What should I expect during my initial consultation?','what-should-i-expect-during-my-initial-consultation',NULL,'During your consultation, youΓÇÖll receive a comprehensive, no-obligation evaluation of your case. WeΓÇÖll listen to your unique concerns, explain the legal process, and discuss the potential strategies tailored to your situation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 16:23:12','2025-02-23 16:23:12',NULL,NULL),(241,'What are your office hours and where are you located?','what-are-your-office-hours-and-where-are-you-located',NULL,'Our office is located in Waterbury, CT at 255 Bank St Suite 2-A. We are open Monday through Friday from 9:00 am to 5:30 pm.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 16:24:08','2025-02-23 16:24:08',NULL,NULL),(242,'Navigating Legal Challenges: Comprehensive Services at Moynahan Law','navigating-legal-challenges-comprehensive-services-at-moynahan-law',NULL,'When life throws unexpected challenges your wayΓÇöwhether through a personal injury accident or a criminal chargeΓÇöthe need for steadfast, expert legal guidance becomes undeniable. At Moynahan Law, we understand that every client\'s situation is unique. ThatΓÇÖs why our comprehensive services in personal injury and criminal defense are delivered with a commitment to personalized care and relentless advocacy. In this blog, we explore the range of services we offer and explain how our unique approach, known as The Moynahan Method, sets us apart.\r\nA Commitment to Personal Injury Advocacy\r\nAccidents can change lives in an instant. Whether youΓÇÖre recovering from a car crash, a slip and fall, or a more complex case of medical malpractice, our team is here to ensure that you get the justice and compensation you deserve.\r\nOur Personal Injury Services\r\nAt Moynahan Law, we provide a wide array of personal injury legal services designed to help you navigate the aftermath of an accident. Our practice areas include:\r\n* Car Accidents: Navigating the complexities of auto insurance claims and liability can be overwhelming. We fight for your right to full compensation for medical expenses, lost wages, and pain and suffering.\r\n* Motorcycle, Bus, and Truck Accidents: Each mode of transportation brings its own challenges. Our experienced team understands the nuances of each case, ensuring that every client receives tailored legal advice.\r\n* WorkersΓÇÖ Compensation: If youΓÇÖve been injured on the job, securing your rightful benefits is essential. We advocate for workers who deserve a safe work environment and fair compensation when accidents occur.\r\n* Medical Malpractice: When healthcare providers fail to meet the standard of careΓÇöresulting in harmΓÇöour firm steps in. From misdiagnoses, such as failure to diagnose breast cancer, to other critical oversights, we hold medical professionals accountable.\r\n* Other Injury Cases: Whether itΓÇÖs a slip and fall accident, wrongful death, dog bite, burn injury, spinal cord damage, construction accident, drug accident, or bicycle accident, our comprehensive approach ensures no detail is overlooked.\r\nEach case is treated with the attention it deserves, and we work tirelessly to build a compelling case that underscores the negligence or wrongdoing involved.\r\nDefending Your Rights with Expertise\r\nFacing criminal charges can be one of the most daunting experiences of your life. The stakes are high, and the impact on your future can be profound. At Moynahan Law, we provide robust criminal defense services to protect your rights and secure the best possible outcome.\r\nOur Criminal Defense Services\r\nOur criminal defense practice covers a broad spectrum of charges, ensuring that regardless of your situation, you have an advocate who understands the legal system inside and out. Our services include:\r\n* Serious Charges: We represent clients facing charges as severe as murder or sexual assault, where every decision and every piece of evidence can significantly affect your future.\r\n* Possession and Domestic Violence Cases: Accusations related to possession or domestic violence require a precise legal strategy. We are dedicated to protecting your reputation and your rights, ensuring that your voice is heard in every courtroom proceeding.\r\n* Specialized Areas: Our expertise also extends to handling domestic violence cases with additional complexities such as breach of peace, assault in DV cases, and even strangulation charges. Additionally, we address cases involving DCF issues, offering a comprehensive defense in all circumstances.\r\nOur goal is to provide vigorous defense services, ensuring that every legal avenue is explored and every right is defended throughout the process.\r\nThe Moynahan Method: A Personalized Approach to Legal Representation\r\nWhat truly distinguishes Moynahan Law is our client-centered approachΓÇöThe Moynahan Method. We believe that the attorney-client relationship is founded on trust, deep understanding, and a commitment to treating every case with the individual attention it deserves.\r\nWhat Is The Moynahan Method?\r\n* Individualized Strategy: Every clientΓÇÖs situation is unique, which is why we develop a tailored legal strategy for each case. Through our Priority Individual Plan (PIP), we ensure that you receive dedicated, one-on-one attention from the very beginning.\r\n* Deep Listening: We take the time to listen to your fears, frustrations, and aspirations. This ensures that we fully understand the circumstances of your case and can advocate effectively on your behalf.\r\n* Transparent Communication: Our commitment to keeping you informed every step of the way means you never feel left in the dark. We explain the legal process clearly and work closely with you to build a strategy that reflects your personal needs and goals.\r\n* Result-Oriented Advocacy: At the heart of our practice is a focus on achieving tangible resultsΓÇöwhether itΓÇÖs securing a favorable settlement in a personal injury case or successfully defending your rights in a criminal trial.\r\nThis method isnΓÇÖt just a slogan; itΓÇÖs the cornerstone of how we serve our community. We understand that legal challenges can be incredibly stressful, and our approach is designed to provide reassurance, clarity, and a path forward.\r\nWhy Choose Moynahan Law?\r\nChoosing the right legal representation is crucial when your future is on the line. HereΓÇÖs why clients across Waterbury, CT, and beyond trust Moynahan Law:\r\n* Experience and Expertise: With years of practice in both personal injury and criminal defense, our firm has a proven track record of success. We understand the intricacies of the law and leverage our experience to benefit every client.\r\n* Community-Focused: Our roots in Waterbury and the surrounding areas mean we are deeply invested in our communityΓÇÖs wellbeing. We strive not only to win cases but also to restore lives and build lasting relationships.\r\n* Comprehensive Support: From the initial consultation through the resolution of your case, we provide comprehensive legal support. Whether youΓÇÖre dealing with a sudden accident or a complex criminal charge, weΓÇÖre here for you.\r\nTake the First Step Toward Resolution\r\nIf you or a loved one is facing a legal challengeΓÇöbe it the aftermath of a personal injury or the stress of criminal chargesΓÇöreach out to us today. At Moynahan Law, our doors are always open for those who need dependable legal counsel and a compassionate ear. Call us at (203) 597-6364 or visit our office at 134 Highland Ave, Waterbury, CT 06708 to schedule your consultation.\r\nBy choosing Moynahan Law, youΓÇÖre not just hiring an attorneyΓÇöyouΓÇÖre gaining a dedicated partner who will work tirelessly to secure your future and restore your peace of mind.',NULL,'2023-02-06','1',6,1,85,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-23 19:09:22','2025-02-23 19:13:07',NULL,NULL),(243,'faq1','faq1',NULL,'faq1',NULL,'2025-02-24','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:42:50','2025-02-24 14:42:50',NULL,NULL),(244,'faq2','faq2',NULL,'faq2',NULL,'2025-02-24','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:43:08','2025-02-24 14:43:08',NULL,NULL),(245,'faq3','faq3',NULL,'faq3',NULL,'2025-02-24','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:43:23','2025-02-24 14:43:23',NULL,NULL),(246,'faq4','faq4',NULL,'faq4',NULL,'2025-02-24','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:43:39','2025-02-24 14:43:39',NULL,NULL),(247,'faq5','faq5',NULL,'faq5',NULL,'2025-02-24','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:45:29','2025-02-24 14:45:29',NULL,NULL),(248,'faq6','faq6',NULL,'faq6',NULL,'2025-02-27','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:46:28','2025-02-24 14:46:28',NULL,NULL),(249,'faq7','faq7',NULL,'faq7',NULL,'2025-02-19','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:46:43','2025-02-24 14:46:43',NULL,NULL),(251,'faq9','faq9',NULL,'faq9',NULL,'2025-02-20','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-24 14:47:10','2025-02-24 14:47:10',NULL,NULL),(255,'What types of pest control services does ProSource offer?','what-types-of-pest-control-services-does-prosource-offer',NULL,'ProSource Pest Control offers a comprehensive range of services including termite control, rodent elimination, tick and mosquito management, spider extermination, and solutions for a wide array of common household pests like ants, cockroaches, and powder post beetles.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-26 16:18:10','2025-02-26 16:18:10',NULL,NULL),(256,'Are the pest control treatments safe for my family and pets?ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿','are-the-pest-control-treatments-safe-for-my-family-and-pets',NULL,'ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿Yes, safety is our top priority. We use environmentally responsible treatments that are safe for both humans and pets. Our technicians are trained to apply solutions effectively while ensuring the well-being of your family and pets.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-26 16:19:51','2025-02-26 16:19:51',NULL,NULL),(257,'How quickly can I expect results after treatment?ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿','how-quickly-can-i-expect-results-after-treatment',NULL,'The time frame for seeing results can vary depending on the type of pest and the extent of the infestation. Some clients notice improvements immediately, while more entrenched infestations might require a bit longer. Our team will provide a realistic timeline following the initial assessment.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-26 16:20:35','2025-02-26 16:20:35',NULL,NULL),(258,'Do you offer any long-term pest management plans?ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿','do-you-offer-any-long-term-pest-management-plans',NULL,'ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿Yes, we offer customized pest management plans tailored to your specific needs, providing regular inspections and treatments to keep your property pest-free year-round.ΓÇ¿',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-26 16:21:16','2025-02-26 16:21:16',NULL,NULL),(259,'What should I do to prepare my home for a pest control treatment?ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿','what-should-i-do-to-prepare-my-home-for-a-pest-control-treatment',NULL,'Preparation steps can vary by service. Generally, it might involve cleaning certain areas, moving furniture for better access, or securing pets. Your ProSource technician will give you specific instructions prior to your appointment.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-26 16:22:03','2025-02-26 16:22:03',NULL,NULL),(260,'How often should I have my property inspected for pests?ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿','how-often-should-i-have-my-property-inspected-for-pests',NULL,'ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿ΓÇ¿We recommend at least an annual inspection to prevent pest problems before they start. Properties with a history of pest issues or those in high-risk areas may benefit from more frequent inspections.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-26 16:22:47','2025-02-26 16:22:47',NULL,NULL),(261,'About Me','about-me-4',NULL,'<p>Bringing the magic of Christmas to life, one light at a time! As a professional Christmas light installer, I take pride in creating dazzling displays that spread joy, warmth, and the true spirit of the season. My passion for lights goes beyond just decorationΓÇöitΓÇÖs about bringing families together, sparking smiles, and making the holidays even more special. ThereΓÇÖs nothing better than seeing the happiness a beautifully lit home or business brings to others. LetΓÇÖs make this Christmas shine brighter than ever!</p>',NULL,'2024-11-15','1',16,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 16:29:38','2025-06-25 00:29:05',NULL,NULL),(263,'Year-Round Outdoor Illumination: Beyond Christmas Lighting','year-round-outdoor-illumination-beyond-christmas-lighting',NULL,'<p>When people think of outdoor lighting, the first thing that often comes to mind is holiday decorations. However, outdoor lighting is not just for ChristmasΓÇöitΓÇÖs an essential part of home enhancement that can provide beauty, security, and ambiance all year round. At Elite Christmas Lights, we offer more than just holiday lighting. Our services extend to home exterior lighting, landscape lighting, and event lighting, allowing you to transform your property no matter the season. HereΓÇÖs how professional outdoor illumination can elevate your space beyond the holidays. 1. Enhance Your HomeΓÇÖs Curb Appeal A well-lit home stands out in any neighborhood. Strategically placed exterior lighting highlights architectural features, adds warmth, and creates an inviting atmosphere. Whether you want soft, warm lighting to enhance your homeΓÇÖs charm or bold, colorful lights for special occasions, we can design a setup that suits your style. 2. Increase Safety and Security Outdoor lighting is one of the best ways to deter potential intruders. A well-lit home reduces dark hiding spots and improves visibility, making your property safer. Motion-activated lights, pathway illumination, and strategically placed floodlights can provide both security and functionality for your home. 3. Create a Cozy Backyard Oasis Your backyard is an extension of your living space, and with the right lighting, you can enjoy it year-round. Landscape lighting highlights garden features, water elements, and pathways, creating a stunning ambiance for nighttime relaxation or entertainment. From string lights over a patio to LED accents in your garden, the possibilities are endless. 4. Celebrate Special Events Who says dazzling lights are just for Christmas? Outdoor lighting can set the mood for birthdays, weddings, BBQs, and other celebrations. Whether itΓÇÖs soft, romantic lighting for an intimate gathering or vibrant, colorful lights for a big event, we customize setups that make any occasion unforgettable. 5. Energy-Efficient and Low-Maintenance Options Our lighting solutions use energy-efficient LED lights, which provide long-lasting brightness while reducing electricity costs. Plus, with professional installation, you wonΓÇÖt have to worry about burnt-out bulbs or tangled wiresΓÇöwe handle all the maintenance, so your lights always look perfect. Let Your Home Shine Year-Round Whether you want to enhance your homeΓÇÖs exterior, increase security, or create an inviting outdoor space, Elite Christmas Lights has the perfect lighting solution for you. DonΓÇÖt wait for the holiday seasonΓÇöcontact us today to explore how outdoor illumination can transform your home throughout the year!</p>',NULL,'2024-12-20','1',6,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 16:58:08','2025-06-25 01:05:29',NULL,NULL),(264,'What\'s Your Light Removal Process?','whats-your-light-removal-process',NULL,'As part of our full-service lease model, we handle complete removal of all holiday lighting installations. Our professional team returns after the season to carefully take down and properly store all lighting elements. Serving Western and Central Massachusetts and Connecticut, we ensure the same level of expertise in removal as we do in installation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 17:22:55','2025-02-27 17:22:55',NULL,NULL),(265,'What If There\'s an Issue With the Lights?','what-if-theres-an-issue-with-the-lights',NULL,'All our rental lights come with comprehensive maintenance coverage throughout the installation period. Since we exclusively use commercial-grade lighting products, malfunctions are rare. However, if any issues arise, our team will promptly address them at no additional cost as part of our service commitment.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 17:23:41','2025-02-27 17:23:41',NULL,NULL),(266,'What Types of Holiday Lighting Do You Offer?','what-types-of-holiday-lighting-do-you-offer',NULL,'What Types of Holiday Lighting Do You Offer?\r\nWe provide a complete range of holiday lighting solutions including:\r\n\r\nHome exterior lighting\r\nBush and tree lighting\r\nLandscape illumination\r\nGarland and wreath installations\r\n2D and 3D decorative elements\r\nCommercial and residential applications',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 17:24:18','2025-02-27 17:24:18',NULL,NULL),(267,'Can You Help Visualize My Holiday Lighting Project?','can-you-help-visualize-my-holiday-lighting-project',NULL,'We provide expert design consultations to help you envision your perfect holiday lighting display. Our team collaborates with you to understand your preferences and create detailed plans, ensuring you can preview your project before installation. From residential facades to commercial properties, our design process guarantees your complete satisfaction with the final result.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 17:25:10','2025-02-27 17:25:10',NULL,NULL),(268,'What Areas Do You Serve?','what-areas-do-you-serve-4',NULL,'We proudly serve an extensive area across Western and Central Massachusetts and Connecticut, including:\r\n\r\nWestern MA: Berkshire, Hampshire, Hampden, Franklin, and northwest Bristol Counties\r\nCentral MA: Worcester County\r\nConnecticut: All counties (Fairfield, Hartford, Litchfield, Middlesex, New Haven, New London, Tolland, and Windham)',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 17:25:48','2025-02-27 17:25:48',NULL,NULL),(269,'Light Rental Model: Do You Sell Christmas Lights?','light-rental-model-do-you-sell-christmas-lights',NULL,'We operate on a full light lease model. Rather than selling lights, we provide a comprehensive rental service that includes professional installation, maintenance throughout the season, removal, and storage. This ensures you receive top-quality, professionally maintained lighting without the hassle of year-round storage.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 17:26:44','2025-02-27 17:26:44',NULL,NULL),(270,'Is Home Access Required During Installation?','is-home-access-required-during-installation',NULL,'No, you don\'t need to be present during the installation process. Our fully insured professional team can complete the installation while you\'re away, making it convenient for your busy schedule. We handle everything from setup to maintenance and eventual removal.\r\n\r\nOur full-service approach includes:\r\n\r\nProfessional installation\r\nRegular maintenance\r\nComplete removal\r\nOff-season storage\r\nInsurance coverage\r\nComprehensive support\r\nFor inquiries, contact us at 413-564-4847',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 17:27:34','2025-02-27 17:27:34',NULL,NULL),(283,'Life Coach Certification','transforming-the-way-people-connect',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 22:20:02','2025-03-05 00:35:14',NULL,NULL),(284,'Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.','impressions-that-last-connections-that-matter',NULL,'Four years ago, I discovered a staggering fact: 10 billion business cards are printed annually in the U.S., but 82% are discarded within a week. This outdated method of networking needed a modern, impactful replacement. I teamed up with Abdul Aziz, a talented web designer, and later, Zohaib Ullah Baig, a skilled software engineer. Together, we built vBiz Me, not just a digital business card but an experience that tells stories, builds connections, and leaves lasting impressions. More Than Just a Virtual Business Card With vBiz Me, users can: Create Dynamic Intro Videos to share their stories. Add Background Music & Animations for engagement. Integrate Branding & Interactive Elements seamlessly. The goal? To enable users to be able to make an informed decision within seconds not hours, days, or weeks. The Journey Building vBiz Me wasnΓÇÖt easy. We faced challenges, sleepless nights, and moments of doubt. But every obstacle fueled our passion to deliver a platform that redefines networking. Why Emotion Matters We know 95% of decisions are driven by emotion. ThatΓÇÖs why every feature, from animations to intro videos, is designed to create emotional impact and leave a lasting impression. Today & Beyond vBiz Me is empowering individuals and businesses to stand out. With tools like AI-powered video creation and Canva integration, weΓÇÖre just getting started. For me, vBiz Me isnΓÇÖt just a businessΓÇöitΓÇÖs a passion. ItΓÇÖs proof that with vision, determination, and an incredible team, anything is possible. Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.',NULL,'2024-09-22','1',6,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 23:13:29','2025-12-04 00:56:19',NULL,NULL),(285,'Entrepreneur, Innovator and Out of the Box Thinker','entrepreneur-innovator-and-out-of-the-box-thinker',NULL,'<h3>I wasnΓÇÖt handed anything. I built myself through hardship, hard work, and relentless drive. Every obstacle taught me somethingΓÇöand I turned those lessons into a tool that helps others leave a lasting impression in seconds.</h3><h3><strong>vBiz Me</strong>&nbsp;is more than a digital card. ItΓÇÖs a first-impression machine. A conversion tool. A way to stand out and get remembered.</h3><h3>≡ƒö╣ Visionary &amp; Builder ΓÇô I create solutions that break the mold</h3><h3>≡ƒö╣ Sales &amp; Marketing Strategist ΓÇô I turn attention into action</h3><h3>≡ƒö╣ Empowerment Coach ΓÇô I help people level up, fast</h3><h3>≡ƒö╣ Founder ΓÇô Leading with purpose, not just profit</h3><h3>Your brand deserves more than a paper card.</h3><h3><strong>LetΓÇÖs make it unforgettable.</strong></h3><h3><strong>Impressions That Last ΓÇô Connections That Matter.</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 23:23:24','2025-08-02 03:05:56',NULL,NULL),(286,'Science of Well Being','science-of-well-being',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-27 23:28:53','2025-03-05 00:35:58',NULL,NULL),(289,'Click To View My Availability','click-to-see-availability',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-03-16','1',14,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 00:36:22','2025-05-20 15:05:05',NULL,NULL),(290,'What is vBiz Me?','what-is-vbiz-me-2',NULL,'vBiz Me is a next-generation virtual business card (vCard) platform designed to help professionals and businesses make lasting impressions and meaningful connections. Unlike traditional business cards, vBiz Me vCards feature dynamic intro videos, customizable backgrounds, integrated music, and interactive elements.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(291,'How does vBiz Me work?','how-does-vbiz-me-work-2',NULL,'When someone scans your vBiz Me QR code, theyΓÇÖre instantly taken to your personalized digital business card. They can watch your intro video, explore your links, save your contact information, and engage with your contentΓÇöall in seconds.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(292,'What makes vBiz Me different from other digital business cards?','what-makes-vbiz-me-different-from-other-digital-business-cards-2',NULL,'Dynamic intro video that plays immediately upon scanning\r\nCustomizable design with video backgrounds, images, and music\r\nSeamless integration with Canva, Adobe Express, YouTube, and more\r\nAI-powered features for personalization and engagement tracking\r\nInteractive elements like scheduling, contact-saving, and social media links\r\nExclusive scrolling navigation bar that allows potential clients to make informed decisions within secondsΓÇönot days, weeks, or never',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(293,'What is the scrolling navigation bar, and why is it important?','what-is-the-scrolling-navigation-bar-and-why-is-it-important-2',NULL,'The scrolling navigation bar is a revolutionary feature that sets vBiz Me apart. It provides quick and seamless access to all the key sections of your business without requiring visitors to navigate your website. This means no wasted time, no searching through multiple pages, and no frustrationΓÇöjust instant access to the information that matters most.\r\n\r\nWith the scrolling navigation bar, potential clients can quickly find:\r\n\r\nAbout Me ΓÇô A short introduction or business bio\r\nSocial Links ΓÇô Direct access to your social media profiles\r\nPortfolio ΓÇô Showcase your work, products, or past projects\r\nVideos ΓÇô Highlight key content, testimonials, or explainer videos\r\nContact Information ΓÇô Make it easy for people to call, email, or message you\r\nScheduling Links ΓÇô Clients can book an appointment with you instantly\r\nCustom Content Areas ΓÇô Add personalized sections, including promotions, special offers, or branded messaging',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(294,'Why does this matter?','why-does-this-matter-2',NULL,'Because 82% of traditional business cards are thrown away within a week, leaving you with no follow-up and no engagement. vBiz Me changes that by keeping your essential information front and center, allowing potential clients to make informed decisions in secondsΓÇönot days, weeks, or never.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(295,'Can I customize the navigation bar?','can-i-customize-the-navigation-bar-2',NULL,'Yes! You can customize the navigation bar by adding or removing sections based on whatΓÇÖs most relevant to your business or personal brand.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(296,'Can I update my vCard anytime?','can-i-update-my-vcard-anytime-2',NULL,'Yes, your vBiz Me card is fully editable, and you can update it anytime through your account',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(297,'Can I buy vBiz Me cards for my company?','can-i-buy-vbiz-me-cards-for-my-company-2',NULL,'Yes! vBiz Me offers corporate bulk pricing. You can set up vCards for your entire team, ensuring brand consistency and professional networking',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(298,'Can I white-label vBiz Me for my business?','can-i-white-label-vbiz-me-for-my-business-2',NULL,'We offer custom branding and white-labeling options for businesses that want a fully branded experience.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,61,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-01 01:15:53','2025-03-01 01:15:53',NULL,NULL),(299,'How can vBiz Me help my business?','how-can-vbiz-me-help-my-business-2