tomer gets the same level of care and dedication. My team and I take pride in showing up on time, handling your belongings with respect, and getting the job done right. When IΓÇÖm not helping people move into their next chapter, I enjoy spending time with family, staying active, and looking for new ways to improve my business. I believe in honest work, fair prices, and going above and beyond for my customers. If youΓÇÖre looking for a moving company you can trust, give me a call. LetΓÇÖs make your move smooth, easy, and hassle-freeΓÇöRain or Shine!</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,96,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 11:25:52','2025-07-15 03:13:40',NULL,NULL),(372,'Discover the World with One Travel LLC','discover-the-world-with-one-travel-llc',NULL,'Are you dreaming of sandy beaches, historic landmarks, or thrilling adventures? Look no further! One Travel LLC is here to turn your travel dreams into reality. Whether you\'re planning a relaxing getaway, a business trip, or an exciting family vacation, we have the expertise to make your journey smooth and unforgettable.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose One Travel LLC?\r\n\r\nWith so many online booking options, you might wonder why working with a travel agency is still the best choice. HereΓÇÖs why:\r\n\r\nPersonalized Service: We take the time to understand your preferences, budget, and travel goals to craft the perfect itinerary just for you.\r\n\r\nExclusive Deals: We have access to discounts and special packages that arenΓÇÖt available to the public.\r\n\r\nHassle-Free Planning: From booking flights and accommodations to arranging tours and activities, we handle it all.\r\n\r\n24/7 Support: Unexpected travel hiccups? WeΓÇÖre here to assist you anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nTop Destinations We Recommend\r\n\r\nNot sure where to go? Here are some of our top travel picks:\r\n\r\nThe Caribbean ΓÇô Crystal-clear waters, white sandy beaches, and all-inclusive resorts make for the perfect tropical escape.\r\n\r\nEurope ΓÇô Explore the romantic streets of Paris, the historic sites of Rome, or the breathtaking landscapes of Switzerland.\r\n\r\nHawaii ΓÇô Experience the aloha spirit with stunning beaches, volcano hikes, and rich cultural experiences.\r\n\r\nAsia ΓÇô From the bustling streets of Tokyo to the serene beauty of Bali, Asia offers something for every traveler.\r\n\r\nCustom Travel Packages\r\n\r\nWe specialize in creating travel packages tailored to your needs. Whether itΓÇÖs a honeymoon, group tour, cruise, or adventure trip, we ensure every detail is perfect. Plus, we help with:\r\n\r\nVisa and passport assistance\r\n\r\nTravel insurance options\r\n\r\nHotel and flight bookings\r\n\r\nPrivate tours and excursions\r\n\r\nCorporate travel management\r\n\r\nLetΓÇÖs Plan Your Next Adventure!\r\n\r\nTravel should be exciting, not stressful. Let One Travel LLC handle the details so you can focus on making memories. Contact us today to start planning your next getaway!',NULL,NULL,'1',6,66,67,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 14:53:35','2025-03-12 14:53:35',NULL,NULL),(373,'Our Belief','our-belief',NULL,'At Cocoboca, our mission is to revolutionize oral care by harnessing the natural power of unrefined coconut oil. Rooted in ancient Ayurvedic traditions, we are committed to providing a holistic, chemical-free solution that promotes healthier gums, fresher breath, and brighter smiles.\r\n\r\nWe believe in the purity of nature, which is why our products contain only the highest-quality ingredients, free from artificial additives, preservatives, or harsh chemicals. Sustainability is at the heart of our brand, from our eco-friendly packaging to our dedication to ethical sourcing.\r\n\r\nOur goal is simple: to empower individuals to take control of their oral health naturally while fostering a deeper connection between wellness and sustainability. With Cocoboca, a healthier smile isnΓÇÖt just a dreamΓÇöitΓÇÖs a natural reality.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 15:20:18','2025-03-12 15:20:18',NULL,NULL),(374,'Unlock the Power of Nature with Cocoboca','unlock-the-power-of-nature-with-cocoboca',NULL,'In a world filled with artificial ingredients and harsh chemicals, your oral care routine should be as pure as your smile. Welcome to Cocoboca, where we believe in harnessing the power of nature to promote healthier gums, fresher breath, and brighter smilesΓÇöall without the toxins found in conventional oral care products.\r\n\r\nWhy Coconut Oil? A Time-Tested Secret for Oral Health\r\n\r\nThe practice of oil pulling has been around for centuries, deeply rooted in Ayurvedic traditions. At Cocoboca, we bring this ancient wisdom into the modern world with our premium unrefined coconut oil, packed with powerful properties to:\r\n\r\nWhiten Teeth Naturally ΓÇô No bleach, no artificial whitenersΓÇöjust the natural antibacterial power of coconut oil helping to lift stains and brighten your smile.\r\n\r\nCombat Bad Breath ΓÇô Say goodbye to morning breath! Coconut oil helps eliminate odor-causing bacteria for a cleaner, fresher mouth.\r\n\r\nStrengthen Gums ΓÇô Gingivitis and gum sensitivity can be a thing of the past with the anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial benefits of coconut oil.\r\n\r\nDetoxify Your Mouth ΓÇô Our oil gently pulls toxins from your oral cavity, promoting overall wellness beyond just oral health.\r\n\r\nThe Cocoboca Difference\r\n\r\nWhat makes Cocoboca stand out from other oil pulling brands? We are committed to:\r\n\r\n100% Pure & Unrefined Coconut Oil ΓÇô No additives, preservatives, or unnecessary ingredients.\r\n\r\nEco-Friendly Packaging ΓÇô We use lead-free glass jars to ensure purity and sustainability, avoiding the risks of plastic contamination.\r\n\r\nAuthenticity & Tradition ΓÇô Our method stays true to the Ayurvedic roots of oil pulling, making it a time-honored practice with modern convenience.\r\n\r\nHow to Use Cocoboca for Maximum Benefits\r\n\r\nStarting your oil-pulling journey is easy:\r\n\r\nTake a tablespoon of Cocoboca coconut oil.\r\n\r\nSwish it around in your mouth for 5ΓÇô15 minutes (the longer, the better!).\r\n\r\nSpit it out into a trash can (avoid the sink to prevent clogging).\r\n\r\nRinse with warm water and brush your teeth as usual.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a fresher, healthier smile!\r\n\r\nJoin the Oral Care Revolution\r\n\r\nAt Cocoboca, we believe your health begins in your mouth. Our mission is to bring pure, natural, and effective oral care to every household, helping people move away from chemical-laden products and toward a more holistic approach.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to transform your smile naturally? Explore the magic of Cocoboca today!\r\n\r\n≡ƒôì Visit us at www.cocoboca.com',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 15:23:31','2025-03-12 15:23:31',NULL,NULL),(375,'How often should I use Cocoboca for best results?','how-often-should-i-use-cocoboca-for-best-results',NULL,'For optimal benefits, we recommend oil pulling daily, preferably in the morning before eating or drinking.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 15:26:43','2025-03-12 15:26:43',NULL,NULL),(376,'Can oil pulling replace brushing my teeth?','can-oil-pulling-replace-brushing-my-teeth',NULL,'No, oil pulling is a complementary practice. It works best when combined with regular brushing and flossing.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 15:27:38','2025-03-12 15:27:38',NULL,NULL),(377,'Is Cocoboca safe for children?','is-cocoboca-safe-for-children',NULL,'Yes, but we recommend children use a smaller amount and swish for a shorter time. Always supervise young kids to prevent swallowing.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 15:28:27','2025-03-12 15:28:27',NULL,NULL),(378,'Can I use Cocoboca if I have sensitive teeth?','can-i-use-cocoboca-if-i-have-sensitive-teeth',NULL,'Absolutely! Our unrefined coconut oil is gentle on sensitive teeth and gums, providing a natural way to strengthen oral health.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 15:29:19','2025-03-12 15:29:19',NULL,NULL),(379,'Will oil pulling whiten my teeth?','will-oil-pulling-whiten-my-teeth',NULL,'Yes! Regular use of Cocoboca can help remove surface stains and naturally brighten your smile over time.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-12 15:30:16','2025-03-12 15:30:16',NULL,NULL),(380,'Let My Journey Inspire You','let-my-journey-inspire-you',NULL,'Growing up, poverty wasn\'t just a wordΓÇöit was my daily reality. I stumbled, I struggled, and I learned to fight back. I saw hardship firsthand, felt it deeply, and vowed early on I\'d find a way out. Born from tough circumstances in the challenging neighborhoods of Waterbury, as one of five boys and half Puerto Rican with sky-blue eyes, I was always the protector and savior for my brothersΓÇöa role I proudly carry to this day. My late father instilled in me the true meaning of loyalty, family, and relentless hard workΓÇövalues etched deep into my soul. Today, as a proud father, devoted husband, and successful entrepreneur, I\'ve not only discovered that better path but walked it with unwavering conviction. Family isn\'t just my anchor; it\'s my compass, guiding every decision and shaping the man I\'ve become. Let my journey inspire yours, proving that resilience and loyalty can conquer any adversity.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-16 11:15:16','2025-03-16 11:15:16',NULL,NULL),(417,'Click to Verify','click-to-verify',NULL,'Click to Verify',NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,89,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-19 23:22:32','2025-03-19 23:26:55',NULL,NULL),(418,'Workmens Comp','workmens-comp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-21 22:23:12','2025-03-21 22:23:12',NULL,NULL),(419,'Click To Verify','click-to-verify-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',10,1,72,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-21 23:15:46','2025-03-21 23:15:46',NULL,NULL),(420,'Click to Verify','click-to-verify-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',10,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-22 02:49:03','2025-03-22 02:49:03',NULL,NULL),(421,'Liability Insurance','liability-insurance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-22 03:25:23','2025-03-22 03:25:23',NULL,NULL),(422,'Workmens Comp','workmens-comp-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-22 03:27:18','2025-03-22 03:27:18',NULL,NULL),(423,'Home Improvement License','home-improvement-license-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,76,NULL,NULL,'2025-03-22 03:29:59','2025-03-22 03:29:59',NULL,NULL),(424,'Master Trainer Certification','master-trainer-certification',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:11:50','2025-04-04 21:11:50',NULL,NULL),(425,'Elite Trainer','elite-trainer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:12:44','2025-04-04 21:12:44',NULL,NULL),(426,'Mission Statement','mission-statement',NULL,'Our mission is fueled by two unwavering rules: Rule #1ΓÇöNEVER GIVE UP, and Rule #2ΓÇöNEVER FORGET RULE #1. We believe whatever you put in is exactly what you get out. If you want to stand out in front of thousands, you must first outwork thousands when no one is watching. We commit daily to relentless effort, resilience, and the grit required to transform potential into undeniable greatness.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:31:58','2025-04-04 21:31:58',NULL,NULL),(427,'Certified Personal Trainer','certified-personal-trainer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:44:48','2025-04-04 21:44:48',NULL,NULL),(428,'Youth Fitness Trainer','youth-fitness-trainer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:45:38','2025-04-04 21:45:38',NULL,NULL),(429,'Strength and Conditioning Specialist','strength-and-conditioning-specialist',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:46:49','2025-04-04 21:46:49',NULL,NULL),(430,'Certified Nutritionist','certified-nutritionist',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:47:45','2025-04-04 21:47:45',NULL,NULL),(431,'Weight Management Specialist','weight-management-specialist',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:49:12','2025-04-04 21:49:12',NULL,NULL),(432,'Body Building Specialist','body-building-specialist',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 21:50:46','2025-04-04 21:50:46',NULL,NULL),(433,'What does the complimentary fitness assessment include?','what-does-the-complimentary-fitness-assessment-include',NULL,'Your complimentary fitness assessment evaluates your current fitness level, identifies your unique strengths and areas for improvement, and helps us create a customized training plan tailored specifically to your goals.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 22:08:52','2025-04-04 22:08:52',NULL,NULL),(434,'Can I customize my meal plans based on dietary restrictions?','can-i-customize-my-meal-plans-based-on-dietary-restrictions',NULL,'Absolutely! All meal plans are fully customized to accommodate your dietary preferences and nutritional needs.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 22:09:28','2025-04-04 22:09:28',NULL,NULL),(435,'How do the Zoom check-ins work?','how-do-the-zoom-check-ins-work',NULL,'Zoom check-ins are scheduled regularly to monitor your progress, provide accountability, and address any questions or challenges you may be facing during your transformation journey.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 22:10:08','2025-04-04 22:10:08',NULL,NULL),(436,'Is the You vs You Total Transform Hybrid System suitable for beginners?','is-the-you-vs-you-total-transform-hybrid-system-suitable-for-beginners',NULL,'Yes, the program is suitable for all fitness levels. Each workout and nutrition plan is personalized to your specific abilities and goals, whether you\'re just starting out or you\'re a seasoned athlete.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 22:11:28','2025-04-04 22:11:28',NULL,NULL),(437,'What kind of support can I expect during the program?','what-kind-of-support-can-i-expect-during-the-program',NULL,'You\'ll receive full access to our expert coaches 7 days a week to ensure continuous motivation, guidance, and support throughout your transformation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 22:12:07','2025-04-04 22:12:07',NULL,NULL),(438,'Master Trainer. Mentor. Game-Changer.','master-trainer-mentor-game-changer',NULL,'I am a Master-Level Personal Trainer, Strength & Conditioning Specialist, and NutritionistΓÇöwith over 23 years of hands-on experience and a long list of certifications and specialties to back it up. For the past 15 years, I\'ve been coaching youth athletes and traveling up and down the East Coast with my teams, helping young talent rise to the next level.\r\n\r\nMy mission? To prepare athletes both physically and mentallyΓÇöon and off the field or court. I specialize in sport-specific strength and conditioning, plyometrics, speed and agility, and injury prevention, all tailored to ensure my athletes perform at their absolute peak, not just for one season, but for the entire span of their careers.\r\n\r\nThis isnΓÇÖt just trainingΓÇöitΓÇÖs transformation. And I bring everything IΓÇÖve got to every rep, every drill, and every athlete I coach.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 22:59:52','2025-04-04 22:59:52',NULL,NULL),(439,'The Grind Nobody Sees','the-grind-nobody-sees',NULL,'Everyone wants the spotlightΓÇöfew are willing to train in the shadows.\r\nThe truth is, greatness isnΓÇÖt built in front of a crowd. ItΓÇÖs forged in empty gyms, early mornings, late nights, and sweat-soaked silence. ThatΓÇÖs where champions are made.\r\n\r\nIΓÇÖve spent over 23 years training, learning, and leveling up. For the past 15, IΓÇÖve been traveling the East Coast with youth athletes, preparing them for that next levelΓÇöphysically, mentally, and emotionally. My method isnΓÇÖt flashy. ItΓÇÖs effective. Sports-specific strength and conditioning, speed and agility, injury prevention... every drill, every session is designed for one thing: sustained excellence.\r\n\r\nRemember:\r\nIf you want to look good in front of thousands, you better outwork thousands in front of no one.',NULL,'2025-04-01','1',6,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 23:03:24','2025-04-04 23:06:07',NULL,NULL),(440,'Two Rules. One Mindset.','two-rules-one-mindset',NULL,'I live by two simple rules:\r\nRule #1: Never give up.\r\nRule #2: Never forget Rule #1.\r\n\r\nThatΓÇÖs not just a mantraΓÇöitΓÇÖs a mindset. Whether you\'re an athlete trying to make varsity or a weekend warrior trying to reclaim your edge, success demands consistency, discipline, and grit.\r\n\r\nIΓÇÖm not here to hand out trophies. IΓÇÖm here to train you like the elite, because thatΓÇÖs what it takes.\r\nIΓÇÖll push you. IΓÇÖll challenge you. And IΓÇÖll make sure you walk out strongerΓÇöin body and in mind.\r\n\r\nWhatever you put in, is exactly what youΓÇÖll get out.\r\nSo ask yourselfΓÇöhow bad do you want it?',NULL,'2025-01-25','1',6,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 23:05:20','2025-04-04 23:06:38',NULL,NULL),(441,'MY Local News Debut','my-local-news-debut',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-01-03','1',18,1,102,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-04 23:47:10','2025-04-05 00:22:09',NULL,NULL),(442,'From Shingles to CEO: A Legacy in the Making','from-shingles-to-ceo-a-legacy-in-the-making',NULL,'At 13, my grandfather told me he wasnΓÇÖt buying my school clothes anymoreΓÇöI had to earn them. So, I started working for him, hauling shingles and cleaning job sites. I went from a skinny kid who got cut from the football team to returning after a summer of hard labor with a new frame and mindset. I made the team, played high school ball, and eventually Division-1 college football.\r\nAfter graduating with a degree in business and finance, I joined a Sears roofing crew to pay billsΓÇöand stayed for 22 years. I mastered roofing, siding, windows, kitchens, bathrooms, and became an HVAC tech. In 2010, after speaking to a sales team about cleaner installs, I was offered a sales role. That launched a new path, eventually rising into upper management until Sears\' downfall in 2017.\r\n\r\nI then led the commercial division for one of CTΓÇÖs top roofing companies. But in 2020, I launched Hall Of Fame Construction Group LLCΓÇöa family-run business built on legacy and integrity. Our mission? Offer homeowners high-end solutions without the bloated big-box prices. With my wife and kids in the business, we keep costs low (no payroll for familyΓÇökidding, kind of).\r\nWe focus on smart home solutions, expert installs, and real warranties at prices that make sense.\r\nThereΓÇÖs the \"Do it Right\" price and the \"Do it Twice\" priceΓÇöDo it Right with Hall Of Fame.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-06 23:56:46','2025-04-06 23:56:46',NULL,NULL),(443,'Your Trusted Home Improvement Experts','your-trusted-home-improvement-experts',NULL,'With over 30 years of experience in the home improvement industry, we here at Hall of Fame Construction Group, LLC, strive for excellence on every single project. From our full time customer care center, to our elite sales department and production team, our mission is to provide the ultimate customer experience one project at a time.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 00:31:50','2025-04-07 00:31:50',NULL,NULL),(444,'Home Improvement License','home-improvement-license-4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 01:13:19','2025-04-07 01:13:19',NULL,NULL),(446,'Liability Insurance','liability-insurance-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 01:27:25','2025-04-07 01:27:25',NULL,NULL),(447,'Vinyl Siding Certification','vinyl-siding-certification',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 01:28:26','2025-04-07 01:28:26',NULL,NULL),(448,'Workmans Comp Liability Insurance','workmans-comp-liability-insurance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 01:29:32','2025-04-07 01:29:32',NULL,NULL),(449,'What services do you offer?','what-services-do-you-offer',NULL,'WeΓÇÖre not just a one-trick pony. We specialize in roofing (shingle & metal), siding, insulation, window & door replacements, storm damage assessments, and roof repair. If it protects or upgrades your home, chances areΓÇöwe do it and do it well.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 02:16:16','2025-04-07 02:16:16',NULL,NULL),(450,'Are your installers certified?','are-your-installers-certified',NULL,'Absolutely. Our team includes VSI Certified Installers, meaning your project gets done right the first timeΓÇönot the \"oops, call us back\" kind of work.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 02:16:55','2025-04-07 02:16:55',NULL,NULL),(451,'Do you offer free estimates?','do-you-offer-free-estimates-3',NULL,'You bet we do. No pressure, no gimmicks. Just straight talk, honest pricing, and a clear plan for how weΓÇÖll make your house the MVP of the block.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 02:17:40','2025-04-07 02:17:40',NULL,NULL),(452,'How long does a typical roofing or siding project take?','how-long-does-a-typical-roofing-or-siding-project-take',NULL,'Depends on the size of your home and what weΓÇÖre tackling, but most projects wrap up in a few days to a week. We work fast, clean, and with laser focusΓÇölike your home is up for an award.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 02:18:26','2025-04-07 02:18:26',NULL,NULL),(453,'What kind of warranties do you offer?','what-kind-of-warranties-do-you-offer',NULL,'We donΓÇÖt mess around with fine print. We offer strong manufacturer warranties and our own workmanship guarantee. YouΓÇÖre covered from every angleΓÇöliterally.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,103,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-07 02:19:03','2025-04-07 02:19:03',NULL,NULL),(465,'What types of cases do you handle?','what-types-of-cases-do-you-handle',NULL,'I handle criminal defense, civil rights, personal injury, juvenile and family law, and sports & entertainment law. If your freedom, rights, or reputation are on the line ΓÇö IΓÇÖm the one you call.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 04:50:49','2025-04-08 04:50:49',NULL,NULL),(466,'Do you offer free consultations?','do-you-offer-free-consultations',NULL,'Yes. I offer a no-pressure consultation so we can talk through your situation and see if weΓÇÖre a good fit. If I can help, IΓÇÖll tell you how. If not, IΓÇÖll still point you in the right direction.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 04:59:25','2025-04-08 04:59:25',NULL,NULL),(467,'What sets you apart from other attorneys?','what-sets-you-apart-from-other-attorneys',NULL,'I come from struggle ΓÇö I know what itΓÇÖs like to be underestimated. ThatΓÇÖs why I fight with purpose. I donΓÇÖt just talk a good game, I show up, strategize, and win. I treat every case like itΓÇÖs personal, because to you ΓÇö it is.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 05:00:03','2025-04-08 05:00:03',NULL,NULL),(468,'How do I get started?','how-do-i-get-started',NULL,'Click the ΓÇ£CallΓÇ¥ or ΓÇ£Book ConsultationΓÇ¥ button on this card. You can also email me directly or visit my office in Springfield. However you reach me, youΓÇÖll get a straight answer ΓÇö and fast.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 05:02:41','2025-04-08 05:02:41',NULL,NULL),(469,'WhatΓÇÖs your track record like?','whats-your-track-record-like',NULL,'LetΓÇÖs just say this: my name holds weight. IΓÇÖve defended high-stakes cases, worked with pro athletes, and fought for families that had everything on the line. I donΓÇÖt take shortcuts ΓÇö I take results.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 05:03:30','2025-04-08 05:03:30',NULL,NULL),(470,'Do you take payment plans?','do-you-take-payment-plans',NULL,'Do you take payment plans?\r\nDepending on the case, yes ΓÇö I believe good people deserve strong representation, and IΓÇÖll work with you to make it manageable. LetΓÇÖs talk about it during your consultation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 05:04:05','2025-04-08 05:04:05',NULL,NULL),(471,'Where I Come From. Why I Fight.','where-i-come-from-why-i-fight',NULL,'IΓÇÖm Attorney Kedar K. Ismail ΓÇö a trial lawyer, a strategist, and a fighter for justice. I built my law practice in Springfield, MA, but my journey started far from the courtroom. I grew up in Elizabeth, New Jersey ΓÇö in a place where opportunities were limited, and the odds werenΓÇÖt in anyoneΓÇÖs favor. That upbringing didnΓÇÖt break me ΓÇö it built me. It taught me how to fight smart, speak up, and never back down.\r\n\r\nToday, I run a law firm that stands up for the underdog. I represent people facing criminal charges, civil rights violations, personal injury battles, family struggles, and even high-stakes issues in the sports and entertainment world. IΓÇÖve gone toe-to-toe with powerful institutions, and IΓÇÖve had the backs of athletes, artists, and everyday people who just needed someone to believe in them.\r\n\r\nWhat sets me apart? I donΓÇÖt sugarcoat things. I give it to you straight ΓÇö with a plan. I mix legal precision with street-level understanding. I treat every case like itΓÇÖs personal, because when your futureΓÇÖs on the line, you donΓÇÖt need a lawyer who plays it safe. You need one who plays to win.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re looking for real representation ΓÇö not just someone to show up in a suit ΓÇö letΓÇÖs talk. IΓÇÖm here to fight for you.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 05:08:26','2025-04-08 05:08:26',NULL,NULL),(472,'What They DonΓÇÖt Tell You When YouΓÇÖre Charged With a Crime','what-they-dont-tell-you-when-youre-charged-with-a-crime',NULL,'Let me keep it all the way real ΓÇö when youΓÇÖre charged with a crime, the system isnΓÇÖt on your side. ItΓÇÖs fast, unforgiving, and designed to push you through like a number, not a person. And if you donΓÇÖt have someone in your corner who knows how to fight smart? YouΓÇÖre already ten steps behind.\r\n\r\nAs a criminal defense attorney, IΓÇÖve seen it all ΓÇö wrongful arrests, overcharged offenses, and people being pressured into taking deals they donΓÇÖt understand. The truth is, most folks donΓÇÖt even know their rights ΓÇö and thatΓÇÖs exactly how the system wants it.\r\n\r\nHereΓÇÖs what you need to know right now if you or someone you love is facing charges:\r\n\r\nDonΓÇÖt say a word without a lawyer. Not to the cops, not to the DA, not even ΓÇ£just to explain.ΓÇ¥ That \"explanation\" can and will be used against you.\r\nBail doesnΓÇÖt mean guilt. It just means they want to hold you ΓÇö and I can often help reduce or eliminate it if IΓÇÖm brought in early.\r\nPublic defenders are overloaded. They care, but theyΓÇÖre buried. You deserve someone who has the time and strategy to focus fully on your case.\r\nBottom line? You get one shot to protect your freedom. DonΓÇÖt waste it rolling the dice with someone whoΓÇÖs not built to win in that courtroom.',NULL,'2024-12-21','1',6,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 06:08:36','2025-04-17 03:51:18',NULL,NULL),(473,'Know Your Rights ΓÇö Or Risk Losing Them','know-your-rights-or-risk-losing-them',NULL,'I donΓÇÖt care what neighborhood youΓÇÖre from, what you look like, or what your past says ΓÇö if your rights were violated, I want to hear about it.\r\n\r\nBecause hereΓÇÖs the truth: civil rights arenΓÇÖt optional. TheyΓÇÖre not negotiable. And they sure as hell arenΓÇÖt reserved for the privileged few.\r\n\r\nIΓÇÖve fought for people whoΓÇÖve been unlawfully arrested, assaulted by police, harassed at work, and profiled for simply existing in the wrong place at the wrong time. And let me tell you ΓÇö these arenΓÇÖt just ΓÇ£unfortunate situations.ΓÇ¥ TheyΓÇÖre violations of the Constitution.\r\n\r\nIf any of this sounds familiar, here\'s what you need to do:\r\n\r\nDocument everything. Dates, times, names, badge numbers. Screenshots. Video. The more, the better.\r\nDonΓÇÖt wait. The longer you sit on it, the harder it becomes to build a case.\r\nCall me. This isnΓÇÖt just about money ΓÇö itΓÇÖs about holding people accountable and making sure it doesnΓÇÖt happen again.\r\nThe system wonΓÇÖt fix itself. But together, we can make sure it doesn\'t break you.',NULL,'2025-02-05','1',6,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 06:09:42','2025-04-17 03:51:41',NULL,NULL),(474,'My Mission is Simple','my-mission-is-simple',NULL,'To fight for justice with relentless integrity, fearless strategy, and unwavering respect for the people I serve. I stand up for those whoΓÇÖve been overlooked, mistreated, or underestimated ΓÇö and I donΓÇÖt stop until their voices are heard and their rights are protected.\r\n\r\nWhether IΓÇÖm defending someoneΓÇÖs freedom in a courtroom, holding law enforcement accountable, or negotiating deals for athletes and artists ΓÇö I bring the same energy every time: real, raw, and results-driven.\r\n\r\nI didnΓÇÖt become an attorney to play it safe. I became one to make an impact.\r\nBecause when the system tries to break you, you need someone who refuses to fold.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 06:11:39','2025-04-08 06:11:39',NULL,NULL),(475,'Why Choose Me','why-choose-me',NULL,'Because I donΓÇÖt just take cases ΓÇö I take a stand.\r\n\r\nWhen you work with me, you\'re not getting some cookie-cutter lawyer who checks boxes and files paperwork. You\'re getting a fighter. A strategist. Someone who grew up in the real world, understands the system from the inside out, and knows how to win ΓÇö because IΓÇÖve had to.\r\n\r\nHereΓÇÖs what makes me different:\r\n\r\nI keep it real. I donΓÇÖt sugarcoat. I give you the facts, the risks, and the game plan ΓÇö straight up.\r\nI treat every case like itΓÇÖs personal. Because to you, it is. And that means I show up prepared, aggressive, and laser-focused.\r\nI donΓÇÖt get intimidated. Not by the system, not by the other side, and definitely not by a challenge.\r\nI get results. Whether itΓÇÖs beating criminal charges, fighting for your rights, or securing life-changing deals ΓÇö IΓÇÖve done it, and IΓÇÖll do it again.\r\nYouΓÇÖre not just hiring an attorney. YouΓÇÖre getting an advocate, a protector, and someone who actually gives a damn.\r\n\r\nIf thatΓÇÖs the kind of lawyer youΓÇÖre looking for ΓÇö IΓÇÖm ready when you are.',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-08 06:24:09','2025-04-08 06:24:09',NULL,NULL),(485,'From Marine to Master Roofer: Leading with Integrity, Serving with Purpose','from-marine-to-master-roofer-leading-with-integrity-serving-with-purpose',NULL,'I\'m Ronald Day, proud owner of Roof Savers and a Veteran of the U.S. Marine Corps. My time in service taught me discipline, integrity, and leadershipΓÇövalues I bring to every roofing project I undertake. At Roof Savers, I believe everyone deserves premium products without breaking the bank. That\'s why I\'ve dedicated myself to providing high-quality roofing solutions at fair and affordable prices.\r\n\r\nMy approach is simpleΓÇöI lead by example, ensuring every customer feels confident and supported from start to finish. Whether it\'s a small repair or a complete roof replacement, I\'m here to protect your home like it\'s my own.\r\n\r\nWhen you choose Roof Savers, you\'re not just getting great productsΓÇöyou\'re gaining a trusted leader who genuinely cares.\r\n\r\nSemper Fi and quality roofs for life!',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 00:36:59','2025-04-16 00:36:59',NULL,NULL),(486,'Our Mission','our-mission-2',NULL,'At Roof Savers, our mission is simple: to protect and enhance every home by providing premium products at affordable pricing. Guided by integrity, dedication, and unmatched craftsmanship, we strive to deliver exceptional value and peace of mind, ensuring our customers never have to choose between quality and affordability.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 01:07:17','2025-04-16 01:07:17',NULL,NULL),(487,'Home Improvement Contractors License','home-improvement-contractors-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:00:52','2025-04-16 04:00:52',NULL,NULL),(488,'Bond','bond',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:04:14','2025-04-16 04:04:14',NULL,NULL),(489,'Certificate of Liability Insurance','certificate-of-liability-insurance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:06:07','2025-04-16 04:06:07',NULL,NULL),(490,'Why choose Roof Savers for my roofing needs?','why-choose-roof-savers-for-my-roofing-needs',NULL,'At Roof Savers, we combine premium products with affordable pricing, all delivered with honesty, integrity, and leadership from our owner, Ronald Day, a veteran of the U.S. Marine Corps. We treat your home as our own.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:07:58','2025-04-16 04:07:58',NULL,NULL),(491,'How do I know if my roof needs replacement or just repairs?','how-do-i-know-if-my-roof-needs-replacement-or-just-repairs',NULL,'Our detailed roof inspections pinpoint exactly what your roof requires. We\'ll clearly explain your options, so you can make an informed decision without unnecessary expenses.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:08:34','2025-04-16 04:08:34',NULL,NULL),(492,'Are your roofing estimates free?','are-your-roofing-estimates-free',NULL,'Absolutely! We provide free, no-obligation estimates so you can budget confidently, knowing exactly what to expect.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:09:06','2025-04-16 04:09:06',NULL,NULL),(493,'Do you offer warranties on your services?','do-you-offer-warranties-on-your-services',NULL,'Yes, Roof Savers stands by all work performed. We offer comprehensive warranties on both products and labor, giving you peace of mind long after the job is done.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:09:44','2025-04-16 04:09:44',NULL,NULL),(494,'Can Roof Savers help me file an insurance claim for roof damage?','can-roof-savers-help-me-file-an-insurance-claim-for-roof-damage',NULL,'Definitely! We\'re experienced with insurance claims and will guide you through the entire process, making it as smooth and hassle-free as possible.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:10:15','2025-04-16 04:10:15',NULL,NULL),(495,'How long will my roofing project take?','how-long-will-my-roofing-project-take',NULL,'Every project varies, but we pride ourselves on efficiency and clear communication. Once we assess your specific needs, we\'ll provide a realistic timelineΓÇöand we stick to it.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:10:51','2025-04-16 04:10:51',NULL,NULL),(496,'What roofing materials do you use?','what-roofing-materials-do-you-use',NULL,'We use only premium-quality roofing materials from trusted brands, ensuring superior durability, aesthetics, and value for your investment.\r\n\r\nHave more questions? Feel free to reach outΓÇöwe\'re always happy to help!',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:11:28','2025-04-16 04:11:28',NULL,NULL),(497,'5 Signs Your Roof Needs Immediate Attention','5-signs-your-roof-needs-immediate-attention',NULL,'A reliable roof is crucial to protecting your homeΓÇöbut how do you know when it\'s time for repairs or replacement? Here are five signs your roof needs immediate attention:\r\n\r\n1. Missing or Damaged Shingles\r\nIf shingles are curling, cracked, or completely missing, your home could be vulnerable to leaks and further damage.\r\n\r\n2. Water Stains on Ceilings or Walls\r\nDiscolored spots inside your home indicate leaks and potential mold growth, a clear sign of roofing issues.\r\n\r\n3. Granules in Your Gutters\r\nExcess granules collecting in gutters means your shingles are deteriorating and may soon fail to protect your home.\r\n\r\n4. Sagging Roof\r\nAny visible sagging points to structural issues that require immediate professional evaluation to ensure safety.\r\n\r\n5. Recent Storm Damage\r\nSevere weather can compromise your roofΓÇÖs integrity. Even subtle storm damage could lead to costly problems later.\r\n\r\nAt Roof Savers, we offer expert inspections and timely repairs, providing premium products at affordable pricing to ensure your home stays safe and secure. DonΓÇÖt waitΓÇöcall today!',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:13:29','2025-04-16 04:13:29',NULL,NULL),(500,'Why Hiring a Veteran-Owned Roofing Company Makes a Difference','why-hiring-a-veteran-owned-roofing-company-makes-a-difference-2',NULL,'When it comes to selecting a roofing contractor, values matter just as much as quality and price. Choosing a veteran-owned business like Roof Savers offers unique benefits:\r\n\r\n1. Integrity and Trust\r\nRonald Day, our founder and a proud U.S. Marine Corps veteran, brings discipline, honesty, and transparency to every job.\r\n\r\n2. Commitment to Service\r\nVeterans understand the importance of serviceΓÇöour company is dedicated to serving our customers and community with exceptional quality and reliability.\r\n\r\n3. Leadership and Precision\r\nMarine training translates directly into meticulous attention to detail, ensuring your roof is installed or repaired correctly the first time.\r\n\r\n4. Premium Quality, Fair Prices\r\nAt Roof Savers, we believe premium products donΓÇÖt need premium price tags. Our commitment ensures affordability without compromising on quality.\r\n\r\nWhen you hire Roof Savers, youΓÇÖre choosing more than a contractorΓÇöyouΓÇÖre choosing a company committed to excellence, integrity, and affordability. Experience the difference today!',NULL,'2024-11-22','1',6,1,105,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-16 04:24:25','2025-04-16 04:24:25',NULL,NULL),(501,'My Property Listings','my-property-listings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',15,1,92,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-17 17:57:32','2025-04-17 17:57:32',NULL,NULL),(502,'Passionate and Driven Visionary','passionate-and-driven-visionary',NULL,'As a visionary, passionate and driven real estate professional, I thrive on\r\nhelping individuals and families turn their homeownership dreams into\r\nreality. I believe that home is more than just a placeΓÇô itΓÇÖs your sanctuary\r\nwhere dreams take root, memories are created, and futures are built. With an\r\neducational background in finance, business, financial crime investigations\r\nand entrepreneurship, I bring a keen eye for detail, problem solving, strong\r\nnegotiation skills, and a deep commitment to integrity in every transaction.\r\nMy journey into real estate was inspired by my love for people and my desire\r\nto create unforgettable experiences. It has been a natural evolution of my\r\nlifelong passion for helping others and creating lasting impact. Whether\r\nguiding first-time buyers, sellers, or investors, I prioritize transparency, trust,\r\nand personalized service. For me, real estate is not just a transactionΓÇô itΓÇÖs\r\nabout empowering people to take the next step in their lives with confidence\r\nand excitement. My mission is to guide you through every part of the process,\r\nmaking it as simple, smooth and rewarding as possible.\r\nAs a proud mother of a U.S. Air Force service member, I also hold a special\r\nplace in my heart for military families and those seeking new homes, as well\r\nas smooth relocations. Rooted in a deep appreciation for culture, diversity,\r\nand community, I aim to make every client feel empowered and supported\r\nthroughout their real estate journey. My greatest joy is turning aspirations and\r\ndreams into realityΓÇô one home at a time.\r\nEvery clientΓÇÖs journey is unique, and thatΓÇÖs what makes this work so\r\ngratifying and special. I find true joy in turning keys into dreams. IΓÇÖm excited\r\nto be part of your magical story and help you achieve your real estate goals.\r\nLetΓÇÖs turn your vision into reality and unlock the door to something truly\r\nmagical! Contact me today and letΓÇÖs get started.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-19 06:46:15','2025-04-19 06:46:15',NULL,NULL),(503,'Click To View Listings','click-to-view-listings',NULL,'.',NULL,NULL,'1',15,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-19 06:57:03','2025-04-19 06:57:03',NULL,NULL),(504,'5 Decisive Questions To Ask Your Significant Other Before Buying A House Together!','5-decisive-questions-to-ask-your-significant-other-before-buying-a-house-together',NULL,'While itΓÇÖs a cliche that communication is key among successful couples, it couldnΓÇÖt be any truer and more crucial if youΓÇÖre planning to buy a house together. Not only are you going to make one of the most fulfilling purchases of your lifeΓÇöbut youΓÇÖre also going to experience the joy and hardships of homeownership with the person you love.\r\nSo before you start poring through real estate listings and begin your next chapter together, you and your significant other need to have an open and honest conversation in which you ask yourselves and each other these key questions.\r\n\r\n1. Where do we want to live?\r\nThe first step in deciding you want to buy a home is knowing where you want to live. Because unlike renting, becoming a homeowner involves a much bigger commitment, which could cement you to a particular place for a couple of years or so. And, if youΓÇÖre moving with a partner, you need to agree on this matter early on to avoid any contention.\r\nDo you want to stay in the same neighborhood where you are now? Or do you want to move somewhere closer to work, family, or friends? If one of you prefers the suburbs while the other one loves the city, what compromises do you need to make? What aspects of a neighborhood are most important to both of you? Before starting your house-hunting, make sure that you both agree on the kind of neighborhood that you envision and if they align with your long-term goals and values.\r\n2. Do we have any financial red flags that we need to work through?\r\nBuying a home together means youΓÇÖll be entering a joint financial commitment like no other. If you havenΓÇÖt done so already, now is the time for the both of you to share everything about your finances even before starting your home search. Discuss and be transparent about each otherΓÇÖs current income, assets, savings, credit score, and even debt obligationsΓÇömay it be student loans, credit card debt, car loans, or other personal debts. This disclosure between you and your partner will guide your home-buying approach since you need to make sure that you can both afford a home purchase.\r\nIf youΓÇÖre planning to buy a home with cash, all you need is money. But if youΓÇÖre planning to apply for a mortgage, then lenders will have to look at your debt-to-income ratio (DTI) and credit scores to see whether you qualify. The DTI ratio is your combined monthly debt payments divided by your combined monthly income. If any or both of you have debts, seek ways to minimize them to improve your credit score, so you can get a better mortgage rate.\r\n3. What is our budget and how will we divide up expenses?\r\nWhether youΓÇÖre buying solo or with a partner, there are a lot of expenses associated with homeownership that you need to prepare for aside from your monthly mortgage payments. Especially if youΓÇÖre both a first-time homeowner, things like closing costs, repairs and maintenance, utilities, homeownerΓÇÖs insurance, property taxes, and other costs can catch you both by surprise.\r\nBy looking at your combined monthly income and recurring expenses, you can begin mapping out how much youΓÇÖll be able to afford. As a general rule of thumb, most financial experts agree that your housing payments should not exceed 30 percent of your gross monthly income. And while youΓÇÖre on the topic, be sure to also consider how much you have on hand for a down payment, and how much you still need to save.\r\nMoreover, itΓÇÖd be helpful to agree on how you will pay for these expenses as a couple. Will you divide each expense in half, or will you each take responsibility for certain bills? How will you share the expenses if one of you experiences a financial crisis?\r\n4. What are your needs and wants in a home, and why?\r\nSince youΓÇÖre two unique individuals in a relationship, naturally, you will have different tastes and preferences when it comes to your dream home. This might be highlighted more when itΓÇÖs time for you to go house-hunting. You may be a great cook and want a modern and luxurious kitchen, so other features such as a spacious living room or additional bedrooms can be a sacrifice. Meanwhile, your partner would love an extra room for his stuff or a large living room that can fit a sectional couch perfect for those Super Bowl nights.\r\nSeparately listing out what each of you wants in your new home is a fun yet meaningful conversation thatΓÇÖs crucial to have at the beginning of your search. Talk about your priorities, and discuss what is most important to each of you, and the reason behind it. In short, donΓÇÖt be afraid to get down to the nitty-gritty details. How many bedrooms and bathrooms? Is a living room with a fireplace essential? Do you want a house with a pool? A garden? What do you mean when you say you donΓÇÖt want a ΓÇ£too modernΓÇ¥ house? WhatΓÇÖs one thing youΓÇÖre willing toΓÇ¿compromise? WhatΓÇÖs one thing you definitely wonΓÇÖt?\r\nVery rarely will the perfect house appear, especially when factors like your budget, location, and individual preferences are to be considered. But when you can meet in the middle and identify potential deal-breakers, you will come up with something that gives you both a little of what you want. And it will be your guide in finding the loveliest abode that will fit both of your needs.\r\n5. What happens if we break up?\r\nYouΓÇÖre having the most wonderful time in your relationship, so breaking up may be the last thing on your mind. But while it isnΓÇÖt pleasant to think about, you need to be realistic and consider all possible outcomes. You could split up or get divorced. Or one of you could just decide not to pursue the home. One of you could decide to move out of state or out of the country. When something like this happens, where will that leave both of you standing?\r\nHaving an exit strategy is the most practical way to prepare for all possible eventualities. Before drawing up an agreement, both of you must understand the type of homeownership option to choose from when purchasing a home together. The most common is joint tenancy, where each person holds an equal interest in the property. ThereΓÇÖs also what is called tenancy in common, where each person has a distinct, separately transferable interest in the property. Seek help from experts when creating an agreement detailing how you divide your assets just in case your relationship has to be dissolved.\r\nSince purchasing a property is a major financial commitment, having everything in writing for any unexpected occurrence that might disrupt your original plans could save you and your partner a big headache.\r\nBottom lineΓÇ¿Purchasing your first home together could be one of the most amazing experiences you can have as a couple. But since you will be putting six figures into this jointly-owned abode, it sure wonΓÇÖt be an easy feat for both of you. So take the time to sit down with your partner and make sure to have even the most difficult conversations, such as debts and the possibility of a breakup. Communicate and be honest with each other, and see how you can better support each other (instead of clashing each and every time) on your path to homeownership.',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-19 06:59:38','2025-04-19 06:59:38',NULL,NULL),(505,'What areas does Carl Guild & Associates serve?','what-areas-does-carl-guild-associates-serve',NULL,'Carl Guild & Associates operates throughout Connecticut, with a focus on Middlesex, Hartford, and New London counties. They have offices in East Hampton, Colchester, and Glastonbury, and they assist clients in various communities including Portland, Colchester, Glastonbury, Middletown, East Haddam, Cromwell, and Hebron.ΓÇï',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-19 07:08:54','2025-04-19 07:08:54',NULL,NULL),(506,'What types of real estate services are offered?','what-types-of-real-estate-services-are-offered',NULL,'What types of real estate services are offered?\r\nThey provide a comprehensive range of services, including residential sales and rentals, commercial sales and leasing, investment properties, new construction, luxury homes, second homes and vacation properties, condominiums and townhomes, land development and sales, relocation services, short sales and foreclosures, agricultural and farm properties, industrial and warehouse properties, and lease negotiation and renewal.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-19 07:09:27','2025-04-19 07:09:27',NULL,NULL),(507,'How accessible are the agents?','how-accessible-are-the-agents',NULL,'How accessible are the agents?\r\nThe agents at Carl Guild & Associates are known for their availability, offering support seven days a week. Whether it\'s a weekend or a Sunday morning, they\'re committed to providing professional and insightful advice whenever you need it.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-19 07:10:06','2025-04-19 07:10:06',NULL,NULL),(508,'How can I find out what my home is worth?','how-can-i-find-out-what-my-home-is-worth',NULL,'Carl Guild & Associates offers a comparative market analysis to help you price your home accurately. You can request this service through their website to get an estimate of your home\'s value based on current market conditions',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-19 07:10:53','2025-04-19 07:10:53',NULL,NULL),(518,'Kevin \"King\" Walsh: Fighting Forward, Inspiring Champions','kevin-king-walsh-fighting-forward-inspiring-champions',NULL,'IΓÇÖm Kevin \"King\" Walsh, professional boxer and proud native of Brockton, MassachusettsΓÇöthe legendary \"City of Champions.\" Life threw some tough punches early on, but boxing taught me how to roll with adversity, transforming obstacles into stepping stones toward success.\r\n\r\nToday, IΓÇÖm honored to hold an undefeated record in both featherweight and super featherweight divisions, proudly wearing the WBC USA Silver Featherweight Championship belt. Each match I fight is a tribute to my community, my family, and the relentless spirit that defines who I am.\r\n\r\nOutside the ropes, my passion is empowering others. I share my story to remind people that every setback can become a comeback, and every challenge is an opportunity to rise higher.\r\n\r\nMy mantra? Never back downΓÇöalways fight forward.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 13:52:12','2025-04-25 13:52:12',NULL,NULL),(519,'Who is Kevin \"King\" Walsh?','who-is-kevin-king-walsh',NULL,'Who is Kevin \"King\" Walsh?\r\nKevin \"King\" Walsh is an undefeated professional boxer from Brockton, Massachusetts. He\'s known for his powerful performances in the featherweight and super featherweight divisions, holding the WBC USA Silver Featherweight Championship.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 13:57:29','2025-04-25 13:57:29',NULL,NULL),(520,'Why is Kevin known as \"King\"?','why-is-kevin-known-as-king',NULL,'The nickname \"King\" symbolizes KevinΓÇÖs dominant presence in the ring, his relentless pursuit of excellence, and his roots in Brockton, famously called the \"City of Champions.\"',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 13:58:13','2025-04-25 13:58:13',NULL,NULL),(521,'How did Kevin Walsh get started in boxing?','how-did-kevin-walsh-get-started-in-boxing',NULL,'How did Kevin Walsh get started in boxing?\r\nAfter facing personal challenges and adversity in his youth, Kevin turned to boxing as an outlet and a path to redemption. Inspired by his late father, he pursued boxing professionally, channeling his determination into success.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 13:59:29','2025-04-25 13:59:29',NULL,NULL),(522,'What is Kevin WalshΓÇÖs professional boxing record?','what-is-kevin-walshs-professional-boxing-record',NULL,'Kevin holds an impressive undefeated record of 16-0, including 9 knockouts.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:00:51','2025-04-25 14:00:51',NULL,NULL),(523,'What motivates Kevin Walsh outside the ring?','what-motivates-kevin-walsh-outside-the-ring',NULL,'Kevin is driven by his desire to inspire others, especially youth who face hardships. He regularly mentors young people, sharing his story of transformation to motivate them to overcome their own struggles.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:01:55','2025-04-25 14:01:55',NULL,NULL),(524,'How can I watch Kevin Walsh fight?','how-can-i-watch-kevin-walsh-fight',NULL,'KevinΓÇÖs matches are regularly featured in boxing promotions and can often be viewed on sports networks, streaming platforms, or at live events. Follow his social media for updates on upcoming fights.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:02:38','2025-04-25 14:02:38',NULL,NULL),(525,'Does Kevin Walsh offer boxing training or mentorship?','does-kevin-walsh-offer-boxing-training-or-mentorship',NULL,'Kevin is passionate about mentorship and often engages with his community through training sessions, youth mentoring programs, and motivational speaking.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:03:26','2025-04-25 14:03:26',NULL,NULL),(526,'How can I connect with Kevin Walsh?','how-can-i-connect-with-kevin-walsh',NULL,'How can I connect with Kevin Walsh?\r\nKevin is active on social media platforms like Instagram and Facebook. Fans and prospective collaborators are encouraged to reach out through these channels.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:05:08','2025-04-25 14:05:08',NULL,NULL),(527,'What\'s Kevin WalshΓÇÖs signature motto?','whats-kevin-walshs-signature-motto',NULL,'KevinΓÇÖs personal mantra is: \"Never back downΓÇöalways fight forward.\"',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:06:35','2025-04-25 14:06:35',NULL,NULL),(528,'From Struggle to Champion ΓÇô My Journey','from-struggle-to-champion-my-journey',NULL,'Growing up in Brockton, life wasnΓÇÖt exactly a walk in the park. I found myself caught up in challenges, struggles, and setbacks that wouldΓÇÖve easily knocked anyone out. But in boxing, I discovered something powerfulΓÇödiscipline, determination, and a way to channel my frustrations into strength.\r\n\r\nLosing my father was the hardest blow IΓÇÖd ever taken. It changed me, but it also inspired me to fightΓÇönot just physically in the ring, but mentally, emotionally, and spiritually. Every punch I throw now is fueled by passion and purpose. Every victory is dedicated to him.\r\n\r\nToday, I proudly wear the WBC USA Silver Featherweight title, proof that no matter your past, your future can be legendary. My mission is simple: show others that struggle is part of the journey, but perseverance defines the champion.\r\n\r\nRemember, life will test you, but you decide how you respond. Never back downΓÇöalways fight forward.',NULL,'2024-09-12','1',6,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:16:27','2025-04-25 14:19:20',NULL,NULL),(529,'The Real Meaning of Victory','the-real-meaning-of-victory',NULL,'People often ask what winning feels like. Honestly? It feels amazingΓÇöbut not just because of belts, trophies, or titles. Victory to me means something deeper. It means overcoming fear, silencing doubt, and proving to myself and others that change is possible.\r\n\r\nAs a boxer, IΓÇÖve learned that victory isnΓÇÖt about a perfect record; itΓÇÖs about growth. Every fight teaches me something new. Every round challenges me to become better, smarter, strongerΓÇönot just in the ring, but in life.\r\n\r\nOutside boxing, my greatest joy is mentoring young people. I share my story because I want them to understand this truth: winning doesnΓÇÖt mean never fallingΓÇöit means getting up one more time than youΓÇÖve been knocked down.\r\n\r\nReal victory is found in resilience. It\'s found in persistence. And most importantly, it\'s found in the heart of anyone brave enough to keep fighting.\r\n\r\nStay strong. Keep pushing. Always move forward.',NULL,'2025-02-17','1',6,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-25 14:18:23','2025-04-25 14:19:43',NULL,NULL),(530,'CES CHAMPIONSHIP JACKPOT (click on photo)','ces-championship-jackpot',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-10','1',17,1,106,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-26 14:49:14','2025-05-02 21:10:07',NULL,NULL),(531,'The Fight Life- KING KEVIN WALSH','the-fight-life-king-kevin-walsh',NUL