nsurance-or-medicaid-for-transportation-services',NULL,'Yes, we accept Medicaid, Medicare, private insurance, and workers\' compensation. We also accept cash, debit and credit cards, PayPal, Venmo, CashApp, and Apple Pay.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,109,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-26 15:45:56','2025-04-26 15:45:56',NULL,NULL),(538,'What safety measures do you take?','what-safety-measures-do-you-take',NULL,'Your safety and comfort are our top priorities. We provide thoroughly cleaned vehicles, conduct rigorous driver background checks, and ensure all staff receive specialized safety and sensitivity training.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,109,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-26 15:46:45','2025-04-26 15:46:45',NULL,NULL),(539,'Can a caregiver or companion accompany me during the trip?','can-a-caregiver-or-companion-accompany-me-during-the-trip',NULL,'Absolutely! Passengers can have a caregiver or companion travel along at no additional charge.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,109,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-26 15:47:30','2025-04-26 15:47:30',NULL,NULL),(540,'Are your services wheelchair accessible?','are-your-services-wheelchair-accessible',NULL,'Yes, our fleet includes wheelchair-accessible vehicles specifically designed for safe and comfortable transport.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,109,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-26 15:48:07','2025-04-26 15:48:07',NULL,NULL),(541,'How do I schedule a ride?','how-do-i-schedule-a-ride',NULL,'You can schedule a ride directly through our websiteΓÇÖs booking page or call us at (508) 642-3995.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,109,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-26 15:48:49','2025-04-26 15:48:49',NULL,NULL),(542,'What are your operating hours?','what-are-your-operating-hours',NULL,'Monday ΓÇô Friday: 4:00 AM ΓÇô 5:00 PM\r\nSaturday ΓÇô Sunday: 8:00 AM ΓÇô 3:00 PM',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,109,NULL,NULL,'2025-04-26 15:49:41','2025-04-26 15:49:41',NULL,NULL),(543,'Can you accommodate special requests?','can-you-accommodate-special-requests',NULL,'We always strive to accommodate special requests and unique needs. Please inform us when booking, and we\'