cellence. Throughout my career, I have cultivated a results-driven mindset, always seeking new and innovative ways to add value, drive growth, and foster lasting relationships.\r\n\r\nBeyond my professional pursuits, I am a dedicated family man and proud father of two. I believe that true success is measured not just by accomplishments in business, but by the meaningful moments we create with the people who matter most. Traveling and exploring new cultures are passions of mine, as they continuously broaden my perspective and fuel both personal and professional growth.\r\n\r\nI am always open to connecting with like-minded individuals, sharing ideas, and exploring new opportunities for collaboration and impact.\r\n\r\nLetΓÇÖs connect and create something meaningful together.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,127,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-04 19:00:40','2025-05-04 19:00:40',NULL,NULL),(792,'Where Passion Meets Purpose','where-passion-meets-purpose',NULL,'<p><strong>My name is FridahΓÇöI\'m a passionate pharmacist with a heart for service and a drive to make a real impact. I specialize in long-term care, mental health, and disability services, serving vulnerable communities with empathy and precision. I believe nothing is impossible with the right mindset, and I donΓÇÖt take ΓÇ£noΓÇ¥ for an answer.</strong></p><p><strong>Fueled by resilience, creativity, and a deep love for human connection, I lead with intention and positivity. My motto? ΓÇ£What you think, you feelΓÇöwhat you feel, you create.ΓÇ¥ I\'m not just in healthcare; I\'m here to spark change, inspire growth, and prove that perseverance can turn challenges into transformation.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,127,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-04 19:24:34','2025-05-04 19:24:34',NULL,NULL),(793,'From Shingles to CEO: A Legacy in the Making','from-shingles-to-ceo-a-legacy-in-the-making-2',NULL,'At 13, my grandfather told me he wasnΓÇÖt buying my school clothes anymoreΓÇöI had to earn them. So, I started working for him, hauling shingles and cleaning job sites. I went from a skinny kid who got cut from the football team to returning after a summer of hard labor with a new frame and mindset. I made the team, played high school ball, and eventually Division-1 college football.\r\nAfter graduating with a degree in business and finance, I joined a Sears roofing crew to pay billsΓÇöand stayed for 22 years. I mastered roofing, siding, windows, kitchens, bathrooms, and became an HVAC tech. In 2010, after speaking to a sales team about cleaner installs, I was offered a sales role. That launched a new path, eventually rising into upper management until Sears\' downfall in 2017.\r\n\r\nI then led the commercial division for one of CTΓÇÖs top roofing companies. But in 2020, I launched Hall Of Fame Construction Group LLCΓÇöa family-run business built on legacy and integrity. Our mission? Offer homeowners high-end solutions without the bloated big-box prices. With my wife and kids in the business, we keep costs low (no payroll for familyΓÇökidding, kind of).\r\nWe focus on smart home solutions, expert installs, and real warranties at prices that make sense.\r\nThereΓÇÖs the \"Do it Right\" price and the \"Do it Twice\" priceΓÇöDo it Right with Hall Of Fame.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(794,'Your Trusted Home Improvement Experts','your-trusted-home-improvement-experts-2',NULL,'With over 30 years of experience in the home improvement industry, we here at Hall of Fame Construction Group, LLC, strive for excellence on every single project. From our full time customer care center, to our elite sales department and production team, our mission is to provide the ultimate customer experience one project at a time.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(795,'Home Improvement License','home-improvement-license-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(796,'Liability Insurance','liability-insurance-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(797,'Vinyl Siding Certification','vinyl-siding-certification-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(798,'Workmans Comp Liability Insurance','workmans-comp-liability-insurance-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(799,'What services do you offer?','what-services-do-you-offer-2',NULL,'WeΓÇÖre not just a one-trick pony. We specialize in roofing (shingle & metal), siding, insulation, window & door replacements, storm damage assessments, and roof repair. If it protects or upgrades your home, chances areΓÇöwe do it and do it well.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(800,'Are your installers certified?','are-your-installers-certified-2',NULL,'Absolutely. Our team includes VSI Certified Installers, meaning your project gets done right the first timeΓÇönot the \"oops, call us back\" kind of work.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(801,'Do you offer free estimates?','do-you-offer-free-estimates-4',NULL,'You bet we do. No pressure, no gimmicks. Just straight talk, honest pricing, and a clear plan for how weΓÇÖll make your house the MVP of the block.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(802,'How long does a typical roofing or siding project take?','how-long-does-a-typical-roofing-or-siding-project-take-2',NULL,'Depends on the size of your home and what weΓÇÖre tackling, but most projects wrap up in a few days to a week. We work fast, clean, and with laser focusΓÇölike your home is up for an award.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:32','2025-05-07 03:49:32',NULL,NULL),(803,'What kind of warranties do you offer?','what-kind-of-warranties-do-you-offer-2',NULL,'We donΓÇÖt mess around with fine print. We offer strong manufacturer warranties and our own workmanship guarantee. YouΓÇÖre covered from every angleΓÇöliterally.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,128,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 03:49:33','2025-05-07 03:49:33',NULL,NULL),(824,'2','2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:16:42','2025-05-07 14:16:42',NULL,NULL),(825,'1','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:21:08','2025-05-07 14:21:08',NULL,NULL),(826,'3','3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,101,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:22:53','2025-05-07 14:22:53',NULL,NULL),(827,'What types of cases do you handle?','what-types-of-cases-do-you-handle-2',NULL,'I handle criminal defense, civil rights, personal injury, juvenile and family law, and sports & entertainment law. If your freedom, rights, or reputation are on the line ΓÇö IΓÇÖm the one you call.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(828,'Do you offer free consultations?','do-you-offer-free-consultations-2',NULL,'Yes. I offer a no-pressure consultation so we can talk through your situation and see if weΓÇÖre a good fit. If I can help, IΓÇÖll tell you how. If not, IΓÇÖll still point you in the right direction.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(829,'What sets you apart from other attorneys?','what-sets-you-apart-from-other-attorneys-2',NULL,'I come from struggle ΓÇö I know what itΓÇÖs like to be underestimated. ThatΓÇÖs why I fight with purpose. I donΓÇÖt just talk a good game, I show up, strategize, and win. I treat every case like itΓÇÖs personal, because to you ΓÇö it is.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(830,'How do I get started?','how-do-i-get-started-2',NULL,'Click the ΓÇ£CallΓÇ¥ or ΓÇ£Book ConsultationΓÇ¥ button on this card. You can also email me directly or visit my office in Springfield. However you reach me, youΓÇÖll get a straight answer ΓÇö and fast.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(831,'WhatΓÇÖs your track record like?','whats-your-track-record-like-2',NULL,'LetΓÇÖs just say this: my name holds weight. IΓÇÖve defended high-stakes cases, worked with pro athletes, and fought for families that had everything on the line. I donΓÇÖt take shortcuts ΓÇö I take results.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(832,'Do you take payment plans?','do-you-take-payment-plans-2',NULL,'Do you take payment plans?\r\nDepending on the case, yes ΓÇö I believe good people deserve strong representation, and IΓÇÖll work with you to make it manageable. LetΓÇÖs talk about it during your consultation.',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(833,'Where I Come From. Why I Fight.','where-i-come-from-why-i-fight-2',NULL,'IΓÇÖm Attorney Kedar K. Ismail ΓÇö a trial lawyer, a strategist, and a fighter for justice. I built my law practice in Springfield, MA, but my journey started far from the courtroom. I grew up in Elizabeth, New Jersey ΓÇö in a place where opportunities were limited, and the odds werenΓÇÖt in anyoneΓÇÖs favor. That upbringing didnΓÇÖt break me ΓÇö it built me. It taught me how to fight smart, speak up, and never back down.\r\n\r\nToday, I run a law firm that stands up for the underdog. I represent people facing criminal charges, civil rights violations, personal injury battles, family struggles, and even high-stakes issues in the sports and entertainment world. IΓÇÖve gone toe-to-toe with powerful institutions, and IΓÇÖve had the backs of athletes, artists, and everyday people who just needed someone to believe in them.\r\n\r\nWhat sets me apart? I donΓÇÖt sugarcoat things. I give it to you straight ΓÇö with a plan. I mix legal precision with street-level understanding. I treat every case like itΓÇÖs personal, because when your futureΓÇÖs on the line, you donΓÇÖt need a lawyer who plays it safe. You need one who plays to win.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re looking for real representation ΓÇö not just someone to show up in a suit ΓÇö letΓÇÖs talk. IΓÇÖm here to fight for you.',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(834,'What They DonΓÇÖt Tell You When YouΓÇÖre Charged With a Crime','what-they-dont-tell-you-when-youre-charged-with-a-crime-2',NULL,'Let me keep it all the way real ΓÇö when youΓÇÖre charged with a crime, the system isnΓÇÖt on your side. ItΓÇÖs fast, unforgiving, and designed to push you through like a number, not a person. And if you donΓÇÖt have someone in your corner who knows how to fight smart? YouΓÇÖre already ten steps behind.\r\n\r\nAs a criminal defense attorney, IΓÇÖve seen it all ΓÇö wrongful arrests, overcharged offenses, and people being pressured into taking deals they donΓÇÖt understand. The truth is, most folks donΓÇÖt even know their rights ΓÇö and thatΓÇÖs exactly how the system wants it.\r\n\r\nHereΓÇÖs what you need to know right now if you or someone you love is facing charges:\r\n\r\nDonΓÇÖt say a word without a lawyer. Not to the cops, not to the DA, not even ΓÇ£just to explain.ΓÇ¥ That \"explanation\" can and will be used against you.\r\nBail doesnΓÇÖt mean guilt. It just means they want to hold you ΓÇö and I can often help reduce or eliminate it if IΓÇÖm brought in early.\r\nPublic defenders are overloaded. They care, but theyΓÇÖre buried. You deserve someone who has the time and strategy to focus fully on your case.\r\nBottom line? You get one shot to protect your freedom. DonΓÇÖt waste it rolling the dice with someone whoΓÇÖs not built to win in that courtroom.',NULL,'2024-12-21','1',6,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(835,'Know Your Rights ΓÇö Or Risk Losing Them','know-your-rights-or-risk-losing-them-2',NULL,'I donΓÇÖt care what neighborhood youΓÇÖre from, what you look like, or what your past says ΓÇö if your rights were violated, I want to hear about it.\r\n\r\nBecause hereΓÇÖs the truth: civil rights arenΓÇÖt optional. TheyΓÇÖre not negotiable. And they sure as hell arenΓÇÖt reserved for the privileged few.\r\n\r\nIΓÇÖve fought for people whoΓÇÖve been unlawfully arrested, assaulted by police, harassed at work, and profiled for simply existing in the wrong place at the wrong time. And let me tell you ΓÇö these arenΓÇÖt just ΓÇ£unfortunate situations.ΓÇ¥ TheyΓÇÖre violations of the Constitution.\r\n\r\nIf any of this sounds familiar, here\'s what you need to do:\r\n\r\nDocument everything. Dates, times, names, badge numbers. Screenshots. Video. The more, the better.\r\nDonΓÇÖt wait. The longer you sit on it, the harder it becomes to build a case.\r\nCall me. This isnΓÇÖt just about money ΓÇö itΓÇÖs about holding people accountable and making sure it doesnΓÇÖt happen again.\r\nThe system wonΓÇÖt fix itself. But together, we can make sure it doesn\'t break you.',NULL,'2025-02-05','1',6,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(836,'My Mission is Simple','my-mission-is-simple-2',NULL,'To fight for justice with relentless integrity, fearless strategy, and unwavering respect for the people I serve. I stand up for those whoΓÇÖve been overlooked, mistreated, or underestimated ΓÇö and I donΓÇÖt stop until their voices are heard and their rights are protected.\r\n\r\nWhether IΓÇÖm defending someoneΓÇÖs freedom in a courtroom, holding law enforcement accountable, or negotiating deals for athletes and artists ΓÇö I bring the same energy every time: real, raw, and results-driven.\r\n\r\nI didnΓÇÖt become an attorney to play it safe. I became one to make an impact.\r\nBecause when the system tries to break you, you need someone who refuses to fold.',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(837,'Why Choose Me','why-choose-me-2',NULL,'Because I donΓÇÖt just take cases ΓÇö I take a stand.\r\n\r\nWhen you work with me, you\'re not getting some cookie-cutter lawyer who checks boxes and files paperwork. You\'re getting a fighter. A strategist. Someone who grew up in the real world, understands the system from the inside out, and knows how to win ΓÇö because IΓÇÖve had to.\r\n\r\nHereΓÇÖs what makes me different:\r\n\r\nI keep it real. I donΓÇÖt sugarcoat. I give you the facts, the risks, and the game plan ΓÇö straight up.\r\nI treat every case like itΓÇÖs personal. Because to you, it is. And that means I show up prepared, aggressive, and laser-focused.\r\nI donΓÇÖt get intimidated. Not by the system, not by the other side, and definitely not by a challenge.\r\nI get results. Whether itΓÇÖs beating criminal charges, fighting for your rights, or securing life-changing deals ΓÇö IΓÇÖve done it, and IΓÇÖll do it again.\r\nYouΓÇÖre not just hiring an attorney. YouΓÇÖre getting an advocate, a protector, and someone who actually gives a damn.\r\n\r\nIf thatΓÇÖs the kind of lawyer youΓÇÖre looking for ΓÇö IΓÇÖm ready when you are.',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:16','2025-05-07 14:34:16',NULL,NULL),(838,'2','3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:17','2025-05-07 14:34:17',NULL,NULL),(839,'1','2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:17','2025-05-07 14:34:17',NULL,NULL),(840,'3','4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 14:34:17','2025-05-07 14:34:17',NULL,NULL),(841,'Rooted in Experience, Rising for Justice','rooted-in-experience-rising-for-justice',NULL,'<p><strong>Joel Wesonga is an aspiring lawyer who is dedicated to making a positive impact on the lives of those struggling within the current immigration system. Joel\'s background as the son of immigrants from Kenya and Uganda fuels his unwavering mission as a part-time evening law student at Western New England University School of Law. With a deep understanding of the challenges faced by individuals seeking a better life in a foreign land, Joel is driven to bring about change and reform within the immigration system.</strong></p><p><strong>ΓÇïΓÇï</strong></p><p><strong>Prior to his journey in law, Joel graduated with a Bachelor of Science &amp; Arts degree in Sociology and Urban and Community Studies from the University of Connecticut. Currently employed full-time in healthcare management, he also has previous experience as a social worker for the Department of Children and Families (DCF), offering him a distinct viewpoint and varied skill set.</strong></p><p><strong>ΓÇï</strong></p><p><strong>As a first-generation law student, Joel is determined to effect positive change and ensure that the rights and needs of marginalized individuals are upheld with compassion and integrity. His commitment to justice, coupled with his personal experiences, makes him a promising force in the legal professio</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">n</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,130,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-07 15:09:52','2025-05-07 15:11:12',NULL,NULL),(842,'My Mission','our-mission-18',NULL,'<p><strong>At Keys To Dreams By Jessica, my mission is to empower individuals and families by guiding them through every step of the real estate journey with integrity, professionalism, and heart. I am committed to turning dreams into addresses by delivering personalized service, building lasting relationships, and helping my clients confidently buy and sell homes throughout Connecticut and beyond.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,107,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-16 22:10:58','2025-05-18 01:17:46',NULL,NULL),(843,'Brooklyn bred. Paris inspired. Soul rooted.','brooklyn-bred-paris-inspired-soul-rooted',NULL,'<p><strong>&nbsp;Yma Orn├⌐ Campbell, the bold and brilliant founder behind&nbsp;<em>Orn├⌐</em>. With a background in psychology and decades of service in the human services field, Yma Orn├⌐ has always been driven by one thing: helping people feel seen, loved, and cared for.</strong></p><p><strong>And now, sheΓÇÖs doing it through cookies.</strong></p><p><strong>Baking and cooking have always been her favorite pastimesΓÇöa place where love meets flavor and memories are made one batch at a time. Blending Brooklyn sass with a touch of Parisian elegance, she created&nbsp;<em>Orn├⌐</em>&nbsp;to elevate the everyday cookie into something soulful, stylish, and unforgettable.</strong></p><p><strong>Every bite is a reflection of her storyΓÇögrit, grace, and a whole lotta flavor.</strong></p><p><strong>Because for Yma Orn├⌐, cookies arenΓÇÖt just treats.</strong></p><p><strong>TheyΓÇÖre therapy. TheyΓÇÖre connection.</strong></p><p><strong>TheyΓÇÖre love,&nbsp;<em>embellished</em></strong>.</p>',NULL,'2025-06-05','1',16,1,131,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-17 15:16:56','2025-06-04 20:53:05',NULL,NULL),(844,'Orn├⌐ Mission Statement','orne-mission-statement',NULL,'<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Orn├⌐</strong>, our mission is to elevate the cookie from a simple treat to an unforgettable experienceΓÇöwhere each bite is thoughtfully handcrafted, elegantly adorned, and rooted in love.</p><p>We blend Brooklyn boldness with Parisian grace, using only the finest ingredients and intentional care to create cookies that not only taste exquisite but tell a story. From classic comforts to couture creations, we exist to make people feel cherished, seen, and celebratedΓÇöone luxurious crumb at a time.</p><p><strong>Because at Orn├⌐... every cookie is a love letter.</strong></p>',NULL,'2025-06-05','1',19,1,131,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-17 16:09:39','2025-06-04 20:53:36',NULL,NULL),(845,'Luxury Cookie Brand ΓÇ£Orn├⌐ΓÇ¥ Launches to Elevate the Art of Indulgence','luxury-cookie-brand-orne-launches-to-elevate-the-art-of-indulgence',NULL,'<p><strong><em>Founded by Yma Orn├⌐ Campbell, the Brooklyn-born, Paris-inspired baker is redefining what it means to taste elegance.</em></strong></p><p><strong>BROOKLYN, NY</strong> ΓÇö&nbsp;Orn├⌐, a new luxury cookie brand, is making waves in the gourmet dessert space with its signature blend of soulful flavor and high-end design. Founded by&nbsp;Yma Orn├⌐ Campbell, a Brooklyn native with a background in psychology and human services, Orn├⌐ is not just about cookiesΓÇöitΓÇÖs about connection, comfort, and class.</p><p>Crafted with organic butter, Madagascar vanilla, and a touch of French flair, each cookie in the Orn├⌐ collection is a handcrafted experience. From the beloved&nbsp;<em>Le Classique au Chocolat</em>&nbsp;to the decadent&nbsp;<em>Peanut Butter Toffee w/ Pretzel</em>, every creation is adorned with intentionΓÇöand love.</p><p>ΓÇ£The word<strong> ΓÇÿOrn├⌐</strong>ΓÇÖ means adorned or embellished,ΓÇ¥ says Campbell. ΓÇ£ThatΓÇÖs what our cookies are. Not just bakedΓÇöbut made beautiful.ΓÇ¥</p><p>With offerings like curated tasting events, monthly indulgence boxes, luxury gifting services, and even ΓÇ£Cookie TherapyΓÇ¥ sets, Orn├⌐ is positioned to become a leader in experiential dessert branding.</p><p>For more information or to order.</p><p>Media Contact:</p><p>Kameron Pierre Wilson/PR Rep</p><p>kameron.wilson09@gmail.com</p><p>(860) 818-2154</p>',NULL,'2025-06-05','1',18,1,131,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-17 16:32:43','2025-06-04 20:54:18',NULL,NULL),(846,'Orn├⌐: La Collection de Biscuits de Luxe - Curated confections for the cultivated palate.','orne-la-collection-de-biscuits-de-luxe',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Orn├⌐: La Collection de Biscuits de Luxe</strong></p><p><em>Curated confections for the cultivated palate.</em></p><p>At <strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Orn├⌐</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">,</span> we believe true indulgence is found in the details. Our cookies are handcrafted using only the finest ingredientsΓÇöorganic butter, Madagascar vanilla, and a touch of sea saltΓÇöbaked to perfection in small batches to ensure each bite is pure delight.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">1. Le Classique au Chocolat ΓÇô The Signature Chocolate Chip</strong></p><p><em>A timeless classic, redefined.</em></p><p>Rich milk chocolate morsels folded into golden dough made with organic butter and sea salt. Soft, melty, and elegant in every bite.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">2. Beurre de Cacahu├¿te ├ël├⌐gant ΓÇô The Peanut Butter Classic</strong></p><p><em>Simple elegance with bold flavor.</em></p><p>Crafted with organic peanut butter, this cookie delivers a smooth, nutty richness that lingers luxuriously on the palate.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">3. Biscuit Blanc &amp; Noir ΓÇô Oreo Crush</strong></p><p><em>Decadent meets nostalgic.</em></p><p>Crushed Oreo cookies wrapped in a soft dough with creamy white chocolate chips. A refined spin on a childhood favorite.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">4. Chocolat ├á Deux Visages ΓÇô Double Chocolate Affair</strong></p><p><em>For the unapologetic chocolate lover.</em></p><p>Infused with Hershey\'s chocolate, this cookie features a mix of white chocolate chips, milk chocolate chips, or both for a rich, layered experience.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">5. Cannelle Sucr├⌐e ΓÇô Sweet Doodle</strong></p><p><em>The softer side of indulgence.</em></p><p>A soft, pillowy cookie combining cinnamon and brown sugar. Warm, comforting, and elegantly simple.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">6. Cr├¿me de Banane ΓÇô Banana Pudding Bliss</strong></p><p><em>A Southern classic, elevated.</em></p><p>Flavored with pure banana extract and notes of ripe banana, this cookie melts in your mouth with comforting sweetness.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">7. Croquant Sal├⌐ au Beurre de Cacahu├¿te ΓÇô Peanut Butter Toffee with Pretzel</strong></p><p><em>A refined fusion of sweet and salty.</em></p><p>Crunchy pretzels, buttery toffee bits, and organic peanut butter come together for a striking contrast of texture and taste.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">8. Noix de P├⌐can Dor├⌐e ΓÇô Toasted Pecan</strong></p><p><em>Buttery, toasty perfection.</em></p><p>Loaded with deep, roasted pecan flavor and wrapped in a melt-in-your-mouth buttery dough, this cookie is nutty, nostalgic, and endlessly satisfying.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">9. Noix de Coco R├┤tie ΓÇô Roasted Coconut Cookie</strong></p><p><em>Tropical elegance in every bite.</em></p><p>Buttery roasted coconut blended seamlessly into a delicate, soft cookie. Rich, golden, and slightly crisp at the edgesΓÇölike a beach vacation in baked form.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">10. G├óteau Carotte Reimagin├⌐ ΓÇô Carrot Cake Cookie</strong></p><p><em>A classic dessert, redefined.</em></p><p>All the flavor of a rich carrot cake packed into one perfect cookie. Infused with carrots, raisins, and pecans for a texture that\'s layered, moist, and unforgettable.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Orn├⌐. Because elegance should be tasted.</strong></p>',NULL,'2025-06-05','1',21,1,131,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-18 19:47:09','2025-06-04 20:55:50',NULL,NULL),(847,'Test Menu 1','test-menu-1',NULL,'<p>Test Menu 1</p>',NULL,'2025-05-19','1',21,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-19 22:44:11','2025-05-19 22:44:11',NULL,NULL),(848,'MichelangeloΓÇ»Casanova | Empowerment Coach ┬╖ Keynote Speaker ┬╖ Founder,ΓÇ»GettΓÇ»Excited','michelangelo-casanova-empowerment-coach-keynote-speaker-founder-gett-excited',NULL,'<p><br></p><p><strong>IΓÇÖve walked the hard milesΓÇöfrom childhood trauma and addiction to the front row of my own comebackΓÇöand I turned that road map into a coaching framework that sparks rapid, lasting change. Certified in Life Coaching and grounded in YaleΓÇÖs ΓÇ£ScienceΓÇ»ofΓÇ»WellΓÇæBeing,ΓÇ¥ I blend evidenceΓÇæbased psychology with unapologetic, straightΓÇætalk motivation.</strong></p><p><strong>Through&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"www.gettexcited.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\"><strong>GettΓÇ»Excited,</strong></a><strong> I help leaders, athletes, and restless goΓÇægetters dismantle limiting beliefs, rewire mindset, and execute on bold goals. Clients call my sessions ΓÇ£a shot of espresso for the soulΓÇ¥ΓÇöhighΓÇæenergy, practical, and results obsessed.</strong></p><p><strong>If youΓÇÖre ready to trade excuses for momentum and rewrite your narrative, letΓÇÖs connect. Your next level is waitingΓÇöGett Excited!</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,53,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-20 17:42:31','2025-05-20 17:42:31',NULL,NULL),(849,'Life Coach Certification','life-coach-certification-15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,53,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-20 19:43:01','2025-05-20 19:43:01',NULL,NULL),(850,'Science of Well Being Yale','science-of-well-being-yale',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,53,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-20 19:43:55','2025-05-20 19:43:55',NULL,NULL),(851,'Why Work With Me?','why-work-with-me',NULL,'<h3><strong>Clients call my sessions ΓÇ£a shot of espresso for the soulΓÇ¥ΓÇöhighΓÇæenergy, practical, and resultsΓÇæobsessed. Whether youΓÇÖre a CΓÇæsuite exec, a 17ΓÇæyearΓÇæold phenom, or a returning citizen ready for a reset, I bring the same missionΓÇæcritical intensity:&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">refuse to let you quit on yourself.</strong></h3><h3><strong>If youΓÇÖre ready to trade excuses for momentum and rewrite your narrative, letΓÇÖs connect. Your next level is waitingΓÇöget excited and letΓÇÖs go.</strong></h3><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,53,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-20 22:00:01','2025-05-20 22:00:01',NULL,NULL),(852,'GettΓÇ»Excited','gett-excited',NULL,'<h3><strong>Empower individuals to demolish limiting beliefs and execute bold visions through evidenceΓÇæbased, highΓÇæenergy coaching that turns obstacles into fuel for growth.</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,53,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-20 22:23:20','2025-05-20 22:23:20',NULL,NULL),(853,'From Prison Cell to BusinessΓÇæCard Disruptor: MichelangeloΓÇ»CasanovaΓÇÖs TwoΓÇæPronged Mission to MotivateΓÇöand Modernize Networking','from-prison-cell-to-businesscard-disruptor-michelangelo-casanovas-twopronged-mission-to-motivate-and-modernize-networking',NULL,'<p><strong>From Prison Cell to BusinessΓÇæCard Disruptor: MichelangeloΓÇ»CasanovaΓÇÖs TwoΓÇæPronged Mission to MotivateΓÇöand Modernize Networking</strong></p><p><em>By Staff Writer,ΓÇ»The Hartford Beacon</em></p><p><em> Hartford, Conn.ΓÇ»ΓÇöΓÇ»MayΓÇ»20,ΓÇ»2025</em></p><p>MichelangeloΓÇ»CasanovaΓÇÖs journey from inmate to inspiration has been well documented, but the lifeΓÇæcoachΓÇæturnedΓÇætechΓÇæfounder refuses to coast on redemption alone. While his <strong>GettΓÇ»Excited</strong> platform keeps filling calendars with highΓÇæoctane coaching sessions and keynote gigs, Casanova has quietly launched a second ventureΓÇö<strong>vBizΓÇ»Me</strong>, a SaaS tool that turns boring business cards into mini marketing campaigns. Together, the two companies paint a picture of a man determined to upgrade both mindΓÇæsets and first impressions.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Coaching That DoesnΓÇÖt Coddle</strong></p><p>At GettΓÇ»Excited, Casanova offers a service menu that ranges from motivational speaking and oneΓÇæonΓÇæone life coaching to youth mentoring and postΓÇæprison reintegration programs. His approach blends straightΓÇætalk accountability with coursework from Yale UniversityΓÇÖs ΓÇ£Science of WellΓÇæBeing,ΓÇ¥ ensuring the pep talk comes with evidenceΓÇæbased muscle.&nbsp;</p><p>ΓÇ£Clients are the experts on their own livesΓÇöIΓÇÖm the expert on the coaching process,ΓÇ¥ Casanova says on his website. That process includes hard questions, weekly action plans, and a zeroΓÇæexcuse policy. Offerings like <strong>Confidence, SelfΓÇæEsteem &amp; SelfΓÇæWorth Coaching</strong> and <strong>Accountability Coaching</strong> are designed to convert selfΓÇædoubt into forward momentum, whether the client is a teenager, a returning citizen, or a CΓÇæsuite veteran.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>A Digital Card That Actually Gets Kept</strong></p><p>CasanovaΓÇÖs knack for reinvention shows up again in <strong>vBizΓÇ»Me</strong>, which aims to solve a pain point every networker knows: paper business cards that wind up in the trash. The platform replaces cardstock with an interactive vCard that opens with a dynamic intro video, showcases clickable callsΓÇætoΓÇæaction, and can be shared via QR code or custom URL. Users can embed logos, brand colors, and even realΓÇætime analytics to see who viewed or shared their card.&nbsp;</p><p>ΓÇ£Be unforgettable, network smarter,ΓÇ¥ the vBizΓÇ»Me homepage declares, highlighting features like customizable design elements, socialΓÇæmedia icons, and engagement buttons such as ΓÇ£BookΓÇ»Now.ΓÇ¥ A builtΓÇæin tracking dashboard lets users measure ROI on every handshake.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>One Mission, Two Vehicles</strong></p><p>Asked how a lifeΓÇæcoaching brand and a networking SaaS fit under the same umbrella, Casanova shrugs: ΓÇ£Whether IΓÇÖm coaching a client or building a tech platform, the goal is the sameΓÇöhelp people bet on themselves and win.ΓÇ¥ With GettΓÇ»Excited addressing the inner game and vBizΓÇ»Me supercharging the first impression, Casanova now offers a full stack of personal and professional upgrades.</p><p><strong>How to Connect</strong></p><p>Prospective clients can reach Casanova at <strong>mc@gettexcited.com</strong> or <strong>mcasanova@vbizme.com</strong>, or call <strong>(860)ΓÇ»770ΓÇæ9893</strong>to book a coaching session or request a demo of vBizΓÇ»Me. For a man who once wondered whether his own story would end behind bars, the next chapter is already writing itselfΓÇöone empowered client and one unforgettable vCard at a time.</p><h3><br></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',18,1,53,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-20 22:30:13','2025-05-20 22:30:13',NULL,NULL),(854,'≡ƒì¬ ΓÇ£What Makes a Cookie Gourmet?ΓÇ¥','what-makes-a-cookie-gourmet',NULL,'<h2><br></h2><p><em>By Yma Orn├⌐ Campbell, Founder of Orn├⌐</em></p><p><strong>LetΓÇÖs clear something up right now:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Not all cookies are created equal.</strong></p><p><strong>Some are quick fixes.</strong></p><p><strong>Some are afterthoughts.</strong></p><p><strong>And some?</strong></p><p><strong>Some are&nbsp;<em>experiences</em>ΓÇölayered, intentional, and unforgettable.</strong></p><p><strong>ThatΓÇÖs what we cal</strong>l&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">gourmet.</strong></p><p><strong>SoΓÇª what&nbsp;<em>does</em>&nbsp;make a cookie gourmet? Let me break it down:</strong></p><p><br></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">1.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Ingredients that Matter</strong></h3><p><strong>A gourmet cookie starts with what you&nbsp;<em>donΓÇÖt</em>&nbsp;see on the label of a store-bought pack. IΓÇÖm talking about:</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Organic butter that actually tastes like cream</strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Madagascar vanilla that lingers like a love song</strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Sea salt<em>&nbsp;</em></strong><strong><em>(because a touch of salt brings out the soul of the sweet)</em></strong></li><li><strong>And premium add-ins like roasted pecans, Belgian chocolate, and white chocolate that&nbsp;<em>melts</em>, not clumps</strong></li></ul><p><strong>A gourmet cookie isnΓÇÖt just about flavorΓÇöitΓÇÖs about integrity. If it wouldnΓÇÖt make Grandma proud, we donΓÇÖt use it.</strong></p><p><br></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">2.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Texture Is Queen</strong></h3><p><strong>Crispy edges. Soft centers. Gooey pockets.</strong></p><p><strong>A real gourmet cookie isnΓÇÖt just one noteΓÇöitΓÇÖs a&nbsp;<em>symphony.</em></strong></p><p><strong>It plays with texture like silk on skin. Every bite evolves.</strong></p><p><strong>At Orn├⌐, we perfect every batch with patience and purpose. If the cookie doesn\'t&nbsp;<em>feel</em>&nbsp;right when you break it in halfΓÇª back to the drawing board.</strong></p><p><br></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">3.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Presentation That Feels Like a Gift</strong></h3><p><strong>LetΓÇÖs be real: we eat with our eyes first.</strong></p><p><strong>ThatΓÇÖs why at Orn├⌐, every cookie is</strong>&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">adorned</strong>ΓÇö<strong>not just baked. From the elegant swirl of a chocolate chip to the custom packaging that looks like it came out of a Parisian boutique, we treat every order like a love letter.</strong></p><p><strong>Gourmet means&nbsp;<em>you feel special</em>&nbsp;before you even take the first bite.</strong></p><p><br></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">4.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Flavors That Tell a Story</strong></h3><p><strong>Anyone can make a chocolate chip cookie. But can they make you&nbsp;<em>remember it</em>&nbsp;three days later?</strong></p><p><strong>Gourmet cookies are rooted in&nbsp;<em>intention.</em>&nbsp;Our&nbsp;<em>Cr├¿me de Banane</em>&nbsp;is a nod to banana pudding Sundays. Our&nbsp;<em>Cannelle Sucr├⌐e</em>&nbsp;is comfort dressed in brown sugar and cinnamon silk. And our&nbsp;<em>G├óteau Carotte Reimagin├⌐</em>? ThatΓÇÖs carrot cake if it got invited to the Met Gala.</strong></p><p><br></p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">5.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">The Emotion Behind It All</strong></h3><p><strong>HereΓÇÖs the secret:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Gourmet isnΓÇÖt just a taste. ItΓÇÖs a feeling.</strong></p><p><strong>When someone opens an Orn├⌐ box, I want them to feel&nbsp;<em>seen.</em></strong></p><p><strong>When they bite into that cookie, I want them to feel&nbsp;<em>held.</em></strong></p><p><strong>And when itΓÇÖs gone, I want them to think,</strong></p><blockquote><em>ΓÇ£</em><em style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">That wasnΓÇÖt just dessertΓÇª that was a moment.ΓÇ¥</em></blockquote><p><strong>Because in this fast world of fast food and fast feelings, a gourmet cookie slows you down. Grounds you.</strong></p><p><strong>Reminds you that</strong>&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">youΓÇÖre worth every crumb.</strong></p><p><strong>Want to know more about our ingredients, seasonal flavors, or how I went from human services to cookie couture?</strong></p><p><strong>Stick around.</strong></p><p><strong>Because at Orn├⌐.</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">..&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">weΓÇÖre just getting started.</em></p><p>ΓÇö</p><p><strong>With elegance and a touch of sea salt,</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(194, 133, 255);\">Yma Orn├⌐ Campbell</strong></p><p><strong>Founder, Orn├⌐</strong></p>',NULL,'2025-06-05','1',6,1,131,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-22 00:55:06','2025-06-04 20:57:11',NULL,NULL),(855,'What services does Forest Tech USA offer?','what-services-does-forest-tech-usa-offer',NULL,'<p><strong>Jack and his team at Forest Tech USA specialize in:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Tree Removal</strong></li><li><strong>Land clearing for residential, commercial, and municipal properties</strong></li><li><strong>24/7 emergency storm damage response</strong></li><li><strong>Brush chipping and debris cleanup </strong></li></ul><p><strong>Basically, if it\'s leafy and causing you grief, we\'ve got the gear and the grit to handle it.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 13:45:17','2025-08-01 01:18:43',NULL,NULL),(856,'Is Forest Tech USA licensed and insured?','is-forest-tech-usa-licensed-and-insured',NULL,'<p><strong>Absolutely. They\'re fully licensed and insured, so you can rest easy knowing that your propertyΓÇöand their crewΓÇöare protected.&nbsp;No need to worry about unexpected \"tree-mageddons\" on your dime.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 13:46:27','2025-05-23 13:46:27',NULL,NULL),(857,'Do they handle emergency tree removals?','do-they-handle-emergency-tree-removals',NULL,'<p><strong>Yes, indeed. Storms don\'t keep business hours, and neither does Forest Tech USA.&nbsp;They\'re on call 24/7 to tackle fallen trees, dangling limbs, and any other arboreal emergencies that Mother Nature throws your way.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 13:47:40','2025-05-23 13:47:40',NULL,NULL),(858,'What areas do they serve?','what-areas-do-they-serve',NULL,'<p>Forest Tech USA is based in Bristol, Connecticut, and serves the surrounding areas.&nbsp;Whether you\'re in New Britain, Southington, or nearby towns, they\'re ready to bring their tree expertise to your doorstep.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 13:48:40','2025-08-01 01:21:48',NULL,NULL),(859,'How experienced is the team?','how-experienced-is-the-team',NULL,'<p><strong>Jack Bardales, the president of Forest Tech USA, has been leading the charge since the company\'s inception.&nbsp;With years of hands-on experience, the team knows their oaks from their maples and handles each project with professionalism and care.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 13:50:52','2025-05-23 13:50:52',NULL,NULL),(860,'How can I get a quote or schedule a service?','how-can-i-get-a-quote-or-schedule-a-service',NULL,'<p><strong>Easy peasy. Give them a call at (203) 727-3052 or visit their website at&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://foresttechusa.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>foresttechusa.com</strong></a><strong>.&nbsp;They\'re prompt, professional, and ready to tackle your tree troubles.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 13:51:59','2025-08-01 01:24:13',NULL,NULL),(861,'≡ƒî▓ Forest Tech USA ΓÇô Mission Statement','forest-tech-usa-mission-statement',NULL,'<p><strong>At Forest Tech USA, our mission is simple:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">To protect property, preserve safety, and provide expert tree care with integrity, precision, and respect for the environment. We are committed to delivering prompt, professional serviceΓÇöday or nightΓÇöto homeowners, businesses, and municipalities in need of reliable tree removal, land clearing, and emergency response.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">We donΓÇÖt just remove treesΓÇöwe remove worries.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 14:44:03','2025-05-23 14:44:03',NULL,NULL),(862,'≡ƒî▓ \"Why Tree Removal IsnΓÇÖt Just About TreesΓÇöItΓÇÖs About Safety, Value, and Peace of Mind\"','why-tree-removal-isnt-just-about-trees-its-about-safety-value-and-peace-of-mind',NULL,'<h2><br></h2><p>When people hear \"tree removal,\" they often imagine a guy with a chainsaw taking down a dead oak. Simple, right? Not quite. At Forest Tech USA, we know itΓÇÖs way more than thatΓÇötree removal is about protecting your home, preserving your property value, and keeping your family safe.</p><h3>≡ƒî¬∩╕Å 1.&nbsp;<strong>Storms DonΓÇÖt KnockΓÇöThey Kick the Door In</strong></h3><p>One strong wind, and that leaning tree you\'ve been ignoring becomes a living wrecking ball. WeΓÇÖve seen it all: trees through rooftops, blocking driveways, crushing fences. ThatΓÇÖs why we offer&nbsp;<strong>24/7 emergency service</strong>ΓÇöbecause Mother Nature doesnΓÇÖt care if itΓÇÖs 2 a.m.</p><h3>≡ƒÅí 2.&nbsp;<strong>Your Property Value is Rooted in Curb Appeal</strong></h3><p>Overgrown trees can make a home look abandoned. Dead branches hanging like chandeliers of doom? Not a good look. Regular tree maintenance and smart removals boost curb appeal and increase property valueΓÇöespecially when youΓÇÖre looking to sell or renovate.</p><h3>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å 3.&nbsp;<strong>DIY? More Like D.I.-Why?!</strong></h3><p>Tree removal is dangerous. We\'re talking thousands of pounds of unpredictable timber, chainsaws, and gravityΓÇönot exactly a recipe for a relaxing Sunday. Our team is&nbsp;<strong>fully licensed, insured, and trained</strong>&nbsp;to handle the risky stuff so you donΓÇÖt have to.</p><h3>≡ƒî┐ 4.&nbsp;<strong>We Clear More Than TreesΓÇöWe Clear Space For Your Vision</strong></h3><p>Need to build? Expand your yard? Put in a pool or a patio? We offer complete&nbsp;<strong>land clearing and debris removal</strong>, giving you the clean slate you need to bring your project to life.</p><h3>≡ƒÆ¬ 5.&nbsp;<strong>Forest Tech USA: A Cut Above</strong></h3><p>Founded by Jack Bardales and based in Bristol, Connecticut, Forest Tech USA is built on reliability, fast response, and top-notch service. From brush chipping to big tree takedowns, we bring the experienceΓÇöand the muscleΓÇöto get the job done right.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒô₧ Ready to clear the way?</h3><p>Call us at&nbsp;<strong>(203) 727-3052</strong>&nbsp;or visit&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.foresttechusa.com/\" target=\"_blank\">foresttechusa.com</a>&nbsp;to schedule a quote.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-09','1',6,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-23 14:46:53','2026-02-10 02:05:30',NULL,NULL),(863,'What events do you service?','what-events-do-you-service',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Weddings, birthdays, corporate events, baby showers, graduationsΓÇöif people are smiling, weΓÇÖll be there to capture it!</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,133,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-12 21:34:24','2025-06-12 21:34:24',NULL,NULL),(864,'Do you provide props and backdrops?','do-you-provide-props-and-backdrops',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Yes! We bring a fun selection of themed props and customizable backdrops to match your eventΓÇÖs style.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,133,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-12 21:35:14','2025-06-12 21:35:14',NULL,NULL),(865,'How much space do you need for setup?','how-much-space-do-you-need-for-setup',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We recommend a 10x10 ft area for optimal setup and guest flow, but we can adjust to fit tighter spaces when needed.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,133,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-12 21:36:28','2025-06-12 21:36:28',NULL,NULL),(866,'How do guests get their photos?','how-do-guests-get-their-photos',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Instantly! Guests can receive their photos via text, email, or QR code on-site. We also offer prints upon request.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,133,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-12 21:37:29','2025-06-12 21:37:29',NULL,NULL),(867,'Q: Do you offer custom photo templates?','q-do-you-offer-custom-photo-templates',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Absolutely! We design custom templates to match your event theme, colors, and logo (if applicable).</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,133,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-12 21:38:32','2025-06-12 21:38:32',NULL,NULL),(868,'Freeze Moments That Matter','freeze-moments-that-matter',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(153, 51, 255);\">At&nbsp;<em>A Moment in Time</em>, our mission is to freeze the moments that matter mostΓÇöone snapshot at a time. We bring energy, elegance, and creativity to every event, delivering an interactive photo booth experience that leaves guests smiling, laughing, and sharing memories theyΓÇÖll cherish forever. Whether itΓÇÖs a wedding, a birthday, or a corporate celebration, we donΓÇÖt just take picturesΓÇöwe capture the magic.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,133,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-13 15:28:14','2025-06-13 15:28:14',NULL,NULL),(869,'Founder | Volunteer | Joy Creator','founder-volunteer-joy-creator',NULL,'<h3><br></h3><p><strong>Hi, IΓÇÖm the proud owner of&nbsp;<em>A Moment in Time</em>, where every event becomes a memory worth framing! When IΓÇÖm not bringing joy through photo booths, IΓÇÖm giving back. IΓÇÖve spent the last 5 years as a lead volunteer with GodΓÇÖs Love We Deliver in NYC, and I regularly lend my time to incredible causes like&nbsp;<em>The Gathering of the Paws</em>,&nbsp;<em>Broome Animal Sanctuary</em>, and several nonprofit organizations throughout the Northeast.</strong></p><p><strong>For me, life is about capturing moments and creating impactΓÇöwhether it\'s through a photo or through service. ≡ƒÆ¢</strong></p>',NULL,'2025-06-14','1',16,1,133,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-13 19:54:57','2025-06-16 00:28:33',NULL,NULL),(870,'The Cocoboca Story: From Problem to Pure Solution','the-cocoboca-story-from-problem-to-pure-solution',NULL,'<p><strong>IΓÇÖm&nbsp;Dagmary Balanta, Founder and CEO of&nbsp;Cocoboca.</strong></p><p>After decades of searching for a genuine solution to chronic gum bleeding, I turned to the research on lauric-acid-rich coconut oil, refined a formula of my own, and saw my symptoms disappear. That breakthrough became Cocoboca: a 100 % pure, unrefined coconut pulling oil designed to support healthy gums, freshen breath, and naturally brighten teethΓÇöwithout chemicals or additives.</p><p><strong>What sets us apart</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Clinical-grade purity</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Every batch is cold-pressed, unbleached, and laboratory-tested for quality and safety.</li><li><strong>Glass, not plastic</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô We package exclusively in recyclable glass to protect product integrity and reduce environmental impact.</li><li><strong>Subscription convenience</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Automated monthly delivery ensures customers never miss a day of oral care, while offering cost savings over single-jar purchases.</li><li><strong>Community commitment</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô A portion of each sale is directed to autism-support initiatives and other nonprofit partners that share our values.</li></ul><p>My goal is simple: provide an effective, natural alternative to conventional mouthwash and help individuals achieve lasting oral health. Thank you for visiting our vCard. I invite you to explore our product line and discover the difference Cocoboca can make in your daily routine.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,54,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-16 21:17:31','2025-06-16 21:17:31',NULL,NULL),(871,'At Elite Christmas Lights, we transform holiday hassles into brilliant, worry-free displays.','at-elite-christmas-lights-we-transform-holiday-hassles-into-brilliant-worry-free-displays',NULL,'<p><strong> As a professional Christmas light installer, I take pride in creating dazzling displays that spread joy, warmth, and the true spirit of the season. My passion for lights goes beyond just decorationΓÇöitΓÇÖs about bringing families together, sparking smiles, and making the holidays even more special. ThereΓÇÖs nothing better than seeing the happiness a beautifully lit home or business brings to others. LetΓÇÖs make this Christmas shine brighter than ever!</strong><span class=\"ql-cursor\">∩╗┐</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,65,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 00:37:55','2025-06-25 00:37:55',NULL,NULL),(872,'At Smoove Intimacy, we create a classy, judgment-free playground.','at-smoove-intimacy-we-create-a-classy-judgment-free-playground',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£At&nbsp;Smoove Intimacy, we create a classy, judgment-free playground where adventurous, consenting adults can explore connection, chemistry, and community. Rooted in respect and discretion, our mission is to provide a safe, sexy, and sophisticated environment that celebrates freedom of expression and the thrill of shared experiencesΓÇöright here in the heart of Connecticut.ΓÇ¥</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,134,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-26 06:21:17','2025-06-26 06:21:17',NULL,NULL),(881,'Professional Gun Slinger','professional-gun-slinger',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">NameΓÇÖs Johnny John. Some call me a legend. Most call me when things get&nbsp;<em>complicated</em>. IΓÇÖm a professional gun slingerΓÇölicensed in lead, fluent in sarcasm, and faster than Wi-Fi in a Motel 6.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">I donΓÇÖt shoot first. I just shoot better. Whether itΓÇÖs bandits, bad contracts, or business deals gone south, I bring precision, grit, and just the right amount of dramatic slow motion.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">Born with a six-shooter in one hand and a strong cup of black coffee in the other, IΓÇÖve been outdrawing problems since ΓÇÖ97ΓÇª 1897 or 1997? I ainΓÇÖt sayinΓÇÖ.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">So if you need someone who walks the walk, talks the talk, and occasionally rides into town on a Tuesday just to stir things upΓÇöwell, I reckon IΓÇÖm your huckleberry.<span class=\"ql-cursor\">∩╗┐</span></strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,42,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 00:37:06','2025-07-03 00:37:06',NULL,NULL),(883,'FAQ\'s','faqs',NULL,'<p><strong>1. What does LS Express Delivery LLC specialize in?</strong></p><p>We specialize in delivering heavy-duty and bulky items like furniture, appliances, yard equipment, machinery, mulch, and more. If it\'s big, awkward, or heavy ΓÇö we move it.</p><p><strong>2. Do you deliver from stores like LoweΓÇÖs or Home Depot?</strong></p><p>Absolutely. Whether you just bought it from a major retailer or a local spot, weΓÇÖll get it from point A to point B safely and quickly.</p><p><strong>3. Can you pick up and deliver stone, wood, or mulch?</strong></p><p>Yes! We handle landscaping materials like stone, mulch, wood, and even yard tools ΓÇö no problem.</p><p><strong>4. Do you offer same-day delivery?</strong></p><p>When possible, yes. We hustle hard to offer same-day or next-day delivery based on availability and item size. Give us a call and letΓÇÖs make it happen.</p><p><strong>5. What areas do you serve?</strong></p><p>WeΓÇÖre based locally but serve all surrounding areas ΓÇö give us your location and weΓÇÖll confirm delivery availability.</p><p><strong>6. Do you deliver machinery and equipment like lawn mowers or snow blowers?</strong></p><p>You bet. Riding mowers, snow blowers, generators, pressure washers ΓÇö weΓÇÖve got the equipment and muscle to handle it all.</p><p><strong>7. Are you insured?</strong></p><p>Yes, LS Express Delivery LLC is fully insured. Your items are protected while in our care.</p><p><strong>8. How do I schedule a delivery?</strong></p><p>Easy. Call or text us, shoot us an email, or hit us up through our website or social media. WeΓÇÖll book your delivery and give you a quote.</p><p><strong>9. Can I ride along or have someone accompany the delivery?</strong></p><p>For safety and insurance reasons, we donΓÇÖt allow ride-alongs ΓÇö but youΓÇÖre welcome to meet us at the destination.</p><p><strong>10. Do you offer assembly or setup services?</strong></p><p>Right now, we specialize in delivery only. But if setup or assembly is something you need, let us know ΓÇö we may be able to refer someone or help coordinate.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,135,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 11:27:11','2025-07-03 11:27:11',NULL,NULL),(884,'OUR MISSION','our-mission-18',NULL,'<p><strong>At&nbsp;LS Express Delivery LLC, our mission is simple:</strong></p><p><strong>Deliver the heavy, handle the bulky, and do it fast, safe, and right.</strong></p><p><strong>WeΓÇÖre committed to providing dependable, no-nonsense delivery services for furniture, machinery, appliances, landscaping materials, and more. Whether itΓÇÖs a lawnmower or a load of stone, we move it with care, hustle, and integrity ΓÇö so our customers never have to lift a finger.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,135,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 11:59:45','2025-07-03 11:59:45',NULL,NULL),(885,'Family. Freedom. Freight.','family-freedom-freight',NULL,'<p><strong>I got tired of building someone else\'s dream while mine sat on the shelf. After years of working for others, I made the decision to bet on myself. I started</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">&nbsp;LS Express Delivery LLC</strong><strong>&nbsp;because I wanted more ΓÇö more time with my family, more independence, and the freedom to build something thatΓÇÖs mine.</strong></p><p><strong>This business is more than just moving furniture and equipment ΓÇö itΓÇÖs about delivering on my promise to create a better future. I show up every day ready to grind, because when you work for yourself, thereΓÇÖs no clock ΓÇö just commitment.</strong></p><p><strong>LetΓÇÖs move something.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,135,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 12:03:17','2025-07-03 12:03:17',NULL,NULL),(886,'Why Choose LS Express Delivery LLC?','why-choose-ls-express-delivery-llc',NULL,'<p><strong>We donΓÇÖt just deliver ΓÇö we&nbsp;<em>come through</em>.</strong></p><p>HereΓÇÖs why our customers choose us (and why youΓÇÖll be glad you did):</p><p><strong>≡ƒÆ¬ We Handle the Heavy Stuff</strong></p><p>Furniture, mulch, machinery, appliances ΓÇö if itΓÇÖs bulky, awkward, or a pain to move, we make it look easy.</p><p><strong>ΓÅ▒∩╕Å Fast, Punctual &amp; Precise</strong></p><p>We show up&nbsp;<em>on time</em>, every time ΓÇö and we donΓÇÖt just toss your stuff around. Every delivery is handled with care, accuracy, and attention to detail.</p><p><strong>≡ƒÆ╕ Super Affordable</strong></p><p>Top-tier service without the top-shelf price tag. We keep our rates low so you can keep your stress lower.</p><p><strong>≡ƒ¢╗ Local &amp; Independent</strong></p><p>WeΓÇÖre not some massive delivery chain. We\'re your neighbors ΓÇö real people with real hustle, serving the community we care about.</p><p><strong>≡ƒæ¿ΓÇì≡ƒæ⌐ΓÇì≡ƒæº Built for Family</strong></p><p>This business was born out of a dream to build something for our family ΓÇö and every job we take on helps us do just that. YouΓÇÖre not just a customer ΓÇö youΓÇÖre part of the mission.</p><p><strong>≡ƒöÑ No Gimmicks. Just Grit.</strong></p><p>Honest service. Hard work. Done right, the first time.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,135,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 12:27:54','2025-07-03 12:27:54',NULL,NULL),(887,'The Art of the Safe Haul ΓÇô How We Keep Your Stuff in One Piece','the-art-of-the-safe-haul-how-we-keep-your-stuff-in-one-piece',NULL,'<p>When you hire a delivery company, youΓÇÖre not just paying to move something from Point A to Point B ΓÇö youΓÇÖre trusting them not to wreck it in the process. At&nbsp;<strong>LS Express Delivery LLC</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>safety isnΓÇÖt optional ΓÇö itΓÇÖs our obsession.</strong></p><p>WeΓÇÖre pros at hauling the heavy and awkward: couches, machinery, appliances, mulch, stone, and more. And every single item we move gets the same treatment ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>wrapped, strapped, and handled with care</strong>.</p><p>HereΓÇÖs how we roll:</p><ul><li><strong>Proper Padding:</strong>&nbsp;Furniture isnΓÇÖt just thrown in the truck. We use blankets, straps, and foam to keep it safe and scuff-free.</li><li><strong>Tight Tie-Downs:</strong>&nbsp;Heavy equipment and yard materials are locked in tighter than a drum ΓÇö no sliding, no tipping, no \"oops.\"</li><li><strong>Safe Driving Matters:</strong>&nbsp;Speed demons and jerky stops donΓÇÖt belong behind our wheel. Our drivers keep it smooth and steady to protect your cargo.</li></ul><p>Bottom line? We treat your stuff like it\'s our own ΓÇö because repeat customers come from&nbsp;<strong>reliable service, not broken deliveries.</strong></p><p>Need something moved the right way? Hit us up. We donΓÇÖt just deliver ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>we protect.</strong></p>',NULL,'2025-07-03','1',6,1,135,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 12:50:14','2025-07-03 13:06:35',NULL,NULL),(888,'Strap It Like You Mean It ΓÇô Why Securing Your Load Is Everything','strap-it-like-you-mean-it-why-securing-your-load-is-everything',NULL,'<p>Ever seen someone cruising down the highway with a mattress flapping like a flag? Yeah, donΓÇÖt be that guy.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>LS Express Delivery LLC</strong>, we know that&nbsp;<strong>securing the load is just as important as moving it.</strong>&nbsp;Loose materials arenΓÇÖt just risky ΓÇö theyΓÇÖre dangerous, illegal, and just plain sloppy. We donΓÇÖt roll that way.</p><p>HereΓÇÖs what we do to lock it down right:</p><ul><li><strong>Ratchet Straps on Deck:</strong>&nbsp;We use industrial-strength straps to secure everything from snow blowers to sofas to stone. Once itΓÇÖs tied down, itΓÇÖs staying put.</li><li><strong>Even Weight Distribution:</strong>&nbsp;We know how to load a truck so it rides smooth, stable, and safe. No leaning towers of landscaping mulch here.</li><li><strong>Weather-Ready Wraps:</strong>&nbsp;Rain, snow, or blazing sun ΓÇö your cargo stays covered and protected. Because no one wants soggy cardboard or rusted metal.</li></ul><p>Cut corners? Not us. Whether itΓÇÖs one appliance or a full load of yard gear, it leaves our truck the same way it entered ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>secure, safe, and damage-free.</strong></p><p>Trust your delivery to the crew that gets it done&nbsp;<em>tight and right</em>.</p>',NULL,'2025-04-04','1',6,1,135,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 12:57:24','2025-07-03 13:07:01',NULL,NULL),(889,'What services do you provide?','the-heart-behind-access-greenadine-llc',NULL,'<p>I offer trauma-informed therapy, grief counseling, wellness coaching, and creative arts-based healing, both in-person and virtually. My services are tailored to support your emotional well-being and personal growth.</p><p><strong>2. What is trauma-informed therapy?</strong></p><p>Trauma-informed therapy recognizes the impact of past trauma and creates a safe, supportive space for healing. I use creative techniques to help clients reconnect with themselves and rebuild from within.</p><p><strong>3. How do you help clients manage grief?</strong></p><p>Grief is deeply personal. I provide compassionate guidance and evidence-based tools to help clients process loss, honor their emotions, and find meaning as they heal.</p><p><strong>4. What makes Access GREENADINE unique?</strong></p><p>Access GREENADINE combines clinical expertise with creative arts, empowering clients with practical skills and personalized support. ItΓÇÖs not just therapy ΓÇö itΓÇÖs a transformational experience.</p><p><strong>5. Do you offer virtual sessions?</strong></p><p>Yes. I offer secure, HIPAA-compliant virtual sessions to make care accessible and flexible, wherever you are.</p><p><strong>6. WhatΓÇÖs your background and experience?</strong></p><p>I have over 20 years of experience as a Licensed Clinical Social Worker. IΓÇÖm certified in CBT, a Master Teaching Artist, and actively involved in professional associations and conferences.</p><p><strong>7. Do you offer services for organizations or groups?</strong></p><p>Absolutely. I lead workshops, speaking engagements, and wellness programs for schools, companies, and community groups. LetΓÇÖs collaborate to support your teamΓÇÖs well-being.</p><p><strong>8. How can I schedule a session or consultation?</strong></p><p>You can schedule directly through my vCard using the ΓÇ£Book a SessionΓÇ¥ button or contact me via phone or email. I look forward to connecting with you.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-08 00:02:29','2025-07-08 00:41:11',NULL,NULL),(890,'≡ƒô£ Certifications & Affiliations','certifications-affiliations',NULL,'<h3><br></h3><ul><li>Licensed Clinical Social Worker (LCSW)</li><li>Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) Certified</li><li>Member, Employee Assistance Professionals Association (EAPA)</li><li>Master Teaching Artist</li><li>Participant, Southern New England Teaching Artists Conference (2024ΓÇô2025)</li><li>Honorary Clinical Instructor, Walden University</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-08 00:46:08','2025-07-08 00:46:08',NULL,NULL),(891,'The Heart Behind Access GREENADINE','the-heart-behind-access-greenadine',NULL,'<h3><br></h3><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Nadine Green is deeply committed to her divine calling: empowering others in their journey of self-help. A devoted mother and life partner, she thrives as a clinician, community mobilizer, wellness coach, grief and trauma specialist, speaker, author, and teaching artist. As the founder and CEO of Access GREENADINE LLC, Nadine has created a platform that equips clients with practical tools to design the lives they deserve. With over 20 years of experience, she specializes in trauma-informed care and grief management using the creative arts as a path to healing and empowerment.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-08 00:49:29','2025-07-08 00:49:29',NULL,NULL),(892,'Empowering Healing, Inspiring Growth','empowering-healing-inspiring-growth',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Access GREENADINE LLC, my mission is to empower individuals to reclaim their stories, heal from trauma and grief, and step fully into the lives they were meant to live. Through a unique blend of clinical expertise, creative expression, and compassionate guidance, I help clients build emotional resilience, cultivate self-awareness, and access the tools they need for lasting transformation. I believe healing is both an art and a journey ΓÇö and IΓÇÖm honored to walk that path with those ready to begin.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-08 01:00:06','2025-07-08 01:14:11',NULL,NULL),(893,'Licensed Clinical Social Worker','licensed-clinical-social-worker',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-14 20:00:50','2025-07-14 20:00:50',NULL,NULL),(894,'Utlimate Therapist Award','utlimate-therapist-award',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-14 20:11:57','2025-07-14 20:11:57',NULL,NULL),(895,'2024 Teaching Artist\'s  Grant Recipient Literary Arts','2024-teaching-artists-grant-recipient-literary-arts',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-14 20:13:43','2025-07-14 20:13:43',NULL,NULL),(896,'Healing IsnΓÇÖt Linear ΓÇö But It Is Possible','healing-isnt-linear-but-it-is-possible',NULL,'<p><em>By Nadine Green, LCSW | Founder of Access GREENADINE LLC</em></p><p>LetΓÇÖs get one thing straight ΓÇö healing is not a straight line. ItΓÇÖs not a neat, tidy checklist where you move from pain to peace in a perfect progression. ItΓÇÖs messy. ItΓÇÖs emotional. And itΓÇÖs absolutely possible.</p><p>Over the past 20+ years, IΓÇÖve walked alongside people whoΓÇÖve experienced deep trauma, heartbreaking loss, and life-altering events. IΓÇÖve witnessed the rawest grief and the quietest triumphs. And through it all, one truth has stayed constant:&nbsp;<strong>healing happens when weΓÇÖre seen, heard, and supported.</strong></p><p>At Access GREENADINE, I combine clinical tools with creative expression ΓÇö art, writing, movement ΓÇö to help people access the parts of themselves that words alone canΓÇÖt always reach. Because sometimes the soul doesnΓÇÖt want to talk. Sometimes it wants to paint, sing, breathe, cry, or dance. And when we give it permission to do so, we unlock something powerful.</p><p>I believe in meeting people where they are, not where the world thinks they should be. Whether you\'re navigating grief, healing old wounds, or simply trying to reconnect with who you areΓÇª you donΓÇÖt have to do it alone.</p><p><strong>My mission is simple:</strong>&nbsp;To empower you with the tools, support, and space you need to create a life you donΓÇÖt need to escape from ΓÇö a life that honors your truth.</p><p>Healing isnΓÇÖt about getting over it. ItΓÇÖs about growing through it.</p><p>YouΓÇÖre not broken. YouΓÇÖre becoming.</p><p>LetΓÇÖs take the next step together.</p>',NULL,'2025-03-16','1',6,1,136,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-14 20:24:19','2025-07-14 20:25:54',NULL,NULL),(897,'Click Here','click-here',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,96,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-15 02:23:29','2025-07-15 02:23:29',NULL,NULL),(898,'Lucky You: The Magic Behind Shamrock Detailing LLC Γ£¿','lucky-you-the-magic-behind-shamrock-detailing-llc',NULL,'<p><em>By Kenneth Pierce</em></p><p>LetΓÇÖs face itΓÇöyour car\'s been through it. Rain. Mud. That weird bird with a vendetta. Life leaves its mark, and before you know it, your ride looks more ΓÇ£junkyard dogΓÇ¥ than ΓÇ£driveway trophy.ΓÇ¥ But donΓÇÖt worryΓÇöShamrock Detailing LLC is here to turn that tired steed into a head-turning, mirror-shining chariot of glory.</p><p>At Shamrock Detailing, we donΓÇÖt just wash carsΓÇöwe&nbsp;<em>resurrect them</em>. From bumper to bumper, rim to roof, we breathe new life into every surface. Our secret sauce? Hard work, elite-grade products, and a whole lot of pride. And yesΓÇª maybe just a little Irish luck.</p><p><strong>Why the Shamrock?</strong></p><p>Owner Kenneth Pierce built this business from the ground up with a simple goal: deliver top-tier detailing without cutting corners. The shamrock represents not only good fortune but precision, pride, and passion. We donΓÇÖt leave until your car looks so good, even your reflection will blush.</p><p><strong>What We Do (Better Than Most):</strong></p><ul><li>Interior deep cleaning (likeΓÇª&nbsp;<em>exorcism-level</em>&nbsp;clean)</li><li>Exterior polishing and waxing thatΓÇÖll blind your ex</li><li>Paint correction for those ΓÇ£oopsΓÇ¥ moments you pretend didnΓÇÖt happen</li><li>Ceramic coating for long-term shine and protection</li><li>Engine bay detailingΓÇöbecause even your horsepower deserves a bath</li></ul><p><strong>Why People Trust Us:</strong></p><p>WeΓÇÖre not some pop-up tent with a hose and a prayer. WeΓÇÖre insured, experienced, and obsessed with perfection. Our customers leave with their jaws on the pavement and their friends asking, ΓÇ£Where the hell did you get that done?ΓÇ¥</p><p><strong>A Word from Kenneth:</strong></p><p>ΓÇ£I started Shamrock Detailing because I was tired of people overpaying for mediocre results. This is my passion. I treat every vehicle like itΓÇÖs my own, and every customer like family. This isnΓÇÖt just businessΓÇöitΓÇÖs personal.ΓÇ¥</p><p>≡ƒôì Located right here in town, Shamrock Detailing LLC is your local go-to for premium auto detailing done right.</p><p>Book today, and let us bring the luck, the love, and the luster back to your vehicle.</p><p><strong>Because when you ride clean, you ride proud.</strong></p><p>≡ƒº╝Γÿÿ∩╕ÅΓ£¿</p>',NULL,'2026-04-06','1',6,1,137,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-17 16:27:11','2026-04-06 13:12:15',NULL,NULL),(899,'What Drives Me','what-drives-me',NULL,'<p><strong>IΓÇÖve been around cars my whole life, and detailing them? ThatΓÇÖs always been more than just a jobΓÇöitΓÇÖs been a passion. About four years ago, I decided to stop working for other people and go all in. I launched Shamrock Detailing LLC full time, and itΓÇÖs been making noise in the game ever since.</strong></p><p><strong>In just a few years, Shamrock Detailing has earned a reputation for excellence, consistency, and serious attention to detail. I use only premium, professional-grade products, and I treat every vehicle like itΓÇÖs my own. IΓÇÖm not here to do a ΓÇ£quick wash and wave goodbye.ΓÇ¥ IΓÇÖm here to restore pride in your ride.</strong></p><p><strong>If youΓÇÖre looking for someone who cares about your car just as much as you doΓÇömaybe even moreΓÇöthen youΓÇÖre in the right place. At Shamrock Detailing, every detail matters, and every client leaves shining.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,137,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-17 17:49:20','2025-07-17 17:49:20',NULL,NULL),(900,'My Mission','my-mission',NULL,'<p><strong>At Shamrock Detailing LLC, our mission is simple: to deliver elite-level auto detailing with premium products, unmatched precision, and the kind of care that treats every vehicle like itΓÇÖs our own. WeΓÇÖre here to raise the bar, not just wash cars. Whether itΓÇÖs a quick cleanup or a full restoration, we bring passion, pride, and perfection to every jobΓÇöbecause you deserve more than average, and so does your ride.</strong>∩╗┐</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,137,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-17 17:51:43','2025-07-21 04:38:42',NULL,NULL),(901,'How long does a full detail take?∩╗┐','heres-the-answer-to-that',NULL,'<p>Depending on the condition of your vehicle, a full interior and exterior detail can take anywhere from 3 to 6 hours. We donΓÇÖt rushΓÇöwe do it right.</p><p><strong>2. WhatΓÇÖs the difference between detailing and a regular car wash?</strong></p><p>A car wash just gets the surface grime. Detailing goes deepΓÇöweΓÇÖre talking shampooing carpets, restoring paint, conditioning leather, and protecting your ride inside and out.</p><p><strong>3. What is paint correction, and do I need it?</strong></p><p>Paint correction removes swirl marks, light scratches, and oxidation. If your paint looks dull or hazy, this service can bring it back to life and prep it for ceramic coating.</p><p><strong>4. WhatΓÇÖs the benefit of ceramic coating?</strong></p><p>Ceramic coating adds a durable, glossy layer of protection that lasts for years. It repels water, dirt, and UV raysΓÇömaking maintenance easier and keeping your car looking brand new.</p><p><strong>5. Do you use quality products?</strong></p><p>Absolutely. We only use premium-grade products made right here in Connecticut by&nbsp;<strong>SWAG Detailers</strong>. No cheap stuffΓÇöyour car deserves better.</p><p><strong>6. Can I drop off my car or do you offer mobile service?</strong></p><p>Currently, weΓÇÖre shop-based so you can drop your vehicle off. This allows us to control the environment and deliver the best results without rushing against the weather.</p><p><strong>7. How often should I get my car detailed?</strong></p><p>For regular drivers, every 3ΓÇô4 months is a solid rhythm. For ceramic-coated vehicles, maintenance is easier, but we still recommend periodic interior and exterior upkeep.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,137,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-17 17:58:58','2025-07-17 18:00:31',NULL,NULL),(902,'Why I DonΓÇÖt Use Business Cards ΓÇö I Just Shoot My Info Into the Air','why-i-dont-use-business-cards-i-just-shoot-my-info-into-the-air',NULL,'<p><strong>Howdy, partners.</strong></p><p>Johnny John here.</p><p>Professional gun slinger.</p><p>Part-time philosopher.</p><p>Full-time menace to paper business cards.</p><p>Now I know what youΓÇÖre thinkinΓÇÖ:</p><p><em>ΓÇ£Johnny, how do folks get your info if you ain\'t handinΓÇÖ out cards like a desperate insurance agent at a rodeo?ΓÇ¥</em></p><p>Well, lemme tell yaΓÇöI donΓÇÖt waste trees or time. I got me one of them&nbsp;<strong>vBiz Me vCards</strong>, and itΓÇÖs so high-tech it nearly scared my horse. (He still won\'t make eye contact with it.)</p><p>I used to hand out paper cards. But every time I did, someone either used it to roll a cigarette, wipe barbecue sauce, or write down their cousin EarlΓÇÖs bail amount.</p><p><strong>No more.</strong></p><p>Now when I meet someone, I just say,</p><blockquote>ΓÇ£Pull out your phone and scan this QR codeΓÇª and donΓÇÖt flinch, it ain\'t a trap.ΓÇ¥</blockquote><blockquote>Then&nbsp;<em>bam</em>ΓÇömy vCard pops up, like a ghost in a saloon mirror, only handsomer.</blockquote><p><strong>WhatΓÇÖs on my vCard?</strong></p><ul><li>A dynamic intro video where I wink, spin my pistol, and casually mention I once outdueled a fax machine.</li><li>My contact info (yes, even my fax, for legal reasons).</li><li>Links to all my social mediaΓÇª including my side hustle teaching llamas how to moonwalk.</li><li>A custom background video of tumbleweeds blowing through a LinkedIn convention.</li></ul><p><strong>Why It Works</strong></p><p>People remember me. Not because of my aim (though itΓÇÖs terrifyingly accurate), but because my vCard doesnΓÇÖt get thrown awayΓÇöit gets&nbsp;<strong>saved</strong>, shared, and occasionally screenshotted by confused grandmas.</p><p>Plus, it updates in real-time. So when I switch from \"Gun Slinger\" to \"Conflict Resolution Specialist (with flair),\" it changes instantly. AinΓÇÖt no paper card ever done that unless you write in crayon.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Final Thoughts from the Trail</strong></p><p>Look, the worldΓÇÖs gone digital. Either get with the times, or be the guy still trying to staple business cards to a cactus.</p><p>So if you want to stand out like a cowboy at a tech convention, ditch the paper and get yourself a vBiz Me vCard. ItΓÇÖs faster than a prairie fire with a tailwindΓÇª and a lot less flammable.</p><p>Stay sharp. Stay wild.</p><p>ΓÇöJohnny John</p><p><em>Professional Gun Slinger. QR Code Enthusiast. Voted \"Most Likely to Wink During a Duel.\"</em></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,42,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-21 07:17:22','2025-07-21 07:17:22',NULL,NULL),(903,'Q: Are you a real gun-slinger or just cosplaying Clint Eastwood on casual Fridays?','q-are-you-a-real-gun-slinger-or-just-cosplaying-clint-eastwood-on-casual-fridays',NULL,'<p><strong>A:&nbsp;Both. I shoot deals and shoot the breeze. IΓÇÖve got quicker hands than a cat meme on TikTok and a squint that could stop a boardroom in its tracks.</strong></p><p><strong>Q: Do you still carry live ammo?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;Only in negotiations. And by ammo, I mean sarcasm, witty one-liners, and the occasional business card shaped like a bullet.</strong></p><p><strong>Q: What exactly do you&nbsp;<em>do</em>?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;I slay inboxes, crush awkward small talk, and shoot straight when it comes to business. Whether itΓÇÖs closing deals or shutting down nonsense, IΓÇÖm your huckleberry.</strong></p><p><strong>Q: Can I hire you for protection?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;Only from bad branding, boring pitches, and outdated paper business cards. If itΓÇÖs actual danger, you better call someone with a badgeΓÇöor a lawyer.</strong></p><p><strong>Q: WhatΓÇÖs your hourly rate?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;I donΓÇÖt do hourly. I do legendary. My rate is \"worth every penny,\" payable in cash, crypto, or a bottle of aged whiskey.</strong></p><p><strong>Q: Are you available for childrenΓÇÖs parties?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;Only if the pi├▒ata is an outlaw and thereΓÇÖs a root beer saloon. And even then, I donΓÇÖt do balloon animals. I do&nbsp;<em>drama</em>.</strong></p><p><strong>Q: How fast is your draw?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;LetΓÇÖs just say I once beat someone in a duel&nbsp;<em>before</em>&nbsp;they challenged me.</strong></p><p><strong>Q: WhatΓÇÖs your biggest weakness?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;Puppies. And maybe karaoke. But mostly puppies.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,42,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-21 07:24:24','2025-07-21 07:24:24',NULL,NULL),(904,'What areas do you service?','what-areas-do-you-service',NULL,'<p>We proudly serve ALL OF CONNECTICUT. If youΓÇÖre not sure we come your way, just give us a shout ΓÇö if a beaver can get there, so can we.</p><p><strong>2. Do you offer emergency services?</strong></p><p>Yes! Storm blew a tree into your driveway at 2 AM? WeΓÇÖll be there faster than you can say ΓÇ£timber.ΓÇ¥ Emergency rates may apply.</p><p><strong>3. What happens to the debris after tree or brush removal?</strong></p><p>We haul it away like it never existed. Or, if youΓÇÖd like to keep the wood chips or logs, weΓÇÖre happy to leave them with you.</p><p><strong>4. Do you handle permits or city approvals?</strong></p><p>Some jobs require them ΓÇö and weΓÇÖll walk you through whatΓÇÖs needed. We donΓÇÖt cut corners (just trees and stumps).</p><p><strong>5. Is stump grinding included in tree removal?</strong></p><p>Nope ΓÇö itΓÇÖs a separate service, but we highly recommend it. Otherwise, youΓÇÖre left with a giant tripping hazard that haunts your lawn like a wooden ghost.</p><p><strong>6. Can you work during the winter?</strong></p><p>Absolutely. Snow doesnΓÇÖt stop us ΓÇö in fact, we remove that too. WeΓÇÖre like the postal service, but louder and with chainsaws.</p><p><strong>7. Are you licensed and insured?</strong></p><p>100%. WeΓÇÖre fully licensed and insured to protect your property, your peace of mind, and our fearless crew.</p><p><strong>8. How do I get an estimate?</strong></p><p>Easy. Call us, text us, email us, or send a message via carrier pigeon (okay, maybe not that last one). WeΓÇÖll give you a fast, free, no-pressure quote.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,138,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-24 20:56:44','2025-07-24 20:56:44',NULL,NULL),(905,'Mission Statement','dont-wait-until-its-too-late-why-yard-cleanup-isnt-just-about-looking-pretty',NULL,'<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Scary Beaver Tree Services LLC</strong>, our mission is to provide fast, reliable, and professional tree care services that protect both your property and the environment. With over 15 years of hands-on experience, we combine a deep passion for trees with a no-nonsense commitment to safety, punctuality, and quality work. Whether itΓÇÖs snow, brush, or stubborn stumps, weΓÇÖre here to clean it up and clear the way ΓÇö because healthy trees and a clean yard shouldnΓÇÖt be a luxury, they should be a standard.</p><p>We donΓÇÖt just cut trees.</p><p><strong>We care for them. We respect them.</strong></p><p>And when they become a threat ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>we handle business.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,138,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-24 21:35:53','2025-07-24 22:25:02',NULL,NULL),(906,'1. What is Dream Vacations?','1-what-is-dream-vacations',NULL,'<p>Dream Vacations is a full-service travel agency franchise that specializes in creating personalized, stress-free vacation experiencesΓÇöcruises, resorts, tours, and custom getaways.</p><p><strong>2. Why should I book with you instead of doing it online myself?</strong></p><p>Because Google wonΓÇÖt fight for your upgrades, track price drops, or hook you up with exclusive perks. I will.</p><p><strong>3. Do you charge a service fee?</strong></p><p>Nope. My services are free to you. I get paid through the travel suppliers, not from your wallet.</p><p><strong>4. Can you save me money?</strong></p><p>Yes! I have access to special promotions, group rates, and discounts you wonΓÇÖt find on public booking sites.</p><p><strong>5. What types of vacations do you plan?</strong></p><p>Cruises, all-inclusive resorts, guided tours, destination weddings, honeymoons, bucket-list trips, and custom adventures.</p><p><strong>6. Do you offer payment plans?</strong></p><p>Absolutely. Many of my suppliers allow flexible paymentsΓÇöso you can book now and pay over time.</p><p><strong>7. How do I start planning a trip with you?</strong></p><p>ItΓÇÖs simple. Click the&nbsp;<strong>ΓÇ£Book a CallΓÇ¥</strong>&nbsp;button on my vCard, tell me your travel dreams, and IΓÇÖll handle the rest.</p><p><strong>8. What if I need to cancel or change my trip?</strong></p><p>IΓÇÖll take care of it. No endless hold music or call center headachesΓÇöjust stress-free solutions.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,139,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-25 16:54:40','2025-07-25 16:54:40',NULL,NULL),(907,'≡ƒîì Why Booking with Dream Vacations Is the Smartest Move YouΓÇÖll Make This Year','why-booking-with-dream-vacations-is-the-smartest-move-youll-make-this-year',NULL,'<p><br></p><p>LetΓÇÖs be honestΓÇöplanning a vacation these days feels more like a second job than a getaway.</p><p>Γ£ê∩╕Å Endless tabs open.</p><p>≡ƒº│ Conflicting reviews.</p><p>≡ƒò╡∩╕ÅΓÇìΓÖé∩╕Å Hidden fees.</p><p>≡ƒÿ╡ΓÇì≡ƒÆ½ Overwhelming options.</p><p>...and before you know it, youΓÇÖre exhausted before you even&nbsp;<em>pack</em>.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs where I come in.</p><p>IΓÇÖm&nbsp;<strong>C. Alexander Forrest</strong>, Franchise Owner of&nbsp;<strong>Dream Vacations</strong>, and my mission is simple:</p><p><strong>Take the stress off your plate and replace it with a pi├▒a colada.</strong></p><h4>≡ƒºá Expertise Without Extra Cost</h4><p>I donΓÇÖt charge you a penny for my service. I work directly with trusted travel partners, cruise lines, resorts, and tour operators to get you the best price&nbsp;<em>and</em>&nbsp;exclusive perks that online travel sites simply canΓÇÖt offer.</p><h4>ΓÅ│ Time Is PreciousΓÇöLetΓÇÖs Not Waste It</h4><p>While youΓÇÖre trying to decode hotel cancellation policies and airline baggage fees, IΓÇÖm already handling it. I tailor every trip to match your vibe, budget, and goalsΓÇöwhether youΓÇÖre chasing waterfalls in Costa Rica or chasing drinks on a beach in Cancun.</p><h4>≡ƒô▓ Real Human Support</h4><p>Online travel sites leave you on hold. I pick up the phone.</p><p>Something goes wrong on your trip? IΓÇÖve got your back.</p><p>Need help changing dates or upgrading flights? IΓÇÖll fight for itΓÇöso you donΓÇÖt have to.</p><h4>≡ƒÜó Cruises, Resorts, &amp; More</h4><p>Dreaming of a luxury cruise? All-inclusive getaway? Romantic escape?</p><p>Whatever your dream, IΓÇÖll make it realΓÇöand easy.</p><p><strong>Your dream vacation doesnΓÇÖt start with booking a flight. It starts with booking a call.</strong></p><p>LetΓÇÖs make it happen. Tap&nbsp;<strong>ΓÇ£Schedule NowΓÇ¥</strong>&nbsp;on my vCard and IΓÇÖll take care of the rest.</p><p>Because lifeΓÇÖs too short for bad Wi-Fi, confusing fine print, and generic trips.</p><p><strong>Dream bigger. Travel smarter. Let me handle it.</strong></p><p>ΓÇö&nbsp;<em>C. Alexander Forrest</em></p><p>Certified Travel Consultant &amp; Vacation Matchmaker</p>',NULL,'2025-05-05','1',6,1,139,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-25 16:58:06','2025-08-05 18:59:29',NULL,NULL),(908,'About C. Alexander Forrest','about-c-alexander-forrest',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖve been traveling the world since 1966ΓÇöand itΓÇÖs been shaping my perspective ever since. From the bustling streets of London, England to the tranquil beaches of the Caribbean, travel has shown me that the world is full of beauty, wisdom, and culture just waiting to be explored.</p><p>I officially began my journey as a&nbsp;<strong>Travel Consultant in 1994</strong>, right in&nbsp;<strong>Bloomfield, Connecticut</strong>, and IΓÇÖve been helping others chase their dream vacations ever since. I graduated from&nbsp;<strong>Central Connecticut State University</strong>, where I proudly made the&nbsp;<strong>DeanΓÇÖs List</strong>&nbsp;and earned induction into the&nbsp;<strong>National Honor Society as a Political Science Major</strong>.</p><p>Beyond travel, I have been a&nbsp;<strong>member of the Independent United Order of Mechanics since 1976</strong> and am currently a Venerable&nbsp;Past Grand Master and Patriarch of one of the oldest Fraternal organizations in the world.</p><p>To me, travel isnΓÇÖt just about booking flights and hotelsΓÇöitΓÇÖs about&nbsp;<strong>bridging cultures</strong>, expanding mindsets, and creating unforgettable experiences. My mission is simple: to make your dream vacation smooth, personal, and stress-freeΓÇöevery time.</p><p>LetΓÇÖs explore the world together.</p><p>ΓÇö&nbsp;<em>C. Alexander Forrest</em></p><p>Franchise Owner, Dream Vacations</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,139,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-25 17:12:37','2025-07-25 17:50:44',NULL,NULL),(909,'Our Mission','our-mission-19',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Alpha Male Kennels Inc., our mission is to breed, train, and raise elite canines that embody strength, intelligence, and loyalty. We are committed to preserving the highest bloodlines and delivering dogs that are not only exceptional companions but also fearless protectors. Through integrity, discipline, and an unrelenting dedication to excellence, we strive to lead the packΓÇöempowering every client with a dog that reflects true alpha standards.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,140,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-29 23:41:05','2025-07-29 23:41:05',NULL,NULL),(910,'What breeds do you specialize in?','what-breeds-do-you-specialize-in',NULL,'<p><br></p><p>We specialize in top-tier working breeds known for strength, intelligence, and loyaltyΓÇöprimarily American Bullies, Cane Corsos, and other elite guard and companion dogs.</p><p><strong>2. Are your dogs registered and health-tested?</strong></p><p>Every dog we breed comes with registration papers and a full health screening. We donΓÇÖt cut cornersΓÇöour bloodlines are clean, strong, and documented.</p><p><strong>3. Do you offer training services?</strong></p><p>Yes. We offer obedience training, protection training, and custom programs tailored to your needs. Whether itΓÇÖs for the family or the front lineΓÇöwe train with purpose.</p><p><strong>4. Can I meet the parents of a puppy before I purchase?</strong></p><p>Absolutely. We encourage it. Seeing the temperament, build, and behavior of the parents gives you confidence in what youΓÇÖre taking home.</p><p><strong>5. WhatΓÇÖs included when I purchase a puppy?</strong></p><p>Each pup comes with health papers, initial vaccinations, deworming, a starter kit, and lifetime support from our kennel. When you buy from Alpha MaleΓÇöyou join the pack.</p><p><strong>6. Do you ship dogs out of state?</strong></p><p>Yes, we offer safe, professional nationwide delivery through trusted pet transport services. We make sure your pup arrives healthy and stress-free.</p><p><strong>7. How do I reserve a puppy?</strong></p><p>A deposit is required to hold a pup from any litter. Spots fill fast, so we always recommend early reservations to secure your pick.</p><p><strong>8. Why should I choose Alpha Male Kennels Inc.?</strong></p><p>Because we donΓÇÖt just raise dogsΓÇöwe raise champions. Our pups are bred for temperament, power, and presence. YouΓÇÖre not just buying a dogΓÇöyouΓÇÖre investing in loyalty, protection, and legacy.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,140,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-29 23:42:59','2025-07-29 23:42:59',NULL,NULL),(911,'Why ΓÇ£AlphaΓÇ¥ IsnΓÇÖt Just a NameΓÇöItΓÇÖs a Standard','why-alpha-isnt-just-a-name-its-a-standard',NULL,'<p>When we named our company&nbsp;<strong>Alpha Male Kennels Inc.</strong>, we werenΓÇÖt just flexinΓÇÖ for attention. We were making a statement.</p><p>In the world of dog breeding, thereΓÇÖs a lot of talkΓÇöbut very little walk. A lot of flashΓÇöbut no function. At Alpha Male Kennels, we&nbsp;<em>donΓÇÖt play that game.</em>&nbsp;We donΓÇÖt breed for trendsΓÇöwe breed for legacy.</p><p>Every pup that leaves our kennel is a product of&nbsp;<strong>purposeful breeding</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>elite genetics</strong>, and&nbsp;<strong>hands-on development</strong>. These arenΓÇÖt just dogs. These are protectors. Companions. Loyal family members. And yeahΓÇösome of them could probably bench press you in spirit.</p><h4>Why People Choose Us (Again and Again):</h4><ul><li>We&nbsp;<strong>train with discipline</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>love with intention.</strong></li><li>Our dogs are&nbsp;<strong>health-tested, temperament-evaluated, and battle-ready</strong>ΓÇöfor life or the living room.</li><li>WeΓÇÖre not just building bloodlinesΓÇöweΓÇÖre building&nbsp;<strong>trust</strong>.</li></ul><p>People donΓÇÖt come to us because weΓÇÖre cute. They come to us because weΓÇÖre&nbsp;<strong>real</strong>. Because they want a dog that commands respect but knows when to chill. A dog that watches your backΓÇöand becomes your best friend in the process.</p><p>So whether youΓÇÖre looking for a working dog, a family protector, or just an all-around&nbsp;<strong>canine alpha</strong>, know this:</p><p><strong>At Alpha Male Kennels Inc., we donΓÇÖt raise petsΓÇöwe raise pride.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,140,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-29 23:45:50','2025-07-29 23:45:50',NULL,NULL),(912,'About Me','about-me-7',NULL,'<p>This isnΓÇÖt just a job ΓÇö itΓÇÖs a calling. With&nbsp;<strong>over 40 years in the dog training and breeding game</strong>, IΓÇÖve dedicated my life to understanding, working with, and mastering some of the most unique and powerful breeds on Earth.</p><p>IΓÇÖm proud to say IΓÇÖm ranked among the&nbsp;<strong>Top 10 Dog Trainers in the U.S.</strong>, and that didnΓÇÖt happen overnight. It came from decades of hard work, hands-on experience, and a deep, unshakable passion for what I do.</p><p>I specialize in dogs that most people canΓÇÖt handle ΓÇö because I believe greatness comes from challenge. Whether it\'s breeding champions or building unbreakable bonds through elite training,&nbsp;<strong>I do this because I was built for it.</strong></p><p>At Alpha Male Kennels Inc., we donΓÇÖt raise pets ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>we build legacies.</strong></p><p>Loyalty. Strength. Intelligence. ItΓÇÖs in our bloodlineΓÇª and it shows.</p><p><strong>Welcome to Alpha.</strong>&nbsp;Where experience meets excellence ΓÇö and every dog is born to lead.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,140,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-29 23:59:57','2025-07-29 23:59:57',NULL,NULL),(913,'Who Am I','who-am-i',NULL,'<p>I\'m a proud father, grandfather, and the founder of Forest Tech USA. With years of hands-on experience and a deep respect for the trade, IΓÇÖve become a true master of my craft. Tree removal isnΓÇÖt just what I doΓÇöitΓÇÖs what I&nbsp;<em>know</em>.</p><p>When IΓÇÖm not climbing trees or leading my crew, youΓÇÖll find me spending time with my friends and family. For me, it\'s all about working hard, staying grounded, and doing right by the people who count on usΓÇöboth on the job and at home.</p><p>At Forest Tech, we treat every property like it\'s our own. Because at the end of the day, this isnΓÇÖt just a businessΓÇöit\'s a legacy.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,132,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-01 01:15:08','2025-08-01 01:15:08',NULL,NULL),(914,'50 Countries Later: Why You Should Trust Me With Your Next Vacation','from-bloomfield-to-the-bahamas-a-life-fueled-by-travel',NULL,'<h3><strong>≡ƒîì 50 Countries Later: Why You Should Trust Me With Your Next Vacation</strong></h3><p>I\'ve walked the cobblestone streets of&nbsp;<strong>Barcelona</strong>, sipped tea in&nbsp;<strong>London</strong>, and stood in awe at temples, castles, mountains, and coastlines across&nbsp;<strong>48 other countries</strong>.</p><p>But no matter how far IΓÇÖve traveledΓÇöor how many stamps are in my passportΓÇöthereΓÇÖs one thing that never changes:</p><p><strong>Helping others experience the magic of travel lights me up.</strong></p><h3>Γ£ê∩╕Å A Life Built Around Exploring the World</h3><p>I took my first international trip back in&nbsp;<strong>1966</strong>, and letΓÇÖs just sayΓÇª I havenΓÇÖt slowed down. That one trip flipped a switch in my soul. Since then, IΓÇÖve been chasing culture, cuisine, and connection around the globe.</p><p>In&nbsp;<strong>1994</strong>, I turned that lifelong passion into a professionΓÇölaunching my career as a&nbsp;<strong>Travel Consultant</strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<strong>Bloomfield, Connecticut</strong>. Since then, IΓÇÖve built a reputation for delivering world-class travel planning with heart.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÄô Credentials You Can Count On</h3><p>I\'m a proud&nbsp;<strong>graduate of Central Connecticut State University</strong>, where I earned&nbsp;<strong>DeanΓÇÖs List honors</strong>&nbsp;and was inducted into the&nbsp;<strong>National Honor Society</strong>. IΓÇÖm also a&nbsp;<strong>Past Grand Master</strong>&nbsp;and long-standing member of the&nbsp;<strong>Independent United Order of Mechanics</strong>ΓÇöa position of leadership that reflects how seriously I take service and integrity.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒ¢│∩╕Å What I Offer (That Google CanΓÇÖt)</h3><p>LetΓÇÖs keep it real: booking online might seem easyΓÇöuntil itΓÇÖs not.</p><p>I offer real human support and curated expertise based on&nbsp;<strong>decades of personal travel</strong>. I donΓÇÖt just&nbsp;<em>know</em>&nbsp;the destinationsΓÇöIΓÇÖve been there.</p><p>LondonΓÇÖs hidden foodie gems? IΓÇÖll send you.</p><p>Best rooftop view in Barcelona? IΓÇÖve stood there.</p><p>Want to know when NOT to go to Venice? Ask meΓÇöIΓÇÖve made that mistake so you donΓÇÖt have to.</p><h3>≡ƒÆ╝ My Services Include:</h3><ul><li>Custom vacation planning (solo, couples, families, or group trips)</li><li>Cruises, all-inclusive resorts, guided tours</li><li>Destination weddings &amp; honeymoons</li><li>Corporate retreats &amp; incentive trips</li><li>Travel insurance advice</li><li>And yes,&nbsp;<strong>payment plans are available</strong></li></ul><h3>≡ƒÆ¼ Final Boarding Call</h3><p>Travel isnΓÇÖt just a break from routineΓÇöitΓÇÖs a doorway to perspective, healing, excitement, and joy.</p><p>Whether you want to explore the streets of Spain or cruise the Caribbean, IΓÇÖm here to get you thereΓÇöwithout the stress, hassle, or guesswork.</p><p>So if you\'re tired of ΓÇ£DIYΓÇ¥ travel and ready for an expert whoΓÇÖs been to&nbsp;<strong>50 countries and counting</strong>, hit the&nbsp;<strong>ΓÇ£Book a CallΓÇ¥</strong>&nbsp;button on my vBiz Me vCard.</p><p>LetΓÇÖs turn your next trip into a story worth telling.</p><p>ΓÇö&nbsp;<em>C. Alexander Forrest</em></p><p>Franchise Owner | Dream Vacations</p><h3><em>ΓÇ£I donΓÇÖt just plan trips. I craft experiences that stay with you long after the suitcase is unpacked.ΓÇ¥</em></h3>',NULL,'2024-06-03','1',6,1,139,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-05 13:39:49','2025-08-05 19:15:42',NULL,NULL),(915,'My Mission','my-mission-2',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Dream Vacations, my mission is to craft unforgettable travel experiences that go far beyond the brochure. With over 50 countries explored and decades of industry expertise, I provide personalized, stress-free vacation planning rooted in trust, service, and global perspective. I believe travel should expand your mind, soothe your soul, and fit your lifeΓÇönot frustrate it. Whether you\'re dreaming of London, lounging in Barcelona, or cruising through the Caribbean, IΓÇÖm here to make your journey seamless, enriching, and truly unforgettable.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,139,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-05 19:28:17','2025-08-05 19:28:17',NULL,NULL),(916,'New Franchise Training','new-franchise-training',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,139,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-06 19:51:17','2025-08-06 19:51:17',NULL,NULL),(919,'What exactly is vBiz Me?','what-exactly-is-vbiz-me',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">video-first digital business card</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. It opens with a quick&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9-second intro video that flows into your logo</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, then puts&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">one-tap actions</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book, Call, Text, Get a Quote) right under it. People can&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;to contacts in one tap, and you get&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">analytics</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;on views and clicks. Share by&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">link or QR</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">no app</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;needed.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-13 23:22:35','2025-08-13 23:22:35',NULL,NULL),(920,'HowΓÇÖs this different from paper cards or link farms?','hows-this-different-from-paper-cards-or-link-farms',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Paper cards get tossed (</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">88%</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">). Link pages are clutter. vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">mini commercial built to convert</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: video up top, clear CTAs, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">reporting</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;so you know whatΓÇÖs working. It drives outcomesΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">bookings, calls, quotes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇönot link-wandering.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-13 23:23:23','2025-08-13 23:23:23',NULL,NULL),(921,'Does this replace my website or socials?','does-this-replace-my-website-or-socials',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: No. vBiz Me is the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">front door</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;that gets opened. It funnels attention to your site, reviews, calendar, payments, portfolio, and socialsΓÇöin the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">right order</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-13 23:24:26','2025-08-13 23:24:26',NULL,NULL),(922,'Will the video autoplay with sound?','will-the-video-autoplay-with-sound',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Browsers block autoplay&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">with sound</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. Your video&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">autoplays muted</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">; users tap to unmute. We design around that: the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">logo locks in</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;after the intro, CTAs are right below, and music/voice plays when they tap.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-13 23:27:05','2025-08-13 23:27:05',NULL,NULL),(923,'What actions can I add?','what-actions-can-i-add',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: The greatest hits:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Book a Consult</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Call Now</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Text Me</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Get a Quote</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(short form or ΓÇ£text a photo for a quoteΓÇ¥),&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pay/Invoice</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Reviews</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Directions/Maps</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, plus&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info (.vcf)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. We can add custom buttons and reorder them to match your sales flow.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-13 23:27:55','2025-08-13 23:27:55',NULL,NULL),(924,'What do the analytics show me?','what-do-the-analytics-show-me',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Clear signal:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">who viewed</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">what they tapped</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">which sections got attention</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book vs. Quote vs. Call). Use it to follow up&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">smart, not spammy</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. If they submit a form, youΓÇÖll see their details; otherwise itΓÇÖs behavior dataΓÇöno creepy tracking.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-13 23:28:56','2025-08-13 23:28:56',NULL,NULL),(925,'How does pricing and setup workΓÇösolo and teams?','how-does-pricing-and-setup-work-solo-and-teams',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Keep it lean: a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">small setup</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;+ a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">low monthly</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(around&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">under ten bucks</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;tier), with&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">unlimited updates</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇöno printing ever again. Teams get&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">on-brand templates</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">event QR codes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and light CRM/lead routing so every rep looks sharp and you can&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">measure conversions</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-13 23:29:46','2025-08-13 23:29:46',NULL,NULL),(926,'1. What services does LP Insurance Marketing Group provide?','1-what-services-does-lp-insurance-marketing-group-provide',NULL,'<p>We offer a wide range of insurance products including Medicare and prescription drug plans, hospital indemnity, lump-sum critical illness coverage, final expense and funeral policies, term and whole life insurance, long-term care solutions, and annuities.</p><p><br></p><h3>2.&nbsp;<strong>How long has LP Insurance been in business?</strong></h3><p>LP Insurance Marketing Group has been serving clients since 2008. With over a decade of experience, we are committed to providing trusted, relationship-driven insurance solutions.</p><p><br></p><h3>3.&nbsp;<strong>Do you work with multiple insurance carriers?</strong></h3><p>Yes. We represent many of the nationΓÇÖs top-rated insurance companies, ensuring we can offer clients the best products tailored to their individual needs.</p><p><br></p><h3>4.&nbsp;<strong>How is LP Insurance different from other agencies?</strong></h3><p>We believe in personalized service over impersonal online quotes. Our agents work directly with clients to educate, guide, and help them make the best insurance decisions for themselves and their families.</p><p><br></p><h3>5.&nbsp;<strong>Is LP Insurance Marketing Group local or national?</strong></h3><p>We are headquartered in Hartford, Connecticut, and serve clients both locally and across the country through our toll-free support and national licensing.</p><p><br></p><h3>6.&nbsp;<strong>How do I get started with a policy?</strong></h3><p>You can contact us directly by phone or email to schedule a consultation with a licensed agent. WeΓÇÖll take the time to understand your goals and guide you through the best options available.</p><p><br></p><h3>7.&nbsp;<strong>Can I join your team as an insurance agent?</strong></h3><p>Yes. We welcome experienced and aspiring agents who are entrepreneurial and people-focused. LP Insurance provides ongoing training, support, and access to a collaborative team environment.</p><p><br></p><h3>8.&nbsp;<strong>What is your companyΓÇÖs mission?</strong></h3><p>Our mission is to be the community\'s trusted source for insurance solutions by offering exceptional service, honest guidance, and comprehensive coverage tailored to each clientΓÇÖs needs.</p><p><br></p><h3>9.&nbsp;<strong>Do you provide support after the policy is in place?</strong></h3><p>Absolutely. We are committed to long-term client relationships and offer ongoing service, policy reviews, and support whenever you need it.</p><p><br></p><h3>10.&nbsp;<strong>How can I contact LP Insurance Marketing Group?</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Phone (Hartford):</strong>&nbsp;(860) 206-0689</li><li><strong>Toll-Free:</strong>&nbsp;(877) 880-9787</li><li><strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;info@lpinsurancemg.com</li><li><strong>Website:</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.lpinsurancemg.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.lpinsurancemg.com</a></li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:11:53','2025-08-22 09:11:53',NULL,NULL),(927,'CT Insurance License','ct-insurance-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:32:12','2025-08-22 09:32:12',NULL,NULL),(928,'Office License','office-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:32:52','2025-08-22 09:32:52',NULL,NULL),(929,'Customer Service In Action','3',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-05-02','1',18,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:39:23','2025-08-22 09:57:01',NULL,NULL),(930,'Our Mission','our-mission-20',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At LP Insurance Marketing Group, our mission is to provide trusted, personalized insurance solutions that protect families, secure futures, and bring peace of mind. We are committed to integrity, education, and exceptional service, ensuring every client receives guidance tailored to their unique needs. By partnering with top carriers and focusing on lasting relationships, we strive to be the communityΓÇÖs first choice for comprehensive insurance coverage and financial security.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 10:19:57','2025-08-22 11:17:53',NULL,NULL),(931,'5 Reasons to Consider Final Expense Insurance','bbb-accreditation',NULL,'<p>Planning for the future isnΓÇÖt always easy, but protecting your loved ones from unexpected financial burdens is one of the greatest gifts you can leave behind. Final expense insuranceΓÇösometimes called funeral insuranceΓÇöis designed to cover end-of-life costs and provide peace of mind. Here are five reasons why itΓÇÖs worth considering:</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>1. Protect Your Family From Financial Strain</strong></h3><p>Funeral and burial costs can quickly add up, often ranging from $8,000 to $12,000 or more. Without coverage, these expenses fall on family members at an already difficult time. Final expense insurance ensures your loved ones wonΓÇÖt be burdened with sudden bills.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>2. Affordable and Accessible Coverage</strong></h3><p>Final expense policies are typically easier to qualify for compared to traditional life insurance. With lower face amounts and simplified underwriting, many individualsΓÇöeven seniors or those with health issuesΓÇöcan obtain coverage at an affordable rate.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>3. Flexible Use of Benefits</strong></h3><p>While the primary purpose is to cover funeral expenses, the payout can also help with medical bills, outstanding debts, or other financial obligations. This flexibility allows families to focus on healing instead of scrambling for resources.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>4. Quick Payout to Loved Ones</strong></h3><p>Final expense insurance is designed to pay beneficiaries quickly, often within days of a claim. This rapid response ensures funds are available exactly when families need them most.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>5. Peace of Mind for You and Your Family</strong></h3><p>Planning ahead provides comfort. Knowing your loved ones wonΓÇÖt face unnecessary stress during a difficult time allows you to live with greater confidence today.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>The Bottom Line</strong></h2><p>Final expense insurance isnΓÇÖt about planning for the endΓÇöitΓÇÖs about protecting the people you love long after youΓÇÖre gone. At LP Insurance Marketing Group, we help families choose policies that are affordable, straightforward, and tailored to their needs.</p>',NULL,'2025-03-25','1',6,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 11:38:34','2025-08-25 06:11:54',NULL,NULL),(932,'Click Here to Verify','dept-of-consumer-protection-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-25 06:26:58','2025-08-25 06:26:58',NULL,NULL),(935,'BBB','bbb-4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-26 23:26:35','2025-08-26 23:26:35',NULL,NULL),(936,'Who Is Carlos','who-is-carlos',NULL,'<p><strong>I am a dedicated professional committed to helping individuals and families find the right solutions to protect what matters most. With a strong focus on integrity, education, and personalized service, I take pride in guiding clients through important decisions with clarity and care.</strong></p><p><strong>Over the years, I have built lasting relationships by listening first, understanding unique needs, and delivering strategies that create peace of mind and long-term security. Whether itΓÇÖs planning for the future, protecting a familyΓÇÖs well-being, or finding ways to navigate todayΓÇÖs challenges, I approach every client with the same dedication and respect I would give my own family.</strong></p><p><strong>Outside of work, I value community, connection, and continuous growth. My mission is simple: to serve with honesty, to lead with compassion, and to ensure every person I work with feels supported and confident in their choices.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-29 15:16:58','2025-08-29 15:16:58',NULL,NULL),(937,'Honest Work','honest-work',NULL,'<p><strong>IΓÇÖm Dana, a guy who believes in hard work, honesty, and helping people whenever I can. If you know me, you know IΓÇÖd give the shirt off my back to someone in needΓÇöthatΓÇÖs just who I am.</strong></p><p><strong>I br