-15 17:26:43','2025-10-15 17:26:43',NULL,NULL),(1004,'Our Mission','our-mission-26',NULL,'<p><strong>At Elite Remodeling Services, our mission is to provide exceptional remodeling and construction solutions for both residential and commercial properties throughout Southington, Connecticut, and surrounding areas. We specialize in transforming spaces inside and out ΓÇö from kitchens, bathrooms, and home additions to roofing, siding, and full-scale commercial renovations. With a focus on quality craftsmanship, clear communication, and lasting value, we are dedicated to delivering reliable, customized results that exceed expectations and stand the test of time.<span class=\"ql-cursor\">∩╗┐</span></strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,153,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-15 17:28:15','2025-10-15 18:56:51',NULL,NULL),(1005,'.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,153,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-15 17:59:10','2025-10-15 17:59:10',NULL,NULL),(1006,'Insurance','insurance-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,153,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-15 18:05:21','2025-10-15 18:05:21',NULL,NULL),(1007,'Our Mission','our-mission-27',NULL,'<h3><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£We protect people, property, and peace of mind with disciplined officers, smart technology, and service so smooth you barely noticeΓÇöuntil it matters.</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,134,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 04:18:20','2025-10-17 04:18:20',NULL,NULL),(1008,'What areas do you serve?','what-areas-do-you-serve-5',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We cover Connecticut and surrounding states. Multi-site or national? WeΓÇÖll coordinate and staff through trusted partners so you get one program, one point of contact.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,134,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 04:41:13','2025-10-17 04:41:13',NULL,NULL),(1009,'Are your officers licensed and insured?','are-your-officers-licensed-and-insured',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. State-licensed officers, full background checks, drug screening, and ongoing training (de-escalation, report writing, CPR/First Aid as required). COI available on request.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,134,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 04:42:25','2025-10-17 04:42:25',NULL,NULL),(1010,'How is pricing structured?','how-is-pricing-structured',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Clear and modular: hourly per post for on-site, flat rates for mobile patrol/alarm response, and project quotes for systems (access control, CCTV, intrusion, fire). No surprise feesΓÇöeverything is itemized.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,134,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 04:44:36','2025-10-17 04:44:36',NULL,NULL),(1011,'How fast can you start?','how-fast-can-you-start',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rapid deployments in&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">72 hours</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;for standard posts;&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1ΓÇô2 weeks</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;for complex sites or tech installs (access badges, cameras, control room setup). WeΓÇÖll give you a precise timeline at kickoff.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,134,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 04:45:26','2025-10-17 04:45:26',NULL,NULL),(1012,'What does onboarding look like?','what-does-onboarding-look-like',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Site walk ΓåÆ risk review ΓåÆ post orders/SOPs ΓåÆ client portal access ΓåÆ officer briefing and shadow shift ΓåÆ go-live. You get daily activity reports, incident summaries, and a single account manager.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,134,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 04:46:17','2025-10-17 04:46:17',NULL,NULL),(1013,'Who Is Mike Goggin','who-is-mike-goggin',NULL,'<p><strong>With over 12 years of hands-on experience in the construction industry, Mike Goggin is the proud owner of Elite Remodeling Services. Based in Southington, CT, Mike specializes in high-quality residential renovations, custom remodeling, and general contracting services. Known for his attention to detail, reliability, and commitment to craftsmanship, Mike works closely with clients to bring their visions to life ΓÇö on time and on budget.</strong></p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,153,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 08:16:19','2025-10-17 08:16:19',NULL,NULL),(1014,'Q: What makes the eR3 PlanΓäó different from traditional retirement strategies?','what-do-you-actually-change-in-my-group-health-plan-to-cut-costs',NULL,'<p>A: It combines private insurance with a self-directed Roth IRA or Solo Roth 401(k) to super fund retirement with tax-advantaged dollarsΓÇösomething most CPAs or advisors wonΓÇÖt show you.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 16:31:27','2025-10-22 01:23:09',NULL,NULL),(1015,'Q: What are the main perks of participating?','how-much-are-most-companies-overpaying',NULL,'<p>A: You gain tax-advantaged growth, asset protection, risk coverage, and the ability to transfer wealth to family-<strong>TAX FREE</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 16:32:19','2025-10-22 01:56:05',NULL,NULL),(1016,'Q: How flexible is the program?','is-this-erisa-compliant-i-dont-want-an-audit-headache',NULL,'<p>A: You can fund through a Solo Roth 401(k) or Roth IRA, cancel at any time, and ownership can even include family membersΓÇömaking it a powerful tool for tax-efficient wealth transfer.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 16:33:11','2025-10-22 01:48:53',NULL,NULL),(1017,'What do you specialize in?','what-do-you-specialize-in',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Behavioral-health/psychotherapy billingΓÇöcredentialing, claims, denials, patient statements, and insurer follow-ups so you can focus on clients, not hold music.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 22:50:17','2025-10-19 22:50:17',NULL,NULL),(1018,'Can you help me get paneled with insurance?','can-you-help-me-get-paneled-with-insurance',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Can you help me get paneled with insurance?</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. We handle credentialing and re-credentialing (CAQH, attestations, EFT/ERA setup) to get you in-network faster.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 22:51:26','2025-10-19 22:51:26',NULL,NULL),(1019,'Do you manage denials and appeals?','do-you-manage-denials-and-appeals',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Absolutely. We track, correct, and resubmit denials, then chase payers until the money lands where it belongsΓÇöyour account</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 22:53:00','2025-10-19 22:53:00',NULL,NULL),(1020,'Do you post payments and send patient statements?','do-you-post-payments-and-send-patient-statements',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yep. We post EOBs/ERAs accurately and send clear patient statements to keep A/R tidy and predictable.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 22:54:02','2025-10-19 22:54:02',NULL,NULL),(1021,'Are you HIPAA compliant?','are-you-hipaa-compliant',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Are you HIPAA compliant?</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100%. Secure processes, limited-access data handling, and documented workflowsΓÇöprivacy is non-negotiable.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 22:57:58','2025-10-19 22:57:58',NULL,NULL),(1025,'My Mission','my-mission-5',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission is to serve behavioral-health providers with precise, ethical billing that speeds reimbursement and reduces stressΓÇöso clinicians can focus on patient care. We pair 20+ years of expertise with personal, monthly check-ins and straight talk. Promises kept, claims paid, dignity preserved.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 23:26:48','2025-10-19 23:26:48',NULL,NULL),(1026,'Stop Leaving Money on the Table: 7 Billing Mistakes Behavioral-Health Practices Make (and How to Fix Them)','stop-leaving-money-on-the-table-7-billing-mistakes-behavioral-health-practices-make-and-how-to-fix-them',NULL,'<h1>Stop Leaving Money on the Table: 7 Billing Mistakes Behavioral-Health Practices Make (and How to Fix Them)</h1><p><em>By Melissa Velez, Founder, MV Medical Billing LLC</em></p><p>If youΓÇÖre a clinician, your superpower is careΓÇönot CPT codes. But when billing gets messy, great care still ends in denied claims and aging A/R. Here are the seven most common billing mistakes we see in behavioral healthΓÇöand how to fix each one without losing your mind (or your Mondays).</p><h2>1) Skipping Eligibility &amp; Benefits Verification</h2><p><strong>The problem:</strong>&nbsp;You assume the plan covers telehealth or a specific modalityΓÇª until the EOB says ΓÇ£lol, no.ΓÇ¥</p><p><strong>The fix:</strong>&nbsp;Verify&nbsp;<strong>before</strong>&nbsp;the first session: deductible, copay/coinsurance, telehealth coverage, visit limits, and whether prior auth is required. Document the call or portal screen for your records.</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong>&nbsp;Make it a script your admin can run in 3ΓÇô5 minutes. Front-end clarity saves backend chaos.</p><h2>2) Using the Right CPT CodeΓÇª with the Wrong Modifiers</h2><p><strong>The problem:</strong>&nbsp;You bill 90837 correctly, but miss the telehealth modifier or POS change, and the payer treats it like a coding crime.</p><p><strong>The fix:</strong>&nbsp;Keep a one-page cheat sheet for your top codes with&nbsp;<strong>POS</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>telehealth modifiers</strong>&nbsp;(e.g., 95/GT), and payer quirks. Train once; use forever.</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong>&nbsp;Update that sheet quarterly. Payers love changing the rules mid-game.</p><h2>3) Treating Authorizations Like a ΓÇ£WeΓÇÖll Get to ItΓÇ¥ Task</h2><p><strong>The problem:</strong>&nbsp;Sessions happen, but no prior auth existsΓÇöor it expired last week. Denial city.</p><p><strong>The fix:</strong>&nbsp;Track units and end dates in a simple dashboard. Set alerts at 75% utilization and 10 days before expiration. Renew before the last unit is used.</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong>&nbsp;If an auth is pending, submit claims with the pending number when allowed and follow upΓÇödonΓÇÖt let them age.</p><h2>4) Dirty Claims: Small Errors, Big Consequences</h2><p><strong>The problem:</strong>&nbsp;Typos in patient info, wrong NPI, missing taxonomy, or mismatched subscriber IDs.</p><p><strong>The fix:</strong>&nbsp;Bake validation checks into your workflow: name/DOB/ID match, rendering vs. billing NPI, taxonomy, and location. Use EHR edits and payer portal tools to catch errors before sending.</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong>&nbsp;If you must paper file, triple-check the CMS-1500 alignment. Paper denials are slow-motion pain.</p><h2>5) Denial Follow-Up ThatΓÇÖs ΓÇ£When I Have TimeΓÇ¥</h2><p><strong>The problem:</strong>&nbsp;Denials pile up like laundry you pretend is d├⌐cor.</p><p><strong>The fix:</strong>&nbsp;Work denials&nbsp;<strong>weekly</strong>. Categorize (eligibility, coding, auth, timely filing), fix the root cause, resubmit or appeal, and log the outcome.</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong>&nbsp;Track denial rate by payer. If one plan is a frequent flyer, we target trainingΓÇöor reconsider participation.</p><h2>6) Not Reconciling ERAs/EOBs to Bank Deposits</h2><p><strong>The problem:</strong>&nbsp;You ΓÇ£postedΓÇ¥ payments, but did the money actually land? Partial payments and offsets hide in the weeds.</p><p><strong>The fix:</strong>&nbsp;Reconcile posted amounts to actual deposits every week. Investigate deltas immediately (recoupments, offsets, crossing claims).</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong>&nbsp;Keep a ΓÇ£mystery moneyΓÇ¥ log. 30-day rule: if itΓÇÖs still unexplained, escalate with the payer.</p><h2>7) Patients Left Out of the Loop</h2><p><strong>The problem:</strong>&nbsp;Patients get a surprise statement three months later and think youΓÇÖre the villain.</p><p><strong>The fix:</strong>&nbsp;Communicate benefits up front, collect copays at the visit, and send&nbsp;<strong>clear</strong>, timely statements. Offer payment options and a friendly script for follow-up calls.</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong>&nbsp;Use plain language. If a patient understands why they owe, they pay faster (and stay happier).</p><h2>Bonus: A Simple Weekly Billing Rhythm (That Actually Works)</h2><ul><li><strong>Monday:</strong>&nbsp;Eligibility checks and prior-auth updates for new/intake clients.</li><li><strong>Daily:</strong>&nbsp;Submit clean claims; fix rejections same day.</li><li><strong>Wednesday:</strong>&nbsp;Work denials and appeals; document outcomes.</li><li><strong>Thursday:</strong>&nbsp;Post ERAs/EOBs and reconcile to deposits.</li><li><strong>Friday:</strong>&nbsp;Send patient statements and make courtesy calls. Review KPIs (charges, collections, denial rate, A/R aging).</li></ul><p>This rhythm keeps cash flowing and problems small.</p><p><br></p><h2>What to Track (So You DonΓÇÖt Guess)</h2><ul><li><strong>Days in A/R</strong>&nbsp;(goal: trend down)</li><li><strong>First-pass acceptance rate</strong>&nbsp;(goal: 95%+)</li><li><strong>Denial rate by payer &amp; reason</strong>&nbsp;(goal: &lt;5ΓÇô8%, improving)</li><li><strong>Time-to-payment</strong>&nbsp;(electronic should beat paper by a mile)</li><li><strong>Auth utilization</strong>&nbsp;(no surprise expirations)</li></ul><p>If any of those numbers are a mystery, youΓÇÖre not alone. Most practices donΓÇÖt track themΓÇª until they doΓÇöand collections jump.</p><p><br></p><h2>When to Ask for Help</h2><ul><li>YouΓÇÖre spending more time on portals than progress notes.</li><li>Claims feel ΓÇ£random,ΓÇ¥ and appeals go nowhere.</li><li>YouΓÇÖre expanding (new clinicians, new payers) and need clean onboarding.</li><li>Your A/R report makes you want to lie down.</li></ul><p>This is exactly where we come in. At MV Medical Billing, weΓÇÖre behavioral-health nerds: credentialing, eligibility, authorizations, clean claims, denials, posting, statements, auditsΓÇöthe unsexy stuff that gets you paid.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-10-19','1',6,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-19 23:30:19','2025-10-19 23:30:19',NULL,NULL),(1027,'2','4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 02:02:58','2025-10-20 02:02:58',NULL,NULL),(1028,'2','5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 02:10:26','2025-10-20 02:10:26',NULL,NULL),(1029,'Featured on NBC, News Talk, ABC, MarketWatch, Fox News & more','featured-on-nbc-news-talk-abc-marketwatch-fox-news-more',NULL,'<p>Fractional Resiliency Strategist:&nbsp;I help companies grow strongerΓÇösteady margins, real cash flow.</p><p>Most teams chase revenue. I partner with CEOs/owners to find&nbsp;Found Money: hidden cash, lower friction, higher EBITDAΓÇöno new overhead. These plays often sit outside your CPA/CMO/boardΓÇÖs sightline. My job isnΓÇÖt to sell services; itΓÇÖs to expose&nbsp;zero-net-cost&nbsp;fixes, underused assets, and&nbsp;Black Swan&nbsp;moves that build resilience and profit.</p><h2>By Invitation: ER┬│ Tax Unicorn</h2><p>For qualified firms ($500K+ gross): a private design aligning&nbsp;deductible business premiums&nbsp;with&nbsp;Roth-style, tax-free growth, integrating risk management and cash-flow control. Reinsurance follows&nbsp;IRC ┬º831(a)&nbsp;with independent actuarial oversight.</p><ul><li>Turn overlooked risk dollars into strategic capital.</li><li>Potential dividends not bound by qualified-plan caps (subject to plan/tax/statutory rules).</li><li>Built for leaders whoΓÇÖve maxed the usual playbook.</li></ul><p>Scaling, exiting, or cutting noiseΓÇöI bring tested frameworks to grow&nbsp;profitably and durably.</p><p>Why am I upbeat? Because the math smiles back.</p><h3>Invitation-Only Workshop</h3><p>Request a seat at the next&nbsp;ER┬│ Tax UnicornΓäó&nbsp;session led by a nationally known Tax Attorney/CPA. Limited. Confidential. Educational.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 02:30:26','2025-10-20 02:30:26',NULL,NULL),(1030,'Who Is Melissa Velez?','who-is-melissa-velez',NULL,'<p>Founded in 2016 by&nbsp;<strong>Melissa Velez</strong>, MV Medical Billing serves New Britain and the surrounding area with expert behavioral-health billing. Melissa brings&nbsp;<strong>20+ years</strong>&nbsp;of experience across psychotherapy, psychiatry, multi-specialty, and hospital settingsΓÇöand she handles the full cycle:&nbsp;<strong>claims, posting, follow-ups, patient statements</strong>.</p><p>SheΓÇÖs also a&nbsp;<strong>mom of one</strong>&nbsp;and a&nbsp;<strong>Cristian</strong>, which shows up in how she worksΓÇöpatient, fair, and steadfast. Melissa keeps it personal with&nbsp;<strong>monthly check-ins</strong>, clear communication, and a ΓÇ£weΓÇÖll get it doneΓÇ¥ mindset so you can focus on care while we chase the reimbursements. Friendly team, dependable results, promises kept.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 11:48:13','2025-10-20 11:48:13',NULL,NULL),(1031,'My Mission','my-mission-6',NULL,'<p><strong>At Black Swan Business and Financial Strategists, we uncover and apply unconventional, proven strategies that help individuals and businesses make, protect, and grow their wealth beyond the limits of conventional wisdom.</strong></p><p><strong>We traffic in strategies that no one talks about.</strong></p>',NULL,'2025-10-20','1',19,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:02:12','2025-10-20 13:00:03',NULL,NULL),(1032,'Entrepreneur, Financial Professional, and Contrarian Thinker','entrepreneur-financial-professional-and-contrarian-thinker',NULL,'<p><strong>I have never enjoyed following the crowd. I am a trailblazer, a continuous learner, and a motivator, and I believe life is always changing. You are either growing or stagnating, which is why I pursue rare and uncommon information for success. That is the philosophy behind Black Swan Business and Financial Strategists.</strong></p><p><strong>I feel very fortunate to be part of unique professional circles I never expected to join.</strong></p><p><strong>I was an Electrical Engineer for 22 years, have been licensed in the financial services industry for over 30 years, serve as a Board Member of the Exit Planning Institute Orange County, California Chapter, am a member of the Newport Beach Chamber of Commerce Commodores Club, and have held leadership roles in multiple organizations.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:06:00','2025-10-20 12:06:00',NULL,NULL),(1033,'cert1','cert1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:22:18','2025-10-20 12:22:18',NULL,NULL),(1034,'Cert2','cert2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:22:57','2025-10-20 12:22:57',NULL,NULL),(1035,'Cert3','cert3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:27:56','2025-10-20 12:27:56',NULL,NULL),(1036,'Stop Leaking Profit: 6 ΓÇ£HiddenΓÇ¥ Cash Levers Most Companies Ignore (Until It Hurts)','stop-leaking-profit-6-hidden-cash-levers-most-companies-ignore-until-it-hurts',NULL,'<p>HereΓÇÖs the blunt version: most businesses bleed money in places nobodyΓÇÖs watchingΓÇöbenefits, utilities, taxes, risk. Not because youΓÇÖre lazy. Because the system is a maze and youΓÇÖve got a company to run. Black Swan exists to flip those ΓÇ£expense inevitabilitiesΓÇ¥ into cash-back opportunitiesΓÇöwithout adding headcount or gambling on some shiny new software.</p><p>Today weΓÇÖre walking you through six levers that quietly move the needle: from group health downshifts to R&amp;D credits and privately owned reinsurance plays. Keep your CFO hat on; weΓÇÖre going in.</p><p><br></p><h2>1) Life, Annuity &amp; Health (Individual &amp; Group): Stop Paying Retail for Benefits</h2><p><strong>Icon:</strong>&nbsp;≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å</p><p><strong>WhatΓÇÖs broken:</strong>&nbsp;Renewal season turns smart operators into hostage negotiators. Carriers inch up rates, brokers smile through it, and your P&amp;L takes another love tap.</p><p><strong>What we do:</strong></p><ul><li>Re-bid carriers and restructure plan design to maintain coverage quality while&nbsp;<strong>cutting group health spend up to ~25%</strong>&nbsp;(typical range, not a promise).</li><li>Layer supplemental options (voluntary life, gap, HSA/HRA combos) to boost perceived value for employees without blowing the budget.</li><li>Align benefits with recruiting goals so the package actually helps you hire and retain.</li></ul><p><strong>The result:</strong>&nbsp;less waste, happier people, cleaner margins. Because paying more every year for the same stuff isnΓÇÖt ΓÇ£normalΓÇ¥ΓÇöitΓÇÖs lazy procurement.</p><p><br></p><h2>2) Preventive Health Indemnity + Payroll Reduction: Found Money for Both Sides</h2><p><strong>Icon:</strong>&nbsp;≡ƒÆ│</p><p><strong>The play:</strong>&nbsp;Pair a compliant preventive indemnity plan with optimized pre-tax elections. Employees cover first-dollar care; employers reduce FICA.</p><p><strong>Why it works:</strong></p><ul><li>Employees see more take-home pay.</li><li>Employers realize&nbsp;<strong>~$480ΓÇô$900 annual savings per employee</strong>&nbsp;(typical).</li><li>Morale improves because ΓÇ£benefitsΓÇ¥ finally benefit.</li></ul><p><strong>Reality check:</strong>&nbsp;This is not magic. ItΓÇÖs structure. Do it right, audit annually, and communicate clearly. Do it sloppy and youΓÇÖll annoy HR and freak out payroll. We do it right.</p><p><br></p><h2>3) R&amp;D Tax Credits: You Probably QualifyΓÇöYou Just Never Documented It</h2><p><strong>Icon:</strong>&nbsp;≡ƒº¬</p><p><strong>Do you improve products, processes, or software?</strong>&nbsp;Then you may be leaving cash on the table. The problem isnΓÇÖt eligibilityΓÇöitΓÇÖs proof.</p><p><strong>What changes:</strong></p><ul><li>We map qualifying activities (engineering, prototyping, testing, process tweaks).</li><li>Tie time, wages, and supplies to activities.</li><li>Create an audit-defensible file so the credit survives daylight.</li></ul><p><strong>Industries that routinely win:</strong>&nbsp;manufacturing, construction, SaaS, food science, logistics, and anyone tinkering with efficiency or functionality. If youΓÇÖve got smart people solving problems, letΓÇÖs translate that into dollars.</p><p><br></p><h2>4) Resiliency Energy Savings: Utilities DonΓÇÖt Need Your Tip</h2><p><strong>Icon:</strong>&nbsp;ΓÜí≡ƒÆº</p><p><strong>Your utility bills arenΓÇÖt sacrosanct.</strong>&nbsp;Between bad rate classes, sloppy building controls, and ΓÇ£set it and forget itΓÇ¥ operations, thereΓÇÖs fat to trim.</p><p><strong>Our approach:</strong></p><ul><li>Correct tariffs and rate classes.</li><li>Fix leaks (yes, literal water leaks) and phantom loads.</li><li>Retrofit with ROI disciplineΓÇöno greenwashing, just payback math.</li><li>Add resilience planning (generators, battery storage, demand response).</li></ul><p><strong>Typical outcome:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>8%ΓÇô20% reduction</strong>&nbsp;in water and energy costs over a realistic timeline. Bonus: youΓÇÖre harder to knock offline when the grid sneezes.</p><p><br></p><h2>5) Privately Owned Reinsurance Company (PORC): Handle Risk Like a Grown-Up</h2><p><strong>Icon:</strong>&nbsp;≡ƒÅª≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å</p><p><strong>Who this is for:</strong>&nbsp;profitable firms with insurable enterprise risks (supply chain interruption, key-person gaps, regulatory change, cyberΓÇöthings you know are real but havenΓÇÖt formally priced).</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Risk reduction &amp; transference:</strong>&nbsp;stop self-insuring with vibes.</li><li><strong>Asset protection &amp; wealth acceleration:</strong>&nbsp;premiums become part of a balance-sheet strategy, not a donation.</li><li><strong>Tax efficiency:</strong>&nbsp;when structured properly with independent actuarial oversight and compliance discipline.</li></ul><p><strong>Translation:</strong>&nbsp;youΓÇÖve been paying for ΓÇ£what-ifsΓÇ¥ for years. A PORC lets you formalize, price, and potentially recapture some of that valueΓÇöresponsibly.</p><p><br></p><h2>6) Tax Reduction Strategies: Your CPA Files; We Engineer</h2><p><strong>Icon:</strong>&nbsp;≡ƒº╛</p><p><strong>The gap:</strong>&nbsp;filing a return and designing your tax position are two different jobs.</p><p><strong>What we coordinate:</strong></p><ul><li>Entity structure and compensation design</li><li>Cost segregation (for real estate heavy ops)</li><li>Credits &amp; incentives (beyond R&amp;DΓÇöthink energy, hiring, training)</li><li>Timing, deferrals, and basis planning</li></ul><p><strong>Bottom line:</strong>&nbsp;durable, defensible savings. No stunts. No ΓÇ£too cuteΓÇ¥ schemes that age like milk.</p><p><br></p><h2>What This Looks Like in the Wild (Mini Scenarios)</h2><p><strong>The 120-Employee Manufacturer</strong></p><ul><li>Swapped to a smarter group health design ΓåÆ&nbsp;<strong>18% premium reduction</strong>.</li><li>Documented process improvements ΓåÆ meaningful&nbsp;<strong>R&amp;D credit</strong>.</li><li>Utility audit found a misapplied rate class + lighting retrofit ΓåÆ&nbsp;<strong>~12% energy reduction</strong>.</li><li><em>Net effect:</em>&nbsp;better cash flow without cutting a single head.</li></ul><p><strong>The Regional Services Firm (Multi-State)</strong></p><ul><li>Implemented preventive indemnity + payroll reduction ΓåÆ&nbsp;<strong>$600/employee average annual savings</strong>.</li><li>Explored a PORC to formalize supply-chain interruption risk ΓåÆ balance-sheet asset + improved risk posture.</li><li><em>Net effect:</em>&nbsp;resilience + happier team + CFO doesnΓÇÖt hate renewal season.</li></ul><p><strong>The Software Company</strong></p><ul><li>R&amp;D credit on ongoing feature development + process documentation.</li><li>Tax strategy aligned comp and equity to reduce leakage.</li><li><em>Net effect:</em>&nbsp;more runway without begging the board.</li></ul><p><em>(Results vary; your facts, filings, and follow-through run the show.)</em></p>',NULL,'2025-10-20','1',6,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:34:16','2025-10-20 12:35:32',NULL,NULL),(1037,'Is all of this actually legal and compliant?','is-all-of-this-actually-legal-and-compliant',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">YesΓÇöwhen itΓÇÖs done correctly and documented. We design within IRS, DOL, and state regs, use independent actuarial oversight where appropriate (e.g., PORC/captive), and build audit-ready files (benefits changes, R&amp;D studies, payroll strategies, energy incentives). If itΓÇÖs cute-but-risky, we donΓÇÖt do it.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:37:36','2025-10-20 12:37:36',NULL,NULL),(1038,'How fast do we see resultsΓÇöand how much?','how-fast-do-we-see-results-and-how-much',NULL,'<p><strong>Group Health:</strong>&nbsp;plan redesigns and carrier re-bids can land in the next renewal, often trimming&nbsp;<strong>up to ~25%</strong>&nbsp;for groups.</p><ul><li><strong>Preventive Indemnity + Payroll Reduction:</strong>&nbsp;typically goes live the next plan month after approvals;&nbsp;<strong>~$480ΓÇô$900 per employee per year</strong>&nbsp;is common.</li><li><strong>Energy/Water:</strong>&nbsp;audit ΓåÆ fixes/retrofits ΓåÆ savings build over 1ΓÇô3 billing cycles;&nbsp;<strong>~8%ΓÇô20%</strong>&nbsp;is typical.</li><li><strong>R&amp;D Credits/Tax:</strong>&nbsp;realized at filing or via amended returns.</li><li><em>(Ranges arenΓÇÖt promisesΓÇöyour numbers, filings, and follow-through drive outcomes.)</em></li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:38:53','2025-10-20 12:38:53',NULL,NULL),(1039,'Do you replace our CPA, broker, or advisors?','do-you-replace-our-cpa-broker-or-advisors',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Keep them. We add specialized strategy and documentation; your CPA still files, your broker still services. We coordinate so everyone looks good and the dollars stick.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:40:11','2025-10-20 12:40:11',NULL,NULL),(1040,'Do we qualify for the R&D tax creditΓÇöeven if we donΓÇÖt wear lab coats?','do-we-qualify-for-the-rd-tax-credit-even-if-we-dont-wear-lab-coats',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Probably. If you improve products, processes, or software (design, prototyping, testing, iteration), you might qualify. We map activities, tie wages/supplies/contractors to qualified work, and produce an audit-defensible study. Common winners: manufacturing, construction, engineering, SaaS, food science, logistics.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:40:53','2025-10-20 12:40:53',NULL,NULL),(1041,'WhatΓÇÖs the real story with preventive health indemnity + payroll reduction?','whats-the-real-story-with-preventive-health-indemnity-payroll-reduction',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ItΓÇÖs structure, not magic. Employees get first-dollar coverage for preventive basics and increase pre-tax elections; employers reduce FICA. Done right: employees take home more, HR stays sane, and employers save&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">~$480ΓÇô$900 per head annually</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. We handle compliance, communications, and payroll coordination so it doesnΓÇÖt turn into a mess.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:41:53','2025-10-20 12:41:53',NULL,NULL),(1042,'What is a Privately Owned Reinsurance Company (PORC) and who should consider it?','what-is-a-privately-owned-reinsurance-company-porc-and-who-should-consider-it',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A PORC (properly structured captive) lets qualified, profitable firms formalize enterprise risks (supply chain hits, regulatory shifts, cyber, key-person gaps) and potentially capture underwriting profit. Benefits:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">risk reduction, asset protection, tax efficiency, wealth acceleration, and risk transference</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇöwith independent actuarial oversight. Good fit if you have real, quantifiable risks and stable profits; not a fit if cash is tight or risks are pretend.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:43:14','2025-10-20 12:43:14',NULL,NULL),(1043,'Test mission','test-mission',NULL,'<p>Test mission</p>',NULL,'2025-10-20','1',19,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 12:56:29','2025-10-20 12:56:29',NULL,NULL),(1044,'Click To See My Availability','click-to-see-my-availability',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 15:04:44','2025-10-20 15:04:44',NULL,NULL),(1045,'The Commodores Club','media-release',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-10','1',18,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 15:26:57','2025-10-20 15:40:34',NULL,NULL),(1046,'EPI','epi',NULL,'<p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-09-15','1',18,1,155,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 17:09:39','2025-10-20 17:11:34',NULL,NULL),(1047,'Who Am I?','who-am-i',NULL,'<p><strong>Most firms chase the top line. I fortify the bottom line. I work with CEOs and owners to surface hidden cash flow, cut friction, and raise EBITDAΓÇö</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">zero new overhead.</strong><strong> My playbook lives outside the usual CPA/CMO/board lens: benefits restructuring, vendor fee forensics, payroll tax savings, R&amp;D credits, and invitation-only designs like ER┬│ Tax UnicornΓäó (with independent actuarial oversight under ┬º831(a)). IΓÇÖm featured on NBC, News Talk, ABC, MarketWatch, and Fox NewsΓÇönot for hype, but for outcomes. If you want resilient growth, fewer leaks, and decisions made in plain English, IΓÇÖm your guy.</strong></p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 17:26:29','2025-10-20 17:26:29',NULL,NULL),(1048,'Stop Chasing Only the Top Line: Your ΓÇ£Found MoneyΓÇ¥ Is Hiding in Plain Sight','stop-chasing-only-the-top-line-your-found-money-is-hiding-in-plain-sight',NULL,'<p>&nbsp;Revenue is loud. Waste is quiet. If you want durable growthΓÇösteady margins, calmer cash flow, higher EBITDAΓÇöstart by digging up cash you already earn but never keep. HereΓÇÖs where it hides and how to pull it out without adding new overhead.</p><p><br></p><h2>The Problem with ΓÇ£Grow, Grow, GrowΓÇ¥</h2><p>Most teams sprint after the top line like itΓÇÖs the last donut in the break room. Then month-end hits andΓÇösurpriseΓÇöprofits didnΓÇÖt move. Why? Because margins are leaking through benefits bloat, junk vendor fees, dusty processes, and tax opportunities no one has time to document.</p><p>Top line is sexy.&nbsp;<strong>Resiliency</strong>&nbsp;pays the bills.</p><p><br></p><h2>Found Money 101: Where the Cash Usually Hides</h2><p>Think of your company like a house. You donΓÇÖt start by adding a second story (new revenue) before fixing the leaky roof (margin). We start with the roof.</p><h3>1) Health Plan Cost Disruption (Yes, itΓÇÖs a thing)</h3><p>If your group health plan reads like a phone book and your broker gets paid more when your costs riseΓÇª congratulations, youΓÇÖre on the default setting.</p><p><strong>Fix:</strong>&nbsp;Move to transparent, wholesale pricing; introduce $0 Rx options where eligible; untangle the fee stack; make plan design serve&nbsp;<em>you</em>&nbsp;(not the middlemen).</p><p><strong>Outcome:</strong>&nbsp;Same or better benefits, materially lower spend, fewer ΓÇ£mystery fees.ΓÇ¥</p><h3>2) Payroll Tax SavingsΓÇöWithout Nickel-and-Diming People</h3><p>ΓÇ£Raise take-home payΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£no new employer costΓÇ¥ can live in the same sentence.</p><p><strong>Fix:</strong>&nbsp;Implement an employer-sponsored, employee-funded structure that reduces taxable income correctly and compliantly.</p><p><strong>Outcome:</strong>&nbsp;Average employer savings per employee + happier staff who keep more of their paycheck.</p><h3>3) R&amp;D Tax CreditsΓÇöYou DonΓÇÖt Need a Lab Coat</h3><p>If you improve products, software, or processes, you might qualifyΓÇöeven if nobody wears goggles to stand-up.</p><p><strong>Fix:</strong>&nbsp;Document the qualified activities, map the expenses, file it right.</p><p><strong>Outcome:</strong>&nbsp;Credits you likely shouldΓÇÖve been taking all along.</p><h3>4) Vendor/Broker Fee Forensics</h3><p>Junk fees love the shadows.</p><p><strong>Fix:</strong>&nbsp;Benchmark pricing, re-paper contracts, and force transparency. If itΓÇÖs bundled and ΓÇ£canΓÇÖt be unbundled,ΓÇ¥ thatΓÇÖs your cue.</p><p><strong>Outcome:</strong>&nbsp;Same service (or better), less money out the door.</p><h3>5) Working Capital &amp; Process Flow</h3><p>Sales are great until cash gets stuck in purgatory.</p><p><strong>Fix:</strong>&nbsp;Compress order-to-cash, tighten approvals, and automate choke points.</p><p><strong>Outcome:</strong>&nbsp;Faster cash cycles, calmer ops, fewer ΓÇ£whereΓÇÖs the payment?ΓÇ¥ Slack threads.</p><h2>The Black Swan Bucket: ER┬│ Tax UnicornΓäó (Invitation-Only)</h2><p>For qualified firms, thereΓÇÖs a private structure that aligns&nbsp;<strong>deductible business premiums</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong>Roth-style, tax-advantaged growth</strong>, integrating risk management and cash-flow control in one design. The reinsurance component follows an&nbsp;<strong>IRC ┬º831(a)</strong>&nbsp;framework with independent actuarial oversight.</p><p><strong>Plain English:</strong>&nbsp;YouΓÇÖre already spending ΓÇ£risk dollars.ΓÇ¥ We align them so they work harderΓÇöpotentially creating strategic capital rather than disappearing as a sunk cost.</p><p><strong>Who itΓÇÖs for:</strong>&nbsp;Owners/advisors whoΓÇÖve maxed the usual playbook and want a compliant, high-leverage structure with professional governance. (We keep it invitation-only and education-first, led by a nationally known Tax Attorney/CPA. No hype, all substance.)</p><blockquote><strong>Note:</strong>&nbsp;As always, coordinate with qualified legal/tax advisors. Strategy first, paperwork second.</blockquote><h2>Mini Case Sketches (Illustrative)</h2><ul><li><strong>The $0 Rx Wake-Up:</strong>&nbsp;180-employee manufacturer switches to a transparent benefits platform. Copays drop, certain meds hit $0, and the annual plan cost falls by double digits. Morale up, spend down.</li><li><strong>The ΓÇ£We DonΓÇÖt Pay Junk FeesΓÇ¥ Era:</strong>&nbsp;A services firm with 12 vendors renegotiates three contracts and unbundles two ΓÇ£requiredΓÇ¥ packages. Same outcomes, mid-five-figure annual savings.</li><li><strong>The R&amp;D ΓÇ£We Qualify?ΓÇ¥ Moment:</strong>&nbsp;A SaaS shop documenting iterative builds captures credits it had missed for yearsΓÇöfueling new hires from money they were already earning.</li></ul><h2>Why This Works (Even When YouΓÇÖve Tried Stuff Before)</h2><ol><li><strong>ItΓÇÖs outside the usual lens.</strong>&nbsp;Your CPA may focus on filing; your CMO on pipeline; your broker on renewals. Found Money cuts across silos.</li><li><strong>ItΓÇÖs not theoretical.</strong>&nbsp;These are&nbsp;<strong>zero-net-cost</strong>&nbsp;or net-positive plays. If it doesnΓÇÖt pencil, it doesnΓÇÖt ship.</li><li><strong>It compounds.</strong>&nbsp;Lower baseline costs + better cash discipline = stronger, calmer growth.</li></ol><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-10-20','1',6,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-20 17:31:46','2025-10-20 17:31:46',NULL,NULL),(1049,'Cert 2','cert-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,156,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-21 16:57:58','2025-10-21 16:57:58',NULL,NULL),(1050,'Who qualifies for R&D tax credits?','who-qualifies-for-rd-tax-credits',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">More companies than think they doΓÇösoftware, manufacturing, ecommerce, even food/retail if youΓÇÖre improving products or processes. We run a free benefits evaluation to confirm eligibility.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-21 23:40:27','2025-10-21 23:40:27',NULL,NULL),(1051,'WhatΓÇÖs your process?','whats-your-process',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Initial consult ΓåÆ detailed assessment of activities/expenses ΓåÆ custom evaluation of potential credits ΓåÆ hands-on guidance through filing for maximum benefit.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-21 23:42:03','2025-10-21 23:42:03',NULL,NULL),(1052,'What kind of outcomes do similar businesses see?','what-kind-of-outcomes-do-similar-businesses-see',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Published examples include: $375K for a $3M app firm, $500K for a $20M agency, ~$1M for a $63.1M manufacturer, $2.2M for a $31M ecommerce brand, and $1.3M for a $20M retailer. Your mileage varies, but the upside is real.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-21 23:42:54','2025-10-21 23:42:54',NULL,NULL),(1053,'What do you actually change in my group health plan to cut costs?','what-do-you-actually-change-in-my-group-health-plan-to-cut-costs-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We replace bloated, mark-up heavy plans with wholesale pricing, zero-cost Rx options, and remove the middleman broker structure that hides fees and conflicts. We also audit your current plan and contracts for waste.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 01:41:53','2025-10-22 01:41:53',NULL,NULL),(1054,'How much are most companies overpaying?','how-much-are-most-companies-overpaying',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Typically 20ΓÇô40% on health benefitsΓÇöbecause thatΓÇÖs how the systemΓÇÖs built. WeΓÇÖll show you where the bloat lives in black and white.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 01:43:12','2025-10-22 01:43:12',NULL,NULL),(1055,'Is this ERISA-compliant? I donΓÇÖt want an audit headache.','is-this-erisa-compliant-i-dont-want-an-audit-headache',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Our approach is designed to be ERISA-compliant and to strengthen your fiduciary oversight of brokers and vendors. Translation: lower cost, tighter compliance.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 01:44:06','2025-10-22 01:47:25',NULL,NULL),(1056,'WhoΓÇÖs OTR forΓÇöadults or athletes?','whos-otr-for-adults-or-athletes',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Both. OTR trains busy adults for lifelong strength&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">and</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;youth/HS/college athletes for performance and confidence.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:15:33','2025-10-22 09:15:33',NULL,NULL),(1057,'Do you do 1:1 and small-group training?','do-you-do-11-and-small-group-training',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">YesΓÇösemi-private coaching and 1:1 sessions are core offers. Book through their scheduling link.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:17:15','2025-10-22 09:17:15',NULL,NULL),(1058,'Is nutrition coaching included?','is-nutrition-coaching-included',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yep. Personalized nutrition support alongside training so results actually stick.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:17:52','2025-10-22 09:17:52',NULL,NULL),(1059,'WhatΓÇÖs the Recovery Lab?','whats-the-recovery-lab',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A recovery zone (think compression/rehab-minded support) to maximize performance and prevent injuries.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:18:48','2025-10-22 09:18:48',NULL,NULL),(1060,'How long are sessions?','how-long-are-sessions',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">How long are sessions?</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Programs are built to be efficientΓÇöshort, smart, and scalable to your level. (Exact minutes vary by session/coach.)&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:19:21','2025-10-22 09:19:21',NULL,NULL),(1061,'Do you track progress?','do-you-track-progress',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">YesΓÇöexpect assessments and ongoing progress checks so youΓÇÖre not guessing. (ThatΓÇÖs how they build ΓÇ£stronger, faster, smarterΓÇ¥ movers.)&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:20:01','2025-10-22 09:20:01',NULL,NULL),(1062,'Do you work with teams or just individuals?','do-you-work-with-teams-or-just-individuals',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Both. OTR supports youth, high-school, collegiate, and adult athletesΓÇösolo or as a squad.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:20:43','2025-10-22 09:20:43',NULL,NULL),(1063,'How do I book a consult?','how-do-i-book-a-consult',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Use our booking link (Vagaro) or call/email.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:21:52','2025-10-22 09:21:52',NULL,NULL),(1064,'Where are you located?','where-are-you-located',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100 Harding St, Berlin, CT 06037. Phone: (860) 213-3522. Email:&nbsp;results@otrhealthclub.com</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:22:27','2025-10-22 09:22:27',NULL,NULL),(1065,'Do you offer a first-time session or consult?','do-you-offer-a-first-time-session-or-consult',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">YesΓÇöbook a free consultation to map goals and fit.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 09:23:19','2025-10-22 09:23:19',NULL,NULL),(1067,'Click for Blog','click-for-blog',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 10:15:12','2025-10-22 10:15:12',NULL,NULL),(1068,'My Blog','my-blog',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22','1',6,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 10:21:50','2025-10-22 10:21:50',NULL,NULL),(1069,'Our Mission','our-mission-28',NULL,'<h3><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At OTR, our mission is to help busy adults and competitive athletes get measurably stronger, faster, and more resilientΓÇöwithout the gym drama or time waste. We deliver focused coaching, habit-first nutrition, and recovery youΓÇÖll actually use, so progress isnΓÇÖt a guessΓÇöitΓÇÖs a plan.</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 10:35:37','2025-10-22 10:35:37',NULL,NULL),(1070,'The 40-Minute Myth: You DonΓÇÖt Need 2 Hours to Get Strong','the-40-minute-myth-you-dont-need-2-hours-to-get-strong',NULL,'<p>Most folks waste time ΓÇ£warming upΓÇ¥ (a.k.a. wandering). We stack intent: prep ΓåÆ prime ΓåÆ lift ΓåÆ finish.</p><p><strong>Why it works:</strong></p><ul><li>Progressive overload beats random sweat.</li><li>Short + focused &gt; long + sloppy.</li><li>Recovery is part of the program, not an afterthought.</li><li><strong>Try this:</strong>&nbsp;Book one semi-private session and tell your coach your #1 goal. WeΓÇÖll reverse-engineer the plan.</li><li><strong>CTA:</strong>&nbsp;Book a Free Consult</li></ul><h2>2) Semi-Private vs 1:1: Which One Actually Fits You?</h2><p><strong>Semi-Private</strong>&nbsp;= coaching, community, and efficiency.&nbsp;<strong>1:1</strong>&nbsp;= laser focus for tight timelines or complex needs.</p><p><strong>Choose semi-private if:</strong>&nbsp;you want accountability, coaching, and value.</p><p><strong>Choose 1:1 if:</strong>&nbsp;youΓÇÖre rehabbing, on a deadline, or want max attention.</p><p><strong>Result:</strong>&nbsp;Both drive progress; the right fit keeps you consistent.</p><p><strong>CTA:</strong>&nbsp;See Schedule</p><h2>3) Athlete Speed 101: Faster Feet Start with Strong Hips</h2><p>Everyone wants ΓÇ£quick feet.ΓÇ¥ Cool. Start with&nbsp;<strong>force production</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>positioning</strong>.</p><p><strong>Pillars:</strong></p><ul><li>Strength (hinge, squat, split-stance)</li><li>Acceleration mechanics (shin angles, projection)</li><li>Plyos done right (quality &gt; quantity)</li><li><strong>Outcome:</strong>&nbsp;Faster first step, better top speed, fewer tweaks.</li><li><strong>CTA:</strong>&nbsp;Book Athlete Assessment</li></ul><h2>4) Fat Loss Without Food Drama</h2><p>No fads, no shame spiralsΓÇöjust habits that stick.</p><p><strong>Simple wins:</strong></p><ul><li>Protein at every meal (hand-sized)</li><li>Fiber daily (veggies/berries/beans)</li><li>Weekend plan (donΓÇÖt ΓÇ£wing itΓÇ¥)</li><li>8k+ steps, 2ΓÇô3 strength days</li><li><strong>Bonus:</strong>&nbsp;Stop ΓÇ£starting over Monday.ΓÇ¥ Start nowΓÇösmall, boring, effective.</li><li><strong>CTA:</strong>&nbsp;Start Nutrition Coaching</li></ul><h2>5) Recovery Lab Basics: How to Train More Without Breaking</h2><p>Progress =&nbsp;<strong>stress + recovery</strong>. Skip the second part and your body sends invoices.</p><p><strong>Do this weekly:</strong></p><ul><li>10ΓÇô15 min mobility (hips, T-spine, ankles)</li><li>Breath work post-lift (downshift nervous system)</li><li>Compression or soft-tissue work for hotspots</li><li><strong>Payoff:</strong>&nbsp;Better sessions, fewer aches, steadier gains.</li><li><strong>CTA:</strong>&nbsp;Book Recovery Session</li></ul><h2>6) Proof Beats Vibes: Why We Re-Test</h2><p>ΓÇ£Feeling goodΓÇ¥ is nice.&nbsp;<strong>Data</strong>&nbsp;is nicer.</p><p><strong>We track:</strong>&nbsp;strength PRs, sprint/vertical changes, body comp, movement quality.</p><p><strong>Why it matters:</strong></p><ul><li>Keeps motivation tied to reality</li><li>Shows what to double down on</li><li>Makes plateaus obviousΓÇöand fixable</li><li><strong>CTA:</strong>&nbsp;Schedule Progress Check</li></ul>',NULL,'2025-10-22','1',6,1,157,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-22 10:41:20','2025-10-22 10:42:14',NULL,NULL),(1071,'My Mission','you-tube-channel',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission is to protect employers and fiduciaries with disciplined governance, design plans that reflect company goals and culture, and help participants reach real retirement outcomesΓÇöso your plan becomes a strategic asset, not a checkbox.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-24 01:38:38','2025-10-30 12:06:37',NULL,NULL),(1072,'What do you actually specialize in?','what-do-you-actually-specialize-in',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Employer-sponsored retirement plans: 401(k), 403(b), 457, Defined Benefit, ESOP, and non-qualified plansΓÇöplus full plan design, governance, and support.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-30 11:48:29','2025-10-30 11:48:29',NULL,NULL),(1073,'How do you help us avoid DOL headaches and lawsuits?','how-do-you-help-us-avoid-dol-headaches-and-lawsuits',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You get a documented governance process (the DOL looks for specific points during audits) to help protect the company and fiduciaries from fines/fees.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-30 11:49:14','2025-10-30 11:49:14',NULL,NULL),(1074,'Can a retirement plan lower our business taxes?','can-a-retirement-plan-lower-our-business-taxes',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Employer contributions can reduce tax liabilityΓÇöand plan design can legally skew contributions to help highly compensated owners when appropriate.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-30 11:49:50','2025-10-30 11:49:50',NULL,NULL),(1075,'Will you review our target-date funds (TDFs)?','will-you-review-our-target-date-funds-tdfs',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Absolutely. All target date funds are not the same its best to find the one that fits your organization.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-30 11:50:32','2025-11-03 23:18:48',NULL,NULL),(1076,'Do you handle qualified vs. non-qualified executive benefit plans?','do-you-handle-qualified-vs-non-qualified-executive-benefit-plans',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. I design bothΓÇöERISA-qualified plans and flexible non-qualified options for key talent and executives, with a nod to making the organization more successful.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-30 11:51:19','2025-11-03 23:21:34',NULL,NULL),(1077,'License','do-you-work-with-nonprofits-churches-charities-hoas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-30 11:51:57','2025-11-03 23:49:02',NULL,NULL),(1078,'Your Retirement Plan IsnΓÇÖt Just a Benefit. ItΓÇÖs a Business Strategy.','your-retirement-plan-isnt-just-a-benefit-its-a-business-strategy',NULL,'<p>Most owners treat the company retirement plan like office coffee: necessary, but not exactly strategic. ThatΓÇÖs backwards. Done right, your plan can help you recruit killers, keep them happy, minimize headaches with the DOL, and even lower your tax bill. ThatΓÇÖs not ΓÇ£HR stuff.ΓÇ¥ ThatΓÇÖs growth.&nbsp;</p><h2>Design it like you mean it</h2><p>A retirement plan should reflect your companyΓÇÖs actual goalsΓÇöculture, growth targets, the whole thingΓÇönot just a cookie-cutter lineup of funds. When you treat the plan as an asset, you attract better talent and keep the A-players you already have. Translation: Recruit, Reward, RetainΓÇöon purpose.&nbsp;</p><h2>Governance: the boring part that saves your neck</h2><p>Fiduciary responsibility isnΓÇÖt a vibe; itΓÇÖs a rule. Plan sponsors have to act in participantsΓÇÖ best interests and be able to&nbsp;<strong>prove</strong>&nbsp;it. That means documenting processes, supervising vendors, and staying on top of fees and functions. Do it right and you avoid fees, fines, and lawsuit migraines. Skip it andΓÇª enjoy writing checks.&nbsp;</p><h2>Target-Date Funds: default Γëá dummy</h2><p>Yes, TDFs are often the default in 401(k), 403(b), and 457 plansΓÇöbut ΓÇ£defaultΓÇ¥ doesnΓÇÖt mean ΓÇ£no-brainer.ΓÇ¥ You still have to evaluate the&nbsp;<strong>glide path</strong>&nbsp;(how risk steps down as people age), the investment style, the underlying funds, lineup diversity, and performance. Not all TDFs are created equal, and not every series fits your participants. Pick like a pro, or have a pro pick with you.&nbsp;</p><h2>Taxes: pay the people who build your business (and less to Uncle Sam)</h2><p>Qualified plans can legally reduce your companyΓÇÖs tax liability. Employer contributions are deductible, and smart plan design can allow higher contributions for owners and other HCEsΓÇö<strong>when appropriate and compliant</strong>. You canΓÇÖt avoid taxes; you can, however, stop tipping.&nbsp;</p><h2>Qualified vs. Non-Qualified: different tools, different jobs</h2><p>Qualified plans (think 401(k), profit sharing) live under ERISA with contribution limits and broad eligibility rules. Non-qualified plans are more flexible, built to reward key people and executives, and follow different tax timing. Use qualified for the team; layer non-qualified when you need precision incentives. ItΓÇÖs both/and, not either/or.&nbsp;</p><h2>Nonprofits count too</h2><p>Churches, charities, HOAsΓÇöif you steward assets and policies, you still need clear investment governance and administration. Mission-driven doesnΓÇÖt mean math-free.&nbsp;</p><h2>Values matter (because people can smell nonsense)</h2><p>ΓÇ£Always do the right thing,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£deliver excellence,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£build trust,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£embrace changeΓÇ¥ΓÇöif your advisor doesnΓÇÖt live those values, your plan will show it. Participants arenΓÇÖt dumb; they know the difference between a benefit that benefits them and a checkbox.</p><p><br></p><h3>Quick OwnerΓÇÖs Checklist</h3><ul><li><strong>Is our plan design tied to business goals?</strong>&nbsp;(Hiring, retention, margins)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://jevonkthomas.com/what-we-do\" target=\"_blank\">Jevon K Thomas</a></li><li><strong>Can we prove fiduciary prudence?</strong>&nbsp;(Docs, vendor supervision, fee monitoring)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.jevonkthomas.com/fiduciary-responsibility\" target=\"_blank\">Jevon K Thomas</a></li><li><strong>Have we reviewed our TDFs lately?</strong>&nbsp;(Glide path, style, underlying funds)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.jevonkthomas.com/target-date-funds\" target=\"_blank\">Jevon K Thomas</a></li><li><strong>Are we optimizing tax impactΓÇölegally?</strong>&nbsp;(Owner/HCE contributions within the rules)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.jevonkthomas.com/tax-liability\" target=\"_blank\">Jevon K Thomas</a></li><li><strong>Do we need a non-qualified layer for key talent?</strong>&nbsp;(Retention without ERISA handcuffs)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.jevonkthomas.com/plans\" target=\"_blank\">Jevon K Thomas</a></li><li><strong>If weΓÇÖre a nonprofit, do we have policy + process dialed in?</strong>&nbsp;(Yes, you still need them)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.jevonkthomas.com/non-profits\" target=\"_blank\">Jevon K Thomas</a></li></ul><h2>The bottom line</h2><p>A retirement plan thatΓÇÖs just ΓÇ£thereΓÇ¥ costs you. A retirement plan thatΓÇÖs designed, governed, and reviewed like a business tool pays youΓÇöthrough better hiring, stronger retention, lower risk, and smarter taxes. If youΓÇÖre ready to turn your plan from overhead into edge, thatΓÇÖs exactly what Jevon K. Thomas does all day.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Call to action:</strong>&nbsp;Get a practical audit of your planΓÇödesign, governance, TDFs, tax impactΓÇöin plain English, with real next steps. Then decide if you want help executing. No fluff, just results.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-10-30','1',6,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-30 12:03:00','2025-10-30 12:03:00',NULL,NULL),(1079,'Click To Set Up Call','click-to-set-up-call',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 12:49:58','2025-11-03 12:49:58',NULL,NULL),(1080,'Press/media','who-is-vanessa',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',18,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:35:55','2025-11-03 14:51:53',NULL,NULL),(1081,'What makes you different from other travel advisors?','what-makes-you-different-from-other-travel-advisors',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I treat every trip like itΓÇÖs my own ΓÇö with attention, care, and excitement. IΓÇÖm not just a planner; IΓÇÖm a partner in turning your dream vacation into a real experience youΓÇÖll never forget.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:40:01','2025-11-03 14:40:01',NULL,NULL),(1082,'Do you charge a fee for your services?','do-you-charge-a-fee-for-your-services',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes, I charge a one-time&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">$50 administrative fee</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;for each person. This covers the time, research, and personalized attention I dedicate to building the perfect itinerary. Every detail is handled for you ΓÇö so all you have to do is relax and enjoy your journey.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:40:59','2025-12-08 21:21:33',NULL,NULL),(1083,'Can you help plan group or family trips?','can-you-help-plan-group-or-family-trips',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Absolutely! I love planning family adventures, reunions, and group getaways. I make sure everyone ΓÇö from toddlers to grandparents ΓÇö has something to look forward to.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:42:38','2025-11-03 14:42:38',NULL,NULL),(1084,'What destinations do you specialize in?','what-destinations-do-you-specialize-in',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖve personally traveled to Aruba, St. Lucia, Cura├ºao, Santorini, Mykonos, and Athens ΓÇö and I specialize in tropical escapes, cruises, and Mediterranean vacations.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:43:22','2025-11-03 14:43:22',NULL,NULL),(1085,'What if something unexpected happens during my trip?','what-if-something-unexpected-happens-during-my-trip',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖm with you every step of the way. Whether itΓÇÖs a flight change or a last-minute issue, IΓÇÖll assist with rebooking, travel insurance, and support so you can relax and keep enjoying your trip.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:44:23','2025-11-03 14:44:23',NULL,NULL),(1086,'How do we get started?','how-do-we-get-started',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ItΓÇÖs simple! Just reach out to me for a quick consultation ΓÇö tell me where youΓÇÖd love to go, and IΓÇÖll handle the rest, from research to reservations.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:45:17','2025-11-03 14:45:17',NULL,NULL),(1087,'Who Is Vanessa?','who-is-vanessa',NULL,'<p><strong>Hi ΓÇö IΓÇÖm Vanessa, your dedicated travel partner and dream-builder! I donΓÇÖt just book vacations ΓÇö I craft once-in-a-lifetime experiences that turn your dreams into reality. From Aruba and St. Lucia to Santorini, Mykonos, and Athens, IΓÇÖve explored some of the most breathtaking places on Earth ΓÇö and I canΓÇÖt wait to help you do the same.</strong></p><p><strong>IΓÇÖm a proud team player and natural team builder who believes that great journeys start with great connections. Family means everything to me ΓÇö whether itΓÇÖs a group getaway, a romantic escape, or a family adventure, I plan every trip as if it were my own.</strong></p><p><strong>LetΓÇÖs create memories that last a lifetime and make your travel experience effortless, exciting, and unforgettable.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:54:32','2025-11-03 14:54:32',NULL,NULL),(1088,'My Mission','my-mission-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Your Dream Vacation Travel</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, my mission is simple ΓÇö to&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">turn your dream vacation into a reality.</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;I believe every journey should be personal, stress-free, and unforgettable. With a passion for exploring the world and a heart centered around family, IΓÇÖm dedicated to creating seamless travel experiences that bring people closer together. Whether itΓÇÖs a romantic escape, a family adventure, or a once-in-a-lifetime bucket-list trip, my goal is to plan every detail with care, integrity, and excitement ΓÇö so all you have to do is pack your bags and enjoy the adventure.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:57:28','2025-11-03 14:57:28',NULL,NULL),(1089,'cert1','cert2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 14:59:04','2025-11-03 14:59:04',NULL,NULL),(1090,'cert3','turning-your-dream-vacation-into-a-reality',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 15:10:09','2025-11-03 15:21:37',NULL,NULL),(1091,'Turning Your Dream Vacation Into a Reality','turning-your-dream-vacation-into-a-reality',NULL,'<h2>≡ƒî┤&nbsp;<strong>Turning Your Dream Vacation Into a Reality</strong></h2><p><em>by Vanessa Joyce Sutton ΓÇô Your Dream Vacation Travel</em></p><p>They say life is short, but I believe itΓÇÖs also meant to be&nbsp;<em>beautiful.</em>&nbsp;Traveling isnΓÇÖt just about checking places off a list ΓÇö itΓÇÖs about reconnecting with what really matters: joy, family, love, and discovery.</p><p>When I started my journey as a travel advisor, it wasnΓÇÖt just because I loved hopping on planes (though I&nbsp;<em>definitely</em>&nbsp;do). It was because I saw how much happiness a perfectly planned trip can bring. From the sparkle in a coupleΓÇÖs eyes as they celebrate their honeymoon in Santorini, to the laughter of families splashing in the turquoise waters of Aruba ΓÇö&nbsp;<em>those</em>&nbsp;are the moments that stay with you forever.</p><p>IΓÇÖve been blessed to explore some of the worldΓÇÖs most stunning destinations ΓÇö St. Lucia, Cura├ºao, Mykonos, Athens, and beyond ΓÇö and each one reminds me why I do what I do. Every client I help isnΓÇÖt just another booking; they become part of my travel family. I listen, I learn, and I build your vacation around what excites&nbsp;<em>you</em>.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Your Dream Vacation Travel</strong>, IΓÇÖm not just creating itineraries ΓÇö IΓÇÖm creating memories that last a lifetime. Whether youΓÇÖre planning a romantic getaway, a solo escape, or an unforgettable family adventure, my mission is to make your experience effortless, affordable, and extraordinary.</p><p>So where do you want to go next? LetΓÇÖs make it happen.</p><p>Γ£¿&nbsp;<em>Because your dream vacation deserves to become your reality.</em>&nbsp;Γ£ê∩╕Å</p>',NULL,'2025-11-03','1',6,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 15:40:32','2025-11-03 15:40:32',NULL,NULL),(1092,'cert3','cert3-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 15:57:19','2025-11-03 15:57:19',NULL,NULL),(1093,'Roth IRA vs. Traditional IRA','roth-ira-vs-traditional-ira',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 22:01:21','2025-11-03 22:01:21',NULL,NULL),(1094,'Retirement Cash vs. Portfolio Construction','retirement-cash-vs-portfolio-construction',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 22:03:00','2025-11-03 22:03:00',NULL,NULL),(1095,'Planning For Big Expenses & Retirement','planning-for-big-expenses-retirement',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 22:06:40','2025-11-03 22:06:40',NULL,NULL),(1096,'Who Is Jevon K. Thomas?','who-is-jevon-k-thomas',NULL,'<p><strong>IΓÇÖm Jevon K. Thomas ΓÇö </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">retirement plan strategist by day, cigar-and-whiskey guy by night, and a man who believes people should actually retire with dignity, not just hope for it.</strong></p><p><strong>I help business owners, nonprofits, and executives design, protect, and grow their employer-sponsored retirement plans ΓÇö 401(k), 403(b), 457, defined benefit, all of it ΓÇö so they stay compliant, take care of their people, and use the plan as a real business tool instead of a dusty HR line item.</strong></p><p><strong>I love what I do because itΓÇÖs part math, part strategy, and part service. When a company gets their plan right, employees feel valued, owners get tax advantages, and leadership sleeps better knowing the DOL wonΓÇÖt be knocking. That matters to me.</strong></p><p><strong>When IΓÇÖm not talking governance, target-date funds, or plan design, you can catch me on a motorcycle clearing my head, or with a good cigar and a solid whiskey ΓÇö two things that teach you to slow down and enjoy life. ThatΓÇÖs kind of the point: work hard, build wisely, and make sure the future youΓÇÖre building is actually funded.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">If you want a retirement plan thatΓÇÖs intentional, compliant, and built around your organizations goals ΓÇö not just a cost center but a profit centerΓÇö thatΓÇÖs where I come in.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,158,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-03 22:21:07','2025-11-03 23:06:45',NULL,NULL),(1097,'What is the D.R.E.A.M.S. model?','what-is-the-dreams-model',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ItΓÇÖs a business framework: Debt, Retirement, Expense, Asset, Money, and Security. Instead of just selling more, it helps a business plug leaks, protect what it has, and grow smarter.</span></p>',NULL,'2025-11-06','1',13,6,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-04 10:48:06','2025-11-06 17:13:50',NULL,NULL),(1098,'How do the ΓÇ£no out-of-pocketΓÇ¥ savings work?','how-do-the-no-out-of-pocket-savings-work',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">They tap into existing programs (tax credits, 125 plans, energy savings) where the savings cover the cost. So you improve the structure and the business keeps more money.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-04 10:48:47','2025-11-04 10:53:24',NULL,NULL),(1099,'Who is Jim Quinn?','why-would-i-need-this-if-i-already-have-a-cpa-and-payroll',NULL,'<p><strong>Jim Quinn is, before anything else, a man who puts God ,family, and people first ΓÇö a dedicated husband, proud father, loving grandfather, and loyal friend. </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\"> That ΓÇ£people firstΓÇ¥ mindset is the \"purpose\" he brings into business.</strong></p><p>Through his work with a national network of expert services, Jim helps business owners increase profits and wealth with smarter ways to save money, protect what theyΓÇÖve built, and grow without wasting time or cash. He believes most businesses are playing checkers while the giant corporations are playing chess. He teaches businesses how to play chess by introducing them to the expert services available at $0.00 net cost to them! He believes that by connecting businesses to the right programs, tax incentives, expense-reduction strategies, and protection plans that his mission for their success will come to fruition.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">HeΓÇÖs relationship-driven, not sales-driven. If it doesnΓÇÖt help the person, heΓÇÖs not pushing it. His goal is simple: help good people build stable, profitable businesses so they can take care of the people they love ΓÇö just like he does.</strong></p>',NULL,'2025-11-06','1',16,6,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-04 10:49:27','2025-11-06 17:14:47',NULL,NULL),(1100,'What kind of results are possible?','what-kind-of-results-are-possible',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Businesses can save per employee, lower energy costs, and recover tax incentives most never claim. ItΓÇÖs money thatΓÇÖs usually being left on the table.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-04 10:50:59','2025-11-04 10:50:59',NULL,NULL),(1101,'Is this only for bigger companies?','is-this-only-for-bigger-companies',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Traditional employers (with 10 or more employees), small sole proprietor businesses, and even 1099/self-employed can benefit from services offered.</span></p>',NULL,'2025-11-06','1',13,6,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-04 10:51:45','2025-11-06 17:09:27',NULL,NULL),(1102,'What happens first?','what-happens-first',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A short discovery call to discuss your business to determine where you may be losing money, then you get connected to the right solution ΓÇö itΓÇÖs meant to be turnkey.</span></p>',NULL,'2025-11-06','1',13,6,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-04 10:52:36','2025-11-06 17:11:17',NULL,NULL),(1103,'Stop Leaving Money on the Table: The Business Resources Nobody Told You About','stop-leaving-money-on-the-table-the-business-resources-nobody-told-you-about',NULL,'<p>Most business owners think growth only comes from&nbsp;<strong>selling more</strong>.</p><p>More clients. More contracts. More hustle.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs part of it, sure ΓÇö but hereΓÇÖs the truth nobody tells you: a lot of businesses donΓÇÖt need&nbsp;<em>more sales</em>&nbsp;firstΓÇª they need to&nbsp;<strong>stop the leaks</strong>.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs where business resource networks like the one JimΓÇÖs connected to come in.</p><p>This isnΓÇÖt ΓÇ£buy this software and hope.ΓÇ¥ ItΓÇÖs:</p><ul><li>find the money youΓÇÖre already entitled to,</li><li>reduce the expenses you donΓÇÖt need to be paying,</li><li>and protect what youΓÇÖve already built.</li></ul><p>Simple. Smart. adulting-for-business.</p><p><br></p><h3>The D.R.E.A.M.S. Approach</h3><p>The platform Jim works with uses a model called&nbsp;<strong>D.R.E.A.M.S.</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö Debt, Retirement, Expense, Asset, Money, Security.</p><p>Why does that matter?</p><p>Because most businesses focus on the&nbsp;<strong>front</strong>&nbsp;of the business (marketing, sales, social media), but the money is being lost in the&nbsp;<strong>back</strong>&nbsp;of the business (taxes, energy, benefits, structure, protection).</p><p>So imagine this:</p><ul><li>You lower operating costs ≡ƒÆ╕</li><li>You claim tax incentives you never knew existed ≡ƒÅ¢∩╕Å</li><li>You protect your assets so one surprise doesnΓÇÖt wipe you out ≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å</li><li>And you do it&nbsp;<strong>without</strong>&nbsp;taking on new debt</li></ul><p>ThatΓÇÖs not hype ΓÇö thatΓÇÖs just using whatΓÇÖs already available.</p><p><br></p><h3>ΓÇ£No Out-of-PocketΓÇ¥ ΓÇö What Does That Even Mean?</h3><p>YouΓÇÖll see that phrase a lot.</p><p>It usually means this: they plug your business into programs where the&nbsp;<strong>savings pay for the service</strong>.</p><p>Examples?</p><ul><li>Section 125/indemnity savings for employees</li><li>Energy reduction in deregulated states</li><li>R&amp;D or other tax credits the business never filed for</li></ul><p>So instead of, ΓÇ£HereΓÇÖs a bill,ΓÇ¥ itΓÇÖs ΓÇ£HereΓÇÖs money you werenΓÇÖt gettingΓÇª letΓÇÖs use that.ΓÇ¥</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs real value.</p><p><br></p><h3>Why a Connector Matters</h3><p>HereΓÇÖs the problem: most business owners donΓÇÖt have time to go dig through federal incentives, benefit programs, or specialty tax stuff.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs why having someone like Jim ΓÇö a family-first, people-first connector ΓÇö actually matters. HeΓÇÖs not trying to sell you a random product. HeΓÇÖs trying to match your business with the&nbsp;<strong>right</strong>&nbsp;resource.</p><p>And because heΓÇÖs relationship-driven, not commission-blind, heΓÇÖs going to point you to the thing that makes sense ΓÇö not the thing that just sounds fancy.</p><p><br></p><h3>Bottom Line</h3><p>If you:</p><ul><li>own a business</li><li>pay employees (or even 1099s)</li><li>never filed for credits</li><li>or just feel like youΓÇÖre working too hard to be making this littleΓÇª</li></ul><p>ΓÇªthen a simple discovery call can uncover stuff you didnΓÇÖt know you could access.</p><p>Sometimes growth isnΓÇÖt about running faster.</p><p>Sometimes itΓÇÖs about tightening up what you already have.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs the lane here.</p>',NULL,'2025-11-04','1',6,1,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-04 11:09:22','2025-11-04 11:48:02',NULL,NULL),(1104,'CERT1','cert3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-05 00:57:14','2025-11-05 00:57:14',NULL,NULL),(1105,'Cert 2','cert-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,50,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-05 00:58:28','2025-11-05 00:58:28',NULL,NULL),(1106,'Who is Tony?','who-is-tony',NULL,'<h3><strong>IΓÇÖm Tony ΓÇö a 28-year pro detailer who builds finishes like I build physiques: disciplined, precise, and built to last. IΓÇÖm a retired law-enforcement officer and a 20-year Iraq/Afghanistan veteran, so mission mindset and integrity are non-negotiable. IΓÇÖm also a&nbsp;professional bodybuilder, which means I understand ΓÇ£stage-readyΓÇ¥ shine ΓÇö from flawless paint correction to deep interior restoration. WeΓÇÖre&nbsp;BBB accredited, and every job gets the same standard: showroom quality, delivered on time, with zero shortcuts. If you want your ride looking Absolutely Mint, youΓÇÖre in the right shop.</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:37:28','2025-11-14 21:52:13',NULL,NULL),(1107,'My Mission','my-mission-3',NULL,'<h3><strong>Absolutely Mint Auto Detailing, our mission is to deliver disciplined, showroom-ready results at an honest priceΓÇöso thereΓÇÖs no better feeling than sliding into your vehicle, hands on the wheel, knowing you got a great deal. We combine veteran precision, professional craftsmanship, and BBB-backed integrity to make every ride feel brand new.</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:39:17','2025-11-14 21:39:17',NULL,NULL),(1108,'ΓÇ£My paint looks swirledΓÇödo I need a full detail or paint correction?ΓÇ¥','my-paint-looks-swirled-do-i-need-a-full-detail-or-paint-correction',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If you can see spiderweb swirls in sunlight, you need&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">paint correction</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(machine compounding/polishing) to remove them. A full detail cleans and protects; correction actually fixes defects. WeΓÇÖll inspect under lights and tell you if itΓÇÖs 1-step or multi-step so you donΓÇÖt overpay.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:48:38','2025-11-14 21:48:38',NULL,NULL),(1109,'ΓÇ£How long will ceramic/graphene coatings really lastΓÇöand what voids the warranty?ΓÇ¥','how-long-will-ceramicgraphene-coatings-really-last-and-what-voids-the-warranty',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Properly maintained, expect&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2ΓÇô5+ years</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;depending on the package. Skipping washes, using harsh soaps, or automatic brush tunnels shortens life and can void coverage. We register your coating and give you a simple care routine so it actually hits its lifespan.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:49:21','2025-11-14 21:49:21',NULL,NULL),(1110,'ΓÇ£PPF vs. ceramicΓÇödo I need both?ΓÇ¥','ppf-vs-ceramic-do-i-need-both',NULL,'<p>They do different jobs.&nbsp;<strong>PPF (film)</strong>&nbsp;is physical impact protection (rock chips, scuffs).&nbsp;<strong>Ceramic/graphene</strong>&nbsp;is chemical/UV protection and crazy gloss. Daily highway driving or a new front end? Do PPF on high-impact zones + ceramic over the rest for the best of both worlds.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:53:44','2025-11-14 21:53:44',NULL,NULL),(1111,'ΓÇ£What does a ΓÇÿFull DetailΓÇÖ really includeΓÇöand what costs extra?ΓÇ¥','what-does-a-full-detail-really-include-and-what-costs-extra',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Wash, decon (iron/tar), machine polish (light), sealant/ceramic add-on, wheels/tires dressed, interior deep clean, plastics/leather treated, and glass.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Extras</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: heavy pet hair, bio/mold treatment, sand/salt extraction, severe odor removal, and multi-stage paint correction. We flag any add-ons up front so there are no surprises.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:54:36','2025-11-14 21:54:36',NULL,NULL),(1112,'ΓÇ£How long will you need my car? I use it daily.ΓÇ¥','how-long-will-you-need-my-car-i-use-it-daily',NULL,'<p>Quick Wash/Quick Detail:&nbsp;<strong>60ΓÇô120 min.</strong></p><p>Full Detail:&nbsp;<strong>3ΓÇô6 hrs.</strong></p><p>Correction/Coating:&nbsp;<strong>1ΓÇô2 days</strong>&nbsp;(cure time matters).</p><p>PPF:&nbsp;<strong>┬╜ΓÇô2 days</strong>&nbsp;depending on coverage. WeΓÇÖll give you a firm window at check-in and can help with drop-off/pickup timing.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:55:18','2025-11-14 21:55:18',NULL,NULL),(1113,'ΓÇ£What should I do before my appointmentΓÇöand how do I keep it ΓÇÿmintΓÇÖ afterward?ΓÇ¥','what-should-i-do-before-my-appointment-and-how-do-i-keep-it-mint-afterward',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Empty your personal items and car seats, and tell us about any prior repaints/repairs. After service, use&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">pH-neutral soap</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, soft towels, and avoid brush tunnels. We offer maintenance washes so the finish stays dialed without you buying a closet of products.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:55:50','2025-11-14 21:55:50',NULL,NULL),(1114,'Better Business Bureau','better-business-bureau-2',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-14 21:57:26','2025-11-14 21:57:26',NULL,NULL),(1115,'From ΓÇ£Kinda CleanΓÇ¥ to Absolutely Mint: What Real Detailing Does for Your Ride','from-kinda-clean-to-absolutely-mint-what-real-detailing-does-for-your-ride',NULL,'<p>ThereΓÇÖs no better feeling than sliding into your car, hands on the wheel, knowing you got a great dealΓÇöand that it&nbsp;<strong>looks</strong>like a great deal. ThatΓÇÖs the standard at&nbsp;<strong>Absolutely Mint Auto Detailing</strong>: disciplined, showroom-level results without the nonsense.</p><h2>Why ΓÇ£just a washΓÇ¥ isnΓÇÖt cutting it</h2><p>Automatic brush tunnels slap on gloss for a day and leave micro-scratches (swirls) that dull your paint over time. A real detail is about&nbsp;<strong>surface correction and protection</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Decon</strong>&nbsp;to remove iron/tar.</li><li><strong>Machine polishing</strong>&nbsp;to restore depth and clarity.</li><li><strong>Protectants</strong>&nbsp;(ceramic/graphene) so it&nbsp;<em>stays</em>&nbsp;glossy.</li><li>Result: your paint doesnΓÇÖt just shineΓÇöit looks&nbsp;<strong>wet</strong>.</li></ul><h2>Paint Correction vs. Polishing (and why it matters)</h2><ul><li><strong>Polishing</strong>&nbsp;gives you a light gloss bump. Great if your paint is already in decent shape.</li><li><strong>Paint correction</strong>&nbsp;is where we remove visible swirls, haze, and minor scratches through one or more machine steps. If your car looks like a spiderweb in sunlight, this is the fix.</li></ul><p><strong>Bottom line:</strong>&nbsp;polishing&nbsp;<strong>hides</strong>&nbsp;less, correction&nbsp;<strong>fixes</strong>&nbsp;more. WeΓÇÖll inspect under lights and give you a clear, honest planΓÇöno upsell traps.</p><h2>Ceramic vs. Graphene: Which coating should you pick?</h2><p>Both protect against UV, chemicals, and light marring while delivering that mirror finish.</p><ul><li><strong>Ceramic Coating</strong>: Proven, slick, deep gloss.</li><li><strong>Graphene Coating</strong>: Similar look with excellent durability and easy maintenance.</li></ul><p>With proper care, expect&nbsp;<strong>2ΓÇô5+ years</strong>&nbsp;depending on the package. We register your coating and hand you a&nbsp;<strong>simple wash routine</strong>&nbsp;so the warranty actually means something.</p><h2>Do I need PPF too?</h2><p><strong>PPF (Paint Protection Film)</strong>&nbsp;is a transparent, self-healing layer that absorbs rock chips and scuffs. If you do highway miles or just bought something pretty, PPF on the&nbsp;<strong>front bumper, hood edge, mirrors, and door cups</strong>&nbsp;is a clutch move. Many clients choose&nbsp;<strong>PPF for impact zones + ceramic/graphene for the whole car</strong>ΓÇöbest of both worlds.</p><h2>Interiors: where you live (and breathe)</h2><p>Crumbs, spills, pet hair, mystery funkΓÇöyeah, weΓÇÖve seen it. Our interior process:</p><ul><li>Steam + extraction for carpets and seats</li><li>Leather/plastics cleaned and conditioned</li><li>Glass crystal clear</li><li><strong>Odor &amp; mold treatments</strong>&nbsp;when needed</li><li>If we wouldnΓÇÖt put our own family in it, itΓÇÖs not done. Period.</li></ul><h2>Trust the hands on your paint</h2><p>TonyΓÇöowner of Absolutely MintΓÇöis a&nbsp;<strong>28-year pro detailer</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Iraq/Afghanistan 20-year retired veteran</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>retired law enforcement officer</strong>, and&nbsp;<strong>professional bodybuilder</strong>. Translation: discipline, standards, and zero shortcuts. WeΓÇÖre also&nbsp;<strong>BBB accredited</strong>, so youΓÇÖre not just buying glossΓÇöyouΓÇÖre buying accountability.</p><h2>Real talk on pricing (no booby traps)</h2><p>Costs vary by size, condition, and goals. A lightly swirled sedan with a one-step correction and coating is a different animal than a black SUV needing multi-step correction and PPF. WeΓÇÖll show you the options, explain the tradeoffs, and give you a&nbsp;<strong>clear, written quote</strong>&nbsp;up front.</p><h2>How to keep it ΓÇ£AbsoluteΓÇ¥</h2><p>Simple aftercare = long-term shine:</p><ul><li><strong>pH-neutral soap</strong>, quality mitts, and soft drying towels</li><li>Skip brush tunnels</li><li>Touchless or two-bucket wash</li><li>Maintenance details on a schedule so youΓÇÖre not playing product chemist at home</li></ul><h2>A quick before/after story</h2><p>A daily-driven black coupe rolled in looking like it survived a sandstormΓÇöswirls everywhere, headlights fogged, interior tired. We did a&nbsp;<strong>two-step correction</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>graphene coating</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>headlight restoration</strong>, and an&nbsp;<strong>interior deep clean</strong>. The owner picked it up and said, ΓÇ£This looks better than delivery day.ΓÇ¥ ThatΓÇÖs the mark:&nbsp;<strong>from kinda clean to Absolutely Mint</strong>.</p><h2>Who weΓÇÖre perfect for</h2><ul><li>New car owners who want to&nbsp;<strong>protect value</strong>&nbsp;from day one</li><li>Daily drivers that deserve a&nbsp;<strong>refresh</strong></li><li>Enthusiasts chasing that&nbsp;<strong>show-car pop</strong></li><li>Families who want a clean, healthier cabin</li><li>Anyone who wants honest service, veteran-level precision, and results that last</li></ul><h3>Ready for that ΓÇ£hands on the wheelΓÇ¥ moment?</h3><p>Hit&nbsp;<strong>Call</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Text</strong>, or&nbsp;<strong>Book Now</strong>&nbsp;on the vCard.</p><p>Send a quick pic of the paint in sunlightΓÇöweΓÇÖll reply with the fastest, most accurate estimate.</p><p><strong>Absolutely Mint Auto Detailing</strong></p><p>Showroom results. Straight talk. Fair pricing.</p><p>LetΓÇÖs make your car&nbsp;<em>pop</em>.</p>',NULL,'2025-11-15','1',6,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-15 11:30:39','2025-11-15 11:30:39',NULL,NULL),(1116,'1','3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-15 12:30:38','2025-11-15 12:30:38',NULL,NULL),(1117,'2 vid','2-vid',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-15 12:36:25','2025-11-15 12:36:25',NULL,NULL),(1118,'Click Here to Join','join-my-team',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-18 17:08:24','2025-11-18 17:11:02',NULL,NULL),(1119,'Dream Vacation Cert.','dream-vacation-cert',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,139,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-19 16:58:58','2025-11-19 16:58:58',NULL,NULL),(1120,'Test Video Link','test-video-link',NULL,'<p>Test Video Link</p>',NULL,'2025-11-20','1',27,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-19 20:01:17','2025-11-19 20:01:17',NULL,NULL),(1121,'35 Hour Job','video',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-19 20:18:38','2025-11-19 20:20:45',NULL,NULL),(1122,'Social Media Day','social-media-day',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-19 20:22:54','2025-11-19 20:22:54',NULL,NULL),(1123,'06 Lexus Restoration','06-lexus-restoration',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-19 20:28:26','2025-11-19 20:28:26',NULL,NULL),(1124,'REVIVIFY','revivify',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-19 20:36:37','2025-11-19 20:36:37',NULL,NULL),(1126,'Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.','impressions-that-last-connections-that-matter-5',NULL,'Four years ago, I discovered a staggering fact: 10 billion business cards are printed annually in the U.S., but 82% are discarded within a week. This outdated method of networking needed a modern, impactful replacement. I teamed up with Abdul Aziz, a talented web designer, and later, Zohaib Ullah Baig, a skilled software engineer. Together, we built vBiz Me, not just a digital business card but an experience that tells stories, builds connections, and leaves lasting impressions. More Than Just a Virtual Business Card With vBiz Me, users can: Create Dynamic Intro Videos to share their stories. Add Background Music & Animations for engagement. Integrate Branding & Interactive Elements seamlessly. The goal? To enable users to be able to make an informed decision within seconds not hours, days, or weeks. The Journey Building vBiz Me wasnΓÇÖt easy. We faced challenges, sleepless nights, and moments of doubt. But every obstacle fueled our passion to deliver a platform that redefines networking. Why Emotion Matters We know 95% of decisions are driven by emotion. ThatΓÇÖs why every feature, from animations to intro videos, is designed to create emotional impact and leave a lasting impression. Today & Beyond vBiz Me is empowering individuals and businesses to stand out. With tools like AI-powered video creation and Canva integration, weΓÇÖre just getting started. For me, vBiz Me isnΓÇÖt just a businessΓÇöitΓÇÖs a passion. ItΓÇÖs proof that with vision, determination, and an incredible team, anything is possible. Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.',NULL,'2024-09-22','1',6,61,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1127,'Energy, Focus and Positive Energy','entrepreneur-innovator-and-out-of-the-box-thinker-2',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Julia, a former professional basketball player for Albania with a lifelong passion for athletics and competition. Sports have always been my foundation, and that mindset drives how I approach work, challenges, and growth ΓÇö with discipline, teamwork, and a refusal to quit.</p><p>IΓÇÖm highly adaptable, quick on my feet (and quick-witted), and comfortable stepping into new roles and environments. I love traveling, learning from different cultures, and connecting with people from all walks of life.</p><h4><strong>Family, integrity, and living with purpose are at the center of everything I do. Whether on the court, at work, or in my community, I bring energy, focus, and a positive attitude to every opportunity.</strong></h4>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2026-04-07 02:21:30',NULL,NULL),(1129,'Click To View My Availability','click-to-view-my-availability-4',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-03-16','1',14,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1130,'Who We Are & Why Choose Us','who-we-are-why-choose-us-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">At vBiz Me, we donΓÇÖt just create virtual business cardsΓÇöwe redefine how connections are made. We saw a problem: traditional business cards were outdated, forgettable, and ineffective. So, we built a solutionΓÇöa dynamic, interactive, and innovative way to showcase YOU. Our Mission ΓÇô To revolutionize networking by giving professionals and businesses a powerful, engaging, and unforgettable digital identity. What We Do ΓÇô We merge cutting-edge technology with emotional engagement to create digital business cards that donΓÇÖt just share contact infoΓÇöthey make a statement. From dynamic intro videos and custom animations to background music and interactive features, we help you stand out in seconds. Why WeΓÇÖre Different ΓÇô Unlike other digital business cards that are just glorified contact lists, vBiz Me is about creating an experience. We blend personalization, creativity, and functionality into a seamless, no-app-needed platform that turns first impressions into lasting relationships. Our Promise ΓÇô We donΓÇÖt settle for average, and neither should you. Whether youΓÇÖre a business owner, entrepreneur, or professional, we ensure your virtual presence is as impactful, engaging, and professional as you are. With vBiz Me, youΓÇÖre not just sharing contact detailsΓÇöyouΓÇÖre making an impression that lasts.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1131,'The Mission','the-mission',NULL,'<p><strong>Our mission at vBiz Me is to revolutionize professional networking by delivering cutting-edge digital business cards that make powerful first impressions and drive immediate connection.</strong></p><p><strong>We empower individuals and organizations to stand out, communicate their value instantly, and turn every introduction into a lasting opportunity.</strong></p><h3><br></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1132,'What exactly is vBiz Me?','what-exactly-is-vbiz-me-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">video-first digital business card</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. It opens with a quick&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9-second intro video that flows into your logo</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, then puts&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">one-tap actions</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book, Call, Text, Get a Quote) right under it. People can&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;to contacts in one tap, and you get&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">analytics</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;on views and clicks. Share by&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">link or QR</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">no app</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;needed.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1133,'HowΓÇÖs this different from paper cards or link farms?','hows-this-different-from-paper-cards-or-link-farms-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Paper cards get tossed (</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">88%</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">). Link pages are clutter. vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">mini commercial built to convert</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: video up top, clear CTAs, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">reporting</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;so you know whatΓÇÖs working. It drives outcomesΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">bookings, calls, quotes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇönot link-wandering.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1134,'Does this replace my website or socials?','does-this-replace-my-website-or-socials-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: No. vBiz Me is the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">front door</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;that gets opened. It funnels attention to your site, reviews, calendar, payments, portfolio, and socialsΓÇöin the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">right order</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1135,'Will the video autoplay with sound?','will-the-video-autoplay-with-sound-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Browsers block autoplay&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">with sound</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. Your video&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">autoplays muted</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">; users tap to unmute. We design around that: the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">logo locks in</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;after the intro, CTAs are right below, and music/voice plays when they tap.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1136,'What actions can I add?','what-actions-can-i-add-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: The greatest hits:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Book a Consult</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Call Now</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Text Me</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Get a Quote</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(short form or ΓÇ£text a photo for a quoteΓÇ¥),&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pay/Invoice</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Reviews</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Directions/Maps</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, plus&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info (.vcf)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. We can add custom buttons and reorder them to match your sales flow.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1137,'What do the analytics show me?','what-do-the-analytics-show-me-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Clear signal:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">who viewed</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">what they tapped</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">which sections got attention</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book vs. Quote vs. Call). Use it to follow up&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">smart, not spammy</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. If they submit a form, youΓÇÖll see their details; otherwise itΓÇÖs behavior dataΓÇöno creepy tracking.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,166,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-20 16:22:04','2025-11-20 16:22:04',NULL,NULL),(1138,'How does pricing and setup workΓÇösolo and teams?','how-does-pricing-and-setup-work-solo-and-teams-2',NULL,'<p><sp