l usually find me in the kitchen making homemade wine, fresh sausage, capicola, and cooking for the people I love. I bring that same passion, hospitality, and charisma into the shop every day, making sure everyone who walks in feels like a welcomed guest, not just a customer.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 06:10:40','2025-11-23 06:10:40',NULL,NULL),(1142,'Organic','organic',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',21,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 06:15:35','2025-11-23 06:15:35',NULL,NULL),(1143,'French','french',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',21,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 06:16:41','2025-11-23 06:16:41',NULL,NULL),(1144,'Our Mission','our-mission-29',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Litchfield County Liquors, our mission is to bring old-world hospitality to every visitΓÇöpairing the right wine, spirit, or brew with the moments that matter most. Rooted in Sicilian tradition and a love for great food, drink, and conversation, we treat every customer like family, offering quality selections, honest guidance, and a warm, welcoming experience every time you walk through the door.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 06:42:21','2025-11-23 06:42:21',NULL,NULL),(1145,'What are your store hours?','what-are-your-store-hours',NULL,'<p>Our hours are:</p><ul><li>MondayΓÇôSaturday:&nbsp;<em>[add times]</em></li><li>Sunday:&nbsp;<em>[add times]</em></li><li>On holidays or bad weather days, give us a quick call or check Google to confirm weΓÇÖre open.</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 07:37:19','2025-11-23 07:37:19',NULL,NULL),(1146,'Do you offer delivery?','do-you-offer-delivery',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes, we do offer delivery. ≡ƒÜÜ≡ƒì╖</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Delivery is available within a local radius of the store. Minimum order amounts, ID requirements, and any delivery fees may apply.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Call the shop for details and to place your order:&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">[add phone number]</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 07:38:22','2025-11-23 07:38:22',NULL,NULL),(1147,'How does delivery work?','how-does-delivery-work',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You call in your order, we help you pick what you need, and then we deliver to your address within our delivery area. A valid ID is required at drop-offΓÇöno exceptions. Someone 21 or older must be present to receive the order.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 07:39:24','2025-11-23 07:39:24',NULL,NULL),(1148,'Do you take special orders for wine, spirits, or beer?','do-you-take-special-orders-for-wine-spirits-or-beer',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. If youΓÇÖre looking for a specific bottle or brand, let us know the name, size, and any details you have. If our distributors carry it, weΓÇÖll order it and let you know when itΓÇÖs in.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 07:40:41','2025-11-23 07:40:41',NULL,NULL),(1149,'Can you help me pick the right wine or bottle for a gift or dinner?','can-you-help-me-pick-the-right-wine-or-bottle-for-a-gift-or-dinner',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Absolutely. Tell Anthony what youΓÇÖre cooking or who the bottle is for, and heΓÇÖll point you to something that actually fitsΓÇöwhether itΓÇÖs a bold red for pasta, a crisp white for seafood, or a bottle that doesnΓÇÖt look cheap when you show up with it.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 07:41:38','2025-11-23 07:41:38',NULL,NULL),(1150,'Do you make custom gift baskets?','do-you-make-custom-gift-baskets',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes, we can create custom gift baskets with wine, spirits, mixers, and more (depending on what we have in stock). Let us know your budget and what the person likes, and weΓÇÖll build something that feels personal, not generic.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 07:42:56','2025-11-23 07:42:56',NULL,NULL),(1151,'Do you carry local or regional products?','do-you-carry-local-or-regional-products',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We work to support local and regional brandsΓÇöcraft beers, small-batch spirits, and select wines. If thereΓÇÖs a local favorite you donΓÇÖt see on the shelf, ask us. If we can bring it in, we will.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,163,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-23 07:44:13','2025-11-23 07:44:13',NULL,NULL),(1152,'1vid','1vid',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-24 17:33:32','2025-11-24 17:33:32',NULL,NULL),(1153,'2vid','2vid',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-24 19:50:12','2025-11-24 19:50:12',NULL,NULL),(1154,'What services do you handle?','what-services-do-you-handle-2',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;Interior remodels (kitchens, bathrooms, basements), exterior upgrades (siding, roofing, decks),&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">additions</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(sunrooms, added levels, extensions), plus&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">commercial roofing</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,168,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-28 05:22:13','2025-11-28 05:22:13',NULL,NULL),(1155,'Do you work on commercial roofs or just homes?','do-you-work-on-commercial-roofs-or-just-homes-2',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;Both. For businesses, we install, repair, and maintain flat/metal systems including&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TPO</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">EPDM</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇöon schedule, with durable, energy-efficient materials.<