ing industry, Bill McNeil brings unmatched knowledge and insight to every project. From high-end waterfront homes to single-family residences, Bill has done it all. He specializes in cedar products. He guides clients from concept to completion ΓÇö including blueprint review and site preparation. Friendly, experienced, and always ready to help, Bill is a trusted resource for turning ideas into reality.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,169,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-28 05:43:35','2025-11-28 05:46:38',NULL,NULL),(1174,'Life Coach Certification','life-coach-certification-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1175,'Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.','impressions-that-last-connections-that-matter-6',NULL,'Four years ago, I discovered a staggering fact: 10 billion business cards are printed annually in the U.S., but 82% are discarded within a week. This outdated method of networking needed a modern, impactful replacement. I teamed up with Abdul Aziz, a talented web designer, and later, Zohaib Ullah Baig, a skilled software engineer. Together, we built vBiz Me, not just a digital business card but an experience that tells stories, builds connections, and leaves lasting impressions. More Than Just a Virtual Business Card With vBiz Me, users can: Create Dynamic Intro Videos to share their stories. Add Background Music & Animations for engagement. Integrate Branding & Interactive Elements seamlessly. The goal? To enable users to be able to make an informed decision within seconds not hours, days, or weeks. The Journey Building vBiz Me wasnΓÇÖt easy. We faced challenges, sleepless nights, and moments of doubt. But every obstacle fueled our passion to deliver a platform that redefines networking. Why Emotion Matters We know 95% of decisions are driven by emotion. ThatΓÇÖs why every feature, from animations to intro videos, is designed to create emotional impact and leave a lasting impression. Today & Beyond vBiz Me is empowering individuals and businesses to stand out. With tools like AI-powered video creation and Canva integration, weΓÇÖre just getting started. For me, vBiz Me isnΓÇÖt just a businessΓÇöitΓÇÖs a passion. ItΓÇÖs proof that with vision, determination, and an incredible team, anything is possible. Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.',NULL,'2024-09-22','1',6,61,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1176,'Who is TJ?','entrepreneur-innovator-and-out-of-the-box-thinker-2',NULL,'<h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖm a proud father of one amazing little boy and a man completely in love with life. I wake up every day highly motivated to be better than I was yesterday, both as a dad and as a professional. As a licensed CDL holder, I take safety, responsibility, and reliability seriouslyΓÇöon the road and in everything I do.</span></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:58:10',NULL,NULL),(1177,'Science of Well Being','science-of-well-being-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1178,'Click To View My Availability','click-to-view-my-availability-5',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-03-16','1',14,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1179,'Who We Are & Why Choose Us','who-we-are-why-choose-us-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">At vBiz Me, we donΓÇÖt just create virtual business cardsΓÇöwe redefine how connections are made. We saw a problem: traditional business cards were outdated, forgettable, and ineffective. So, we built a solutionΓÇöa dynamic, interactive, and innovative way to showcase YOU. Our Mission ΓÇô To revolutionize networking by giving professionals and businesses a powerful, engaging, and unforgettable digital identity. What We Do ΓÇô We merge cutting-edge technology with emotional engagement to create digital business cards that donΓÇÖt just share contact infoΓÇöthey make a statement. From dynamic intro videos and custom animations to background music and interactive features, we help you stand out in seconds. Why WeΓÇÖre Different ΓÇô Unlike other digital business cards that are just glorified contact lists, vBiz Me is about creating an experience. We blend personalization, creativity, and functionality into a seamless, no-app-needed platform that turns first impressions into lasting relationships. Our Promise ΓÇô We donΓÇÖt settle for average, and neither should you. Whether youΓÇÖre a business owner, entrepreneur, or professional, we ensure your virtual presence is as impactful, engaging, and professional as you are. With vBiz Me, youΓÇÖre not just sharing contact detailsΓÇöyouΓÇÖre making an impression that lasts.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1180,'The Mission','the-mission-2',NULL,'<p><strong>Our mission at vBiz Me is to revolutionize professional networking by delivering cutting-edge digital business cards that make powerful first impressions and drive immediate connection.</strong></p><p><strong>We empower individuals and organizations to stand out, communicate their value instantly, and turn every introduction into a lasting opportunity.</strong></p><h3><br></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1181,'What exactly is vBiz Me?','what-exactly-is-vbiz-me-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">video-first digital business card</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. It opens with a quick&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9-second intro video that flows into your logo</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, then puts&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">one-tap actions</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book, Call, Text, Get a Quote) right under it. People can&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;to contacts in one tap, and you get&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">analytics</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;on views and clicks. Share by&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">link or QR</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">no app</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;needed.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1182,'HowΓÇÖs this different from paper cards or link farms?','hows-this-different-from-paper-cards-or-link-farms-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Paper cards get tossed (</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">88%</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">). Link pages are clutter. vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">mini commercial built to convert</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: video up top, clear CTAs, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">reporting</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;so you know whatΓÇÖs working. It drives outcomesΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">bookings, calls, quotes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇönot link-wandering.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1183,'Does this replace my website or socials?','does-this-replace-my-website-or-socials-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: No. vBiz Me is the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">front door</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;that gets opened. It funnels attention to your site, reviews, calendar, payments, portfolio, and socialsΓÇöin the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">right order</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1184,'Will the video autoplay with sound?','will-the-video-autoplay-with-sound-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Browsers block autoplay&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">with sound</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. Your video&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">autoplays muted</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">; users tap to unmute. We design around that: the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">logo locks in</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;after the intro, CTAs are right below, and music/voice plays when they tap.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1185,'What actions can I add?','what-actions-can-i-add-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: The greatest hits:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Book a Consult</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Call Now</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Text Me</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Get a Quote</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(short form or ΓÇ£text a photo for a quoteΓÇ¥),&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pay/Invoice</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Reviews</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Directions/Maps</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, plus&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info (.vcf)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. We can add custom buttons and reorder them to match your sales flow.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1186,'What do the analytics show me?','what-do-the-analytics-show-me-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Clear signal:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">who viewed</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">what they tapped</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">which sections got attention</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book vs. Quote vs. Call). Use it to follow up&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">smart, not spammy</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. If they submit a form, youΓÇÖll see their details; otherwise itΓÇÖs behavior dataΓÇöno creepy tracking.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1187,'How does pricing and setup workΓÇösolo and teams?','how-does-pricing-and-setup-work-solo-and-teams-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Keep it lean: a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">small setup</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;+ a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">low monthly</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(around&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">under ten bucks</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;tier), with&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">unlimited updates</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇöno printing ever again. Teams get&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">on-brand templates</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">event QR codes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and light CRM/lead routing so every rep looks sharp and you can&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">measure conversions</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,170,NULL,NULL,'2025-11-30 16:39:45','2025-11-30 16:39:45',NULL,NULL),(1188,'Who is Javier?','who-is-javier',NULL,'<p><strong>My name is Javier Serrano, and IΓÇÖm the owner of Serrano Transport. For five years I worked for a transportation company that showed me how powerful great service can beΓÇöbeing on time, being reliable, and treating every rider with respect. That experience inspired me to open my own company and do it my way.</strong></p><p><strong>Today, I transport people all overΓÇöairport runs, appointments, shopping trips, nights outΓÇösimilar to Uber, but with a more personal touch. When you ride with Serrano Transport, youΓÇÖre not just a pickup on an app. YouΓÇÖre a priority. My goal is simple: safe, comfortable, on-time rides, every single time.</strong><span class=\"ql-cursor\">∩╗┐</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 19:04:05','2025-12-01 19:04:05',NULL,NULL),(1189,'How do I book a ride with Serrano Transport?','how-do-i-book-a-ride-with-serrano-transport',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You can call or text me directly, or schedule through my vBiz Me card with your pickup, destination, date, and time. IΓÇÖll confirm your ride personally.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 20:41:22','2025-12-01 20:41:22',NULL,NULL),(1190,'What areas do you serve?','what-areas-do-you-serve-6',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I cover the local area and surrounding cities, including airport runs, house-to-house rides, and out-of-town trips. If youΓÇÖre unsure, just ask.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 20:42:03','2025-12-01 20:42:03',NULL,NULL),(1191,'Do you offer airport transportation?','do-you-offer-airport-transportation',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. I specialize in airport drop-offs and pickups and aim to be on time so youΓÇÖre never rushed or stranded</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 20:42:51','2025-12-01 20:42:51',NULL,NULL),(1192,'How are you different from Uber or Lyft?','how-are-you-different-from-uber-or-lyft',NULL,'<p>With Serrano Transport, you get a&nbsp;<strong>dedicated driver</strong>, not a random match. ItΓÇÖs more personal, consistent, and reliableΓÇösomeone who knows you and your needs.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 20:43:27','2025-12-01 20:43:27',NULL,NULL),(1193,'Can I schedule rides in advance?','can-i-schedule-rides-in-advance',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Absolutely. You can pre-book early morning, late-night, and special event rides to guarantee your spot.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 20:43:55','2025-12-01 20:43:55',NULL,NULL),(1194,'How do I pay for my ride?','how-do-i-pay-for-my-ride',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I accept cash and digital payments (like apps/transfers, depending on what we agree on). YouΓÇÖll always know the costΓÇöno surprise surge pricing.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 20:44:33','2025-12-01 20:44:33',NULL,NULL),(1195,'Our Mission','our-mission-32',NULL,'<p>At Serrano Transport, my mission is to provide safe, reliable, and personal transportation for every rider, every time. I treat each trip like IΓÇÖm driving familyΓÇöon time, respectful, and focused on your comfort. Whether itΓÇÖs an airport run, a local ride, or an important appointment, my goal is simple: get you where you need to go, stress-free, with service you can trust.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,167,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-01 20:59:20','2025-12-01 20:59:20',NULL,NULL),(1196,'Who is Chago?','who-is-chago',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖm a proud father of four ΓÇö one amazing son and three beautiful daughters who inspire everything I do. As the owner of&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Making Power Moves Electrical</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, I built my business on hard work, honesty, and treating people right. I love life, I love people, and IΓÇÖm always willing to lend a hand wherever IΓÇÖm needed. Whether itΓÇÖs powering a home, helping a neighbor, or supporting my community, IΓÇÖm all about making a positive impact every day.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-02 17:21:53','2026-04-21 23:17:54',NULL,NULL),(1197,'Cert 1','cert-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 20:31:07','2025-12-04 20:31:07',NULL,NULL),(1198,'Q: How is O & M different from other suppliers? Γ¡É','q-what-kind-of-products-do-you-carry',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Q: How is O &amp; M different from other suppliers? Γ¡É</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;WeΓÇÖre family owned, local, and still believe in old-school, impeccable customer service. YouΓÇÖre not just an account number here ΓÇö youΓÇÖre a relationship we value.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 22:30:07','2025-12-04 22:35:21',NULL,NULL),(1199,'Q: Do you offer paint color matching? ≡ƒÄ¿','q-do-you-offer-paint-color-matching',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;Yes, we do professional color matching. Bring us the code, a sample, or the vehicle info, and weΓÇÖll help you get an accurate match for a clean, factory-looking finish.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 22:30:50','2025-12-04 22:30:50',NULL,NULL),(1200,'Q: Can you help me choose the right products? ≡ƒñ¥','q-can-you-help-me-choose-the-right-products',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;100%. WeΓÇÖre a family-run business, and we actually&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">talk</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;to our customers. Tell us what youΓÇÖre working on, and weΓÇÖll recommend the right paint system, materials, and supplies.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 22:31:38','2025-12-04 22:31:38',NULL,NULL),(1201,'Q: Do you work with both small shops and larger operations? ≡ƒÅ¬≡ƒÅ¡','q-do-you-work-with-both-small-shops-and-larger-operations',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;Yes. We support everyone from one-man body shops to full production facilities. No shop is too small to get great service from us.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 22:34:19','2025-12-04 22:34:19',NULL,NULL),(1202,'Q: What kind of products do you carry?','q-what-kind-of-products-do-you-carry',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;We supply automotive paint, primers, clear coats, body fillers, sandpaper, masking supplies, tools, detailing products, safety gear, and more ΓÇö everything a body shop needs to get the job done right.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 22:36:12','2025-12-04 22:36:12',NULL,NULL),(1203,'Q: What are your hours? ΓÅ░','q-what-are-your-hours',NULL,'<p><strong>A:</strong>&nbsp;Our hours of operation are:</p><ul><li><strong>Monday ΓÇô Friday:</strong>&nbsp;8:30 AM ΓÇô 5:00 PM</li><li><strong>Saturday:</strong>&nbsp;8:30 AM ΓÇô 12:00 PM</li><li><strong>Sunday:</strong>&nbsp;Closed</li></ul><p>For holiday hours or special closings, just tap the&nbsp;<strong>Call</strong>&nbsp;button on this vCard to double-check.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 22:43:28','2025-12-04 22:43:28',NULL,NULL),(1204,'What Drives O & M Auto Supplies','what-drives-o-m-auto-supplies',NULL,'<p>Eric has been in the auto body supply business for over&nbsp;<strong>30 years</strong>, learning the trade from his father and eventually taking over the family business alongside his wife, Jen. Together, they run O &amp; M Auto Body Supplies as a&nbsp;<strong>true family-owned shop</strong>&nbsp;that still believes in doing things the right way ΓÇö with honesty, respect, and real customer care.</p><p>Outside the shop, Eric and Jen are proud parents to two young daughters and a lively pack at home:&nbsp;<strong>Raven</strong>&nbsp;the husky, and three cats ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>Chester, Bella, and Cookie</strong>. Their number one priority, whether youΓÇÖre a small body shop or a busy production operation, is simple:&nbsp;<strong>your satisfaction</strong>. When you work with O &amp; M, youΓÇÖre treated like family, not just another invoice.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 23:17:44','2025-12-04 23:17:44',NULL,NULL),(1206,'Maintaining Old school Values','maintaining-old-school-values-2',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At O &amp; M Auto Body Supplies, our mission is to give every body shop the tools, products, and support they need to deliver flawless results ΓÇö backed by old-school, family-style service. With over 30 years of hands-on experience, weΓÇÖre committed to stocking quality, professional-grade materials, offering honest guidance, and treating every customer like family. We donΓÇÖt just move product off the shelf ΓÇö we build relationships, stand behind what we sell, and make sure you leave with exactly what you need to get the job done right.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-04 23:30:09','2025-12-04 23:30:09',NULL,NULL),(1207,'Who is Brian?','who-is-brian',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm your Kia specialist here in East Hartford.</p><p>IΓÇÖve been in the car business for over a decade, helping drivers all across Connecticut find the right vehicle for their lifestyle and budget. IΓÇÖm friendly, fun to work with, and I genuinely care about making sure you feel comfortable, informed, and never pressured.</p><p>Whether youΓÇÖre buying your first car, upgrading your family ride, or just exploring options, IΓÇÖm here to listen, answer your questions, and make the process easy. Stop by Kia of East Hartford and letΓÇÖs have a conversation ΓÇö weΓÇÖll find the perfect car for you together.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:02:40','2025-12-05 22:02:40',NULL,NULL),(1208,'Do I need an appointment to work with you, or can I just walk in?','do-i-need-an-appointment-to-work-with-you-or-can-i-just-walk-in',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">YouΓÇÖre welcome to do both. Walk-ins are always welcome at Kia of East Hartford, but if you want to save time, you can text or call me ahead of time and IΓÇÖll have vehicles ready for you to see and test drive.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:26:16','2025-12-05 22:26:16',NULL,NULL),(1209,'What should I bring with me when IΓÇÖm ready to buy a car?','what-should-i-bring-with-me-when-im-ready-to-buy-a-car',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bring your driverΓÇÖs license, proof of income, proof of residence, and your insurance information. If youΓÇÖre trading in a vehicle, bring your registration and any loan payoff info too. If youΓÇÖre not sure, just reach out and IΓÇÖll walk you through it.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:26:57','2025-12-05 22:26:57',NULL,NULL),(1210,'Can you help if my credit isnΓÇÖt perfect?','can-you-help-if-my-credit-isnt-perfect',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. I work with all types of credit situationsΓÇögreat credit, rebuilding credit, or no credit at all. My goal is to help you find a realistic option that fits your monthly budget without judgment or pressure.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:27:44','2025-12-05 22:27:44',NULL,NULL),(1211,'Do you only sell new Kias, or do you have used cars too?','do-you-only-sell-new-kias-or-do-you-have-used-cars-too',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I can help you with&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">new Kias, certified pre-owned Kias, and a variety of quality used vehicles</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;from other brands. If you tell me your budget and what youΓÇÖre looking for, IΓÇÖll narrow down the best options for you.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:28:17','2025-12-05 22:28:17',NULL,NULL),(1212,'WhatΓÇÖs the difference between leasing and financing, and which is better for me?','whats-the-difference-between-leasing-and-financing-and-which-is-better-for-me',NULL,'<p>Leasing usually gives you a lower monthly payment and keeps you in a newer car more often. Financing builds ownership and is better if you plan to keep the car long-term. IΓÇÖll ask you a few simple questions about your driving habits and goals, then help you decide which one makes more sense.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:29:03','2025-12-05 22:29:03',NULL,NULL),(1213,'Do you take trade-ins, and how is the value of my car decided?','do-you-take-trade-ins-and-how-is-the-value-of-my-car-decided',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes, we take trade-ins. Your vehicleΓÇÖs value is based on its year, mileage, condition, market demand, and history report. IΓÇÖll walk you through the appraisal so you understand how we arrived at the numberΓÇöand how it helps lower your payment on your next vehicle.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:29:44','2025-12-05 22:29:44',NULL,NULL),(1214,'IΓÇÖm nervous about high-pressure sales. WhatΓÇÖs it like working with you?','im-nervous-about-high-pressure-sales-whats-it-like-working-with-you',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I keep it&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">friendly, fun, and simple</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. My job is to give you honest information, clear options, and space to make a decision you feel good about. No games, no pressureΓÇöjust a smooth experience from ΓÇ£just lookingΓÇ¥ to driving home</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:30:21','2025-12-05 22:30:21',NULL,NULL),(1215,'Car Shopping in CT DoesnΓÇÖt Have to Be Stressful (Seriously)','car-shopping-in-ct-doesnt-have-to-be-stressful-seriously',NULL,'<h3><strong>Car Shopping in CT DoesnΓÇÖt Have to Be Stressful (Seriously)</strong></h3><p>LetΓÇÖs be honestΓÇömost people would rather do just about anything&nbsp;<em>other</em>&nbsp;than spend a day at a car dealership.</p><p>You picture long wait times, confusing numbers, and someone trying to ΓÇ£close youΓÇ¥ before youΓÇÖve even finished your coffee.</p><p>It doesnΓÇÖt have to be like that.</p><p>IΓÇÖve been in the car business for&nbsp;<strong>over a decade</strong>, helping people all over Connecticut find the right vehicle for their life, their family, and their budget. In that time, IΓÇÖve learned one simple truth:</p><blockquote>When you treat people with respect, listen more than you talk, and keep it realΓÇª the whole experience changes.</blockquote><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Kia of East Hartford</strong>, my goal isnΓÇÖt just to ΓÇ£sell you a car.ΓÇ¥</p><p>My goal is to help you feel&nbsp;<strong>confident</strong>&nbsp;about your decision.</p><h4>What ItΓÇÖs Like Working With Me</h4><p>When you sit down with me, hereΓÇÖs what you can expect:</p><ul><li><strong>No pressure, no gimmicks</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô IΓÇÖm here to guide, not push.</li><li><strong>Straight answers</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô IΓÇÖll break down payments, leases, and financing in plain English.</li><li><strong>Real conversations</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Tell me what you need, what you hate, what you love. I actually listen.</li><li><strong>Options that make sense</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Whether itΓÇÖs a new Kia, a certified pre-owned, or a used vehicle, weΓÇÖll find something that fits&nbsp;<em>your</em>&nbsp;situation.</li></ul><p>I know buying a car is a big decision. For some people itΓÇÖs their first car, for others itΓÇÖs upgrading for a growing family, and for some itΓÇÖs finally treating themselves after years of hard work. Whatever your story is, I take that seriously.</p><h4>More Than Just a ΓÇ£Car GuyΓÇ¥</h4><p>Yeah, I know the numbers, the models, the features, and all the tech.</p><p>But what really matters is this:</p><p>IΓÇÖm&nbsp;<strong>friendly</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>fun to work with</strong>, and I actually&nbsp;<strong>care</strong>&nbsp;how you feel when you drive off the lot.</p><p>If you leave stressed, confused, or unsure, I didnΓÇÖt do my job.</p><p>If you leave excited, confident, and proud of your decisionΓÇö<em>thatΓÇÖs</em>&nbsp;a win.</p><h4>Ready When You Are</h4><p>If youΓÇÖre thinking about your next car, but donΓÇÖt want the usual dealership headache, reach out:</p><ul><li>We can start with a quick call or text</li><li>Set up a no-pressure visit</li><li>Or just come by, say hello, and look around</li></ul><p>Car shopping in CT doesnΓÇÖt have to be stressful.</p><p>With the right person in your corner, it can actually beΓÇª kinda fun.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-05','1',6,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:32:02','2025-12-05 22:44:18',NULL,NULL),(1216,'My Mission','my-mission-4',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to make car buying simple, honest, and enjoyable for every customer I meet. By combining over a decade of experience in the car business with a friendly, fun, and caring approach, IΓÇÖm committed to listening first, respecting your budget, and guiding you to a vehicle that truly fits your life. Every interaction should end with you feeling confident, valued, and excited to drive away.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-05 22:33:22','2025-12-05 22:33:22',NULL,NULL),(1217,'BD Vid 1','bd-vid-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-06 10:34:24','2025-12-06 10:34:24',NULL,NULL),(1218,'BD vid 2','bd-vid-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-06 10:35:22','2025-12-06 10:35:22',NULL,NULL),(1219,'Where the Magic Happens','where-the-magic-happens',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,171,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-06 11:05:46','2025-12-06 11:05:46',NULL,NULL),(1220,'New Cars','new-cars',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-09 16:16:34','2025-12-09 16:16:34',NULL,NULL),(1221,'Pre Owned','pre-owned',NULL,'<p>All Pre Owned</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-09 16:18:30','2025-12-09 16:18:30',NULL,NULL),(1223,'Passion & Profit   Every Wednesday','passion-profit-every-wednesday',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-09 16:58:34','2025-12-09 16:58:34',NULL,NULL),(1225,'Ohio College Podcast','ohio-college-podcast',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-09 20:14:57','2025-12-09 20:14:57',NULL,NULL),(1226,'vBiz Me Commercial 1','vbiz-me-commercial',NULL,'<p>Vbiz Me Commercial</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-09 20:24:46','2025-12-09 20:25:10',NULL,NULL),(1227,'Our Mission','our-mission-33',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Litchfield County Liquors, our mission is to bring old-world Sicilian hospitality to a modern neighborhood liquor storeΓÇöoffering quality wine, spirits, and beer with honest guidance, warmth, and personality. We donΓÇÖt just ring up bottles; we help you choose the right one for your table, your celebration, or your gift, so every visit feels personal, every recommendation makes sense, and every customer leaves feeling like family.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 06:02:08','2025-12-11 06:02:08',NULL,NULL),(1228,'1','4',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 06:15:32','2025-12-11 06:15:32',NULL,NULL),(1229,'2','6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 06:16:08','2025-12-11 06:16:08',NULL,NULL),(1230,'3','5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 06:16:53','2025-12-11 06:16:53',NULL,NULL),(1231,'The Neighborhood Store with a Sicilian Heart','the-neighborhood-store-with-a-sicilian-heart',NULL,'<h3><strong>The Neighborhood Store with a Sicilian Heart</strong></h3><p><strong>Litchfield County Liquors &amp; the Italian ΓÇ£PaesanoΓÇ¥ Feel</strong></p><p>In every good town, thereΓÇÖs&nbsp;<em>that</em>&nbsp;spot.</p><p>Not the big chain, not the cold, fluorescent place where nobody looks up from the registerΓÇöbut the shop where people linger a little longer, talk a little louder, and laugh a little harder. For a lot of folks in the area, that spot is&nbsp;<strong>Litchfield County Liquors</strong>, and a big reason why is the men behind the counter:&nbsp;<strong>Anthony &amp; Jimmy</strong></p><p>Anthony doesnΓÇÖt just run a liquor store. He brings a whole&nbsp;<strong>Sicilian neighborhood culture</strong>&nbsp;with him every time he unlocks the door.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Walking In Feels Like Walking Into a FriendΓÇÖs Kitchen</strong></h3><p>If you grew up around Italians, you already know the vibe.</p><p>You donΓÇÖt just ΓÇ£stop by.ΓÇ¥ You get greeted, questioned, fed, and before you leave, someoneΓÇÖs insisting you take something with youΓÇöwine, leftovers, sausage,&nbsp;<em>something</em>.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs the energy Anthony brings to Litchfield County Liquors.</p><p>You walk in and youΓÇÖre not getting hit with, ΓÇ£Can I help you?ΓÇ¥ in that bored tone. YouΓÇÖre getting:</p><blockquote>ΓÇ£What are you making tonight?ΓÇ¥</blockquote><blockquote>ΓÇ£WhoΓÇÖs coming over?ΓÇ¥</blockquote><blockquote>ΓÇ£You want something bold or something easy-drinking?ΓÇ¥</blockquote><p>Because for him, itΓÇÖs not about a bottle on a shelfΓÇöitΓÇÖs about&nbsp;<strong>whatΓÇÖs happening at your table</strong>.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Sicilian Roots, Real-World Recommendations</strong></h3><p>AnthonyΓÇÖs from strong Sicilian roots, and you feel it immediately:</p><ul><li>He loves to&nbsp;<strong>cook</strong>.</li><li>He makes&nbsp;<strong>homemade wine</strong>.</li><li>He makes&nbsp;<strong>fresh sausage and capicola</strong>.</li><li>He understands that food and drink are not separateΓÇötheyΓÇÖre a package deal.</li></ul><p>So when you ask him what wine to bring for Sunday dinner, heΓÇÖs not guessing. HeΓÇÖs picturing the sauce, the garlic, the meat, the cheese, the whole setup. Then he lines you up with something that actually fits the moment.</p><p>This is where the neighborhood Italian feel kicks in hard:</p><p>ItΓÇÖs not ΓÇ£customer and clerkΓÇ¥ΓÇöitΓÇÖs&nbsp;<strong>host and guest</strong>.</p><h3><strong>More Than a Transaction: ItΓÇÖs a Relationship</strong></h3><p>Old-school Italian neighborhoods run on relationships.</p><p>You go to the same butcher, the same baker, the same guy for produce, because they&nbsp;<strong>know you</strong>. They remember what you like, they ask about your family, they notice when you havenΓÇÖt been in for a while.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs exactly how Anthony &amp; Jimmy treat Litchfield County Liquors:</p><ul><li>They remembers your go-to red.</li><li>They knows who in your house prefers white.</li><li>They knows which bottle you liked last time and what didnΓÇÖt really hit.</li></ul><p>Over time, youΓÇÖre not just ΓÇ£a customer.ΓÇ¥ YouΓÇÖre one of&nbsp;<em>his</em>&nbsp;people.</p><p>And when your people walk in, you donΓÇÖt rush them out. You talk. You laugh. You give them something better than what they wouldΓÇÖve grabbed on their own. ThatΓÇÖs the neighborhood feel you canΓÇÖt fake.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>The Italian Way: Hospitality Over Hype</strong></h3><p>The best part? ItΓÇÖs not forced.</p><p>Anthony doesnΓÇÖt need to memorize corporate scripts or upsell nonsense. He operates on a simple, very Italian philosophy:</p><blockquote>ΓÇ£If I take care of you today, youΓÇÖll come back tomorrow.ΓÇ¥</blockquote><p>HeΓÇÖs not just pushing the most expensive bottle; heΓÇÖs recommending what actually works for you, your budget, and your occasion. Sometimes thatΓÇÖs a high-end Italian red. Sometimes itΓÇÖs a reliable, everyday bottle that wonΓÇÖt empty your wallet.</p><p>Either way, you leave feeling like someone&nbsp;<strong>looked out for you</strong>, not like somebody worked you.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>A Neighborhood Store in a Fast, Impersonal World</strong></h3><p>We live in a world where you can tap your phone, get a random bottle dropped at your door, and never speak to a human. Convenient? Sure.</p><p>But thatΓÇÖs not community. ThatΓÇÖs a transaction.</p><p>Litchfield County Liquors is cut from a different cloth. ItΓÇÖs the kind of place where:</p><ul><li>You hear real conversation, not just beeps from a scanner.</li><li>You get eye contact and a smile instead of silence.</li><li>You leave with a story behind the bottle, not just a receipt.</li></ul><p>The shop has that&nbsp;<strong>old-school Italian block energy</strong>: familiar faces, warm greetings, and the unspoken rule that nobody leaves without being taken care of.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Delivery Coming Soon, Neighborhood Feel Stays</strong></h3><p>Yeah, delivery is coming soonΓÇöbecause life is busy and sometimes you&nbsp;<em>need</em>&nbsp;that convenience.</p><p>But hereΓÇÖs the difference:</p><p>Even when delivery launches, the heart of the place doesnΓÇÖt change.</p><p>YouΓÇÖre not just an address on a screen. YouΓÇÖre still&nbsp;<strong>AnthonyΓÇÖs customer</strong>. YouΓÇÖll still get recommendations, guidance, and that same sense of being part of the neighborhoodΓÇöeven if your order ends up at your front door instead of over the counter.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Why the Neighborhood Italian Feel Matters</strong></h3><p>In the end, a liquor store can be just shelves and bottlesΓÇöor it can be something more.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Litchfield County Liquors</strong>, that ΓÇ£something moreΓÇ¥ is simple:</p><ul><li>A Sicilian owner who treats food and drink like family traditions.</li><li>A neighborhood feel where people are remembered, not processed.</li><li>A place where every bottle comes with a little guidance, a little story, and a whole lot of heart.</li></ul><p>You might walk in looking for a bottle.</p><p>YouΓÇÖll walk out feeling like you just left a friendΓÇÖs place.</p><p>And thatΓÇÖs the difference.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 06:30:21','2025-12-11 06:30:21',NULL,NULL),(1232,'About Us','about-us-2',NULL,'<p><strong>About Us ΓÇô Jimmy DeMicco &amp; Anthony Engala</strong></p><p>WeΓÇÖre Jimmy DeMicco and Anthony Engala, proud Italian owners of Litchfield County Liquors. Together, weΓÇÖve turned a simple package store into a true neighborhood spot where people feel welcome the second they walk through the door.</p><p>Anthony brings his Sicilian roots, love for cooking, homemade wine, fresh sausage, and capicolaΓÇöand that passion for food and family is exactly how he helps customers pick the right bottle for their table. Jimmy, also Italian, brings a sharp business mind, a calm, laid-back presence, and a genuine love for people. He makes sure the store runs smoothly while still taking the time to talk, laugh, and connect with everyone who comes in.</p><p>For us, this isnΓÇÖt just about stocking shelves with wine, beer, and spiritsΓÇöitΓÇÖs about community and old-school Italian hospitality. We know our customers by name, remember what they like, and make sure nobody leaves with ΓÇ£whatever was closest,ΓÇ¥ but with the&nbsp;<em>right</em>&nbsp;bottle for the moment. From quiet dinners to big celebrations, our goal is simple: <strong>you walk in as a customer and walk out feeling like family.&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:22:28','2025-12-11 08:22:28',NULL,NULL),(1233,'What are your store hours?','what-are-your-store-hours-2',NULL,'<p>Our hours are:</p><ul><li>MondayΓÇôSaturday:&nbsp;<em>[add times]</em></li><li>Sunday:&nbsp;<em>[add times]</em></li><li>On holidays or rough weather days, give us a quick call or check Google to confirm weΓÇÖre open.</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:32:55','2025-12-11 08:32:55',NULL,NULL),(1234,'Do you offer delivery?','do-you-offer-delivery-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Not yetΓÇöbut itΓÇÖs coming soon. ≡ƒÜÜ</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">WeΓÇÖre working on launching local delivery so you can get your favorite wine, beer, and spirits brought right to your door. Keep an eye on our vBiz Me card and socials for the official start date.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:34:10','2025-12-11 08:34:10',NULL,NULL),(1235,'How will delivery work once itΓÇÖs live?','how-will-delivery-work-once-its-live',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Once delivery launches, youΓÇÖll be able to place an order by phone (and possibly online later). A valid 21+ ID will be required at drop-off, and someone must be home to receive the order. WeΓÇÖll share details on delivery area, minimum order, and any fees when we go live.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:35:30','2025-12-11 08:35:30',NULL,NULL),(1236,'Do you take special orders for wine, spirits, or beer?','do-you-take-special-orders-for-wine-spirits-or-beer-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. If thereΓÇÖs a specific bottle or brand youΓÇÖre hunting for, tell us the name, size, and any details you know. If our distributors carry it, weΓÇÖll bring it in and let you know when it arrives.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:37:24','2025-12-11 08:37:24',NULL,NULL),(1237,'Do you carry local or regional products?','do-you-carry-local-or-regional-products-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We do our best to support local and regional brandsΓÇöcraft beers, small-batch spirits, and select wines. If thereΓÇÖs a local favorite you donΓÇÖt see, tell us. If we can get it, we will.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:38:24','2025-12-11 08:38:24',NULL,NULL),(1238,'Can you help with parties, events, or holidays?','can-you-help-with-parties-events-or-holidays',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Whether itΓÇÖs a small family gathering or a bigger event, we can help you estimate how much to buy and suggest a balanced mix so you donΓÇÖt overspendΓÇöor run out halfway through the night.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:40:06','2025-12-11 08:40:06',NULL,NULL),(1239,'What kind of atmosphere can I expect when I walk in?','what-kind-of-atmosphere-can-i-expect-when-i-walk-in',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Friendly, warm, and a little Sicilian. Anthony loves cooking, making wine, and talking with peopleΓÇöso the store has that same energy. You come in for a bottle, you leave feeling like family.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,164,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-11 08:41:14','2025-12-11 08:41:14',NULL,NULL),(1240,'What does an MLM coach do?','what-does-an-mlm-coach-do',NULL,'<p>I help you build a profitable network marketing business by teaching systems, mindset, and duplicationΓÇönot spam.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:34:46','2025-12-12 15:34:46',NULL,NULL),(1241,'Do I need experience?','do-i-need-experience',NULL,'<p>No. I coach beginners and seasoned reps. All you need is willingness to learn and work.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:35:17','2025-12-12 15:35:17',NULL,NULL),(1242,'Will you help me recruit?','will-you-help-me-recruit',NULL,'<p>&nbsp;Γüá</p><p>ΓÇÖll teach you how to recruit the right wayΓÇöthrough attraction, conversations, and valueΓÇönot pressure.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:35:48','2025-12-12 15:35:48',NULL,NULL),(1243,'Do I need a big following?','do-i-need-a-big-following',NULL,'<p>Absolutely not. You can start with 0ΓÇô100 followers if youΓÇÖre coachable and consistent.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:36:26','2025-12-12 15:36:26',NULL,NULL),(1244,'Can I really make money in MLM?','can-i-really-make-money-in-mlm',NULL,'<p>YesΓÇöbut only if you treat it like a business, stay consistent, and plug into coaching.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:37:13','2025-12-12 15:37:13',NULL,NULL),(1245,'Do I have to sell to friends & family?','do-i-have-to-sell-to-friends-family',NULL,'<p>No. I teach modern methods: social media strategy, content creation, and relationship marketing.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:38:21','2025-12-12 15:38:21',NULL,NULL),(1246,'ΓüáHow long before I see results?','how-long-before-i-see-results',NULL,'<p>Results follow consistency. Some see growth in weeks, others months. You get out what you put in.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:39:03','2025-12-12 15:39:03',NULL,NULL),(1247,'ΓüáWhat tools do you use to help reps grow?','what-tools-do-you-use-to-help-reps-grow',NULL,'<p>Scripts, onboarding systems, content ideas, daily action plans, mindset coaching, and duplication strategies.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:39:42','2025-12-12 15:39:42',NULL,NULL),(1248,'Is MLM hard?','is-mlm-hard',NULL,'<p>ItΓÇÖs simpleΓÇöbut not easy. The work is predictable. Stay coachable and you win.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:40:26','2025-12-12 15:40:26',NULL,NULL),(1249,'Can I do this part-time?','can-i-do-this-part-time',NULL,'<p>YesΓÇömost people start part-time. My coaching fits any schedule.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 15:41:08','2025-12-12 15:41:08',NULL,NULL),(1250,'Who Am I','who-am-i-2',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Grandfather of 6 and father of 2, originally from Chicago and now based in Atlanta. IΓÇÖm passionate about helping peopleΓÇöespecially youthΓÇöand I work with credit-challenged individuals to rebuild confidence and create real financial momentum. I love life, I love people, and IΓÇÖm big on progress.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 17:56:59','2025-12-12 17:56:59',NULL,NULL),(1251,'Click Here To Join My team','click-here-to-join-my-team',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 18:57:05','2025-12-12 18:57:05',NULL,NULL),(1252,'My Mission','my-mission-5',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our Mission</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Unhyped Collective exists to champion creators, thinkers, and builders who choose substance over spectacle. We bring together a community that values craft, integrity, and real impactΓÇöamplifying work that speaks for itself, without the noise, gimmicks, or fake hype.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-12 19:05:47','2025-12-12 19:05:47',NULL,NULL),(1262,'Cert1','cert4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 16:46:37','2025-12-16 16:46:37',NULL,NULL),(1263,'Cert 2','cert-4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 16:58:20','2025-12-16 16:58:20',NULL,NULL),(1264,'cert 3','cert-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 17:03:28','2025-12-16 17:03:28',NULL,NULL),(1265,'Who Is Flecha?','who-is-flecha',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Flecha, a professional barber with&nbsp;<strong>24 years of experience</strong>&nbsp;behind the chair. I take pride in what I do and in delivering high-quality service every single time. IΓÇÖm very good at my craft, but what really sets me apart is the connection I build with my clients.</p><p>I love interacting with peopleΓÇötalking, sharing stories, and getting to know each person who sits in my chair. For me, itΓÇÖs more than just a haircut; itΓÇÖs an experience. While IΓÇÖm cutting your hair, youΓÇÖll get to know a little more about me, and IΓÇÖll make sure you leave feeling confident, fresh, and taken care of.</p><p>I truly love my work, and it shows in the service I provide. Γ£é∩╕Å≡ƒöÑ</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:19:05','2025-12-16 21:19:05',NULL,NULL),(1266,'How long have you been a barber?','how-long-have-you-been-a-barber',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">≡ƒÆê </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I bring&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">24 years of professional experience</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, precision, and mastery to every cut.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:26:05','2025-12-16 21:26:05',NULL,NULL),(1267,'What services do you offer?','what-services-do-you-offer-3',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Γ£é∩╕Å </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Luxury haircuts, clean fades, sharp line-ups, beard trims, and premium grooming services.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:26:58','2025-12-16 21:26:58',NULL,NULL),(1268,'Do you accept appointments or walk-ins?','do-you-accept-appointments-or-walk-ins',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">≡ƒôà </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Both are welcome.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Appointments are recommended</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;for a smooth, uninterrupted experience.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:27:40','2025-12-16 21:27:40',NULL,NULL),(1269,'What are your business hours?','what-are-your-business-hours',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÅ░ </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Open&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">MondayΓÇôSaturday | 9:00 AM ΓÇô 6:00 PM</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;for those who value quality and consistency.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:28:26','2025-12-16 21:28:26',NULL,NULL),(1270,'Do you work with all hair types and styles?','do-you-work-with-all-hair-types-and-styles',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">≡ƒºöΓÇìΓÖé∩╕Å </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Absolutely. Every cut is&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">custom-tailored</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;to your hair type, face shape, and personal style.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:29:07','2025-12-16 21:29:07',NULL,NULL),(1271,'What makes your service different?','what-makes-your-service-different',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">≡ƒöÑ </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Attention to detail, great conversation, and a premium experience where you leave looking sharp and feeling confident.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:29:46','2025-12-16 21:29:46',NULL,NULL),(1272,'Cert 1','cert-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,176,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-16 21:58:36','2025-12-16 21:58:36',NULL,NULL),(1273,'From Credit Chaos to Control: A Simple Blueprint to Rebuild and Move Forward','from-credit-chaos-to-control-a-simple-blueprint-to-rebuild-and-move-forward',NULL,'<h3><strong>From Credit Chaos to Control: A Simple Blueprint to Rebuild and Move Forward</strong></h3><p>If your credit feels like itΓÇÖs been running your life like a bad manager, youΓÇÖre not alone. Most people donΓÇÖt need another motivational speech. They need a plan thatΓÇÖs clear, realistic, and actually works in the real world.</p><p>HereΓÇÖs the blueprint.</p><h4><strong>Step 1:</strong> Get brutally clear on whatΓÇÖs hurting your score</h4><p>Credit doesnΓÇÖt improve by hoping harder. It improves when you identify the exact issues dragging you downΓÇölate payments, high utilization, collections, errorsΓÇöand you tackle them in the right order. Clarity first. Then strategy.</p><h4><strong>Step 2: </strong>Build habits that donΓÇÖt collapse when life gets busy</h4><p>Most people start strongΓÇª and then Monday shows up with bills, kids, work, and stress. The goal isnΓÇÖt perfection. The goal is a system you can maintain:</p><ul><li>Set reminders for due dates</li><li>Keep balances low (especially on revolving accounts)</li><li>Track progress monthly, not daily</li></ul><p>Small consistent moves beat big random ones.</p><h4>Step 3: If youΓÇÖre building a business, treat it like one</h4><p>A home-based business can absolutely create incomeΓÇöif you stop treating it like a hobby. That means:</p><ul><li>Clear goals</li><li>Consistent daily action</li><li>Learning how to talk to people without sounding like a script</li><li>Keeping momentum even when you donΓÇÖt ΓÇ£feel motivatedΓÇ¥</li></ul><p>Feelings come and go. Systems stay.</p><h4><strong>Step 4: </strong>Set up your business foundations the right way</h4><p>One of the fastest ways to level up is getting your foundation straight. Clean structure, clean processes, clean money. When things are organized, growth becomes easierΓÇöand a lot less stressful.</p><h4><strong>Step 5: </strong>Train for real life, not perfect conditions</h4><p>Real life doesnΓÇÖt play fair. Unexpected expenses happen. Time gets tight. Motivation disappears. The people who win arenΓÇÖt the ones with the best intentionsΓÇötheyΓÇÖre the ones with a plan that survives real life.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Ready to stop guessing?</strong></h3><p>If youΓÇÖre tired of confusion and you want a clear path forwardΓÇöletΓÇÖs talk. A good plan is powerful. The right guidance is even better.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-17','1',6,1,172,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-17 19:50:20','2025-12-17 19:50:20',NULL,NULL),(1274,'Who is Lawrence','who-is-lawrence',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖm Lawrence, founder of&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scary Beaver Tree Removal</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. Back in&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2007</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, I needed a job, spotted the opportunity, scraped together the start-up money, and went all in. Since then, weΓÇÖve built a reputation for doing the hard jobs the right wayΓÇösafe removals, clean cuts, and thorough cleanups. We show up when we say we will, protect your property like itΓÇÖs our own, and price the work fairly. From dangerous takedowns to storm damage, we keep it simple: honest work, done right.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,138,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-19 16:07:21','2025-12-19 16:07:21',NULL,NULL),(1276,'Welcome','welcome',NULL,'<p>Legacy Tax and Resolution Services, is a premiere tax relief and tax services company with over 26 years experience in the tax planning and tax resolution field and has the expertise to handle any of your IRS Tax problems. Keeping your taxes as low as allowable by law, protecting your assets, and maximizing tax deductions, within IRS tax compliance is our focus.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-23','1',19,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 21:23:10','2025-12-26 20:58:11',NULL,NULL),(1277,'Better Business Bureau (BBB) Accreditation','better-business-bureau-bbb-accreditation',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23','1',8,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 21:32:13','2025-12-23 21:32:13',NULL,NULL),(1278,'About Me','about-me-9',NULL,'<p>Stephan H. Brewer, CTRS, JSM Tax, NTPI Fellow</p><p>Founder of Legacy Tax Resolution Services, LLC</p><p>Certified Tax Resolution Specialist</p><p>After spending 20 years in the Air Force as a highly decorated Command Controller, Stephan decided to retire from a life of service to our nation.&nbsp;With an education in accounting and finance from a top rated university, meticulous detail oriented training, learned from running large OPS in the Air Force, Stephan decided to serve in a smaller community.&nbsp;In 2000 he purchased two accounting and tax offices and before 2003 had built the practice to five offices throughout Phoenix Metro area.&nbsp;&nbsp;Having a large practice that was consistently growing at a rate of 30% per year meant that the practice saw large numbers of tax problems resulting from errors found in the returns of new clients.&nbsp;It became rare when the firm did not amend several of the returns of our new clients.&nbsp;The firm became so successful at tax resolution, tax preparation and tax planning; in 2006 it became our primary focus. Stephan being the consummate learner studied the practices of all of the large firms in the industry and sought out all education specific to the industry.&nbsp;Stephan has since received the coveted certification as a Certified Tax Resolution Specialist from the American Society of Tax Problem Solver, and a Master Degree in Tax from Thomas Jefferson School of Law.</p><p>On a more personal note, when StephanΓÇÖs not working on the practice, reviewing returns or solving clientΓÇÖs tax problems, heΓÇÖs spending time vacationing with his lovely wife, visiting with grandchildren, his immediate family or his off-road family.&nbsp;He has a short course race truck and races in the Lucas Oil Regional series.&nbsp;He also attends as many of the desert races as possible.</p><p>We, as a firm only hire seasoned professionals and constantly expand our knowledge.&nbsp;The staff consists of Attorneys,&nbsp;CPAs, former IRS revenue officers, Tax Resolution Seniors, Tax Resolution Juniors, Tax Resolution Assistants, Tax Preparation staff and an outstanding support staff.&nbsp;Because of the vast knowledge of the staff, the firm is capable of solving tax issues arising from almost every imaginable scenario.&nbsp;&nbsp;It should be noted that we do not directly represent clients with criminal tax matters; however, through our relationship with criminal tax attorneys, we are able to assist in the defense.&nbsp;The vast majority of clients start out as tax resolution clients&nbsp;and remain clients for life.&nbsp;We strongly believe in a maintenance program to help to keep clients in compliance and out of trouble.&nbsp;Our strongest referral sources are other CPA firms, Accountants, Mortgage Brokers/Loan Officers, Realtors, Financial Advisors and Attorneys.&nbsp;We help these professionals solve tax and state issues for their clients, while always respecting the source of the referral.</p><p>Even though our firm has expanded across the nation, opened offices in 4 other states and become one of the largest and most successful firms in the industry, we still pride ourselves on the personalized service we offer each and every client.&nbsp;We have emerged as an industry leader for our resolution rates and customer satisfaction, yet we still think like a small firm.&nbsp;We still treat each and every client as if they are one of our first.&nbsp;Our goal is now and will always be, to ease the minds of our clients through regular contact and allowed them to sleep better at night, knowing that we are going to battle for them.</p><p>You can feel confident that our firm has the resources, depth, knowledge, personal attention to detail and dedication to successfully confront, challenge, and conquer any issues you may be facing from the IRS and State taxing authorities. We are happy to answer your questions on the telephone and look forward to meeting you in person.</p><p><a href=\"http://www.bbb.org/phoenix/business-reviews/accountants-certified-public/legacy-financial-tax-services-in-scottsdale-az-31003621\" target=\"_blank\">1) Better Business Bureau</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ripoffreport.com/\" target=\"_blank\">2) Rip Off Report</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.complaintsboard.com/\" target=\"_blank\">3) Complaints.com</a></p>',NULL,'2025-12-23','1',16,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 22:41:23','2025-12-23 22:41:23',NULL,NULL),(1279,'Who is Stephan?','who-is-stephan',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm&nbsp;<strong>Stephan H. Brewer, CTRS, JSM Tax, NTPI Fellow,</strong> Founder of&nbsp;<strong>Legacy Tax Resolution Services, LLC</strong>&nbsp;and a&nbsp;<strong>Certified Tax Resolution Specialist</strong>. After&nbsp;<strong>20 years in the U.S. Air Force</strong>&nbsp;as a highly decorated Command Controller, I transitioned into accounting and taxΓÇöbuilding and scaling a multi-office practice in the Phoenix metro area.</p><p>Over time, tax resolution became our primary focus because we saw firsthand how often clients walked in with avoidable IRS and state tax issues. I earned a&nbsp;<strong>MasterΓÇÖs Degree in Tax</strong>&nbsp;and pursued specialized industry training to deliver real solutionsΓÇönot guesswork.</p><p>Today, our firm is staffed with seasoned professionals, including&nbsp;<strong>CPAs, attorneys, former IRS revenue officers, and dedicated tax resolution specialists</strong>, allowing us to handle nearly any IRS or state tax scenario. We pride ourselves on&nbsp;<strong>personalized service, frequent communication, and results</strong>, so our clients can finally breathe again and sleep better at night.</p><p>When IΓÇÖm not fighting tax battles, IΓÇÖm spending time with family, traveling, or racing my off-road truck in the desertΓÇöbecause apparently I like high-stakes situations in&nbsp;<em>all</em>&nbsp;areas of life.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-27','1',16,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 22:52:09','2025-12-27 13:31:33',NULL,NULL),(1280,'Who do you help?','who-do-you-help',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We help individuals and business owners dealing with IRS or state tax problemsΓÇöespecially back taxes, notices, levies, garnishments, liens, and unfiled returns.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 22:56:07','2025-12-23 22:56:07',NULL,NULL),(1281,'What tax problems can you resolve?','what-tax-problems-can-you-resolve',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Common cases include&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">unpaid tax debt</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">unfiled returns</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">installment agreements (payment plans)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Offer in Compromise</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">penalty relief</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and help addressing&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">levies, liens, and wage garnishments</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 22:56:41','2025-12-23 22:56:41',NULL,NULL),(1282,'Do I have to talk to the IRS or the state agency myself?','do-i-have-to-talk-to-the-irs-or-the-state-agency-myself',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">NoΓÇöyour representative can communicate with the IRS/state on your behalf so youΓÇÖre not stuck doing the ΓÇ£hold music Olympics.ΓÇ¥</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 22:57:28','2025-12-23 22:57:28',NULL,NULL),(1283,'How fast can you stop a wage garnishment or levy?','how-fast-can-you-stop-a-wage-garnishment-or-levy',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In many situations, they focus on immediate action and note wage garnishments/levy issues can sometimes be stopped, avoided, or released quicklyΓÇöoften cited as&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">as fast as one day</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;in certain cases.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 22:58:39','2025-12-23 22:58:39',NULL,NULL),(1284,'Will an Offer in Compromise automatically stop a levy?','will-an-offer-in-compromise-automatically-stop-a-levy',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Not always. They explain that levy/collection activity isnΓÇÖt automatically paused in every situation, and eligibility matters.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 22:59:30','2025-12-23 22:59:30',NULL,NULL),(1285,'If my bank account is levied, is there a deadline to act?','if-my-bank-account-is-levied-is-there-a-deadline-to-act',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">YesΓÇöLegacyΓÇÖs IRS levy info notes banks generally hold funds for&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">21 days</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;after the levy date before sending them to the IRS, which is a critical window to respond.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 23:00:16','2025-12-23 23:00:16',NULL,NULL),(1286,'Who will be working on my case?','who-will-be-working-on-my-case',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Their location pages describe a team that includes&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CPAs, Enrolled Agents (EAs), and Attorneys</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;with experience resolving tax liabilities.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-23 23:01:24','2025-12-23 23:01:24',NULL,NULL),(1287,'HIC License','hic-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-26 12:55:13','2025-12-26 12:55:13',NULL,NULL),(1288,'Insurance','insurance-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-26 12:55:39','2025-12-26 12:55:39',NULL,NULL),(1289,'Our Core Values','our-core-values',NULL,'<h2>Our Core Values</h2><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Compassion:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Treat others the way you want to be treated.&nbsp;Strive for excellence without exception.&nbsp;Listen and remember, people donΓÇÖt care how much you know, until they know how much you care.</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Integrity:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Be truthful and authentic in the way you relate to others</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Directness</strong>:&nbsp;Give people the honest truth.&nbsp;This means that we are not always going to make the sale or be the popular one, but that is OK</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Trust:</strong>&nbsp;Trust is gained through transparency, empathy, and the communication of expectations.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Open and Honest Communication:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Create a culture that rewards and promotes honest communications.</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Appreciation:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Communicate with each other that we are building a company TOGETHER that will be the envy of the industry.</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Passion:&nbsp;</strong>Life is too short not to love what you do, why you do it, and who you do it with.&nbsp;If you are not passionate about what we do, you are in the wrong place.</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Transparent and Open Culture:</strong>&nbsp;Do not be afraid to make a mistake, and when you do, own it and take responsibility.</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Work to Make a Difference:</strong>&nbsp;Strive to change the industry through inspired ideas, adaptation, improved technology, and seeking new opportunities.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Personal Growth:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Always strive to grow personally by pursuing knowledge and personal insight.</li></ul><h2><br></h2>',NULL,'2025-12-26','1',19,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-26 21:30:32','2025-12-26 21:39:55',NULL,NULL),(1290,'My Calendar','my-calendar',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27','1',25,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27 13:36:58','2025-12-27 13:36:58',NULL,NULL),(1291,'My Calendar','my-calendar-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27','1',25,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27 13:43:58','2025-12-27 13:43:58',NULL,NULL),(1292,'My Calendar','my-calendar-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27','1',25,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27 18:18:00','2025-12-27 18:18:00',NULL,NULL),(1293,'My Calendar','my-calendar-4',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27','1',14,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-27 18:32:43','2025-12-27 18:32:43',NULL,NULL),(1294,'Invisible Advantage of vBiz Me','invisible-advantage-of-vbiz-me',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-29 23:45:58','2025-12-29 23:45:58',NULL,NULL),(1295,'Certified Tax Resolution Specialist (CTRS)','certified-tax-resolution-specialist-ctrs',NULL,'<p>Earning the Certified Tax Resolution Specialist designation is a commitment to excellence, continuous learning, and unparalleled service to your clients.</p><p>ItΓÇÖs a signal to your peers and clients that youΓÇÖve gone above and beyond, mastered the complexities of tax resolution, and stand ready to tackle even the most challenging cases with expertise and confidence.</p><h3><br></h3><h3><strong>Program Structure</strong></h3><p>The CTRS Program contains 15 individual courses that will build on what you learned in the Accelerator program. Each course contains several modules, with a short exam after each module followed by a final exam. Here are the courses take:</p><ol><li>Managing a Tax Resolution Practice</li><li>Accessing Information ΓÇô Transcripts &amp; PPS</li><li>POA &amp; 8821</li><li>IRS Notices</li><li>Offer in Compromise</li><li>Installment Agreements &amp; CNC</li><li>Non-Filers</li><li>Innocent Spouse</li><li>Liens, Levies, &amp; Alter Egos</li><li>Hearings &amp; Appeals</li><li>Statues of Limitations</li><li>Penalty Abatement</li><li>TAS &amp; Elevating Cases</li><li>Employment Taxes and TFRP</li><li>Audits &amp; Audit Reconsideration</li></ol><p><br></p><p>The full CTRS program is a total of <strong>20 hours of training</strong>. Once you complete all 15 courses and pass all exams, you will officially become a Certified Tax Resolution Specialist.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-31','1',11,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-31 16:10:57','2025-12-31 16:10:57',NULL,NULL),(1296,'Certified Public Accountant (Currently Inactive)','certified-public-accountant-currently-inactive',NULL,'<p>To become a licensed Certified Public Accountant (CPA), you must meet the education, examination, and experience requirements. All candidates must pass the Uniform CPA Examination ┬« (CPA Exam), which consists of three four-hour Core sections and one four-hour Discipline section of your choice. The Core sections are Auditing and Attestation (AUD), Financial Accounting and Reporting (FAR), and Taxation and Regulation (REG). The Discipline sections are Business Analysis and Reporting (BAR), Information Systems and Control (ISC), and Tax Compliance and Planning (TCP).</p>',NULL,'2025-12-31','1',11,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-31 16:13:00','2025-12-31 16:13:00',NULL,NULL),(1297,'NTPI Fellow','ntpi-fellow',NULL,'<p>NTPI Fellows have completed a stringent, three-level program of study that covers all facets of representing clients before the IRS. They have learned to guide their clients through the often challenging maze of IRS codes, internal regulations, and agency structure. Once enrolled in NTPI, attendees study a broad range of applicable topics, including:</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Communicating with the IRS</li><li>Assisting Non-Filers</li><li>Examination (introduction and advanced)</li><li>Appeals (introduction, exam appeals, collection appeals, and advanced appeals)</li><li>Tax Research and Resources</li><li>Collections</li><li>Criminal Investigation (introduction and advanced)</li><li>Form 1040 Audits</li><li>Innocent Spouse</li><li>Freedom of Information Act</li><li>Case Resolutions</li><li>Trust Fund Recovery Penalty</li><li>Liens and Levies</li><li>Correcting Bad Actions of Clients</li><li>Bankruptcy</li></ul><p><br></p><p>The process of becoming an NTPI Fellow often takes several years, but the learning doesnΓÇÖt stop there. As a whole, NTPI Fellows are individuals who exceed IRSΓÇÖ minimum standard for continuing education and are dedicated to staying on top of the latest changes to the tax code. Many Fellows participate annually in NTPIΓÇÖs Graduate Level courses in Representation because they donΓÇÖt want to miss a thing.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-31','1',11,156,177,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-31 16:14:49','2025-12-31 16:14:49',NULL,NULL),(1298,'What do you actually do?','what-do-you-actually-do',NULL,'<h3>ΓÿÇ∩╕Å We help homeowners and businesses&nbsp;<strong>inspect, troubleshoot, repair, and improve solar systems</strong>, and we offer resiliency equipment that supports stronger building performance and efficiency.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:34:54','2026-01-04 03:34:54',NULL,NULL),(1299,'Why would I need a solar inspection?','why-would-i-need-a-solar-inspection',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒöì Because solar systems can ΓÇ£look fineΓÇ¥ while quietly underperforming. An inspection helps identify&nbsp;<strong>output issues, failing components, or performance drops</strong>&nbsp;before they cost you real money.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:35:57','2026-01-04 03:35:57',NULL,NULL),(1300,'Do you service systems installed by another company?','do-you-service-systems-installed-by-another-company',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å Yes. If your original installer is hard to reach (or vanished into the solar sunset), we can step in to&nbsp;<strong>diagnose issues and handle repairs/service</strong>.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:39:38','2026-01-04 03:39:38',NULL,NULL),(1301,'Do you offer battery backup?','do-you-offer-battery-backup',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒöï Yes. Battery backup helps keep critical power running during outages and adds another layer of&nbsp;<strong>energy resiliency</strong>&nbsp;for your home or business.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:40:16','2026-01-04 03:40:16',NULL,NULL),(1302,'My solar production dropped ΓÇö whatΓÇÖs usually the cause?','my-solar-production-dropped-whats-usually-the-cause',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒôë Common causes include&nbsp;<strong>equipment faults, wiring issues, inverter problems, shading changes, or system performance degradation</strong>. We inspect, pinpoint the cause, and recommend the fix.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:41:09','2026-01-04 03:41:09',NULL,NULL),(1303,'What is ΓÇ£resiliency equipmentΓÇ¥?','what-is-resiliency-equipment',NULL,'<h3>ΓÜí ItΓÇÖs equipment designed to strengthen overall performance and reliability ΓÇö focused on areas like&nbsp;<strong>energy efficiency</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>water management</strong>, and&nbsp;<strong>air quality</strong>.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:41:59','2026-01-04 03:41:59',NULL,NULL),(1304,'WhatΓÇÖs the first step if I want to work with you?','whats-the-first-step-if-i-want-to-work-with-you',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒô₧ Start with a quick call/consultation. WeΓÇÖll ask a few questions, review your situation, and recommend the best next step (inspection, repair, upgrade, or equipment option).</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:42:43','2026-01-04 03:42:43',NULL,NULL),(1305,'Our Mission','our-mission-34',NULL,'<h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SPT Resiliency SystemsΓÇÖ mission is to help homeowners and businesses achieve reliable, efficient energy by servicing and optimizing solar systems and delivering practical resiliency equipment that strengthens long-term performance.</span></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 03:46:11','2026-01-04 03:46:11',NULL,NULL),(1306,'Click to Schedule a Meeting','click-to-schedule-a-meeting',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 15:45:30','2026-01-04 15:45:30',NULL,NULL),(1307,'Click to View My Availability','click-to-view-my-availability-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,94,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 21:14:03','2026-01-04 21:14:03',NULL,NULL),(1308,'Mila Zoho Calendar','mila-zoho-calendar',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,94,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-04 21:27:04','2026-01-04 21:27:04',NULL,NULL),(1314,'Paper Cards vs. vBiz Me vCard','paper-cards-vs-vbiz-me-vcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,94,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-05 02:23:33','2026-01-05 02:23:33',NULL,NULL),(1315,'Invisible Advantage of the vBiz Me vcard','anatomy-of-a-vbiz-me-vcard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,94,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-05 02:32:07','2026-01-05 02:35:34',NULL,NULL),(1316,'vBiz me Commercial w/ CEO','vbiz-me-commercial-w-ceo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,94,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-05 02:41:28','2026-01-05 02:41:28',NULL,NULL),(1318,'Who is Barry?','who-is-barry',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖm Barry DeHart. IΓÇÖve been detailing since&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1987</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and I still bring the same drive and pride to every vehicle. I donΓÇÖt act my age or look my age, and IΓÇÖm constantly searching for&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">great products</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;to get the best possible results. I put full effort into every job and deliver&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: