ong></p><p>How people-centered decisions drive performance, retention, and trust.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-03','1',6,1,179,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-09 03:10:10','2026-06-03 08:33:16',NULL,NULL),(1328,'Who Is Sonserae?','who-is-sonserae',NULL,'<p><strong>My journey has been built on determination, resilience, and an unwavering belief in purpose. Nothing was handed to meΓÇöI worked for every step, every lesson, and every breakthrough. Challenges didnΓÇÖt slow me down; they shaped me.</strong></p><p><strong>I believe growth comes from showing up consistently, doing the hard work, and staying aligned with values even when the road gets uncomfortable. Through discipline and vision, IΓÇÖve turned obstacles into momentum and purpose into progress.</strong></p><p><strong>I lead with intention, serve with integrity, and remain committed to creating pathways for others to rise. The work is never finishedΓÇöand thatΓÇÖs exactly what drives me.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,179,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-09 18:08:18','2026-01-09 18:08:18',NULL,NULL),(1329,'25 Years In ΓÇö Still Loving It','25-years-in-still-loving-it',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖve been in the car business for&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">25 years</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, with&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">20 years in management</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, helping customers and teams make smart, confident decisions. IΓÇÖm big on consistencyΓÇödoing the right thing, staying disciplined, and keeping the process smooth and straightforward. Outside of work, IΓÇÖm into fitness, I love life, and IΓÇÖm a proud father to&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">one son</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,181,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-10 00:26:15','2026-01-10 00:26:15',NULL,NULL),(1330,'Where are you located?','where-are-you-located-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">WeΓÇÖre