or anyone who likes refreshing protection regularly. A&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3-year option</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;is the sweet spot for solid durability without going all-in. And the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5-year coating</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;is for people who want maximum long-term protection and the least maintenance headaches.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,'2026-01-30','1',6,1,180,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-10 12:30:44','2026-01-30 19:48:03',NULL,NULL),(1355,'What is Conexi├│n Cafecito VIP?','what-is-conexion-cafecito-vip',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A VIP membership created for women who want more than networking ΓÇö real community, authentic support, ongoing education, and experiences that support both personal and professional growth.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,174,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-10 17:04:39','2026-01-10 17:04:39',NULL,NULL),(1356,'Who is this for?','who-is-this-for',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Who is this for?</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Women entrepreneurs in Connecticut who want to connect, build partnerships, and grow with a supportive network</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,174,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-10 17:05:12','2026-01-10 17:05:12',NULL,NULL),(1357,'Click Here to Join My Fica Tips Tax Credit Team','fica-tax-credit',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-10 18:28:44','2026-02-06 15:26:01',NULL,NULL),(1358,'What do I get as a VIP member?','what-do-i-get-as-a-vip-member',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Monthly Zoom meetups, an Instagram welcome feature, quarterly masterminds, a private WhatsApp group, priority access to events/vendor spots, and wellness-centered activities.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,174,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-10 22:56:57','2026-01-10 22:56:57',NULL,NULL),(1359,'Is it only online, or are there in-person events too?','is-it-only-online-or-are-t