family activity planning, business content creation, digital presence/marketing strategy, and event management, helping experiences and businesses shine in the real world and online.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,174,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-11 00:24:24','2026-01-23 01:24:42',NULL,NULL),(1368,'Don LaPlume Coaching','don-laplume-coaching',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-14 00:50:33','2026-01-14 00:50:33',NULL,NULL),(1369,'Do you provide the alcohol?','do-you-provide-the-alcohol',NULL,'<p>Laws vary by location, so clients typically provide the alcohol. WeΓÇÖre happy to guide you on quantities, selections, and shopping lists to make it easy.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:34:25','2026-01-17 19:34:25',NULL,NULL),(1370,'≡ƒÜÉ What does your mobile bar service include?','what-does-your-mobile-bar-service-include',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒÜÉ What does your mobile bar service include?</h3><p>Our service includes professional bartenders, bar tools, setup and breakdown, cocktail preparation, and a polished presentation. Add-ons like custom menus and garnish styling are available.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:34:44','2026-01-17 19:34:44',NULL,NULL),(1371,'≡ƒÄë What types of events do you service?','what-types-of-events-do-you-service',NULL,'<p>We specialize in weddings, private parties, corporate events, showers, birthdays, and special celebrations of all kinds.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:35:27','2026-01-17 19:35:27',NULL,NULL),(1372,'≡ƒì╣ Can you create custom cocktails?','can-you-create-custom-cocktails',NULL,'<p>Absolutely! We design signature cocktails tailored to your theme, preferences, and event vibe.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:36:00','2026-01-17 19:36:00',NULL,NULL),(1373,'≡ƒôì How far do you travel?','how-far-do-you-travel',NULL,'<p>We service local and surrounding areas. Travel fees may apply for events outside our standard service radius.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:36:33','2026-01-17 19:36:33',NULL,NULL),(1374,'≡ƒô¥ How do I book and secure my date?','how-do-i-book-and-secure-my-date',NULL,'<p>Booking is easy! A signed agreement and deposit secure your date. Early booking is recommended, especially for peak seasons.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:37:07','2026-01-17 19:37:07',NULL,NULL),(1375,'Why a Mobile Bartender Changes the Whole Party','why-a-mobile-bartender-changes-the-whole-party',NULL,'<h2>Why a Mobile Bartender Changes the Whole Party</h2><p>LetΓÇÖs be realΓÇöhosting is fun until it turns into work.</p><p>You plan the food, the music, the vibeΓÇª and then somehow youΓÇÖre also the bartender, the cleaner, the refiller, and the person who never gets to sit down. ThatΓÇÖs where a mobile bartending service comes in.</p><p>A mobile bartender isnΓÇÖt just someone who pours drinks. ItΓÇÖs a full experience that upgrades your event from ΓÇ£niceΓÇ¥ to ΓÇ£people wonΓÇÖt stop talking about this.ΓÇ¥</p><h3><strong>1) You Actually Get to Enjoy Your Own Event</strong></h3><p>Instead of worrying about who needs ice, whoΓÇÖs out of mixers, or whoΓÇÖs making drinks too strong (or too weak), you can relax and be present. ThatΓÇÖs the whole point of throwing a party.</p><h3><strong>2) Professional Drinks, Every Time</strong></h3><p>A great bartender knows how to balance flavors, keep service smooth, and make every guest feel taken care of. No random ΓÇ£kitchen sink cocktails.ΓÇ¥ Just clean, consistent, delicious pours.</p><h3><strong>3) It Creates a Built-In Social Hub</strong></h3><p>The bar becomes the heartbeat of the event. Guests mingle, laugh, connect, and the vibe stays alive. A good bartender keeps energy high and service flowingΓÇöwithout the chaos.</p><h3><strong>4) Custom Cocktails Make It Personal</strong></h3><p>Signature drinks are the secret weapon. We can create cocktails that match your theme, your colors, your personalityΓÇöanything from classy and elegant to fun and tropical. ItΓÇÖs a small detail that makes the whole event feel elevated.</p><h3><strong>5) Cleaner Setup, Less Stress</strong></h3><p>We show up ready. We set up. We serve. We break down. You get the ΓÇ£wowΓÇ¥ factor without the ΓÇ£what am I forgetting?ΓÇ¥ panic.</p><h3><strong>Ready to Bring the Bar to You?</strong></h3><p>If youΓÇÖre planning a wedding, private party, corporate event, or celebration, mobile bartending is the easiest way to level up the experienceΓÇöwithout adding stress to your plate.</p><p>Because every party deserves a perfect pour. ≡ƒì╕Γ£¿</p>',NULL,'2026-01-17','1',6,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:40:08','2026-01-17 20:13:11',NULL,NULL),(1376,'My Mission','my-mission-8',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission is to bring a seamless, stylish, and unforgettable bartending experience to every event by delivering exceptional service, expertly crafted cocktails, and a stress-free atmosphereΓÇöbecause every party deserves a perfect pour.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:41:38','2026-01-17 19:41:38',NULL,NULL),(1378,'Who is Shyleen','who-is-shyleen',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖm Shyleen, based in Central Connecticut. By day I work in government administration, and by night IΓÇÖm a lifelong learner and a behind-the-scenes event-planning pro. IΓÇÖm honest, kind, and strong-willed, and I genuinely love connecting with people, sharing stories, and creating unforgettable moments. My friends and family mean everything to me, and I cherish every laugh, toast, and memory we make together.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 19:48:02','2026-01-17 19:59:51',NULL,NULL),(1379,'Cert 1','cert-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 20:11:34','2026-01-17 20:11:34',NULL,NULL),(1380,'Cert 2','cert-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,184,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-17 22:44:06','2026-01-17 22:44:06',NULL,NULL),(1381,'Who is Kokutz','who-is-kokutz',NULL,'<p><strong>IΓÇÖm Leslie ΓÇ£KokutzΓÇ¥ Rochester, a barber since 1995. For me, barbering has always been bigger than a haircutΓÇöitΓÇÖs about taking care of the community and giving people a place to feel seen, respected, and uplifted. IΓÇÖm passionate about working with troubled youth and creating a calm, supportive experience for every client. IΓÇÖm also sensory certified, which means IΓÇÖm trained to better serve clients who may have sensory needs and prefer a more thoughtful, patient approach.</strong></p><p><strong>When IΓÇÖm not behind the chair, I run a small travel agency and IΓÇÖm usually planning my next trip. IΓÇÖm an avid world traveler, and I love connecting people to experiences that open their worldΓÇöwhether thatΓÇÖs through a fresh cut or a fresh passport stamp.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,185,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 02:48:31','2026-01-19 02:48:31',NULL,NULL),(1382,'Who is Joseph','who-is-joseph',NULL,'<p>My name is Joseph Downer, and IΓÇÖm the founder of JD&amp;K Trucking LLC, a trucking and logistics company. I began my entrepreneurial journey in&nbsp;<strong>May 2023</strong>&nbsp;after spending five years working as a truck driver. Along the way, I realized I wasnΓÇÖt just passionate about drivingΓÇöI was passionate about&nbsp;<strong>building</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>leading</strong>, and creating something of my own. That clarity pushed me to step forward and turn the dream into a real business.</p><p>IΓÇÖm also a proud family man, my wife, son, and my family keep me grounded, focused, and motivated to keep raising the bar every day.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,165,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:06:00','2026-02-05 01:47:03',NULL,NULL),(1383,'What areas do you service?','what-areas-do-you-service-2',NULL,'<p>We haul freight&nbsp;<strong>nationwide across the United States</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö local, regional, and coast-to-coast.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:43:51','2026-01-19 16:43:51',NULL,NULL),(1384,'What types of freight do you haul?','what-types-of-freight-do-you-haul',NULL,'<p>We handle&nbsp;<strong>general freight</strong>&nbsp;and common commercial loads. If you tell us what youΓÇÖre moving, weΓÇÖll confirm fit and requirements.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:44:57','2026-01-19 16:44:57',NULL,NULL),(1385,'How do I get a quote?','how-do-i-get-a-quote',NULL,'<p>Send the&nbsp;<strong>pickup + delivery locations, load details (weight, dimensions), desired date/time, and any special notes</strong>. WeΓÇÖll quote fast and clearly.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:45:34','2026-01-19 16:45:34',NULL,NULL),(1386,'Do you offer expedited or time-critical delivery?','do-you-offer-expedited-or-time-critical-delivery',NULL,'<p>Yes ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>expedited options are available</strong>&nbsp;depending on lane availability and scheduling.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:46:14','2026-01-19 16:46:14',NULL,NULL),(1387,'Can I get updates during transport?','can-i-get-updates-during-transport',NULL,'<p>Yes. YouΓÇÖll get&nbsp;<strong>real-time communication and ETA updates</strong>, so youΓÇÖre not left guessing.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:47:05','2026-01-19 16:47:05',NULL,NULL),(1388,'Are you insured and compliant?','are-you-insured-and-compliant',NULL,'<p>Yes ΓÇö we operate&nbsp;<strong>DOT-compliant</strong>&nbsp;and maintain the standard requirements expected for professional freight hauling.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:48:12','2026-01-19 16:48:12',NULL,NULL),(1389,'How far in advance should I book?','how-far-in-advance-should-i-book',NULL,'<p>As early as possible, but we can often handle&nbsp;<strong>short-notice loads</strong>&nbsp;depending on route and availability.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 16:49:17','2026-01-19 16:49:17',NULL,NULL),(1390,'Why Reliable Nationwide Trucking Matters (And Why ItΓÇÖs Harder Than People Think)','why-reliable-nationwide-trucking-matters-and-why-its-harder-than-people-think',NULL,'<p>Most people only notice trucking when something goes wrong: the shipmentΓÇÖs late, the timelineΓÇÖs blown, and now everybodyΓÇÖs stressed and pointing fingers. The truth is, moving freight across the United States isnΓÇÖt just ΓÇ£drive from A to B.ΓÇ¥ ItΓÇÖs coordination, timing, communication, and doing the job right when conditions change in real time.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>JD &amp; K Trucking LLC</strong>, my focus is simple:&nbsp;<strong>dependable nationwide hauling with clear communication</strong>. Whether itΓÇÖs a one-time load or consistent lanes, shippers need a carrier who treats their freight like it mattersΓÇöbecause it does. Every delivery impacts deadlines, labor schedules, customer expectations, and profits.</p><p>What separates a solid carrier from a headache isnΓÇÖt talk ΓÇö itΓÇÖs execution:</p><ul><li><strong>On-time pickup and delivery</strong></li><li><strong>Honest ETAs and updates</strong></li><li><strong>Professional load handling</strong></li><li><strong>No excuses, just solutions</strong></li></ul><p>If youΓÇÖre looking for a trucking partner that runs freight across the U.S. with a straightforward, reliable approach,&nbsp;<strong>JD &amp; K Trucking LLC</strong>&nbsp;is ready to move.</p>',NULL,'2026-01-19','1',6,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 17:14:31','2026-01-19 17:15:55',NULL,NULL),(1391,'Our Forever Mission','our-forever-mission',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission at&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">JD &amp; K Trucking LLC</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;is to deliver freight&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">safely, on time, and with complete professionalism</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇönationwide. WeΓÇÖre committed to dependable service, clear communication, and treating every load like it directly impacts your business, because it does.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,186,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-19 17:41:45','2026-01-19 17:41: