NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,187,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-23 18:39:42','2026-01-23 18:39:42',NULL,NULL),(1424,'Do you have makeup help tooΓÇölike shade matching?','do-you-have-makeup-help-too-like-shade-matching',NULL,'<p>Yes. Send me a selfie in natural light and tell me what coverage you like (light/medium/full) and IΓÇÖll help you choose shades and products.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,187,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-23 18:40:18','2026-01-23 18:40:18',NULL,NULL),(1425,'WhatΓÇÖs the best way to save money with Farmasi?','whats-the-best-way-to-save-money-with-farmasi',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The best savings usually comes from becoming a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Preferred Customer</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. Ask me and IΓÇÖll tell you if it makes sense for how often you shop.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,187,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-23 18:40:46','2026-01-23 18:40:46',NULL,NULL),(1426,'Can I earn income with Farmasi too?','can-i-earn-income-with-farmasi-too',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. If youΓÇÖre curious, I can explain the basics and show you how people earn through sharing products and building a customer baseΓÇöno pressure, just info.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,187,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-23 18:42:22','2026-01-23 18:42:22',NULL,NULL),(1427,'My Mission','who-is-brenda',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help you feel confident in your skin by making beauty and wellness simple, affordable, and personalized. I guide you to the right Farmasi products for your goals, so youΓÇÖre not wasting money guessingΓÇöjust getting results, feeling good, and showing up as your best self every day.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,187,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-23 19:50:02','2026-01-23 19:57:26',NULL,NULL),(1428,'Stop Guessing ΓÇö Build a Simple Routine That Works','stop-guessing-build-a-simple-routine-that-works',NULL,'<p>LetΓÇÖs be real: most people donΓÇÖt need more productsΓÇª they need a plan. If your bathroom looks like a mini Sephora but your skin still isnΓÇÖt acting right, itΓÇÖs because everything is random. Random products = random results.</p><p>HereΓÇÖs the simple routine I recommend to start with:</p><p><strong>1) Cleanse (AM + PM)</strong></p><p>Your cleanser sets the stage. You want ΓÇ£cleanΓÇ¥ ΓÇö not ΓÇ£tight, dry, and mad at you.ΓÇ¥ A good cleanser removes buildup without stripping your skin.</p><p><strong>2) Treat (Pick ONE goal)</strong></p><p>This is where people mess up: they try to fix everything at once. Choose one focus:</p><ul><li>Glow / dark spots</li><li>Hydration</li><li>Texture / pores</li><li>Fine lines</li><li>Then stay consistent long enough to see results.</li></ul><p><strong>3) Moisturize (Always)</strong></p><p>Even oily skin needs moisture. When you skip this step, your skin often gets worseΓÇönot better.</p><p><strong>Bonus:</strong>&nbsp;Sunscreen in the morning (non-negotiable if youΓÇÖre working on glow and dark spots).</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,187,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-23 19:51:40','2026-01-23 19:51:40',NULL,NULL),(1429,'Who is Brenda?','who-is-brenda-2',NULL,'<p> IΓÇÖm&nbsp;<strong>Brenda Davila</strong>ΓÇöa beauty influencer and entrepreneur passionate about&nbsp;<strong>faith, confidence, and helping women build income with purpose</strong>.</p><p>To me, beauty is more than products. ItΓÇÖs&nbsp;<strong>empowerment</strong>. ItΓÇÖs&nbsp;<strong>growth</strong>. ItΓÇÖs learning how to show up as your best selfΓÇöinside and outΓÇöand&nbsp;<strong>walking boldly in your calling</strong>.</p><p>Through beauty, community, and mentorship, I help women boost their confidence, elevate their routines, andΓÇöif they want itΓÇölearn how to create real income in a way that aligns with their values. My goal is simple:&nbsp;<strong>help you feel confident, supported, and capable of more.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,187,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-23 19:56:48','2026-01-23 19:56:48',NULL,NULL),(1430,'CLICK PHOTO','farmasinergy',NULL,