Travel Bee and fly on your own, your journey starts here. ItΓÇÖs time to embark, explore, and transform the way you experience travel.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,188,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-26 21:05:02','2026-01-26 21:05:02',NULL,NULL),(1451,'How do I place an order?','how-do-i-place-an-order-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Use my shop link on this card, add items to your cart, and check out like normal. If you want help first, message me what youΓÇÖre looking for and IΓÇÖll guide you.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 00:39:35','2026-01-27 00:39:35',NULL,NULL),(1452,'I donΓÇÖt know what to buy ΓÇö can you recommend products for me?','i-dont-know-what-to-buy-can-you-recommend-products-for-me',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Tell me your&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">skin type</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(dry/oily/combo/sensitive) and your&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">goal</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(acne, glow, dark spots, fine lines, etc.), plus your budget, and IΓÇÖll suggest a simple routine.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 00:40:06','2026-01-27 00:40:06',NULL,NULL),(1453,'How long does shipping take?','how-long-does-shipping-take',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Shipping times can vary based on location and volume. After you order, I can help you track it and make sure everything looks right.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 00:40:32','2026-01-27 00:40:32',NULL,NULL),(1454,'What if something arrives damaged or I donΓÇÖt love it?','what-if-something-arrives-damaged-or-i-dont-love-it',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Message me right away. IΓÇÖll help you follow FarmasiΓÇÖs return/exchange process and get it handled the right way.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 00:40:57','2026-01-27 00:40:57',NULL,NULL),(1455,'Are the products safe for sensitive skin?','are-the-products-safe-for-sensitive-skin',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Many options work well for sensitive skin, but everyoneΓÇÖs skin is different. If you tell me your sensitivities/allergies, IΓÇÖll point you toward gentler choices and what to avoid.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 00:41:27','2026-01-27 00:41:27',NULL,NULL),(1456,'Can I join Farmasi or get a discount as a customer?','can-i-join-farmasi-or-get-a-discount-as-a-customer',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. There are options for&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">customer perks/discounts</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;and for those who want to&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">build income</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;as an influencer/IBO. Ask me ΓÇ£Which one fits me?ΓÇ¥ and IΓÇÖll explain both simply.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 00:42:07','2026-01-27 00:42:07',NULL,NULL),(1457,'Stop Guessing ΓÇö Build a Routine That Actually Works','stop-guessing-build-a-routine-that-actually-works',NULL,'<p>If your bathroom looks like a skincare museum, youΓÇÖre not alone. Most people arenΓÇÖt inconsistentΓÇª theyΓÇÖre just using random products that donΓÇÖt match their skin.</p><p>HereΓÇÖs the simple way to get results without wasting money:</p><h3>1) Start with ONE goal</h3><p>Pick one:&nbsp;<strong>acne</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>dark spots</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>dryness</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>texture</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>glow</strong>, or&nbsp;<strong>fine lines</strong>. One goal = clear plan.</p><h3>2) Know your skin type</h3><p><strong>Dry</strong>&nbsp;(tight/flaky),&nbsp;<strong>Oily</strong>&nbsp;(shiny by midday),&nbsp;<strong>Combination</strong>&nbsp;(oily T-zone + dry cheeks), or&nbsp;<strong>Sensitive</strong>&nbsp;(red/irritated easily). Your skin type decides what you should&nbsp;<em>avoid</em>.</p><h3>3) Build a basic routine (AM + PM)</h3><p>You only need the core steps:</p><ul><li><strong>Cleanser</strong></li><li><strong>Treatment</strong>&nbsp;(target your goal)</li><li><strong>Moisturizer</strong></li><li><strong>SPF in the morning</strong>&nbsp;(non-negotiable)</li></ul><h3>4) DonΓÇÖt switch products every 3 days</h3><p>Give your routine&nbsp;<strong>2ΓÇô4 weeks</strong>&nbsp;before you judge it. Consistency beats ΓÇ£new product excitementΓÇ¥ every time.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-01','1',6,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 00:47:29','2026-02-02 00:40:37',NULL,NULL),(1458,'Our Mission','our-mission-38',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help people feel confident in their own skin by making beauty and wellness simple, affordable, and personalizedΓÇöthrough honest guidance, quality products, and real support.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 01:12:15','2026-01-27 01:12:15',NULL,NULL),(1459,'What do you actually do?','what-do-you-actually-do-2',NULL,'<h3>ΓÿÇ∩╕Å We help homeowners and businesses&nbsp;<strong>inspect, troubleshoot, repair, and improve solar systems</strong>, and we offer resiliency equipment that supports stronger building performance and efficiency.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1460,'Why would I need a solar inspection?','why-would-i-need-a-solar-inspection-2',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒöì Because solar systems can ΓÇ£look fineΓÇ¥ while quietly underperforming. An inspection helps identify&nbsp;<strong>output issues, failing components, or performance drops</strong>&nbsp;before they cost you real money.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1461,'Do you service systems installed by another company?','do-you-service-systems-installed-by-another-company-2',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å Yes. If your original installer is hard to reach (or vanished into the solar sunset), we can step in to&nbsp;<strong>diagnose issues and handle repairs/service</strong>.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1462,'Do you offer battery backup?','do-you-offer-battery-backup-2',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒöï Yes. Battery backup helps keep critical power running during outages and adds another layer of&nbsp;<strong>energy resiliency</strong>&nbsp;for your home or business.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1463,'My solar production dropped ΓÇö whatΓÇÖs usually the cause?','my-solar-production-dropped-whats-usually-the-cause-2',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒôë Common causes include&nbsp;<strong>equipment faults, wiring issues, inverter problems, shading changes, or system performance degradation</strong>. We inspect, pinpoint the cause, and recommend the fix.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1464,'What is ΓÇ£resiliency equipmentΓÇ¥?','what-is-resiliency-equipment-2',NULL,'<h3>ΓÜí ItΓÇÖs equipment designed to strengthen overall performance and reliability ΓÇö focused on areas like&nbsp;<strong>energy efficiency</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>water management</strong>, and&nbsp;<strong>air quality</strong>.</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1465,'WhatΓÇÖs the first step if I want to work with you?','whats-the-first-step-if-i-want-to-work-with-you-2',NULL,'<h3>≡ƒô₧ Start with a quick call/consultation. WeΓÇÖll ask a few questions, review your situation, and recommend the best next step (inspection, repair, upgrade, or equipment option).</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1466,'Our Mission','our-mission-39',NULL,'<h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SPT Resiliency SystemsΓÇÖ mission is to help homeowners and businesses achieve reliable, efficient energy by servicing and optimizing solar systems and delivering practical resiliency equipment that strengthens long-term performance.</span></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1467,'Click to Schedule a Meeting','click-to-schedule-a-meeting-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1468,'Don LaPlume Coaching','don-laplume-coaching-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1469,'SPT Resiliency Products Link 1','spt-resiliency-products-link-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',30,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1470,'Oncore Solar','oncore-solar-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',29,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 10:52:10','2026-01-27 10:52:10',NULL,NULL),(1471,'Who is Lisa?','who-is-lisa',NULL,'<p><br></p><p>IΓÇÖm a wife, mother, and grandmother firstΓÇöand caring for people has always been at the center of my life. That same purpose has guided my 26-year career in victim services, mental health, and community advocacy.</p><p>I hold an M.S. in Community Counseling from the University of Bridgeport, and IΓÇÖm a Certified Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault Counselor and Mental Health Therapist. In my role as a Victim Advocate with the State of ConnecticutΓÇÖs Office of Victim Services, I help victims and their families navigate the court and parole process with compassion, clarity, and steady support.</p><p>I also support women outside of my formal work by helping facilitate an emotional support group where women can be heard, encouraged, and reminded theyΓÇÖre not alone. IΓÇÖm the Founder, CEO, and Chairwoman of Sistahs In Spirit, and I recently became a certified interdisciplinary doula to support women and families in an even more holistic way.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 16:55:13','2026-01-27 16:55:13',NULL,NULL),(1472,'Be Empowered Join Us','be-empowered-join-us',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27 17:04:09','2026-01-27 17:04:09',NULL,NULL),(1474,'vBiz Me Phone Commercial','vbiz-me-phone-commercial',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,91,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 02:20:41','2026-01-28 02:20:41',NULL,NULL),(1475,'Rock Slide','rock-slide',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,188,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 02:30:15','2026-01-28 02:30:15',NULL,NULL),(1476,'Madison Hotel','madison-hotel',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,188,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 02:34:47','2026-01-28 02:34:47',NULL,NULL),(1477,'The Flight','the-flight',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,188,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 02:37:53','2026-01-28 02:37:53',NULL,NULL),(1479,'Room Tour','tour-of-room',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-27','1',27,1,188,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 03:19:00','2026-01-29 18:10:54',NULL,NULL),(1480,'Balanced Glow Life Essentials','balance-glow-life-essentials',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,189,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 18:58:13','2026-01-28 19:09:53',NULL,NULL),(1481,'You DonΓÇÖt Have to Carry It Alone','you-dont-have-to-carry-it-alone',NULL,'<p>ThereΓÇÖs something powerful that happens when women stop pretending theyΓÇÖre ΓÇ£fineΓÇ¥ and finally get to be real.</p><p>Life comes fast. Responsibilities stack up. YouΓÇÖre showing up as a wife, a mother, a grandmother, a sister, a friend, an employee, a business ownerΓÇösometimes all in the same day. And somehow, youΓÇÖre still expected to keep it together, stay quiet, and smile through it.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Sistahs In Spirit</strong>, weΓÇÖre saying this out loud:&nbsp;<strong>you donΓÇÖt have to carry everything by yourself.</strong></p><h3><strong>Sisterhood IsnΓÇÖt a Trend ΓÇö ItΓÇÖs a Lifeline</strong></h3><p>Sistahs In Spirit was created for women who need a safe space to breathe, reset, and be supportedΓÇöwithout judgment, without gossip, and without having to explain why youΓÇÖre tired. We believe healing happens faster when youΓÇÖre surrounded by women who&nbsp;<em>get it</em>.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs why we build real connection through:</p><ul><li>emotional support circles</li><li>uplifting conversations and encouragement</li><li>community fellowship and social outings</li><li>quarterly gatherings that strengthen the village</li></ul><h3>A Place Where Your Voice Matters</h3><p>Some women come in carrying grief. Some carry anxiety. Some carry trauma. Some carry the weight of being the ΓÇ£strong oneΓÇ¥ for everyone else. Here, you donΓÇÖt have to prove anything. You donΓÇÖt have to perform strength. You can justΓÇª show up.</p><p>We listen. We support. We remind you who you are.</p><h3>Our Mission: Keep the Circle Strong</h3><p>Our foundation is simple:&nbsp;<strong>ΓÇ£I am my sisterΓÇÖs keeper.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p>Not in words onlyΓÇöthrough action, consistency, and community. WeΓÇÖre building a circle where women feel seen, loved, and empowered. A circle that helps you rise when life tries to pull you down.</p><h3>Come Join the Sisterhood</h3><p>If youΓÇÖve been craving deeper connections, genuine support, and a community that feels like homeΓÇö<strong>this is your invitation.</strong></p><p>You belong here. And weΓÇÖve been saving a seat for you.</p><p><strong>Join Sistahs In Spirit.</strong></p><p>Because healing feels different when youΓÇÖre surrounded by Sistahs.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-01-28','1',6,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 20:17:50','2026-02-02 23:18:26',NULL,NULL),(1482,'Our Mission','our-mission-40',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sistahs In Spirit exists to create a safe, supportive sisterhood where women are encouraged, empowered, and emotionally supported through every season of life. We foster healing, connection, and growth through community, fellowship, and meaningful gatheringsΓÇöreminding every woman that she is seen, she is valued, and she never has to walk alone.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 20:24:31','2026-01-28 20:24:31',NULL,NULL),(1483,'Makeup','makeup',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,189,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-28 20:59:06','2026-01-28 20:59:06',NULL,NULL),(1484,'What do you need from me to start?','w