NULL,'1',13,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 01:36:01','2026-01-30 01:36:01',NULL,NULL),(1500,'┬┐Pueden ayudarme con formularios de inmigraci├│n?','pueden-ayudarme-con-formularios-de-inmigracion',NULL,'<p>S├¡, como apoyo&nbsp;<strong>clerical/administrativo</strong>&nbsp;para completar formularios seg├║n USCIS.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 01:36:37','2026-01-30 01:36:37',NULL,NULL),(1501,'┬┐Dan asesor├¡a legal de inmigraci├│n o me representan?','dan-asesoria-legal-de-inmigracion-o-me-representan',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. No somos bufete y no damos asesor├¡a legal ni representaci├│n.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 01:37:13','2026-01-30 01:37:13',NULL,NULL),(1502,'┬┐Hacen apostillas/legalizaciones para documentos internacionales?','hacen-apostillaslegalizaciones-para-documentos-internacionales',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">S├¡, gestionamos preparaci├│n para validez en el extranjero.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 01:37:52','2026-01-30 01:37:52',NULL,NULL),(1503,'┬┐Tambi├⌐n ayudan a formar una LLC o Corporation?','tambien-ayudan-a-formar-una-llc-o-corporation',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">S├¡: documentos, registro y EIN para comenzar correctamente.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 01:38:31','2026-01-30 01:38:31',NULL,NULL),(1504,'5 Errores Caros en Tr├ímites y Documentos (Y C├│mo Evitarlos Antes de Perder Tiempo y Dinero)','5-errores-caros-en-tramites-y-documentos-y-como-evitarlos-antes-de-perder-tiempo-y-dinero',NULL,'<h3><br></h3><p>La mayor├¡a de los problemas con tr├ímites no son ΓÇ£mala suerteΓÇ¥ΓÇöson errores evitables. Aqu├¡ van 5 de los m├ís comunes y c├│mo solucionarlos r├ípido.</p><p><br></p><p>Seamos claros: los tr├ímites tienen una sola misi├│nΓÇª&nbsp;<strong>salir aprobados</strong>.</p><p>Pero a veces parece que tienen otra misi├│n secreta:&nbsp;<strong>rebotar por el detalle m├ís peque├▒o</strong>.</p><p>Si alguna vez te dijeron ΓÇ£falta algoΓÇ¥, ΓÇ£hay que corregirloΓÇ¥ o ΓÇ£vuelva otro d├¡aΓÇ¥, sabes exactamente de lo que hablo. La buena noticia es que la mayor├¡a de estos problemas se pueden evitar si sabes d├│nde se comete el error.</p><p>Aqu├¡ tienes&nbsp;<strong>5 errores caros</strong>&nbsp;que la gente comete todo el tiempo ΓÇö y c├│mo evitarlos desde el principio.</p><p><br></p><h3>1) Usar la versi├│n equivocada del formulario</h3><p>Los formularios cambian. Las reglas cambian. Y nadie te manda un aviso bonito por correo.</p><p><strong>C├│mo evitarlo:</strong></p><p>Antes de llenar cualquier documento, aseg├║rate de usar la versi├│n actualizada y sus instrucciones (especialmente en inmigraci├│n, tr├ímites estatales y solicitudes oficiales). Si no est├ís seguro, no adivines. Adivinar es la receta perfecta para atrasos.</p><h3>2) Traducciones ΓÇ£m├ís o menosΓÇ¥ (y eso sale caro)</h3><p>ΓÇ£Casi igualΓÇ¥ no sirve cuando hablamos de nombres, fechas, t├⌐rminos oficiales y formatos.</p><p><strong>C├│mo evitarlo:</strong></p><p>Aseg├║rate de que la traducci├│n sea clara, precisa y que refleje exactamente la informaci├│n del documento original. Un detalle mal traducido puede causar retrasos o rechazo.</p><h3>3) No notarizar cuando s├¡ es requisito</h3><p>Hay documentos que pasan sin notar├¡aΓÇª y otros que sin notar├¡a&nbsp;<strong>no valen nada</strong>.</p><p><strong>C├│mo evitarlo:</strong></p><p>Pregunta desde el inicio:&nbsp;<strong>┬┐Este documento requiere notarizaci├│n?</strong></p><p>Si la respuesta es s├¡, hazlo correctamente para evitar que te lo devuelvan.</p><h3>4) ΓÇ£Peque├▒osΓÇ¥ detalles que detienen todo</h3><p>Una firma faltante. Una fecha incorrecta. Un campo vac├¡o. Un apellido escrito diferente al de tu identificaci├│n.</p><p><strong>C├│mo evitarlo:</strong></p><p>Antes de enviar cualquier tr├ímite, haz un ΓÇ£chequeo r├ípidoΓÇ¥:</p><ul><li>El nombre coincide exactamente con tu ID</li><li>Las fechas son correctas y consistentes</li><li>No dejaste campos requeridos en blanco</li><li>Las firmas est├ín donde deben estar</li><li>Incluiste anexos/documentos requeridos</li></ul><h3>5) Mezclar papeles personales y de negocio como si fuera lo mismo</h3><p>Si tienes negocio, tus tr├ímites y tu contabilidad necesitan estructura. Impuestos, payroll, QuickBooks, EIN, formaci├│n de empresaΓÇª si todo est├í revuelto, despu├⌐s vienen los dolores de cabeza (y los costos).</p><p>Γ£à&nbsp;<strong>C├│mo evitarlo:</strong></p><p>Organiza tus documentos desde el principio y trabaja con un proceso claro, especialmente en temporada de impuestos.</p><h2>Conclusi├│n</h2><p>Los tr├ímites no tienen que ser un caos. Solo necesitan estar&nbsp;<strong>bien preparados</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>completos</strong>&nbsp;y&nbsp;<strong>presentados correctamente</strong>&nbsp;desde la primera vez.</p><p>En&nbsp;<strong>Rios Lema Global Services LLC</strong>&nbsp;te apoyamos con servicios como:</p><p>≡ƒûï∩╕Å Notar├¡a ΓÇó ≡ƒô¥ Traducciones ΓÇó ≡ƒÆ╝ Impuestos personales y corporativos ΓÇó ≡ƒôä Preparaci├│n de documentos y cartas ΓÇó ≡ƒîì Apostilla y legalizaci├│n ΓÇó ≡ƒº╛ Preparaci├│n clerical de formularios ΓÇó ≡ƒÄô Student Visa Support ΓÇó ≡ƒÅó Formaci├│n de negocio (LLC/Corporation + EIN) ΓÇó ≡ƒÆì Wedding Officiant</p><p><strong>Hazlo bien a la primera ΓÇö y sigue con tu vida sin atrasos.</strong></p>',NULL,'2026-01-30','1',6,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 10:48:49','2026-01-30 10:48:49',NULL,NULL),(1505,'Nuestra Miss├¼on','nuestra-mission',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">En&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rios Lema Global Services LLC</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, nuestra misi├│n es brindar servicios confiables, precisos y biling├╝es en&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">notar├¡a, impuestos, traducciones y preparaci├│n de documentos</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, ofreciendo una experiencia clara, r├ípida y humana. Nos comprometemos a proteger la confidencialidad de cada cliente y a entregar soluciones bien hechas desde la primera vez, para que cada persona y negocio avance con tranquilidad y seguridad.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 10:50:55','2026-01-30 10:50:55',NULL,NULL),(1507,'Acerca De Mi','acerca-de-mi',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SOMOS RIOS LEMA GLOBAL SERVICES, SOMOS ABOGADOS EN EL ECUADOR, QUE QUEREMOS SERVIR A LA COMUNIDAD LATINA EN MERIDEN CT Y SUS ALREDEDORES, NUESTRA VOCACION HA SIDO Y SERA SERVIR A LA GENTE.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-30 12:26:55','2026-01-30 12:26:55',NULL,NULL),(1508,'Currency Converter','currency-converter-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-31 11:20:32','2026-01-31 11:20:32',NULL,NULL),(1509,'FLIGHT TRACKER','flight-tracker-2',NULL,'<p>Track Yours or Your Loved Ones Flight</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-31 11:22:40','2026-01-31 11:22:40',NULL,NULL),(1510,'WORLD CLOCK','world-clock-2',NULL,'<p>Click to See the Time Difference</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-31 11:24:43','2026-01-31 11:24:43',NULL,NULL),(1511,'THE BIG PICTURE','the-big-picture',NULL,'<p>Sharing the Vision</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-31 12:21:26','2026-01-31 12:21:26',NULL,NULL),(1512,'Travel Cert','travel-cert',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,159,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-31 12:23:39','2026-01-31 12:23:39',NULL,NULL),(1514,'Who is Julia Chacon','who-is-julia-chacon',NULL,'<p>I am a busy working woman and wife and grandma who decided to start building something of my own on the side. I run a Farmasi wellness &amp; beauty business, I am a beauty influencer, where I focus on self-care, confidence, and helping women feel good from the inside out even on my busiest days.</p><p><br></p><p>What I love most is connecting with women who are juggling life, work, and dreams just like me. I truly believe self-care isnΓÇÖt selfish itΓÇÖs necessary.</p><p><br></p><p>IΓÇÖm here to support, learn, and grow together. If youΓÇÖre building a business, thinking about starting one, or just need encouragement, IΓÇÖd love to connect ≡ƒñì</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-01 17:57:27','2026-02-01 17:57:27',NULL,NULL),(1516,'Click Image to Register','click-image-to-register-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-09','1',17,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-02 00:37:27','2026-02-02 00:40:08',NULL,NULL),(1517,'Click Here to Join','click-here-to-join',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,190,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-02 00:56:22','2026-02-02 00:56:22',NULL,NULL),(1518,'Educaci├│n Financiera','educacion-financiera',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-02 01:58:24','2026-02-02 01:58:24',NULL,NULL),(1519,'Education Financeria','education-financeria',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-02 01:59:43','2026-02-02 01:59:43',NULL,NULL),(1520,'Educaci├│n Financiera','educacion-financiera-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-02 02:06:39','2026-02-02 02:06:39',NULL,NULL),(1521,'Educaci├│n Financiera','educacion-financiera-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,182,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-02 02:07:50','2026-02-02 02:07:50',NULL,NULL),(1522,'Protection That Pays','protection-that-pays',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:13:12','2026-02-03 00:13:12',NULL,NULL),(1523,'Who Is Walter?','who-is-walter',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I didnΓÇÖt grow up being taught how money really works. I had to learn it the hard wayΓÇöthrough experience, education, and a lot of trial and error. Now I help others get clarity, build confidence, and take control of their financial future. IΓÇÖm a proud father of a son and a daughter, and family is my why. I believe financial stability isnΓÇÖt just about moneyΓÇöitΓÇÖs about peace at home.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:23:38','2026-02-03 01:59:25',NULL,NULL),(1524,'Click Here to Increase Your Wealth','click-here-to-increase-your-wealth',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:27:13','2026-02-03 00:27:13',NULL,NULL),(1525,'Click Image to Attend','click-image-to-attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-14','1',17,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:31:22','2026-02-03 00:56:38',NULL,NULL),(1526,'What do you actually help with?','what-do-you-actually-help-with',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Credit education, identity protection/monitoring tools, and financial organization support ΓÇö based on what you need most.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:35:17','2026-02-03 00:35:17',NULL,NULL),(1527,'Is this credit repair?','is-this-credit-repair',NULL,'<p>I donΓÇÖt promise specific score increases. I focus on education, tools, and guidance to help you take the right steps.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:35:57','2026-02-03 00:35:57',NULL,NULL),(1528,'How fast does it work?','how-fast-does-it-work',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Depends on your starting point and what youΓÇÖre trying to accomplish. Some benefits are immediate (like monitoring), while credit-building is a process.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:36:47','2026-02-03 00:36:47',NULL,NULL),(1529,'Do I have to meet in person?','do-i-have-to-meet-in-person',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No ΓÇö we can handle everything by phone/video.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:37:36','2026-02-03 00:37:36',NULL,NULL),(1530,'What do I need to get started?','what-do-i-need-to-get-started',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Basic contact info and a quick understanding of your goals (credit, protection, organization, etc.).</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:38:57','2026-02-03 00:38:57',NULL,NULL),(1531,'Can I cancel if itΓÇÖs not for me?','can-i-cancel-if-its-not-for-me',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes ΓÇö IΓÇÖll explain the cancel/refund rules before you enroll so there are no surprises.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:39:42','2026-02-03 00:39:42',NULL,NULL),(1532,'My Mission','my-mission-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help families build long-term financial stability by protecting what matters, strengthening credit, and replacing stress with structure, confidence, and a clear path forward.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:47:32','2026-02-03 00:47:32',NULL,NULL),(1533,'Walter cert 1','walter-cert-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 00:58:42','2026-02-03 00:58:42',NULL,NULL),(1534,'The 3 Things You Must Get Right With Money (Before You Do Anything Fancy)','the-3-things-you-must-get-right-with-money-before-you-do-anything-fancy',NULL,'<p><strong>Most people donΓÇÖt need a new hustle.</strong></p><p><strong>They donΓÇÖt need a crypto lecture.</strong></p><p><strong><u>They donΓÇÖt need ΓÇ£manifesting abundanceΓÇ¥ with a vision board and a candle.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>They need&nbsp;<strong>three basics handled</strong>:</p><ol><li><strong>Credit clarity</strong>&nbsp;(know what your credit is really saying about you)</li><li><strong>Identity protection</strong>&nbsp;(because fraud is not a ΓÇ£maybe,ΓÇ¥ itΓÇÖs a ΓÇ£whenΓÇ¥)</li><li><strong>A simple system</strong>&nbsp;(so your money stops disappearing like itΓÇÖs got legs)</li></ol><p>LetΓÇÖs break it down in a way that doesnΓÇÖt feel like homework.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>1) Credit Clarity: Stop Guessing</strong></h3><p>If youΓÇÖre trying to rent an apartment, buy a car, get a mortgage, start a business, or even get certain jobsΓÇª your credit isnΓÇÖt just a number ΓÇö itΓÇÖs a&nbsp;<strong>gatekeeper</strong>.</p><p><strong>What to do first:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Know whatΓÇÖs on your reports</strong>&nbsp;(not what you&nbsp;<em>think</em>&nbsp;is on them)</li><li>Look for:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">wrong addresses or names</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">accounts that arenΓÇÖt yours</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">late payments you donΓÇÖt recognize</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">duplicates (same debt showing twice)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">old items that shouldΓÇÖve fallen off</li><li>If you find errors, you donΓÇÖt ignore them ΓÇö you&nbsp;<strong>address them properly</strong>.</li></ul><p><strong>Big truth:</strong>&nbsp;Credit progress isnΓÇÖt magic. ItΓÇÖs accuracy + time + consistency.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒöÉ 2) Identity Protection: Catch Problems Early</strong></h3><p>Identity theft is one of those things people donΓÇÖt take seriouslyΓÇª until it becomes their full-time job.</p><p><strong>A simple rule:</strong></p><p>If you donΓÇÖt have monitoring/alerts in place, youΓÇÖre basically driving at night with the headlights off and hoping for the best.</p><p><strong>What protection helps you do:</strong></p><ul><li>spot suspicious activity earlier</li><li>reduce damage if something happens</li><li>stop problems from quietly building for months</li></ul><p>Because when fraud hits, itΓÇÖs rarely just one thing. ItΓÇÖs a domino party ΓÇö and nobody invited you.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒºá 3) A Simple Money System: Make Your Money Behave</strong></h3><p>Most financial stress is not from income ΓÇö itΓÇÖs from&nbsp;<strong>lack of structure</strong>.</p><p>You donΓÇÖt need a 19-tab spreadsheet. You need something youΓÇÖll actually use.</p><p><strong>Start with this 3-part system:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Track</strong>&nbsp;what comes in and what goes out (yes, even the little stuff)</li><li><strong>Control</strong>&nbsp;the leaks (subscriptions, impulse spending, ΓÇ£quick runsΓÇ¥ that cost $70)</li><li><strong>Plan</strong>&nbsp;a weekly money check-in (10 minutes, once a week)</li></ul><p>ThatΓÇÖs it. Boring works.</p><p><br></p><h2>The Truth About ΓÇ£Fixing Your FinancesΓÇ¥</h2><p>If someone tells you:</p><ul><li>ΓÇ£Guaranteed score increase in 7 daysΓÇ¥</li><li>ΓÇ£Delete everything negative instantlyΓÇ¥</li><li>ΓÇ£DonΓÇÖt worry about the detailsΓÇ¥</li></ul><p>ΓÇªrun. Fast.</p><p>Real financial progress is:</p><ul><li><strong>clean information</strong></li><li><strong>consistent actions</strong></li><li><strong>a step-by-step plan</strong></li><li><strong>support so you donΓÇÖt quit</strong></li></ul><p>ThatΓÇÖs the lane Walter is in.</p><p><br></p><h2>Want a Straight Answer on Where You Stand?</h2><p>If youΓÇÖre not sure what to tackle first ΓÇö credit, protection, budgeting, or all of it ΓÇö just reach out.</p><p>Walter is an independent agent with&nbsp;United Wealth Education&nbsp;and can walk you through the options, explain what matters for&nbsp;<em>your</em>&nbsp;situation, and help you pick a plan that makes sense.</p><p><strong>No pressure. No hype. Just clarity.</strong></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-02','1',6,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 01:04:16','2026-02-03 01:18:33',NULL,NULL),(1535,'Enroll as an Agent','enroll-as-an-agent',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 01:30:53','2026-02-03 01:30:53',NULL,NULL),(1536,'Learn our Services','learn-our-services',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 01:31:27','2026-02-03 01:31:27',NULL,NULL),(1537,'Earn Commisions','earn-commisions',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 01:32:50','2026-02-03 01:32:50',NULL,NULL),(1538,'Build Your Team','build-your-team',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,194,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 01:33:29','2026-02-03 01:33:29',NULL,NULL),(1539,'Event 1','event-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:07:09','2026-02-03 17:07:09',NULL,NULL),(1540,'Protection Plan','protection-plan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:14:17','2026-02-03 17:14:17',NULL,NULL),(1541,'My Mission','my-mission-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to provide clients with a structured pathway to stronger credit, improved financial organization, and greater personal security through education, protection tools, and consistent guidance.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:42:38','2026-02-03 17:42:38',NULL,NULL),(1542,'Who is Carlos?','who-is-carlos',NULL,'<p>Hey, IΓÇÖm&nbsp;<strong>Carlos</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö a father of three, a real estate investor, and an entrepreneur whoΓÇÖs passionate about helping people build a stronger future. I love traveling, meeting new people, and keeping life funΓÇª but when itΓÇÖs time to get focused, IΓÇÖm all about structure, growth, and real results. If youΓÇÖre looking for someone whoΓÇÖs knowledgeable, approachable, and genuinely in your corner, youΓÇÖre in the right place.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:54:08','2026-02-03 17:54:08',NULL,NULL),(1543,'What do you help people with?','what-do-you-help-people-with',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I help individuals and families build financial structureΓÇöstarting with credit improvement support, protection tools, and a simple plan to move forward with confidence.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:56:09','2026-02-03 17:56:09',NULL,NULL),(1544,'Is this ΓÇ£credit repairΓÇ¥?','is-this-credit-repair',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ItΓÇÖs credit education and restoration support. We focus on identifying whatΓÇÖs hurting your credit, disputing whatΓÇÖs inaccurate where appropriate, and building better habits and structureΓÇöno magic tricks, no fake promises.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:57:05','2026-02-03 17:57:05',NULL,NULL),(1545,'How long does it take to see results?','how-long-does-it-take-to-see-results',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">It depends on your situation. Some people see movement quickly, others take longer. The goal is steady, trackable progressΓÇönot ΓÇ£overnight miracles.ΓÇ¥</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:57:35','2026-02-03 17:57:35',NULL,NULL),(1546,'Do I need good credit or a lot of money to start?','do-i-need-good-credit-or-a-lot-of-money-to-start',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Most people start because theyΓÇÖre tired of feeling stuck. We start where you are and build from there.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:58:05','2026-02-03 17:58:05',NULL,NULL),(1547,'What if IΓÇÖve been denied for things before (cards, apartments, loans, etc.)?','what-if-ive-been-denied-for-things-before-cards-apartments-loans-etc',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ThatΓÇÖs exactly why we start with the basicsΓÇöclean up whatΓÇÖs dragging your profile down, build it the right way, and put you in position to get approved when it matters.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:58:39','2026-02-03 17:58:39',NULL,NULL),(1548,'WhatΓÇÖs the next step if I want to work with you?','whats-the-next-step-if-i-want-to-work-with-you',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Click&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Book a Consult</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(or hit&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Call/Text</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">) and IΓÇÖll ask a few quick questions to understand your goal, then IΓÇÖll point you to the best starting step.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 17:59:36','2026-02-03 17:59:36',NULL,NULL),(1549,'Click Image to Join My Team','click-image-to-join-my-team',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-03','1',24,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 18:08:42','2026-02-03 18:08:42',NULL,NULL),(1550,'CERT','cert',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-03 18:13:26','2026-02-03 18:13:26',NULL,NULL),(1551,'Event 1','event-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 00:09:27','2026-02-06 00:09:27',NULL,NULL),(1552,'Event 2','event-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 00:10:39','2026-02-06 00:49:21',NULL,NULL),(1553,'UWE Tax Track','uwe-tax-track',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 00:41:26','2026-02-06 00:41:26',NULL,NULL),(1554,'Credit Scores ArenΓÇÖt ΓÇ£RandomΓÇ¥ ΓÇö HereΓÇÖs What Really Moves Them','credit-scores-arent-random-heres-what-really-moves-them',NULL,'<p>Most people think credit scores go up and down like the weather. Wrong. Your score reacts to patterns ΓÇö and the biggest ones are usually the simplest:</p><ul><li><strong>Payment history</strong>: late payments hit hard (and stick around).</li><li><strong>Credit utilization</strong>: maxing cards makes lenders nervous.</li><li><strong>Account age</strong>: older accounts help you.</li><li><strong>Inquiries</strong>: too many applications too fast looks risky.</li></ul><p>The truth? You donΓÇÖt need to be rich ΓÇö you need to be&nbsp;<strong>consistent</strong>. Credit is basically a trust score, and trust is built the boring way: showing up on time, every time.</p><p><strong>Quick action step:</strong></p><p>Pick ONE account and put it on autopay today (even minimum). Consistency beats motivation.</p><p><strong>Want help building a plan?</strong>&nbsp;Hit&nbsp;<strong>Book a Consult</strong>.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05','1',6,1,195,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 00:51:32','2026-02-06 00:51:32',NULL,NULL),(1555,'My Mission','my-mission-5',NULL,'<p><strong>My mission is to guide restaurants, hospitality, and qualifying beauty businesses through the FICA Tips Tax Credit process with clarity and integrityΓÇöhelping them claim what theyΓÇÖre owed and build cleaner payroll and reporting systems going forward.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 02:30:19','2026-02-06 02:30:19',NULL,NULL),(1556,'What is the FICA Tips Tax Credit?','what-is-the-fica-tips-tax-credit',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ItΓÇÖs an&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">income tax credit</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;that lets eligible employers recover the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">employer-paid FICA (Social Security + Medicare)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">employee-reported tips</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. The rate tied to that employer FICA portion is&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7.65%</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 10:42:34','2026-02-06 10:42:34',NULL,NULL),(1557,'Who qualifies for the credit?','who-qualifies-for-the-credit',NULL,'<p>Businesses with&nbsp;<strong>W-2 employees</strong>&nbsp;in industries where tipping is customaryΓÇötraditionally&nbsp;<strong>food &amp; beverage / hospitality</strong>, and now (new)&nbsp;<strong>beauty &amp; personal care</strong>&nbsp;under the OBBB changes.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 10:43:05','2026-02-06 10:43:05',NULL,NULL),(1558,'What changed for the Beauty & Personal Care industry?','what-changed-for-the-beauty-personal-care-industry',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Beauty &amp; personal care businesses became&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">new qualifying businesses after 12/31/24</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and the credit is&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">claimed with 2025 returns</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, due to the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2025 Budget Reconciliation Bill (OBBB)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;signed into law&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">July 4, 2025</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 10:43:34','2026-02-06 10:43:34',NULL,NULL),(1559,'What beauty businesses are typically tipped and may qualify?','what-beauty-businesses-are-typically-tipped-and-may-qualify',NULL,'<p><strong>What beauty businesses are typically tipped and may qualify?</strong></p><p>Common examples include:</p><ul><li>Hair salons &amp; barbershops</li><li>Nail salons</li><li>Spas, wellness centers (facials, wraps, body treatments, etc.)</li><li>Esthetics &amp; skincare studios (waxing, lashes, brows, tanning)</li><li>Makeup artists</li><li>Fitness services (trainers / group instructors)&nbsp;<em>(where tipping is standard in that setting)</em></li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 10:44:11','2026-02-06 10:44:11',NULL,NULL),(1560,'WhatΓÇÖs the minimum wage threshold for the credit calculation?','whats-the-minimum-wage-threshold-for-the-credit-calculation',NULL,'<p>For eligibility and credit math, the ΓÇ£minimum wage basisΓÇ¥ differs by industry:</p><ul><li><strong>Restaurant/hospitality:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>$5.15</strong>&nbsp;(for this creditΓÇÖs calculation rules)</li><li><strong>Beauty/personal care:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>$7.25</strong>&nbsp;(for this creditΓÇÖs calculation rules)</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 10:45:06','2026-02-06 10:45:06',NULL,NULL),(1561,'Is this a refund of payroll taxes?','is-this-a-refund-of-payroll-taxes',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. The FICA Tip Credit&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">does not refund payroll taxes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;you already paid. It offsets&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">income tax owed</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;by the business (C-Corp) or flows through to owners (S-Corp/Partnership). Refund outcomes depend on your tax liability and credit utilization rules.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 10:46:27','2026-02-06 10:46:27',NULL,NULL),(1562,'How far back can we recover missed credits?','how-far-back-can-we-recover-missed-credits',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Often the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">current year plus up to the last three years</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(depending on filing timing and amendment rules). After enough time passes, that year is goneΓÇöno rewinds.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 10:47:25','2026-02-06 10:47:25',NULL,NULL),(1563,'How Your Credit Gets Paid (And When Fees Are Charged)','how-your-credit-gets-paid-and-when-fees-are-charged',NULL,'<h3><strong>Full Refund</strong></h3><ul><li>You receive a full cash refund</li><li>No fee due at filing</li><li>Fee can be deducted after IRS processes refund (or optional advance)</li></ul><h3><strong> Partial Refund + Partial Carry-Forward</strong></h3><ul><li>Some refunded now, some applied to future taxes</li><li>If refund covers fee ΓåÆ no payment at filing</li><li>If not ΓåÆ invoiced when filed</li><li>Contingency-style when possible</li></ul><h3><strong> Full Carry-Forward</strong></h3><ul><li>Entire credit carries forward to offset future tax years</li><li>Fee is invoiced at filing (financing options available)</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 11:06:43','2026-02-06 11:06:43',NULL,NULL),(1564,'What We Do (And Why It Matters)','what-we-do-and-why-it-matters',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">Because this credit is easy to miss, easy to miscalculate, and expensive to ignore. We confirm you qualify, calculate it correctly, file it clean, and support you if the IRS ever asks questions.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1) Quiet Second Opinion (Eligibility + Real Savings)</strong></p><p>We confirm you qualify under&nbsp;<strong>IRS ┬º45B</strong>, identify which employees/services count, and estimate what you may be missing.</p><p><strong>2) Tip + Payroll Verification (Built to Hold Up)</strong></p><p>We verify tips are captured through payroll and reflected properly in your reporting, since the credit is based on&nbsp;<strong>reported tips</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>employer-paid FICA</strong>.</p><p><strong>3) Tip vs Service Charge Separation (Big Deal)</strong></p><p>We separate true tips from&nbsp;<strong>service charges/auto-gratuities</strong>, because mandatory charges generally donΓÇÖt qualify as tips for the credit.</p><p><strong>4) Minimum Wage Threshold Math (Where People Mess Up)</strong></p><p>We apply the correct minimum-wage basis rules so the credit only includes&nbsp;<strong>eligible tips above the threshold</strong>.</p><p><strong>5) Form 8846-Ready Credit Package</strong></p><p>We prepare the calculations and documentation needed to claim the credit correctly using&nbsp;<strong>Form 8846</strong>.</p><p><strong>6) Prior-Year Recovery (When Eligible)</strong></p><p>We help pursue missed credits for prior years through amended filings, so you stop losing money to the calendar.</p><h3>The ΓÇ£Real TipΓÇ¥ Rules We Check</h3><p>For tips to count, they must be:</p><ul><li><strong>Voluntary</strong>&nbsp;(not forced; service charges generally donΓÇÖt count)</li><li>Customer controls the&nbsp;<strong>amount</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>who receives it</strong></li><li><strong>Reported to the employer</strong></li><li>Earned by&nbsp;<strong>W-2 employees</strong>&nbsp;(not contractors)</li><li>Wages + tips exceed minimum wage</li><li>Credit applies to tips&nbsp;<strong>above</strong>&nbsp;the minimum-wage basis used in the calculation</li></ul><h2>How Our Process Works</h2><p><strong>01 ΓÇö Simple Application</strong></p><p>Quick form with basic business info.</p><p><strong>Transparent Pricing:</strong>&nbsp;no upfront cost to check eligibility; fees explained before you sign.</p><p><strong>02 ΓÇö We Do the Heavy Lifting</strong></p><p>We calculate savings, prepare documents, and handle filing requirements.</p><p><strong>03 ΓÇö Tracking + Audit Defense Included</strong></p><p>We keep you updated and respond with documentation support if the IRS asks questions.</p><p><strong>04 ΓÇö Get Paid</strong></p><h3>Timing varies by IRS processing.&nbsp;<strong>Advance options may be available</strong>&nbsp;for eligible businesses (when offered).</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-06 11:17:12','2026-02-06 11:17:12',NULL,NULL),(1565,'Who is Danna','who-is-danna',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Danna. IΓÇÖm a mom, a proud grandma and a daughter, and IΓÇÖm very much a family-first kind of person. I was raised in California, and these days I call Las Vegas, Nevada home.</p><p>I love life ΓÇö the simple stuff and the big moments. IΓÇÖm all about good energy, real conversations, laughing until it hurts, and making memories with the people I love. Family means everything to me, and I try not to take any of it for granted.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,196,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-07 10:21:35','2026-02-07 17:40:46',NULL,NULL),(1566,'Fica Tips Tax Credit','fica-tips-tax-credit',NULL,'<p>Click Here</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,154,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-08 16:39:56','2026-02-08 16:39:56',NULL,NULL),(1567,'Who is Dr. Karen?','who-is-dr-karen-2',NULL,'<p>I approach AI as an amplifier of God-given giftsΓÇönot a substitute for human purpose. Faith isnΓÇÖt an accessory to my work; itΓÇÖs my operating system. Every strategy, system, and framework I design is filtered through stewardship, integrity, and sustainability.</p><p>I build people before I build systems. I begin by helping clients understand who they are, what theyΓÇÖve been given, and what theyΓÇÖre called to buildΓÇöthen I architect business models, AI workflows, and leadership strategies that are scalable and grounded.</p><p>My voice carries executive clarity with pastoral careΓÇödirect, structured, and warm. I donΓÇÖt chase trends or hype. I build foundations, develop leaders, and design systems meant to last.</p><p>My work is legacy-focused, not lifestyle-driven. IΓÇÖm committed to raising disciplined entrepreneurs, ethical innovators, and faith-anchored leaders who are prepared to build well in a rapidly changing world.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 14:35:06','2026-02-09 15:03:12',NULL,NULL),(1568,'The Mission','the-mission-3',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help entrepreneurs, startups, and leaders build with clarity, discipline, and purpose through faith-centered AI strategy and business architecture. I bridge identity alignment, strategic execution, and ethical technology to bring order to vision, structure to ambition, and real accountability to growth.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 15:04:23','2026-02-09 15:04:23',NULL,NULL),(1569,'Who do you work with?','who-do-you-work-with',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I work with entrepreneurs, startups, nonprofit leaders, and executives who want clarity, structure, and systems that scaleΓÇöwithout sacrificing values.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:15:13','2026-02-09 16:15:13',NULL,NULL),(1570,'What does ΓÇ£faith-driven AIΓÇ¥ mean?','what-does-faith-driven-ai-mean',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">It means I treat AI like a tool for stewardshipΓÇöan amplifier of your God-given gifts, not a replacement for purpose, discernment, or integrity.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:17:38','2026-02-09 16:17:38',NULL,NULL),(1571,'IΓÇÖm not tech-savvy. Can you still help me?','im-not-tech-savvy-can-you-still-help-me',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. My job is to translate the tech into plain English and build a system you can actually run (and not hate).</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:21:02','2026-02-09 16:21:02',NULL,NULL),(1572,'What kinds of results can I expect?','what-kinds-of-results-can-i-expect',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What kinds of results can I expect?</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">More time back, fewer dropped leads, cleaner operations, stronger follow-through, and a business structure that doesnΓÇÖt fall apart when you get busy.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:22:37','2026-02-09 16:22:37',NULL,NULL),(1573,'Do you build AI systems or just give advice?','do-you-build-ai-systems-or-just-give-advice',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Both. I can design the strategy, build the workflows, and help implement toolsΓÇöso youΓÇÖre not stuck with a ΓÇ£nice planΓÇ¥ and zero execution.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:23:43','2026-02-09 16:23:43',NULL,NULL),(1574,'Can you set up an AI receptionist / lead intake / scheduling flow?','can-you-set-up-an-ai-receptionist-lead-intake-scheduling-flow',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. I can help automate first-contact, collect key info, qualify leads, and route scheduling so you stop playing phone tag all day.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:25:36','2026-02-09 16:25:36',NULL,NULL),(1575,'How do you handle ethics, privacy, and data security?','how-do-you-handle-ethics-privacy-and-data-security',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I build guardrails from day oneΓÇöwhat tools to use, what data not to share, what permissions matter, and how to stay aligned with integrity and sustainability.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:30:17','2026-02-09 16:30:17',NULL,NULL),(1576,'Do you provide legal or tax advice (like 501(c)(3) filing)?','do-you-provide-legal-or-tax-advice-like-501c3-filing',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">IΓÇÖm not an attorney or CPA. I can guide the process, organize whatΓÇÖs needed, and help you build the operational structureΓÇöwhile you use the right licensed pros for legal/tax sign-off.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 16:31:14','2026-02-09 16:31:14',NULL,NULL),(1577,'How do we get started?','how-do-we-get-started-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Start with a clarity call. IΓÇÖll assess where you are, whatΓÇÖs breaking, whatΓÇÖs missing, and what a realistic build plan looks likeΓÇöthen we move forward with a clear next step.</sp