 and handling needs.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 17:23:40','2026-02-11 17:23:40',NULL,NULL),(1588,'Can you do scheduled / appointment deliveries?','can-you-do-scheduled-appointment-deliveries',NULL,'<p>YesΓÇöscheduled and coordinated delivery is part of our process, especially for white glove jobs.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 17:24:11','2026-02-11 17:24:11',NULL,NULL),(1589,'How do we get started?','how-do-we-get-started-3',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Call or email us with pickup/delivery details and timingΓÇöour team will confirm the plan and next steps.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 17:24:44','2026-02-11 17:24:44',NULL,NULL),(1590,'Do you handle high-value or sensitive equipment?','do-you-handle-high-value-or-sensitive-equipment',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">YesΓÇöour white glove and specialized handling is built for sensitive and high-value freight</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 17:33:53','2026-02-11 17:33:53',NULL,NULL),(1591,'Who is Clinton?','who-is-clinton',NULL,'<p>Clinton H.Weston Jr. is a devoted father and grandfather who believes leadership begins with character, discipline, and accountability.</p><p>Outside of logistics and transportation operations, he enjoys reading novels, studying strategic themes through filmΓÇöparticularly spy and classic cinemaΓÇöand maintaining an active lifestyle through running and strength training.</p><p>His Christian faith informs his commitment to integrity, stewardship, and treating every partnership with respect and professionalism.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 18:05:17','2026-02-11 21:28:24',NULL,NULL),(1592,'What ΓÇ£White Glove DeliveryΓÇ¥ Really Means (And What It Should Include)','what-white-glove-delivery-really-means-and-what-it-should-include',NULL,'<p>Most people hear ΓÇ£white gloveΓÇ¥ and think it just means ΓÇ£be careful.ΓÇ¥ Nope. Real white glove delivery is a&nbsp;<strong>process</strong>: scheduled appointment windows, inside delivery, protective handling, placement where the client needs it, and cleanup so the site doesnΓÇÖt look like a cardboard tornado hit it. The goal is simple:&nbsp;<strong>deliver the item and protect the customer experience</strong>.</p><p>If your delivery team shows up late, unprepared, or canΓÇÖt coordinate with the site, the damage isnΓÇÖt just to the freight ΓÇö itΓÇÖs to your brand. White glove means precision, planning, and professionalism from start to finish.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-11','1',6,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 18:10:49','2026-02-11 18:10:49',NULL,NULL),(1593,'Healthcare & Sensitive Deliveries: Why Chain-of-Custody Matters','healthcare-sensitive-deliveries-why-chain-of-custody-matters',NULL,'<p>When youΓÇÖre moving medical devices, lab materials, or sensitive equipment, ΓÇ£drop it off and goΓÇ¥ isnΓÇÖt the standard. Healthcare delivery requires a stronger approach: documented handling, correct hand-off procedures, and careful coordination with strict sites.</p><p>Chain-of-custody isnΓÇÖt paperwork for fun ΓÇö itΓÇÖs how you protect compliance, reduce liability, and make sure the right package reaches the right person in the right condition. If your logistics partner doesnΓÇÖt take this seriously, theyΓÇÖre not a partner ΓÇö theyΓÇÖre a risk.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-01','1',6,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 18:13:56','2026-02-11 18:14:20',NULL,NULL),(1594,'Click Image to Join Our Team','click-image-to-join-our-team',NULL,'<p><strong>If You are Reliable and Professional? APPLY NOW</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 18:22:44','2026-02-11 18:22:44',NULL,NULL),(1595,'cert 1','cert-8',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 20:06:44','2026-02-11 20:06:44',NULL,NULL),(1596,'Click to See Video','click-to-see-video',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 21:34:29','2026-02-11 21:34:29',NULL,NULL),(1597,'Successful Rescue Mission','successful-rescue-mission',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 21:36:19','2026-02-11 21:36:19',NULL,NULL),(1598,'Unloading','unloading',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-11 21:37:17','2026-02-11 21:37:17',NULL,NULL),(1599,'Who is Sara?','who-is-sara',NULL,'<p>I am the founder of&nbsp;<strong>SL Solutions</strong>, a financial wellness support brand dedicated to helping individuals and families build stronger financial foundations. My focus is on simplifying complex financial concepts and providing access to tools and resources that support long-term stability and growth.</p><p>Through a structured and educational approach, I help clients improve organization, strengthen financial habits, and make more confident decisions. My goal is to replace financial stress with clarity, direction, and a practical path forward.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 14:42:25','2026-02-13 14:42:25',NULL,NULL),(1600,'My Mission','my-mission-6',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help individuals and families achieve greater financial stability by providing access to structured tools, educational resources, and practical solutions that support long-term growth, protection, and confidence.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 14:43:07','2026-02-13 14:43:07',NULL,NULL),(1601,'What do you help people with?','what-do-you-help-people-with-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I help individuals and families gain financial clarity by providing access to structured tools, educational resources, and practical solutions designed to improve organization, protection, and long-term stability.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 15:00:45','2026-02-13 15:00:45',NULL,NULL),(1602,'Do I need good credit to get started?','do-i-need-good-credit-to-get-started',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Many clients come to me specifically because they want to improve their credit or strengthen their financial foundation. We focus on practical steps based on your current situation.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 15:03:15','2026-02-13 15:03:15',NULL,NULL),(1603,'Is this financial, legal, or tax advice?','is-this-financial-legal-or-tax-advice',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. I provide education, tools, and guidance. For legal, tax, or investment advice, you should always consult a licensed professional.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 15:04:03','2026-02-13 15:04:03',NULL,NULL),(1604,'How long does it take to see results?','how-long-does-it-take-to-see-results-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Every situation is different. Some improvements can be seen in a few months, while others take longer. The key is consistency and following a structured plan.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 15:04:40','2026-02-13 15:04:40',NULL,NULL),(1605,'What is the first step to working with you?','what-is-the-first-step-to-working-with-you',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The first step is a short consultation where we discuss your goals and current financial situation. From there, we review the tools and solutions that best fit your needs.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 15:05:43','2026-02-13 15:05:43',NULL,NULL),(1606,'Can I also learn about the business opportunity?','can-i-also-learn-about-the-business-opportunity',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. If youΓÇÖre interested, I can walk you through the United Wealth Education (UWE) opportunity, explain how it works, and help you decide if itΓÇÖs the right fit for you.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 15:06:18','2026-02-13 15:06:18',NULL,NULL),(1607,'Protection Comes Before Growth','protection-comes-before-growth',NULL,'<p>When people think about their finances, they often focus on growthΓÇöhigher income, better credit, or building wealth. While those goals are important, they work best when theyΓÇÖre built on a strong and protected foundation. Without the right safeguards in place, unexpected issues can undo months or even years of progress.</p><p>Financial protection means having systems that help you stay informed, organized, and prepared. It includes understanding your accounts, monitoring your activity, and making sure important areas of your financial life are not being neglected. When these basics are in place, you reduce risk and create a more stable environment for growth.</p><p>Once your financial base is structured and protected, every step forward becomes more effective. Instead of constantly fixing problems, you can focus on building momentum. Growth is important, but protection is what makes that growth sustainable.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-13','1',6,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 15:21:47','2026-02-13 15:21:47',NULL,NULL),(1608,'Cert 1','cert-9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 16:32:08','2026-02-13 16:32:08',NULL,NULL),(1609,'Click Here For an Amazing Opportunity','click-here-for-an-amazing-opportunity',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,198,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 16:35:31','2026-02-13 16:35:31',NULL,NULL),(1610,'My Mission','my-mission-7',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To deliver secure, compliant, and on-time logistics with precision and accountability, all while protecting our clientsΓÇÖ assets, timelines, and reputation on every move.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-13 22:20:45','2026-02-13 22:21:48',NULL,NULL),(1611,'cert 5','cert-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-14 00:38:11','2026-02-14 00:38:11',NULL,NULL),(1612,'cert 7','cert-7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-14 00:38:30','2026-02-14 00:38:30',NULL,NULL),(1613,'cert 8','cert-8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,193,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-14 00:38:54','2026-02-14 00:38:54',NULL,NULL),(1614,'cert 9','cert-9',NULL,