ng>Transparent Pricing:</strong>&nbsp;no upfront cost to check eligibility; fees explained before you sign.</p><p><strong>02 ΓÇö We Do the Heavy Lifting</strong></p><p>We calculate savings, prepare documents, and handle filing requirements.</p><p><strong>03 ΓÇö Tracking + Audit Defense Included</strong></p><p>We keep you updated and respond with documentation support if the IRS asks questions.</p><p><strong>04 ΓÇö Get Paid</strong></p><h3>Timing varies by IRS processing.&nbsp;<strong>Advance options may be available</strong>&nbsp;for eligible businesses (when offered).</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,201,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 02:41:11','2026-02-21 02:41:11',NULL,NULL),(1645,'Who is Robert?','who-is-danna-2',NULL,'<p>I believe strength starts from the inside out.</p><p>I love working out ΓÇö not just for the physical challenge, but because discipline in the gym builds discipline in life. The grind teaches consistency, and consistency builds results.</p><p>IΓÇÖve always had an entrepreneurial spirit. I donΓÇÖt wait for opportunity ΓÇö I create it. I believe in building, improving, and constantly leveling up. Growth isnΓÇÖt optional. ItΓÇÖs a responsibility.</p><p>Being a grandfather is one of the greatest honors of my life. It reminds me daily that legacy matters. What we build today impacts generations tomorrow.</p><p>IΓÇÖm also an animal lover. Loyalty, instinct, and unconditional love ΓÇö animals teach us more about character than most people realize.</p><p>But above everything else, IΓÇÖm a servant at heart. My mission is simple: help people succeed and become better versions of themselves. Real success isnΓÇÖt just about money ΓÇö itΓÇÖs about growth, purpose, and impact.</p><p><strong>I invest in staying healthy and I love imparting that on others ΓÇö stay healthy, because if you want to reach your greatest heights, you have to be strong enough to stand there with a strong mind, body, and soul. Health is the foundation. Without it, nothing else holds up.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,201,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 02:41:11','2026-02-21 03:39:15',NULL,NULL),(1647,'Featured ORYGN Products','featured-orygn-products',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,201,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 12:07:50','2026-02-21 12:07:50',NULL,NULL),(1648,'The FICA Tips Tax Credit: The Money Most Tipped Businesses Miss','the-fica-tips-tax-credit-the-money-most-tipped-businesses-miss-2',NULL,'<p>If you have&nbsp;<strong>tipped W-2 employees</strong>&nbsp;and youΓÇÖre&nbsp;<strong>not filing Form 8846</strong>, thereΓÇÖs a strong chance youΓÇÖre leaving money on the table.</p><p>The&nbsp;<strong>FICA Tips Tax Credit (IRS ┬º45B)</strong>&nbsp;is an&nbsp;<strong>income tax credit</strong>&nbsp;that lets eligible employers claim back the&nbsp;<strong>employer portion of FICA (7.65%)</strong>&nbsp;paid on&nbsp;<strong>employee-reported tips</strong>. ItΓÇÖs not a payroll refundΓÇöit reduces income tax owed (and depending on your situation, it can create a refund or carry forward).</p><h2>Who typically qualifies?</h2><p>Historically, itΓÇÖs been&nbsp;<strong>restaurants and hospitality</strong>ΓÇöthink:</p><ul><li>Full-service restaurants, bars, nightclubs</li><li>Hotels/resorts, catering, cafes</li><li>Other tip-customary service operations</li></ul><p>And starting&nbsp;<strong>after 12/31/2024</strong>&nbsp;(claimed on&nbsp;<strong>2025 returns</strong>), qualifying&nbsp;<strong>beauty &amp; personal care</strong>&nbsp;businesses with tipped W-2 staff may also qualify.</p><h2>The 4 reasons businesses get it wrong</h2><ol><li><strong>Not all ΓÇ£gratuitiesΓÇ¥ count</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö service charges/auto-gratuities often donΓÇÖt qualify.</li><li><strong>Minimum wage threshold rules apply</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö the credit generally applies to eligible tips&nbsp;<strong>above</strong>&nbsp;the threshold used in the calculation.</li><li><strong>Tip reporting must be solid</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö itΓÇÖs based on&nbsp;<strong>reported tips</strong>&nbsp;and employer FICA paid.</li><li><strong>W-2 employees only</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö contractors donΓÇÖt qualify.</li></ol><h2>Why it gets missed</h2><p>Payroll companies usually wonΓÇÖt apply it automatically, and many tax preparers donΓÇÖt take the time to calculate it properly. Owners assume itΓÇÖs being handledΓÇª and it often isnΓÇÖt.</p><h2>Bottom line</h2><p>A quick review can tell you if youΓÇÖre missing the credit nowΓÇöand whether prior years may still be recoverable. No hype. Just math.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-21','1',6,1,201,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 12:12:47','2026-02-21 12:12:47',NULL,NULL),(1649,'Amazing Business Opportunity','amazing-business-opportunity',NULL,'<p><strong>Click here To Join My Team </strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,201,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-21 12:32:02','2026-02-21 12:32:02',NULL,NULL),(1651,'Who is Randle?','who-is-randle-2',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Quite simply put, I help to enhance your physical, mental, spiritual, social and financial well-being, therefore I\'ve often been labeled as a \"Life Coach\".</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Having a life coach or mentor can significantly enhance personal and professional development by providing structured guidance, accountability, and support. One of the most compelling benefits is the tailored approach they offer in setting and achieving goals. Unlike generic advice found in books or online resources, a life coach or mentor works closely with individuals to understand their unique strengths, weaknesses, aspirations, and challenges. This personalized attention helps create more effective strategies for reaching specific milestones while also adapting to any changes along the way.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Another major advantage of having a life coach or mentor is the sense of accountability they provide. It\'s easy to set lofty goals but much harder to maintain focus and motivation over time. A life coach often holds regular sessions where progress is reviewed, obstacles are analyzed, and encouragement is given just when itΓÇÖs needed most. This ongoing interaction not only keeps one on track but also fosters a sense of responsibility towards one\'s own commitments. Knowing that someone else is invested in your success can be highly motivating and lead you to push past barriers that may have previously seemed insurmountable.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lastly, mentors bring invaluable real-world experience into the relationship which can accelerate learning curves tremendously. Whether it\'s navigating career advancements, developing leadership skills, or managing work-life balance betterΓÇömentors draw from their own experiences and lessons learned over years or even decades in similar situations. They can provide insight into industry-specific trends that you might not yet be aware of as well as offer practical advice grounded in reality rather than theory alone. This seasoned perspective not only enriches decision-making processes but also builds confidence as you\'re guided through proven paths toward success!</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 01:22:24','2026-02-22 01:22:24',NULL,NULL),(1653,'≡ƒöÉ What makes ADT different from DIY security systems?','what-makes-adt-different-from-diy-security-systems',NULL,'<p>DIY systems may send alerts to your phone. ADT provides 24/7 professional monitoring. When an alarm is triggered, trained monitoring specialists verify the emergency and dispatch police, fire, or medical responders immediately. That added layer of response makes a real difference.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 01:44:39','2026-02-22 01:44:39',NULL,NULL),(1654,'≡ƒÅá Is the system customized to my property?','is-the-system-customized-to-my-property',NULL,'<p>Yes. Every security solution is designed based on your home or business layout, entry points, risk factors, and protection priorities. No one-size-fits-all packages.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',1