 protection options available.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 01:48:45','2026-02-22 01:48:45',NULL,NULL),(1663,'≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å Why Professional Security Monitoring Still Matters in 2026','why-professional-security-monitoring-still-matters-in-2028',NULL,'<h1>≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å Why Professional Security Monitoring Still Matters in 2026</h1><p>In todayΓÇÖs connected world, security is no longer optional ΓÇö itΓÇÖs essential.</p><p>With rising property crime, increased package theft, and growing concerns around home invasions, homeowners and business owners alike are seeking smarter, more reliable protection solutions. While DIY systems have gained popularity, professional monitoring continues to offer a critical advantage: immediate response.</p><h2>The Difference Between Alerts and Action</h2><p>A self-installed alarm may send you a notification.</p><p>A professionally monitored system sends help.</p><p>When an ADT security system is triggered, trained monitoring professionals verify the situation and dispatch emergency responders immediately. That response time can make the difference between minor damage and catastrophic loss.</p><h2>Smart Security Is More Than Just Cameras</h2><p>Modern security systems integrate:</p><p>ΓÇó Intrusion detection</p><p>ΓÇó Video surveillance</p><p>ΓÇó Fire and carbon monoxide monitoring</p><p>ΓÇó Smart home automation</p><p>ΓÇó 24/7 professional monitoring</p><p>ItΓÇÖs not just about recording incidents ΓÇö itΓÇÖs about preventing them.</p><h2>Business Protection Requires Infrastructure</h2><p>For business owners, downtime equals lost revenue. Commercial security systems provide layered protection through surveillance, access control, and environmental monitoring to safeguard assets, employees, and operations.</p><h2>Peace of Mind Is the Real Product</h2><p>Security isnΓÇÖt just hardware. ItΓÇÖs confidence. ItΓÇÖs knowing your family is protected. ItΓÇÖs knowing your business is secure after hours.</p><p>As an Independent National Dealer for ADT, I work directly with clients to design customized systems that align with their specific protection needs ΓÇö backed by one of the most recognized security monitoring networks in the country.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-21','1',6,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 01:53:23','2026-02-22 02:07:35',NULL,NULL),(1664,'Check My Availability','check-my-availability-2',NULL,'<p>Schedule A Time </p>',NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 01:56:06','2026-02-22 01:56:06',NULL,NULL),(1665,'Welcome to Safe Streets','welcome-to-safe-streets',NULL,'<p>Click to view video</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 02:09:24','2026-02-22 02:09:24',NULL,NULL),(1666,'ORYGN','orygn',NULL,'<p>Learn More About Orygn</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 03:02:15','2026-02-22 03:02:15',NULL,NULL),(1667,'Click image to Watch Video','click-image-to-watch-video',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 03:05:45','2026-02-22 03:05:45',NULL,NULL),(1672,'.','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 04:57:14','2026-02-22 04:57:14',NULL,NULL),(1673,'REFERRAL PARTNER REWARDS','referral-partner-rewards',NULL,'<p>Click Here to Become a Referral Partner</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,202,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-22 13:59:44','2026-02-22 13:59:44',NULL,NULL),(1674,'Test Product 1','test-product-1',NULL,'<p>Test Product details</p>',NULL,'2026-02-24','1',34,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-23 21:49:18','2026-02-23 21:49:18',NULL,NULL),(1675,'Schedule a Test Drive','schedule-a-test-drive-with-b-love',NULL,'<p>Click here to Schedule a Test Drive with B Love </p>',NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-24 15:42:02','2026-02-24 15:46:47',NULL,NULL),(1676,'Instant Financing/Pre-Approval','instant-financingpre-approval',NULL,'<p>Click Here and Get Financed Now</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-24 15:45:51','2026-02-24 15:45:51',NULL,NULL),(1677,'BOOK SERVICE APPOINTMENT','book-service-appointment',NULL,'<p>Click Here to Book Service Appt.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-24 17:07:08','2026-02-24 17:07:08',NULL,NULL),(1680,'triGLP Natural Peptides vs Synthetic GLP-1 Medications','triglp-natural-peptides-vs-synthetic-glp-1-medications',NULL,'<p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',18,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 02:43:09','2026-02-25 02:43:09',NULL,NULL),(1681,'Science and Clinical Facts','science-and-clinical-facts',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-01-05','1',18,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 02:50:33','2026-02-25 02:50:33',NULL,NULL),(1682,'Stanford Clinical Study','stanford-clinical-study',NULL,'<h3><strong><u>Science &amp; Clinical Facts</u></strong></h3><p><em>(Perfect for your Press &amp; Media header on vBiz Me vCard)</em></p><p><strong>triGLP ΓÇö Clinically Studied Bioactive Peptides for Performance Aging</strong></p><p>triGLP is a proprietary, patent-protected bioactive peptide mix derived from fresh, sashi-grade Atlantic salmon from Norway using gentle enzymatic hydrolysis. It is classified by the US FDA as a New Dietary Ingredient (NDI) with self-affirmed GRAS status.</p><p><strong>Unique Triple-Pathway Activation + Gene-Level Support</strong></p><p>triGLP naturally activates three key metabolic receptors:</p><p>ΓÇó <strong>GLP-1</strong> ΓÇô quiets food noise and supports appetite control</p><p>ΓÇó <strong>GIP</strong> ΓÇô enhances fat burning and insulin sensitivity</p><p>ΓÇó <strong>GLP-2</strong> ΓÇô strengthens gut barrier function and nutrient absorption</p><p>Advanced gene-expression studies show:</p><p>ΓÇó &gt;3├ù upregulation of <strong>FTH1</strong> ΓÇô improves iron absorption from food, supports healthy ferritin &amp; hemoglobin levels, and boosts natural energy (no side effects of iron supplements)</p><p>ΓÇó &gt;3├ù upregulation of <strong>HMOX1</strong> ΓÇô powerful antioxidant protection and gut health support</p><p>ΓÇó Downregulation of <strong>ALOX-12</strong> ΓÇô increases fat oxidation and improves insulin sensitivity</p><h3><strong><u>Human Clinical Results</u></strong></h3><ol><li><strong>Metabolic Health Study</strong>&nbsp;(14 healthy subjects, 12 g/day, 8 weeks)</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">7 % reduction in BMI (28.6 ΓåÆ 26.6 kg/m┬▓)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">10 % reduction in body fat with zero loss of muscle or body water</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Significant improvements in blood glucose, insulin sensitivity, and inflammatory markers (TNF-╬▒, IL-6, zonulin)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Marked increase in ferritin levels</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Overweight Subjects Study</strong>&nbsp;(48 subjects, 16 g/day, 6 weeks) ΓÇô published in Journal of Obesity &amp; Weight Loss Therapy 2016</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">6 % BMI reduction in just 6 weeks</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Significant rise in adiponectin and bile acids (enhanced fat burning)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">15 % reduction in IL-6 (key inflammation marker)</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Energy, Vitality &amp; Mood Study</strong>&nbsp;(20 healthy subjects, 4 g/day, 128 days)</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">87 % of participants reported statistically significant increases in energy and vitality within 4 weeks</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">57 % increase in anti-inflammatory IL-10</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">4.2├ù increase in HMOX-1 gene expression</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Reduced oxidative stress and irritability</li></ul><p><strong>Gut Health ΓÇô Stanford Research Model</strong></p><p>In a chemically-induced IBD mouse model, triGLP significantly reduced gut inflammation, preserved normal intestinal structure, and accelerated recovery ΓÇö outperforming standard collagen peptides (Vital Proteins) which showed no benefit. Mechanism: strong upregulation of protective HMOX-1 and FTH1 genes.</p><h3><strong><u>Additional Validated Benefits</u></strong></h3><p>ΓÇó Up to 67.5 % greater protein absorption than highly hydrolyzed whey in 2 hours</p><p>ΓÇó Strong inhibition of myostatin and activin A ΓåÆ protects lean muscle during fat loss</p><p>ΓÇó Health Canada Qualified Health Claims (ferritin/hemoglobin, antioxidants, skin health)</p><p>ΓÇó Multiple US FDA Structure/Function Claims (iron metabolism, metabolic efficiency, GI &amp; immune support, skin health)</p><p>All studies were conducted on the exact salmon protein hydrolysate used in triGLP. Individual results may vary. Always consult your healthcare provider before starting any new supplement.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',18,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 02:54:20','2026-02-25 02:54:20',NULL,NULL),(1683,'My Mission','my-mission-10',NULL,'<p>To help everyday people finally quiet the food noise, drop stubborn fat, and reclaim their energy ΓÇö naturally.</p><p>With triGLPΓÇÖs breakthrough peptide drops, IΓÇÖm on a mission to deliver real metabolic transformation without needles, crashes, or crazy diets. One person, 10 drops a day, at a time.</p><p>LetΓÇÖs get you feeling incredible again. </p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 02:59:17','2026-02-25 02:59:17',NULL,NULL),(1684,'What is ORYGN?','what-is-orygn',NULL,'<p>ORYGN is a breakthrough wellness brand that delivers pharma-level metabolic results naturally. Our flagship product triGLP uses advanced peptide technology to support healthy appetite control, fat loss, energy, gut health, and overall vitality ΓÇö no needles required.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:00:51','2026-02-25 03:00:51',NULL,NULL),(1685,'What exactly is triGLP?','what-exactly-is-triglp',NULL,'<p>triGLP is a premium oral liquid drop formula featuring <strong>double-patented bioactive peptides</strong> sourced from pristine Norwegian Atlantic salmon protein, plus organic lemon and ginger extracts. It naturally activates the three key metabolic pathways (GLP-1, GIP &amp; GLP-2).</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:01:29','2026-02-25 03:01:29',NULL,NULL),(1686,'How does triGLP work?','how-does-triglp-work',NULL,'<p>triGLP works with your bodyΓÇÖs natural systems:</p><p>ΓÇó GLP-1 quiets ΓÇ£food noiseΓÇ¥ and cravings</p><p>ΓÇó GIP supports fat burning &amp; healthy insulin response</p><p>ΓÇó GLP-2 promotes gut integrity and helps preserve muscle</p><p>All in one easy daily drop ΓÇö without the side effects of synthetic injections.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:02:24','2026-02-25 03:02:24',NULL,NULL),(1687,'How do I take triGLP?','how-do-i-take-triglp',NULL,'<p>Super simple! Shake the bottle, take 5 drops twice daily (10 drops total). Place under or on your tongue, hold for 10ΓÇô20 seconds, then swallow. Pleasant natural citrus-ginger taste. Take any time of day, with or without food.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:03:13','2026-02-25 03:03:13',NULL,NULL),(1688,'How soon will I see results?','how-soon-will-i-see-results',NULL,'<p>ΓÇó Weeks 1ΓÇô2: Reduced cravings, steady energy, better sleep (ΓÇ£The AwakeningΓÇ¥)</p><p>ΓÇó Weeks 3ΓÇô8: Noticeable fat loss, improved digestion &amp; focus (ΓÇ£The TransformationΓÇ¥)</p><p>ΓÇó Week 9+: Sustained results &amp; a whole new relationship with food &amp; your body</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:04:11','2026-02-25 03:04:11',NULL,NULL),(1689,'Is triGLP safe?','is-triglp-safe',NULL,'<p>Is triGLP safe?</p><p>Yes ΓÇö 100% natural and manufactured to pharmaceutical-grade standards. The only caution is: do not use if you have a fish allergy (salmon-derived peptides). Always check with your doctor before starting any new supplement. No reported harsh side effects in thousands of users.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:04:54','2026-02-25 03:04:54',NULL,NULL),(1690,'How much does triGLP cost & how do I get it?','how-much-does-triglp-cost-how-do-i-get-it',NULL,'<p>A 30-day supply is $47 retail. Preferred customers &amp; Brand Partners get lower wholesale pricing.</p><p>Just message me or scan this vCard ΓÇö IΓÇÖll send you my personal link, current specials, and help you get started right away.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:05:56','2026-02-25 03:05:56',NULL,NULL),(1691,'Why Choose ORYGN triGLP Over Pharmaceutical GLP-1 Drugs?','why-choose-orygn-triglp-over-pharmaceutical-glp-1-drugs',NULL,'<p>If youΓÇÖre tired of the constant ΓÇ£food noise,ΓÇ¥ stubborn fat, and energy crashes but donΓÇÖt want weekly injections, expensive prescriptions, or the harsh side effects that come with synthetic GLP-1 medications like Ozempic┬«, Wegovy┬« (semaglutide), Mounjaro┬«, or Zepbound┬« (tirzepatide), ORYGN triGLP offers a powerful natural alternative.</p><p>triGLP is a patented blend of bioactive peptides derived from pristine Norwegian Atlantic salmon. Instead of a synthetic drug that forcefully activates only one or two pathways, triGLP gently works with your bodyΓÇÖs own systems by naturally activating <strong>three</strong> key metabolic pathways: GLP-1 (quiets cravings and food noise), GIP (supports fat burning and healthy insulin response), and GLP-2 (strengthens the gut lining and improves nutrient absorption). On top of that, it delivers advanced gene-level support ΓÇö upregulating FTH1 for better natural energy through improved iron utilization, HMOX1 for antioxidant and gut protection, and downregulating ALOX-12 for enhanced fat oxidation.</p><p>Clinical studies on the exact peptides in triGLP show impressive results: 6ΓÇô7% BMI reduction and up to 10% body-fat loss in just 6ΓÇô8 weeks ΓÇö while <strong>completely preserving lean muscle</strong>. ThatΓÇÖs a major advantage over synthetic GLP-1 drugs, where a large portion of the weight lost is often muscle. triGLP also actively protects muscle by inhibiting myostatin and activin A, supports gut healing (shown in StanfordΓÇÖs IBD research model), and improves energy and vitality in 87% of users within four weeks.</p><p>Most people tolerate triGLP extremely well with virtually no side effects in the studies. There are no reports of the nausea, vomiting, constipation, gallbladder issues, or ΓÇ£Ozempic faceΓÇ¥ commonly associated with the pharmaceutical options. And because itΓÇÖs a natural dietary supplement, thereΓÇÖs no prescription required, no doctor visits for refills, and the cost is a fraction of the $900ΓÇô$1,300 monthly price tag of the drugs.</p><p>In short, triGLP delivers <strong>pharma-like metabolic transformation</strong> ΓÇö steady fat loss, preserved muscle, real energy, and gut support ΓÇö in a simple, daily 10-drop ritual under the tongue. ItΓÇÖs designed for sustainable, long-term results without the needles, the side effects, or the ongoing medical dependency.</p><p>triGLP is a dietary supplement, not a medication. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Always consult your healthcare provider before starting any new supplement, especially if you are taking prescription medications.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 03:31:09','2026-02-25 03:31:09',NULL,NULL),(1692,'Health First. Always','health-first-always',NULL,'<p><strong>I know what it feels like to want more energy, more control, and to be tired of ΓÇ£quick fixesΓÇ¥ that donΓÇÖt last. A lot of people carry that struggle quietly.</strong></p><p><strong>ThatΓÇÖs why I connected with ORYGN. IΓÇÖm drawn to simple, supportive solutions that help the body find balance. ORYGNΓÇÖs metabolic support is designed to help with appetite control, steadier energy, and overall wellness ΓÇö without injections or complicated routines.</strong></p><p><strong>IΓÇÖm not here to pressure anyone. IΓÇÖm here to listen, answer questions, and help you decide whatΓÇÖs best for you. Health is the foundation ΓÇö and you donΓÇÖt have to figure it out alone.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 11:10:34','2026-02-25 11:10:34',NULL,NULL),(1693,'Click To See Featured Products','featured-products',NULL,'<p><strong>Click Here to See My Products</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',34,1,204,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-25 11:29:55','2026-02-25 15:22:33',NULL,NULL),(1694,'Click to See Our Health and Wellness Pro