gnificantly lowering operating expenses across electricity, HVAC systems, backup power, communications, and infrastructure.</p><p><br></p><p>By leveraging innovative resiliency technologies along with government-backed grants and incentives for business owners, Raj helps clients achieve measurable monthly savings ΓÇö typically ranging from $5,000 to $20,000+ per use case, depending on implementation/ use cases.</p><p><br></p><p>SPTΓÇÖs dedicated resiliency team of 10 experienced professionals works ( all are in USA) directly on behalf of each client to design tailored solutions, assist with implementation, and monitor performance and cost savings. The team provides strategic guidance and ongoing support at no charge, ensuring measurable operational improvements and long-term financial sustainability.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,191,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-27 01:43:48','2026-02-27 01:43:48',NULL,NULL),(1703,'cert 1','cert-10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,180,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-08 10:18:26','2026-03-08 10:18:26',NULL,NULL),(1704,'Sales Person','sales-person',NULL,'<p>Sales Person Details here...</p>',NULL,'2026-03-09','1',35,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-09 06:31:25','2026-03-09 06:31:25',NULL,NULL),(1705,'Schedule A Test Drive','schedule-a-test-drive',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-09 19:52:40','2026-03-09 19:52:40',NULL,NULL),(1706,'Instant Financing/Pre-Approval','instant-financingpre-approval-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-09 19:58:18','2026-03-09 19:58:18',NULL,NULL),(1707,'Book Service Appointment','book-service-appointment-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,165,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-09 20:01:07','2026-03-09 20:01:07',NULL,NULL),(1708,'Ven y Disfruta','ven-y-disfruta',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-13 02:09:44','2026-03-13 02:09:44',NULL,NULL),(1709,'Sabor Ecuatoriano 3','sabor-ecuatoriano-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-13 02:14:44','2026-03-13 02:14:44',NULL,NULL),(1710,'Con Bistec 