 17:29:42','2026-03-13 17:29:42',NULL,NULL),(1716,'Do you offer takeout or delivery?','do-you-offer-takeout-or-delivery',NULL,'<p>Yes. Customers can order their favorite dishes for takeout, and delivery may also be available depending on the location.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-13 17:30:23','2026-03-13 17:30:23',NULL,NULL),(1717,'Do you have daily specials?','do-you-have-daily-specials',NULL,'<p>Yes. Sabor Ecuatoriano offers fresh daily lunch specials that provide a delicious and affordable way to enjoy authentic Ecuadorian meals.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-13 17:31:00','2026-03-13 17:31:00',NULL,NULL),(1718,'Do you serve natural juices or traditional drinks?','do-you-serve-natural-juices-or-traditional-drinks',NULL,'<p>Yes. The restaurant offers refreshing natural fruit juices and traditional beverages that complement the flavors of the dishes.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-13 17:31:36','2026-03-13 17:31:36',NULL,NULL),(1719,'Are families welcome at the restaurant?','are-families-welcome-at-the-restaurant',NULL,'<p>Absolutely. Sabor Ecuatoriano provides a warm and welcoming environment where families and friends can gather to enjoy great food and authentic Ecuadorian hospitality.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-13 17:32:14','2026-03-13 17:32:14',NULL,NULL),(1720,'BBB','bbb-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,197,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-18 01:22:24','2026-03-18 01:22:24',NULL,NULL),(1721,'Mayan Botanicals Mission','mayan-botanicals-mission',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Mayan Botanicals, our mission is to support healthier living through natural herbal wellness, education, and personalized guidance. We are committed to helping individuals explore plant-based solutions and lifestyle choices that promote balance, vitality, and long-term well-being.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,208,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-18 22:08:55','2026-03-18 22:08:55',NULL,NULL),(1722,'About Mayan Botanicals','about-maya