ck-to-access-our-herbal-shop',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,208,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-19 17:33:40','2026-03-19 17:33:40',NULL,NULL),(1738,'Click Image to Order My Book','order-my-book',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',34,1,208,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-19 19:10:04','2026-03-21 11:40:27',NULL,NULL),(1739,'My Mission','my-mission-11',NULL,'<p>My mission as a doula is to support families</p><p>through planning a future as parents, through</p><p>pregnancy, birth, labor, and postpartum with</p><p>love, care, guidance, and heartfelt education. As</p><p>a doula I aim to empower families with</p><p>confidence and comfort as they welcome and</p><p>nurture new life.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 08:26:26','2026-03-26 21:13:02',NULL,NULL),(1740,'What is a doula?','what-is-a-doula',NULL,'<p>A doula is a trained professional who provides emotional, physical, and informational support during pregnancy, labor, and postpartum.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 08:27:46','2026-03-22 08:27:46',NULL,NULL),(1741,'Do doulas replace doctors or midwives?','do-doulas-replace-doctors-or-midwives',NULL,'<p>No. Doulas do not provide medical care. They support the mother while working alongside the medical team.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 08:37:50','2026-03-22 08:37:50',NULL,NULL),(1742,'When should I hire a doula?','when-should-i-hire-a-doula',NULL,'<p>Many families hire a doula during the second trimester, but support can begin at any stage of pregnancy.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 08:38:32','2026-03-22 08:38:32',NULL,NULL),(1743,'Can a doula help with hospital births?','can-a-doula-help-with-hospital-births',NULL,'<p>Yes. Doulas support mothers in hospitals, birthing centers, and home births.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 08:39:18','2026-03-22 08:39:18',NULL,NULL),(1744,'Will my partner still be involved?','will-my-partner-still-be-involved',NULL,'<p>Absolutely. A doula helps support both the mother and partner so everyone feels confident and supported.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 08:39:59','2026-03-22 08:39:59',NULL,NULL),(1745,'Do you offer postpartum support?','do-you-offer-postpartum-support',NULL,'<p>Yes. Postpartum support helps families adjust after birth and provides guidance during the early days with a newborn.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 08:40:32','2026-03-22 08:40:32',NULL,NULL),(1746,'The Power of Doula Support: Why No Mother Should Walk the Birth Journey Alone','the-power-of-doula-support-why-no-mother-should-walk-the-birth-journey-alone',NULL,'<p>Pregnancy and birth are among the most powerful and transformative experiences in a womanΓÇÖs life. While every journey into motherhood is unique, one thing remains true for many mothers:&nbsp;<strong>support matters.</strong></p><p>This is where the role of a doula becomes incredibly meaningful.</p><p>A doula is a trained professional who provides&nbsp;<strong>emotional, physical, and informational support</strong>&nbsp;throughout pregnancy, labor, and the postpartum period. Unlike doctors or midwives, doulas do not provide medical care. Instead, they focus on helping mothers feel&nbsp;<strong>calm, confident, and empowered</strong>&nbsp;during one of lifeΓÇÖs most important moments.</p><h3><strong>A Calm Presence During Labor</strong></h3><p>Labor can be intense and unpredictable. Having a doula present offers a steady and reassuring presence. Doulas help guide breathing techniques, offer comfort measures, and provide encouragement when it is needed most.</p><p>Their role is to ensure that mothers feel supported and heard throughout the birth process.</p><h3><strong>Supporting the Whole Family</strong></h3><p>Doula support is not only beneficial for mothers, but also for partners and families. A doula helps partners feel confident in their role by offering guidance and reassurance during labor and delivery.</p><p>This creates a more positive and connected birth experience for everyone involved.</p><h3><strong>Evidence Shows the Benefits</strong></h3><p>Research has shown that continuous support from a doula can lead to:</p><p>ΓÇó Reduced stress and anxiety during labor</p><p>ΓÇó Shorter labor times</p><p>ΓÇó Lower likelihood of medical interventions</p><p>ΓÇó Greater satisfaction with the birth experience</p><p>Most importantly, doulas help mothers feel&nbsp;<strong>safe, empowered, and respected</strong>&nbsp;throughout the birth journey.</p><h3><strong>Beyond Birth</strong></h3><p>Support does not end when the baby arrives. Many doulas continue to offer postpartum support, helping mothers adjust to life with their newborn while providing encouragement, education, and reassurance during those early days.</p><h3><strong>Every Mother Deserves Support</strong></h3><p>My mission is simple: to walk alongside mothers during pregnancy, birth, and beyondΓÇöoffering compassionate support every step of the way.</p><p>Motherhood is a sacred journey, and no woman should have to walk it alone.</p>',NULL,'2026-03-22','1',6,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 09:17:56','2026-03-22 09:19:09',NULL,NULL),(1747,'Who is Essence?','who-is-essence',NULL,'<p><strong>Essence </strong>is a life long Connecticut resident</p><p>who has been a big advocate for education and</p><p>health and wellness. She also runs a nonprofit</p><p>organization that she is the founder of called</p><p>One Heart One Soul that supplies the needs of</p><p>the community. Essence has such a deep</p><p>passion for the lives of others that it is also</p><p>poured into her business Key To Life where she</p><p>is in the role of a Life Coach and state certified</p><p>Interdisciplinary Doula. One of her biggest</p><p>accomplishments is the work she has done on</p><p>herself. These great accomplishments have</p><p>molded Essence to be a pillar in the communities</p><p>that she is today.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-22 10:57:51','2026-03-26 21:12:09',NULL,NULL),(1748,'Rango Says Hello','rango-says-hello',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 11:29:35','2026-03-25 11:29:35',NULL,NULL),(1749,'Who is Rango?','who-is-rango',NULL,'<p>Hi there, my friend! ≡ƒæï</p><p>My name is&nbsp;<strong>Rango</strong>, and IΓÇÖm a big, lovable Dogue de Bordeaux with an even bigger heart.</p><p>I wasnΓÇÖt always the confident, kind, and happy pup you see today. Just like you, I had to learn some very important life lessons along the way. Through my journey, I discovered how to be brave, how to be a good friend, how to believe in myself, and how to treat others with kindness and respect.</p><p>Now, IΓÇÖm on a mission! ≡ƒÉ╛Γ£¿</p><p>I travel through stories to help kids just like you become the&nbsp;<strong>best version of themselves</strong>.</p><p>In my books, youΓÇÖll learn about:</p><p>Friendship ≡ƒñ¥</p><p>Confidence ≡ƒÆ¬</p><p>Kindness ≡ƒÆû</p><p>Respect ≡ƒîƒ</p><p>Making good choices ≡ƒºá</p><p>Every page you turn is a new lesson, a new adventure, and a new way to grow stronger, happier, and more YOU!</p><p>So come along with meΓÇª</p><p>LetΓÇÖs learn, grow, and have fun together! ≡ƒÉ╢≡ƒôû</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 14:35:47','2026-03-25 20:02:26',NULL,NULL),(1750,'What kind of dog is Rango?','what-kind-of-dog-is-rango',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm a&nbsp;Dogue de Bordeaux, also known as a French Mastiff! I may look big and strong, but IΓÇÖm really a gentle and loving friend.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 14:41:38','2026-03-25 14:41:38',NULL,NULL),(1751,'What is RangoΓÇÖs mission?','what-is-rangos-mission',NULL,'<p>My mission is to help kids learn important life lessons in a fun and loving way so they can grow into confident, kind, and respectful people.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 14:42:42','2026-03-25 14:42:42',NULL,NULL),(1752,'Are RangoΓÇÖs stories only for kids?','are-rangos-stories-only-for-kids',NULL,'<p>Nope! My stories are for&nbsp;kids and grown-ups. Parents love reading them too because they teach meaningful lessons the whole family can talk about.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 14:43:35','2026-03-25 14:43:35',NULL,NULL),(1753,'What can I learn from RangoΓÇÖs books?','what-can-i-learn-from-rangos-books',NULL,'<p>You can learn how to:</p><ul><li>Believe in yourself</li><li>Be a good friend</li><li>Make positive choices</li><li>Handle big feelings</li><li>Show love and respect</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 14:44:26','2026-03-25 14:44:26',NULL,NULL),(1754,'Is Rango a real dog?','is-rango-a-real-dog',NULL,'<p>Yes, I am! ≡ƒÉ╛</p><p>IΓÇÖm a real dog with a real story, and my life inspired these books to help others grow and shine.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 14:45:31','2026-03-25 14:45:31',NULL,NULL),(1755,'Rango\'s Mission','rangos-mission',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Empowering children to become their best selves through storytelling, life lessons, and love ΓÇö one page at a time with Rango.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 19:54:30','2026-03-25 19:54:30',NULL,NULL),(1756,'Service Dog Certification','service-dog-certification',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-25 23:19:04','2026-03-25 23:19:04',NULL,NULL),(1757,'Rango Cert 2','rango-cert-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-26 01:48:52','2026-03-26 01:48:52',NULL,NULL),(1758,'Who is Ronica','who-is-ronica',NULL,'<p>Hello Everyone!</p><p>My name is Ronica ΓÇ£RoniΓÇ¥ Keith.&nbsp;I am the grateful owner of&nbsp;</p><p>The Cupcake Factory</p><p>I have been in the dessert business since 2007,&nbsp;thatΓÇÖs almost 20 years!!!ΓÇª.time really flies.&nbsp;During this time I have sharpened my skills as a Professional Baker and Cake Decorator, which allows me to offer my customers the absolute best cupcakes on the planet!!!&nbsp;I live to make beautiful cupcakes that taste absolutely amazing.&nbsp;My hope is to have an opportunity to make your cupcake dreams come true!</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 06:37:14','2026-04-01 22:33:35',NULL,NULL),(1759,'The Cupcake Factory Mission','our-mission-41',NULL,'<p>The mission of <strong>The Cupcake Factory</strong> is to create amazing cupcakes to suit every occasion.&nbsp;<strong>Weddings, Birthdays,</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Graduations,&nbsp;Corporate Events</strong> or just because you want a sweet treat,&nbsp;we are here for it! Every cupcake is tailor made for your special event. We are ready and available.&nbsp;So give us a try, you will not be disappointed.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 06:37:46','2026-04-01 22:36:14',NULL,NULL),(1760,'Do you offer custom cupcake designs?','do-you-offer-custom-cupcake-designs',NULL,'<p>Yes!&nbsp;<strong>The Cupcake Factory</strong>&nbsp;specializes in custom cupcakes designed to match your theme, colors, and special occasion. Whether it\'s elegant, fun, or unique, we can create cupcakes that fit your vision.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 06:39:08','2026-03-29 06:39:08',NULL,NULL),(1761,'What types of events do you bake for?','what-types-of-events-do-you-bake-for',NULL,'<p>We provide cupcakes for birthdays, weddings, baby showers, bridal showers, corporate events, anniversaries, holiday parties, and other special celebrations.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 06:40:34','2026-03-29 06:40:34',NULL,NULL),(1762,'How far in advance should I place an order?','how-far-in-advance-should-i-place-an-order',NULL,'<p>To ensure availability, we recommend placing your order&nbsp;<strong>at least several days in advance</strong>, especially for custom designs or large orders.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 06:41:20','2026-03-29 06:41:20',NULL,NULL),(1763,'Do you offer large or bulk cupcake orders?','do-you-offer-large-or-bulk-cupcake-orders',NULL,'<p>Yes.&nbsp;<strong>The Cupcake Factory</strong>&nbsp;can accommodate both small and large orders depending on availability. Bulk orders are perfect for events, parties, and corporate gatherings.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 06:59:14','2026-03-29 06:59:14',NULL,NULL),(1764,'Can I request specific colors or themes?','can-i-request-specific-colors-or-themes',NULL,'<p>Absolutely! We love bringing creative ideas to life. You can request specific colors, decorations, or themed designs to match your event.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 06:59:56','2026-03-29 06:59:56',NULL,NULL),(1765,'How do I place an order?','how-do-i-place-an-order-3',NULL,'<p>Simply contact&nbsp;<strong>Ronica J. Keith at The Cupcake Factory</strong>&nbsp;through the contact section of this vCard to discuss your order, theme, quantity, and event details.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 07:00:38','2026-03-29 07:00:38',NULL,NULL),(1766,'≡ƒºü The Science of a Perfect Cupcake','the-science-of-a-perfect-cupcake',NULL,'<p><em>By Ronica J. Keith ΓÇô Owner &amp; Baker, The Cupcake Factory</em></p><p>Cupcakes may look simple, but creating a truly exceptional cupcake is both an art and a science. A well-made cupcake should have three essential qualities:&nbsp;<strong>balance, texture, and flavor</strong>. Achieving that balance requires careful attention to ingredients, measurements, and baking technique.</p><h2>The Importance of Ingredient Quality</h2><p>One of the most overlooked aspects of baking is ingredient quality. Cupcakes depend heavily on the structure created by flour, the richness provided by butter, and the moisture supplied by liquids like milk or buttermilk.</p><p>High-quality ingredients produce noticeable differences in both flavor and texture. Real butter, fresh eggs, and proper vanilla extract contribute to a richer and more authentic taste. Even small changesΓÇösuch as the type of cocoa used or the freshness of baking powderΓÇöcan dramatically affect the final result.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Cupcake Factory</strong>, every batch begins with carefully selected ingredients to ensure consistent results.</p><h2>The Balance of Structure and Moisture</h2><p>Cupcakes rely on a delicate balance between structure and softness. Flour and eggs provide the structural framework, while fats and liquids create tenderness.</p><p>Too much flour can produce a dry, dense cupcake. Too much liquid can cause the cupcake to collapse during baking. Professional bakers pay close attention to the ratios between these ingredients to ensure the cupcake holds its shape while remaining light and moist.</p><p>Temperature control also plays a critical role. Ingredients such as butter and eggs perform best when they are at room temperature, allowing them to mix evenly and create a smoother batter.</p><h2>The Role of Proper Mixing</h2><p>Overmixing is one of the most common mistakes in baking. When batter is mixed too aggressively, gluten develops in the flour, creating a tougher texture.</p><p>The goal is to mix just enough to combine the ingredients while maintaining a tender crumb. Proper mixing allows the cupcake to rise evenly while preserving the softness that makes a cupcake enjoyable.</p><p>Professional bakers often use specific mixing techniquesΓÇösuch as creaming butter and sugar togetherΓÇöto introduce air into the batter. This air helps create the light texture that defines a well-made cupcake.</p><h2>Baking Temperature and Timing</h2><p>Oven temperature is another crucial factor. Cupcakes baked at the proper temperature rise evenly and form a delicate, slightly golden surface.</p><p>If the oven is too hot, the outside may cook before the inside is fully baked. If it is too cool, the cupcake may become dense or uneven. Precise timing ensures the cupcake is fully baked without losing moisture.</p><p>Experienced bakers learn to recognize subtle visual cues, such as the slight spring of the cupcake when touched, which indicates it is finished baking.</p><h2>The Final Touch: Frosting and Presentation</h2><p>While the cupcake itself is the foundation, frosting adds the final layer of flavor and visual appeal. The frosting should complement the cupcake rather than overpower it.</p><p>A good frosting enhances the cupcakeΓÇÖs flavor profile and provides the right level of sweetness without overwhelming the palate.</p><p>Presentation also matters. A beautifully decorated cupcake creates anticipation before the first bite and elevates the entire experience.</p><h2>Baking with Purpose</h2><p>At&nbsp;<strong>The Cupcake Factory</strong>, baking is about more than simply producing desserts. It is about combining craftsmanship, precision, and creativity to produce cupcakes that taste as good as they look.</p><p>Every cupcake represents a commitment to quality ingredients, careful technique, and a passion for the craft of baking.</p><p>When these elements come together, the result is not just a cupcakeΓÇöit is a memorable experience.</p>',NULL,'2026-03-29','1',6,1,210,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-29 08:18:54','2026-03-29 10:37:24',NULL,NULL),(1767,'Essence Interview','essence-interview',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,209,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31 22:17:58','2026-03-31 22:17:58',NULL,NULL),(1768,'Menu','5',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31','1',21,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-01 01:19:29','2026-04-01 01:31:42',NULL,NULL),(1769,'QR code','qr-code',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31','1',21,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-01 01:21:32','2026-04-01 01:28:56',NULL,NULL),(1770,'Menu Pagina 1/4','menu-pagina-14',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31','1',21,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-01 01:23:05','2026-04-01 01:29:08',NULL,NULL),(1771,'Menu Pagina 2/4','menu-pagina-24',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31','1',21,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-01 01:23:37','2026-04-01 01:30:19',NULL,NULL),(1772,'Menu Pagina 3/4','menu-pagina-34',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31','1',21,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-01 01:25:35','2026-04-01 01:29:20',NULL,NULL),(1773,'Menu pagina 4/4','menu-pagina-44',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-03-31','1',21,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-01 01:26:18','2026-04-01 01:29:34',NULL,NULL),(1774,'Why Ecuadorian Cuisine Is One of South AmericaΓÇÖs Hidden Culinary Gems','why-ecuadorian-cuisine-is-one-of-south-americas-hidden-culinary-gems',NULL,'<p>When people think of Latin American food, they often immediately think of Mexican or Brazilian cuisine. But those who truly explore South America quickly discover something special ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>Ecuadorian food is one of the regionΓÇÖs best-kept culinary secrets.</strong></p><p>Ecuador may be a small country, but its cuisine is incredibly diverse. ThatΓÇÖs because Ecuador has&nbsp;<strong>four unique geographic regions</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö the coast, the Andes mountains, the Amazon rainforest, and the Gal├ípagos Islands. Each region brings its own ingredients, cooking styles, and traditions to the table.</p><p>The result is a cuisine filled with&nbsp;<strong>rich flavors, fresh ingredients, and comforting dishes that have been passed down for generations.</strong></p><p>One of the things that makes Ecuadorian food so special is its&nbsp;<strong>balance of simplicity and bold flavor</strong>. Many traditional dishes are built around staple ingredients like rice, beans, plantains, seafood, fresh vegetables, and perfectly seasoned meats. When prepared properly, these ingredients create meals that are both hearty and satisfying.</p><p>Seafood also plays a major role in Ecuadorian cooking, especially along the coastal regions. Dishes made with shrimp, fish, and other fresh seafood are often seasoned with citrus, herbs, and spices that highlight the natural flavors of the ingredients.</p><p>Another favorite is&nbsp;<strong>chaulaf├ín</strong>, EcuadorΓÇÖs famous fried rice dish that blends shrimp, chicken, pork, vegetables, and savory seasonings into a flavorful meal inspired by Chinese-Ecuadorian culinary influences. ItΓÇÖs one of the most popular dishes in Ecuador and loved by people around the world.</p><p>But Ecuadorian food is about more than just flavor ΓÇö&nbsp;<strong>itΓÇÖs about family, culture, and tradition.</strong>&nbsp;Many recipes have been passed down from grandparents to parents and then to the next generation, keeping the heart of Ecuadorian culture alive through food.</p><p>Restaurants like&nbsp;<strong>Sabor Ecuatoriano</strong>&nbsp;help bring these traditions to life here in Connecticut by offering authentic dishes prepared with care and passion. For many customers, itΓÇÖs a taste of home. For others, itΓÇÖs an opportunity to discover something new and delicious.</p><p>If youΓÇÖve never tried Ecuadorian food before, youΓÇÖre in for a treat. And if you already know it well, you understand why so many people say the same thing after their first bite:</p><p><strong>Once you try Ecuadorian cuisine, youΓÇÖll keep coming back for more.</strong>&nbsp;≡ƒì╜∩╕Å≡ƒç¬≡ƒç¿</p>',NULL,'2026-04-01','1',6,1,205,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-01 01:49:13','2026-04-01 01:49:13',NULL,NULL),(1775,'Who is Gigi?','who-is-gigi',NULL,'<p><strong>Fun-loving single Mom writer at heart and coffee-fueled plant lover who leads with faith and purpose. I find joy in hiking camping and meaningful connections and I\'m passionate about uplifting others building community, and bringing positive energy into everything I do.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-02 21:03:56','2026-04-03 01:17:39',NULL,NULL),(1776,'Cert 1','cert-11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 00:52:05','2026-04-03 00:52:05',NULL,NULL),(1777,'Cert 2','cert-8',NULL,'<p>cert22</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 00:56:07','2026-04-03 00:56:07',NULL,NULL),(1778,'Cert 3','cert-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 00:57:14','2026-04-03 00:57:14',NULL,NULL),(1779,'Cert 4','cert-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 00:57:44','2026-04-03 00:57:44',NULL,NULL),(1780,'What is LegalShield?','what-is-legalshield',NULL,'<p>LegalShield is a subscription service that provides access to legal advice and services from provider law firms for personal or business legal issues.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 01:59:34','2026-04-03 01:59:34',NULL,NULL),(1781,'What types of legal issues can be covered?','what-types-of-legal-issues-can-be-covered',NULL,'<p>Common issues include contract review, family matters, traffic tickets, real estate questions, and consumer disputes depending on plan coverage.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:00:14','2026-04-03 02:00:14',NULL,NULL),(1782,'What is IDShield?','what-is-idshield',NULL,'<p>IDShield is an identity theft protection service that monitors personal information and helps restore your identity if fraud occurs.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:00:59','2026-04-03 02:00:59',NULL,NULL),(1783,'How does identity monitoring work?','how-does-identity-monitoring-work',NULL,'<p>IDShield can monitor credit activity, financial accounts, and personal information for suspicious activity and send alerts if risks are detected.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:01:38','2026-04-03 02:01:38',NULL,NULL),(1784,'Who should consider LegalShield?','who-should-consider-legalshield',NULL,'<p>Individuals, families, and small business owners who want affordable access to legal help and identity protection.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:02:15','2026-04-03 02:02:15',NULL,NULL),(1785,'How do I get started?','how-do-i-get-started-4',NULL,'<p>You can connect with Gigi or enroll directly through her LegalShield link.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:02:58','2026-04-03 02:02:58',NULL,NULL),(1786,'Why Legal Protection Is Becoming More Important','why-legal-protection-is-becoming-more-important',NULL,'<p>Most people never plan on needing a lawyer.</p><p>But life happens.</p><p>Contracts, disputes, identity theft, consumer issues, and business challenges can appear when you least expect them. Traditional legal services often cost hundreds of dollars per hour, which causes many people to delay getting the help they need.</p><p>LegalShield was created to change that by offering access to legal advice and services through a monthly membership instead of hourly billing.&nbsp;</p><p>When combined with identity monitoring services like IDShield, individuals and families can also take steps to protect themselves from identity theft and fraudΓÇöissues that affect millions of people every year.&nbsp;</p><p>Being proactive about legal and identity protection isnΓÇÖt just smart.</p><p><strong>ItΓÇÖs peace of mind.</strong></p>',NULL,'2026-04-02','1',6,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:04:15','2026-04-03 02:04:15',NULL,NULL),(1787,'Connecticut at Your Service','connecticut-at-your-service',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:10:05','2026-04-03 02:10:05',NULL,NULL),(1788,'My Mission','my-mission-12',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to empower individuals, families, and business owners with access to affordable legal protection and identity theft protection so they can move forward in life prepared, protected, and confident.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 02:23:11','2026-04-03 02:23:11',NULL,NULL),(1789,'La Hora Escolar','la-hora-escolar',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 14:29:46','2026-04-03 14:29:46',NULL,NULL),(1790,'Joy For Midlife Woman','joy-for-midlife-woman',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 14:51:23','2026-04-03 14:51:23',NULL,NULL),(1796,'CT Business Networking Association','ct-business-networking-association',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-03 15:10:25','2026-04-03 15:10:25',NULL,NULL),(1797,'cert2','cert4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-04 10:52:07','2026-04-04 10:52:07',NULL,NULL),(1798,'Click to Enroll','click-to-enroll',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-04 11:00:50','2026-04-04 11:00:50',NULL,NULL),(1799,'Click to Schedule a Meeting','click-to-schedule-