 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You can follow Yanira on Instagram at @yany_24.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,212,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-06 21:51:41','2026-04-06 21:51:41',NULL,NULL),(1806,'Is this only about beauty products?','is-this-only-about-beauty-products',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. YaniraΓÇÖs public brand also includes motivation, empowerment, and self-love, not just products.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,212,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-06 21:52:22','2026-04-06 21:52:22',NULL,NULL),(1807,'Why Beauty Is More Than Makeup','why-beauty-is-more-than-makeup',NULL,'<p>Beauty is not just about how you look. It is also about how you feel. For me, beauty connects with confidence, self-love, and the way we care for ourselves every day. That is why I love sharing products, encouragement, and motivation that help women feel more empowered in their own skin. Through Farmasi, I enjoy introducing people to products they can truly use and love while also creating a space that celebrates confidence and personal growth. Whether you are looking for skincare, beauty favorites, or simply a little inspiration, my goal is to help you discover something that makes you feel your best. This matches how Yanira publicly presents her brand through beauty, motivation, and self-love content.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,212,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-06 21:54:33','2026-04-06 21:54:33',NULL,NULL),(1808,'Click For an Amazing Opportunity','click-for-an-amazing-opportunity',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,212,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-06 23:01:05','2026-04-06 23:01:05',NULL,NULL),(1809,'Rango and The Grinch Song','rango-and-the-grinch-song',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-07 00:54:32','2026-04-07 00:54:32',NULL,NULL),(1810,'My Mission','my-mission-13',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help people feel confident, empowered, and beautiful by connecting them with high-quality Farmasi products that support everyday beauty and self-care. I believe beauty is not just about appearance ΓÇö itΓÇÖs about confidence, self-love, and feeling your best in your own skin. Through personalized guidance, honest recommendations, and genuine connection, I strive to create a positive experience for every customer while building a supportive community centered around beauty, motivation, and personal growth.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,212,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-07 01:03:22','2026-04-07 01:03:22',NULL,NULL),(1811,'Check Out Our Wonderful Products','check-out-our-wonderful-products',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',34,1,212,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-07 01:09:45','2026-04-07 01:09:45',NULL,NULL),(1813,'My Mission','my-mission-14',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">At Clear Victory Home Improvement, our mission is simple: do the job right the first time. We provide high-quality home improvement services backed by integrity, reliability, and workmanship that homeowners can depend on.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:17:54','2026-04-10 12:17:54',NULL,NULL),(1814,'Do you offer free estimates?','do-you-offer-free-estimates-5',NULL,'<p>Yes. Clear Victory Home Improvement provides&nbsp;<strong>free estimates</strong>&nbsp;so homeowners can understand the scope and cost of their project before work begins.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:19:33','2026-04-10 12:19:33',NULL,NULL),(1815,'What areas do you service?','what-areas-do-you-service-3',NULL,'<p>We proudly serve&nbsp;<strong>Fairfield County, Connecticut and surrounding communities</strong>, providing reliable home improvement services for residential properties.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:20:22','2026-04-10 12:20:22',NULL,NULL),(1816,'What types of projects do you handle?','what-types-of-projects-do-you-handle',NULL,'<p>We handle a wide range of home improvement services including&nbsp;<strong>interior and exterior painting, remodeling, basement finishing, roofing, siding, power washing, and general handyman repairs.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:21:09','2026-04-10 12:21:09',NULL,NULL),(1817,'Are you licensed and insured?','are-you-licensed-and-insured-4',NULL,'<p>Yes. Clear Victory Home Improvement operates professionally and maintains proper insurance to protect both our clients and our work.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:22:11','2026-04-10 12:22:11',NULL,NULL),(1818,'How long will my project take?','how-long-will-my-project-take',NULL,'<p>Project timelines depend on the&nbsp;<strong>size and complexity of the job</strong>, but we always communicate clearly and work efficiently to complete projects as quickly as possible while maintaining high quality.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:22:55','2026-04-10 12:22:55',NULL,NULL),(1819,'How do I get started?','how-do-i-get-started-5',NULL,'<p>Simply&nbsp;<strong>call, text, or request an estimate</strong>&nbsp;through this page and weΓÇÖll schedule a time to discuss your project and provide a quote.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:23:40','2026-04-10 12:23:40',NULL,NULL),(1820,'How Professional Home Improvements Increase the Value of Your Home','how-professional-home-improvements-increase-the-value-of-your-home',NULL,'<p>For many homeowners, their house is the largest investment they will ever make. Keeping it in great condition not only improves daily living but also protects and increases the value of the property over time. At&nbsp;<strong>Clear Victory Home Improvement</strong>, we help homeowners throughout Fairfield County transform and maintain their homes with professional craftsmanship and dependable service.</p><h2>First Impressions Matter</h2><p>The exterior of your home is the first thing people notice. Fresh exterior paint, clean siding, and well-maintained surfaces can dramatically improve curb appeal. Services like&nbsp;<strong>power washing and exterior painting</strong>&nbsp;remove years of dirt and wear, giving your home a fresh, updated appearance.</p><h2>Modern Kitchens and Bathrooms Add Value</h2><p>Two of the most valuable improvements you can make are&nbsp;<strong>kitchen and bathroom renovations</strong>. These spaces are used every day and are often the deciding factor for buyers if you ever decide to sell your home. Updated cabinets, new tile work, modern fixtures, and improved layouts can completely transform these spaces.</p><h2>Unlock the Potential of Your Basement</h2><p>Many homes have basements that go unused. Finishing your basement can turn that extra space into a&nbsp;<strong>home office, entertainment room, gym, or additional living area</strong>. This not only improves functionality but also increases the usable square footage of your home.</p><h2>Protecting Your HomeΓÇÖs Structure</h2><p>Roofing, siding, and structural repairs are essential to protecting your property from weather and long-term damage. Addressing these issues early can prevent costly problems later and help maintain your home\'s value.</p><h2>The Importance of Skilled Craftsmanship</h2><p>Home improvement projects require experience, attention to detail, and the right tools. Working with a trusted contractor ensures that the job is done properly and safely. At Clear Victory Home Improvement, we take pride in delivering quality workmanship and dependable results on every project.</p><h2>Investing in Your Home</h2><p>Whether itΓÇÖs a simple paint refresh or a full remodeling project, investing in your home improves both comfort and long-term value. Our goal is to help homeowners create spaces they love while ensuring the work stands the test of time.</p><p>If you\'re considering a home improvement project,&nbsp;<strong>Clear Victory Home Improvement is here to help bring your vision to life.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-10 12:35:35','2026-04-10 12:35:35',NULL,NULL),(1821,'Who is Cesar','who-is-cesar',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Cesar Vertiz, owner of Clear Victory Home Improvement. I came to the United States from Peru in 1994 chasing the American Dream, and IΓÇÖve been building it ever since through hard work, dedication, and a commitment to doing things the right way.</p><p>IΓÇÖm a proud father of two daughters, and my home is always full of life with a parakeet and two guinea pigs. When IΓÇÖm not working, I enjoy swimming and bakingΓÇötwo things that keep me balanced and remind me to enjoy the process just as much as the results.</p><p>In my business, I treat every project like itΓÇÖs my own home. I believe in honest work, clear communication, and delivering results that my clients can truly feel proud of.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 14:31:26','2026-04-14 14:31:26',NULL,NULL),(1822,'Home Improvement Contractors License','home-improvement-contractors-license-3',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 14:56:43','2026-04-14 14:56:43',NULL,NULL),(1823,'Insurance','insurance-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 14:57:32','2026-04-14 14:57:32',NULL,NULL),(1824,'Painting Exterior','painting-exterior',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 15:15:03','2026-04-14 15:15:03',NULL,NULL),(1825,'Interior Painting','interior-painting',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 15:16:43','2026-04-14 15:16:43',NULL,NULL),(1826,'What is CBNA?','what-is-cbna',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CBNA is a private networking community for entrepreneurs and business professionals focused on referrals, relationships, and ROI.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 21:27:00','2026-04-14 21:27:00',NULL,NULL),(1827,'Is CBNA only for Connecticut businesses?','is-cbna-only-for-connecticut-businesses',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. While CBNA is rooted in Connecticut, the Skool page says members can network locally or nationally.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 21:27:46','2026-04-14 21:27:46',NULL,NULL),(1828,'What do members get?','what-do-members-get',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Members get access to the online community, app access, free events, referral groups, workshops, directory listings, contact info, and more.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 21:29:04','2026-04-14 21:29:04',NULL,NULL),(1829,'Is there a long-term commitment?','is-there-a-long-term-commitment',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The page says members can cancel anytime, with no additional fees or time constraints.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 21:30:11','2026-04-14 21:30:11',NULL,NULL),(1830,'What makes CBNA different?','what-makes-cbna-different',NULL,'<p>CBNA positions itself as simple, fun, and focused on real ROI, not empty networking theater. In plain English: less fluff, more actual business.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 21:31:03','2026-04-14 21:31:03',NULL,NULL),(1831,'What kind of results can I expect?','what-kind-of-results-can-i-expect',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Strong relationships, consistent referrals, and real business growth.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 21:41:00','2026-04-14 21:41:00',NULL,NULL),(1832,'My Mission','my-mission-15',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To empower Connecticut businesses by fostering meaningful connections, creating opportunities for collaboration, and building a community where success is shared.</span></p>',NULL,'2026-03-11','1',19,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 21:43:27','2026-04-15 00:56:08',NULL,NULL),(1833,'Why Most Networking Fails (And How to Fix It)','why-most-networking-fails-and-how-to-fix-it',NULL,'<h4>LetΓÇÖs be honestΓÇömost networking events are a waste of time.</h4><h4>You walk into a room, shake a few hands, exchange business cards, have the same surface-level conversations, and leave thinking,&nbsp;<em>ΓÇ£What did I actually gain from that?ΓÇ¥</em></h4><h4>If that sounds familiar, youΓÇÖre not the problem. The system is.</h4><h3>Γ¥î<strong> The Real Reason Networking Fails</strong></h3><p>Most people approach networking with the wrong mindset.</p><p>TheyΓÇÖre trying to:</p><ul><li>Pitch too fast</li><li>Sell too soon</li><li>Collect contacts instead of building relationships</li></ul><p>It becomes transactional. And people can feel that instantly.</p><p>HereΓÇÖs the truth:</p><p><strong>Nobody wants to be sold the moment they meet you.</strong></p><p>People do business with those they:</p><ul><li>Trust</li><li>Like</li><li>Remember</li></ul><p>And none of that happens in a 30-second elevator pitch.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒöæ The Shift That Changes Everything</strong></h3><p>The most successful networkers donΓÇÖt focus on selling.</p><p>They focus on:</p><ul><li>Listening</li><li>Understanding</li><li>Building genuine relationships</li></ul><p>Instead of asking,&nbsp;<em>ΓÇ£What can I get?ΓÇ¥</em></p><p>They ask,&nbsp;<em>ΓÇ£How can I help?ΓÇ¥</em></p><p>ThatΓÇÖs where everything changes.</p><p>Because when you consistently show up with value, people naturally:</p><ul><li>Refer you</li><li>Recommend you</li><li>Want to work with you</li></ul><h3><strong>≡ƒñ¥ What Real Networking Looks Like</strong></h3><p>Real networking is:</p><ul><li>Following up after the event</li><li>Supporting other membersΓÇÖ businesses</li><li>Showing up consistently</li><li>Being someone people trust</li></ul><p>ItΓÇÖs not about how many people you meet.</p><p>ItΓÇÖs about how many people remember youΓÇöand why.</p><h3>≡ƒÜÇ <strong>The CBNA Difference</strong></h3><p>This is exactly why CBNA exists.</p><p>We donΓÇÖt believe in:</p><ul><li>Forced referrals</li><li>Awkward pitches</li><li>Surface-level connections</li></ul><p>We believe in:</p><ul><li>Real relationships</li><li>Consistent visibility</li><li>Organic referrals</li><li>A community that actually supports each other</li></ul><p>Because when the relationship is real, the business follows naturally.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒÆí Final Thought</strong></h3><p>If networking hasnΓÇÖt worked for you in the past, donΓÇÖt write it off.</p><p>Just change the approach.</p><p>Stop chasing transactions.</p><p>Start building relationships.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs where the real opportunities are.</p>',NULL,'2026-04-14','1',6,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 23:03:58','2026-04-15 00:55:53',NULL,NULL),(1834,'The Power of Consistent Visibility','the-power-of-consistent-visibility',NULL,'<p><strong>Out of sight = out of business.</strong></p><p>ItΓÇÖs that simple.</p><p>You might be great at what you do.</p><p>You might offer incredible value.</p><p>You might even be better than your competition.</p><p>But if people donΓÇÖt see you consistentlyΓÇª</p><p><strong>they forget about you.</strong></p><h3><strong>≡ƒºá How People Actually Buy</strong></h3><p>HereΓÇÖs something most people donΓÇÖt realize:</p><p>People rarely buy the first time they meet you.</p><p>They buy when:</p><ul><li>They recognize you</li><li>They feel familiar with you</li><li>They trust you</li></ul><p>And that only comes from&nbsp;<strong>consistent exposure</strong>.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒöü Why One Event IsnΓÇÖt Enough</strong></h3><p>A lot of people go to one networking event and expect results.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs like going to the gym once and expecting a six-pack.</p><p>It doesnΓÇÖt work like that.</p><p>Real results come from:</p><ul><li>Showing up again and again</li><li>Being seen regularly</li><li>Staying top of mind</li></ul><p>Because when someone needs your service, they donΓÇÖt search for the bestΓÇª</p><p>They remember the most&nbsp;<strong>visible</strong>.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒÄ» The Top-of-Mind Advantage</strong></h3><p>LetΓÇÖs say someone in your network needs:</p><ul><li>A contractor</li><li>A realtor</li><li>A financial advisor</li><li>A marketer</li></ul><p>Who do they refer?</p><p>Not the person they met once six months ago.</p><p>They refer the person they:</p><ul><li>See consistently</li><li>Interact with regularly</li><li>Feel connected to</li></ul><p>ThatΓÇÖs the&nbsp;<strong>top-of-mind advantage</strong>ΓÇöand itΓÇÖs powerful.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒôú Visibility Builds Trust</strong></h3><p>The more people see you:</p><ul><li>The more credible you become</li><li>The more familiar you feel</li><li>The more they trust you</li></ul><p>Even if you havenΓÇÖt had a direct conversation yet.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs why consistency beats talent in networking.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒöÑ <strong>How CBNA Helps You Stay Visible</strong></h3><p>CBNA is designed around one thing:</p><p><strong>Keeping you visible.</strong></p><p>Through:</p><ul><li>Weekly and monthly events</li><li>Online community interaction</li><li>Member directory exposure</li><li>Ongoing conversations and engagement</li></ul><p>YouΓÇÖre not just showing up onceΓÇöyouΓÇÖre staying present.</p><p>And thatΓÇÖs where the real business comes from.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒÆí Final Thought</strong></h3><p>You donΓÇÖt need to be everywhere.</p><p>You just need to be&nbsp;<strong>seen consistently in the right places.</strong></p><p>Because when the opportunity shows upΓÇª</p><p>The person who gets the call is the one people remember.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-12','1',6,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 23:05:51','2026-04-15 00:56:50',NULL,NULL),(1835,'Farmasi NY Trip','farmasi-ny-trip',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,212,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-14 23:14:16','2026-04-14 23:14:16',NULL,NULL),(1836,'Who is Cesar?','who-is-cesar',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Cesar Barros, founder of the Connecticut Business Networking Association (CBNA).</p><p>I built CBNA with one goal in mindΓÇöto create a space where business owners, entrepreneurs, and professionals can connect, collaborate, and grow through real relationshipsΓÇönot just handshakes and business cards.</p><p>I believe that strong networks create strong businesses. Through CBNA, IΓÇÖve helped bring together driven individuals who are serious about supporting one another, sharing opportunities, and building lasting success.</p><p>If youΓÇÖre looking to surround yourself with people who are about growth, accountability, and real resultsΓÇöyouΓÇÖre in the right place.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 00:54:15','2026-04-15 00:54:15',NULL,NULL),(1837,'My Mission','my-mission-16',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To empower Connecticut businesses by fostering meaningful connections, creating opportunities for collaboration, and building a community where success is shared.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 00:54:56','2026-04-15 00:54:56',NULL,NULL),(1838,'Who is Vanessa','who-is-vanessa',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Vanessa, the owner of VanjerrickoΓÇÖs Cleaning ServicesΓÇöand I donΓÇÖt do anything halfway.</p><p>I love life, I love good food, and IΓÇÖll take a plane ticket anywhere if it means a new experience. But at the core of everything I do is family, laughter, and the people I surround myself with. ThatΓÇÖs what keeps me groundedΓÇöand thatΓÇÖs exactly how I run my business.</p><p>My team isnΓÇÖt just a crewΓÇª itΓÇÖs a unit. We work hard, we laugh, and we take pride in every job we touch. When we show up, weΓÇÖre bringing energy, attention to detail, and a standard that most people donΓÇÖt even come close to.</p><p>I believe in doing things the right way, not the easy way.</p><p>And when it comes to your space? WeΓÇÖre not leaving until itΓÇÖs right.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,215,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 20:23:31','2026-04-15 20:23:31',NULL,NULL),(1839,'≡ƒº╝ Why Professional Cleaning IsnΓÇÖt a LuxuryΓÇöItΓÇÖs a Smart Investment','why-professional-cleaning-isnt-a-luxury-its-a-smart-investment',NULL,'<p>When most people think about professional cleaning services, they often see it as an extra expenseΓÇösomething nice to have, but not necessary. The truth is, professional cleaning isnΓÇÖt a luxuryΓÇª itΓÇÖs one of the smartest investments you can make for your home or business.</p><p>At VanjerrickoΓÇÖs Cleaning Services LLC, weΓÇÖve seen firsthand how a properly cleaned space can completely transform not just the environmentΓÇöbut the way people feel, work, and even make decisions.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÅá&nbsp;<strong>First Impressions Matter More Than You Think</strong></h3><p>Whether itΓÇÖs a home, office, or commercial space, the first impression is everything.</p><p>A spotless environment instantly creates:</p><ul><li>Trust</li><li>Comfort</li><li>Professionalism</li></ul><p>For homeowners, it sets the tone for guests and potential buyers.</p><p>For businesses, it can mean the difference between gaining or losing a customer.</p><p>People may not always notice when something is cleanΓÇöbut they&nbsp;<em>always</em>&nbsp;notice when itΓÇÖs not.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÅù∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Post-Construction Cleaning: The Real Final Step</strong></h3><p>A construction project isnΓÇÖt truly complete when the last nail is hammeredΓÇöitΓÇÖs complete when the space is clean, safe, and ready to be used.</p><p>Dust, debris, and residue donΓÇÖt just look badΓÇöthey can:</p><ul><li>Affect air quality</li><li>Damage surfaces</li><li>Delay openings or move-ins</li></ul><p>Professional post-construction cleaning ensures your project is presented at its absolute bestΓÇöbecause the final reveal should be impressive, not messy.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÅó&nbsp;<strong>A Clean Business Is a Profitable Business</strong></h3><p>Cleanliness directly impacts productivity and reputation.</p><p>Employees perform better in clean environments.</p><p>Customers feel more comfortable doing business in clean spaces.</p><p>And letΓÇÖs be honestΓÇöno one wants to walk into a business that looks neglected.</p><p>Consistent, professional cleaning shows that you care about your space, your team, and your customers.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒº╜&nbsp;<strong>ItΓÇÖs Not Just CleaningΓÇöItΓÇÖs Attention to Detail</strong></h3><p>ThereΓÇÖs a big difference between surface cleaning and professional cleaning.</p><p>At VanjerrickoΓÇÖs Cleaning Services, we focus on:</p><ul><li>High-touch areas most people overlook</li><li>Deep cleaning that goes beyond whatΓÇÖs visible</li><li>Consistency that keeps spaces looking their best every time</li></ul><p>Because real cleaning isnΓÇÖt about making things look good for a momentΓÇöitΓÇÖs about maintaining a standard.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÆí&nbsp;<strong>Save Time, Reduce Stress, Get Better Results</strong></h3><p>Your time is valuable.</p><p>Instead of spending hours trying to clean on your own, you can:</p><ul><li>Focus on your business</li><li>Spend time with family</li><li>Handle what actually matters</li></ul><p>We handle the cleaning so you donΓÇÖt have to.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒöÑ&nbsp;<strong>The Bottom Line</strong></h3><p>Professional cleaning isnΓÇÖt an expenseΓÇöitΓÇÖs an upgrade.</p><p>It improves how your space looks, how it feels, and how others perceive it. Whether itΓÇÖs your home, your business, or a construction project, investing in professional cleaning pays off in more ways than one.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒô₧&nbsp;<strong>Ready for a Spotless Space?</strong></h2><p>Let VanjerrickoΓÇÖs Cleaning Services LLC take care of it.</p><p>≡ƒæë Book your cleaning today and experience the difference a truly clean space makes.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-04-15','1',6,1,215,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 20:24:44','2026-04-15 23:38:55',NULL,NULL),(1840,'About Me','about-me-10',NULL,'<p>My name is Elizabeth Dom├¡nguez, and I am a dedicated Early Childhood Educator with a passion for nurturing young minds. I specialize in supporting children through their developmental stages by focusing on their sensory, emotional, social, and cultural growth.</p><p>I believe every child is unique and deserves a safe, loving environment where they can explore, learn, and grow with confidence. Through patience, creativity, and guidance, I strive to create meaningful experiences that help children build strong foundations for their future.</p><p>At Pedacito de Cielo, my goal is to partner with families to provide care, support, and education that truly makes a difference in each childΓÇÖs life.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,203,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 20:48:02','2026-04-15 23:29:14',NULL,NULL),(1841,'My Mission','my-mission-17',NULL,'<p>At Pedacito de Cielo, our mission is to provide a nurturing and inclusive environment where children are supported in their sensory, emotional, social, and cultural development. We aim to build strong foundations that empower children to grow with confidence, curiosity, and compassion.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,203,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 21:14:22','2026-04-15 21:14:22',NULL,NULL),(1842,'What makes your program unique?','what-makes-your-program-unique',NULL,'<p>A holistic approach focusing on emotional, sensory, social, and cultural development.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,203,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 21:25:23','2026-04-15 21:25:23',NULL,NULL),(1843,'Is your environment structured or flexible?','is-your-environment-structured-or-flexible',NULL,'<p>A balance of structured learning and guided exploration.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,203,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 21:28:01','2026-04-15 21:28:01',NULL,NULL),(1844,'What does a typical day look like for a child in your program?','what-does-a-typical-day-look-like-for-a-child-in-your-program',NULL,'<p> Each day includes a mix of structured activities, sensory play, learning time, social interaction, and restΓÇöcreating a balanced and engaging experience.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,203,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 22:04:23','2026-04-15 22:04:23',NULL,NULL),(1845,'How do you communicate with parents?','how-do-you-communicate-with-parents',NULL,'<p> I maintain open and consistent communication through updates, conversations, and feedback to ensure we work together for each childΓÇÖs growth.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,203,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-15 22:06:17','2026-04-15 22:06:17',NULL,NULL),(1846,'How do you support emotional development?','how-do-you-support-emotional-development',NULL,'<p> I help chi