lp you move forward in a vehicle you feel good about.</p><p>At DriveX Auto, itΓÇÖs not just about selling cars. ItΓÇÖs about helping people drive away with confidence.</p>',NULL,'2026-04-19','1',6,1,218,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-19 09:10:00','2026-04-19 09:32:46',NULL,NULL),(1889,'Pre Approval','pre-approval',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,218,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-19 09:24:50','2026-04-19 09:24:50',NULL,NULL),(1890,'Locate Your Car','locate-your-car',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,218,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-19 09:32:25','2026-04-19 09:32:25',NULL,NULL),(1891,'Cars Underneath $10,000','cars-underneath-10000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,218,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-19 09:37:14','2026-07-18 22:27:08',NULL,NULL),(1892,'Cars Over $20,000','cars-over-20000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,218,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-19 09:39:04','2026-04-19 09:39:04',NULL,NULL),(1893,'If You Need Electrical Work ΓÇö Call Me','if-you-need-electrical-work-call-me',NULL,'<p>LetΓÇÖs not overcomplicate thisΓÇöif you need electrical work done right, call me.</p><p>IΓÇÖm Chago Vargas, owner of Making Power Moves Electrical, and I take pride in doing things the right way the first time. No shortcuts, no guessing, and no leaving you wondering whatΓÇÖs going on. When I show up, youΓÇÖre getting efficient, responsive service backed by real experience and a commitment to safety.</p><p>Whether itΓÇÖs your home or your business, electrical work isnΓÇÖt something you want to gamble with. I handle everything from full electrical installations and new construction projects to panel upgrades, service upgrades, and EV charger installations. If your system is outdated, IΓÇÖll modernize it so it can handle todayΓÇÖs demandsΓÇösafely and reliably.</p><p>Got an issue out of nowhere? ThatΓÇÖs why we offer 24/7 emergency services. Electrical problems donΓÇÖt wait for a convenient time, and neither do we. When you call, you get a fast response and a solution that actually fixes the problemΓÇönot a temporary patch.</p><p>I also provide detailed safety inspections to make sure everything is up to code and running the way it should. For businesses, I help improve efficiency, reduce energy costs, and build systems that grow with youΓÇönot hold you back.</p><p>What separates us? Simple:</p><p>We show up on time.</p><p>We communicate clearly.</p><p>We do clean, professional work.</p><p>And we stand by it.</p><p>At the end of the day, you want someone you can trustΓÇösomeone who respects your time, your property, and your investment. ThatΓÇÖs exactly what we bring to every job.</p><p>So if you need electrical workΓÇöbig or smallΓÇödonΓÇÖt stress it.</p><p>Call me. LetΓÇÖs make the power move. ΓÜí</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,68,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-21 23:44:18','2026-04-21 23:44:18',NULL,NULL),(1894,'Moving and Junk Removal','moving-and-junk-removal',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,96,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 18:58:10','2026-04-22 18:58:10',NULL,NULL),(1895,'Late Night Moving','late-night-moving',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,96,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 18:59:17','2026-04-22 18:59:17',NULL,NULL),(1896,'Mission Statement','mission-statement-2',NULL,'<p>At <strong>AVENTZ Co</strong>., our mission is to create intentional, elegant, and beautifully executed events that reflect the story, vision, and values of each client. Through inspired design, strategic planning, and thoughtful coordination, we bring weddings and events to life with purpose, precision, and heart</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 20:42:24','2026-04-22 20:42:24',NULL,NULL),(1897,'What types of events does AVENTZ Co. plan?','what-types-of-events-does-aventz-co-plan',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">AVENTZ Co. plans weddings, social affairs, retreats, intimate gatherings, brand activations, and other personalized events.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 21:51:46','2026-04-22 21:51:46',NULL,NULL),(1898,'Where does AVENTZ Co. provide services?','where-does-aventz-co-provide-services',NULL,'<p>The company is based in Central Connecticut and serves clients throughout Connecticut, New York, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, and Vermont.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 21:52:31','2026-04-22 21:52:53',NULL,NULL),(1899,'Does AVENTZ Co. offer virtual planning?','does-aventz-co-offer-virtual-planning',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. AVENTZ Co. can work with clients both in person and virtually.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 21:53:28','2026-04-22 21:53:28',NULL,NULL),(1900,'What makes AVENTZ Co. different?','what-makes-aventz-co-different',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">AVENTZ Co. combines inspired design, logistical expertise, thoughtful coordination, and a strong eye for detail to create events that feel seamless, intentional, and elegant.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 21:53:59','2026-04-22 21:53:59',NULL,NULL),(1901,'Does AVENTZ Co. help with vendor selection?','does-aventz-co-help-with-vendor-selection',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Abby helps source and secure vendors and carefully aligns clients with creative partners based on professionalism, shared values, and execution.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 21:54:33','2026-04-22 21:54:33',NULL,NULL),(1902,'Is AVENTZ Co. currently accepting bookings?','is-aventz-co-currently-accepting-bookings',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. The company is currently booking weddings and events for 2026 and 2027.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 21:55:15','2026-04-22 21:55:15',NULL,NULL),(1903,'Why Hiring an Event Planner IsnΓÇÖt a Luxury ΓÇö ItΓÇÖs a Strategy','why-hiring-an-event-planner-isnt-a-luxury-its-a-strategy',NULL,'<p>LetΓÇÖs clear something upΓÇöhiring an event planner isnΓÇÖt about ΓÇ£extra help.ΓÇ¥</p><p>ItΓÇÖs about execution, experience, and peace of mind.</p><p>When planning a wedding or event, most people focus on the visible elementsΓÇöflowers, d├⌐cor, venue, music. What they donΓÇÖt see is what actually makes the event successful: timing, coordination, vendor communication, and problem-solving in real time.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs where a professional planner changes everything.</p><p>At AVENTZ Co., we approach every event with intention. From the very first consultation, weΓÇÖre not just organizingΓÇöweΓÇÖre building a strategy. We help you make decisions faster, avoid costly mistakes, and ensure that every moving piece works together seamlessly.</p><p>Think about this:</p><p>ΓÇó WhoΓÇÖs managing the timeline when things run behind?</p><p>ΓÇó WhoΓÇÖs coordinating vendors while youΓÇÖre getting ready?</p><p>ΓÇó WhoΓÇÖs solving problems before you even know they exist?</p><p>Without a planner, that responsibility falls on youΓÇöor worse, your family.</p><p>With AVENTZ Co., you get more than support. You get a calm, experienced presence that ensures your event flows effortlessly from start to finish.</p><p>Because the truth isΓÇö</p><p>Anyone can plan an event.</p><p>But not everyone can execute it flawlessly.</p>',NULL,'2026-04-24','1',6,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 22:00:14','2026-04-24 17:10:18',NULL,NULL),(1904,'The Difference Between a ΓÇ£Nice EventΓÇ¥ and an Unforgettable Experience','the-difference-between-a-nice-event-and-an-unforgettable-experience',NULL,'<p>ThereΓÇÖs a difference between an event that looks goodΓÇª</p><p>and one that&nbsp;<em>feels unforgettable.</em></p><p>Most events check the boxesΓÇövenue, food, music, d├⌐cor.</p><p>But the ones people remember? Those are designed with intention.</p><p>At <strong>AVENTZ Co</strong>., we donΓÇÖt just plan eventsΓÇöwe design experiences.</p><p>Every detail matters. The way guests enter the space. The flow of the timeline. The transitions between moments. The energy in the room. These are the elements that create a lasting impression.</p><p>An unforgettable event tells a story.</p><p>It reflects who you are, what you value, and how you want people to feel. ItΓÇÖs not about doing moreΓÇöitΓÇÖs about doing the&nbsp;<em>right things</em>&nbsp;at the right time, in the right way.</p><p>ThatΓÇÖs where design and planning come together.</p><p>We guide our clients through every stepΓÇöhelping shape their vision, refine their ideas, and bring everything together with precision and creativity. The result isnΓÇÖt just a beautiful eventΓÇöitΓÇÖs one that feels effortless, meaningful, and uniquely theirs.</p><p>Because at the end of the day, people may forget what they sawΓÇª</p><p>but theyΓÇÖll always remember how it made them feel.</p>',NULL,'2026-03-10','1',6,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-22 22:01:56','2026-04-24 17:10:38',NULL,NULL),(1905,'Who is Abby','whi-is-abby',NULL,'<p>In Abby\'s personal life, she is a homebody who enjoys nights out once and while. She loves to learn about history and the architecture of buildings and homes. She does love interior design, and enjoys small chats with those older then her to listen to stories. Abby asks a lot of questions because everyday is a new day to learn something. In her personal life she enjoys book shops,</p><p><img src=\"//:0\" alt=\"page1image2021472\" height=\"1.000000\" width=\"112.000000\"></p><p>antiquing, going to new coffee shops, co-working with her other business owner friends, and traveling. She is an aunt and loves taking her niece out for ice cream! Abby is a quiet, old soul, who has grown up fast to navigate through life. She loves dogs, desserts, and travel. She enjoys watching baking and home improvement shows as well as Law and Order SVU and CSI NY. She listens to music, and can identify cars by their taillights. Her attention to detail flows throughout her life and career. And she never stops saying yes to new opportunities!</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 17:21:00','2026-04-24 17:28:55',NULL,NULL),(1906,'Click Here to Book Your Event','click-here-to-book-your-event',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 17:32:11','2026-04-24 17:32:11',NULL,NULL),(1907,'Click to See My A+ Rating','click-to-see-my-a-rating',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,213,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-24 18:41:11','2026-04-24 18:41:11',NULL,NULL),(1908,'Nadeem Karim','nadeem-karim',NULL,'<p>Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim Nadeem Karim </p>',NULL,'2026-04-25','1',36,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-25 17:33:20','2026-04-25 17:33:20',NULL,NULL),(1909,'Wedding Exp. At the Estate','wedding-exp-at-the-estate',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 17:58:45','2026-04-27 17:58:45',NULL,NULL),(1910,'Murder Mystery','murder-mystery',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 18:01:56','2026-04-27 18:01:56',NULL,NULL),(1911,'Tap Image to See Article','green-wedding-shoes-article',NULL,'<p>Click Image to See</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-02-19','1',18,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:12:52','2026-04-27 19:19:35',NULL,NULL),(1912,'Aventz Co. Awards','aventz-co-awards',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,220,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:14:31','2026-04-27 19:14:31',NULL,NULL),(1913,'My Mission','my-mission-19',NULL,'<p><strong>My mission is to guide restaurants, hospitality, and qualifying beauty businesses through the FICA Tips Tax Credit process with clarity and integrityΓÇöhelping them claim what theyΓÇÖre owed and build cleaner payroll and reporting systems going forward.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1914,'What is the FICA Tips Tax Credit?','what-is-the-fica-tips-tax-credit-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ItΓÇÖs an&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">income tax credit</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;that lets eligible employers recover the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">employer-paid FICA (Social Security + Medicare)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">employee-reported tips</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. The rate tied to that employer FICA portion is&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7.65%</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1915,'Who qualifies for the credit?','who-qualifies-for-the-credit-4',NULL,'<p>Businesses with&nbsp;<strong>W-2 employees</strong>&nbsp;in industries where tipping is customaryΓÇötraditionally&nbsp;<strong>food &amp; beverage / hospitality</strong>, and now (new)&nbsp;<strong>beauty &amp; personal care</strong>&nbsp;under the OBBB changes.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1916,'What changed for the Beauty & Personal Care industry?','what-changed-for-the-beauty-personal-care-industry-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Beauty &amp; personal care businesses became&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">new qualifying businesses after 12/31/24</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and the credit is&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">claimed with 2025 returns</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, due to the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2025 Budget Reconciliation Bill (OBBB)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;signed into law&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">July 4, 2025</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1917,'What beauty businesses are typically tipped and may qualify?','what-beauty-businesses-are-typically-tipped-and-may-qualify-4',NULL,'<p><strong>What beauty businesses are typically tipped and may qualify?</strong></p><p>Common examples include:</p><ul><li>Hair salons &amp; barbershops</li><li>Nail salons</li><li>Spas, wellness centers (facials, wraps, body treatments, etc.)</li><li>Esthetics &amp; skincare studios (waxing, lashes, brows, tanning)</li><li>Makeup artists</li><li>Fitness services (trainers / group instructors)&nbsp;<em>(where tipping is standard in that setting)</em></li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1918,'WhatΓÇÖs the minimum wage threshold for the credit calculation?','whats-the-minimum-wage-threshold-for-the-credit-calculation-4',NULL,'<p>For eligibility and credit math, the ΓÇ£minimum wage basisΓÇ¥ differs by industry:</p><ul><li><strong>Restaurant/hospitality:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>$5.15</strong>&nbsp;(for this creditΓÇÖs calculation rules)</li><li><strong>Beauty/personal care:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>$7.25</strong>&nbsp;(for this creditΓÇÖs calculation rules)</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1919,'Is this a refund of payroll taxes?','is-this-a-refund-of-payroll-taxes-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. The FICA Tip Credit&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">does not refund payroll taxes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;you already paid. It offsets&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">income tax owed</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;by the business (C-Corp) or flows through to owners (S-Corp/Partnership). Refund outcomes depend on your tax liability and credit utilization rules.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1920,'How far back can we recover missed credits?','how-far-back-can-we-recover-missed-credits-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Often the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">current year plus up to the last three years</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(depending on filing timing and amendment rules). After enough time passes, that year is goneΓÇöno rewinds.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1921,'How Your Credit Gets Paid (And When Fees Are Charged)','how-your-credit-gets-paid-and-when-fees-are-charged-4',NULL,'<h3><strong>Full Refund</strong></h3><ul><li>You receive a full cash refund</li><li>No fee due at filing</li><li>Fee can be deducted after IRS processes refund (or optional advance)</li></ul><h3><strong> Partial Refund + Partial Carry-Forward</strong></h3><ul><li>Some refunded now, some applied to future taxes</li><li>If refund covers fee ΓåÆ no payment at filing</li><li>If not ΓåÆ invoiced when filed</li><li>Contingency-style when possible</li></ul><h3><strong> Full Carry-Forward</strong></h3><ul><li>Entire credit carries forward to offset future tax years</li><li>Fee is invoiced at filing (financing options available)</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1922,'What We Do (And Why It Matters)','what-we-do-and-why-it-matters-4',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">Because this credit is easy to miss, easy to miscalculate, and expensive to ignore. We confirm you qualify, calculate it correctly, file it clean, and support you if the IRS ever asks questions.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1) Quiet Second Opinion (Eligibility + Real Savings)</strong></p><p>We confirm you qualify under&nbsp;<strong>IRS ┬º45B</strong>, identify which employees/services count, and estimate what you may be missing.</p><p><strong>2) Tip + Payroll Verification (Built to Hold Up)</strong></p><p>We verify tips are captured through payroll and reflected properly in your reporting, since the credit is based on&nbsp;<strong>reported tips</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>employer-paid FICA</strong>.</p><p><strong>3) Tip vs Service Charge Separation (Big Deal)</strong></p><p>We separate true tips from&nbsp;<strong>service charges/auto-gratuities</strong>, because mandatory charges generally donΓÇÖt qualify as tips for the credit.</p><p><strong>4) Minimum Wage Threshold Math (Where People Mess Up)</strong></p><p>We apply the correct minimum-wage basis rules so the credit only includes&nbsp;<strong>eligible tips above the threshold</strong>.</p><p><strong>5) Form 8846-Ready Credit Package</strong></p><p>We prepare the calculations and documentation needed to claim the credit correctly using&nbsp;<strong>Form 8846</strong>.</p><p><strong>6) Prior-Year Recovery (When Eligible)</strong></p><p>We help pursue missed credits for prior years through amended filings, so you stop losing money to the calendar.</p><h3>The ΓÇ£Real TipΓÇ¥ Rules We Check</h3><p>For tips to count, they must be:</p><ul><li><strong>Voluntary</strong>&nbsp;(not forced; service charges generally donΓÇÖt count)</li><li>Customer controls the&nbsp;<strong>amount</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>who receives it</strong></li><li><strong>Reported to the employer</strong></li><li>Earned by&nbsp;<strong>W-2 employees</strong>&nbsp;(not contractors)</li><li>Wages + tips exceed minimum wage</li><li>Credit applies to tips&nbsp;<strong>above</strong>&nbsp;the minimum-wage basis used in the calculation</li></ul><h2>How Our Process Works</h2><p><strong>01 ΓÇö Simple Application</strong></p><p>Quick form with basic business info.</p><p><strong>Transparent Pricing:</strong>&nbsp;no upfront cost to check eligibility; fees explained before you sign.</p><p><strong>02 ΓÇö We Do the Heavy Lifting</strong></p><p>We calculate savings, prepare documents, and handle filing requirements.</p><p><strong>03 ΓÇö Tracking + Audit Defense Included</strong></p><p>We keep you updated and respond with documentation support if the IRS asks questions.</p><p><strong>04 ΓÇö Get Paid</strong></p><h3>Timing varies by IRS processing.&nbsp;<strong>Advance options may be available</strong>&nbsp;for eligible businesses (when offered).</h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,223,NULL,NULL,'2026-04-27 19:59:37','2026-04-27 19:59:37',NULL,NULL),(1924,'Gigi May 1st Video','gigi-may-1st-video',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,211,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-01 15:53:34','2026-05-01 15:53:34',NULL,NULL),(1925,'Who is Alisa?','who-is-alisa',NULL,'<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hi, I\'m Alisa St. Georges.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I\'m a </span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Health &amp; Wealth Optimization Strategist</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> and founder of </span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Adding Valu</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I\'m passionate about helping proactive people optimize their health, wealth, and longevity so they have more energy, more financial confidence, and more freedom to enjoy life.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I believe the best decisions come from understanding your optionsΓÇönot simply following the default path. If you\'re someone who values curiosity, personal responsibility, and lifelong growth, I\'d love to connect.</span></p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 08:39:11','2026-07-12 17:43:16',NULL,NULL),(1926,'Click to Book a Call','click-to-book-a-call',NULL,'<p>Click to Book a Call</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',25,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 08:42:51','2026-07-12 17:13:58',NULL,NULL),(1930,'Our Mission','our-mission-42',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission is to h</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">elp people create more options through better health, smarter financial strategies, and a proactive approach to longevity.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 09:46:09','2026-07-12 17:43:32',NULL,NULL),(1931,'What makes \"Adding Valu\" different?','what-are-lifewave-patches',NULL,'<p>I don\'t believe in one-size-fits-all solutions.</p><p>My role isn\'t to convince people what to do. It\'s to help them ask better questions, understand their options, and make informed decisions that align with their goals and values.</p><p>Whether the conversation is about health, wealth, or longevity, my mission is the same: to help people create more capacity, more freedom, and more choices for the future.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 09:48:42','2026-07-12 17:35:28',NULL,NULL),(1932,'What does \"Adding Valu\" do?','are-the-patches-transdermal',NULL,'<p>I\'m a <strong>Health &amp; Wealth Optimization Strategist</strong>. I help people explore opportunities to improve their health, strengthen their financial future, and build greater capacity to enjoy life. I do that by connecting them with trusted education, innovative solutions, and experienced professionals.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 09:49:43','2026-07-12 17:28:17',NULL,NULL),(1933,'Why health and wealth?','how-long-do-you-wear-the-x39-patch',NULL,'<p>Because they\'re deeply connected.</p><p>Better health can create more energy, confidence, and quality of life. Better financial planning can reduce stress, increase options, and provide peace of mind. I believe optimizing both leads to a stronger, more resilient future.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 09:50:36','2026-07-12 17:29:05',NULL,NULL),(1934,'Who do you typically work with?','can-i-ask-questions-before-buying',NULL,'<p>I enjoy working with proactive individuals who value personal responsibility, lifelong learning, and exploring opportunities beyond the conventional path.</p><p>Many of my clients are planning for the next chapter of life and want to be intentional about their health, finances, and future.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 09:51:36','2026-07-12 17:29:44',NULL,NULL),(1935,'What kinds of health solutions do you offer?','can-you-help-me-order-lifewave-products',NULL,'<p>I share innovative wellness technologies and educational resources designed to support energy, recovery, resilience, and healthy aging as part of a proactive lifestyle through my affiliation with Lifewave wellness technology.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 10:01:14','2026-07-12 17:41:10',NULL,NULL),(1936,'What kinds of financial services do you offer?','can-you-stay-connected-with-me-after-i-order',NULL,'<p>I help people explore strategies related to protection, retirement planning, tax-efficient accumulation, wealth preservation, and long-term financial confidence through my affiliation with IronHawk Financial.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 10:02:32','2026-07-12 17:33:22',NULL,NULL),(1937,'Who is Cecil?','who-is-cecil',NULL,'<p><strong>C&amp;H Insurance </strong>is a Connecticut-based independent insurance brokerage focused on helping growing businesses and individuals better understand and manage risk. Led by<strong> Cecil Austin</strong>, the agency takes a relationship-driven approach centered on education, responsiveness, and clear communication.</p><p>C&amp;H Insurance works closely with business owners to help clear up the unknowns that can create costly surprises, allowing clients to stay focused on growth and daily operations with greater confidence. The agency provides commercial, personal, and life insurance solutions tailored to the needs of both businesses and families throughout Connecticut.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,225,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 12:53:20','2026-05-02 12:53:20',NULL,NULL),(1938,'Click to See My A+ BBB Rating','click-to-see-my-a-bbb-rating',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,225,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 13:18:59','2026-05-02 13:18:59',NULL,NULL),(1939,'View Our Blogs','view-our-blogs',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,225,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-02 13:43:03','2026-05-02 13:43:03',NULL,NULL),(1943,'How do we get started?','where-should-i-wear-the-patches',NULL,'<p>It begins with a conversation.</p><p>I\'ll learn about your goals, answer your questions, and help you determine whether there are opportunities worth exploring. There is never any obligationΓÇöjust an opportunity to discover what\'s possible.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,208,224,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-04 15:41:17','2026-07-12 17:37:07',NULL,NULL),(1947,'Additional Services','additional-services',NULL,'<h3><strong>≡ƒôï Policy Reviews &amp; Coverage Analysis</strong></h3><p>Review your current policies to better understand your coverage, identify possible gaps, and see whether your protection still fits your needs.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒöì Risk Assessment Consultations</strong></h3><p>Get professional guidance on potential insurance risks for your home, family, business, property, or operations.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒôä Certificate of Insurance Support</strong></h3><p>Assistance with Certificates of Insurance for businesses, contractors, vendors, landlords, and clients who need proof of coverage.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒñ¥ Claims Guidance &amp; Assistance</strong></h3><p>Support and guidance during the claims process so clients are not left trying to figure everything out alone.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å Contractor Insurance Programs</strong></h3><p>Insurance support for contractors who need proper coverage for job sites, liability, equipment, workers, vehicles, and contract requirements.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒÅó Commercial Landlord Insurance</strong></h3><p>Coverage guidance for commercial property owners and landlords who need protection for buildings, tenants, liability, and rental operations.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒÜÜ Business Auto Coverage Reviews</strong></h3><p>Review commercial vehicle coverage to help ensure company cars, trucks, vans, and drivers are properly protected.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å Umbrella Liability Reviews</strong></h3><p>Additional liability protection designed to provide broader coverage beyond standard policy limits.</p><h3><strong>≡ƒôê Insurance Support for Growing Businesses</strong></h3><p>Ongoing insurance guidance for businesses as they expand, hire employees, add vehicles, take on contracts, or increase risk exposure.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,225,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-04 19:14:19','2026-05-04 19:14:19',NULL,NULL),(1948,'Cecil Video','cecil-video',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,225,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-04 19:59:05','2026-05-04 19:59:05',NULL,NULL),(1949,'We Protect Whats Most Important to You','we-protect-whats-most-important-to-you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,225,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-04 21:42:58','2026-05-04 21:42:58',NULL,NULL),(1950,'Our Mission','our-mission-43',NULL,'<p>At C&amp;H Insurance, our mission is to help individuals and growing businesses clear the unknowns around risk so they can move forward with confidence. We are committed to providing straightforward guidance, responsive service, and practical solutions that align with our clientsΓÇÖ real needs building long-term relationships grounded in trust, clarity, and consistency.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,225,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-06 18:22:22','2026-05-06 18:22:22',NULL,NULL),(1951,'Pizza Commercial','pizza-commercial',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,162,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-06 19:53:48','2026-05-06 19:53:48',NULL,NULL),(1952,'My Mission','my-mission-20',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Xingxing ChenΓÇÖs mission is to help families move forward with financial literacy, stronger planning, and greater confidence. Through education, guidance, and simple conversations, she helps people take the next step toward building a better financial future.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:19:26','2026-05-11 14:19:26',NULL,NULL),(1953,'What does Xingxing Chen do?','what-does-xingxing-chen-do',NULL,'<p>Xingxing Chen is a Financial Professional with World System Builder. She helps individuals and families learn important financial concepts through education, workshops, and personal guidance.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:21:07','2026-05-11 14:21:07',NULL,NULL),(1954,'What kind of financial topics can I learn about?','what-kind-of-financial-topics-can-i-learn-about',NULL,'<p>You can learn about increasing cash flow, debt management, building a strong financial foundation, proper protection, wealth building, asset accumulation, retirement strategies, and wealth preservation.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:21:38','2026-05-11 14:21:38',NULL,NULL),(1955,'Does Xingxing offer financial workshops?','does-xingxing-offer-financial-workshops',NULL,'<p>Yes. Xingxing provides access to financial education workshops designed to explain money concepts in a simple, clear, and practical way.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:22:18','2026-05-11 14:22:18',NULL,NULL),(1956,'What languages does Xingxing speak?','what-languages-does-xingxing-speak',NULL,'<p>Xingxing speaks&nbsp;<strong>Chinese and English</strong>, making financial education more accessible for families who prefer either language.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:22:58','2026-05-11 14:22:58',NULL,NULL),(1957,'Is this only for people who already understand finance?','is-this-only-for-people-who-already-understand-finance',NULL,'<p>No. The workshops and conversations are designed to be simple and clear, even for people who are just beginning to learn about financial plannin</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:23:52','2026-05-11 14:23:52',NULL,NULL),(1958,'Can Xingxing help me understand debt management?','can-xingxing-help-me-understand-debt-management',NULL,'<p>Yes. Xingxing can help educate you on debt management concepts so you can better understand, control, and reduce debt.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:24:32','2026-05-11 14:24:32',NULL,NULL),(1959,'Can Xingxing help with retirement education?','can-xingxing-help-with-retirement-education',NULL,'<p>Yes. Retirement strategy is one of the key educational topics covered through World System Builder workshops.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:25:12','2026-05-11 14:25:12',NULL,NULL),(1960,'How do I get started?','how-do-i-get-started-6',NULL,'<p>You can contact Xingxing directly or schedule an appointment to begin learning more about how to build a stronger financial foundation.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 14:25:53','2026-05-11 14:25:53',NULL,NULL),(1961,'Why Financial Education Matters','why-financial-education-matters',NULL,'<p>Most people work hard for their money, but many were never truly taught how money works. They were taught to get a job, pay bills, and keep going ΓÇö but not always how to build a strong financial foundation, manage debt, protect their family, or prepare for retirement.</p><p>That is why financial education is so important.</p><p>Financial education gives individuals and families the knowledge to make better decisions with more confidence. It helps people understand important topics like cash flow, debt management, protection, wealth building, retirement strategies, and wealth preservation.</p><p>A strong financial future starts with a strong foundation. Just like a house needs stability before anything can be built on top of it, your financial life needs structure, planning, and protection. Without that foundation, even a good income can feel unstable.</p><p>Debt management is another important part of financial education. Many families feel overwhelmed by credit cards, loans, and bills. Learning how debt works can help create a clearer path toward control, discipline, and long-term progress.</p><p>Protection also matters. Life can change unexpectedly, and families need to understand how to prepare for emergencies, loss of income, illness, or other challenges. Financial education helps people protect what matters most.</p><p>Retirement planning should not be left to chance. Hope is not a strategy. The earlier people begin learning about retirement options, the better prepared they can be for the future.</p><p>Xingxing Chen is a Financial Professional with World System Builder, dedicated to helping individuals and families learn how money works. Through financial education workshops and personal conversations, she helps people better understand cash flow, debt management, protection, retirement strategies, wealth building, and long-term planning.</p><p>Fluent in Chinese and English, Xingxing is committed to making financial education simple, clear, and accessible.</p><p>You do not have to know everything to begin. You just have to be willing to learn.</p><p><strong>Learn how money works. Build your future with confidence.</strong></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-06-15','1',6,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 16:26:48','2026-06-15 17:29:43',NULL,NULL),(1962,'Who is Xingxing?','who-is-xingxing',NULL,'<p>I am a Christian, a child of God, a proud mother of two wonderful children, and a loving grandmother to Morty, our family cat.</p><p>Personal growth is very important to me. I love reading, learning, and continuously becoming a better version of myself. I believe life is a journey of faith, growth, discipline, and purpose.</p><p>I also enjoy staying active and spending time doing the things that bring me peace, joy, and balance. Some of my favorite activities include skiing, yoga, pickleball, hiking, going to the gym, golfing, puzzles, and board games.</p><p>At the heart of everything I do is my faith, my family, and my desire to keep growing while helping others move forward with confidence.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 16:33:59','2026-05-11 16:33:59',NULL,NULL),(1963,'My Licenses','my-licenses',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11 16:43:04','2026-05-11 16:43:04',NULL,NULL),(1964,'Who is Jennifer?','who-is-jennifer',NULL,'<p>Jenniffer Mart├¡nez is a Dominican communicator, community leader, writer, speaker, and founder of the 1st Dominican Chamber of Commerce in Long Island.</p><p>Originally from the Dominican Republic community and living in New York. Jenniffer has built her life around faith, discipline, service, and purpose. She is a graduate of Nassau Community College and currently works as an independent reporter for&nbsp;<em>Noticia</em>&nbsp;in Long Island, where she uses her voice to inform, uplift, and connect the community.</p><p>As the Founder and Director of the Dominican Chamber of Commerce in Long Island, Jenniffer is helping create a powerful platform for Dominican entrepreneurs, professionals, and business owners to grow, collaborate, and be recognized.</p><p>Her work is rooted in womenΓÇÖs empowerment, financial education, community service, and personal growth. Whether she is officiating a wedding, helping someone rebuild their credit, speaking on stage, writing inspirational content, or hosting an event, Jenniffer brings passion, professionalism, and heart to everything she does.</p><p>She firmly believes that with faith, discipline, and consistency, dreams do come true.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 19:56:33','2026-05-14 15:40:39',NULL,NULL),(1965,'Do you officiate weddings in English and Spanish?','do-you-officiate-weddings-in-english-and-spanish',NULL,'<p>Yes. Jenniffer can create meaningful wedding ceremonies that reflect the coupleΓÇÖs love story, culture, values, and personal preferences.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:00:20','2026-05-13 20:00:20',NULL,NULL),(1966,'What makes your wedding ceremonies personal?','what-makes-your-wedding-ceremonies-personal',NULL,'<p>Each ceremony is created with care, intention, and attention to the coupleΓÇÖs journey. Jenniffer focuses on making the moment feel authentic, memorable, and heartfelt.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:01:43','2026-05-13 20:01:43',NULL,NULL),(1967,'Can you help me repair my credit?','can-you-help-me-repair-my-credit',NULL,'<p>Yes. Jenniffer helps people understand their credit, identify areas that need improvement, and take steps toward rebuilding their financial profile.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:02:14','2026-05-13 20:02:14',NULL,NULL),(1968,'Do you speak at events?','do-you-speak-at-events',NULL,'<p>Yes. Jenniffer is available for motivational speaking, empowerment events, community events, womenΓÇÖs events, business gatherings, and faith-based conversations.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:03:10','2026-05-13 20:03:10',NULL,NULL),(1969,'What topics do you speak about?','what-topics-do-you-speak-about',NULL,'<p>Jenniffer speaks about faith, discipline, consistency, womenΓÇÖs empowerment, financial growth, leadership, community service, and personal transformation.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:03:54','2026-05-13 20:03:54',NULL,NULL),(1970,'Can you host my event as an MC?','can-you-host-my-event-as-an-mc',NULL,'<p>Yes. Jenniffer can serve as a Master of Ceremonies for community events, business events, celebrations, panels, ceremonies, and special occasions.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:04:54','2026-05-13 20:04:54',NULL,NULL),(1971,'What is the Dominican Chamber of Commerce in Long Island?','what-is-the-dominican-chamber-of-commerce-in-long-island',NULL,'<p>The Dominican Chamber of Commerce in Long Island is being created to support Dominican entrepreneurs, professionals, and business owners by building community, visibility, and opportunity.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:05:28','2026-05-13 20:05:28',NULL,NULL),(1972,'How can I connect with Jenniffer?','how-can-i-connect-with-jenniffer',NULL,'<p>You can call, text, or connect with Jenniffer through Facebook, Instagram, and TikTok.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:07:16','2026-05-13 20:07:16',NULL,NULL),(1973,'Homenaje a George Siber├│n destaca su legado y llamado a la defensa de la comunidad','homenaje-a-george-siberon-destaca-su-legado-y-llamado-a-la-defensa-de-la-comunidad',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-11','1',18,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:30:22','2026-05-14 16:15:33',NULL,NULL),(1974,'Madre inmigrante, emprendedora y voz de inspiraci├│n para otras mujeres','madre-inmigrante-emprendedora-y-voz-de-inspiracion-para-otras-mujeres',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07','1',18,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:31:19','2026-05-14 16:15:56',NULL,NULL),(1975,'Periodista y productora dominicana lidera iniciativa de mentor├¡a gratuita para j├│venes','periodista-y-productora-dominicana-lidera-iniciativa-de-mentoria-gratuita-para-jovenes',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-04','1',18,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:32:16','2026-05-14 16:16:14',NULL,NULL),(1976,'ΓÇÿWomen EmpowermentΓÇÖ impulsa negocios y liderazgo de mujeres en Nueva York y Long Island','women-empowerment-impulsa-negocios-y-liderazgo-de-mujeres-en-nueva-york-y-long-island',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-03-25','1',18,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:33:22','2026-05-14 16:15:15',NULL,NULL),(1977,'Fundaci├│n Hispanoamericana invita a la Chocolatada Peruana/Colombiana en Brentwood para financiar becas estudiantiles','fundacion-hispanoamericana-invita-a-la-chocolatada-peruanacolombiana-en-brentwood-para-financiar-becas-estudiantiles',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-12-03','1',18,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:34:13','2026-05-14 16:17:35',NULL,NULL),(1978,'My Mission','my-mission-21',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to empower people through faith, leadership, education, and community service ΓÇö helping them grow, celebrate meaningful moments, strengthen their future, and believe that with discipline and consistency, dreams do come true.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-13 20:37:38','2026-05-13 20:37:38',NULL,NULL),(1979,'Mechanics of Grace','mechanics-of-grace',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-14 23:18:44','2026-05-14 23:18:44',NULL,NULL),(1981,'Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.','impressions-that-last-connections-that-matter-7',NULL,'Four years ago, I discovered a staggering fact: 10 billion business cards are printed annually in the U.S., but 82% are discarded within a week. This outdated method of networking needed a modern, impactful replacement. I teamed up with Abdul Aziz, a talented web designer, and later, Zohaib Ullah Baig, a skilled software engineer. Together, we built vBiz Me, not just a digital business card but an experience that tells stories, builds connections, and leaves lasting impressions. More Than Just a Virtual Business Card With vBiz Me, users can: Create Dynamic Intro Videos to share their stories. Add Background Music & Animations for engagement. Integrate Branding & Interactive Elements seamlessly. The goal? To enable users to be able to make an informed decision within seconds not hours, days, or weeks. The Journey Building vBiz Me wasnΓÇÖt easy. We faced challenges, sleepless nights, and moments of doubt. But every obstacle fueled our passion to deliver a platform that redefines networking. Why Emotion Matters We know 95% of decisions are driven by emotion. ThatΓÇÖs why every feature, from animations to intro videos, is designed to create emotional impact and leave a lasting impression. Today & Beyond vBiz Me is empowering individuals and businesses to stand out. With tools like AI-powered video creation and Canva integration, weΓÇÖre just getting started. For me, vBiz Me isnΓÇÖt just a businessΓÇöitΓÇÖs a passion. ItΓÇÖs proof that with vision, determination, and an incredible team, anything is possible. Impressions That Last - Connections That Matter.',NULL,'2024-09-22','1',6,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23',NULL,NULL),(1982,'Entrepreneur, Innovator and Out of the Box Thinker','entrepreneur-innovator-and-out-of-the-box-thinker-2',NULL,'<p>My name is&nbsp;<strong>Leon White</strong>, and IΓÇÖm a proud father of six, a motivated entrepreneur, and someone who believes hard work, discipline, and ambition can open almost any door. IΓÇÖve never been the type to accept ΓÇ£noΓÇ¥ as the final answer. When I believe in something, I stay focused, adjust the plan, and keep moving until I make it happen.</p><p>My journey has allowed me to grow in several industriesΓÇöas a&nbsp;<strong>movie producer, actor, songwriter, automotive sales professional, and business owner</strong>. IΓÇÖm the owner of&nbsp;<strong>Butter Sounds Studios</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Fly Motors</strong>, where I combine creativity, leadership, and business experience to build opportunities for myself and others.</p><p>Outside of business, I enjoy working out and writing. Fitness keeps me disciplined, while writing gives me a way to express ideas, tell stories, and create something meaningful. Everything I do is driven by one purpose: to provide for my family, build a lasting legacy, and show my children that with vision, persistence, and hard work, there is no limit to what you can accomplish.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-07-29 21:32:02',NULL,NULL),(1984,'Click To View My Availability','click-to-view-my-availability-7',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-03-16','1',14,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1985,'Who We Are & Why Choose Us','who-we-are-why-choose-us-5',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">At vBiz Me, we donΓÇÖt just create virtual business cardsΓÇöwe redefine how connections are made. We saw a problem: traditional business cards were outdated, forgettable, and ineffective. So, we built a solutionΓÇöa dynamic, interactive, and innovative way to showcase YOU. Our Mission ΓÇô To revolutionize networking by giving professionals and businesses a powerful, engaging, and unforgettable digital identity. What We Do ΓÇô We merge cutting-edge technology with emotional engagement to create digital business cards that donΓÇÖt just share contact infoΓÇöthey make a statement. From dynamic intro videos and custom animations to background music and interactive features, we help you stand out in seconds. Why WeΓÇÖre Different ΓÇô Unlike other digital business cards that are just glorified contact lists, vBiz Me is about creating an experience. We blend personalization, creativity, and functionality into a seamless, no-app-needed platform that turns first impressions into lasting relationships. Our Promise ΓÇô We donΓÇÖt settle for average, and neither should you. Whether youΓÇÖre a business owner, entrepreneur, or professional, we ensure your virtual presence is as impactful, engaging, and professional as you are. With vBiz Me, youΓÇÖre not just sharing contact detailsΓÇöyouΓÇÖre making an impression that lasts.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',22,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1986,'The Mission','the-mission-4',NULL,'<p><strong>Our mission at vBiz Me is to revolutionize professional networking by delivering cutting-edge digital business cards that make powerful first impressions and drive immediate connection.</strong></p><p><strong>We empower individuals and organizations to stand out, communicate their value instantly, and turn every introduction into a lasting opportunity.</strong></p><h3><br></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1987,'What exactly is vBiz Me?','what-exactly-is-vbiz-me-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">video-first digital business card</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. It opens with a quick&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9-second intro video that flows into your logo</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, then puts&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">one-tap actions</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book, Call, Text, Get a Quote) right under it. People can&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;to contacts in one tap, and you get&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">analytics</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;on views and clicks. Share by&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">link or QR</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">no app</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;needed.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1988,'HowΓÇÖs this different from paper cards or link farms?','hows-this-different-from-paper-cards-or-link-farms-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Paper cards get tossed (</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">88%</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">). Link pages are clutter. vBiz Me is a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">mini commercial built to convert</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: video up top, clear CTAs, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">reporting</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;so you know whatΓÇÖs working. It drives outcomesΓÇö</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">bookings, calls, quotes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇönot link-wandering.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1989,'Does this replace my website or socials?','does-this-replace-my-website-or-socials-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: No. vBiz Me is the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">front door</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;that gets opened. It funnels attention to your site, reviews, calendar, payments, portfolio, and socialsΓÇöin the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">right order</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1990,'Will the video autoplay with sound?','will-the-video-autoplay-with-sound-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Browsers block autoplay&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">with sound</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. Your video&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">autoplays muted</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">; users tap to unmute. We design around that: the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">logo locks in</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;after the intro, CTAs are right below, and music/voice plays when they tap.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1991,'What actions can I add?','what-actions-can-i-add-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: The greatest hits:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Book a Consult</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Call Now</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Text Me</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Get a Quote</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(short form or ΓÇ£text a photo for a quoteΓÇ¥),&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pay/Invoice</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Reviews</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Directions/Maps</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, plus&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Save My Info (.vcf)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. We can add custom buttons and reorder them to match your sales flow.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1992,'What do the analytics show me?','what-do-the-analytics-show-me-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Clear signal:&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">who viewed</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">what they tapped</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">which sections got attention</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(Book vs. Quote vs. Call). Use it to follow up&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">smart, not spammy</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. If they submit a form, youΓÇÖll see their details; otherwise itΓÇÖs behavior dataΓÇöno creepy tracking.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1993,'How does pricing and setup workΓÇösolo and teams?','how-does-pricing-and-setup-work-solo-and-teams-4',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A: Keep it lean: a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">small setup</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;+ a&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">low monthly</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(around&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">under ten bucks</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;tier), with&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">unlimited updates</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇöno printing ever again. Teams get&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">on-brand templates</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">event QR codes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, and light CRM/lead routing so every rep looks sharp and you can&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">measure conversions</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1994,'Ohio College Podcast','ohio-college-podcast-2',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1995,'vBiz Me Commercial 1','vbiz-me-commercial-1',NULL,'<p>Vbiz Me Commercial</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1996,'Invisible Advantage of vBiz Me','invisible-advantage-of-vbiz-me-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1997,'Click Here to Join My Fica Tips Tax Credit Team','click-here-to-join-my-fica-tips-tax-credit-team',NULL,'<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1998,'vBiz Me Phone Commercial','vbiz-me-phone-commercial-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,228,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-15 09:29:24','2026-05-15 09:29:24',NULL,NULL),(1999,'First Time Seeing Stairs','first-time-seeing-stairs',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-16 02:26:50','2026-05-16 02:26:50',NULL,NULL),(2000,'Watching TV','watching-tv',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-16 02:32:23','2026-05-16 02:32:23',NULL,NULL),(2001,'Who is Lewis?','who-is-lewis',NULL,'<p>Apostle Lewis D. Lambert, Sr. is the founding pastor of&nbsp;<strong>Kingdom Lovers International Ministries</strong>, a multicultural, non-denominational ministry based in Baltimore, Maryland.</p><p>Known for his humility, faithfulness, prophetic gifting, and heart for people, Apostle Lambert is committed to preaching, teaching, and sharing the Gospel of Jesus Christ while providing spiritual guidance, pastoral care, mentorship, and support to those navigating lifeΓÇÖs challenges.</p><p>Born and raised in Baltimore, Apostle Lambert was an All-American basketball player before earning a&nbsp;<strong>Bachelor of Arts in Communication from Slippery Rock University</strong>. He gave his life to Christ in 2007 and faithfully served in ministry leadership before founding Kingdom Lovers International Ministries in 2015.</p><p>Today, he also leads&nbsp;<strong>Kingdom Lovers International Fellowship</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Lewis Lambert International Ministries</strong>, overseeing churches and ministries nationally and internationally. In addition to ministry, he serves as a mentor, wellness coach, personal trainer, and holistic herbalist.</p><p>Apostle Lambert is married to&nbsp;<strong>Pastor Felicia R. Lambert</strong>, and together they are blessed with four children and several grandchildren.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,229,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-21 15:51:54','2026-05-21 15:51:54',NULL,NULL),(2002,'My Mission','my-mission-22',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to lead people closer to God through the Word of God, prayer, spiritual guidance, mentorship, and compassionate pastoral care. I am committed to helping individuals grow spiritually, emotionally, and physically while building strong families, strong churches, and stronger communities.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,229,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-21 15:53:52','2026-05-21 15:53:52',NULL,NULL),(2003,'Faith, Discipline, and Consistency: Turning Dreams Into Reality','faith-discipline-and-consistency-turning-dreams-into-reality',NULL,'<p><strong>Success does not happen overnight</strong>. It is built through faith, discipline, consistency, and the courage to keep moving forward when the road is not easy.</p><p>For Jenniffer Mart├¡nez, these values are the foundation of her life, her work, and her mission to serve others.</p><p>As a Dominican communicator, community leader, writer, speaker, wedding officiant, credit repair specialist, MC, and Founder and Director of the Dominican Chamber of Commerce in Long Island, Jenniffer is dedicated to helping people grow, connect, and believe in what is possible.</p><p>Having lived in New York since the age of 15, Jenniffer understands hard work, sacrifice, and vision. She knows that building a dream takes more than desire. It requires action, discipline, and the courage to believe in yourself even when the journey is difficult.</p><p>One of JennifferΓÇÖs greatest passions is community empowerment. Through her leadership in creating the first Dominican Chamber of Commerce in Long Island, she is helping open doors for entrepreneurs, professionals, business owners, and future leaders. Her goal is to create a space where people can connect, support one another, build visibility, and create real opportunities.</p><p>Her work reaches far beyond community leadership. As a wedding officiant, she helps couples celebrate meaningful moments with heartfelt ceremonies. As a credit repair specialist, she helps people move toward financial confidence. As a writer and speaker, she shares messages of faith, growth, empowerment, and resilience. As an MC, she brings warmth, energy, and professionalism to every event.</p><p>What makes JennifferΓÇÖs work special is that everything she does is connected by purpose. Whether she is speaking on stage, helping someone understand their credit, officiating a wedding, writing a message of hope, or building community partnerships, Jenniffer leads with heart.</p><p>Her message is simple but powerful:</p><p><strong>With faith, discipline, and consistency, dreams do come true.</strong></p><p>Faith gives people the strength to believe before they see the result. Discipline gives them the structure to keep working when motivation fades. Consistency turns small steps into real progress.</p><p>Jenniffer Mart├¡nez represents leadership with purpose. She is a voice for empowerment, a connector of people, and a woman committed to building something bigger than herself.</p><p>Dreams do come true. But first, we must have the faith to believe, the discipline to work, and the consistency to keep going.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-21 23:56:22','2026-05-21 23:56:22',NULL,NULL),(2004,'New Flyer','new-flyer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,146,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-22 17:08:59','2026-05-22 17:08:59',NULL,NULL),(2005,'LP Ins. Flyer','lp-ins-flyer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,144,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-22 18:30:43','2026-05-22 18:30:43',NULL,NULL),(2006,'Our Team','our-team',NULL,'<p>The Team</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',36,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 17:09:57','2026-05-23 17:09:57',NULL,NULL),(2007,'Who is Maria','who-is-maria',NULL,'<p>Family, fitness, and faith keep me grounded. IΓÇÖm a proud wife, mom of three beautiful children, and grandma who loves CrossFit, celebrating my Puerto Rican roots, and making meaningful memories with the people I love. I believe in living with gratitude, showing up for others, enjoying lifeΓÇÖs little moments, and living each day with purpose.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 17:43:42','2026-05-23 17:43:42',NULL,NULL),(2008,'My Mission','my-mission-23',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to provide every client with honest guidance, trusted insurance solutions, and the best possible value while maintaining the highest level of ethics, care, and professionalism.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 17:45:24','2026-05-23 17:45:24',NULL,NULL),(2009,'Resident Producer Agency','resident-producer-agency',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:11:37','2026-05-23 18:11:37',NULL,NULL),(2010,'South Carolina License','south-carolina-license',NULL,'<p>SC</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:12:27','2026-05-23 18:12:27',NULL,NULL),(2011,'Maryland Insurance License','maryland-insurance-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:15:29','2026-05-23 18:15:29',NULL,NULL),(2012,'South Carolina License','south-carolina-license-2',NULL,'<p>State of South Carolina</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:17:20','2026-05-23 18:17:20',NULL,NULL),(2013,'Florida Dept. of Finances Certification','florida-dept-of-finances-certification',NULL,'<p>Florida</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:18:47','2026-05-23 18:18:47',NULL,NULL),(2014,'Pennsylvania Subsistence Certification','pennsylvania-subsistence-certification',NULL,'<p>Pennsylvania</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:20:13','2026-05-23 18:20:13',NULL,NULL),(2015,'What type of insurance do I actually need?','what-type-of-insurance-do-i-actually-need',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">That depends on your age, health, family situation, income, and future goals. Maria helps you look at your real-life needs first, then explains which options make the most sense.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:22:09','2026-05-23 18:22:09',NULL,NULL),(2016,'Can you help me understand Medicare or Medicaid options?','can-you-help-me-understand-medicare-or-medicaid-options',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Maria helps seniors and families understand Medicare, Medicaid, and prescription plan options so they can make a confident decision without feeling overwhelmed.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:22:54','2026-05-23 18:22:54',NULL,NULL),(2017,'Do you offer life insurance for families?','do-you-offer-life-insurance-for-families',NULL,'<p>Yes. Maria helps individuals and families find life insurance options designed to protect loved ones financially if something unexpected happens.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:23:29','2026-05-23 18:23:29',NULL,NULL),(2018,'Can you help me find affordable health insurance?','can-you-help-me-find-affordable-health-insurance',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Maria works with clients to explore health insurance options that fit their needs and budget, while making sure they understand what the coverage actually includes.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:24:14','2026-05-23 18:24:14',NULL,NULL),(2019,'What if I already have insurance but IΓÇÖm not sure itΓÇÖs enough?','what-if-i-already-have-insurance-but-im-not-sure-its-enough',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maria can review your current coverage and help you see if there are gaps, better options, or additional protection you may want to consider.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:24:49','2026-05-23 18:24:49',NULL,NULL),(2020,'Why should I work with Maria instead of trying to figure it out myself online?','why-should-i-work-with-maria-instead-of-trying-to-figure-it-out-myself-online',NULL,'<p>Because insurance can get confusing fast. Maria gives you personal guidance, explains things clearly, and helps you avoid choosing a policy that looks good online but does not actually fit your life.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:25:51','2026-05-23 18:25:51',NULL,NULL),(2021,'Why Having the Right Insurance Matters More Than Most People Realize','why-having-the-right-insurance-matters-more-than-most-people-realize',NULL,'<p>Insurance is one of those things many people do not think about until they need it. The problem is, by the time life happens, it may be too late to start asking questions.</p><p>Whether it is health insurance, life insurance, Medicare, long-term care, funeral coverage, or protection against serious illnesses, the right insurance can make a major difference for you and your family. It is not just about having a policy. It is about having the&nbsp;<strong>right protection</strong>&nbsp;in place before something unexpected happens.</p><p>That is where personal guidance matters.</p><p>Many people try to figure insurance out on their own by searching online, comparing prices, or choosing the plan that looks cheapest. But insurance is not always simple. A plan may look good at first, but if it does not cover what you truly need, it can leave you exposed when it matters most.</p><p>As an insurance professional, my goal is to help people understand their options clearly. I take the time to listen, ask the right questions, and explain coverage in a way that makes sense. Every personΓÇÖs situation is different. A young family may need life insurance and health coverage. A senior may need help understanding Medicare, Medicaid, or prescription plan options. Someone planning ahead may need long-term care coverage, funeral insurance, or annuities for retirement protection.</p><p>The truth is, insurance is not one-size-fits-all.</p><p>The right policy should fit your life, your family, your budget, and your future goals. It should give you peace of mind, not confusion. It should help protect your loved ones, not leave them carrying financial stress during difficult times.</p><p>That is why working with someone who cares matters.</p><p>At LP Insurance Group, we believe in serving the community one family at a time. That means treating every client with respect, patience, and honesty. It means explaining the details, answering questions, and helping people make informed decisions without pressure.</p><p>If you are unsure whether you have the right coverage, now is the time to ask. Do not wait until there is an emergency to find out what your policy does or does not cover.</p><p>A simple conversation today can help protect your tomorrow.</p><p><strong>LetΓÇÖs have an insurance talk today.</strong></p>',NULL,'2026-05-23','1',6,1,230,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 18:29:13','2026-05-23 18:29:13',NULL,NULL),(2022,'What is LifeWave?','what-is-lifewave',NULL,'<p>LifeWave is a wellness company that offers patented phototherapy patches designed to support general health, energy, sleep, recovery, and overall well-being.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:53:29','2026-05-23 22:53:29',NULL,NULL),(2023,'How do LifeWave patches work?','how-do-lifewave-patches-work',NULL,'<p>LifeWave states that its patches are designed to reflect the bodyΓÇÖs infrared energy back to specific points on the skin, helping stimulate points that may support general wellness and healthy activity.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:54:07','2026-05-23 22:54:07',NULL,NULL),(2024,'Do the patches contain medicine or chemicals?','do-the-patches-contain-medicine-or-chemicals',NULL,'<p>LifeWave describes its patches as non-invasive and drug-free. They are used externally on the skin and are not meant to be ingested</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:54:52','2026-05-23 22:54:52',NULL,NULL),(2025,'How long do I wear the patches?','how-long-do-i-wear-the-patches',NULL,'<p>LifeWaveΓÇÖs placement guide says patches are generally applied to clean, dry skin and may be worn for up to 12 hours before being discarded</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:55:19','2026-05-23 22:55:19',NULL,NULL),(2026,'Can anyone use LifeWave patches?','can-anyone-use-lifewave-patches',NULL,'<p>Not everyone should use them without guidance. LifeWave cautions that people who are pregnant, nursing, have health conditions, or have medical concerns should consult a health professional before use. The products are also not intended for children.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:55:57','2026-05-23 22:55:57',NULL,NULL),(2027,'Can Audrey help me choose the right LifeWave product?','can-audrey-help-me-choose-the-right-lifewave-product',NULL,'<p>Yes. Audrey can help explain the different LifeWave patch options and guide you toward products that may align with your personal wellness goals.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:56:34','2026-05-23 22:56:34',NULL,NULL),(2028,'Is there a LifeWave business opportunity?','is-there-a-lifewave-business-opportunity',NULL,'<p>Yes. Audrey can explain how becoming a LifeWave customer, preferred customer, or Brand Partner works.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:57:17','2026-05-23 22:57:17',NULL,NULL),(2029,'Do LifeWave products cure medical conditions?','do-lifewave-products-cure-medical-conditions',NULL,'<p>No. LifeWave products should not be presented as cures or medical treatments. They are wellness products designed to support the bodyΓÇÖs natural functions.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:57:54','2026-05-23 22:57:54',NULL,NULL),(2030,'A Simple Way to Explore Wellness with LifeWave','a-simple-way-to-explore-wellness-with-lifewave',NULL,'<p>Wellness can feel complicated. There are endless products, routines, supplements, diets, and opinions. For many people, the hardest part is knowing where to begin.</p><p>That is where LifeWave offers something different.</p><p>LifeWave focuses on wellness patches that use phototherapy technology. These patches are designed to be placed on the skin and work with the bodyΓÇÖs natural energy. They are non-invasive, easy to use, and created for people who want to support their health without adding another complicated routine to their day.</p><p>As a LifeWave Brand Partner, Audrey Garrison helps people understand the products, how they are used, and which options may fit their goals. Some people are interested in more energy. Others want better rest, recovery support, or a wellness routine that feels simple and manageable.</p><p>AudreyΓÇÖs role is not to diagnose or make medical claims. Her role is to educate, guide, and help people make informed decisions.</p><p>LifeWave may be a good fit for people who are curious about natural wellness, interested in drug-free support, or looking for a simple daily routine that aligns with a healthier lifestyle.</p><p>Wellness does not have to be overwhelming. Sometimes, the first step is just asking questions, learning what is available, and finding the right person to guide you.</p><p>Audrey Garrison is here to help you do exactly that</p>',NULL,'2026-05-24','1',6,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-23 22:58:52','2026-05-24 07:43:29',NULL,NULL),(2031,'Who is Audrey?','who-is-audrey',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Audrey Garrison, a LifeWave Brand Partner who helps people explore wellness in a simple, natural, and non-invasive way. Through LifeWaveΓÇÖs innovative phototherapy patch technology, I educate individuals on products designed to support energy, balance, recovery, sleep, and overall well-being.</p><p>My mission is to help people feel informed, confident, and empowered as they take steps toward a healthier lifestyle. Whether youΓÇÖre curious about LifeWave patches, looking for product guidance, or interested in the business opportunity, I provide personal support every step of the way.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-24 07:40:39','2026-05-27 14:57:18',NULL,NULL),(2032,'My Mission','my-mission-24',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help people discover simple, non-invasive wellness options that support the bodyΓÇÖs natural ability to function, restore, and thrive. I believe wellness should feel approachable, not overwhelming ΓÇö and IΓÇÖm here to help you understand LifeWave products, how they work, and which options may fit your personal goals.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-24 07:42:00','2026-05-24 07:42:00',NULL,NULL),(2033,'Faith, Purpose, and Wholeness ΓÇö The Ministry of Apostle Lewis D. Lambert, Sr.','faith-purpose-and-wholeness-the-ministry-of-apostle-lewis-d-lambert-sr',NULL,'<p>In a world where many people are searching for direction, healing, encouragement, and spiritual strength, leaders like&nbsp;<strong>Apostle Lewis D. Lambert, Sr.</strong>&nbsp;play an important role in helping people reconnect with faith, purpose, and personal growth.</p><p>Apostle Lambert is the founding pastor of&nbsp;<strong>Kingdom Lovers International Ministries</strong>, a multicultural, non-denominational ministry based in Baltimore, Maryland. His calling is centered on preaching and teaching the Word of God, providing spiritual leadership, and walking alongside individuals and families through the different seasons of life.</p><p>What makes Apostle LambertΓÇÖs ministry powerful is not only his ability to lead from the pulpit, but his heart for people. His work reaches beyond Sunday worship. He provides biblical counseling, prayer, mentorship, discipleship, hospital and home visitation, crisis support, and guidance for those facing grief, illness, family challenges, and personal struggles.</p><p>His journey is one of faith, discipline, and transformation. Born and raised in Baltimore, Apostle Lambert was an All-American basketball player before earning his degree in Communication from Slippery Rock University. After giving his life to Christ in 2007, he began serving faithfully in ministry leadership and later founded Kingdom Lovers International Ministries in 2015.</p><p>Today, Apostle Lambert continues to serve as a pastor, mentor, spiritual leader, wellness coach, personal trainer, and holistic herbalist. His approach is rooted in the belief that people need more than inspiration ΓÇö they need guidance, accountability, prayer, wisdom, and support.</p><p>Through&nbsp;<strong>Kingdom Lovers International Fellowship</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Lewis Lambert International Ministries</strong>, Apostle Lambert oversees churches and ministries nationally and internationally. His work is built on faith, service, leadership, and a commitment to helping people grow spiritually, emotionally, and physically.</p><p>Whether he is preaching the Gospel, officiating a wedding, comforting a grieving family, mentoring a young person, leading prayer, or helping someone improve their wellness, Apostle LambertΓÇÖs mission remains the same: to serve people with humility, faithfulness, and love.</p><p>Apostle Lewis D. Lambert, Sr. is more than a pastor. He is a guide, mentor, teacher, encourager, and servant leader committed to helping people become stronger in faith, healthier in life, and clearer in purpose.</p><p><strong>Faith. Leadership. Healing. Purpose. That is the heart of Apostle Lewis D. Lambert, Sr.ΓÇÖs ministry.</strong></p>',NULL,'2026-05-26','1',6,1,229,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:04:27','2026-05-26 16:04:27',NULL,NULL),(2034,'A New Beginning: Why Recovery Requires More Than a Place to Sleep','a-new-beginning-why-recovery-requires-more-than-a-place-to-sleep',NULL,'<p>Recovery is not just about removing substances from someoneΓÇÖs life. It is about rebuilding the foundation underneath that life.</p><p>For many men in early recovery, the biggest challenge is not simply staying sober for one day. The challenge is learning how to live differently. That means building structure, finding accountability, developing healthy relationships, finding employment, healing mentally and emotionally, and learning how to become part of a community again.</p><p>That is why a strong recovery environment matters.</p><p>New Beginning Recovery Houses was created to provide more than sober living. It was built to provide a real recovery community. A safe home is important, but safety alone is not enough. Men need guidance. They need support. They need people around them who understand the journey and who will hold them accountable without giving up on them.</p><p>At New Beginning, recovery is treated as a full-life process. Guests are encouraged to attend meetings, participate in community service, pursue employment, take care of their health, and build relationships with other men who are walking the same path. This kind of environment helps men move from survival into stability.</p><p>One of the most powerful parts of recovery is connection. Isolation keeps people stuck. Community helps people heal. When men live in a recovery-focused environment, they are surrounded by others who understand the struggle, respect the process, and believe change is possible.</p><p>Founder Rick DelValle understands this personally. His own recovery journey gave him a deep passion for helping men rebuild their lives. New Beginning Recovery Houses reflects that mission: to give men a safe place, a strong community, and a real chance at a better life.</p><p>Recovery does not happen by accident. It happens through support, structure, honesty, and action.</p><p>And sometimes, all a man needs is the right environment to finally believe: my life can begin again.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-15','1',6,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:29:21','2026-06-15 23:49:11',NULL,NULL),(2035,'What is New Beginning Recovery Houses?','what-is-new-beginning-recovery-houses',NULL,'<p>New Beginning Recovery Houses provides safe, structured sober living homes for men in recovery who are ready to rebuild their lives with support, accountability, and community.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:32:13','2026-05-26 16:32:13',NULL,NULL),(2036,'Is this just a sober house?','is-this-just-a-sober-house',NULL,'<p>No. New Beginning is more than sober housing. It is a recovery community with peer support, house meetings, employment assistance, medication management support, recovery resources, and community activities.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:32:53','2026-05-26 16:32:53',NULL,NULL),(2037,'How do I get started?','how-do-i-get-started-7',NULL,'<p>The first step is a phone interview. This helps the team understand your needs, explain the program, and determine whether New Beginning is the right fit.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:33:50','2026-05-26 16:33:50',NULL,NULL),(2038,'What happens after I am accepted?','what-happens-after-i-am-accepted',NULL,'<p>After acceptance, you meet your house manager, move into the house, learn the expectations, and begin focusing on your recovery, health, meetings, and personal growth.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:34:40','2026-05-26 16:34:40',NULL,NULL),(2039,'Does New Beginning help with employment?','does-new-beginning-help-with-employment',NULL,'<p>Yes. New Beginning works with local employers, temp agencies, contractors, and partner organizations to help guests pursue stable employment and financial independence.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:35:16','2026-05-26 16:35:16',NULL,NULL),(2040,'Are there meetings and recovery support?','are-there-meetings-and-recovery-support',NULL,'<p>Yes. Guests participate in house meetings, recovery meetings, peer support, community service, and recovery-focused activities designed to build connection and accountability.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:35:53','2026-05-26 16:35:53',NULL,NULL),(2041,'What makes this program different?','what-makes-this-program-different',NULL,'<p>New Beginning focuses on community, structure, family, service, employment, accountability, and long-term personal growth ΓÇö not just a bed in a house.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:36:44','2026-05-26 16:36:44',NULL,NULL),(2042,'Who should contact New Beginning?','who-should-contact-new-beginning',NULL,'<p>Men in early recovery who want a safe place to live, structure, support, accountability, and a real chance to rebuild their lives should reach out.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 16:37:37','2026-05-26 16:37:37',NULL,NULL),(2043,'RIZZ Lounge and Grill','rizz-lounge-and-grill',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 20:31:33','2026-05-26 20:31:33',NULL,NULL),(2044,'Click to See Our Rating','click-to-see-our-rating',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-27 01:15:12','2026-05-27 01:15:12',NULL,NULL),(2045,'Schedule a Meeting','click-link',NULL,'<h4><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">Click Meeting Link Button Below</strong></h4>',NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-27 01:19:06','2026-05-27 01:21:48',NULL,NULL),(2046,'Join Now','join-now',NULL,'<p>Click Here for an Amazing Opportunity</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,214,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-27 02:01:09','2026-05-27 02:01:09',NULL,NULL),(2047,'Click to Join','click-to-join',NULL,'<p>Click for an Amazing Business Opportunity</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-27 15:00:49','2026-05-27 15:00:49',NULL,NULL),(2048,'Audrey Testimony','audrey-testimony',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,231,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-02 21:47:00','2026-06-02 21:47:00',NULL,NULL),(2049,'Audrey Cert1','audrey-cert1',NULL,NULL,NULL