,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. We offer a safe space for women to talk, be heard, and feel supportedΓÇöwithout judgment, pressure, or having to ΓÇ£performΓÇ¥ strength.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-03 07:19:11','2026-06-03 07:19:11',NULL,NULL),(2057,'Who can join?','who-can-join',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any woman who wants sisterhood, support, and genuine community. If youΓÇÖre looking for real connection and a place to breathe, youΓÇÖre welcome here.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-03 07:19:59','2026-06-03 07:19:59',NULL,NULL),(2058,'What happens at meetings or gatherings?','what-happens-at-meetings-or-gatherings',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You can expect encouragement, conversation, support, and community. Some events are focused and reflective; others are social and upliftingΓÇöalways rooted in respect and sisterhood.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-03 07:20:40','2026-06-03 07:20:40',NULL,NULL),(2059,'Is this confidential?','is-this-confidential',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We take privacy seriously. WhatΓÇÖs shared in the circle stays in the circle. We keep it respectful, supportive, and safe.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-03 07:21:31','2026-06-03 07:21:31',NULL,NULL),(2060,'Is this therapy or clinical counseling?','is-this-therapy-or-clinical-counseling',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">NoΓÇöthis is peer-based support and sisterhood. WeΓÇÖre here to uplift and encourage. If someone needs clinical help, we support them in seeking professional services too.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,192,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-03 07:22:11','2026-06-03 07:22:11',NULL,NULL),(2061,'Who is Don?','who-is-don',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Donald LaPlume, Chief Resiliency Officer and Co-Founder of SPT Resiliency Systems. I help homeowners and business owners become more energy-efficient, better protected, and prepared for the future.</p><p>My focus is on practical resiliency solutions, including solar design, system inspections, repairs, maintenance, efficiency upgrades, and long-term planning. I believe the right systems should help people lower costs, protect their property, and avoid expensive problems before they happen.</p><p>At SPT Resiliency Systems, my goal is simple: provide honest guidance, smart solutions, and dependable service that helps every client save money and build a stronger, more sustainable future.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,178,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-03 08:50:09','2026-06-03 08:50:09',NULL,NULL),(2062,'Cert 1 UWE','cert-1-uwe',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,227,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-05 15:07:27','2026-06-05 15:07:27',NULL,NULL),(2063,'My Guaranteed Mission','my-guaranteed-mission',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help individuals and families protect their health, finances, and future through honest education and personalized insurance guidance. I am committed to listening carefully, explaining every option clearly, and helping each client choose coverage that truly supports their needs and the people they love.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 04:49:43','2026-06-07 04:49:43',NULL,NULL),(2065,'Who is Juliana','who-is-juliana',NULL,'<p><strong>Hi, IΓÇÖm Juliana Rosa</strong>, a trusted insurance broker with LP Insurance Group PA, proudly serving individuals and families throughout the Lehigh Valley and surrounding communities.</p><p><strong>I understand that insurance is not one-size-fits-all. ThatΓÇÖs why I take the time to meet personally with each client, understand their unique situation, and explain their options in a clear and honest way.</strong></p><p>Whether youΓÇÖre looking for health coverage, life insurance, retirement solutions, long-term care, or additional protection for your family, <strong>IΓÇÖm here to help you make informed decisions with confidence. My goal is to provide personalized guidance and insurance solutions designed around your needs, priorities, and budget.</strong></p><p>LetΓÇÖs have a conversation and find the right protection for you and the people you love.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:05:49','2026-06-07 05:05:49',NULL,NULL),(2066,'Cert 1','cert-12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:09:43','2026-06-07 05:09:43',NULL,NULL),(2067,'Cert 2','cert-9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:10:26','2026-06-07 05:10:26',NULL,NULL),(2068,'How do I know whether I have enough insurance coverage?','how-do-i-know-whether-i-have-enough-insurance-coverage',NULL,'<p>I review your current situation, family responsibilities, income, debts, healthcare needs, and future goals. From there, I can help identify possible coverage gaps and explain which options may provide better protection.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:32:27','2026-06-07 05:32:27',NULL,NULL),(2069,'Can you help me understand my policy before I enroll?','can-you-help-me-understand-my-policy-before-i-enroll',NULL,'<p>Absolutely. I believe you should know what you are paying for. I explain the benefits, costs, limitations, waiting periods, and important details in plain language before you make a decision</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:33:31','2026-06-07 05:33:31',NULL,NULL),(2070,'What should I bring to an insurance consultation?','what-should-i-bring-to-an-insurance-consultation',NULL,'<p>It helps to have a list of your current medications, doctors, existing policies, monthly budget, household information, and any specific concerns. DonΓÇÖt worry if you donΓÇÖt have everythingΓÇöI can still help you get started</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:35:06','2026-06-07 05:35:06',NULL,NULL),(2071,'Can my insurance needs change as my life changes?','can-my-insurance-needs-change-as-my-life-changes',NULL,'<p>Yes. Marriage, retirement, a new child, a job change, health concerns, or becoming a caregiver can all affect your insurance needs. I recommend reviewing your coverage regularly to make sure it still fits your life.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:35:52','2026-06-07 05:35:52',NULL,NULL),(2072,'Can you help if I already have insurance but am unhappy with it?','can-you-help-if-i-already-have-insurance-but-am-unhappy-with-it',NULL,'<p>Yes. I can review what you currently have, help you understand where it may be falling short, and discuss other options that may better match your needs and budget.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:36:42','2026-06-07 05:36:42',NULL,NULL),(2073,'Do you stay available after I choose a plan?','do-you-stay-available-after-i-choose-a-plan',NULL,'<p>Yes. My support does not end after enrollment. I am available to answer questions, assist with annual reviews, explain changes, and help you understand the next steps when your needs evolve.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:37:25','2026-06-07 05:37:25',NULL,NULL),(2074,'Protecting Your Future Starts with Understanding Your Options','protecting-your-future-starts-with-understanding-your-options',NULL,'<p>Insurance can feel confusing, especially when every company seems to use different terms, different plans, and a mountain of fine print. The truth is, choosing the right coverage should not leave you feeling overwhelmed or pressured.</p><p>My goal is to make the process easier.</p><p>At LP Insurance Group PA, I help individuals and families understand the protection available to them, whether they are exploring health insurance, Medicare options, life insurance, final expense coverage, long-term care, critical illness protection, or retirement solutions.</p><p>The right insurance plan should fit your life, not force your life to fit the plan.</p><p>That means looking at your health needs, family responsibilities, budget, future goals, and the level of financial protection you want. A plan that works well for one person may not be the right choice for someone else.</p><p>It is also important to review your coverage as life changes. Retirement, marriage, a new child, health concerns, or a change in income can all affect what kind of protection you may need.</p><p>That is why I believe in personal conversations, clear explanations, and honest guidance. I take the time to answer questions, explain the details, and help you make an informed decision without unnecessary pressure.</p><p>Insurance is not just paperwork. It is a way to protect your health, your income, your savings, and the people who depend on you.</p><p>You do not have to figure everything out alone.</p><p>LetΓÇÖs review your options together and build a plan designed around what matters most to you.</p><p><strong>Juliana Rosa</strong></p><p><strong>LP Insurance Group PA</strong></p><p><em>Helping you protect today while preparing for tomorrow.</em></p>',NULL,'2026-06-07','1',6,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 05:40:23','2026-06-07 05:40:23',NULL,NULL),(2075,'What is Right Now Benefit?','what-is-right-now-benefit',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Right Now Benefit helps individuals, families, employees, and business owners access affordable legal support and identity-theft protection through established LegalShield and IDShield membership plans.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:22:19','2026-06-07 06:22:19',NULL,NULL),(2076,'Do I have to be involved in a lawsuit to use the legal plan?','do-i-have-to-be-involved-in-a-lawsuit-to-use-the-legal-plan',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Members can use their plan for everyday legal matters such as reviewing documents, landlord or tenant concerns, traffic issues, family matters, debt questions, estate planning, and general legal guidance.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:22:58','2026-06-07 06:22:58',NULL,NULL),(2077,'What does identity-theft protection include?','what-does-identity-theft-protection-include',NULL,'<p>IDShield plans may include identity monitoring, privacy monitoring, credit-related alerts, consultation services, and licensed identity-restoration assistance if your personal information is compromised.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:23:37','2026-06-07 06:23:37',NULL,NULL),(2078,'Are plans available for small businesses and commercial drivers?','are-plans-available-for-small-businesses-and-commercial-drivers',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. There are plan options designed for small-business owners and commercial drivers who may need assistance with contracts, business questions, traffic matters, compliance concerns, and other legal issues</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:24:42','2026-06-07 06:24:42',NULL,NULL),(2079,'Can employers offer these services as an employee benefit?','can-employers-offer-these-services-as-an-employee-benefit',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Employers can make legal and identity-protection plans available as voluntary employee benefits. These services may help reduce stress, distraction, and presenteeism caused by unresolved personal legal or identity-related problems.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:25:35','2026-06-07 06:25:35',NULL,NULL),(2080,'Why Legal and Identity Protection Matter Before a Crisis Happens','why-legal-and-identity-protection-matter-before-a-crisis-happens',NULL,'<p>Most people do not think about calling an attorney until something has already gone wrong. A landlord dispute becomes serious. An important contract creates unexpected problems. A traffic issue threatens someoneΓÇÖs livelihood. Personal information is stolen, and suddenly the victim is dealing with unfamiliar accounts, damaged credit, and hours of frustration.</p><p>By that point, the problem is no longer small.</p><p>That is why having access to legal and identity-protection services before an emergency happens can make such a major difference.</p><p>Legal concerns are not limited to courtrooms and major lawsuits. Everyday situations involving family matters, contracts, consumer disputes, estate planning, housing, traffic violations, or business decisions may all require professional guidance. Unfortunately, many people avoid asking for help because they assume speaking with an attorney will be complicated or unaffordable.</p><p>A legal membership plan can help remove that hesitation by giving members access to qualified legal support for covered situations. Instead of searching online, guessing what a document means, or waiting until a problem becomes worse, members have somewhere to turn for guidance.</p><p>Identity theft is another growing concern. Personal information can be exposed through data breaches, phishing attempts, stolen devices, compromised accounts, and many other situations. Monitoring services and professional restoration support can help individuals respond more quickly when suspicious activity occurs.</p><p>For business owners and employers, these concerns can also affect the workplace. Employees dealing with unresolved legal or identity problems may become distracted, stressed, and less productive. Offering legal and identity-protection plans as voluntary benefits can provide employees with valuable support while helping businesses address absenteeism and presenteeism.</p><p>The goal is not to live in fear of what might happen. The goal is to be prepared.</p><p>Through Right Now Benefit, I help individuals, families, employees, commercial drivers, and small-business owners explore affordable legal and identity-protection options through LegalShield and IDShield. My role is to explain the available plans, answer questions, and help people choose protection that fits their needs.</p><p>You insure your vehicle, home, health, and other valuable assets. Having access to legal assistance and identity protection is another practical way to protect your family, business, and future.</p><p>Do not wait until a stressful situation leaves you asking, ΓÇ£Who can I call?ΓÇ¥</p><p>Prepare today, so you have support when life happens.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-12','1',6,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:28:02','2026-06-12 21:41:35',NULL,NULL),(2081,'Click For Amazing Business Opportunity','click-for-amazing-business-opportunity',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:41:06','2026-06-07 06:41:06',NULL,NULL),(2082,'Employees Benefit Overview','employees-benefit-overview',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:49:43','2026-06-07 06:49:43',NULL,NULL),(2083,'My Mission','my-mission-25',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help businesses strengthen and support their workforce by providing affordable access to legal services and identity-theft protection. I am committed to helping employers offer meaningful benefits that reduce employee stress, improve peace of mind, and provide professional support when unexpected legal or identity-related problems arise. Through education, personal service, and trusted solutions, I help businesses protect the people who help their companies succeed.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:54:21','2026-06-07 06:54:21',NULL,NULL),(2084,'ΓÇ£Do today what others donΓÇÖt, so tomorrow you can have what others wonΓÇÖt.ΓÇ¥','do-today-what-others-dont-so-tomorrow-you-can-have-what-others-wont',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Angel MelendezΓÇöa dedicated professional, entrepreneur, and relationship builder with a passion for helping people recognize their potential and protect what matters most.</p><p>Through my work as an Independent LegalShield Associate, I help individuals, families, employees, and business owners gain affordable access to legal services and identity-theft protection. My goal is to educate, build lasting relationships, and provide practical solutions that create greater confidence, security, and peace of mind.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 06:57:01','2026-06-07 06:57:01',NULL,NULL),(2085,'Dream Bigger','dream-bigger',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 07:18:57','2026-06-07 07:18:57',NULL,NULL),(2086,'Dream Bigger','dream-bigger-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,234,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 07:20:40','2026-06-07 07:20:40',NULL,NULL),(2087,'Who is JP Morgan?','who-is-jp-morgan',NULL,'<p>Marine Corps veteran, girl dad, business owner, and founder of Backbone Capital, built from years of real-world sales experience, entrepreneurship, and learning business the hard way. After spending years helping customers through service-based businesses and studying business funding strategies, I became passionate about helping entrepreneurs understand how to position themselves for growth through smarter access to capital.&nbsp;</p><p>Backbone Capital focuses on connecting business owners with funding solutions that can help support expansion, operations, marketing, equipment, and cash flow needs. My approach is straightforward, relationship-driven, and rooted in real conversations with real business owners trying to build something bigger without unnecessary confusion or guesswork.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 07:31:59','2026-06-07 07:31:59',NULL,NULL),(2088,'What types of business funding does Backbone Capital help with?','what-types-of-business-funding-does-backbone-capital-help-with',NULL,'<p>Backbone Capital helps business owners explore funding solutions for working capital, equipment, inventory, marketing, expansion, payroll, renovations, and other business-related needs.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 08:31:53','2026-06-07 08:31:53',NULL,NULL),(2089,'Do I need perfect credit to qualify?','do-i-need-perfect-credit-to-qualify',NULL,'<p>No. Perfect credit is not always required. Funding decisions may also consider your time in business, monthly revenue, cash flow, industry, existing obligations, and overall financial profile.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 08:32:48','2026-06-07 08:32:48',NULL,NULL),(2090,'How much funding could my business qualify for?','how-much-funding-could-my-business-qualify-for',NULL,'<p>The amount varies based on the strength of the business and the financing program. Revenue, credit, time in business, documentation, and intended use of funds can all affect eligibility. No amount is guaranteed.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 08:47:37','2026-06-07 08:47:37',NULL,NULL),(2091,'How long does the funding process take?','how-long-does-the-funding-process-take',NULL,'<p>Timing depends on the type of funding, the provider, and how quickly the required documents are submitted. Some options may move quickly, while more complex financing can take longer.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 08:48:28','2026-06-07 08:48:28',NULL,NULL),(2092,'Will checking my options affect my credit?','will-checking-my-options-affect-my-credit',NULL,'<p>That depends on the funding provider and the stage of the process. Some initial reviews may use a soft credit inquiry, while a full application could require a hard inquiry. Any potential credit impact should be explained before you proceed.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 08:49:08','2026-06-07 08:49:08',NULL,NULL),(2093,'Your Business May Not Have a Sales ProblemΓÇöit May Have a Capital Problem','your-business-may-not-have-a-sales-problem-it-may-have-a-capital-problem',NULL,'<p>Many entrepreneurs know exactly what their businesses need to reach the next level.</p><p>They may need another employee, better equipment, a larger inventory order, a stronger marketing campaign, or enough working capital to take on a major opportunity. The vision is there. The customers may even be there. What is missing is often the financial breathing room needed to move.</p><p>That does not mean every business should borrow money.</p><p>Capital without a clear plan can create more pressure instead of more progress. The first question should not be, ΓÇ£How much money can I get?ΓÇ¥ It should be, ΓÇ£What will this capital help my business accomplish?ΓÇ¥</p><p>Will it increase revenue?</p><p>Will it improve efficiency?</p><p>Will it help the company fulfill more orders?</p><p>Will it solve a temporary cash-flow problem?</p><p>Will the expected return justify the cost?</p><p>Smart business funding begins with a purpose.</p><p>It also requires preparation. Business owners should understand their revenue, expenses, existing obligations, credit position, and how much they can realistically afford to repay. Walking into a funding conversation without that information is like taking a road trip with no fuel gauge. You may moveΓÇöbut you have no idea how far you can safely go.</p><p>At Backbone Capital, the goal is to make the process clearer. We start with a real conversation about where your business stands, what you are trying to accomplish, and what challenges may be holding you back.</p><p>Because the right capital, used at the right time for the right reason, can become a tool for growth. The wrong capital can become an expensive headache wearing a necktie.</p><p>Your company deserves more than guesswork. It deserves a strategyΓÇöand a strong financial backbone.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-07','1',6,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 08:51:14','2026-06-07 08:54:37',NULL,NULL),(2094,'My Mission','my-mission-26',NULL,'<p>At <strong>Backbone Capital,</strong> our mission is to help business owners stop guessing and start growing. We connect entrepreneurs with strategic funding solutions designed to fuel expansion, strengthen cash flow, and create new opportunities for success. <strong>Built on integrity, relationships, and real-world business experience</strong>, we\'re committed to helping owners build stronger companies with the confidence and support they deserve. <strong>Because Every Business Needs a Backbone</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,233,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-07 08:53:11','2026-06-09 00:55:14',NULL,NULL),(2095,'My Mission','my-mission-27',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help individuals and families make informed legal and financial decisions that protect the people they love, preserve their assets and create a meaningful legacy. Through compassionate guidance and personalized Life &amp; Legacy Planning┬«, I work to ensure that every clientΓÇÖs plan provides clarity during life, protection during incapacity and peace of mind for the future.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 23:57:52','2026-06-11 23:57:52',NULL,NULL),(2096,'Who is Stephanie','who-is-stephanie',NULL,'<p>I am an ordained minister, entrepreneur, attorney, and senior executive with more than 20 years of experience working at the intersection of law, public policy, education, faith, and community service.</p><p>Throughout my career, I have helped develop, restructure, and negotiate business ventures across government, academia, civil rights, nonprofit, public, and faith-based organizations. My faith has always guided my work and my commitment to creating opportunities for individuals and communities that have too often been overlooked or excluded.</p><p>I have successfully addressed complex organizational challenges, regulatory compliance matters, and operational issues. I have also shared my experience with nonprofit and faith-based organizations to help them reorganize, strengthen their operations, expand their reach, and better serve their communities.</p><p>Over the years, I have served on numerous boards and committees supporting community fundraising, endowment growth, organizational expansion, social justice, and recruitment initiatives. Whether practicing law, serving in ministry, working in academia, or leading within government, I have remained committed to improving communication, service, and engagement between leaders and the people they serve.</p><p>I had the privilege of serving under two gubernatorial administrations as a senior Massachusetts state government official. I oversaw the daily operations of the Department of Labor and Workforce Development, which addresses workforce development, labor relations, worker safety, and unemployment benefits.</p><p>Before that, I held several leadership positions at the Massachusetts Department of Transportation, including Assistant Secretary and Chief of Staff, Undersecretary, and Interim Chief of Civil Rights. In my civil rights leadership role, I reorganized the Diversity and Civil Rights Department and led the development of its first multimodal equal opportunity plan, helping position the department as a national leader.</p><p>Nearly 20 years ago, I accepted my call to ministry. I understood from the beginning that my calling was centered on ΓÇ£ministry without wallsΓÇ¥ΓÇöserving wherever God places me. One of my greatest passions is the practical application of the Gospel through womenΓÇÖs ministry, both inside and outside the church. I currently lead OneLove Christian Ministries.</p><p>I am a graduate of Columbia University in the City of New York, Boston University School of Law, and Gordon-Conwell Theological Seminary.</p><p>Above all, I attribute my success to GodΓÇÖs favor and the strength of my family. I have been married to my husband, Frederich Johnson, for more than three decades. Together, we are blessed with two accomplished, college-educated sons, Jabari and Jonah. Jonah is also a Phillips Exeter Academy alumnus and is currently pursuing his masterΓÇÖs degree in architecture.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:04:13','2026-06-12 00:04:13',NULL,NULL),(2097,'Why do I need an estate plan if I am not wealthy?','why-do-i-need-an-estate-plan-if-i-am-not-wealthy',NULL,'<p>Estate planning is not only for wealthy families. It allows you to decide who will manage your affairs, receive your assets, care for your children, and make medical or financial decisions if you become unable to do so. Without a plan, state law and the courts may make those decisions for you.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:06:21','2026-06-12 00:06:21',NULL,NULL),(2098,'What is the difference between a will and a trust?','what-is-the-difference-between-a-will-and-a-trust',NULL,'<p>A will provides instructions for distributing your assets after your death and can name guardians for minor children. However, assets controlled by a will generally must go through probate. A properly created and funded trust can help your family avoid probate, maintain privacy, and manage assets during incapacity and after death.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:06:59','2026-06-12 00:06:59',NULL,NULL),(2099,'Can estate planning help keep my family out of court?','can-estate-planning-help-keep-my-family-out-of-court',NULL,'<p>Yes. A carefully designed estate plan can reduce the likelihood of probate, guardianship proceedings, family disputes, and unnecessary legal expenses. The goal is to make your wishes clear and give your loved ones a practical plan to follow during difficult circumstances.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:07:34','2026-06-12 00:07:34',NULL,NULL),(2100,'What happens to my children if something happens to me?','what-happens-to-my-children-if-something-happens-to-me',NULL,'<p>Without written legal instructions, a judge may ultimately decide who cares for your minor children. A Kids Protection Plan allows you to legally nominate long-term guardians and provide instructions for temporary care so your children are protected while permanent arrangements are being made.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:08:16','2026-06-12 00:08:16',NULL,NULL),(2101,'How often should I update my estate plan?','how-often-should-i-update-my-estate-plan',NULL,'<p>Your plan should be reviewed regularly and whenever there is a major life change, such as marriage, divorce, the birth of a child, the death of a loved one, relocation, retirement, the purchase of property, or a significant change in finances or business ownership. An outdated plan may not work the way you intended.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:08:49','2026-06-12 00:08:49',NULL,NULL),(2102,'What should I expect during the estate-planning process?','what-should-i-expect-during-the-estate-planning-process',NULL,'<p>The process begins with a conversation about your family, finances, concerns, and goals. I will explain your options in understandable language and help you create a personalized plan that protects your loved ones, reflects your values, and works when it is needed most.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:09:24','2026-06-12 00:09:24',NULL,NULL),(2103,'Estate Planning Is Not About DeathΓÇöIt Is About Protecting Life','estate-planning-is-not-about-death-it-is-about-protecting-life',NULL,'<p>Many people avoid estate planning because they believe it is something they only need when they are older, wealthy, seriously ill, or preparing for the end of life.</p><p>The truth is, estate planning is not really about death.</p><p>It is about protecting your life, your family, your wishes, and everything you have worked hard to build.</p><p>A well-designed estate plan gives you the ability to decide what happens if you become unable to make decisions for yourself. It identifies the people you trust to manage your finances, make medical decisions, care for your children, and carry out your wishes.</p><p>Without a plan, those decisions may be left to the courts.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">Estate Planning Is for Everyday Families</strong></h2><p>You do not need to own multiple homes or have millions of dollars to benefit from estate planning.</p><p>If you have children, a home, a bank account, retirement benefits, life insurance, a business, personal property, or people who depend on you, you already have important reasons to create a plan.</p><p>Estate planning helps answer questions such as:</p><p>Who will care for my children if I cannot?</p><p>Who will make medical decisions for me?</p><p>Who will manage my finances?</p><p>How will my property be distributed?</p><p>Can my family avoid unnecessary court proceedings?</p><p>How can I reduce confusion and conflict among the people I love?</p><p>These are not questions that should be left unanswered.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">A Will May Not Be Enough</strong></h2><p>A will is an important part of many estate plans, but it may not provide all the protection your family needs.</p><p>A will usually becomes effective only after death and may require your family to go through probate court. It also does not necessarily protect you during a period of incapacity.</p><p>Depending on your circumstances, a complete estate plan may include a will, trust, power of attorney, health-care documents, guardian nominations, beneficiary planning, and instructions for managing your assets.</p><p>The goal is not to collect legal documents.</p><p>The goal is to create a coordinated plan that works when your family needs it most.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">Parents Have an Additional Responsibility</strong></h2><p>For parents of minor children, estate planning is especially important.</p><p>Many parents assume that close family members will automatically step in if something happens to them. Unfortunately, without clear legal instructions, confusion can arise, family members may disagree, and a judge may ultimately decide who will care for the children.</p><p>A properly prepared Kids Protection Plan can name temporary and long-term guardians and provide clear instructions for the care of your children.</p><p>Few decisions are more important.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">Your Plan Should Grow With You</strong></h2><p>Estate planning is not something that should be completed once and forgotten.</p><p>Life changes.</p><p>People get married or divorced. Children are born. Loved ones pass away. Families move. Businesses grow. Property is purchased or sold. Relationships change.</p><p>Your estate plan should be reviewed regularly to make sure it still reflects your life, your values, and your wishes.</p><p>An outdated plan can sometimes create nearly as many problems as having no plan at all.</p><h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">Planning Is an Act of Love</strong></h2><p>Creating an estate plan may feel uncomfortable at first, but avoiding the conversation does not protect your family.</p><p>Planning does.</p><p>Estate planning provides clarity during uncertain moments. It reduces the burden placed on your loved ones and gives them direction when they may already be experiencing grief, fear, or stress.</p><p>It is one of the most thoughtful gifts you can give the people you love.</p><p>At The Truth Group, LLC, I help individuals and families understand their options and create personalized plans that protect their loved ones, preserve their wishes, and provide peace of mind.</p><p>Your family should not have to guess what you wanted.</p><p>Let us create a plan that speaks for you when you cannot speak for yourself.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-12','1',6,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 00:13:30','2026-06-12 14:47:42',NULL,NULL),(2104,'Book a 15 Min. Consultation','book-a-15-min-consultation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,236,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 15:40:57','2026-06-12 15:40:57',NULL,NULL),(2109,'Adri├ín Mieses','8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 17:26:21','2026-06-12 17:30:01',NULL,NULL),(2111,'Abdiel Mieses','abdiel-mieses',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 17:39:32','2026-06-12 17:39:32',NULL,NULL),(2112,'Andy Mieses','andy-mieses',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',24,1,235,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-12 17:40:10','2026-06-12 17:40:10',NULL,NULL),(2113,'Your Great Idea Deserves More Than a PatentΓÇöIt Deserves a Path to Market','your-great-idea-deserves-more-than-a-patent-it-deserves-a-path-to-market',NULL,'<p>Every successful invention begins with an idea.</p><p>It may come to you during a conversation, while solving a problem at work, or in the middle of the night when your mind refuses to shut off. You recognize that your idea could improve lives, transform an industry, or create an entirely new business opportunity.</p><p>But having a great idea is only the beginning.</p><p>The real challenge is knowing what to do next.</p><h2>An Idea Alone Is Not a Business</h2><p>Many inventors make the mistake of believing that a strong idea will naturally become a successful product. Unfortunately, the journey from inspiration to income is rarely that simple.</p><p>Before investing heavily in development, an inventor must answer several important questions:</p><ul><li>Is the idea truly new?</li><li>Can it be legally protected?</li><li>Does a market exist for the product?</li><li>Will customers actually pay for it?</li><li>Should the product be manufactured, licensed, sold, or presented to investors?</li><li>How can the inventor protect the idea while discussing it with others?</li></ul><p>Without the right answers, even a brilliant invention can become an expensive lesson.</p><p>That is why Emanus takes a more complete approach to innovation.</p><h2>Protecting the Idea Is Only One Part of the Process</h2><p>A patent can be an extremely valuable business asset. It may help protect an invention from competitors, strengthen a companyΓÇÖs position in the marketplace, create licensing opportunities, and make the business more attractive to potential investors.</p><p>However, obtaining a patent does not automatically create a successful product.</p><p>The invention must still be evaluated, developed, tested, positioned, and introduced to the right market. A patent sitting in a drawer is protectedΓÇöbut it is not producing revenue.</p><p>Emanus helps inventors think beyond simply filing paperwork. The goal is to create an intellectual property and commercialization strategy that supports the inventorΓÇÖs larger business objectives.</p><h2>From Inspiration to Market-Ready Innovation</h2><p>Emanus works with entrepreneurs, independent inventors, and growing businesses at many different stages of development.</p><p>Some clients arrive with nothing more than an early concept. Others already have drawings, prototypes, patent applications, or products that need a stronger path to market.</p><p>Depending on the project, the process may include:</p><h3>Idea Evaluation and Valuation</h3><p>Before committing significant time and money, the idea should be carefully evaluated. Research can help determine whether the concept is original, commercially realistic, and capable of creating a sustainable competitive advantage.</p><h3>Intellectual Property Protection</h3><p>The right protection may include a provisional patent, utility patent, design patent, trademark, copyright, trade-secret strategy, or a combination of intellectual property rights.</p><p>Choosing the wrong form of protection can leave important parts of an invention exposed.</p><h3>Patent and Prior-Art Research</h3><p>A professional search can uncover similar inventions, identify potential obstacles, and help determine whether the idea may qualify for patent protection.</p><p>This work can save an inventor from spending thousands of dollars developing something that already exists.</p><h3>Prototype and Product Development</h3><p>A concept becomes much easier to test, demonstrate, and improve once it becomes tangible. Prototype development allows inventors to evaluate functionality, gather feedback, correct weaknesses, and prepare the product for manufacturing or licensing discussions.</p><h3>Commercialization and Licensing Strategy</h3><p>Every invention requires a clear path to revenue.</p><p>Some inventors want to build and operate their own companies. Others prefer to license their technology to an established manufacturer in exchange for royalties. Some projects may require outside investment, strategic partnerships, or specialized distribution channels.</p><p>The right strategy depends on the inventor, the product, the available resources, and the market.</p><h3>Sales Strategy and Market Entry</h3><p>A product cannot succeed if the right people never see it.</p><p>Successful commercialization requires a clear understanding of the target customer, the productΓÇÖs value, its competitive advantage, pricing, sales channels, and launch strategy.</p><h2>Why Inventors Need a Strategic Partner</h2><p>Innovation can become overwhelming quickly. Inventors may find themselves dealing with patent professionals, engineers, prototype developers, manufacturers, marketers, investors, and licensing representativesΓÇöall while trying to protect their original vision.</p><p>Emanus helps bring those moving parts together.</p><p>Founded by Wil Jacques, a USPTO-registered patent agent, mechanical engineer, MBA, and experienced intellectual property strategist, Emanus combines technical knowledge with practical business and commercialization experience.</p><p>Rather than treating the inventor as another application number, Emanus provides personalized guidance designed around the invention, the market, and the inventorΓÇÖs long-term goals.</p><h2>Do Not Let Uncertainty Keep Your Idea Stuck</h2><p>Many valuable ideas never leave the inventorΓÇÖs notebook because the person behind them does not know where to begin.</p><p>Others move too quickly, disclose the idea publicly, spend money without validating the market, or attempt to navigate the patent process without a complete strategy.</p><p>Neither extreme is necessary.</p><p>The first step does not have to be manufacturing thousands of units or spending a fortune. It can begin with a confidential conversation, a professional evaluation, and a realistic plan.</p><p>Your idea may have the potential to become a protected invention, a profitable product, a licensing opportunity, or part of a lasting legacy.</p><p>But potential only becomes valuable when it is developed, protected, and put into motion.</p><h2>Bring Your Great Idea to Market</h2><p>Emanus helps innovators move forward with greater clarity, stronger protection, and a commercialization strategy built for the real world.</p><p>From early-stage ideation and patent protection to prototype development, licensing, sales strategy, and market entry, Emanus provides the experience and guidance needed to turn promising ideas into meaningful opportunities.</p><p>Do not allow fear, confusion, or a lack of direction to keep your innovation hidden.</p><p>Your idea deserves a serious strategyΓÇöand the right team to help bring it to life.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 16:29:42','2026-06-13 16:29:42',NULL,NULL),(2114,'Your Great Idea Deserves More Than a PatentΓÇöIt Deserves a Path to Market','your-great-idea-deserves-more-than-a-patent-it-deserves-a-path-to-market-2',NULL,'<p>Every successful invention begins with an idea.</p><p>It may come to you during a conversation, while solving a problem at work, or in the middle of the night when your mind refuses to shut off. You recognize that your idea could improve lives, transform an industry, or create an entirely new business opportunity.</p><p>But having a great idea is only the beginning.</p><p>The real challenge is knowing what to do next.</p><h2>An Idea Alone Is Not a Business</h2><p>Many inventors make the mistake of believing that a strong idea will naturally become a successful product. Unfortunately, the journey from inspiration to income is rarely that simple.</p><p>Before investing heavily in development, an inventor must answer several important questions:</p><ul><li>Is the idea truly new?</li><li>Can it be legally protected?</li><li>Does a market exist for the product?</li><li>Will customers actually pay for it?</li><li>Should the product be manufactured, licensed, sold, or presented to investors?</li><li>How can the inventor protect the idea while discussing it with others?</li></ul><p>Without the right answers, even a brilliant invention can become an expensive lesson.</p><p>That is why Emanus takes a more complete approach to innovation.</p><h2>Protecting the Idea Is Only One Part of the Process</h2><p>A patent can be an extremely valuable business asset. It may help protect an invention from competitors, strengthen a companyΓÇÖs position in the marketplace, create licensing opportunities, and make the business more attractive to potential investors.</p><p>However, obtaining a patent does not automatically create a successful product.</p><p>The invention must still be evaluated, developed, tested, positioned, and introduced to the right market. A patent sitting in a drawer is protectedΓÇöbut it is not producing revenue.</p><p>Emanus helps inventors think beyond simply filing paperwork. The goal is to create an intellectual property and commercialization strategy that supports the inventorΓÇÖs larger business objectives.</p><h2>From Inspiration to Market-Ready Innovation</h2><p>Emanus works with entrepreneurs, independent inventors, and growing businesses at many different stages of development.</p><p>Some clients arrive with nothing more than an early concept. Others already have drawings, prototypes, patent applications, or products that need a stronger path to market.</p><p>Depending on the project, the process may include:</p><h3>Idea Evaluation and Valuation</h3><p>Before committing significant time and money, the idea should be carefully evaluated. Research can help determine whether the concept is original, commercially realistic, and capable of creating a sustainable competitive advantage.</p><h3>Intellectual Property Protection</h3><p>The right protection may include a provisional patent, utility patent, design patent, trademark, copyright, trade-secret strategy, or a combination of intellectual property rights.</p><p>Choosing the wrong form of protection can leave important parts of an invention exposed.</p><h3>Patent and Prior-Art Research</h3><p>A professional search can uncover similar inventions, identify potential obstacles, and help determine whether the idea may qualify for patent protection.</p><p>This work can save an inventor from spending thousands of dollars developing something that already exists.</p><h3>Prototype and Product Development</h3><p>A concept becomes much easier to test, demonstrate, and improve once it becomes tangible. Prototype development allows inventors to evaluate functionality, gather feedback, correct weaknesses, and prepare the product for manufacturing or licensing discussions.</p><h3>Commercialization and Licensing Strategy</h3><p>Every invention requires a clear path to revenue.</p><p>Some inventors want to build and operate their own companies. Others prefer to license their technology to an established manufacturer in exchange for royalties. Some projects may require outside investment, strategic partnerships, or specialized distribution channels.</p><p>The right strategy depends on the inventor, the product, the available resources, and the market.</p><h3>Sales Strategy and Market Entry</h3><p>A product cannot succeed if the right people never see it.</p><p>Successful commercialization requires a clear understanding of the target customer, the productΓÇÖs value, its competitive advantage, pricing, sales channels, and launch strategy.</p><h2>Why Inventors Need a Strategic Partner</h2><p>Innovation can become overwhelming quickly. Inventors may find themselves dealing with patent professionals, engineers, prototype developers, manufacturers, marketers, investors, and licensing representativesΓÇöall while trying to protect their original vision.</p><p>Emanus helps bring those moving parts together.</p><p>Founded by Wil Jacques, a USPTO-registered patent agent, mechanical engineer, MBA, and experienced intellectual property strategist, Emanus combines technical knowledge with practical business and commercialization experience.</p><p>Rather than treating the inventor as another application number, Emanus provides personalized guidance designed around the invention, the market, and the inventorΓÇÖs long-term goals.</p><h2>Do Not Let Uncertainty Keep Your Idea Stuck</h2><p>Many valuable ideas never leave the inventorΓÇÖs notebook because the person behind them does not know where to begin.</p><p>Others move too quickly, disclose the idea publicly, spend money without validating the market, or attempt to navigate the patent process without a complete strategy.</p><p>Neither extreme is necessary.</p><p>The first step does not have to be manufacturing thousands of units or spending a fortune. It can begin with a confidential conversation, a professional evaluation, and a realistic plan.</p><p>Your idea may have the potential to become a protected invention, a profitable product, a licensing opportunity, or part of a lasting legacy.</p><p>But potential only becomes valuable when it is developed, protected, and put into motion.</p><h2>Bring Your Great Idea to Market</h2><p>Emanus helps innovators move forward with greater clarity, stronger protection, and a commercialization strategy built for the real world.</p><p>From early-stage ideation and patent protection to prototype development, licensing, sales strategy, and market entry, Emanus provides the experience and guidance needed to turn promising ideas into meaningful opportunities.</p><p>Do not allow fear, confusion, or a lack of direction to keep your innovation hidden.</p><p>Your idea deserves a serious strategyΓÇöand the right team to help bring it to life.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 16:30:52','2026-06-13 16:30:52',NULL,NULL),(2115,'Your Great Idea Deserves More Than a PatentΓÇöIt Deserves a Path to Market','your-great-idea-deserves-more-than-a-patent-it-deserves-a-path-to-market-3',NULL,'<p>Every successful invention begins with an idea.</p><p>It may come to you during a conversation, while solving a problem at work, or in the middle of the night when your mind refuses to shut off. You recognize that your idea could improve lives, transform an industry, or create an entirely new business opportunity.</p><p>But having a great idea is only the beginning.</p><p>The real challenge is knowing what to do next.</p><h2>An Idea Alone Is Not a Business</h2><p>Many inventors make the mistake of believing that a strong idea will naturally become a successful product. Unfortunately, the journey from inspiration to income is rarely that simple.</p><p>Before investing heavily in development, an inventor must answer several important questions:</p><ul><li>Is the idea truly new?</li><li>Can it be legally protected?</li><li>Does a market exist for the product?</li><li>Will customers actually pay for it?</li><li>Should the product be manufactured, licensed, sold, or presented to investors?</li><li>How can the inventor protect the idea while discussing it with others?</li></ul><p>Without the right answers, even a brilliant invention can become an expensive lesson.</p><p>That is why Emanus takes a more complete approach to innovation.</p><h2>Protecting the Idea Is Only One Part of the Process</h2><p>A patent can be an extremely valuable business asset. It may help protect an invention from competitors, strengthen a companyΓÇÖs position in the marketplace, create licensing opportunities, and make the business more attractive to potential investors.</p><p>However, obtaining a patent does not automatically create a successful product.</p><p>The invention must still be evaluated, developed, tested, positioned, and introduced to the right market. A patent sitting in a drawer is protectedΓÇöbut it is not producing revenue.</p><p>Emanus helps inventors think beyond simply filing paperwork. The goal is to create an intellectual property and commercialization strategy that supports the inventorΓÇÖs larger business objectives.</p><h2>From Inspiration to Market-Ready Innovation</h2><p>Emanus works with entrepreneurs, independent inventors, and growing businesses at many different stages of development.</p><p>Some clients arrive with nothing more than an early concept. Others already have drawings, prototypes, patent applications, or products that need a stronger path to market.</p><p>Depending on the project, the process may include:</p><h3>Idea Evaluation and Valuation</h3><p>Before committing significant time and money, the idea should be carefully evaluated. Research can help determine whether the concept is original, commercially realistic, and capable of creating a sustainable competitive advantage.</p><h3>Intellectual Property Protection</h3><p>The right protection may include a provisional patent, utility patent, design patent, trademark, copyright, trade-secret strategy, or a combination of intellectual property rights.</p><p>Choosing the wrong form of protection can leave important parts of an invention exposed.</p><h3>Patent and Prior-Art Research</h3><p>A professional search can uncover similar inventions, identify potential obstacles, and help determine whether the idea may qualify for patent protection.</p><p>This work can save an inventor from spending thousands of dollars developing something that already exists.</p><h3>Prototype and Product Development</h3><p>A concept becomes much easier to test, demonstrate, and improve once it becomes tangible. Prototype development allows inventors to evaluate functionality, gather feedback, correct weaknesses, and prepare the product for manufacturing or licensing discussions.</p><h3>Commercialization and Licensing Strategy</h3><p>Every invention requires a clear path to revenue.</p><p>Some inventors want to build and operate their own companies. Others prefer to license their technology to an established manufacturer in exchange for royalties. Some projects may require outside investment, strategic partnerships, or specialized distribution channels.</p><p>The right strategy depends on the inventor, the product, the available resources, and the market.</p><h3>Sales Strategy and Market Entry</h3><p>A product cannot succeed if the right people never see it.</p><p>Successful commercialization requires a clear understanding of the target customer, the productΓÇÖs value, its competitive advantage, pricing, sales channels, and launch strategy.</p><h2>Why Inventors Need a Strategic Partner</h2><p>Innovation can become overwhelming quickly. Inventors may find themselves dealing with patent professionals, engineers, prototype developers, manufacturers, marketers, investors, and licensing representativesΓÇöall while trying to protect their original vision.</p><p>Emanus helps bring those moving parts together.</p><p>Founded by Wil Jacques, a USPTO-registered patent agent, mechanical engineer, MBA, and experienced intellectual property strategist, Emanus combines technical knowledge with practical business and commercialization experience.</p><p>Rather than treating the inventor as another application number, Emanus provides personalized guidance designed around the invention, the market, and the inventorΓÇÖs long-term goals.</p><h2>Do Not Let Uncertainty Keep Your Idea Stuck</h2><p>Many valuable ideas never leave the inventorΓÇÖs notebook because the person behind them does not know where to begin.</p><p>Others move too quickly, disclose the idea publicly, spend money without validating the market, or attempt to navigate the patent process without a complete strategy.</p><p>Neither extreme is necessary.</p><p>The first step does not have to be manufacturing thousands of units or spending a fortune. It can begin with a confidential conversation, a professional evaluation, and a realistic plan.</p><p>Your idea may have the potential to become a protected invention, a profitable product, a licensing opportunity, or part of a lasting legacy.</p><p>But potential only becomes valuable when it is developed, protected, and put into motion.</p><h2>Bring Your Great Idea to Market</h2><p>Emanus helps innovators move forward with greater clarity, stronger protection, and a commercialization strategy built for the real world.</p><p>From early-stage ideation and patent protection to prototype development, licensing, sales strategy, and market entry, Emanus provides the experience and guidance needed to turn promising ideas into meaningful opportunities.</p><p>Do not allow fear, confusion, or a lack of direction to keep your innovation hidden.</p><p>Your idea deserves a serious strategyΓÇöand the right team to help bring it to life.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-13','1',6,1,77,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 16:32:17','2026-06-13 16:32:38',NULL,NULL),(2116,'TItle','title',NULL,'<p>Descriptions</p>',NULL,'2026-06-13','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 17:21:23','2026-06-13 17:21:23',NULL,NULL),(2117,'TItle','title-2',NULL,'<p>Descriptions</p>',NULL,'2026-06-13','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 17:21:38','2026-06-13 17:21:38',NULL,NULL),(2118,'TItle','title-3',NULL,'<p>Descriptions</p>',NULL,'2026-06-13','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 17:23:34','2026-06-13 17:23:34',NULL,NULL),(2119,'TItle','title-4',NULL,'<p>Descriptions</p>',NULL,'2026-06-13','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 17:23:55','2026-06-13 17:23:55',NULL,NULL),(2120,'Omnis libero aliquid 222','omnis-libero-aliquid-222',NULL,'<p>Omnis libero aliquid 222</p>',NULL,'2026-06-13','1',13,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 17:25:01','2026-06-13 17:25:01',NULL,NULL),(2121,'Omnis libero aliquid232','omnis-libero-aliquid232',NULL,'<p>service 222312</p>',NULL,'2026-06-13','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 17:28:31','2026-06-13 17:28:31',NULL,NULL),(2122,'Test blog 111 New','test-blog-111-new',NULL,'<p>Test blog 111 New&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2026-06-14','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 21:36:34','2026-06-13 21:36:34',NULL,NULL),(2123,'Book Meeting','book-meeting',NULL,'<h3><strong>Click Here to Schedule </strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,226,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 18:02:41','2026-06-15 18:02:41',NULL,NULL),(2124,'Who is Rick?','who-is-rick',NULL,'<p>Rick DelValle is the founder of New Beginning Recovery Houses, a recovery-centered sober living program dedicated to helping men rebuild their lives with structure, accountability, and genuine support.</p><p>After making the life-changing decision to get sober in 2008, Rick discovered a deeper purpose: helping others find their own path toward recovery, stability, and a better future. His journey eventually led him to become a drug and alcohol counselor and create safe, supportive homes for men working to change their lives.</p><p>Rick is also a proud father of two sons, and fatherhood has played an important role in shaping the man and leader he is today. His sons have strengthened his commitment to living with purpose, leading by example, and showing that a personΓÇÖs past does not have to determine their future.</p><p>Through New Beginning Recovery Houses, Rick has created more than a place to live. He has built a community where men are treated with dignity, challenged to take responsibility, and supported as they work toward lasting recovery.</p><p>For Rick, this mission is deeply personal. It is about recovery, family, second chances, and helping men become the fathers, sons, brothers, and individuals they were always capable of becoming.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 23:52:58','2026-06-15 23:52:58',NULL,NULL),(2125,'My Mission','my-mission-28',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission is to provide safe, structured, and supportive recovery housing for men who are ready to rebuild their lives. Through peer support, accountability, community involvement, employment assistance, recovery meetings, and a family-centered environment, New Beginning Recovery Houses helps men move from early sobriety into lasting recovery and personal growth.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 23:54:03','2026-06-15 23:54:03',NULL,NULL),(2126,'New Beginning Recovery House\'s Mission & Vision','new-beginning-recovery-houses-mission-vision',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 00:00:39','2026-06-16 00:00:39',NULL,NULL),(2127,'Podcast: Risen From the Ashes','podcast',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 00:19:07','2026-06-16 00:23:16',NULL,NULL),(2129,'We Will Help','we-will-help-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',26,1,232,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 01:19:47','2026-06-16 01:19:47',NULL,NULL),(2130,'My Mission','my-mission-29',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">My mission is to help protect clients, information, and organizational trust by approaching every interaction with professionalism, discretion, accuracy, and a strong commitment to security.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:22:35','2026-06-22 05:22:35',NULL,NULL),(2131,'Who is Julia?','who-is-julia',NULL,'<p>My name is Julia Quinn, and I serve as a&nbsp;<strong>Senior Security Representative on the EST Team at Fidelity Investments</strong>.</p><p>In my role,<strong> I focus on supporting security-related processes, protecting sensitive information, and helping maintain the trust that clients and teams depend on every day.</strong> Security is more than a procedure ΓÇö it is about awareness, accuracy, discretion, and consistency.</p><p>I take pride in being professional, dependable, and detail-oriented, especially in situations where trust, privacy, and protection matter most. My goal is to provide support with clarity, care, and confidence while representing FidelityΓÇÖs high standards of client service and security.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:25:23','2026-06-22 05:25:23',NULL,NULL),(2132,'What is JuliaΓÇÖs role?','what-is-julias-role',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Julia serves as a Senior Security Representative on the EST Team at Fidelity Investments.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:27:36','2026-06-22 05:27:36',NULL,NULL),(2133,'What does a security representative focus on?','what-does-a-security-representative-focus-on',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">A security representative supports processes related to protection, accuracy, privacy, and secure client or organizational interactions.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:29:16','2026-06-22 05:29:16',NULL,NULL),(2134,'Can I contact Julia through this card?','can-i-contact-julia-through-this-card',NULL,'<p>Yes. This vBiz Me card gives you a fast and convenient way to save JuliaΓÇÖs contact information, reach out directly, and access relevant professional links.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:30:06','2026-06-22 05:30:06',NULL,NULL),(2135,'Is this card for financial advice?','is-this-card-for-financial-advice',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. This card is for professional contact and informational purposes only. JuliaΓÇÖs role is security-focused, not financial advising.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:31:05','2026-06-22 05:31:05',NULL,NULL),(2136,'Compliance-Safe Disclaimer','compliance-safe-disclaimer',NULL,'<p>This vBiz Me card is for professional contact and informational purposes only. Julia QuinnΓÇÖs role is security-focused and does not represent financial, investment, legal, or tax advice. Fidelity InvestmentsΓÇÖ official website should be used for company information, services, disclosures, and client resources.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:34:56','2026-06-22 05:34:56',NULL,NULL),(2137,'Why Security and Trust Matter in Every Financial Interaction','why-security-and-trust-matter-in-every-financial-interaction',NULL,'<p>When people think about financial services, they often think about accounts, planning, investments, and customer support. But behind every interaction, there is something even more important holding everything together:</p><p><strong>Trust.</strong></p><p>Trust is not built by accident. It is protected through careful processes, attention to detail, professional communication, and a strong commitment to security.</p><p>As a&nbsp;<strong>Senior Security Representative on the EST Team at Fidelity Investments</strong>, my role is centered around supporting security-focused processes that help protect clients, sensitive information, and the integrity of each interaction.</p><p>In a world where scams, fraud attempts, identity concerns, and digital risks are becoming more common, security has never been more important. Every detail matters. Every conversation matters. Every step in the process matters.</p><p>Security is not just about reacting when something goes wrong. It is about staying aware, being prepared, and helping create an environment where clients and teams can feel confident that information is being handled with professionalism and care.</p><h3><strong>What Security Means to Me</strong></h3><p>Security means being alert.</p><p>Security means being accurate.</p><p>Security means protecting information even when no one is watching.</p><p>Security means treating every interaction with the seriousness it deserves.</p><p>It also means understanding that behind every account, every call, and every concern, there is a real person who deserves clarity, respect, and protection.</p><p>My goal is to support trust through professionalism, discretion, and consistency. Whether I am helping with internal processes, security-related support, or client protection efforts, I believe the small details are often what make the biggest difference.</p><h3><strong>Why It Matters</strong></h3><p>Financial information is deeply personal. People want to know that their information is being treated carefully and that the people handling it understand the responsibility that comes with that trust.</p><p>That is why security-focused roles are so important. They help protect not only information, but confidence.</p><p>And confidence matters.</p><p>Because when people feel protected, they can communicate more clearly, ask better questions, and move forward with greater peace of mind.</p><h3><strong>Final Thought</strong></h3><p>Security is not just a department. It is a mindset.</p><p>It is the discipline of doing things correctly, the awareness to notice what matters, and the professionalism to protect trust every step of the way.</p><p>That is the standard I believe in ΓÇö and the standard I work to support every day.</p><h2><br></h2><h2><strong>Compliance-Safe Disclaimer</strong></h2><p>This blog is for professional and informational purposes only. Julia QuinnΓÇÖs role is security-focused and does not represent financial, investment, legal, or tax advice. For official Fidelity Investments information, services, disclosures, and client resources, please visit FidelityΓÇÖs official website.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-22','1',6,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:42:07','2026-06-22 06:06:01',NULL,NULL),(2140,'Huge Inventory. Better Prices. Cars That Move.','huge-inventory-better-prices-cars-that-move',NULL,'<p>At<strong> A Better Way Wholesale Autos,</strong> we keep a large inventory of pre-owned vehicles so customers have real choices ΓÇö cars, trucks, SUVs, luxury vehicles, work vehicles, family vehicles, first-time buyer options, and budget-friendly vehicles all in one place.</p><p><strong>As a high-volume dealership,</strong> our goal is simple:&nbsp;<strong>move vehicles, not let them sit.</strong>&nbsp;That means we regularly review our inventory and adjust pricing to stay competitive in the market. When a vehicle needs to move, we reduce the price and create opportunities for customers to get a better deal.</p><p>My job as manager is to help customers find the right vehicle, understand their options, and take advantage of the best available pricing before the vehicle is gone.<strong> Inventory changes fast, prices can change, and the best deals usually do not wait around.</strong></p><p><strong>Browse the inventory, contact me directly, and letΓÇÖs find the vehicle that makes sense for you.</strong></p>',NULL,'2026-06-22','1',6,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:20:07','2026-06-22 11:12:49',NULL,NULL),(2141,'Our Mission','our-mission-45',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our mission is to provide customers with a better way to purchase and maintain a pre-owned vehicle by combining extensive selection, competitive pricing, flexible financing resources, knowledgeable assistance, and dependable automotive service in one convenient location.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:30:03','2026-06-22 07:30:03',NULL,NULL),(2142,'How many vehicles do you have available?','how-many-vehicles-do-you-have-available',NULL,'<p>Our inventory changes daily and includes hundreds of pre-owned cars, trucks, SUVs, vans, luxury vehicles, and specialty automobiles. Contact me with the stock number or type of vehicle you want, and I will help confirm availability.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:33:04','2026-06-22 07:33:04',NULL,NULL),(2143,'Should I call before visiting?','should-i-call-before-visiting',NULL,'<p>Yes. Because inventory moves quickly, calling or texting before you arrive can help confirm that the vehicle you are interested in is still available. The dealership says it may sell as many as 30 vehicles on busy days</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:33:42','2026-06-22 07:33:42',NULL,NULL),(2144,'Can you help customers with challenged or limited credit?','can-you-help-customers-with-challenged-or-limited-credit',NULL,'<p>We work with multiple lenders and assist customers across different credit situations. Approval, interest rate, down payment, and loan terms depend on the lender and applicant qualifications.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:34:43','2026-06-22 07:34:43',NULL,NULL),(2145,'Do you offer ITIN financing?','do-you-offer-itin-financing',NULL,'<p>Yes. Participating lenders may consider qualified applicants using an ITIN instead of a Social Security number. Contact me for application requirements and assistance.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:35:26','2026-06-22 07:35:26',NULL,NULL),(2146,'What should I bring when applying for financing?','what-should-i-bring-when-applying-for-financing',NULL,'<p>It is helpful to bring a valid driverΓÇÖs license, proof of residence, proof of income, insurance information, and co-signer information when applicable. Additional documents may be required by the lender.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:36:08','2026-06-22 07:36:08',NULL,NULL),(2147,'Can I trade in my current vehicle?','can-i-trade-in-my-current-vehicle',NULL,'<p>Yes. We can review your current vehicle and discuss how its eligible trade value may be applied toward your next purchase. You can also begin with the online Kelley Blue Book Instant Cash Offer tool.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:36:45','2026-06-22 07:36:45',NULL,NULL),(2148,'Are extended warranties available?','are-extended-warranties-available',NULL,'<p>Yes. Depending on the vehicle, different extended-service-contract options may be available, ranging from basic powertrain protection to more comprehensive coverage.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:37:39','2026-06-22 07:37:39',NULL,NULL),(2149,'Do you sell to customers outside Connecticut?','do-you-sell-to-customers-outside-connecticut',NULL,'<p>Yes. The dealership regularly works with out-of-state buyers and may be able to assist with financing, registration, transportation, or shipping arrangements depending on the destination</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:38:29','2026-06-22 07:38:29',NULL,NULL),(2150,'Wh is TJ?','wh-is-tj',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖve been in the automotive business for over two decades, and in that time IΓÇÖve learned one thing: people do not just need a car ΓÇö they need someone they can trust to help them make the right decision.</p><p>I believe in being loyal, fair, and honest with every customer who walks through the door. <strong>My job is to listen, understand what you need, and help you find a vehicle that makes sense for your lifestyle, your budget, and your goals.</strong></p><p>After 20 years in this business, IΓÇÖve developed a pretty sharp instinct for people, vehicles, deals, and yes ΓÇö the occasional nonsense that comes with car shopping. I know how to cut through the confusion, avoid the runaround, and get straight to what matters: helping you find the right vehicle at the right price.</p><p>At A Better Way Wholesale Autos, we move a high volume of vehicles, which means inventory changes quickly and pricing is constantly being reviewed. My goal is to help you take advantage of the best available opportunities before they are gone.</p><p>If you want someone straightforward, experienced, and fair in your corner, contact me directly. IΓÇÖll help you find a better way to buy your next vehicle.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:46:46','2026-06-22 07:46:46',NULL,NULL),(2151,'2024 Consumer Satisfaction Award','2024-consumer-satisfaction-award',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',18,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 07:59:30','2026-06-22 07:59:30',NULL,NULL),(2152,'Schedule a Service Appointment','schedule-a-service-appointment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 08:07:49','2026-06-22 08:07:49',NULL,NULL),(2153,'Get Pre-Qualified in Seconds','get-pre-qualified-in-seconds',NULL,'<p>Pre Qualified</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:19:38','2026-06-22 10:19:38',NULL,NULL),(2154,'KBB Instant Cash Offer','kbb-instant-cash-offer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:43:51','2026-06-22 10:43:51',NULL,NULL),(2155,'Under $15,000','under-15000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:42:52','2026-06-22 11:42:52',NULL,NULL),(2156,'$15,000 to $20,000','15000-to-20000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:45:32','2026-06-22 11:45:32',NULL,NULL),(2157,'$20,000 to 25,000','20000-to-25000',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:47:07','2026-06-22 11:47:07',NULL,NULL),(2158,'$25,000 and more','25000-and-more',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',28,1,240,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:49:48','2026-06-22 11:49:48',NULL,NULL),(2159,'A+ Rating','a-rating',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 16:18:13','2026-06-23 16:18:13',NULL,NULL),(2160,'Insights Live from Fidelity Wealth Management','monthly-events',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,239,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 17:02:04','2026-06-23 17:02:47',NULL,NULL);
