7',NULL,NULL),(2181,'How fast can automation be set up?','how-fast-can-automation-be-set-up',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The site says the AI automations can be running within days, depending on the project.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,241,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 07:44:30','2026-06-28 07:44:30',NULL,NULL),(2182,'Will it sound like my business?','will-it-sound-like-my-business',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Outreach Allies builds the tools around the clientΓÇÖs voice, brand, services, policies, and tone.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,241,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 07:45:21','2026-06-28 07:45:21',NULL,NULL),(2183,'MY Mission','my-mission-30',NULL,'<p>To help small businesses reclaim their time, stay visible, and grow with marketing systems that actually fit their life ΓÇö not another complicated platform, overpriced agency retainer, or robotic AI tool that sounds like it was written by a toaster with a LinkedIn account.</p><p>Outreach Allies believes marketing should be consistent, manageable, and built in the business ownerΓÇÖs real voice. Their approach is phone-first, simple to approve, and designed so nothing goes live without the clientΓÇÖs say-so.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,241,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 07:50:23','2026-06-28 07:50:23',NULL,NULL),(2184,'Who is Robert Brown?','who-is-robert-brown',NULL,'<p><strong>Outreach Allies was built for business owners wearing every hat </strong>ΓÇö the ones trying to serve customers, create content, follow up with leads, answer the same questions, write emails, post online, and somehow still run the actual business.</p><p>They are not just another generic AI tool. They combine AI-powered automations, done-for-you agency services, and smart marketing support built around the way small businesses actually operate. The goal is simple: save owners time, keep their voice intact, and help them stay visible without burning out.</p><p>The company was founded by Rob, a former full-time artist and maker who learned marketing and AI after experiencing the same struggle firsthand: loving the work, but dreading the promotion. That gives the brand a very real, small-business-owner-to-small-business-owner feel.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,241,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 07:52:55','2026-06-28 07:52:55',NULL,NULL),(2185,'How Outreach Allies Uses AI to Turn Digital Marketing Into a Growth Machine','how-outreach-allies-uses-ai-to-turn-digital-marketing-into-a-growth-machine',NULL,'<p>Digital marketing has changed. Fast.</p><p>What used to take hours of manual work ΓÇö writing emails, building campaigns, analyzing data, creating content, tracking leads, and following up ΓÇö can now be done faster, smarter, and more strategically with AI.</p><p>That is where&nbsp;<strong>Outreach Allies</strong>&nbsp;comes in.</p><p>Outreach Allies is not just another digital marketing agency. We help businesses use the full power of artificial intelligence to reach the right people, deliver the right message, and turn attention into real opportunity.</p><p>Because letΓÇÖs be honest: throwing random posts online and hoping customers magically appear is not marketing. That is digital wishful thinking with a Wi-Fi connection.</p><h3>AI-Powered Outreach That Works Smarter</h3><p>With AI, outreach becomes more focused and more effective. Instead of guessing what your audience wants, AI helps analyze behavior, trends, engagement, and customer intent.</p><p>That means better emails, smarter campaigns, stronger messaging, and more meaningful conversations with potential customers.</p><p>Outreach Allies uses AI to help businesses:</p><p>Create better marketing content</p><p>Build smarter email campaigns</p><p>Improve lead generation</p><p>Automate follow-ups</p><p>Analyze customer behavior</p><p>Strengthen social media presence</p><p>Save time while increasing results</p><h3>Marketing With Speed, Strategy, and Precision</h3><p>The biggest advantage of AI is not just speed. It is precision.</p><p>AI helps businesses stop wasting time on people who are not interested and start focusing on people who are more likely to respond, engage, and buy.</p><p>At Outreach Allies, we combine creativity, strategy, and automation to help businesses grow without drowning in busywork.</p><h3>Your Digital Marketing Ally</h3><p>The future of marketing belongs to businesses that adapt.</p><p>AI is no longer optional. It is the difference between chasing customers and attracting them with smarter systems.</p><p>Outreach Allies helps businesses stay ahead by using AI to create marketing that is faster, sharper, and more effective.</p><p>Because your competitors are not waiting.</p><p>And neither should you.</p><p><strong>Outreach Allies</strong></p><p><strong>AI-Powered Digital Marketing for Businesses Ready to Grow</strong></p>',NULL,'2026-06-28','1',6,1,241,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 10:04:48','2026-06-29 02:28:00',NULL,NULL),(2186,'Scan To Order Book','scan-to-order-book',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',34,1,207,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 03:16:52','2026-06-29 03:16:52',NULL,NULL),(2187,'Who is Adam?','who-is-adam',NULL,'<p><strong>Adam Cuatt is an Army Veteran</strong> who understands that service does not end when the uniform comes off. After serving his country, Adam created 4US Because of Us Veterans Foundation to help veterans and families get connected to the support, programs, resources, and community they deserve.</p><p>AdamΓÇÖs approach is simple: veterans should not have to fight alone for help after already fighting for everyone else.</p><p>Through 4US Because of Us, Adam works to bring veterans together, support veteran-owned companies, organize community efforts, and help families find answers when the system feels confusing, frustrating, or impossible to deal with.</p><p>He is direct, loyal, mission-driven, and committed to being there for his brothers and sisters in the veteran community.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,244,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 19:08:53','2026-07-01 19:08:53',NULL,NULL),(2188,'My Mission','my-mission-31',NULL,'<p>At 4US Because of Us Veterans Foundation, our mission is to support U.S. military veterans, their families, and the communities they helped protect.</p><p>We help veterans access programs, assist with disability paperwork, promote veteran-owned businesses, organize local events, support families, and create opportunities for veterans to be seen, heard, respected, and supported.</p><p>We believe veterans deserve more than appreciation.</p><p>They deserve action.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,244,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 19:10:37','2026-07-01 19:10:37',NULL,NULL),(2189,'Veterans Deserve More Than a Thank You','veterans-deserve-more-than-a-thank-you',NULL,'<p>Every year, people say the right words.</p><p>ΓÇ£Thank you for your service.ΓÇ¥</p><p>And while those words matter, they are not enough by themselves.</p><p>Veterans need access to programs. They need help with paperwork. They need community. They need someone to answer the phone. They need families who are supported. They need businesses that get noticed. They need people who do more than clap on holidays and disappear the rest of the year.</p><p>That is why Adam Cuatt created 4US Because of Us Veterans Foundation.</p><p>This organization is built for veterans, families, and the community. It exists to help veterans find resources, get connected, promote their businesses, participate in local events, and know that someone is standing beside them.</p><p>Because support should not be complicated.</p><p>Because veterans should not feel alone.</p><p>Because after everything they gave, the least we can do is show up.</p><p>4US Because of Us is not just a name.</p><p>It is a reminder.</p><p>Because of them, we have freedom.</p><p>Because of us, they should have support.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,244,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 19:22:37','2026-07-01 19:22:37',NULL,NULL),(2190,'Our Mission','our-mission-46',NULL,'<p>Our mission is to raise up a generation of young adults who know God deeply, hear His voice clearly, walk in the gifts of the Holy Spirit, and courageously share the Gospel with the world.</p><p>Through prayer, worship, teaching, healing, deliverance, and evangelism, we help young people encounter God personally and become bold witnesses of His love, power, and mercy.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:45:10','2026-07-01 22:45:10',NULL,NULL),(2191,'Who are the camps for?','who-are-the-camps-for',NULL,'<p>The camps are designed for young adults ages 18 to 30 who want to grow deeper in their relationship with God and develop their spiritual gifts.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:48:33','2026-07-01 22:48:33',NULL,NULL),(2192,'How long is the camp?','how-long-is-the-camp',NULL,'<p>The camp is expected to last approximately 10 days.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:49:34','2026-07-01 22:49:34',NULL,NULL),(2193,'What will participants learn?','what-will-participants-learn',NULL,'<p>Participants will learn about prayer, Scripture, intimacy with God, worship, prophecy, healing prayer, evangelism, and the gifts of the Holy Spirit.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:50:43','2026-07-01 22:50:43',NULL,NULL),(2194,'Is the camp only teaching, or is it interactive?','is-the-camp-only-teaching-or-is-it-interactive',NULL,'<p>The camp includes both teaching and practical workshops. Participants will not just sit and listen ΓÇö they will be invited to participate, pray, practice, worship, and grow.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:51:21','2026-07-01 22:51:21',NULL,NULL),(2195,'Will there be time to relax?','will-there-be-time-to-relax',NULL,'<p>Yes. The camp is designed to be spiritually powerful but also balanced. There will be time for fellowship, games, rest, community, and building friendships.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:52:04','2026-07-01 22:52:04',NULL,NULL),(2196,'How much does the camp cost?','how-much-does-the-camp-cost',NULL,'<p>The cost has not been finalized yet. Pricing will depend on the location, accommodations, meals, and overall camp structure.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:52:41','2026-07-01 22:52:41',NULL,NULL),(2197,'What countries has Antoine ministered in?','what-countries-has-antoine-ministered-in',NULL,'<h3>What countries has Antoine ministered in?</h3><p>Antoine has ministered in Portugal, Spain, France, the United Kingdom, Colombia, and the United States, with invitations to expand into other countries.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:53:11','2026-07-01 22:53:11',NULL,NULL),(2198,'What is the long-term vision?','what-is-the-long-term-vision',NULL,'<p>The long-term vision is to launch ministry summer camps and mission schools around the world, forming young adults who are spiritually mature, filled with the Holy Spirit, and ready to share the Gospel.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 22:59:23','2026-07-01 22:59:23',NULL,NULL),(2199,'Ministry Summer Camps','ministry-summer-camps',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">The ministry summer camps are designed for young adults ages 18 to 30 who desire a deeper relationship with God and want to grow in spiritual maturity, prayer, worship, and mission.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">The camps are built around three main areas of formation:</span></p><p><br></p><h3><strong>1. Intimacy With God</strong></h3><p>Participants are taught how to pray, connect with God, build a personal relationship with the Lord, grow through Scripture, and experience the presence of God through praise and worship.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>2. Spiritual Gifts &amp; Charisms</strong></h3><p>The camp includes practical workshops where participants learn about the gifts of the Holy Spirit, especially prophecy, hearing from God, healing prayer, and physical healing. These sessions are interactive and hands-on, giving young people the opportunity to learn, practice, and grow in a safe spiritual environment.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>3. Evangelism &amp; Mission</strong></h3><p>Participants are trained in how to share the Gospel, speak with others about faith, and bring the good news into real-life situations, including street evangelism and missionary outreach.</p><p>Each evening includes powerful times of worship, prayer, and openness to receiving the baptism of the Holy Spirit.</p><p>The camp is designed to be intense but balanced, combining deep spiritual formation with fellowship, rest, games, community, and joy. The goal is not only to form strong disciples, but also to build lasting Christian friendships and unity.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 23:03:50','2026-07-01 23:03:50',NULL,NULL),(2200,'Who is Antoine?','who-is-antoine',NULL,'<p><strong>Antoine Coelho is a Christian Minister, Director of International Affairs at World Worship Unity, Teacher, and Missionary Leader dedicated to helping young adults encounter God, grow in spiritual maturity, and walk in the gifts of the Holy Spirit.</strong></p><p>After giving his life to the Lord in 1993, Antoine devoted himself to prayer, Scripture, fasting, and spiritual formation. With a background in philosophy, theology, and Scripture, he teaches with both depth and clarity.</p><p>His ministry focuses on inner healing, prophecy, physical healing, deliverance, worship, evangelism, and missionary formation. Antoine has ministered in Portugal, Spain, France, the United Kingdom, Colombia, Pakistan, India and the United States.</p><p>Together with his wife, Antoine now carries a vision to launch ministry summer camps and mission schools around the world through World Worship Unity, helping raise up a generation filled with faith, courage, and the power of the Holy Spirit.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-01 23:11:04','2026-07-03 02:05:54',NULL,NULL),(2201,'What does Fully Promoted Milford do?','what-does-fully-promoted-milford-do',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Fully Promoted Milford helps businesses and organizations create custom branded apparel, promotional products, uniforms, corporate gifts, and marketing merchandise.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:07:13','2026-07-02 21:07:13',NULL,NULL),(2202,'Can Deb help me choose the right products?','can-deb-help-me-choose-the-right-products',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Deb helps clients choose products based on their audience, budget, event, industry, and marketing goal.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:07:50','2026-07-02 21:07:50',NULL,NULL),(2203,'Do you only make shirts?','do-you-only-make-shirts',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Fully Promoted offers apparel, hats, bags, drinkware, pens, technology items, corporate gifts, uniforms, event products, and many other branded items.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:08:35','2026-07-02 21:08:35',NULL,NULL),(2204,'Do you work with small businesses?','do-you-work-with-small-businesses',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Deb works with small businesses, larger organizations, schools, nonprofits, healthcare providers, contractors, automotive businesses, and professional service companies.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:09:09','2026-07-02 21:09:09',NULL,NULL),(2205,'Can you help with employee uniforms?','can-you-help-with-employee-uniforms',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Fully Promoted Milford offers branded uniforms, workwear, polos, button-ups, hats, and apparel for teams that need to look professional and consistent</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:09:52','2026-07-02 21:09:52',NULL,NULL),(2206,'Can you help with event giveaways or trade show products?','can-you-help-with-event-giveaways-or-trade-show-products',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Deb can help create useful branded giveaways for trade shows, networking events, recruiting events, fundraisers, community events, and corporate programs.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:10:28','2026-07-02 21:10:28',NULL,NULL),(2207,'Can you help with employee appreciation gifts?','can-you-help-with-employee-appreciation-gifts',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Deb can help with onboarding kits, recognition gifts, holiday gifts, milestone items, and branded products that make employees feel valued.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:11:02','2026-07-02 21:11:02',NULL,NULL),(2208,'Why are promotional products still important?','why-are-promotional-products-still-important',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Because the right branded product keeps your business in front of people long after the first conversation. A useful product becomes a repeated reminder of your company.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:11:46','2026-07-02 21:11:46',NULL,NULL),(2209,'Your Logo Deserves Better Than Being Slapped on Random Stuff','your-logo-deserves-better-than-being-slapped-on-random-stuff',NULL,'<p>Promotional products work best when they are chosen with purpose.</p><p>A pen, polo, tumbler, hat, jacket, tote bag, or onboarding gift should never be random. It should match the audience, support the message, represent the brand, and be useful enough that people actually keep it.</p><p>That is where smart branding makes the difference.</p><p>A company shirt can help a team look professional. A branded water bottle can become part of someoneΓÇÖs daily routine. A well-made jacket can build employee pride. A thoughtful client gift can keep your business top of mind. A trade show giveaway can turn a quick conversation into a lasting impression.</p><p>The best branded products do more than display a logo.</p><p>They help people remember who you are, what you do, and why your business matters.</p><p>At Fully Promoted Milford, Deb Katz helps businesses, schools, nonprofits, healthcare organizations, trades, and professional teams choose branded products that are useful, polished, and built around real goals.</p><p>Because your brand should not just show up.</p><p>It should stand out.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-02','1',6,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:12:32','2026-07-02 22:07:15',NULL,NULL),(2210,'No Job Too Big: The Full-Service Play That Won A DistributorΓÇÖs Largest Order','no-job-too-big-the-full-service-play-that-won-a-distributors-largest-order',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',18,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:19:35','2026-07-02 21:19:35',NULL,NULL),(2211,'Leveraging the Network. Winning Bigger','leveraging-the-network-winning-bigger',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',18,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 21:21:40','2026-07-02 21:21:40',NULL,NULL),(2212,'My Mission','my-mission-32',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To help businesses and organizations build stronger brand visibility through custom apparel, promotional products, uniforms, corporate gifts, and marketing solutions that are useful, professional, memorable, and built around the clientΓÇÖs real goals.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-02 22:09:03','2026-07-02 22:09:03',NULL,NULL),(2213,'Arise Unity Camps: A Place to Encounter God, Discover Your Gifts, and Step Into Your Calling','arise-unity-camps-a-place-to-encounter-god-discover-your-gifts-and-step-into-your-calling',NULL,'<h1>Arise Unity Camps: A Place to Encounter God, Discover Your Gifts, and Step Into Your Calling</h1><p>Faith was never meant to be something people simply talk about once a week. Faith is meant to be lived, practiced, shared, and carried into the world with courage.</p><p>That is the heart behind&nbsp;<strong>Arise Unity Camps</strong>.</p><p>This Christian camp is being created for young adults who are hungry for more than ordinary religion. It is for those who want to know God deeply, grow in prayer, experience the Holy Spirit, and learn how to serve others with love, boldness, and purpose.</p><p>The vision is simple but powerful:</p><p><strong>Igniting Faith ΓÇó Healing ΓÇó Raising Disciples</strong></p><h2>A Camp Built Around Real Encounter</h2><p>Arise Unity Camps is designed to help young adults build a personal and powerful relationship with God.</p><p>The first focus of the camp is&nbsp;<strong>intimacy with God</strong>. Participants will be guided into deeper prayer, Scripture, worship, and spiritual reflection. The goal is not just to learn about God, but to truly encounter Him.</p><p>In a world filled with noise, pressure, distraction, and confusion, young people need a place where they can slow down, listen, worship, and reconnect with what matters most.</p><h2>Discovering the Gifts of the Holy Spirit</h2><p>Another major part of the camp is learning about the gifts of the Holy Spirit.</p><p>Participants will receive teaching and practical training in spiritual gifts such as prophecy, hearing from God, healing prayer, and physical healing. These sessions are not meant to be passive lectures where people simply sit and listen. They are meant to be interactive, practical, and faith-building.</p><p>The goal is to help young adults grow in confidence, humility, wisdom, and love as they learn how to recognize and use the gifts God has placed within them.</p><h2>Healing for the Heart and Soul</h2><p>Arise Unity Camps will also focus on inner healing.</p><p>Many people carry wounds, fear, anxiety, shame, disappointment, and spiritual heaviness. Through teaching, prayer, worship, and ministry, participants will be invited to open their hearts to GodΓÇÖs healing presence.</p><p>This is not about pretending life is perfect. It is about allowing God to restore what has been broken, strengthen what has been weak, and bring freedom where there has been pain.</p><h2>Evangelism With Love and Courage</h2><p>The camp will also train young adults in evangelism.</p><p>Participants will learn how to share the good news, speak with people, pray with others, and bring the love of Christ into everyday life. Evangelism is not about pressure or performance. It is about compassion, truth, courage, and love.</p><p>The world does not need more empty words. It needs people who carry the presence of God and know how to serve others with sincerity.</p><h2>A Balanced Experience</h2><p>Although the camp will be spiritually powerful, it is also designed to be balanced.</p><p>There will be time for prayer, teaching, worship, ministry, and practical training, but also time for fellowship, relaxation, games, conversation, and friendship.</p><p>The goal is to create an atmosphere that is intense enough to be life-changing, but balanced enough to be joyful, human, and healthy. Nobody needs a camp that feels like spiritual boot camp with bad snacks. This is meant to build people up, not wear them out.</p><h2>Raising a New Generation of Disciples</h2><p>The long-term vision of Arise Unity Camps is bigger than one camp.</p><p>The dream is to raise up young adults who are deeply rooted in God, filled with the Holy Spirit, and ready to serve the world. The future vision includes mission schools in different parts of the world, where students can continue to grow in faith, prayer, healing, evangelism, and ministry.</p><p>This is about forming disciples who do not just believe quietly, but live boldly.</p><h2>The Invitation</h2><p>Arise Unity Camps is for young adults who want more.</p><p>More prayer.</p><p>More purpose.</p><p>More healing.</p><p>More courage.</p><p>More of God.</p><p>It is for those who feel called to grow, serve, worship, evangelize, and discover the gifts God has placed inside them.</p><p>Faith is not meant to stay hidden. It is meant to arise.</p><p><strong>Arise Unity Camps</strong>&nbsp;exists to help young people encounter God, discover their gifts, and step into the mission they were created for.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',6,1,243,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 00:56:36','2026-07-03 00:56:36',NULL,NULL),(2215,'What does Refresh, LLC do?','what-does-refresh-llc-do',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Refresh helps clients declutter, organize, reset, relocate, and maintain spaces in homes, businesses, offices, storage areas, and digital environments.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 23:32:04','2026-07-03 23:32:04',NULL,NULL),(2216,'What is Refreshology?','what-is-refreshology',NULL,'<p>Refreshology is AliciaΓÇÖs signature approach that combines organization, lifestyle support, wellness, routines, and long-term systems so your space supports the way you actually live.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 23:32:41','2026-07-03 23:32:41',NULL,NULL),(2217,'Is any project too big or too small?','is-any-project-too-big-or-too-small',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Refresh handles everything from a few hours of focused organizing to larger projects that may take weeks or months.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 23:33:16','2026-07-03 23:33:16',NULL,NULL),(2218,'Do I have to be embarrassed about my space?','do-i-have-to-be-embarrassed-about-my-space',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Absolutely not. Refresh is built around compassion, support, and non-judgment. The goal is to help you feel successful, not ashamed.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 23:33:58','2026-07-03 23:33:58',NULL,NULL),(2219,'Does Refresh help with moving or downsizing?','does-refresh-help-with-moving-or-downsizing',NULL,'<p>Yes. The Relocate Package supports clients before, during, and after a move with decluttering, packing guidance, unpacking, donation support, and space planning.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 23:34:29','2026-07-03 23:34:29',NULL,NULL),(2220,'Does Refresh offer ongoing support?','does-refresh-offer-ongoing-support',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. After a core organizing project, clients can choose monthly, bi-weekly, weekly, or premium lifestyle maintenance support to keep systems working long-term.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 23:35:06','2026-07-03 23:35:06',NULL,NULL),(2221,'Click to View Our BBB Rating','click-to-view-our-bbb-rating',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-03 23:51:01','2026-07-03 23:51:01',NULL,NULL),(2222,'Click to Shop Now','click-to-shop-now',NULL,'<h3><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 97, 0);\">Click Here to Shop Now</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',34,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-04 11:13:26','2026-07-04 11:13:26',NULL,NULL),(2223,'Who is Deb?','who-is-deb',NULL,'<p>I\'m a lifelong marketer, business owner, and relationship builder who genuinely enjoys helping people solve problems and make meaningful connections. After more than 30 years in corporate marketing, I founded Fully Promoted Milford to combine my passion for branding, creativity, and exceptional customer service. When I\'m not working with clients, you\'ll usually find me cooking, walking the beach, hot air ballooning, or driving my antique car.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,242,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-04 14:54:25','2026-07-04 14:54:25',NULL,NULL),(2224,'My Mission','my-mission-33',NULL,'<p><strong>At Refresh, LLC</strong>, our mission is to help people transform their spaces into environments that support peace, productivity, wellness, and everyday ease. We believe organization is not just about tidying up ΓÇö it is about creating systems that reduce stress, improve routines, and help people feel more in control of their homes, businesses, and lives.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 15:23:00','2026-07-05 15:23:00',NULL,NULL),(2225,'Who is Alicia?','who-is-alicia',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Alicia Soares, founder of&nbsp;<strong>Refresh, LLC</strong>, a professional organizing and lifestyle support company dedicated to helping clients create calmer, cleaner, and more functional spaces. With over 12 years in the organizing industry, I bring a personal, compassionate, and highly customized approach to every project.</p><p>My background in education, including Special Education, gives me a unique ability to understand each clientΓÇÖs needs, routines, challenges, and goals. I do more than organize rooms ΓÇö I help people build spaces that support clarity, peace, confidence, and a better everyday life.</p><p>Through&nbsp;<strong>Refreshology</strong>, I combine practical organizing systems with lifestyle awareness to help clients reduce overwhelm, simplify daily routines, and create environments that feel safe, healing, and inspiring.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 15:41:04','2026-07-05 15:43:16',NULL,NULL),(2226,'Book A Consultation With Me','book-a-consultation-with-me',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 15:48:55','2026-07-05 15:48:55',NULL,NULL),(2227,'A Fresh Start Begins With the Space Around You','a-fresh-start-begins-with-the-space-around-you',NULL,'<p>Most people think organizing is about containers, labels, shelves, and perfectly folded towels.</p><p>And yes, those things help.</p><p>But real organization goes much deeper than making a space look nice for a photo. A truly organized space should make your life feel easier. It should help you breathe better, think clearer, move faster, and feel more peaceful in your own home.</p><p>That is the heart behind&nbsp;<strong>Refresh, LLC</strong>.</p><p>Clutter has a sneaky way of affecting everything. It can make mornings feel rushed, kitchens feel overwhelming, closets feel impossible, and simple tasks feel like youΓÇÖre preparing for battle with a junk drawer. When your environment feels chaotic, your mind often follows.</p><p>That is why professional organizing is not just about cleaning up. It is about creating systems that actually work for the way you live.</p><p>At Refresh, the goal is to help clients create spaces that are calmer, cleaner, and more functional. Every client is different, so every space deserves a personal approach. A busy family does not need the same system as someone downsizing. A home office does not need the same solution as a playroom, garage, pantry, closet, or moving project.</p><p>That is where&nbsp;<strong>Refreshology</strong>&nbsp;comes in.</p><p>Refreshology is about looking at the whole picture: your space, your routines, your habits, your stress points, and your goals. It is organizing with purpose. It is not about judgment. It is not about perfection. It is about helping your home support your life instead of making your life harder.</p><p>A well-organized space can help you save time, reduce stress, improve focus, and feel more confident walking into the rooms you use every day. Sometimes the smallest changes create the biggest relief.</p><p>A refreshed space is more than a clean room.</p><p>It is a reset.</p><p>It is a new rhythm.</p><p>It is the feeling of walking into your home and thinking, ΓÇ£Okay, I can breathe again.ΓÇ¥</p><p>And that is exactly what Refresh is here to help create.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-05','1',6,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 15:50:05','2026-07-05 15:50:31',NULL,NULL),(2228,'My Mission','my-mission-34',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To create extraordinary photographic experiences that help clients feel comfortable, confident, and seen, while preserving meaningful moments through professional portraits that can be cherished, displayed, and shared for generations.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:09:35','2026-07-05 23:09:35',NULL,NULL),(2229,'What types of photography does Walt offer?','what-types-of-photography-does-walt-offer',NULL,'<p>Walt offers professional headshots, personal branding, family portraits, high school senior photos, maternity, glamour, modeling portfolios, boudoir, pets, babies/newborns, and engagement-style portraits.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:40:06','2026-07-05 23:40:06',NULL,NULL),(2230,'Where is Walt Jedziniak Photography located?','where-is-walt-jedziniak-photography-located',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The studio is in East Hampton, Connecticut, serving Central CT and surrounding towns.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:40:39','2026-07-05 23:40:39',NULL,NULL),(2231,'Do I need to know how to pose?','do-i-need-to-know-how-to-pose',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No. Walt guides clients through posing so the session feels relaxed and natural. That is a huge selling point because most people in front of a camera act like theyΓÇÖre being questioned by the FBI.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:41:35','2026-07-05 23:41:35',NULL,NULL),(2232,'Does Walt offer business headshots?','does-walt-offer-business-headshots',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. His headshot sessions are designed for professionals who want strong first impressions for websites, LinkedIn, resumes, marketing, and business profiles</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:42:06','2026-07-05 23:42:06',NULL,NULL),(2233,'Does Walt do personal branding photos?','does-walt-do-personal-branding-photos',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Personal branding sessions are built for business owners who need professional images that reflect their personality, business, and brand message.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:42:35','2026-07-05 23:42:35',NULL,NULL),(2234,'Does Walt photograph high school seniors?','does-walt-photograph-high-school-seniors',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. His senior sessions include custom planning, multiple looks, locations, outfits, props, hobbies, family, friends, and pets.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:43:05','2026-07-05 23:43:05',NULL,NULL),(2235,'Are sessions by appointment only?','are-sessions-by-appointment-only',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. His contact page lists appointment-only availability with weekend and evening appointments available.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:43:36','2026-07-05 23:43:36',NULL,NULL),(2236,'Does Walt offer hair and makeup?','does-walt-offer-hair-and-makeup',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Does Walt offer hair and makeup?</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">For certain experiences, especially the 40 Women Over 40 project and some portrait sessions, professional hair and makeup may be included or available.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:44:23','2026-07-05 23:44:23',NULL,NULL),(2237,'Can clients choose final images?','can-clients-choose-final-images',NULL,'<p>Yes. His process includes reviewing proofs, selecting favorites, and choosing products/images after the session.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:45:08','2026-07-05 23:45:08',NULL,NULL),(2238,'What makes Walt different?','what-makes-walt-different',NULL,'<p>He focuses on the full experience: planning, comfort, posing, personality, image selection, and final products ΓÇö not just clicking the camera button and calling it art.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-05 23:46:01','2026-07-05 23:46:01',NULL,NULL),(2239,'Who is Walt?','who-is-walt',NULL,'<p>Hi, IΓÇÖm Walt.</p><p>IΓÇÖve been happily married to my wife, Renee, for 32 years, and IΓÇÖm the proud father of three beautiful daughters. We live in East Hampton, Connecticut, with our 9-year-old Cavapoo, and weΓÇÖre very active in our local church.</p><p>Before becoming a full-time photographer, I spent 30 years working as an actuary in the insurance industry. Photography started as a passion and hobby, grew into a part-time business, and eventually became my full-time profession ΓÇö something IΓÇÖm incredibly grateful for.</p><p>Outside of photography, IΓÇÖve always had a love for music. IΓÇÖve played drums and accordion in polka bands since I was young. IΓÇÖm also a history lover, an avid reader when time allows, and a big sports fan. My favorite teams are the Boston Red Sox, Miami Dolphins, and UConn Huskies.</p><p>At the heart of everything I do is family, faith, creativity, and the joy of capturing meaningful moments for others.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-06 00:06:31','2026-07-06 00:11:57',NULL,NULL),(2240,'More Than a Picture: Why Professional Photography Still Matters','more-than-a-picture-why-professional-photography-still-matters',NULL,'<p>In a world where everyone has a camera in their pocket, it is easy to think photography has become simple. Point, click, post, done.</p><p>But real photography is not just about taking a picture.</p><p>It is about capturing personality, emotion, confidence, connection, and the story behind the person in front of the lens.</p><p>That is what makes professional photography different.</p><p>At Walt Jedziniak Photography, every session is built around the client. Whether it is a business headshot, family portrait, high school senior session, maternity shoot, boudoir experience, pet portrait, or personal branding session, the goal is always the same: create images that feel personal, polished, and meaningful.</p><p>A great portrait should do more than show what someone looks like. It should show who they are.</p><p>For professionals, the right headshot can create trust before the first conversation ever happens. In business, first impressions are not just important ΓÇö they are currency. A strong image can make a website, LinkedIn profile, business card, or marketing piece feel more credible and memorable.</p><p>For families, portraits preserve moments that pass way too quickly. Kids grow, seasons change, and life keeps moving. A professional family portrait freezes that moment in time so it can be remembered, displayed, and passed down.</p><p>For high school seniors, photography becomes a celebration of personality, growth, achievement, and the exciting next chapter ahead. The best senior portraits are not stiff or generic. They reflect style, interests, confidence, and individuality.</p><p>For personal branding, photography helps business owners show up with authority and personality. People want to know who they are doing business with. A strong branding session gives entrepreneurs images they can use across websites, social media, advertising, and promotional materials.</p><p>And for clients stepping into a boudoir, glamour, or 40 Over 40 portrait experience, photography can become something even deeper: a confidence-building experience. It is a chance to be seen, celebrated, and reminded that beauty, strength, and presence do not have an expiration date.</p><p>That is the difference between a snapshot and a portrait.</p><p>A snapshot captures a second.</p><p>A portrait tells a story.</p><p>Walt Jedziniak Photography focuses on creating a comfortable, guided, and professional experience from start to finish. Clients do not need to know how to pose or what to do in front of the camera. That is part of the process. From planning and lighting to posing, expression, image selection, and final presentation, every detail is handled with care.</p><p>Because great photography should never feel rushed, awkward, or cookie-cutter.</p><p>It should feel personal.</p><p>It should feel professional.</p><p>And most importantly, it should feel like you.</p><p>If you are ready for portraits that go beyond the basic ΓÇ£stand there and smileΓÇ¥ routine, Walt Jedziniak Photography is ready to help create images you will be proud to share, display, and remember.</p><p>Because it is not just an image.</p><p>It is an experience.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-05','1',6,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-06 00:08:30','2026-07-06 00:08:30',NULL,NULL),(2241,'Schedule a Meeting','schedule-a-meeting',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',14,1,246,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-06 00:57:03','2026-07-06 00:57:03',NULL,NULL),(2242,'My Mission','my-mission-35',NULL,'<p>At Cater To You Cleaning, our mission is to provide dependable, professional, and detailed cleaning services that help property owners, investors, contractors, and businesses protect their spaces, save time, and present every property at its best.</p><p>We believe every property matters. Whether we are preparing an Airbnb for the next guest, restoring a property after an eviction, cleaning a commercial office, or completing a post-construction final clean, our goal is to deliver reliable results, clear communication, and a level of care our clients can trust.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:55:24','2026-07-08 01:55:24',NULL,NULL),(2243,'Do you clean Airbnb and short-term rental properties?','do-you-clean-airbnb-and-short-term-rental-properties',NULL,'<p>Yes. Cater To You Cleaning specializes in Airbnb turnovers and STR cleaning, including deep cleaning, linen service, restocking, kitchen resets, damage checks, and guest-ready inspections.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:56:25','2026-07-08 01:56:25',NULL,NULL),(2244,'Can you handle same-day turnovers?','can-you-handle-same-day-turnovers',NULL,'<p>Yes. Same-day turnover support is available depending on schedule and property needs.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:56:54','2026-07-08 01:56:54',NULL,NULL),(2245,'Do you provide REO and foreclosure cleaning?','do-you-provide-reo-and-foreclosure-cleaning',NULL,'<p>Yes. The team provides REO cleaning, foreclosure sales cleans, trash-outs, debris removal, exterior cleanup, preservation support, and photo documentation.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:57:27','2026-07-08 01:57:27',NULL,NULL),(2246,'Do you clean after evictions?','do-you-clean-after-evictions',NULL,'<p>Yes. Cater To You Cleaning handles eviction cleanouts, abandoned items, debris removal, deep sanitization, odor-related cleaning, kitchen and bathroom restoration, and before-and-after documentation.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:57:59','2026-07-08 01:57:59',NULL,NULL),(2247,'Do you offer post-construction cleaning?','do-you-offer-post-construction-cleaning',NULL,'<p>Yes. Services include dust removal, window and glass cleaning, floors, fixtures, cabinets, surfaces, and final debris cleanup.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:58:36','2026-07-08 01:58:36',NULL,NULL),(2248,'Do you bring your own supplies?','do-you-bring-your-own-supplies',NULL,'<p>Yes. The company uses professional-grade equipment and eco-friendly cleaning products. Clients can also request preferred products when needed.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:59:06','2026-07-08 01:59:06',NULL,NULL),(2249,'Are you insured?','are-you-insured',NULL,'<p>Yes. The company states that its team is fully insured and backs every job with a satisfaction guarantee.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 01:59:46','2026-07-08 01:59:46',NULL,NULL),(2250,'Medicare Does Not Have to Feel Like a Maze','medicare-does-not-have-to-feel-like-a-maze',NULL,'<p>Medicare can be confusing. Between deadlines, plan options, prescription coverage, networks, premiums, and all the fine print, it can feel like you need a dictionary, a calculator, and a nap just to understand what you are looking at.</p><p>That is where personal guidance makes all the difference.</p><p>At&nbsp;<strong>Mom &amp; Pops Insurance</strong>, my goal is to help people understand their Medicare and insurance options in a way that feels clear, comfortable, and human. You should not feel rushed, pressured, or left guessing when making decisions about your coverage.</p><p>For many people, Medicare begins around age 65, and the timing matters. Your first enrollment window generally starts three months before you turn 65 and ends three months after the month you turn 65. Missing the right window can create problems, so having someone explain the process early can save you stress later.</p><p>But Medicare is not one-size-fits-all. Your doctors, prescriptions, budget, health needs, travel habits, and future plans all matter. A plan that works perfectly for one person may be completely wrong for someone else. That is why I take the time to review your situation, explain your choices, and help you understand what makes the most sense for you.</p><p>I can help with:</p><p>Medicare planning</p><p>Medicare plan reviews</p><p>Prescription drug cost reviews</p><p>Supplemental insurance options</p><p>Life insurance options</p><p>Coverage questions</p><p>Medicare guidance for veterans and spouses</p><p>Annual reviews to make sure your plan still fits</p><p>This work is personal to me. After losing my loving parents, I often think about how much they would have appreciated having someone simplify this process and truly look out for their best interests. I cannot go back and help them, but I can honor them by helping others the way I wish someone had helped them.</p><p>At Mom &amp; Pops Insurance, you are not treated like a policy number. You are treated like a person.</p><p>Whether you are turning 65, retiring, already on Medicare, helping a parent, or just trying to figure out what your options are, you do not have to do it alone.</p><p>Clear answers. Personal support. No additional fee for my services.</p><p>That is Medicare guidance with heart.</p><p><strong>Ready to review your options? Contact Tracy at Mom &amp; Pops Insurance and schedule a no-cost consultation today.</strong></p>',NULL,'2026-07-11','1',6,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 21:17:33','2026-07-11 10:27:50',NULL,NULL),(2251,'Request a No-Cost Consultation','request-a-consultation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 21:37:13','2026-07-09 02:05:19',NULL,NULL),(2252,'HHIC License','hhic-license',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-08 23:32:26','2026-07-08 23:32:26',NULL,NULL),(2254,'Who is Tracy','who-is-tracy',NULL,'<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Family has always been at the center of everything I do.</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Whether IΓÇÖm serving seniors, educating families, supporting local businesses, or giving back through community events and charitable initiatives, my goal is simpleΓÇöto leave people better than I found them. Mom &amp; Pops Insurance is more than an insurance agency. ItΓÇÖs a place where people are treated like family. A place where questions are welcomed, education comes first, and every client receives honest guidance without pressure.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> ≡ƒö╣ </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Independent Medicare Broker</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇô Making Medicare simple, understandable, and stress-free.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> ≡ƒö╣ </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Life Insurance Advisor </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇô Helping families protect what matters most and leave a legacy of love.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> ≡ƒö╣ </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Community Advocate </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇô Passionate about giving back through local events, outreach, and helping neighbors in need. ≡ƒö╣ </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Family-Driven Professional </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇô Building lifelong relationships based on integrity, compassion, and trust. I believe every senior deserves an advocate. Every family deserves protection. Every client deserves someone who truly cares. Helping People Navigate Today. Protect Tomorrow. Serve for Life. Mom &amp; Pops Insurance</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> ΓÇ£Guiding Families. Serving Seniors. Strengthening Our Community.ΓÇ¥</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 01:53:22','2026-07-09 01:57:17',NULL,NULL),(2255,'My Mission','my-mission-36',NULL,'<p>At&nbsp;<strong>Mom &amp; Pops Insurance</strong>, my mission is to bring clarity, compassion, and personal guidance to Medicare and insurance planning. I help individuals and families understand their choices, avoid costly mistakes, and feel confident about their coverage decisions.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 02:00:15','2026-07-09 02:00:15',NULL,NULL),(2256,'IΓÇÖm turning 65. When should I start looking at Medicare?','im-turning-65-when-should-i-start-looking-at-medicare',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You can usually begin the Medicare enrollment process 90 days before the month you turn 65, assuming you meet workrelated eligibility requirements. Tracy can help you understand what steps to take and when.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 02:00:57','2026-07-09 02:00:57',NULL,NULL),(2257,'Can Tracy help me compare my employer coverage with Medicare?','can-tracy-help-me-compare-my-employer-coverage-with-medicare',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. If you are still working, Tracy can compare your current group insurance to your Medicare options so you can make a smart decision.&nbsp;</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 02:01:39','2026-07-09 02:01:39',NULL,NULL),(2258,'Can I keep my doctors on Medicare?','can-i-keep-my-doctors-on-medicare',NULL,'<p>Usually, but it is important to confirm that your doctors accept Medicare and that they are compatible with the plan you choose.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 02:02:20','2026-07-09 02:02:20',NULL,NULL),(2259,'Does Tracy charge for consultations?','does-tracy-charge-for-consultations',NULL,'<p>No additional fee is charged for her services. Mom &amp; Pops Insurance states that compensation comes from carrier partners.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 02:02:56','2026-07-09 02:02:56',NULL,NULL),(2260,'Does Tracy help with prescription drug costs?','does-tracy-help-with-prescription-drug-costs',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. Tracy can review prescription drug pricing, check plan options, and help determine whether programs such as Extra Help may reduce costs.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 02:03:52','2026-07-09 02:03:52',NULL,NULL),(2261,'Does Mom & Pops Insurance offer more than Medicare?','does-mom-pops-insurance-offer-more-than-medicare',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Yes. In addition to Medicare planning, Mom &amp; Pops Insurance offers supplemental insurance plans and life insurance options.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,250,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 02:04:32','2026-07-09 02:04:32',NULL,NULL),(2262,'Why Airbnb Cleaning Can Make or Break Your Guest Reviews','why-airbnb-cleaning-can-make-or-break-your-guest-reviews',NULL,'<p>When it comes to Airbnb and short-term rentals, guests notice everything.</p><p>They notice the floors.</p><p>They notice the bathroom.</p><p>They notice the sheets.</p><p>They notice the smell when they first walk in.</p><p>And yes ΓÇö they definitely notice the hair in the shower, the crumbs on the counter, and the fingerprints on the glass.</p><p>In the short-term rental business, cleanliness is not just a nice extra. It is one of the biggest reasons guests leave five-star reviews ΓÇö or complaints.</p><p>A beautiful property can lose value fast if it is not cleaned properly between guests. On the other hand, a spotless property creates trust the moment someone walks through the door. It tells your guest, ΓÇ£This place is taken care of. You made the right choice.ΓÇ¥</p><p>For Airbnb owners, investors, and property managers, cleaning is part of the guest experience. A proper turnover cleaning includes more than wiping surfaces and taking out the trash. It means resetting the entire space so every guest feels like they are the first person to stay there.</p><p>That includes clean linens, fresh towels, sanitized bathrooms, spotless kitchens, restocked essentials, organized rooms, damage checks, and attention to the small details that guests remember.</p><p>The truth is simple: one bad cleaning can lead to one bad review, and one bad review can affect future bookings.</p><p>At Cater To You Cleaning, we understand how important every turnover is. Our team helps Airbnb hosts and short-term rental owners keep their properties clean, guest-ready, and review-ready.</p><p>Because in this business, clean properties lead to happy guests ΓÇö and happy guests leave better reviews.</p><p>DonΓÇÖt let anyone leave you dirty. Let Cater To You Cleaning help keep your Airbnb ready for every guest.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-14','1',6,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-11 10:47:21','2026-07-14 18:25:02',NULL,NULL),(2263,'Who is Giuliana?','who-is-giuliana',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Giuliana, a proud wife, mom, Army veteran, and entrepreneur with a passion for serving others and helping people grow.</p><p>IΓÇÖm the Founder and CEO of Cater To You Cleaning and Cater To You Enterprises, where I combine luxury hospitality with professional property services while creating opportunities for other cleaning business owners to succeed.</p><p>I earned both my BachelorΓÇÖs degree and MBA from Post University, and I believe education, discipline, and lifelong learning have played a major role in my journey.</p><p>Outside of business, IΓÇÖm a devoted San Francisco 49ers fan and love spending quality time with my children and family. I enjoy reading, writing, teaching, taking long drives, listening to music, writing songs, and singing. I also played volleyball in high school, and I still value the teamwork, discipline, and determination the sport taught me.</p><p>Above all, IΓÇÖm a woman of faith. My confidence does not come from having all the answers. It comes from trusting that God has guided every step of my journey and will continue to open the doors I am meant to walk through.</p><p>My mission is simple: to serve with excellence, lead with integrity, and help others recognize their worth in business and in life.</p><p>I believe success is not measured only by what we build for ourselves, but by how many people we inspire, encourage, and help build alongside u</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-11 13:50:47','2026-07-11 13:50:47',NULL,NULL),(2264,'HIC License','hic-license-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-11 13:54:26','2026-07-11 13:54:26',NULL,NULL),(2265,'Insurance','insurance-8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-11 13:59:00','2026-07-11 13:59:00',NULL,NULL),(2266,'Cert','cert-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,247,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-11 14:02:51','2026-07-11 14:02:51',NULL,NULL),(2267,'Test blog 266','test-blog-266',NULL,'<p>Descriptions...</p>',NULL,'2026-07-13','1',6,1,17,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-12 20:54:27','2026-07-12 20:54:27',NULL,NULL),(2268,'Who is Christina Regan','who-is-christina-regan',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Christina Regan, a Connecticut-licensed insurance agent helping individuals, families, self-employed professionals and businesses find insurance solutions built around their real needs.</p><p>I specialize in health insurance, Medicare, life insurance, disability protection, supplemental coverage, employee benefits and annuities. My goal is to make insurance easier to understand so you can protect what matters most with confidence.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:09:35','2026-07-13 00:45:49',NULL,NULL),(2269,'Better Business Bureau Rev','better-business-bureau-rev',NULL,'<p>Click to See Our A+ Rating</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:12:08','2026-07-13 00:12:08',NULL,NULL),(2270,'Mission Statement','mission-statement-3',NULL,'<p>My mission is to help healthcare organizations move forward with greater clarity and confidence by providing access to practical, independent and actionable consulting solutions.</p><p>I am committed to helping clients identify risk, strengthen compliance, improve documentation and make informed decisions that protect their patients, providers and organizations.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:16:09','2026-07-13 00:16:09',NULL,NULL),(2272,'Apply Now','apply-now',NULL,'<h3><br></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:25:00','2026-07-13 00:25:36',NULL,NULL),(2273,'Do I need 20% down to purchase a home?','do-i-need-20-down-to-purchase-a-home',NULL,'<p>No. The required down payment depends on the mortgage program, property, occupancy and borrower qualifications. FHA, VA, USDA, conventional and assistance programs may provide qualifying borrowers with lower-down-payment possibilities.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:32:55','2026-07-13 00:32:55',NULL,NULL),(2274,'Do you only work with self-employed people?','do-you-only-work-with-self-employed-people',NULL,'<p>No. I help self-employed professionals, individuals, families, Medicare beneficiaries and businesses.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:34:09','2026-07-13 00:35:30',NULL,NULL),(2275,'Why is disability insurance important for someone who is self-employed?','why-is-disability-insurance-important-for-someone-who-is-self-employed',NULL,'<p>A self-employed person may not have employer-provided sick pay or long-term disability benefits. If illness or injury prevents that person from working, disability coverage may help replace part of the lost income, subject to the policy terms.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:34:57','2026-07-13 00:34:57',NULL,NULL),(2276,'What is a mortgage pre-approval?','what-is-a-mortgage-pre-approval',NULL,'<p>A pre-approval is a lenderΓÇÖs preliminary determination that it may be willing to lend up to a particular amount based on the information reviewed.</p><p>It is not a guaranteed loan approval, but it can help establish a purchasing range and demonstrate to sellers that financing has been considered.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:36:11','2026-07-13 00:58:49',NULL,NULL),(2277,'Can you help me understand my current health plan?','can-you-help-me-understand-my-current-health-plan',NULL,'<p>Yes. I can help you review your current coverage and better understand its benefits, costs and potential gaps.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:36:52','2026-07-13 00:36:52',NULL,NULL),(2278,'Will a pre-approval affect my credit?','will-a-pre-approval-affect-my-credit',NULL,'<p>A formal mortgage application generally involves a credit inquiry. The CFPB explains that a mortgage lender commonly obtains a credit report when a borrower applies and may check credit again before closing.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:37:14','2026-07-13 00:37:14',NULL,NULL),(2279,'Can I get health insurance outside Open Enrollment?','can-i-get-health-insurance-outside-open-enrollment',NULL,'<p>Possibly. Certain qualifying life events may create a Special Enrollment Period. Examples can include losing qualifying coverage, getting married, having a baby or moving to a new coverage area.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:37:58','2026-07-13 02:12:05',NULL,NULL),(2280,'Can you help if I already have a plan?','can-you-help-if-i-already-have-a-plan',NULL,'<p>Absolutely. Reviewing existing coverage is often a smart first step. If your current plan remains appropriate, changing it may not be necessary.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:39:05','2026-07-13 00:39:05',NULL,NULL),(2281,'How much home can I afford?','how-much-home-can-i-afford',NULL,'<p>Your estimated purchasing power depends on several factors, including income, existing debts, credit, available funds, property taxes, insurance, interest rates and mortgage-program guidelines.</p><p>A personalized pre-approval provides a more useful estimate than a general online calculator.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:39:21','2026-07-13 00:39:21',NULL,NULL),(2282,'What documents will I need?','what-documents-will-i-need',NULL,'<p>Commonly requested items may include:</p><ul><li>Identification</li><li>Pay statements</li><li>W-2s or tax returns</li><li>Bank statements</li><li>Employment information</li><li>Documentation of additional income</li><li>Information about current debts</li><li>Property documents after an offer is accepted</li></ul><p>The exact documents depend on your employment, income and chosen mortgage program.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:42:27','2026-07-13 00:42:27',NULL,NULL),(2283,'Can self-employed borrowers qualify?','can-self-employed-borrowers-qualify',NULL,'<p>Yes. Self-employed borrowers can qualify for mortgage financing, although the income-analysis and documentation requirements may differ.</p><p>NOVUS also lists alternative-documentation programs for certain business owners, bank-statement borrowers and 1099 earners, subject to program requirements.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 00:43:12','2026-07-13 00:43:12',NULL,NULL),(2284,'Why Self-Employed Professionals Need More Than Basic Health Insurance','why-self-employed-professionals-need-more-than-basic-health-insurance',NULL,'<p>Being self-employed can provide freedom, flexibility and control over your career.</p><p>It can also mean that you are responsible for benefits that a traditional employer might otherwise provide.</p><p>Health insurance is an important starting point, but it may not protect your income if an illness or injury prevents you from working. Without paid sick leave or employer-sponsored disability benefits, even a temporary medical issue can create significant financial stress.</p><p>Self-employed professionals should consider several areas of protection:</p><ul><li>Health insurance</li><li>Disability income protection</li><li>Life insurance</li><li>Accident coverage</li><li>Critical illness protection</li><li>Hospital indemnity coverage</li></ul><p>The right combination will depend on your occupation, income, family responsibilities, health needs and budget.</p><p>Insurance is not about expecting something bad to happen. It is about making sure one unexpected event does not undo everything you worked to build.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-12','1',6,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 02:02:24','2026-07-13 02:02:24',NULL,NULL),(2285,'Five Things to Consider Before Choosing a Health Insurance Plan','five-things-to-consider-before-choosing-a-health-insurance-plan',NULL,'<p>Choosing a health insurance plan based only on the monthly premium can be a costly mistake.</p><p>Before selecting coverage, consider these five questions:</p><h3>1. Are your doctors in the network?</h3><p>A plan may look affordable until you learn that your preferred doctors or hospitals are not covered in-network.</p><h3>2. Are your medications covered?</h3><p>Review the planΓÇÖs prescription formulary, copayments and pharmacy network.</p><h3>3. What is the deductible?</h3><p>Understand how much you may need to pay before certain benefits begin.</p><h3>4. What is the maximum out-of-pocket cost?</h3><p>This can be one of the most important numbers when considering a serious illness or major medical event.</p><h3>5. How often do you use healthcare?</h3><p>Someone who rarely visits a doctor may have different priorities than a person managing ongoing prescriptions or specialist care.</p><p>A licensed insurance agent can help you compare these details and understand how they may affect your total costs.</p>',NULL,'2026-04-01','1',6,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 02:03:18','2026-07-13 02:18:58',NULL,NULL),(2286,'What Are Living Benefits in a Life Insurance Policy?','what-are-living-benefits-in-a-life-insurance-policy',NULL,'<p>Many people think life insurance only provides a benefit after the insured person passes away.</p><p>Some policies may also include living benefits.</p><p>Living benefits may allow an insured person to access part of the policyΓÇÖs death benefit after a qualifying event such as a chronic, critical or terminal illness. The exact definitions, qualifications and limitations depend on the policy.</p><p>The funds may potentially be used for:</p><ul><li>Medical bills</li><li>Household expenses</li><li>Lost income</li><li>In-home assistance</li><li>Transportation</li><li>Other financial needs</li></ul><p>Living benefits do not make every policy appropriate for every person. It is important to understand how accessing benefits could reduce the remaining death benefit and whether fees or restrictions apply.</p>',NULL,'2026-06-01','1',6,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 02:04:15','2026-07-13 02:16:42',NULL,NULL),(2288,'Why Mortgage Pre-Approval Should Come Before House Hunting','why-mortgage-pre-approval-should-come-before-house-hunting',NULL,'<p>Shopping for a new home is exciting, but looking at properties before understanding your buying power can lead to disappointment and wasted time.</p><p>A mortgage pre-approval helps you estimate how much home you may be able to afford based on factors such as your income, credit, monthly debts, available funds and the mortgage programs for which you may qualify.</p><p>It can also make your offer stronger because sellers and real estate professionals can see that you have already taken an important step toward securing financing.</p><p>During the pre-approval process, I can help you understand:</p><ul><li>Your estimated purchasing range</li><li>Possible down-payment options</li><li>Estimated monthly payments</li><li>Potential closing costs</li><li>Available mortgage programs</li><li>Documents you may need</li><li>Steps you can take to strengthen your application</li></ul><p>A pre-approval is not a final loan approval, but it gives you a much clearer and more confident place to begin.</p><p>Before spending every weekend walking through homes and mentally rearranging somebody elseΓÇÖs furniture, letΓÇÖs make sure the numbers make sense.</p><h3>≡ƒô₧ Ready to begin?</h3><p>Contact me today to start the mortgage pre-approval process.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-15','1',6,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-13 02:33:34','2026-07-16 03:08:40',NULL,NULL),(2289,'My Mission','my-mission-37',NULL,'<p>My mission is to provide clear mortgage education, responsible financing options and personalized solutions that help clients move forward with confidence.</p><p>I am committed to looking at the entire situationΓÇönot simply checking boxes on an application. I take the time to understand each clientΓÇÖs goals, explain the available options and find practical solutions for both straightforward and complicated financing needs.</p><p>I do not just want to close a loan. I want every client to understand the decision they are making, feel supported throughout the process and know they have an experienced mortgage professional they can call long after closing.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-16 06:08:59','2026-07-16 06:08:59',NULL,NULL),(2290,'Better Business Bureau','better-business-bureau-3',NULL,'<h4>Click Button to See BBB Review</h4>',NULL,NULL,'1',8,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-16 08:09:53','2026-07-16 08:09:53',NULL,NULL),(2291,'Video 1','video-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-16 08:34:33','2026-07-16 08:34:33',NULL,NULL),(2292,'Video 1','video-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,245,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-16 08:35:21','2026-07-16 08:35:21',NULL,NULL),(2293,'Who is Scott?','who-is-scott',NULL,'<p>Hi, IΓÇÖm Scott. IΓÇÖm proud to call Madison, Connecticut home, and IΓÇÖve always believed that being part of a community means more than simply living thereΓÇöit means showing up, getting involved and helping where you can.</p><p>Community service has been an important part of my life for many years. IΓÇÖve been involved with the Madison Jaycees and the Rotary Club of Madison, where I had the honor of serving as president. Those experiences have given me the opportunity to support local causes, meet incredible people and contribute to the community that has given me so much.&nbsp;</p><p>IΓÇÖm also a graduate of New England College. I value strong relationships, genuine conversations and treating people with respect. I enjoy connecting with others, bringing people together and being someone friends and neighbors know they can count on.&nbsp;</p><p>To me, success is not measured only by what you accomplish. It is also measured by the relationships you build, the people you help and the positive impact you leave behind.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-16 09:45:25','2026-07-16 09:45:25',NULL,NULL),(2294,'Who is Scott?','who-is-scott-2',NULL,'<p>Hi, IΓÇÖm Scott. IΓÇÖm proud to call Madison, Connecticut home, and IΓÇÖve always believed that being part of a community means more than simply living thereΓÇöit means showing up, getting involved and helping where you can.</p><p>Community service has been an important part of my life for many years. IΓÇÖve been involved with the Madison Jaycees and the Rotary Club of Madison, where I had the honor of serving as president. Those experiences have given me the opportunity to support local causes, meet incredible people and contribute to the community that has given me so much.&nbsp;</p><p>IΓÇÖm also a graduate of New England College. I value strong relationships, genuine conversations and treating people with respect. I enjoy connecting with others, bringing people together and being someone friends and neighbors know they can count on.&nbsp;</p><p>To me, success is not measured only by what you accomplish. It is also measured by the relationships you build, the people you help and the positive impact you leave behind.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-16 09:46:40','2026-07-16 09:46:40',NULL,NULL),(2295,'Who is Scott?','who-is-scott-3',NULL,'<p>Hi, IΓÇÖm Scott. IΓÇÖm proud to call Madison, Connecticut home, and IΓÇÖve always believed that being part of a community means more than simply living thereΓÇöit means showing up, getting involved and helping where you can.</p><p>Community service has been an important part of my life for many years. IΓÇÖve been involved with the Madison Jaycees and the Rotary Club of Madison, where I had the honor of serving as president. Those experiences have given me the opportunity to support local causes, meet incredible people and contribute to the community that has given me so much.&nbsp;</p><p>IΓÇÖm also a graduate of New England College. I value strong relationships, genuine conversations and treating people with respect. I enjoy connecting with others, bringing people together and being someone friends and neighbors know they can count on.&nbsp;</p><p>To me, success is not measured only by what you accomplish. It is also measured by the relationships you build, the people you help and the positive impact you leave behind.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,248,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-16 09:47:59','2026-07-16 09:47:59',NULL,NULL),(2296,'Contact Me Anytime','contact-me-anytime',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',35,1,251,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 06:45:47','2026-07-18 06:45:47',NULL,NULL),(2297,'Who is Casey','who-is-casey',NULL,'<p>Hi, IΓÇÖm Kay, Founder of KayΓÇÖs Solutions Cleaning. I specialize in delivering professional residential and commercial cleaning services with a commitment to quality, consistency, and attention to detail. My mission is to create clean, organized, and refreshed spaces while providing a service experience built on professionalism, reliability, and trust. From recurring maintenance and deep cleaning to move-in/move-out cleanings, post-construction cleaning, and organizing, every service is tailored to meet each clientΓÇÖs unique needs. Proudly serving Hartford, New Haven, and Fairfield Counties, my goal is to make every client feel confident theyΓÇÖve chosen a company that truly cares about the details. Experience the Difference.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 13:40:53','2026-07-18 13:40:53',NULL,NULL),(2298,'My Mission','my-mission-38',NULL,'<p>Our mission is to transform homes and workplaces through dependable, detail-driven cleaning and organization solutions that create comfort, clarity, and peace.</p><p>We are committed to serving every client with honesty, integrity, professionalism, respect, and consistently high-quality resultsΓÇöso every customer can experience the difference of immaculate cleanliness.</p><p>This combines the companyΓÇÖs existing mission language with CaseyΓÇÖs personal reason for founding the business.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 13:56:22','2026-07-18 13:56:22',NULL,NULL),(2299,'Can I receive an estimate over the phone?','can-i-receive-an-estimate-over-the-phone',NULL,'<p>Yes. Estimates may be provided based on the size and condition of the property as described. If the property requires additional time when the team arrives, the client will be asked to approve any added work or cost.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 13:58:48','2026-07-18 13:58:48',NULL,NULL),(2300,'Do I need to be home during the cleaning?','do-i-need-to-be-home-during-the-cleaning',NULL,'<p>No. As long as the team has an approved and secure way to enter the property, you do not need to remain home during the service.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 13:59:32','2026-07-18 13:59:32',NULL,NULL),(2301,'Does KayΓÇÖs Solutions bring cleaning supplies?','does-kays-solutions-bring-cleaning-supplies',NULL,'<p>Yes. The team provides the standard products, supplies, and equipment needed for your cleaning. Any allergies, sensitivities, preferred products, or special requests should be discussed beforehand.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 14:00:13','2026-07-18 14:00:13',NULL,NULL),(2302,'What should I do before the team arrives?','what-should-i-do-before-the-team-arrives',NULL,'<p>Clients should remove clutter from surfaces and put away toys, dishes, clothing, personal belongings, valuables, and fragile or sentimental items whenever possible.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 14:00:55','2026-07-18 14:00:55',NULL,NULL),(2303,'What is the pet policy?','what-is-the-pet-policy',NULL,'<p>KayΓÇÖs Solutions asks that pets be secured in a separate area unless another arrangement has been discussed in advance. This protects the pets, clients, and cleaning technicians.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 14:01:30','2026-07-18 14:01:30',NULL,NULL),(2304,'What happens if I am not satisfied?','what-happens-if-i-am-not-satisfied',NULL,'<p>Contact KayΓÇÖs Solutions within 24 hours of the service. The team will return to address the reported areas. The policy does not provide refunds or recovery cleaning after the 24-hour period.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 14:02:12','2026-07-18 14:02:12',NULL,NULL),(2305,'Is there a long-term contract?','is-there-a-long-term-contract',NULL,'<p>Residential customers are not required to sign a long-term cleaning contract. However, cancellations and rescheduling generally require at least 48 hoursΓÇÖ notice. Late cancellations, inaccessible properties, or clients turning the team away may result in a charge equal to 50% of the scheduled service.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 14:03:02','2026-07-18 14:03:02',NULL,NULL),(2306,'What happens if something is damaged?','what-happens-if-something-is-damaged',NULL,'<h2>What happens if something is damaged?</h2><p>KayΓÇÖs Solutions asks clients to report any damage immediately. The company may attempt to repair or replace an item internally or submit an insurance claim when appropriate. Pre-existing damage, improperly installed items, and unsecured fragile objects may not be covered.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 14:03:39','2026-07-18 14:03:39',NULL,NULL),(2307,'Regular Cleaning vs. Deep Cleaning: WhatΓÇÖs the Difference?','regular-cleaning-vs-deep-cleaning-whats-the-difference',NULL,'<p>Keeping your home clean is important, but not every cleaning service is the same. Two of the most common options are regular cleaning and deep cleaning. Understanding the difference can help you choose the right service for your home, schedule, and current needs.</p><h2>What Is Regular Cleaning?</h2><p>Regular cleaning is designed to maintain a home that is already in generally good condition. It focuses on the areas that collect everyday dust, dirt, and mess.</p><p>A regular cleaning may include:</p><ul><li>Dusting furniture and accessible surfaces</li><li>Vacuuming carpets and rugs</li><li>Sweeping and mopping floors</li><li>Cleaning kitchen countertops and sinks</li><li>Wiping the exterior of appliances</li><li>Cleaning and sanitizing bathrooms</li><li>Emptying trash</li><li>Straightening common areas</li></ul><p>Regular cleaning is ideal for weekly, biweekly, or monthly service. It helps prevent dirt and buildup from becoming overwhelming and keeps your home feeling fresh and comfortable.</p><h2>What Is Deep Cleaning?</h2><p>Deep cleaning is a more detailed and intensive service. It focuses on areas that may not be addressed during routine maintenance and removes heavier buildup that has accumulated over time.</p><p>A deep cleaning may include:</p><ul><li>Cleaning baseboards, doors, and door frames</li><li>Removing buildup from kitchens and bathrooms</li><li>Detailed cleaning around fixtures and appliances</li><li>Cleaning cabinet fronts</li><li>Scrubbing tile and grout</li><li>Cleaning window sills and reachable interior windows</li><li>Removing dust from vents, blinds, and ceiling fans</li><li>Cleaning behind or underneath accessible furniture</li><li>Giving high-touch and commonly overlooked areas extra attention</li></ul><p>Deep cleaning usually takes more time because the goal is to thoroughly reset the condition of the home.</p><h2>When Should You Schedule a Deep Cleaning?</h2><p>A deep cleaning may be the best choice when:</p><ul><li>Your home has not been professionally cleaned recently</li><li>You are preparing for a special event or holiday</li><li>You are moving into or out of a property</li><li>Dust, grease, soap scum, or grime has accumulated</li><li>You are beginning recurring cleaning services</li><li>Your home needs a seasonal reset</li><li>You feel overwhelmed and do not know where to begin</li></ul><p>Many clients start with a deep cleaning and then schedule regular cleaning to maintain the results.</p><h2>Which Service Is Right for You?</h2><p>Choose regular cleaning when your home is already in manageable condition and you want dependable ongoing maintenance.</p><p>Choose deep cleaning when your home needs extra attention, detailed scrubbing, or a complete refresh before transitioning to a recurring schedule.</p><p>Every home is different, which is why KayΓÇÖs Solutions Cleaning takes the time to understand your priorities and recommend a service that fits your space.</p><h2>Let KayΓÇÖs Solutions Give Your Home a Fresh Start</h2><p>At KayΓÇÖs Solutions Cleaning, we believe a clean home should create comfort, clarity, and peace of mind. Whether you need recurring maintenance or a detailed top-to-bottom reset, Casey and her team are ready to help.</p><p><strong>We clean. We organize. You relax.</strong></p><p>Contact KayΓÇÖs Solutions Cleaning today to request a customized quote.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 15:35:36','2026-07-18 15:35:36',NULL,NULL),(2308,'How Often Should You Have Your Home Professionally Cleaned?','how-often-should-you-have-your-home-professionally-cleaned',NULL,'<p>There is no single cleaning schedule that works for every home. The right frequency depends on your household, lifestyle, pets, work schedule, and how quickly dirt and clutter build up.</p><p>Some homes benefit from weekly cleaning, while others may only need professional service once or twice a month. The goal is to create a schedule that keeps your home comfortable without allowing the mess to become overwhelming.</p><h2>Weekly Cleaning</h2><p>Weekly cleaning is a great choice for busy households that need consistent upkeep.</p><p>It may be especially helpful for:</p><ul><li>Families with young children</li><li>Homes with multiple pets</li><li>People with demanding work schedules</li><li>Larger households</li><li>Homes that frequently host guests</li><li>Anyone who prefers their home to remain consistently clean</li></ul><p>Weekly service helps control dust, pet hair, bathroom buildup, kitchen messes, and high-traffic areas before they become harder to manage.</p><h2>Biweekly Cleaning</h2><p>Biweekly cleaning is one of the most popular options because it provides regular maintenance without requiring a weekly appointment.</p><p>It is often a good fit for:</p><ul><li>Smaller families</li><li>Couples</li><li>Homes with light to moderate activity</li><li>People who perform basic cleaning between appointments</li><li>Clients who want dependable support twice a month</li></ul><p>With biweekly cleaning, the home stays manageable while the professional cleaning team handles the more time-consuming work.</p><h2>Monthly Cleaning</h2><p>Monthly cleaning can work well for people who keep up with routine cleaning but want occasional help with more detailed tasks.</p><p>Monthly service may be suitable for:</p><ul><li>Individuals or couples without children</li><li>Homes without pets</li><li>Smaller apartments or condominiums</li><li>People who travel frequently</li><li>Clients who need help with bathrooms, floors, kitchens, and dusting</li></ul><p>However, homes with heavy traffic, children, or pets may need service more frequently to prevent buildup.</p><h2>One-Time Deep Cleaning</h2><p>A one-time deep cleaning is ideal when your home needs more than routine maintenance.</p><p>You may want to schedule a deep cleaning:</p><ul><li>Before or after a holiday</li><li>Before hosting an event</li><li>During spring or seasonal cleaning</li><li>After renovations</li><li>Before moving into a home</li><li>After moving out</li><li>When beginning recurring cleaning service</li><li>When the home has not been professionally cleaned in a while</li></ul><p>A deep cleaning provides a fresh starting point. Afterward, regular weekly, biweekly, or monthly service can help preserve the results.</p><h2>Factors to Consider</h2><p>When deciding how often to schedule professional cleaning, consider the following:</p><h3>Children</h3><p>Young children can create more spills, crumbs, fingerprints, and daily clutter. Homes with children often benefit from weekly or biweekly cleaning.</p><h3>Pets</h3><p>Pet hair, dander, paw prints, and odors can build up quickly. Multiple pets may require more frequent cleaning.</p><h3>Allergies</h3><p>Regular dusting and vacuuming may help reduce dust, pet dander, and other common household irritants.</p><h3>Work Schedule</h3><p>Busy professionals may not have the time or energy to maintain the entire home after a long workday. Professional cleaning helps protect your free time.</p><h3>Home Size</h3><p>Larger homes typically require more time and effort to maintain. A regular schedule prevents the cleaning from becoming unmanageable.</p><h3>Personal Preferences</h3><p>Some people feel most comfortable when their home is cleaned every week. Others are satisfied with monthly support. The best schedule is the one that makes your life easier.</p><h2>Let KayΓÇÖs Solutions Create a Plan for Your Home</h2><p>At KayΓÇÖs Solutions Cleaning, every home is treated differently because every client has different needs.</p><p>Casey and her team can help create a customized cleaning schedule based on your home, lifestyle, priorities, and budget. Whether you need weekly maintenance, biweekly support, monthly cleaning, or a complete deep-cleaning reset, KayΓÇÖs Solutions is ready to help.</p><p><strong>We clean. We organize. You relax.</strong></p><p>Contact KayΓÇÖs Solutions Cleaning today to request a personalized quote.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-18','1',6,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 16:37:31','2026-07-18 17:06:19',NULL,NULL),(2309,'Why Before-and-After Photos Matter When Hiring a Contractor','why-before-and-after-photos-matter-when-hiring-a-contractor',NULL,'<p>Hiring a contractor is a big decision. You are trusting someone with your home, your money, and often one of your most valuable investments.</p><p>That is why before-and-after photos matter.</p><p>They do more than make a project look impressive. They give homeowners a clearer idea of the contractorΓÇÖs experience, attention to detail, and ability to complete real work.</p><h2>They Show Actual Results</h2><p>A contractor can say they provide quality workmanship, but photos help prove it.</p><p>Before-and-after images allow you to see how a space, roof, exterior, kitchen, or repair looked before the work began and how it looked after the project was completed.</p><p>That visual difference can tell you a lot about the contractorΓÇÖs abilities.</p><h2>They Help You Understand the Transformation</h2><p>Many home improvement projects are difficult to imagine before they begin.</p><p>A damaged roof, outdated kitchen, worn siding, or unfinished room may not look like it has much potential. Seeing a similar project completed can help you better understand what may be possible in your own home.</p><p>Before-and-after photos can also give you ideas for materials, layouts, colors, finishes, and design choices.</p><h2>They Show Attention to Detail</h2><p>Quality work is often found in the details.</p><p>Look closely at trim, edges, paint lines, siding placement, cabinet alignment, roofing installation, and how the finished area connects with the rest of the home.</p><p>Clean, consistent results usually show that the contractor took the time to complete the project properly.</p><h2>They Help Build Trust</h2><p>Homeowners naturally want to know that a contractor has completed similar projects before.</p><p>A strong project gallery gives customers confidence because they can see real examples of the contractorΓÇÖs work.</p><p>Photos can also help start better conversations. You can point to a completed project and explain what you like, what you would change, and what you want for your own home.</p><h2>They Make Comparing Contractors Easier</h2><p>When comparing contractors, do not rely only on price.</p><p>Review the quality, consistency, and variety of their completed projects. A lower estimate may not be the better deal if the workmanship does not meet your expectations.</p><p>Before-and-after photos can help you compare experience and results before making your decision.</p><h2>Questions to Ask About Project Photos</h2><p>When reviewing a contractorΓÇÖs gallery, consider asking:</p><ul><li>Was this project completed by your company?</li><li>What work was included?</li><li>Were there any unexpected problems?</li><li>How long did the project take?</li><li>What materials were used?</li><li>Is the finished project similar to what you recommend for my home?</li></ul><p>A trustworthy contractor should be comfortable discussing previous work and explaining the process.</p><h2>LetΓÇÖs Create Your HomeΓÇÖs Next Success Story</h2><p>At FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions, we believe the finished result should speak for itself.</p><p>Whether you need roofing, siding, windows, doors, interior repairs, or a complete remodel, we are ready to help you explore your options and find the right solution for your home.</p><p>Contact Jay Vargas today to discuss your project and request a free quote.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-18','1',6,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:02:28','2026-07-18 18:45:05',NULL,NULL),(2310,'What types of projects does FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions handle?','what-types-of-projects-does-flippin-success-solutions-handle',NULL,'<p>We provide a wide range of interior and exterior home improvement services, including roofing, siding, windows, doors, remodeling, kitchen improvements, cabinet work, drywall, trim, painting, repairs, and general home maintenance.</p><p>Whether you need one problem corrected or several areas of your home improved, contact us to discuss the project.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:07:08','2026-07-18 18:07:08',NULL,NULL),(2311,'Do you offer free estimates?','do-you-offer-free-estimates-6',NULL,'<p>Yes. We offer free estimates for homeowners in our Connecticut service area.</p><p>To help us understand the project, send your name, town, a brief description of the work, and photos of the area whenever possible.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:07:54','2026-07-18 18:07:54',NULL,NULL),(2312,'Do you take on smaller repair projects?','do-you-take-on-smaller-repair-projects',NULL,'<p>Yes. Not every homeowner needs a complete remodel.</p><p>We also handle smaller repairs, maintenance work, drywall, trim, painting, siding repairs, cabinet work, and other improvement projects. The best way to find out whether we can help is to contact us with the details.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:08:38','2026-07-18 18:08:38',NULL,NULL),(2313,'Do you complete full remodeling projects?','do-you-complete-full-remodeling-projects',NULL,'<p>Yes. FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions can assist with larger remodeling and renovation projects as well as individual upgrades.</p><p>We will review your goals, the condition of the space, the work involved, and the best way to move the project forward.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:09:28','2026-07-18 18:09:28',NULL,NULL),(2314,'Can you help with both interior and exterior work?','can-you-help-with-both-interior-and-exterior-work',NULL,'<p>Yes. Our services cover both the inside and outside of the home.</p><p>Exterior services include roofing, siding, windows, doors, and repairs. Interior services include remodeling, kitchens, cabinets, drywall, trim, painting, and general improvements.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:10:07','2026-07-18 18:10:07',NULL,NULL),(2315,'How do I know whether my roof needs repair or replacement?','how-do-i-know-whether-my-roof-needs-repair-or-replacement',NULL,'<p>Every roof is different.</p><p>The answer depends on its age, condition, damage, previous repairs, leaks, and the remaining life of the roofing materials. We can inspect the visible condition of the roof, identify concerns, and discuss whether repair or replacement may be the better option.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:10:47','2026-07-18 18:10:47',NULL,NULL),(2316,'Will I know what is included in the estimate?','will-i-know-what-is-included-in-the-estimate',NULL,'<p>The estimate should clearly identify the work being discussed, the general scope of the project, and the expected cost based on the information available at the time.</p><p>If you have questions about what is or is not included, ask before the project begins so everyone has the same expectations.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:11:43','2026-07-18 18:11:43',NULL,NULL),(2317,'Why should I choose FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions?','why-should-i-choose-flippin-success-solutions',NULL,'<p>We provide hands-on, owner-led service with a focus on communication, practical solutions, and workmanship homeowners can feel good about.</p><p>You are not simply hiring someone to complete a task. You are trusting someone with your home. We take that responsibility seriously.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:13:15','2026-07-18 18:13:15',NULL,NULL),(2318,'Request A Quote','request-a-quote',NULL,'<h3><strong>Request A Quote</strong></h3>',NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 18:43:33','2026-07-18 18:43:33',NULL,NULL),(2319,'My Mission','my-mission-39',NULL,'<p>Our mission is to help Connecticut homeowners protect, improve, and transform their homes through dependable workmanship, honest communication, and practical solutions built around each customerΓÇÖs needs.</p><p>We strive to treat every home with care, complete every project with pride, and create results our customers will be excited to live with.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 19:36:02','2026-07-18 19:36:02',NULL,NULL),(2320,'Who is Jay Vargas?','who-is-jay-vargas',NULL,'<p>IΓÇÖm Jay Vargas, founder of FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions.</p><p>I started this company with a simple goal: to help homeowners protect, improve, and enjoy their homes without making the process more complicated than it needs to be. I enjoy taking a project from ΓÇ£beforeΓÇ¥ to ΓÇ£afterΓÇ¥ and watching everything come together one step at a time.</p><p>Whether IΓÇÖm working on a roof, installing siding, updating windows and doors, transforming a kitchen, repairing drywall, painting, or completing a larger remodel, I approach every project with attention to detail and respect for the homeownerΓÇÖs vision.</p><p>For me, success is not simply finishing a job. It is delivering a result the homeowner feels good about every time they walk through the door</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-18 19:38:17','2026-07-18 19:38:17',NULL,NULL),(2321,'1','5',NULL,'<p>2</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-21 21:24:38','2026-07-21 21:24:38',NULL,NULL),(2322,'Get a Quote','get-a-quote',NULL,'<p>Click Here to Get a Quote</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',25,1,256,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-24 15:35:17','2026-07-24 15:35:17',NULL,NULL),(2323,'HIC License','hic-license-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-28 09:40:35','2026-07-28 09:40:35',NULL,NULL),(2329,'Insurance','insurance-11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',11,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-28 09:41:08','2026-07-28 09:41:08',NULL,NULL),(2331,'Video','video',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',27,1,253,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-28 18:05:34','2026-07-28 18:05:34',NULL,NULL),(2332,'Is Bar Plus licensed and insured?','is-bar-plus-licensed-and-insured',NULL,'<p>Yes. Bar Plus promotes itself as a fully licensed and insured mobile bar service operating in Connecticut.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 17:27:16','2026-07-30 17:27:16',NULL,NULL),(2333,'Events We Serve','events-we-serve',NULL,'<h3><strong>Bar Plus provides mobile bar and charcuterie experiences for events throughout Connecticut and surrounding areas.</strong></h3><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÆì Weddings</strong></h2><p>Create an elevated bar experience for your ceremony, cocktail hour and reception.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒæ░ Bridal Showers</strong></h2><p>Celebrate the bride-to-be with signature drinks, charcuterie cups and professional beverage service.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒì╝<strong> Baby Showers</strong></h2><p>Offer mocktails, coffee, charcuterie and customized beverage options for guests.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÄé Birthday Parties</strong></h2><p>Turn milestone birthdays and private celebrations into a professional bar experience.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÅó Corporate Events</strong></h2><p>Provide organized, efficient beverage service for company celebrations, networking events and client gatherings.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÅí Private Parties</strong></h2><p>Bring the bar directly to your backyard, home, venue or private event space.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÑé Engagement Parties</strong></h2><p>Celebrate the newly engaged couple with signature cocktails and an elegant mobile setup.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒÄô<strong> Graduations</strong></h2><p>Give graduates and their guests a memorable, professionally managed celebration.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÄä Holiday Parties</strong></h2><p>Make company and private holiday celebrations easier with complete mobile bar service.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒÄù∩╕Å<strong> Fundraisers and Community Events</strong></h2><p>Create a professional beverage experience for charitable events and community celebrations.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',17,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 17:39:48','2026-07-30 17:39:48',NULL,NULL),(2335,'What is included with the mobile bar service?','what-is-included-with-the-mobile-bar-service',NULL,'<p>Depending on your selected event package, service may include alcohol, mixers, garnishes, ice, bar supplies, professional bartenders, mobile bar setup and cleanup.</p><p>Your final proposal will explain exactly what is included for your event.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:29:44','2026-07-30 18:29:44',NULL,NULL),(2336,'What types of events do you serve?','what-types-of-events-do-you-serve',NULL,'<p>Bar Plus serves weddings, showers, private parties, corporate events and other celebrations throughout Connecticut and beyond.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:30:16','2026-07-30 18:30:16',NULL,NULL),(2337,'Do you travel outside your immediate area?','do-you-travel-outside-your-immediate-area',NULL,'<p>Yes. Bar Plus serves Connecticut and may travel to surrounding areas. Travel charges may apply depending on the event location.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:31:02','2026-07-30 18:31:02',NULL,NULL),(2338,'How do I request a quote?','how-do-i-request-a-quote',NULL,'<p>Submit an event inquiry with your event date, location, event type, estimated guest count and requested services.</p><p>Bar Plus will contact you to confirm availability, discuss the event and help create the right bar experience.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:32:06','2026-07-30 18:32:06',NULL,NULL),(2339,'Do you offer coffee service?','do-you-offer-coffee-service',NULL,'<p>Yes. Bar Plus offers a mobile coffee-bar experience that can be added to eligible events.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:32:48','2026-07-30 18:32:48',NULL,NULL),(2340,'Is setup and cleanup included?','is-setup-and-cleanup-included',NULL,'<p>Yes. Bar Plus provides full setup and cleanup as part of our complete service experience.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:34:08','2026-07-30 18:34:08',NULL,NULL),(2341,'Who is Pam?','who-is-pam',NULL,'<p>Hi, IΓÇÖm&nbsp;<strong>Pam Horbal, owner of Bar Plus LLC</strong>.</p><p>With more than&nbsp;<strong>20 years of bartending experience</strong>, I understand that excellent bar service is about much more than pouring drinks. It is about creating an inviting atmosphere, keeping service running smoothly and making sure every guest feels taken care of.</p><p>I created Bar Plus to give hosts a complete, professional and stress-free alternative to organizing their own event bar. We bring the bar, alcohol, mixers, garnishes, ice, supplies and experienced bartenders directly to your location. We also handle the setup and cleanup, allowing you to be present and enjoy your own celebration.</p><p>Bar Plus is proudly&nbsp;<strong>veteran-owned, female-owned, licensed and insured</strong>, and operates with a Connecticut liquor permit. Our goal is to make every event feel polished, memorable and effortless from the first pour to the final cleanup.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',16,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:35:50','2026-07-30 18:36:30',NULL,NULL),(2342,'Our Mission','our-mission-47',NULL,'<p>Our mission is to make hosting easier by providing a complete, professional and memorable mobile bar experience.</p><p>We combine experienced bartending, reliable service, quality beverages and an elegant presentation to help our clients relax, celebrate and enjoy every moment with their guests.</p>',NULL,NULL,'1',19,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:37:28','2026-07-30 18:37:28',NULL,NULL),(2343,'Clients can call or text 203-525-7900 or email barplusllc@gmail.com with the date, location, guest count and services requested.','clients-can-call-or-text-203-525-7900-or-email-barplusllc-at-gmailcom-with-the-date-location-guest-count-and-services-requested',NULL,'<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Clients can call or text&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">203-525-7900</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;or email&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">barplusllc@gmail.com</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;with the date, location, guest count and services requested.</span></p>',NULL,NULL,'1',13,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:40:07','2026-07-30 18:40:07',NULL,NULL),(2344,'Five Reasons a Mobile Bar Makes Your Event Better','five-reasons-a-mobile-bar-makes-your-event-better',NULL,'<p>Planning an event means managing dozens of moving pieces. Drinks, ice, mixers, cups, bartenders and guest service can quickly become another full-time job.</p><p>A professional mobile bar solves that problem.</p><p>Bar Plus brings an attractive, organized beverage station directly to your event. Guests receive professional service, lines move efficiently and the host does not have to spend the celebration stocking coolers or searching for more ice.</p><p>A mobile bar also becomes part of the eventΓÇÖs atmosphere. Signature cocktails, personalized service and an eye-catching setup create something guests remember long after the party ends.</p><p>Whether you are planning a wedding, birthday party, corporate gathering or backyard celebration, Bar Plus helps make the experience smoother, safer and more enjoyable.</p><p>Because you should be raising a glassΓÇönot running the bar.</p>',NULL,'2026-07-30','1',6,1,263,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-30 18:44:35','2026-07-30 18:44:35',NULL,NULL);
