INSERT INTO `services` VALUES (5,'Making Power Moves electric','<h2>&nbsp;<strong>Our Services</strong></h2><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒöî&nbsp;<strong>Residential Electrical Solutions</strong></h3><p>From custom wiring to modern lighting and smart home upgrades ΓÇö weΓÇÖve got your home powered right.</p><h3>≡ƒÅó&nbsp;<strong>Commercial Projects</strong></h3><p>Reliable electrical systems to keep your business running smoothly with minimal downtime.</p><h3>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Maintenance &amp; Repairs</strong></h3><p>Fast, efficient troubleshooting and expert repairs that keep your systems safe and functional.</p><h3>≡ƒÆí&nbsp;<strong>Energy-Efficient Upgrades</strong></h3><p>Save on costs and go green with our modern, energy-saving solutions.</p>',1,68,1,'2024-12-23 08:05:40','2025-12-02 17:00:53'),(6,'Israel \'Pito\' Cardona: From World Champion to Mentor ΓÇô A Legacy Inside and Outside the Ring','Israel \"Pito\" Cardona, born on November 30, 1974, in Hartford, Connecticut, is a retired American professional boxer known for his achievements in the junior lightweight and lightweight divisions. He began his professional career in 1993, quickly making a name for himself by winning his first 24 fights, including 18 by knockout. One of his notable victories during this streak was against Jeff Mayweather, from the renowned Mayweather boxing family, earning Cardona the International Boxing Organization (IBO) super featherweight title.\r\nIn 1997, Cardona secured a significant win by stopping \"Mighty\" Ivan Robinson in the third round to claim the United States Boxing Association (USBA) lightweight championship. This victory was particularly impressive as Robinson had previously held the International Boxing Federation (IBF) welterweight title and later achieved two wins over Arturo Gatti.\r\nThroughout his career, Cardona faced several top-tier opponents.  After retiring in 2002, he made a comeback in 2006, aiming to capture a major world title, and continued to compete until 2009, finishing his career with a professional record of 36 wins (28 by knockout) and 10 losses.\r\nBeyond his in-ring accomplishments, Cardona has been recognized for his contributions to the sport and his community. In 2008, he was inducted into the CES Ring of Honor, and in 2013, he was inducted into the Connecticut Boxing Hall of Fame, cementing his legacy in the state\'s boxing history.\r\nOutside of boxing, Cardona continued his dedication to his community as a Cub Master for Troop 49 out of Hartford, CT, where he mentored and guided young boys, instilling values of discipline, leadership, and teamwork. Additionally,After retiring from boxing, Cardona remained active in the sport by working as a trainer at Charter Oak Boxing Academy (Coba) in Hartford, sharing his experience and knowledge with aspiring fighters. \r\n\r\n Israel \"Pito\" Cardona\'s life journey is a testament to resilience, leadership, and an unwavering commitment to giving backΓÇöboth in and out of the ring.',1,69,3,'2025-01-03 18:42:46','2025-01-03 18:42:46'),(10,'Saved','εá╕\r\nεá╕\r\nεá╕\r\nεá╕\r\nεá╕\r\na year ago\r\nHas great transportation from JFK back home. The driver was waiting for us when our flight landed. Travel One really helped us out with transportation when another travel agency cancelled on us the day before we were supposed to land at JFK.',1,67,3,'2025-01-05 17:35:38','2025-01-05 17:35:38'),(11,'Odkrywaj. Do┼¢wiadczaj. Ciesz si─Ö. ΓÇô Premium Us┼éugi Podr├│┼╝nicze One Travel LLC','Odkrywaj. Do┼¢wiadczaj. Ciesz si─Ö. ΓÇô Premium Us┼éugi Podr├│┼╝nicze One Travel LLC\r\n\r\nOne Travel LLC to wiod─àce biuro podr├│┼╝y, kt├│re specjalizuje si─Ö w tworzeniu spersonalizowanych do┼¢wiadcze┼ä podr├│┼╝niczych zar├│wno dla turyst├│w indywidualnych, jak i klient├│w biznesowych. Nasza kompleksowa oferta obejmuje:\r\n\r\nIndywidualnie Dopasowane Pakiety Wakacyjne: Szyte na miar─Ö plany podr├│┼╝y do najpi─Ökniejszych zak─àtk├│w ┼¢wiata, dostosowane do Twoich preferencji i bud┼╝etu.\r\nZarz─àdzanie Podr├│┼╝ami S┼éu┼╝bowymi: Efektywne rozwi─àzania dla podr├│┼╝y biznesowych, obejmuj─àce rezerwacje lot├│w, zakwaterowanie i transport naziemny, dostosowane do unikalnych potrzeb klient├│w korporacyjnych.\r\nPlanowanie Podr├│┼╝y Grupowych: Profesjonalna koordynacja wyjazd├│w dla grup o dowolnej wielko┼¢ci ΓÇô idealne na zjazdy rodzinne, wesela czy wyjazdy integracyjne.\r\nRezerwacje Rejs├│w: Dost─Öp do ekskluzywnych ofert czo┼éowych linii wycieczkowych, oferuj─àcych podr├│┼╝e do egzotycznych miejsc na ca┼éym ┼¢wiecie.\r\nUbezpieczenia Podr├│┼╝ne: Kompleksowe opcje ubezpieczenia, kt├│re zapewniaj─à ochron─Ö przed nieprzewidzianymi okoliczno┼¢ciami podczas podr├│┼╝y.\r\nPomoc w Uzyskaniu Wiz i Paszport├│w: Profesjonalne doradztwo i wsparcie w uzyskaniu niezb─Ödnych dokument├│w podr├│┼╝nych, aby Twoja podr├│┼╝ przebieg┼éa bezproblemowo.\r\nCa┼éodobowe Wsparcie Klienta: Dedykowana pomoc przed podr├│┼╝─à, w jej trakcie i po jej zako┼äczeniu, zapewniaj─àca spok├│j ducha na ka┼╝dym etapie wyjazdu.\r\nW One Travel LLC naszym celem jest ┼¢wiadczenie wyj─àtkowej obs┼éugi i tworzenie niezapomnianych do┼¢wiadcze┼ä podr├│┼╝niczych, przekszta┼écaj─àc Twoje marzenia w rzeczywisto┼¢─ç.',1,67,1,'2025-01-05 17:39:49','2025-01-05 17:39:49'),(12,'One Travel LLC is a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting personalized travel experiences for both leisure and business travelers.','One Travel LLC is a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting personalized travel experiences for both leisure and business travelers. Our comprehensive range of services includes: Customized Vacation Packages: Tailor-made itineraries to destinations worldwide, ensuring each journey aligns with your preferences and budget. Corporate Travel Management: Streamlined solutions for business travel, including flight bookings, accommodations, and ground transportation, designed to meet the unique needs of corporate clients. Group Travel Planning: Expert coordination of travel arrangements for groups of any size, perfect for family reunions, weddings, or corporate retreats. Cruise Bookings: Access to exclusive deals on leading cruise lines, offering voyages to a variety of exotic destinations. Travel Insurance: Comprehensive coverage options to protect you against unforeseen circumstances during your travels. Visa and Passport Assistance: Guidance and support in obtaining necessary travel documents, ensuring a hassle-free journey. 24/7 Customer Support: Dedicated assistance before, during, and after your trip, providing peace of mind throughout your travel experience. At One Travel LLC, our mission is to deliver exceptional service and unforgettable travel experiences, turning your travel dreams into reality.',1,67,3,'2025-01-05 17:41:36','2025-01-05 17:41:36'),(13,'One Travel LLC is a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting personalized travel experiences for both leisure and business travelers.','Our comprehensive range of services includes: Customized Vacation Packages: Tailor-made itineraries to destinations worldwide, ensuring each journey aligns with your preferences and budget. Corporate Travel Management: Streamlined solutions for business travel, including flight bookings, accommodations, and ground transportation, designed to meet the unique needs of corporate clients. Group Travel Planning: Expert coordination of travel arrangements for groups of any size, perfect for family reunions, weddings, or corporate retreats. Cruise Bookings: Access to exclusive deals on leading cruise lines, offering voyages to a variety of exotic destinations. Travel Insurance: Comprehensive coverage options to protect you against unforeseen circumstances during your travels. Visa and Passport Assistance: Guidance and support in obtaining necessary travel documents, ensuring a hassle-free journey. 24/7 Customer Support: Dedicated assistance before, during, and after your trip, providing peace of mind throughout your travel experience. At One Travel LLC, our mission is to deliver exceptional service and unforgettable travel experiences, turning your travel dreams into reality.',1,67,1,'2025-01-05 17:42:34','2025-01-05 17:42:34'),(15,'My Reviews','<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">Click Here to Write or Read My Reviews</strong></h2>',1,68,3,'2025-01-06 05:53:57','2025-12-02 17:47:42'),(16,'Matteo Cavaliere 5 Star Review','Matteo Cavaliere\r\nI would highly recommend to anybody who needs electrical work in their home. They have completed multiple jobs for me and are very detail oriented and professional. Not to mention all of the work was super affordable which is all you can ask for.',0,68,3,'2025-01-06 05:57:04','2025-01-06 05:57:04'),(17,'Paul Small 5 Star Review','Paul Small 5 Star Review\r\nChago and his crew help build value with our customers and we feel fortunate to have a trusted referral for all of our electrical work. If you\'re a contractor or a homeowner looking for quality and reliabiltiy, we highly recommend Making Power Moves LLC!',1,68,3,'2025-01-06 06:02:56','2025-01-06 06:02:56'),(18,'Neal and Karen Shah 5 Star Review','Neal & Karan Shah\r\n5 Star Review\r\nChago (owner) is excellent and very knowledgeable. He was able to go beyond and extra mile to get what what I need. He always leave me happy the work! Highly recommended. 10 out of 10!',1,68,3,'2025-01-06 06:12:47','2025-01-06 06:12:47'),(19,'Brian Franzosa','Brian Franzosa\r\n5 Star Review\r\nIf you need an electrician, look no further. Chago was awesome to work with. He did a bunch of work for me at my new place. Not only did he bang out all the work I wanted done, he went above and beyond and fixed things that he noticed were not up to code without me even asking him. He was everything you would want in a contractor. Punctual, polite, discreet, cleaned up after himself. I highly recommend him for any electrical work you need done.',1,68,3,'2025-01-06 06:14:09','2025-01-06 06:14:09'),(20,'Kim Smith','Kim Smith\r\n5 Star Review\r\nEXCELLENT ELECTRICIAN!  Very professional, responsive and pricing very reasonable. HeΓÇÖs the man for the job.',1,68,3,'2025-01-06 06:15:50','2025-01-06 06:15:50'),(21,'Stunning Craftsmanship','\"If youΓÇÖre looking for beautifully crafted items with deep cultural significance, Quo Vadis Retail is the place to go. I purchased a plate and a few drinking glasses adorned with Polish insignia, and theyΓÇÖre absolutely stunning. You can feel the pride and tradition in every piece. This shop is a treasure trove of Polish artistry!\" - Piotr C',1,70,3,'2025-01-17 16:45:34','2025-01-24 23:31:21'),(29,'Water Damage Restoration','Swift response is crucial to prevent further structural issues and health risks, such as mold growth. HOUZPITAL\'s certified specialists promptly contain damage, remove water, and employ drying and dehumidification methods to eliminate moisture deep within your property.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:36:12','2025-01-22 06:36:12'),(30,'Fire & Smoke Damage Restoration','Recovering from a fire can be overwhelming. HOUZPITAL provides comprehensive services, including emergency board-up, roof tarping, smoke and soot removal, deodorization, and full repairs, ensuring your property is restored to its pre-loss condition.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:37:09','2025-01-22 06:37:09'),(31,'Emergency Board-Up & Roof Tarping','To prevent further damage after incidents like fires or storms, HOUZPITAL provides prompt board-up and roof tarping services, securing your property against weather elements and unauthorized access.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:37:53','2025-01-22 06:37:53'),(32,'Storm Damage Restoration','Natural disasters can cause extensive damage. HOUZPITAL offers comprehensive restoration services, including structural assessments, debris removal, and repairs, to help you recover swiftly.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:38:39','2025-01-22 06:38:39'),(33,'Duct Cleaning','Clean air ducts are vital for indoor air quality. HOUZPITAL\'s team provides thorough duct cleaning services, removing contaminants and ensuring a healthier environment for occupants.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:40:00','2025-01-22 06:40:00'),(34,'Construction Services','Beyond restoration, HOUZPITAL provides full-service construction services, handling everything from structural repairs to complete rebuilds, ensuring quality craftsmanship and adherence to your vision.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:40:50','2025-01-22 06:40:50'),(35,'Smart Home Integration','Modernize your property with smart home technology that enhances safety, convenience, and energy efficiency. HOUZPITAL integrates systems like security cameras, environmental sensors, and automated lighting to create a connected and efficient home.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:41:41','2025-01-22 06:41:41'),(36,'Mold Remediation','Mold poses significant health risks and can damage property. HOUZPITAL\'s experts conduct thorough assessments, containment, removal, and prevention strategies to ensure a safe and healthy environment.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:43:17','2025-01-22 06:43:17'),(37,'Asbestos Removal','Asbestos exposure is hazardous. HOUZPITAL performs safe and efficient asbestos abatement, adhering to all regulatory standards to protect occupants and property.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:43:56','2025-01-22 06:43:56'),(38,'Biohazard Cleanup','Handling biohazard incidents requires specialized expertise. HOUZPITAL offers professional cleanup services to manage hazardous materials safely, ensuring thorough decontamination and compliance with health regulations.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:44:33','2025-01-22 06:44:33'),(39,'Contents Cleaning & Storage','Personal belongings affected by disasters require specialized care. HOUZPITAL offers cleaning, restoration, and secure storage solutions to preserve your valuables during the restoration process.',1,71,1,'2025-01-22 06:45:53','2025-01-22 06:45:53'),(40,'5 Star','You guys have handled many water, fire and mold claims for my insurance customers. The service is excellent and the response time is impeccable, my customers have been beyond pleased with the service... HIGHLY recommended!!!\"\r\nHolly Mclin',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:29:10','2025-01-22 07:29:10'),(41,'5 Star','When we had water damage to our newly remodeled first floor, we called HOUZPITAL and they were at our house within 20 minutes. The entire process was handled efficiently and professionally from beginning to end. We were very pleased and highly recommend this company!ΓÇ¥ Coral L.',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:30:48','2025-01-22 07:30:48'),(42,'5 Star','My fatherΓÇÖs old family home had frozen pipes that burst and there was extreme water damage throughout the home. My father called HOUZPITAL on a Saturday morning and Greg and his entire crew including a plumber & electrician arrived at my familyΓÇÖs home within an hour of my call. From start to finish they were a pleasure to work with. They dealt with our insurance company and adjuster to ensure the entire loss was covered. I highly recommend HOUZPITAL, they are an extremely knowledgeable company with amazing staff and customer service.ΓÇ¥\r\nΓÇö Courtney P.',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:31:43','2025-01-22 07:31:43'),(43,'5 Star','I recently experienced an incident involving sewage back-up into my basement, but fortunately found Atlantic Restoration and Remodeling Group for the clean-up process. They were extremely responsive and sent a crew that same evening. They came back for two additional deep cleans, which made a huge difference not only in appearance of the basement itself, but the smell. I initially contacted Servpro because I was unfamiliar with other options, but I am so glad that I found Atlantic instead. They were responsive, professional, and affordable. I would highly recommend this company!ΓÇ¥\r\nΓÇö Shelley T.',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:32:23','2025-01-22 07:32:23'),(44,'5 Star','Desperate to pump out a flooded basement. Not a high ticket insurance claim item. Took a chance and called Atlantic. Carlos Called, showed up in less than an hour and went right to work with the pumps. It was more complicated than we thought and he set us up with another contractor who could do what he wasnΓÇÖt equipped to do. (Snake the main drain). Contractor also showed up when he said he would. Carlos also left a dehumidifier overnight to dry out as much as possible. Amazing contractor. Lose the number for Servpro. This company is awesome!ΓÇ¥\r\nΓÇö Cindy H.',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:32:51','2025-01-22 07:32:51'),(45,'5 Star','Ryan was very professional and easy to deal with when he came out to assess the damage. I was amazed that he had a crew come out so quickly after his inspection to start the cleanup. I canΓÇÖt describe how pleased I am with the work that the techs did. Jennifer, Juan, and Dylon were the technicians who did the work. IΓÇÖm also happy how easy the company made it for me to go through the nightmare cleanup process and getting what I needed to get done very promptly which made it a dream vs a nightmare. Thank You to everyone involved.ΓÇ¥\r\nΓÇö Mike C.',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:33:30','2025-01-22 07:33:30'),(46,'5 Star','You provided water mitigation when our basement flooded. Ryan, Dylon and their crew did a great job. They were professional and extremely responsive (even in the evening when we had a minor scheduling change on our end). The team did a thorough job and left everything in great shape to start the remodel phase. We couldnΓÇÖt have asked for a better experience!ΓÇ¥\r\nΓÇö Kelly S.',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:33:52','2025-01-22 07:33:52'),(47,'5 Star','HOUZPITAL provided emergency mitigation for a substantial sewage backup issue in our basement. Ryan, Dylan and crew were professional, thorough, and always provided clear communication throughout the process. I am extremely satisfied with the high quality work and attention to the specific needs of my situation. I highly recommend this companyΓÇ¥\r\nΓÇö Christine F.',1,71,3,'2025-01-22 07:34:16','2025-01-22 07:34:16'),(48,'5 Star','This company is exceptional! I ca