e, explaining the entire process and ensuring I understood everything. They conducted a thorough patent search and helped me refine my application to ensure it was strong. They even went the extra mile to help me secure a trademark for my business name. Thanks to their hard work, I now feel secure and confident moving forward. If youΓÇÖre looking for a team that truly cares about your success, look no further than Emanus. TheyΓÇÖre simply the best!- Julia Quinn',1,77,3,'2025-01-28 16:11:18','2025-01-28 16:16:24'),(173,'4','Exceptional Patent and Trademark Expertise!\r\n\r\nΓ¡ÉΓ¡ÉΓ¡ÉΓ¡ÉΓ¡É\r\nI cannot say enough good things about Emanus and their team, especially Wil! From the moment I reached out, Wil took the time to understand my invention and walked me through the entire patent process step by step. His thorough patent search and detailed application gave me complete confidence that my idea was well-protected. What impressed me most was how he handled my trademark application with the same level of care. He was professional, responsive, and incredibly knowledgeable. Thanks to Emanus and Wil, I now have a patent and trademark, and IΓÇÖm excited to bring my product to market with peace of mind. Highly recommended!- Mike C',1,77,3,'2025-01-28 16:13:38','2025-01-28 16:13:38'),(174,'EV Charger Installations:','EV Charger Installations: Customized solutions for homes and businesses, ensuring compatibility with all major EV models.',0,68,1,'2025-02-01 21:07:51','2025-02-01 21:07:51'),(175,'Google Reviews','https://www.google.com/search?q=houzpital+llc+google+reviews+link&sca_esv=46890ce5d97cd057&rlz=1C1CHZN_enUS1011US1011&ei=HgSZZ86YB63V5NoPjcCuwQY&ved=0ahUKEwjOn9K46ZiLAxWtKlkFHQ2gK2gQ4dUDCBA&uact=5&oq=houzpital+llc+google+reviews+link&gs_lp=Egxnd3Mtd2l6LXNlcnAiIWhvdXpwaXRhbCBsbGMgZ29vZ2xlIHJldmlld3MgbGluazIHECEYoAEYCjIHECEYoAEYCjIHECEYoAEYCjIHECEYoAEYCjIFECEYqwJItA5QoQdY9gtwAXgBkAEAmAGBAaABxQSqAQMxLjS4AQPIAQD4AQGYAgagAt0EwgIKEAAYsAMY1gQYR5gDAIgGAZAGCJIHAzEuNaAHuSU&scli