ter, dirt, and grime, making cleaning easier\r\nΓ£ö Enhanced Gloss & Shine ΓÇô Provides a deep, mirror-like finish\r\nΓ£ö Long-Lasting Protection ΓÇô Maintains your carΓÇÖs beauty for years to come',1,78,1,'2025-02-18 00:48:52','2025-02-18 00:48:52'),(209,'≡ƒ¢╗ Fleet & Commercial Vehicle Detailing','Maintain a professional and polished look for your business vehicles with our fleet detailing services.\r\nΓ£ö Exterior and Interior Maintenance ΓÇô Keep your company vehicles in top condition\r\nΓ£ö Bulk Service Discounts ΓÇô Custom packages available for multiple vehicles',1,78,1,'2025-02-18 00:55:46','2025-02-18 00:55:46'),(211,'≡ƒö╣ Interior Protection & Fabric Guard','Preserve your carΓÇÖs upholstery, leather, and carpets with our high-quality fabric and leather protection treatments.\r\nΓ£ö Leather Conditioning ΓÇô Prevents cracking, fading, and drying out\r\nΓ£ö Fabric & Carpet Protection ΓÇô Resists spills and stains for long-lasting cleanliness',1,78,1,'2025-02-18 01:00:19','2025-02-18 01:00:19'),(212,'≡ƒÅå Why Choose Swag Detailers?','Γ£à Over 27 Years of Expertise ΓÇô Trusted by car enthusiasts and professionals\r\nΓ£à Premium Products & Techniques ΓÇô Only the best for your vehicle\r\nΓ£à Personalized Service ΓÇô We tailor every detail to your carΓÇÖs specific needs\r\nΓ£à Satisfaction Guaranteed ΓÇô We treat every car as if it were our own',1,78,1,'2025-02-18 01:04:15','2025-02-18 01:04:15'),(214,'Criminal Defense Cases Connecticut','At Moynahan Law we handle a diverse range of cases throughout CT. Clients from all walks of life can depend on our assistance. No criminal case is too complex for us to defend.\r\n\r\nAttorney Tim Moynahan is ready to stand by your side and fight for you during each step of your case, whether you are accused of driving while intoxicated or a violent crime. Not many lawyers offer the level of care that we do at Moynahan Law. Defending our clients\' rights and future is our purpose. Whether you have been charged with a drug crime, a sex crime, or a murder/manslaughter charges, we are prepared to aggressively defend you.\r\n\r\nLooking for a Connecticut Criminal Lawyer with the experience necessary to get you the outcome you deserve? The Moynahan Law Firm has extensive trial experience with both misdemeanor and felony criminal defense cases.',1,85,1,'2025-02-23 14:11:00','2025-02-23 14:11:00'),(215,'Personal Injury','We are known for our personal injury practice due to our reputation for advocating for injured people and the families of wrongful death victims in Waterbury, CT. With our Personal Injury AttorneysΓÇÖ experience in personal injury lawsuits and litigation, we can help you recover compensation for your injuries and damages, including lost wages, medical expenses, and pain and suffering.',1,85,1,'2025-02-23 14:12:25','2025-02-23 14:12:25'),(216,'Exceptional Legal Representation!','I canΓÇÖt thank Attorney Tim Moynahan enough for his dedication and expertise in helping me reclaim my vehicle. From the moment I reached out to him, he handled my case with professionalism, compassion, and a deep understanding of the law.\r\nTim was thorough in addressing every detail of my situation, ensuring that my rights were protected and that justice was served. He kept me informed throughout the process, answered all my questions with patience, and fought tirelessly on my behalf.\r\nThanks to his hard work and commitment, I was able to get my Tacoma back and move forward with peace of mind. If youΓÇÖre looking for an attorney who truly cares about his clients and gets results, look no further than Tim Moynahan. Highly recommended!',1,85,3,'2025-02-23 15:53:26','2025-02-23 15:53:26'),(217,'I Knew Immediately','ΓÇ£I had the pleasure of getting a free 30 minutes family legal advice which end up being more than that, with The Moynahan Law Firm, From the beginning, they were incredibly knowledgeable, guiding me step-by-step through each legal process and explaining complex matters in a way I could understand. I appreciated attorney Tim his attention to detail and quick response times, with the long phone call plus a more understanding email, which made me feel prioritized and valued. With his help, I achieved a successful outcome, and I couldnΓÇÖt be happier. I highly recommend AttorneyΓÇÖs Tim to anyone in need of a diligent and compassionate lawyer ΓÇ£ -Lino Tapia',1,85,3,'2025-02-23 15:54:30','2025-02-23 15:57:05'),(218,'Unexpected Criminal Issue','Retained Tim Moynahan and his team to represent a family member for an unexpected and very scary criminal issue that we took to trial. Situations as these are nerve racking as a loved oneΓÇÖs future hangs in the balance. Attorney Moynahan, his assistant, Amy, and the rest of his team are honest, thorough, accessible, available, communicative, diligent, experienced and successful. We are extremely grateful to Attorney Moynahan, Amy and the rest of the team for bringing our loved one home and giving him his future back.-D. Garofalo',1,85,3,'2025-02-23 18:52:09','2025-02-23 18:52:09'),(219,'Best Attorney I Ever Had','Hands down Tim is the very best attorney I ever had! I literally mean ever! I 100% would recommend him to FAMILY or ANYONE I know! Always made time for me to talk, was very clear the entire time got me the results I was looking for. Tim is my go-to guy! Thank you so much man! ItΓÇÖs well appreciative.',1,85,3,'2025-02-23 18:56:06','2025-02-23 18:56:06'),(220,'Reviews 3','Reviews 3',1,17,3,'2025-02-24 15:04:02','2025-02-24 15:04:02'),(222,'Reviews 5','Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5Reviews 5',1,17,3,'2025-02-24 15:05:06','2025-02-24 15:05:06'),(228,'Reviews 10','Reviews 10',1,17,3,'2025-02-24 15:07:48','2025-02-24 15:07:48'),(231,'Car Accidents','Navigating the complexities of auto insurance claims and liability can be overwhelming. We fight for your right to full compensation for medical expenses, lost wages, and pain and suffering.',1,85,1,'2025-02-24 20:58:31','2025-02-24 20:58:31'),(232,'Motorcycle, Bus, and Truck Accidents','Each mode of transportation brings its own challenges. Our experienced team understands the nuances of each case, ensuring that every client receives tailored legal advice.',1,85,1,'2025-02-24 20:59:52','2025-02-24 20:59:52'),(233,'WorkersΓÇÖ Compensation','If youΓÇÖve been injured on the job, securing your rightful benefits is essential. We advocate for workers who deserve a safe work environment and fair compensation when accidents occur.',1,85,1,'2025-02-24 21:00:44','2025-02-24 21:00:44'),(235,'Medical Malpractice','When healthcare providers fail to meet the standard of careΓÇöresulting in harmΓÇöour firm steps in. From misdiagnoses, such as failure to diagnose breast cancer, to other critical oversights, we hold medical professionals accountable.',1,85,1,'2025-02-24 21:02:42','2025-02-24 21:02:42'),(236,'Other Injury Cases','Whether itΓÇÖs a slip and fall accident, wrongful death, dog bite, burn injury, spinal cord damage, construction accident, drug accident, or bicycle accident, our comprehensive approach ensures no detail is overlooked.',1,85,1,'2025-02-24 21:04:18','2025-02-24 21:04:18'),(237,'Burn Injuries','A startling 50% of burn injuries are caused by negligence. Burns are excruciatingly painful, have long lasting effects and often result in disfiguring scars.',1,85,1,'2025-02-24 21:06:19','2025-02-24 21:06:19'),(238,'Home Exterior Lighting Service','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">Home exterior lighting services play an essential role in enhancing both the aesthetic appeal and functionality of residential properties. By carefully illuminating pathways and highlighting architectural features, these services not only create inviting outdoor spaces but also greatly contribute to safety and security. With a range of offerings, from design to installation, and flexible options that cater to seasonal needs, one might wonder how such enhancements can be customized to individual preferences and the unique characteristics of a home. The implications of these choices extend past mere illumination, inviting further exploration into their transformative potential.</strong></p>',1,65,1,'2025-02-27 16:37:53','2025-06-25 01:01:03'),(239,'Landscape Lighting Service','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">Scenery lighting service plays an essential role in enhancing not only the aesthetic appeal of outdoor spaces but also their safety and functionality. By utilizing various lighting techniques, professionals can illuminate pathways, emphasize architectural features, and create inviting atmospheres for evening gatherings. Furthermore, the integration of smart control systems adds a layer of convenience that corresponds with modern lifestyles. However, the selection and strategic placement of lighting fixtures are critical to achieving the desired effect. Understanding these elements can substantially impact your outdoor environment, prompting a closer examination of your current setup.</strong></p>',1,65,1,'2025-02-27 16:38:49','2025-06-25 01:00:27'),(242,'Decorative Elements Service','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 138, 0);\">The Decorative Elements Service plays a significant role in transforming spaces through the strategic application of design components such as lighting, wreaths, and garlands. By carefully selecting and installing these elements, one can enhance the aesthetic appeal and create a desired atmosphere that connects with occupants and visitors alike. Understanding how to coordinate colors and utilize creative lighting techniques is essential for achieving a polished finish. As we investigate the intricacies of this service, the impact of seasonal decorations on overall ambiance becomes particularly remarkable, prompting a closer examination of their role in nurturing a welcoming environment.</strong></p>',1,65,1,'2025-02-27 16:40:15','2025-06-25 01:01:28'),(243,'Commercial Christmas Lighting Service','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">The implementation of commercial Christmas lighting services has become a crucial strategy for businesses aiming to enhance their visibility and attract clientele during the holiday season. By integrating aesthetically pleasing designs that reflect brand identity, organizations not only create a festive ambiance but also nurture customer engagement. Additionally, the emphasis on safety and energy efficiency in these installations raises important considerations for long-term sustainability. As we investigate the complex benefits of these services, it becomes evident that the impact extends far further than mere decoration, inviting a deeper examination of their role in modern retail strategy.</strong></p>',1,65,1,'2025-02-27 16:41:12','2025-06-25 01:02:27'),(244,'Residential Christmas Lighting Service','The holiday season presents a unique opportunity to transform your residence into a festive showcase, yet many homeowners find the logistics of installation and maintenance intimidating. A professional residential Christmas lighting service addresses these concerns by providing customized designs that reflect personal style while ensuring safety and efficiency. With a focus on hassle-free solutions, the service not only enhances the homeΓÇÖs ambiance but also strengthens family traditions and community spirit. Consider the implications of such a service for your holiday experience, and investigate how it can redefine your seasonal celebrations.',0,65,1,'2025-02-27 16:43:48','2025-02-27 16:43:48'),(245,'5 Stars','There\'s no one else to hire for your holiday lights! They are THE BEST!! It was done with perfection. They were a pleasure to work with, had great i... More\r\nJulie Corrado',1,65,3,'2025-02-27 18:30:03','2025-02-27 18:30:03'),(246,'5 Star','if youΓÇÖre looking for someone else to decorate your home for Christm