aling through creativity is powerful.ΓÇ¥','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>ΓÇ£I never imagined art could be a tool for healing until I met Nadine. Her approach is refreshing, soulful, and deeply effective. I felt empowered after every session ΓÇö like I was building a new version of myself.ΓÇ¥</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Jason P.</em></p>',1,136,3,'2025-07-08 01:07:40','2025-07-08 01:07:40'),(742,'ΓÇ£The real deal.ΓÇ¥','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>ΓÇ£Nadine brings wisdom, warmth, and professionalism into every session. Her trauma-informed techniques and compassionate presence helped me work through years of emotional pain. IΓÇÖve never felt more seen or supported.ΓÇ¥</em></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Derek W.</em></p>',1,136,3,'2025-07-08 01:11:18','2025-07-08 01:11:18'),(743,'My Services','<h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">Shamrock Detailing LLC</strong></h3><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Γ£¿&nbsp;<strong><em>We donΓÇÖt just clean carsΓÇª we bring them back to life.</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">At Shamrock Detailing, your vehicle gets treated like a luxuryΓÇöevery detail, every surface, every finish perfected using premium products made right here in Connecticut by&nbsp;<strong>SWAG Detailers</strong>.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Because your car shouldnΓÇÖt just look cleanΓÇª it should look&nbsp;<strong>elite.</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">≡ƒöÑ&nbsp;<strong>Turn Heads Everywhere You Go</strong></p><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></h3><h3 class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span class=\"ql-size-large\">≡ƒÆÄ&nbsp;</span><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">Interior Detailing ΓÇô Feel Like ItΓÇÖs Brand New Again</strong></h3><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Say goodbye to stains, odors, and buildup. Step into a fresh, restored, like-ne