tems</strong></p><p>Cards/mobile credentials, door controllers, schedules, audit trails, and visitor managementΓÇöwho gets in, when, and why.</p><p>≡ƒÄÑ&nbsp;<strong>Video Surveillance (CCTV &amp; Cloud VMS)</strong></p><p>HD/AI cameras, remote viewing, people/vehicle analytics, retention policies, and incident clip exports on demand.</p><p>≡ƒÜ¿&nbsp;<strong>Intrusion Detection</strong></p><p>Door/window contacts, motion and glass-break, panic/duressΓÇöintegrated and monitored for real-world response.</p><p>≡ƒöÑ&nbsp;<strong>Fire &amp; Life Safety</strong></p><p>Detection, pull stations, voice evac, 24/7 monitoring, inspections, and code complianceΓÇösafety that passes scrutiny.</p><p>≡ƒÅó&nbsp;<strong>GSOC / Command Center Build-Outs</strong></p><p>From a single incident screen to a full command centerΓÇödashboards, playbooks, escalation trees, and reporting.</p><p>≡ƒº¡&nbsp;<strong>Compliance &amp; Professional Services</strong></p><p>Risk assessments, SOPs/post orders, emergency action plans, drills, and program audits with clear remediation steps.</p><p>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Hosted &amp; Managed Security Platforms</strong></p><p>We host and maintain your access/video platformsΓÇöupdates, backups, user adminΓÇöso your team stays focused.</p>',1,134,1,'2025-10-17 04:09:49','2025-10-17 04:09:49'),(857,'MV Medical Billing LLC ΓÇö Services','<p><strong>≡ƒº¡ Consultations (Strategy &amp; Fix-It Sessions)</strong></p><p>30ΓÇô60 min audits, denial triage, payer/EHR choices, same-day punch-list.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒ¬¬ Credentialing &amp; Payer Enrollment</strong></p><p>CAQH, attestations, new panels, re-cred, EFT/ERA, license renewals.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒöÄ Eligibility &amp; Benefits Verification</strong></p><p>Deductibles, copays, auth requirements verified before sessions.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒùé∩╕Å Authorizations &amp; Pre-Certs</strong></p><p>We obtain, track, and renew auths; manage units/dates to prevent denials.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒôñ Claims Creation &amp; Submission (EDI/CMS-1500)</strong></p><p>Clean claims daily with correct CPT/ICD-10, POS, telehealth modifiers.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å Denial Management &amp; Appeals</strong></p><p>Root cause ΓåÆ correct ΓåÆ resubmit/appeal. We chase until it pays.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒÆ│ Payment Posting (ERA/EOB) &amp; Reconciliation</strong></p><p>Accurate posting, adjustments, write-offs matched to deposits.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒô¿ Patient Statements &amp; A/R Follow-Up</strong></p><p>Clear statements + tactful follow-ups that collect without burning bridges.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒöì Audit &amp; Records Support</strong></p><p>Commercial/government responses packaged tight and on time.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒôê Reporting &amp; Revenue Insights</strong></p><p>Monthly dashboards: charges, collections, denial rates, payer mix, aging, fixes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å Compliance &amp; HIPAA Procedures</strong></p><p>Minimum-necessary access, documented workflows, PHI locked down.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒûÑ∩╕Å Telehealth &amp; Modifiers Guidance</strong></p><p>POS/95/GT done right so virtual visits get paid properly.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>≡ƒÜÇ New Practice Setup (Optional)</strong></p><p>Smart payer strategy, fee schedules, EHR basicsΓÇöskip rookie mistakes.</p>',1,156,1,'2025-10-19 23:07:42','2025-10-19 23:07:42'),(858,'Services','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">At Black Swan, our philosophy is simple: VALUE FIRST! We act as a center of influence that scouts unconventional, proven servicesΓÇöoften unknown to the marketΓÇöto unlock savings, boost EBITDA, and compound long-term profitability.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">∩╗┐</strong><strong>≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å Life, Annuity &amp; Health Insurance (Individual &amp; Group) ΓÇö Save up to 25% (Group Health)</strong></p><p>We restructure coverage to cut waste and boost protectionΓÇöwithout gutting benefits. For groups, our carrier bidding + plan design can trim&nbsp;<strong>up to 25%</strong>&nbsp;while improving employee experience (yes, both can be true).</p><p><em>Best for:</em>&nbsp;owners tired of renewal roulette and creeping premiums.</p><p><strong>≡ƒÆ│ Preventive Health Indemnity + Payroll Reduction Strategies ΓÇö $480ΓÇô$900/yr per employee</strong></p><p>Layer a compliant preventive indemnity and optimize pre-tax elections so employees keep more of each paycheck. Employers see lower FICA; teams see more take-home.</p><p><em>Typical outcome:</em>&nbsp;<strong>$480ΓÇô$900 annual savings per employee</strong>, with better first-dollar coverage for basic care. Win-win.</p><p><strong>≡ƒº¬ R&amp;D Tax Credits</strong></p><p>If you improve products, processes, or software, you might be leaving money on the table. We document qualifying activities, map costs, and defend the credit so you pocket real cashΓÇönot just theory.</p><p><em>Applies to:</em>&nbsp;manufacturing, construction, SaaS, engineering, food science, and more.</p><p><strong>ΓÜí≡ƒÆº Resiliency Energy Savings Strategies ΓÇö 8%ΓÇô20% off water &amp; energy</strong></p><p>Audit. Optimize. Automate. From rate class corrections to retrofit ROI and leak detection, we cut utility spend&nbsp;<strong>8%ΓÇô20%</strong>&nbsp;and harden operations against outages and price spikes.</p><p><em>Extras:</em>&nbsp;demand response, on-bill financing, and resilience planning.</p><p><strong>≡ƒÅª≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å Privately Owned Reinsurance Company (PORC) Strategies</strong></p><p>Advanced risk architecture for qualified firms: shift select enterprise risks into a properly structured captive to pursue&nbsp;<strong>risk reduction, asset protection, tax efficiency, wealth acceleration, and risk transference</strong>ΓÇöwith independent actuarial oversight.</p><p><em>Translation:</em>&nbsp;formalize the ΓÇ£what-ifs,ΓÇ¥ control the dollars, and build a balance-sheet asset.</p><p><strong>≡ƒº╛ Tax Reduction Strategies</strong></p><p>Not smoke and mirrorsΓÇödesign. We coordinate entity structure, comp plans, cost segregation, credits, and deferrals so profit sticks. Your CPA files the return; we engineer the result.</p><p><em>Goal:</em>&nbsp;legal, defensible, and durable savingsΓÇöno heroics, just strategy.</p>',1,155,1,'2025-10-20 12:12:55','2025-10-20 16:30:06'),(862,'Services','<ul><li>≡ƒÆ░&nbsp;<strong>Found Money Audit&nbsp;</strong>ΓÇö uncover hidden cash flow.</li><li>≡ƒº╛<strong>&nbsp;Payroll Tax Savings Plan&nbsp;</strong>ΓÇö raise net pay with no new overhead.</li><li>≡ƒº¬&nbsp;<strong>R&amp;D Tax Credit Studies</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö document, file, maximize credits.</li><li>≡ƒªä&nbsp;<strong>ER┬│ Tax UnicornΓäó Design</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö deductible premiums + Roth-style growth.</li><li>≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å<strong>&nbsp;┬º831(a) Reinsurance Setup&nbsp;</strong>ΓÇö risk transfer with actuarial oversight.</li><li>≡ƒñ¥&nbsp;<strong>BuyΓÇôSell Funding Strategy&nbsp;</strong>ΓÇö continuity if a partner exits.</li><li>≡ƒôê<strong>&nbsp;EBITDA Lift Roadmap&nbsp;</strong>ΓÇö quick wins + operating cadence.</li><li>ΓÅ▒∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Working Capital Optimization</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö speed cash cycles, cut friction.</li><li>≡ƒöÉ&nbsp;<strong>Crypto Literacy 101</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö safety-first education, no hype.</li><li>Γ£à&nbsp;<strong>Implementation &amp; Compliance</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö we build, you benefit.</li><li>≡ƒÄƒ∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Invitation-Only Workshops</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö ER┬│ Tax UnicornΓäó sessions.</li><li>≡ƒÆè<strong>&nbsp;$0 Rx &amp; Wholesale Benefits&nbsp;</strong>ΓÇö zero-cost meds + transparent pricing.</li><li>≡ƒÅÑ&nbsp;<strong>Health Plan Cost Disruption</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇö slash bloated group health spend.</li></ul><p><br></p>',1,154,1,'2025-10-20 20:53:51','2025-10-20 20:53:51'),(863,'Worth Every Penny','<p><strong>Melissa has helped my solo therapy practice thrive.&nbsp;After working in numerous social service agencies, I knew nothing about therapy practice as a business, and they were right there to help when I began this process 5 years