d value.</li><li>ΓÜí&nbsp;<strong>EV &amp; Hybrid Guidance</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Breaking down electric and hybrid options in simple terms so you understand range, charging, and real-world costs before you decide.</li><li>≡ƒÄ»&nbsp;<strong>Personalized Vehicle Matchmaking</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Tell him about your lifestyle, commute, and must-haves, and heΓÇÖll narrow it down so youΓÇÖre not wandering the lot confused.</li><li>≡ƒöü&nbsp;<strong>Trade-In &amp; Upgrade Consultations</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Honest guidance on your trade-in value and how to use your equity to lower payments or upgrade your ride.</li><li>≡ƒÆ│&nbsp;<strong>Lease &amp; Finance Support</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Walking you through lease vs. finance, monthly payment options, and available programs so you feel confident signing.</li><li>≡ƒÖî&nbsp;<strong>First-Time &amp; Credit-Challenge Assistance</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Patient, judgment-free help for first-time buyers or anyone rebuilding credit, with realistic options that actually work.</li><li>≡ƒôà&nbsp;<strong>Test Drive Appointments</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Easy scheduling for relaxed, no-pressure test drives so you can feel the difference before making a decision.</li><li>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Long-Term Ownership Support</strong>&nbsp;ΓÇô Connecting you with service and maintenance so your vehicle stays safe, reliable, and road-ready.</li></ul><p><br></p>',1,165,1,'2025-12-05 22:25:11','2025-12-05 22:25:11'),(1036,'Services','<h3>≡ƒÆí&nbsp;<strong>IP Strategy &amp; Ideation Consulting</strong></h3><p>Turn rough ideas into patentable, market-ready inventions with structured ideation, vetting, and strategic guidance from an experienced patent professional.</p><h3>≡ƒöì&nbsp;<strong>Patent &amp; Prior Art Searches</strong></h3><p>In-depth U.S. and international searches to confirm novelty, avoid conflicts, and position your invention for strong, defensible protection.</p><h3>≡ƒô¥&nbsp;<strong>Provisional &amp; Non-Provisional Patent Drafting</strong></h3><p>End-to-end drafting and filing of provisional, utility, and design patent applications designed to meet USPTO standards and protect real-world value.</p><h3>ΓÜû∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Office Action Response &amp; Prosecution</strong></h3><p>Strategic responses to USPTO Office Actions and ongoing prosecution to move your application toward allowance while managing risk and cost.</p><h3>≡ƒôè&nbsp;<strong>Valuation &amp; Market Due Diligence</strong></h3><p>Practical IP valuation and market analysis to determine if your idea is worth protecting and how it can win in the marketplace.</p><h3>≡ƒñ¥&nbsp;<strong>Commercialization &amp; Licensing Strategy</strong></h3><p>Support to turn patents into revenue through licensing deals, partnerships, and go-to-market strategy for inventors, startups, and growing companies.</p><h3>≡ƒ⌐║&nbsp;<strong>MedTech &amp; Regulated Industries Support</strong>&nbsp;</h3><p>Specialized guidance for medical device and regulated-technology founders to align IP strategy with regulatory and market pathways.</p>',1,77,1,'2025-12-09 18:38:25','2025-12-09 18:38:25'),(1038,'Our Services','<h3>Litchfield County Liquors</h3><p><strong>≡ƒì╖ Curated Wine, Spirits &amp; Beer Selection</strong></p><p>Carefully chosen wines, spirits, and beers for everyday sips, special dinners, and celebrationsΓÇöranging from classics to unique finds.</p><p><strong>≡ƒºá Personalized Recommendations</strong></p><p>Not sure what to grab? Anthony will ask what youΓÇÖre cooking or the occasion and match you with the right bottleΓÇöno guesswork, no pressure.</p><p><strong>≡ƒÄü Custom Gift Bottles &amp; Bundles</strong></p><p>From a single ΓÇ£thank youΓÇ¥ bottle to small gift sets, we help you choose bottles that look and feel like thoughtful gifts, not last-minute grabs.</p><p><strong>≡ƒÄë Event &amp; Party Stock Planning</strong></p><p>Hosting a family dinner, birthday, or gathering? We help estimate how much wine, beer, and liquor youΓÇÖll need so you donΓÇÖt overspendΓÇöor run out.</p><p><strong>≡