:05:59'),(1041,'Perfect Variety','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£We had a big family event and I was stressing about what to buy. Anthony took the time to walk me through everythingΓÇöhow much wine, beer, and liquor I actually needed, and what would pair best with the food. The result? Perfect variety, no shortage, no waste, and everyone left impressed. Professional, knowledgeable, and just a great guy to deal with.ΓÇ¥</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Nick D.</strong></p>',1,164,3,'2025-12-11 06:07:25','2025-12-11 06:07:25'),(1042,'This is the Spot','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£IΓÇÖm big into bourbon and craft spirits, and Jim&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">gets it</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">. He always has something interesting on the shelf, and if he doesnΓÇÖt, heΓÇÖll try to special order it. HeΓÇÖs put me onto bottles I never wouldΓÇÖve found on my own. If you care about quality and not just grabbing the cheapest thing on the rack, this is your spot.ΓÇ¥</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Brian C.</strong></p>',1,164,3,'2025-12-11 06:09:01','2025-12-11 06:09:01'),(1043,'Feel the Difference','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£You can feel the difference the moment you walk in. The store is clean, organized, and welcomingΓÇöand Jimmy treats you like an old friend, even if itΓÇÖs your first time there. His love for cooking, wine, and good company spills over into how he runs the business. This isnΓÇÖt some random liquor store; itΓÇÖs a place you actually&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">enjoy</em><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;going to.ΓÇ¥</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Angela M.</strong></p>',1,164,3,'2025-12-11 06:11:00','2025-12-11 06:11:00'),(1044,'Definition 