r></p><p>≡ƒÆ│&nbsp;<strong>Smart Credit Options Education</strong></p><p>Help reviewing responsible credit strategies and available options based on your goals and current profile.</p><p><br></p><p>≡ƒº╛&nbsp;<strong>Financial Organization Tools</strong></p><p>Support organizing key financial areas (accounts, tracking, budgeting structure) so you can manage money with less stress.</p><p><br></p><p>≡ƒô£&nbsp;<strong>Legacy &amp; Family Planning Support</strong></p><p>Guidance on planning basics to help you get important information and protections in place for your family.</p><p><br></p><p>≡ƒÅª&nbsp;<strong>Personal &amp; Business Funding Direction</strong></p><p>Education on funding pathways and readiness steps so you can pursue personal or business goals more strategically.</p><p><br></p><p>≡ƒñ¥&nbsp;<strong>UWE Business Opportunity Overview</strong></p><p>A clear walkthrough of the UWE opportunityΓÇöhow it works, what it requires, and whether itΓÇÖs the right fit for you.</p>',1,198,1,'2026-02-13 14:46:57','2026-03-07 02:46:42'),(1153,'Simple and Clear','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£Sara took something that always felt overwhelming and made it simple and clear. She walked me through everything step by step, and now I finally feel like I have direction.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇö Melissa R.</span></p>',1,198,3,'2026-02-13 14:49:25','2026-02-13 14:49:25'),(1154,'Explained My Options','<p><strong>ΓÇ£Very professional, very patient, and extremely knowledgeable. Sara doesnΓÇÖt pressure youΓÇöshe explains your options and helps you choose whatΓÇÖs right for you.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p>ΓÇö Daniel T.</p>',1,198,3,'2026-02-13 14:50:28','2026-02-13 14:50:28'),(1155,'Made it All Make Sense','<p><strong>ΓÇ£IΓÇÖve spoken to other people about finances before, but Sara was the first one who made it all make sense. I feel more organized and confident than I have in years.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p>ΓÇö Angela M.</p>',1,198,3,'2026-02-13 14:51:39'