nitoring</h3><p>Around-the-clock monitoring centers that dispatch emergency responders when alarms are triggered.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÅó Commercial Security Solutions</h3><p>Business-grade intrusion systems, access control, video surveillance, and environmental monitoring for offices, retail, warehouses, and more.</p>',1,202,1,'2026-02-22 01:58:46','2026-02-22 01:58:46'),(1178,'Trust Pilot Reviews','<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 102, 204);\">Click Here to See Our Reviews</strong></h2>',1,202,3,'2026-02-23 01:11:26','2026-02-23 01:15:45'),(1179,'RELIEVED WORRY','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£I didnΓÇÖt realize how stressed I was using random app drivers until I started riding with Serrano Transport. Javier shows up when he says he will, sends a quick text when heΓÇÖs close, and actually remembers my usual routes. ItΓÇÖs a small thing, but having a driver I can trust has taken a lot of worry out of my week.ΓÇ¥</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Emily Rodriguez ΓÇô Newington, CT</strong></p>',0,167,3,'2026-03-08 11:57:50','2026-03-08 11:57:50'),(1180,'THE WAY HE TREATS YOUR TIME','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£I travel for work a lot, so IΓÇÖve used every rideshare out there. The difference with Javier is the way he treats your time. HeΓÇÖs early, the car is ready, and thereΓÇÖs no awkward guessing if heΓÇÖll cancel. I stopped price-shopping rides and just book with Serrano because the peace of mind is worth more than saving a couple of dollars.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Michael Turner ΓÇô Hartford, CT</span></p>',1,167,3,'2026-03-08 12:00:03','2026-03-08 12:00:03'),(1181,'DOESN\'T JUST GIVE RIDES','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£I started using Serrano Transport after a late Uber left me stranded after a doctorΓÇÖs appointment. Javier has driven me to several medical visits since then and always waits until IΓÇÖm settled before pulling off. It made me realize how much respect matters in this kind of service. He doesnΓÇÖt just give rides; he makes sure you feel looked after.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Patricia Gomez ΓÇô West Hartford, CT</span></p>',1,167,3,'2026-03-08 12:02:02','2026-03-08 12:02:02'),(1182,'GREAT UNDERSTANDING','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£My teenage daughter uses Serrano Transport for school and practice when IΓÇÖm working. At first I was nervous trusting anyone, but Javier always texts when he picks her up and drops her off. That level of communication made me rethink what ΓÇÿsafe transportationΓÇÖ really means. IΓÇÖm grateful we found him.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Anthony DeLuca ΓÇô New Britain, CT</span></p>',1,167,3,'2026-03-08 12:03:31','2026-03-08 12:06:10'),(1183,'FRIEND RECOMMENDED HIM','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ΓÇ£I booked Serrano Transport for an early morning airport run after a friend recommended him. The ride was so smooth and relaxed that it completely changed how I look at getting to the airport. No rushing, no wondering if a driver will show up, just a calm start to the trip. Now, when people tell me they still roll the dice with apps, I tell them they donΓÇÖt have to.ΓÇ¥</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Linda Morales ΓÇô Manchester, CT</span></p>',1,167,3,'2026-03-08 12:04:43','2026-03-08 12:04:43'),(1184,'Test Service today','<p>Test Service today</p>',1,17,1,'2026-03-13 06:09:48','2026-03-13 06:09:48'),(1185,'Test Title 13/3/2025','<p>Test Title 13/3/2025</p>',1,17,1,'2026-03-13 06:31:43','2026-03-13 06:31:43'),(1186,'How We Serve You','<h3>≡ƒì╜∩╕Å Authentic Ecuadorian Cuisine</h3><p>Enjoy the true flavors of Ecuador with recipes prepared using traditional ingredients, authentic cooking techniques, and the rich culinary heritage of Ecuadorian culture.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÑÿ Traditional Ecuadorian Plates</h3><p>A wide variety of classic Ecuadorian dishes including favorites like arroz con menestra, seco de pollo, fritada, and other comforting meals prepared just like they are back home.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒìñ Seafood &amp; Chaufa</h3><p>Freshly prepared seafood dishes along with Ecuadorian-style chaulaf├ín (a flavorful fried rice dish typically made with shrimp, chicken, pork, vegetables, and spices).</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÑù Fresh Daily Lunch Specials</h3><p>Delicious and affordable daily specials prepared fresh each day, offering a satisfying meal with authentic flavor thatΓÇÖs perfect for lunch.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÑñ Natural Juices &amp; Drinks</h3><p>Refreshing natural fruit juices and traditional beverages made with real fruit, offering a taste of tropical Ecuadorian refreshment.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÑí Takeout Available</h3><p>Order your favorite Ecuadorian dishes to go and enjoy authentic home-style meals wherever you are.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÜù Delivery Available</h3><p>Convenient delivery service allows customers to enjoy Sabor EcuatorianoΓÇÖs flavorful dishes from the comfort of their home or workplace.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒæ¿ΓÇì≡ƒæ⌐ΓÇì≡ƒæº Family Friendly Dining</h3><p>A welcoming environment where families and friends can gather to enjoy great food, warm hospitality, and the vibrant flavors of Ecuador.</p>',1,205,1,'2026-03-13 17:10:26','2026-03-13 17:27:39'),(1187,'Our Services','<h3>≡ƒî▒ Herbal Wellness Products</h3><p>Mayan Botanicals offers a variety of natural herbal products including teas, tinctures, oils, and botanical formulas designed to support overall wellness and healthy living using plant-based ingredients.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒºæΓÇìΓÜò∩╕Å Free 15-Minute Wellness Consultation</h3><p>New clients can schedule a complimentary consultation to discuss their wellness goals, ask questions about herbal support, and learn which products or lifestyle changes may best fit their needs.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒî┐ Personalized Herbal Guidance</h3><p>Clients can receive personalized herbal recommendations based on their individual health goals and lifestyle. The goal is to help people explore natural approaches to improving everyday wellness.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒôÜ Herbal Education &amp; Natural Living Resources</h3><p>Mayan Botanicals provides educational resources to help individuals better understand herbs, nutrition, and natural wellness practices so they can make informed lifestyle choices.</p><p><br></p><h3>Γ¡É Wellness Membership Programs</h3><p>Membership programs provide ongoing access to herbal products, wellness resources, and exclusive benefits designed to support clients on their long-term health and wellness journey.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒñ¥ Affiliate Partnership Program</h3><p>Individuals and wellness advocates can join the affiliate program to share Mayan Botanicals products and earn commissions while promoting natural wellness within their communities.</p>',1,208,1,'2026-03-18 22:07:06','2026-03-18 22:07:06'),(1188,'More than just a store','<p><strong>IΓÇÖve always believed that what we put into our bodies matters, but Mayan Botanicals really opened my eyes to how powerful natural wellness can be. Their products feel thoughtfully crafted and their guidance helped me rethink my daily health habits. This is more than just a store ΓÇö itΓÇÖs a place that encourages people to take control of their well-being in a more natural way</strong>.</p><p>-Michael Thompson</p>',1,208,3,'2026-03-19 19:54:43','2026-03-19 19:54:43'),(1189,'Genuinely Care','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What impressed me most about Mayan Botanicals is the passion behind the brand. You can tell they genuinely care about educating people about herbs and natural living. The consultation alone was incredibly informative and gave me a different perspective on how to support my health. I appreciate businesses that focus on knowledge as much as products.</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-Angela Ramirez</span></p>',1,208,3,'2026-03-19 19:55:23','2026-03-19 19:55:23'),(1190,'Stands Out','<p><strong style=\"colo