</p><p>ΓÇó testimonials</p><p>ΓÇó service menus</p><p>ΓÇó direct call or text buttons</p><p>Everything prospects need is&nbsp;<strong>one tap away.</strong></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒîÖ Your 24-Hour Salesperson</strong></h2><p>Your vBiz Me card works for you&nbsp;<strong>even when youΓÇÖre not working.</strong></p><p>Prospects can watch your intro video, explore your services, view your portfolio, read reviews, and book appointments&nbsp;<strong>any time of day or night.</strong></p><p>Instead of losing opportunities after hours, your card continues introducing you and your business&nbsp;<strong>24 hours a day.</strong></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÅó Team &amp; Corporate Systems</strong></h2><p>Deploy vBiz Me across your entire organization.</p><p>Perfect for:</p><p>ΓÇó sales teams</p><p>ΓÇó real estate agents</p><p>ΓÇó auto dealerships</p><p>ΓÇó contractors</p><p>ΓÇó consultants</p><p>Includes team branding, employee cards, and scalable management.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÄ» Built for Impact</strong></h2><p>Instead of handing someone a card that gets thrown awayΓÇª</p><p>You give them something they&nbsp;<strong>remember.</strong></p><p>vBiz Me turns a simple introduction into a&nbsp;<strong>powerful digital experience.</strong></p>',1,228,1,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1269,'Tommy',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1270,'Wolf',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1271,'Pr Construction',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1272,'Cocoboca',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1273,'CES Boxing',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1274,'Dreams Vacations',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1275,'Mike',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1276,'Dana',NULL,1,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1277,'Gett Excited',NULL,0,228,2,'2026-05-15 09:29:23','2026-05-15 09:29:23'),(1278