<p>≡ƒÆ╡&nbsp;<strong>Hospital Indemnity Plans</strong></p><p>Coverage that helps with hospital-related expenses and unexpected medical costs.</p><p>≡ƒÅí&nbsp;<strong>Long-Term Care Insurance</strong></p><p>Helping clients prepare for future care needs while protecting their independence and assets.</p><p><br></p><p>≡ƒòè∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Funeral Insurance</strong></p><p>Coverage designed to help ease the financial burden on loved ones.</p><p><br></p><p>≡ƒÄù∩╕Å&nbsp;<strong>Cancer, Heart Attack &amp; Stroke Policies</strong></p><p>Protection for serious health events that can create unexpected financial stress.</p><p><br></p><p>≡ƒôê&nbsp;<strong>Annuities</strong></p><p>Retirement-focused solutions designed to help provide financial stability and future income.</p>',1,230,1,'2026-05-23 17:39:11','2026-05-23 17:39:11'),(1318,'Difference in One Week','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Over a year ago, I saw a bunch of folks at the mobile home park in Texas begin to use the LifeWave Patches. I am naturally a skeptic on a lot of things, and this was one that I was particularly skeptic about. \"If it seems too good to be true, it probably is\".</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Last spring, I hurt my hip. Despite three different doctors and all kinds of tests and scans, I was told that they couldn\'t see anything wrong and I probably needed a hip replacement. Audrey Garrison kept telling me to try the patches. Nope, I wasn\'t going to spend my money on those silly things. I went on limping, using a walking stick or even a rollator walker all summer and into the fall.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After we got back to Texas in early November, Scott said \"I want you to give the patches a try\", so I called Audrey Garrison to come over and sign me up. I still had no faith that they would help at all.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Still, the pain when I walked or tried to sleep, was almost unbearable.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">After one week of wearing both the X39 and the AEON patches, I could tell a noticeable difference in the pain level in my hip, but also in my left knee that had begun to suffer from walking off balance due to the hip pain.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scott and I both were convinced and I have been wearing them ever since. Yesterday, I walked a lot doing errands around town and it dawned on me that I wasn\'t limping nearly as bad as I had been this time last year. Even Physical Therapy last summer didn\'t help. And I am not even thinking about hip replacement surgery any more.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-Clare Herrick</strong></p>',1,231,3,'2026-05-23 22:31:16','2026-05-23 22:31:16'),(1319,'No Drugs','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The next generation is grabbing hold of phototherapy and running with it!! They are so happy to use NO drugs to deal with health concerns. Phototherapy is non invasive and literally uses light to give your body a set of instructions to assist in many processes of your biology. ItΓÇÖs SIMPLE and INCREDIBLY EFFECTIVE!! We are just getting started!</span></p>',1,231,3,'2026-05-23 22:32:47','2026-05-23 22:32:47'),(1320,'Patching Technique','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;I want to share about a patching technique that I have been using since my last surgery (Dec 20) and what itΓÇÖs been doing for me. (my surgeries started last year in June) ≡ƒöÿ</span></p><p><br></p><p>Γ£¿Dec 22th&nbsp;I noticed that my eyes were not near as swollen as it has been after the surgery. (mind you I had four surgeries in 2025)</p><p><br></p><p>Γ£¿Dec 30th&nbsp;I went to the Cancer center without my walker. (I had been having to use it since somewhere in mid October). Off of it within 10 days. ≡ƒÿ│</p><p><br></p><p>Γ£¿Dec 31st&nbsp;I realized that I was finally sleeping again. (itΓÇÖs been two and three in the morning before I have been able to fall asleep)</p><p><br></p><p>Γ£¿Jan 26th my knee finally opened up and I am able to walk somewhat more normal.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Γ£¿ I have so much more energy</p>',1,231,3,'2026-05-23 22:34:04','2026-05-23 22:34:04'),(1321,'Healed Scars','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> I gall bladder surgery two weeks ago. Within&nbsp;two weeks my scars were almost completely healed. The doctor was very surprised.&nbsp;-</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Susan Wooten</strong></p>',1,231,3,'2026-05-23 22:35:21','2026-05-23 22:35:21'),(1322,'4 Days','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> She is 73 years young! Using the x39 patch!! Started, June 2nd 2024. So 4 DAYS!&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-Betty Sharp</strong></p>',1,231,3,'2026-05-23 22:36:45','2026-05-23 22:36:45'),(1323,'My Services','<h3><strong>≡ƒî┐ LifeWave Product Education</strong></h3><p>I help people understand LifeWaveΓÇÖs wellness patches, how they are used, and what each product is designed to support.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>ΓÜí Energy &amp; Daily Vitality Support</strong></h3><p>Guidance for individuals interested in products that may help support daily energy, stamina, and an active lifestyle.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒÿ┤ Sleep &amp; Relaxation Support</strong></h3><p>Education on wellness patch options designed to support relaxation, rest, and better nighttime routines.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒÆ¬ Recovery &amp; Active Lifestyle Support</strong></h3><p>Support for people who live active lives and want to explore non-invasive options that may help with recovery, movement, and overall wellness.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒº¼ X39 &amp; X49 Patch Guidance</strong></h3><p>Information on LifeWaveΓÇÖs popular X39 and X49 patches and how they fit into a personal wellness routine.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒºÿ Personal Wellness Consultations</strong></h3><p>One-on-one conversations to better understand your goals and help point you toward LifeWave products that may 