 structure, revenue, credit, and financial preparation can affect funding eligibility.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒº╛ Business Credit Strategy</strong></h3><p>Learn how to strengthen your businessΓÇÖs financial profile and better position your company for future financing opportunities.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒñ¥ Funding-Readiness Review</strong></h3><p>Review important areas of your business to identify strengths, possible obstacles, and steps that may improve your overall funding position.</p>',1,233,1,'2026-06-07 07:41:13','2026-06-07 07:41:13'),(1340,'ΓÇ£Backbone Capital made the funding process feel simple.ΓÇ¥','<p>I had looked into business funding before, but everything felt confusing and overly complicated. Jeremy took the time to explain my options in plain language and helped me understand what actually made sense for my business. He was direct, professional, and never made me feel pressured. I walked away with a much clearer plan and more confidence about my next move.</p><p><strong>ΓÇö Marcus T.</strong></p>',1,233,3,'2026-06-07 08:59:05','2026-06-07 08:59:05'),(1341,'ΓÇ£He treated my business like it actually mattered.ΓÇ¥','<p>What impressed me most was that Jeremy listened before offering any recommendations. He wanted to understand my goals, my challenges, and what I was trying to build. It did not feel like a generic sales pitch. It felt like a real business conversation with someone who understands what entrepreneurs go through.</p><p><strong>ΓÇö Danielle R.</strong></p>',1,233,3,'2026-06-07 09:00:08','2026-06-07 09:00:08'),(1342,'ΓÇ£Honest guidance without the runaround.ΓÇ¥','<p>Jeremy was straightforward from the beginning. He explained what was realistic, what I needed to improve, and what steps could help strengthen my funding position. I appreciated that he did not make exaggerated promises. He gave me honest guidance and treated me with respect throughout the entire process.</p><p><strong>ΓÇö Carlos M.</strong></p>',1,233,3,'2026-06-07 09:01:19','2026-06-07 09:01:19'),(1343,'ΓÇ£The right conversation at the right time.ΓÇ¥','<p>My business was growing, but cash flow was making it difficult to take advantage of new opportunities. Jeremy helped me look at the situation differently and understand how business capital could be used strategically instead of just as a quick fix. His experience and practical advice made a real difference.</p><p><strong>ΓÇö Anthony B.</strong></p>',1,233,3,'2026-06-07 09:02:19','2026-06-07 09:02:19'),(1344,'ΓÇ£Professional, knowledgeable, and easy to work with.ΓÇ¥','<h3>ΓÇ£Professional, knowledgeable, and easy to work with.ΓÇ¥</h3><p>Working with Backbone Capital was a great experience. Jeremy answered my questions, stayed in communication, and made sure I understood each step. He genuinely cares about helping business owners move forward. I would recommend him to any entrepreneur looking for clear and responsible funding guidance.</p><p><strong>ΓÇö Nicole S</strong></p>',1,233,3,'2026-06-07 09:03:29','2026-06-07 09:03:29'),(1345,'My Services','<h3><strong>≡ƒÅ¢∩╕Å Estate Planning</strong></h3><p>Personalized estate plans designed around your family, assets, goals and valuesΓÇönot a one-size-fits-all stack of documents.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒô£ Wills</strong></h3><p>Legally documenting how you want your property handled, who should manage your affairs and who should care for your minor children.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒ¢í∩╕Å Revocable Living Trusts</strong></h3><p>Helping families manage assets, maintain privacy and potentially avoid the delays and expenses associated with probate.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒæ¿ΓÇì≡ƒæ⌐ΓÇì≡ƒæºΓÇì≡ƒæª Kids Protection Planning</strong></h3><p>Creating clear legal instructions for the care of minor children, including the designation of short-term and long-term guardians.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>ΓÜû∩╕Å Probate and Court-Avoidance Planning</strong></h3><p>Structuring your affairs to help keep your loved ones out of unnecessary court proceedings and family conflict.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒºá Incapacity Planning</strong></h3><p>Preparing powers of attorney, health-care documents and other instructions for situations in which you cannot make decisions for yourself.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒÆ╝ Asset and Beneficiary Review</strong></h3><p>Reviewing how assets are owned and how beneficiaries are designated so that your legal documents and financial accounts work together.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>≡ƒöä Estate Plan Reviews and Updates</strong></h3><p>Reviewing existing plans after marriages, divorces, births, deaths, relocations, business changes and other major life events.</p><h3><strong>Γ¥ñ∩╕Å Life &amp; Legacy Planning┬«</strong></h3><p>A counseling-based planning process that helps clients make thoughtful legal, personal and financial decisions for themselves and the people they love.&nbsp;</p>',1,236,1,'2026-06-11 23:50:53','2026-06-11 23:50:53'),(1346,'Friendly & Knowledgeable','<p>ΓÇ£Stephanie is friendly, knowledgeable, and genuinely invested in the well-being of her clients. I came to her believing that my estate plan was already complete, but I learned so much during our very first meeting. I now feel confident that I have a thoughtful plan that will serve both me and my family well into the future.ΓÇ¥</p><p><strong>ΓÇö LD</strong></p>',1,236,3,'2026-06-12 14:53:29','2026-06-12 14:53:29'),(1347,'Understood Legal Complexities','<p>ΓÇ£I contacted Stephanie while dealing with a highly complex institutional matter. I needed an attorney who understood the legal complexities involved and who would make me feel comfortable throughout the process. Stephanie brought both experience and compassion to my situation and helped me reach a resolution that benefited me while also creating positive change for others who may face similar circumstances.ΓÇ¥</p><p><strong>ΓÇö BD</strong></p>',1,236,3,'2026-06-12 14:54:28','2026-06-12 14:54:28'),(1348,'Approached it Differently','<p>ΓÇ£Stephanie approaches 