</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒùô∩╕Å Test-Drive Appointments</strong></h2><p>Customers can contact their salesperson to confirm current availability and schedule a vehicle demonstration before visiting.</p><p><br></p>',1,240,1,'2026-06-22 06:46:47','2026-06-22 06:46:47'),(1353,'Fair Pricing','<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">THERE IS A BETTER WAY!</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the CT Valley region, there is the town of Naugatuck, where I believe I have found a better way to purchase used cars. I am writing this to express my thanks to all those at A Better Way Wholesale Autos. I had been searching for a used truck for some time, and then I cam across this company. After the pressure at dealers asking for deposits and many used car lots where I found high mileage autos at high prices, I found this place. Who would have thought - no pressure, an actual garage with ASE Certified technicians, and nothing but good looking, low mileage, late model autos. I was sure something was up! Not only did I get my truck at a fair price, but they actually put money into after the price was settled. New brakes, rotors, detailing, oil change and diagnostics to determine and engine fault. And a 6,000 mile warranty to boot - all at their expense. Rob the salesman was very cordial and helpful, but the owner told be stories about getting into this business and things he did to help his customers, sometimes at a loss. This closed the deal for me. Are these guys for real? Used cars? Buy them here. It surely is a better way.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-</span><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Norman L, Stratford CT</strong></p>',1,240,3,'2026-06-22 09:13:03','2026-06-22 09:13:03'),(1354,'Happy With Service','<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To Coty in service, and everyone at A Better Way:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I can\'t thank you enough for everything, it was a pleasure meeting you and it was so nice of you to not only take me later than normal, but for all the extras that came with the oil change. (I was so surprised when you told me my car would be washed and vacuumed!) I was so happy with the service I received, just like every other time I\'ve been there. I have never had anything but wonderful experiences since the first time I stepped foot on the lot. I hope you will accept this gift card as a token of my appreciation. I look forward to seeing you at my next visit. Thanks again!</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Kristen D</strong></p>',1,240,3,'2026-06-22 09:15:02','2026-06-22 09:15:02'),(1355,'Made The Experience Easy','<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To the staff at A Better Way Wholesale:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I jus wanted to thank you for being so helpful in my purchase of the BMW. You made the whole experience a breeze -- which I was not expecting! Thanks again!</span></p><p><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Bob H</strong></p>',1,240,3,'2026-06-22 09:16:46','2026-06-22 09:16:46'),(1356,'Cant Thank You Enough','<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">I want to take a minute to thank you for all the kindness and generosity you have shown to my family this past year. Your honesty and simple willingness to do your best for your customers during a sale and after is outstanding. Before my husband\'s illness he would always take care of the maintenance on all our cars, and it has been a blessing to be able to have you, someone I know I can trust, to do a wonderful job in maintaining my 