upport for short-term rental and Airbnb owners who need more than a basic cleaning service. We help keep your property guest-ready, organized, fully stocked, and prepared for every check-in.</p><p>Our STR support services include Airbnb turnover cleaning, guest-ready inspections, inventory tracking, restocking essentials, linen and towel service, turnover coordination, quality control walkthroughs, and issue reporting with photos when something needs attention.</p><p>Whether you own one short-term rental or manage multiple properties, our team helps protect your investment, improve the guest experience, and keep your rental running smoothly between bookings.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒôª Move-In / Move-Out Cleaning</strong></h2><p>Detailed cleaning for tenants, landlords, realtors, and property managers preparing a space for the next resident or final inspection.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÅó Property Turnovers</strong></h2><p>Cleaning and reset services for rental units, investment properties, and managed spaces that need to be rent-ready, guest-ready, or sale-ready.</p>',1,247,1,'2026-07-08 01:53:35','2026-07-14 19:43:17'),(1391,'My Services','<h2><br></h2><h3>≡ƒ⌐║ Medicare Planning</h3><p>Whether you are turning 65, retiring later, already enrolled in Medicare, or unsure where to begin, Tracy helps review your options and explain the differences between available Medicare plans. Her site specifically highlights help for people new to Medicare, plan reviews, Medicare and Medicaid situations, veterans, prescription drug costs, and ancillary coverage.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒöì Plan Review &amp; Options</h3><p>Tracy reviews your current coverage, health needs, prescription costs, benefits, and available plan options to help determine whether your current plan still makes sense ΓÇö or whether there may be a better fit.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÆè Prescription Drug Cost Help</h3><p>Tracy can help review prescription costs, check plan pricing, and look at programs