options that may offer lower down-payment requirements for qualified borrowers.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒç║≡ƒç╕ VA Home Loans</h3><p>Mortgage options designed for eligible veterans, active-duty service members, and qualifying surviving spouses.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒî│ USDA Home Loans</h3><p>No-down-payment financing may be available for qualified borrowers purchasing eligible properties.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÆÄ Jumbo Financing</h3><p>Mortgage solutions for higher-value homes and loan amounts that exceed conventional lending limits.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒôè Non-QM and Alternative Documentation Loans</h3><p>Flexible financing options for self-employed borrowers, business owners, investors, and borrowers with nontraditional income.</p><h3>≡ƒÅó Investment Property Financing</h3><p>Mortgage solutions for qualified borrowers purchasing rental homes and other investment properties.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒî┤ Second and Vacation Homes</h3><p>Financing guidance for clients purchasing a vacation property or second residence.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÅù∩╕Å Construction and Renovation Financing</h3><p>Mortgage options that may help qualified borrowers build, renovate, or improve a home.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒÆ░ Down-Payment Assistance</h3><p>Guidance on available grants and assistance programs that may help qualified buyers with down payments or closing costs.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒöä Mortgage Refinancing</h3><p>Review your current mortgage and explore options to lower your payment, change your term, restructure your loan, or access equity.</p><p><br></p><h3>≡ƒñ¥ Personalized Mortgage Consultations</h3><p>One-on-one guidance to help you understand your options and create a mortgage strategy based on your goals.</p>',1,248,1,'2026-07-13 00:06:02','2026-07-13 00:06:02'),(1405,'Understood my situation','<blockquote>ΓÇ£Christina took the time to understand my situation and explain my options in a way that was easy to understand. I never felt rushed or pressured.ΓÇ¥</blockquote><p><br></p><p><br></p>',1,