<br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒº╛ Medical Coding Audits</strong></h2><p>Certified coding professionals review medical records and claims to identify coding inaccuracies, documentation concerns, compliance exposure and potential revenue opportunities.</p><p>Clients receive understandable reports and practical recommendationsΓÇönot a giant stack of technical language that nobody wants to read.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒôï Clinical Documentation Improvement</strong></h2><p>Guidance to help clinicians improve the accuracy, completeness and clarity of medical documentation.</p><p>Stronger documentation can support accurate coding, reduce audit exposure, improve reimbursement and help prevent unnecessary claim denials.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÆ╡ Billing and Revenue Integrity Review</strong></h2><p>Identification of billing errors, coding inconsistencies, denial trends and documentation issues that may be affecting revenue.</p><p>Compass helps organizations understand where revenue may be lost and where compliance vulnerabilities may exist.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>ΓÜá∩╕Å Compliance Risk Identification</strong></h2><p>Evaluation of specific financial, operational and regulatory vulnerabilities that could expose a healthcare organization to penalties, audits, repayment demands or reputational damage.</p><p>The goal is not merely to find problems. It is to provide a practical plan for addressing them.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒöÉ HIPAA Privacy and Security</strong></h2><p>Assessment and guidance related to HIPAA privacy, security and organizational compliance.</p><p>Compass helps healthcare organizations identify vulnerabilities and develop practical strategies for strengthening the protection of patient and organizational information.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒª║ OSHA and Workplace Safety Compliance</strong></h2><p>Assessment of healthcare workplace safety practices and OSHA-related requirements.</p><p>This may include evaluating operational procedures, employee safety practices, clinical environments and site-level regulatory risks.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÅ¢∩╕Å OIG, CDC and Regulatory Guidance</strong></h2><p>Review of compliance risks associated with guidance and expectations from agencies and organizations such as the Office of Inspector General, CDC and OSHA.</p><p>Compass helps clients understand how regulatory expectations may affect daily operations and compliance planning.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒæÑ Human Resources and Clinical Safety</strong></h2><p>Evaluation of HR-related risk, clinical safety practices and internal procedures.</p><p>Recommendations are tailored to the organizationΓÇÖs specific environment, workforce and operations.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÄô Provider and Staff Education</strong></h2><p>Customized education and training to help providers, coders and staff understand documentation, coding, compliance and operational expectations.</p><p>Compass also offers personalized consultation and continuing support to help organizations improve over time.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒñ¥ Mergers and Acquisitions Due Diligence</strong></h2><p>Independent analysis for buyers, sellers, investors, attorneys, accountants and healthcare leadership involved in a medical-practice acquisition, merger or sale.</p><p>Compass has more than three decades of team experience supporting healthcare M&amp;A due diligence.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒôè Due-Diligence Coding Audit</strong></h2><p>A review of coding accuracy, documentation quality, compliance concerns and potential revenue-growth opportunities before a healthcare transaction is completed.</p><p>This helps buyers and investors identify red flags before those red flags become very expensive red flags.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒÅÑ Due-Diligence Safety and Compliance Review</strong></h2><p>An assessment of operational, administrative, regulatory and site-level risks connected to a potential healthcare acquisition.</p><p>Clients receive a clearer understanding of potential liabilities and areas requiring improvement.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><strong>≡ƒùâ∩╕Å Asset and Inventory Review</strong></h2><p>Evaluation of medical equipment, inventory and related assets to help buyers better understand potential value, replacement costs and financial viability.</p>',1,251,1,'2026-07-18 06:30:56','2026-07-18 06:30:56'),(1412,'Our Services','<h2>≡ƒÅá Roofing Inspections, Repairs &amp; Re-Roofing</h2><p>Protect your home with professional roof inspections, repairs, and re-roofing solutions. FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions evaluates the condition of your roof, identifies potential concerns, and recommends a practical path forward using quality materials designed for lasting protection.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒº▒ Siding Installation &amp; Repair</h2><p>Improve your homeΓÇÖs protection and curb appeal with professional siding installation and repair. From damaged sections to larger exterior upgrades, Jay helps homeowners create a cleaner, more attractive, and weather-resistant exterior.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒÜ¬ Windows &amp; Doors</h2><p>Upgrade old, damaged, or inefficient windows and doors with professional installation. Available styles and materials can be matched to the homeownerΓÇÖs needs, taste, and existing home design while helping improve comfort and energy efficiency.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>≡ƒö¿ Complete Home Remodeling</h2><p>Transform outdated or unfinished spaces with remodeling solutions designed around your goals. Projects can range from targeted improvements to larger interior and exterior renovations.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒì╜∩╕Å Kitchen &amp; Cabinet Improvements</h2><p>Refresh the heart of your home with cabinet work, kitchen improvements, repairs, and remodeling. JayΓÇÖs website gallery and Facebook page feature kitchen and cabinet transformation projects.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒº░ Drywall, Trim &amp; Painting</h2><p>Complete your interior project with drywall work, trim installation or repair, and painting services. These services can be performed individually or incorporated into a larger renovation.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒ¢á∩╕Å General Home Repairs &amp; Maintenance</h2><p>Not every project requires a full remodel. FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions also assists with everyday home repairs, maintenance needs, finishing work, and smaller improvement projects.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒôï Custom Project Solutions</h2><p>Have a project that does not fit neatly into one category? Contact Jay to discuss the work, available options, and whether FlippinΓÇÖ Success Solutions is the right fit.</p>',1,253,1,'2026-07-18 13:09:57','2026-07-18 13:09:57'),(1413,'My Services','<h2>≡ƒÅá Residential Cleaning</h2><p>Reliable recurring cleaning designed to keep your home consistently fresh, comfortable, and well maintained. Available weekly, biweekly, monthly, or as a customized schedule.</p><h2>Γ£¿ Deep Cleaning &amp; Initial Resets</h2><p>A more intensive, top-to-bottom cleaning that addresses areas often missed during routine maintenance. Ideal for seasonal cleaning, special occasions, first-time appointments, or homes that need a complete reset.</p><h2>≡ƒôª Move-In &amp; Move-Out Cleaning</h2><p>Thorough cleaning for homes, apartments, and commercial properties before or after a move. KayΓÇÖs Solutions helps prepare the property so new occupants can enjoy a clean, sanitized, move-in-ready environment.</p><h2>≡ƒÅó Commercial &amp; Office Cleaning</h2><p>Professional cleaning for offices, institutions, apartment buildings, and commercial facilities. Services are available daily, weekly, after hours, or through a customized maintenance schedule.</p><h2>≡ƒº╣ Janitorial Services</h2><p>Recurring facility maintenance that can include restroom sanitation, trash removal, recycling, common-area cleaning, lobby and hallway cleaning, nightly maintenance, and general workplace upkeep.</p><h2>≡ƒÅÿ∩╕Å Apartment Building &amp; Common-Area Cleaning</h2><p>Cleaning for apartment buildings, lobbies, hallways, stairways, restrooms, trash rooms, dumpster areas, and other shared spaces that need to remain clean and presentable.</p><h2>≡ƒ¢Ä∩╕Å Day Porter Services</h2><p>On-site cleaning and maintenance support during operating hours to address spills, restrooms, trash, high-traffic areas, and other ongoing facility needs.</p><h2>≡ƒÅí Vacation Rental &amp; Airbnb Turnovers</h2><p>Detailed turnover cleaning that prepares vacation homes and rental properties for incoming guests. Designed for homeowners and property managers who need dependable, guest-ready results between stays.</p><h2>≡ƒÜº Post-Construction Cleaning</h2><p>Specialized cleaning following construction or renovation projects, including the removal of dust, residue, and construction-related debris to prepare the space for occupancy or presentation.</p><h2>≡ƒº║ Organization &amp; Decluttering</h2><p>Collaborative, nonjudgmental organizing solutions for closets, pantries, offices, individual rooms, or entire homes. Services may also include downsizing and moving assistance.</p><h2>≡ƒº╜ Floor &amp; Carpet Care</h2><p>Available services include:</p><ul><li>Carpet cleaning</li><li>Floor stripping and waxing</li><li>Buffing and polishing</li><li>Tile and grout cleaning</li><li>Hardwood-floor cleaning</li><li>Deep floor scrubbing</li></ul><h2>≡ƒ¬ƒ Specialty Cleaning</h2><p>Additional services include interior window cleaning, priority hourly cleaning, customized cleaning plans, and first-time reset cleaning.</p>',1,256,1,'2026-07-18 13:57:55','2026-07-18 13:57:55'),(1414,'Google Reviews','<h3><strong>Click Here to See or Leave A Review</strong></h3>',1,256,3,'2026-07-18 17:35:30','2026-07-18 17:36:31'),(1415,'Our Services','<h2>≡ƒì╕ Full-Service Mobile Bar</h2><p>Bring a complete, professionally operated bar directly to your venue. Bar Plus handles the bar setup, service and cleanup from beginning to end.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒÑâ Alcohol Provided</h2><p>Unlike many mobile bartending services, Bar Plus can purchase and provide the alcohol for your event.</p><p>Alcohol, mixers, garnishes, ice and necessary bar supplies are handled for you.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒì╣ Professional Bartenders</h2><p>Experienced, professional bartenders provide attentive service while keeping drinks flowing and guests cared for throughout your event.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒÜÉ Luxury Mobile Bar Experience</h2><p>Our mobile bar creates a stylish and functional centerpiece that brings the experience of a professional bar directly to your celebration.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒì╕ Cocktails on Tap</h2><p>Serve polished signature cocktails quickly and efficiently with our cocktail tap service.</p><p>Cocktails on tap help reduce waiting times while maintaining quality and consistency throughout your event.</p><p><br></p><h2>Γÿò Espresso Martinis on Tap</h2><p>Give your guests a stylish late-night or dessert-hour experience with espresso martinis served on tap.</p><p><br></p><h2>Γÿò Mobile Coffee Bar</h2><p>Add a professional coffee-bar experience to weddings, corporate events, showers and private celebrations.</p><p>The coffee bar can create an elegant alternative for guests who prefer a nonalcoholic beverage or need a little fuel before returning to the dance floor.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒºÇ Signature Charcuterie Cups</h2><p>Elegant, individually prepared grazing cups provide guests with a convenient and attractive option during cocktail hour or throughout the event.</p><p>Charcuterie cups are perfect for mingling because guests can enjoy them without needing to crowd around one large board.</p><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒºè Complete Bar Supplies</h2><p>Available bar service includes the essential supplies needed to operate a professional event bar, including:</p><ul><li>Alcohol</li><li>Mixers</li><li>Garnishes</li><li>Ice</li><li>Cups and bar supplies</li><li>Professional bartenders</li><li>Mobile bar setup</li><li>Cleanup</li></ul><p><br></p><h2>≡ƒº╣ Setup and Cleanup</h2><p>Bar Plus handles the full bar setup before your event and cleanup afterward.</p><p>You will not be left assembling the bar before guests arrive or breaking it down after everybody leaves.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2><br></h2>',1,263,1,'2026-07-30 17:16:25','2026-07-30 17:36:26');
